#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:30
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:501
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Axe"
msgstr "战斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1626
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:26
msgctxt "items"
msgid "More of a tool than a weapon, this simple axe will work in a pinch.  But don't expect much."
msgstr "与其说是兵器，不如说是一件工具。杀伤力极其微弱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:827
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:26
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:27
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Battle Axe"
msgstr "战斧"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:27
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Made as a weapon of war instead of a tool, the battle axe is usually employed by barbarians and undisciplined armies."
msgstr "是战斗中使用的战斧。野人和散兵游勇经常使用此类兵器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1628
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "items"
msgid "War Axe"
msgstr "战争之斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1628
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This War Axe appears to be one of a large shipment of such axes seized by Roland during the Succession War.  It was manufactured in Karigor by order of Archibald Ironfist to be used against his brother in their struggle for the throne of Enroth."
msgstr "是在王位争夺战争时期被罗兰德扣留的大批货物中的一件。此类兵器在阿基巴德·艾恩法斯特的命令之下于卡力格打造，并运到恩洛斯在与罗兰德争夺王位的战争中使用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:828
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:27
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:29
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dwarven Axe"
msgstr "矮人之斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1629
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:29
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An example of the high quality work done by the dwarves of the Red Mountains, the blade is sharp and the balance perfect."
msgstr "是由在红色山区的矮人族打制的上乘兵器。它锋利无边，造型优美，比例协调。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1630
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:30
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Supreme Axe"
msgstr "超级战斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1630
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:30
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This weapon surely has a dark history.  An axe of this quality is only forged as the personal weapon of a noble Dwarf, and it is never sold or traded away…"
msgstr "这件兵器沾满了鲜血。如此非凡的兵器原是为了矮人族贵族打制，从不向别人出售。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:31
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Poleax"
msgstr "屠斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:37
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:38
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:39
