#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:54
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:55
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:56
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:57
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Mace"
msgstr "钉锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1653
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:53
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Little more than a glorified club, this common mace is made of ordinary materials and unexceptional craftsmanship."
msgstr "仅是一把粗头棍而已。工艺平凡，质地粗糙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1654
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:54
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wicked Mace"
msgstr "邪恶钉锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1654
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:54
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Solidly designed to inflict fatal injuries, even through armor.  The balance is a little top heavy, but the craftsmanship is good."
msgstr "质地坚硬，可穿透铠甲致敌死命。造型虽略显笨拙，但工艺出色。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1655
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:55
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Thunder Mace"
msgstr "雷霆钉锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1655
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:55
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This mace is one of thousands turned out by the Heavenly Forges before the Silence.  But that was more than a thousand years ago, and not many remain."
msgstr "此钉锤是寂静时代以前由天堂铸造厂打造而成。至今已有一千多年的历史，流传下来的已经不多了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1656
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wonder Mace"
msgstr "神钉锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1656
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Only magic could make such an ungainly weapon so light and yet hit so hard."
msgstr "只有魔法师才能使用如此轻巧的兵器并且造成极大的杀伤力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1657
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:57
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Death Mace"
msgstr "死亡钉锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1657
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:57
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Constructed by the Necromancer's guild just prior to their fall during the Succession War, these unusual weapons are almost always enchanted with powerful magics."
msgstr "是由在王位争夺战争中一蹶不振的死灵法师巫师教派精心打造而成。此类兵器每一件都附有威力强大的魔法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:72
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:73
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:74
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:75
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:76
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:858
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:859
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:860
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1658
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1659
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1660
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:74
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:75
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:76
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:77
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:78
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:57
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:58
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:59
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:58
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:59
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hammer"
msgstr "锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1658
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:58
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A graceless and unimaginative weapon, hammers are slow, but hit very hard.  This one is of common construction and materials."
msgstr "这是件形状简陋，毫无艺术感的兵器。它速度慢，但打击力不小，是一件毫无特色的普遍兵器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1659
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:59
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dark Hammer"
msgstr "黑暗锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1659
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:58
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:59
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A step up in construction quality, these hammers are commonly wielded by humanoid monsters.  Since everyone knows most monsters don't make weapons, the question 'from where are they getting them?' arises…"
msgstr "它在工艺制作上已有极大改进，通常的使用者为类人怪兽。众人皆知这些怪兽根本不会制造兵器，那这些兵器是从哪儿来的呢？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1660
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Holy Hammer"
msgstr "神锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1660
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Magically constructed, these hammers are the property of the Church of the Moon in Karigor."
msgstr "这些大锤由魔法制成，属于卡力格的月亮教派所有。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:77
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:78
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:79
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:861
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:862
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:863
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1661
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1662
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1663
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:79
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:80
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:81
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:513
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:60
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:61
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:62
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:61
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:62
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:63
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Club"
msgstr "粗头棍"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1661
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:61
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A primitive weapon usable by even the stupidest of monsters.  You're not thinking of using this, are you?"
msgstr "是由天下最愚蠢的怪兽才使用的原始兵器，你该对这种东西不屑一顾。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1662
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:61
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:62
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Spiked Club"
msgstr "尖嘴粗头棍"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1662
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:61
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:62
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An improvement over the simple club, this spiked club will inflict nastier wounds."
msgstr "比简单的粗头棍有了些改进，但杀伤力还是太小。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1663
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:63
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Killer Club"
msgstr "致命粗头棍"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1663
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:63
msgctxt "items"
msgid "King of the club family.  If this weapon had a knob or ball on the end, it would be a mace.  There is evidence of real craftsmanship in this club, but you can see no true identifying marks that would indicate who created it."
msgstr "它是粗头棍中的王者。要是顶部再有个大球状物，那就成了钉锤了。它体现了打造者的高超工艺，但却不知道谁有这样出神入化的技术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:80
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:81
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:82
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:83
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:84
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:864
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:865
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:866
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1664
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1665
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1666
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:82
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:83
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:84
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:85
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:86
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:514
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:533
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:63
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:64
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:65
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:64
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:65
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:66
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Staff"
msgstr "手杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1664
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:64
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The staff is the traditional weapon of the oppressed.  This one is unremarkable, and the ruby at the end of it is actually just colored glass."
msgstr "这种手杖是非常普通的兵器。顶部的红宝石仅是块有色玻璃而已。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1665
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:65
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Emerald Staff"
msgstr "翠玉手杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1665
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:65
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Magically light and hard, this staff is made of a rare wood stripped from the Elves during the Timber War in 600 A.S.  The emerald at the end of it is real, and probably serves as a magical reservoir from which the staff draws its strength."
msgstr "此兵器由魔法制成，故使用轻便，质地坚硬。它是由在寂静时代的600年代精灵用罕见的木料精心制成。它顶部的绿宝石货真价实，里面有威力强大的魔法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1666
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:66
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Power Staff"
msgstr "强力手杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1666
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:66
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This staff, along with others of its kind, was found in the treasure room of the Necromancer's guild after their disastrous defeat by Roland at the end of the Succession War."
msgstr "在王位争夺战争的后期，罗兰德胜利击败了死灵法师巫师教派，在他们的宝库里找到了此类兵器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:867
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1667
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:66
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:67
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Blaster"
msgstr "迷你榴弹枪"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:867
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:868
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1667
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1668
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:66
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:67
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:67
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:68
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ancient Weapon"
msgstr "上古兵器"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1667
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:67
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A weapon of awesome power, clearly created during the Time of Wonders.  "
msgstr "它是在奇迹时代制造的具有强大威力的兵器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:868
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1668
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:67
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:68
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Blaster Rifle"
msgstr "榴弹枪"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1668
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:68
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The finest of personal weapons made during the Time of Wonders, this Blaster Rifle can deal death faster than any weapon you have ever seen."
msgstr "它是在奇迹时代制造的天下最完美的供个人使用的武器。它攻击速度奇快，其它任何兵器都赶不上它。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:85
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:86
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:87
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:88
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:89
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:869
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:870
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:871
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:872
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:873
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1669
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1670
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1671
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1672
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1673
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:87
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:88
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:89
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:90
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:91
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:516
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:536
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:68
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:69
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:70
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:71
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:72
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:69
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:70
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:71
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:72
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:73
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Leather Armor"
msgstr "皮革盔甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1669
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:69
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lightest and most easily made among the armors, leather armor offers the least protection.  This particular suit is of average quality."
msgstr "它是所有铠甲中制作最简单，最轻便的一种。保护性最差，质地一般。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:870
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:69
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:70
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Studded Leather"
msgstr "钉甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1670
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:70
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Studded leather offers more protection than regular leather armor at the expense of being stiffer and weighing more.  This particular suit is well made."
msgstr "此类皮甲比普通皮甲重，保护性也强一些。它的制造工艺相当不错。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1671
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:71
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Enchanted Leather"
msgstr "魔法皮甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:871
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:70
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:71
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An otherwise ordinary suit of leather armor, this suit is imbued with a subtle enchantment that strengthens the material against blows without increasing weight."
msgstr "此皮甲经魔力点化，具有惊人的抗击打能力，而重量却没有增加。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1672
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:72
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragon Leather"
msgstr "龙皮甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:872
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:71
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:72
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Standard issue leather armor for officers in the Regnan Navy.  All such leather armor receives enchantments to strengthen and lighten it during its creation in the Regnan Armories."
msgstr "是专为雷格那海军军官特制的铠甲。它经过魔法点化，更轻，保护性更强。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1673
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:73
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Imperial Leather"
msgstr "帝国皮甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1673
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:73
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An extremely rare suit of leather armor created during the conflicts between the Church of the Moon and the Church of the Sun roughly 80 years ago.  These suits provide the finest protection available with leather armor."
msgstr "它是在80年前在月亮教派和太阳教派交战中诞生的稀世奇珍。它在皮甲中保护性是最好的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:874
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:875
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:876
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:877
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:878
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1674
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1675
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1676
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1677
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1678
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:73
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:74
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:75
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:76
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:77
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:535
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:74
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:75
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:76
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:77
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:78
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Chain Mail"
msgstr "锁甲"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:74
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Chain mail is an armor formed of small, interlocking loops of metal.  This suit is low quality:  the metal used is plain iron, there are only two layers of rings, and it is heavy and stiff for its size."
msgstr "锁甲由一片片互相连接的小钢叶组合而成。这件铠甲质量一般，由普通铁皮做成，且只有两层，而且相当沉重。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:74
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:75
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Steel Chain Mail"
msgstr "钢锁甲"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:75
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A superior suit of chain mail, the metal used in this suit is steel, and the former owner was careful to keep the suit well oiled and free of rust."
msgstr "是一件比较高级的铠甲。由钢制成，而且在油中浸泡过，不会生锈。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1676
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:76
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Noble Chain Mail"
msgstr "贵族锁甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1676
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:76
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Cavalry officer's chain mail from the reign of Taledon V of Karigor, Divine High Priest and High Holy Conduit of the Church of the Sun, circa 870 A.S.  The armor is high quality chain, enchanted to lighten and strengthen the metal."
msgstr "此铠甲是在寂静时代870年由卡力格的统治者、神圣大主教和太阳教派的高级神圣主管特尔顿五世为军队首领而制的一件圣物。它的钢质上乘，比较轻巧，抗打击力惊人。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1677
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:77
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Royal Chain Mail"
msgstr "皇室锁甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1677
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:77
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Highly enchanted armor worn by elvish nobility and royalty during the Timber Wars of the seventh and eighth centuries."
msgstr "在七、八世纪的木材战争中，精灵贵族和皇室成员所穿的高度附魔的铠甲。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1678
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:78
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Majestic Chain Mail"
msgstr "帝王锁甲"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:78
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A very rare suit of armor turned out by the Heavenly Forges of Governor Padish before the Silence.  The armor was originally worn strictly by the Governor and his highest military officers as a badge of office.  It is not just for show; this chain mail is lighter, stronger, and more supple than any other chain in the world."
msgstr "一件非常罕见的铠甲，在寂静时代以前由帕第什总督的天堂铸造厂所制。此铠甲原本只有总督和他的最高级军事官员才可穿着，作为其职务的象征。它并不只是为了炫耀，这种锁甲比世界上任何其他锁甲更轻、更强、更柔韧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:95
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:96
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:97
