#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:86
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:502
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Large Shield"
msgstr "大盾"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1682
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:82
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Formed of stretched hides over a wooden frame, this simple shield provides basic protection against physical attacks."
msgstr "它就在木质骨架上盖了一层毛皮，仅对身体有微弱的保护作用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1683
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:83
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Tower Shield"
msgstr "高楼盾牌"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1683
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:83
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The simplicity of the heraldic design on this shield leads one to believe it was created either by barbarians or goblins.  It is made of sturdy materials and should stand up reasonably well in combat."
msgstr "根据此盾牌上的简单纹章设计可以看出它由野人和大耳族打造。它的制作材料坚硬，能够承受一定打击力量。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1684
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:84
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Castle Shield"
msgstr "城堡盾牌"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1684
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:84
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This shield is made of wood framed by iron.  It is somewhat heavy for its size, but it should see you through a battle safely--as long as  you're not backstabbed."
msgstr "此盾牌由铁制骨架和木材复合而成，比较沉重。只要不被暗算，它可以帮助你在战斗中安然无恙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1685
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:85
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Celestial Shield"
msgstr "天际盾牌"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:885
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1685
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:84
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:85
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Made of a lightweight metal, this shield has a foundry stamp from the Kelebrim armory.  Though light, the material is very strong, and the metal is welded almost seamlessly.  "
msgstr "它诞生于克勒布林的锻造厂，由轻质金属制成。尽管比较轻巧，但抗打击力强，舞动时几乎风雨不透。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1686
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:86
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Olympian Shield"
msgstr "众神屏障"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:886
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:85
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:86
msgctxt "items"
msgid "These shields were forged by the Phynaxian empire during its brief rise to power on the steppes of southern Erathia (790-864).  They are made of stalt, a metal that takes well to enchantment, and contributed heavily to Phynaxian military might.  Unfortunately, very little of the metal could be mined, and Phynaxia fell in 864 A.S. to an Elvish offensive."
msgstr "在埃拉西亚南部干草原地区曾经有个菲尼克斯王国昙花一现地统治了那里（790年-864年）。这些盾牌就是他们制造的。它们由一种名叫斯多特的、很容易用魔力点化的金属制成，为菲尼克斯王国立下了汗马功劳。可惜这种金属十分稀有，该王国也在寂静时代864年因精灵族的侵入而灭亡了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:883
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:82
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:87
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wooden Shield"
msgstr "木质盾牌"

