#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/PYRAMID.STR.py:54
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PYRAMID.STR.py:54
msgctxt "location"
msgid "With painstaking care, you are able to decipher the message of the hieroglyphs:                                                                                                                                                     Though the Crossing of the Void be a long and arduous journey, the land you find at the end will be sweet and unspoiled by ancestors or the Enemy.  Take heart that your children's children will live in a perfect world free of war, free of famine, and free of fear.  Remember your sacred duty to care for the Ship on her long Voyage and ensure her safe arrival in the Promised Land.  Tend well the Guardian and house it securely away from the ship lest both be lost in a single misfortune."
msgstr "你绞尽脑汁，终于破译了这些象形文字：\n尽管横渡虚空的旅途漫长艰险，但最终你会找到一个未受先人或敌人破坏的乐土，你的子孙将居住在一个没有战争饥荒恐惧的完美世界中。记住，你神圣的使命是在漫长旅途中尽心看护此船，确保能安全抵达许诺之地。还要照顾好守护者，使他远离船舰，以免一次事故同时毁掉船和守护者。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/PYRAMID.STR.py:55
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/PYRAMID.STR.py:55
msgctxt "location"
msgid "With painstaking care, you are able to decipher the message of the hieroglyphs, intermixed with diagrams of devils:                                                                                          Remember our Enemy, children, and never underestimate the danger they pose.  Though you will never see one during your journey, you must be forever vigilant against invasion from the Void once the Voyage has ended.  Mighty beyond words, the Enemy is nonetheless vulnerable after a Crossing, for their numbers are small and their defenses weak.  Use the energy weapons carried on the Ship to defeat them, and never, ever engage the Enemy with lesser weapons, or you will surely perish."
msgstr "你绞尽脑汁，终于破译了这些象形文字及魔鬼小人状插图：\n孩子们，千万要小心敌人，永远不要低估它们的危害。就算旅途中你看不到敌人，到达目的地后，你依然必须时刻保持警惕，提防来自虚空的入侵。不过，强大的敌人在横渡之后数量少防御弱。你可以用船上的能量武器打败它们，千万别拿比这弱的武器，这是自取灭亡。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1107
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:82
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Show Sulman's letter to Andover Potbello in New Sorpigal."
msgstr "向新索匹格镇的安多弗·波特皮洛出示舒尔曼的信。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1108
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:83
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Bring Sulman's letter to Regent Wilbur Humphrey at Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "把舒尔曼的信带给铁拳城堡的威尔伯·汉弗里摄政王。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1109
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:84
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find the Combination to the vault door in Goblinwatch and return to the Town Hall in New Sorpigal."
msgstr "找到大耳怪前哨宝库门的密码并返回新索匹格镇的市政厅。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1110
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:85
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Get the Chime of Harmony from the Temple of Baa and return to the New Sorpigal Town Hall."
msgstr "从羊鸣庙里找到美妙钟琴并返回新索匹格镇的市政厅。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1112
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:87
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find Lord Kilburn's Shield and return to Wilbur Humphrey in Castle Ironfist to report."
msgstr "找到科尔本爵士的盾牌并返回铁拳城堡向威尔伯·汉弗里报告。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1114
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:89
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Rescue a Damsel in Distress and return with her to Wilbur Humphrey in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "营救一名处于危难之中的少女，并带着她一同返回铁拳城堡威尔伯·汉弗里处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1115
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:90
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Slay Longfang Witherhide in his cave near Castle Darkmoor and return to Wilbur Humphrey in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "杀死盘踞于黑摩尔城堡附近一洞穴里的长牙巨龙威瑟海德，并返回铁拳城堡威尔伯·汉弗里处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1116
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:91
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Entertain Nicolai."
msgstr "哄尼古拉，让他高兴。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1121
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:96
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find and return Prince Nicolai to Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "找到并把尼古拉王子带回铁拳城堡。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1122
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:97
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find the Third Eye and bring it to Prince Nicolai in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "找到第三只眼并把它交给铁拳城堡的尼古拉王子。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1124
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:99
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Capture the Prince of Thieves and bring him to Lord Anthony Stone at Castle Stone."
msgstr "擒获盗贼王子并把他押送回斯通城堡安东尼·斯通爵士处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1131
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:106
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Hire a Stonecutter and a Carpenter, bring them to Temple Stone in Free Haven to repair the Temple, and then return to Lord Anthony Stone at Castle Stone."
msgstr "雇一个石匠和一个木匠，并把他们带到自由天堂的斯通神庙去修复该神庙，然后回到斯通城堡的安东尼·斯通爵士处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1133
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:108
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Take the Sacred Chalice from the monks in their island temple east of Free Haven, return it to Temple Stone in Free Haven, and then return to Lord Stone at Castle Stone."
msgstr "前往自由天堂东面的岛屿的神庙，从众僧侣手中夺得圣杯并把它带回到自由天堂的斯通神庙，然后返回斯通城堡见斯通爵士。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1136
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:111
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find and return the Hourglass of Time to Lord Albert Newton in Mist."
msgstr "找到时间沙漏，交还给浓雾镇的阿尔伯特·牛顿爵士。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1137
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:112
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Drink from the Fountain of Magic and return to Lord Albert Newton in Mist."
msgstr "喝下魔法喷泉的泉水并返回浓雾镇的阿尔伯特·牛顿爵士处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1138
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:113
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Retrieve the Crystal of Terrax and return to Lord Albert Newton in Mist."
msgstr "找回德里克丝水晶并返回浓雾镇的阿尔伯特·牛顿爵士处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1139
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:114
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Destroy the Devil's Outpost and return to Lord Osric Temper at Castle Temper."
msgstr "摧毁恶魔据点并返回坦普城堡的奥斯里克·坦普爵士处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1140
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:115
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Get Knight's nomination from Chadwick and return to Lord Osric Temper at Castle Temper."
msgstr "得到查德威克的骑士提名并返回坦普城堡的奥斯里克·坦普爵士处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1141
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:116
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Defeat the Warlord and bring proof to Osric Temper"
msgstr "击败军阀并把证据带给奥斯里克·坦普。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1142
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:117
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Fix the prices of all 9 stables in the Kingdom and return to Lady Fleise in Silver Cove."
msgstr "稳定王国内所有9个驿站的价格并回到银湾镇的弗丽斯夫人处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1144
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:119
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Visit the Altar of the Sun in the circle of stones north of Silver Cove on an equinox or solstice (HINT:  March 20th is an equinox)."
msgstr "在春秋分或冬夏至前往银湾镇北边的石圈拜祭太阳神坛（提示：3月20日是春分）。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1145
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:120
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Visit the Altar of the Moon in the Temple of the Moon at midnight of a full moon."
msgstr "在满月的午夜时分来到月亮神庙拜祭月亮神坛。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1146
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:121
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "End winter for Lord Stromgard at Castle Stromgard, and return to him with the good news."
msgstr "结束冬天，带着好消息返回斯壮姆嘉德城堡的斯壮姆嘉德爵士处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1147
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:122
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Retrieve the key to the Dragon Towers from Icewind Keep south of Whitecap, and bring it to Lord Stromgard at Castle Stromgard."
msgstr "从白帽镇南边的冰风堡垒中找回龙塔钥匙，并把它带给斯壮姆嘉德城堡的斯壮姆嘉德爵士。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1148
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:123
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Reset all of the Dragon Towers at each town and return to Lord Stromgard in Castle Stromgard."
msgstr "重新设置每个镇的龙塔，并返回斯壮姆嘉德城堡的斯壮姆嘉德爵士处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1150
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:125
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Kill Snergle in Snergle's Caverns and return with his axe to Avinril Smythers at The Haunt tavern in the Mire of the Damned."
msgstr "前往斯纳格的岩洞，除掉斯纳格，并把他的战斧交给幽灵沼泽萦绕旅店的阿维里·辛西亚。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1151
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:126
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Storm the Silver Helm Outpost near Mist and return with evidence of their corruption to the Constable of Mist."
msgstr "突袭浓雾镇附近的银舵前哨并把他们堕落的证据带给浓雾镇的治安官。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1152
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:127
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Retrieve the candelabra from the Abandoned Temple for Andover Potbello in New Sorpigal."
msgstr "为新索匹格的安多弗·波特皮洛夺回废庙中的蜡烛台。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1154
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:129
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Retrieve the harp from the Dragoon's Caverns south of Castle Ironfist and return it to Andrew Besper in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "前往铁拳城堡南面的龙骑兵洞穴，夺回竖琴，并把它交还给铁拳城堡的安德鲁·贝斯普。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1155
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:130
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Retrieve Ethric's skull from his tomb west of Free Haven for Gabriel Cartman in Free Haven."
msgstr "在自由天堂西面的埃斯里克的坟墓中找到埃斯里克的头骨，将它交给自由天堂的盖贝里·卡特曼。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1156
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:131
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Kill the Queen of the Spiders in the Abandoned Temple in New Sorpigal and return with her heart to Buford T. Allman in New Sorpigal."
msgstr "除掉新索匹格的废庙中的蜘蛛女王，并把它的心带给新索匹格镇的布福德·提·奥曼。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1157
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:132
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Deface the altar in the Monolith west of Silver Cove and return to Eleanor Vanderbilt in Silver Cove."
msgstr "摧毁在银湾镇西面独立碑中的祭坛并返回银湾镇的埃里诺·范德贝尔特处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1160
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:135
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Destroy the crystal in the Temple of the Fist and return to Winston Schezar in Bootleg Bay."
msgstr "摧毁神拳庙中的水晶并返回布特雷格湾的温斯顿·舒则处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1162
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:137
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Rescue Emmanuel from the Temple of the Snake near Blackshire and return him to Joanne Cravitz in Blackshire."
msgstr "从布莱克郡附近的巨蛇庙中解救埃曼纽尔，并把他带回布莱克郡的乔安娜·克拉维兹处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1163
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:138
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find the lost artifact in the Dragoons' Keep near Castle Temper and return it to Zoltan Phelps in Free Haven."
msgstr "在坦普城堡附近的龙骑兵堡垒里找到失落的神器，并把它交给自由天堂的佐尔丹·菲尔普。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1164
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:139
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Rescue Sharry from the Shadow Guild Hideout and return with her to Frank Fairchild in New Sorpigal."
msgstr "将雪莉从阴影教隐蔽所救出来，并带她前往新索匹格镇的弗兰克·费尔基德处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1165
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:140
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Rescue Angela from the Abandoned Temple and return her to Violet Dawson in New Sorpigal."
msgstr "将安吉拉从废庙中救出来，并带她前往新索匹格镇的威尔特·德沃森处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1166
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:141
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Rescue Sherell from the cannibals on the islands east of Free Haven and return with her to Carlo Tormini in Free Haven."
msgstr "将谢勒尔从布特雷格湾岛屿上的食人族手中解救出来，并带她前往自由天堂的卡尔罗·托米尼处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1167
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:142
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Destroy the Werewolf's altar in the Lair of the Wolf and return to Maria Trepan in Blackshire."
msgstr "摧毁狼穴中的狼人祭坛并返回布莱克郡的玛利亚·特里潘处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1169
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:144
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find the Pearl of Putrescence in the Lair of the Wolf and bring it to the Ghost of Balthasar, also in the Lair of the Wolf."
msgstr "在狼穴中找到腐败珍珠，交给同在狼穴中的幽灵巴塞萨。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1170
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:145
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Retrieve the jewelled egg from Castle Kriegspire and return it to Emil Lime in Kriegspire village."
msgstr "在克里格斯城堡中找回宝石蛋，交还给克里格斯镇的埃米尔·利姆。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1171
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:146
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Unward the doors in the Hall of the Fire Lord and return to the Lord of Fire, also in the Hall of the Fire Lord."
msgstr "解开烈火爵士的大厅中被魔力锁住的门，然后返回烈火爵士处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1188
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:163
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find Memory Crystal Alpha in the Supreme Temple of Baa and restore it to a module altar at the Oracle beneath the High Council.."
msgstr "前往超级羊鸣庙，找到阿尔法记忆水晶，把它放回到高级议会地下的恩洛斯神使的模块坛处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1189
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:164
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find Memory Crystal Beta in Castle Alamos and restore it to a module altar at the Oracle beneath the High Council."
msgstr "前往阿拉莫斯城堡，找到贝塔记忆水晶，把它放回到高级议会地下的恩洛斯神使的模块坛处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1190
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:165
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find Memory Crystal Delta in Castle Darkmoor and restore it to a module altar at the Oracle beneath the High Council."
msgstr "前往黑摩尔城堡，找到德尔塔记忆水晶，把它放回到高级议会地下的恩洛斯神使的模块坛处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1191
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:166
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find Memory Crystal Epsilon in Castle Kriegspire and restore it to a module altar at the Oracle beneath the High Council."
msgstr "前往克里格斯城堡，找到伊普斯隆记忆水晶，把它放回到高级议会地下的恩洛斯神使的模块坛处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1192
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:167
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Retrieve the Control Cube from the Tomb of Varn in Dragonsand and return to the Oracle beneath the High Council."
msgstr "从飞龙沙漠的维兰坟墓中找回控制块，并返回高级议会地下的恩洛斯神使处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1226
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:201
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find a cure for Slicker Silvertongue in the Superior Temple of Baa east of Castle Kriegspire and return to Wilbur Humphrey with the good news."
msgstr "在克里格斯城堡东面的顶级羊鸣庙中找到治疗斯里克·席尔瓦托恩的方法，并带着好消息回到威尔伯·汉弗里处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1227
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:202
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Bring the the letter detailing Silvertongue's treason to the High Council in Free Haven."
msgstr "把证明斯里克·席尔瓦托恩叛国的信件交给自由天堂的高级议会。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1230
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:205
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find and destroy the Book of Liches in Castle Darkmoor and return to Terry Ros in Darkmoor village."
msgstr "在黑摩尔城堡中找到并摧毁巫妖之书，然后返回黑摩尔镇的德里·罗斯处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1245
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:220
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Place the statuettes in Sweet Water, Kriegspire, Dragonsand, Mire of the Damned, and Bootleg Bay and return to Twillen in Blackshire."
msgstr "把小雕像放在甜水镇、克里格斯、飞龙沙漠、幽灵沼泽和布特雷格湾，然后返回布莱克郡的特威伦处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1261
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Quests.txt.py:236
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Obtain Arcane Magic from Archibald in the Royal Library in Castle Ironfist"
msgstr "从铁拳城堡皇家图书馆阿基巴德处获得神秘的魔法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/SCI-FI.STR.py:3
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SCI-FI.STR.py:3
msgctxt "location"
msgid "Storage Container"
msgstr "储存容器"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/SCI-FI.STR.py:4
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SCI-FI.STR.py:4
msgctxt "location"
msgid "Computer Terminal"
msgstr "电脑终端"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/SCI-FI.STR.py:5
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SCI-FI.STR.py:5
msgctxt "location"
msgid "It's a short circuit!"
msgstr "短路！"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/SCI-FI.STR.py:12
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SCI-FI.STR.py:12
msgctxt "location"
msgid "Hello and welcome to this self-guided tour of the Varn Planetary Control Facility.  We gladly welcome all visitors.  As you arrive at each key area, be sure to check any of our display screens for more information.  Enjoy your tour!"
msgstr "您好，欢迎您使用自助导航参观维兰行星控制设施。我们热烈欢迎所有的游客。当您到达每个关键地点时，别忘了查看我们的显示屏幕以获取更多信息。祝您旅途愉快！"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/SCI-FI.STR.py:13
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SCI-FI.STR.py:13
msgctxt "location"
msgid "This is the main equipment storage and repair facility.  By now, you may have noticed several floating Drone-bots.  They are responsible both for maintaining the key systems of this facility as well as sanitation.  If a unit becomes damaged, it is brought here to be repaired."
msgstr "这里是主要的装备储藏室和维修设施。您也许注意到了几个浮在半空中的无人驾驶飞行机器人，它们负责维护该设施的主系统并保持设施的清洁。当一个作战单元损坏了的时候，就送到这儿来修理。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/SCI-FI.STR.py:14
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SCI-FI.STR.py:14
msgctxt "location"
msgid "The room to your left is the main meeting hall.  Visiting dignitaries from around the world have feasted at banquets held in their honor.  In fact, it is said that at his 21st birthday party King Sheridan nearly choked to death on a piece of mogred, but was saved by a serving girl who he later married and made his Queen.  Ahh, l’amour."
msgstr "您左面的房间是主会客大厅，自世界各地到访的显贵们都曾在此享用为他们准备的豪宴。据说在谢里丹国王21岁的生日那天，他差点被一根莫格里德怪兽骨头噎死，一个侍女救了他，那个侍女后来嫁给他，成了他的皇后。啊，爱情。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/SCI-FI.STR.py:15
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SCI-FI.STR.py:15
msgctxt "location"
msgid "Chief Engineer Wilson’s Personal Log.  I have locked myself in Storage Room #6 but currently have no means of escape.  The drone-bots have gone mad and have started killing everyone in sight.  I was able to access the main control terminal on Level Four despite warnings of a hazardous leak, and I sent a distress signal, but since we have not had contact with any of the colonies for several weeks, I do not believe that a rescue is possible.  I have also managed to seal this facility so that the drones can not escape.  It is my hope that the colonists will be able to mount some sort of defense by the time my encryption codes are broken.  Tell Emma I love her.  Wilson out."
msgstr "总工程师威尔森的个人日志：我把自己锁在6号储藏室，现无法逃脱。飞行机器人疯了，见人就杀。我不顾有害物泄露的警告，去第4层主控制终端发出了求援，但我们和任何殖民星都已失联数周，救援无望。我还设法把整个设施封了起来，以防飞行机器人逃出。望殖民星人在密码被破解前设置防御。告诉艾玛我爱她。威尔森绝笔。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/SCI-FI.STR.py:16
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SCI-FI.STR.py:16
msgctxt "location"
msgid "We apologize for any inconvenience, but we ask that all personnel evacuate the facility at this time.  Please do not be alarmed.  Thank you."
msgstr "请所有人员立即撤离本设施，造成的不便我们非常抱歉。请不要惊慌。谢谢。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/SCI-FI.STR.py:17
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SCI-FI.STR.py:17
msgctxt "location"
msgid "Before entering the Planetary Reaction Chamber, please request a pair of Safety Goggles from one of our Drones.  During peak hours of operation, this facility can generate enough power to produce a light bright enough to be seen from space.  Please avoid looking directly into the light."
msgstr "在进入行星反应室之前，请向无人驾驶飞行机器人索取一副护目镜。在运转高峰时段，该设施会产生大量能量，此能量产生的强光在太空中都能看得见。为避免损害眼睛，请不要直视光线。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/SCI-FI.STR.py:18
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SCI-FI.STR.py:18
msgctxt "location"
msgid "Alert, environmental controls are offline on Level Four, Sections 18 through 96.  Access restricted to drones until further notice."
msgstr "注意，第四层的18至96区的环境控制系统已停止运转，在另行通知前，只允许无人驾驶飞行机器人进入该区域。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/SCI-FI.STR.py:19
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SCI-FI.STR.py:19
msgctxt "location"
msgid "Warning, intruder alert, Level Four, Section.  All drones proceed to Level Four to intercept intruders.  Reactor is offline.  Encryption integrity at 2.064%.  Warning, intruder alert, Level Four…"
msgstr "警告，有入侵者，在第四层。所有无人驾驶飞行机器人前往第四层，拦截入侵者。反应器已停止运转。密码完整性为2.064%。警告，有入侵者，在第四层……"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/SCI-FI.STR.py:20
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SCI-FI.STR.py:20
msgctxt "location"
msgid "Blaster weapons provide an effective, accurate ranged attack.  To operate the blaster, hold the grip comfortably in your hand, point the barrel at your target, and gently squeeze the trigger.  Should the weapon misfire, do not look into the barrel- give the weapon to an instructor and let them fix the problem.  Never point a blaster at something you do not want to vaporize."
msgstr "榴弹枪可以进行高效、准确的远程攻击。要操作该武器，请用手舒适地握住握把，将枪管对准目标，然后轻轻地扣下扳机。如果射不出子弹，不要朝枪管里看——把武器交给指导员，他们会去修的。千万不要将榴弹枪对着你不想轰掉的人或物体。"

