msgid "Permits use of sword in left hand"
msgstr "可左手运剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:4
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:4
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:4
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:4
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "While daggers don’t do the kind of damage that a sword or an axe can deliver, they are very quick—sometimes letting you get two attacks for every one of your slower opponents'.  Expert dagger fighters can wield a dagger in their left hand while using another weapon in their right.  Master dagger fighters have a chance of doing a triple damage attack."
msgstr "匕首虽没有长剑和战斧的杀伤力，但疾如闪电——有时对于一个行动迟缓的敌人，他攻击你一次的时间内你可以攻击他两次。匕首专家可左手持匕首右手挥舞其它武器；匕首大师有时可使出三倍杀伤。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:4
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:4
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:4
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:4
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Permits use of dagger in left hand"
msgstr "可左手使用匕首"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:4
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:4
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:4
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:4
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Chance to cause triple damage equal to skill"
msgstr "可以击出三倍伤害，其概率百分比等于技能等级"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:5
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:5
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "While rather slow on the attack, axes do a lot of damage when they hit.  Expert axe fighters gain a little more speed on their attacks while master axe fighters can deliver extra damage."
msgstr "战斧虽招数缓慢，但一旦击中，杀伤巨大。战斧专家的攻击速度有少许提升；大师则可提高斧头的攻击杀伤。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:4
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:5
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:8
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:2
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:4
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:5
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:8
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:4
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:5
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:8
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:5
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:6
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:8
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Skill added to Attack Damage"
msgstr "技能等级可增加攻击杀伤力"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:6
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Spear covers all kinds of pole weapons with blades attached to the business end.  Spears are versatile and can be used one or two handed (they work better with two hands).  Expert ranking in the spear will increase your armor class and master ranking will boost damage."
msgstr "长矛技能涵盖了各种带有刀刃的杆式武器用法，既可以单手也可以双手使用（双手效果更好）。成为长矛专家可提高防御等级；而大师则可增加杀伤。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:7
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:7
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:7
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:7
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Bow skill covers both bow and crossbow usage.  Expert archers gain a speed increase with their weapon, while master archers can fire two arrows with every attack."
msgstr "弓箭技能涵盖了长弓和十字弓的用法。弓箭专家可提高射箭速度；而弓箭大师每次可射两支箭。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:7
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:7
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:7
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:7
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Bow fires two arrows on every attack"
msgstr "每次攻击发射两支箭"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:8
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:8
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Mace skill covers all kinds of blunt trauma weapons ranging from batons to flails.  Expert mace swingers do extra damage with their weapons while master ranking gives a chance to stun opponents."
msgstr "钉锤指所有的钝击武器，包括钉锤和大锤。钉锤专家可提高该武器的杀伤；而大师则有机会将敌人击晕。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:9
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:9
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "A weapon from before the Silence, their making has long since been lost.  Expert and Master Blasters gain double and triple accuracy with these awesome weapons."
msgstr "这种武器出自寂静时代之前，制作方法早已失传。专家和大师等级的使用者能使这些强大武器的攻击准确度分别乘以2和3。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:9
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:9
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:9
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:9
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Skill added to Attack Bonus (double effect)"
msgstr "技能等级可增加攻击点数（效果乘以2）"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:9
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:9
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:9
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:9
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Skill added to Attack Bonus (triple effect)"
msgstr "技能等级可增加攻击点数（效果乘以3）"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:10
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:10
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Shield skill directly improves a character’s armor class while a shield is employed.  Expert and master ranking in the shield increase this defensive bonus."
msgstr "盾牌技能可在手持盾牌时直接提高防御等级。盾牌的专家和大师可额外增强防御能力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:10
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:11
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:34
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:10
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:11
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:34
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:10
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:11
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:32
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:10
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Skill added to Armor Class (double effect)"
msgstr "技能等级可提高防御等级（效果乘以2）"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:34
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:34
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:32
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:10
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Skill added to Armor Class (triple effect)"
msgstr "技能等级可提高防御等级（效果乘以3）"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:11
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:11
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Leather armor is the lightest armor a character can wear.  While leather provides less protection than chain or plate armor, it also slows your character down the least.  Leather armor skill increases the protection offered by leather armor.  As with all armors, Expert and master ranking both reduce the amount the armor slows you down."
msgstr "皮甲是分量最轻的盔甲，防御力逊于锁甲和钢甲，但负重相对较轻，不致于将行动拖得过慢。皮甲技能可增强皮甲的防护能力。专家和大师可减少皮甲对行动速度的影响。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:11
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:12
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:13
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Recovery penalty reduced"
msgstr "减少恢复时间惩罚"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:10
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:11
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:12
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:13
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:10
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:11
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:12
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Skilldes.txt.py:13
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:10
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:11
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:12
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:13
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:11
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:12
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:13
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Recovery penalty eliminated"
msgstr "无恢复时间惩罚"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:12
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:12
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Chain armor is the medium armor type.  It provides more protection than leather and less than plate, but it also slows your character down more than leather.  Chain armor skill increases the protection offered by chain armor.  As with all armors, Expert and master ranking both reduce the amount the armor slows you down."
msgstr "锁甲是中型盔甲，防御力强于皮甲但逊于钢甲，对行动速度的影响也大于皮甲而小于钢甲。锁甲技能可增强锁甲的防护能力。专家和大师可减少锁甲对行动速度的影响。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:13
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:13
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Plate armor is the heaviest armor type.  It provides the most protection, but it slows your character down more than leather or chain.  Plate armor skill increases the protection offered by plate armor.  As with all armors, Expert and master ranking both reduce the amount the armor slows you down."
msgstr "钢甲是分量最重的盔甲，防御力最强，但对行动速度的影响也大于皮甲和锁甲。钢甲技能可增强钢甲的防护能力。专家和大师可减少钢甲对行动速度的影响。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SKILLDES.TXT.py:14
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/SKILLDES.TXT.py:14
msgctxt "skilldes"
msgid "Fire magic is a good source of offensive spells and includes spells having to do with speed.  Expert and master ranking permit access to greater versions of fire spells."
msgstr "火系魔法包含许多强大的攻击性魔法和速度有关的魔法。精于此道的专家和大师可以掌握魔法的更高形式。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:14
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:15
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Skilldes.txt.py:16
