#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:206
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:42
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "When the Landing commences, Communications Officer, take this code scroll to the central control chamber and speak activator key 'aruhu' when prompted.  All of the senior officers must present their code scrolls and keys to open the way."
msgstr "当着陆开始的时候，通讯官，把这个密码卷轴拿到中心控制室，在弹出提示时输入激活密码“aruhu”。每个高级官员都必须出示他们各自的密码卷轴并输入密码来开启大门。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:207
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:43
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "When the Landing commences, Engineer, take this code scroll to the central control chamber and speak activator key 'yttocs' when prompted.  All of the senior officers must present their code scrolls and keys to open the way."
msgstr "当着陆开始的时候，工程师，把这个密码卷轴拿到中心控制室，在弹出提示时输入激活密码“yttocs”。每个高级官员都必须出示他们各自的密码卷轴并输入密码来开启大门。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:208
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:44
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "When the Landing commences, Doctor, take this code scroll to the central control chamber and speak activator key 'yoccm' when prompted.  All of the senior officers must present their code scrolls and keys to open the way."
msgstr "当着陆开始的时候，医生，把这个密码卷轴拿到中心控制室，在弹出提示时输入激活密码“yoccm”。每个高级官员都必须出示他们各自的密码卷轴并输入密码来开启大门。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:210
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:46
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "The ritual described on this scroll seems to be a complex magical formula requiring the caster to face the target from a distance and follow a lengthy and exacting series of steps.  You can't figure out what the effect of the spell will be once it's been cast."
msgstr "此经文上所描述的仪式好像是一种要求施法者在远处面向目标，经过冗长繁琐的步骤才能成功的复杂的魔法。你很难想象这种魔法的威力到底有多大。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:212
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:48
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Congratulations!  I hereby proclaim you all Super-Goobers!"
msgstr "祝贺你们！我宣布你们是伟大的花生超人！"

