#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:8
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Reduces the time it takes to recover from casting a spell or attacking with a weapon.  Characters will be weak for six hours after this spell wears off."
msgstr "减少角色发射魔法或兵器攻击后的所需的恢复时间。在此魔法失效后六小时内角色将处于虚弱状态。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:7
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:7
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:7
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:8
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 1 hour + 1 minute per skill point"
msgstr "持续时间为1小时加上1分钟乘以魔法等级"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:52
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:81
