#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:84
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Spell affects entire party"
msgstr "对所有角色有效"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:7
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:7
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:7
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:8
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 1 hour + 3 minutes per skill point"
msgstr "持续时间为1小时加上3分钟乘以魔法等级"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:8
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:9
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Another Sorcerer’s favorite, fireball targets a single monster, but explodes to hurt anyone else caught in the blast.  If your party is too close to the blast, they will be hurt as well.  Fireball does 1-6 points of damage per point of skill in Fire Magic."
msgstr "这是另一个深受巫师青睐的魔法。火球可攻击单个怪兽，但爆炸时会伤害所有爆炸范围内的目标。如果距离太近，你自己也可能受到伤害。其攻击力为魔法等级乘以1-6。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:10
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Generates a ring of fire around the party that damages all monsters it contacts.  Happily, Ring of Fire is safe and will not damage your own characters.  Ring of Fire does six points of damage plus one per point of skill in Fire Magic."
msgstr "形成一个火焰攻击圈，对周围所有在有效范围内的怪兽进行打击，并且不会危及你的自身。攻击力为6点加上你的魔法等级。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:10
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Small radius of effect around party"
msgstr "角色周围小范围有效"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:10
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Larger radius"
msgstr "较大范围有效"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:10
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Quicker recovery rate"
msgstr "恢复最快"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:11
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Launches streaks of fire in the direction the characters are facing.  The bolts only hit monsters that stand in their way, so a little aiming practice will help you get the most benefit from Fire Blast.  Fire Blast does 4 points of damage plus 1-3 per point of skill in Fire Magic."
msgstr "向角色面前的目标发射火焰束。由于只能向正前方攻击，所以需要提高准确性。攻击力为4点加上自身魔法等级的1-3倍。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:11
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Slow rate of recovery and 3 shots"
msgstr "恢复慢，可以发射3束"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:11
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Moderate rate of recovery and 5 shots"
msgstr "恢复速度中等，可以发射5束"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:11
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Quick rate of recovery and 7 shots"
msgstr "恢复较快，可以发射7束"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:11
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:11
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:11
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:12
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Meteor Shwr"
msgstr "流星火雨"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:11
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:12
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Summons flaming rocks from the sky in a large radius surrounding your chosen target.  Try not to be near the victim when you use this spell.  A single meteor does 8 points of damage plus 1 per point of skill in Fire Magic.  This spell only works outdoors."
msgstr "招唤天空的陨石降落在所选中的目标周围。施法时不能离目标太近，以免危及自身。攻击力为8点加上自身的魔法等级。只能在室外使用。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:12
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Slow rate of recovery and 8 meteors"
msgstr "恢复慢，有8颗陨石"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:12
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Moderate rate of recovery and 12 meteors"
msgstr "恢复速度中等，有12颗陨石"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:12
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Quick rate of recovery and 16 meteors"
msgstr "恢复较快，有16颗陨石"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:12
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:13
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Inferno burns all monsters in sight when cast, excluding your characters.  Good for cleaning out rooms full of weak or moderate strength monsters in one or two easy castings.  Each monster takes 12 points of damage plus 1 per point of skill in Fire Magic.  This spell only works indoors."
msgstr "可以把视野中的所有目标全部付之一炬，并不会危及自身。最适于消灭大批蜂拥而来的中弱级别怪兽。对每个怪物的攻击伤害为12点加上魔法等级。只能在室内使用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:4
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:30
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:4
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:30
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:4
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:30
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:13
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:14
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:37
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:50
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:73
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:85
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:86
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:110
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Slow rate of recovery"
msgstr "恢复较慢"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:13
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:14
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Amongst the strongest direct damage spells available, Incinerate inflicts massive damage on a single target.  Only the strongest of monsters can expect to survive this spell.  Damage is 15 points plus 1-15 per point of skill in Fire Magic."
msgstr "它是最具威力的单一目标攻击魔法之一。摧毁力极大，只有最强大的怪兽才有可能侥幸逃生。攻击力为15点加上魔法等级的1-15倍。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:15
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:16
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Wizard Eye causes the automap located in the upper right corner of the main gaming screen to show the locations of monsters and other points of interest while outdoors.  The spell lasts 1 hour per point of skill in Air Magic."
msgstr "魔力神眼能在屏幕右上角的小地图中标明怪物所处位置和室外的其他值得一去的地点。持续时间为1小时乘以魔法等级。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:15
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:15
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:15
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:16
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Only shows terrain and monsters"
msgstr "只显示地形和怪物"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:15
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:15
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:15
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:16
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Shows treasure"
msgstr "显示财宝"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:16
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Shows \"points of interest\""
msgstr "显示“值得一去”的地点"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:17
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Static Chrg"
msgstr "电石火花"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:17
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Targets a single monster with a jolt of static electricity.  It only does 2-6 points of damage, but it always hits.  "
msgstr "向单一目标发射静电束。攻击力只有2-6点，但百发百中。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:18
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Protection from Electricity"
msgstr "御电奇术"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:18
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases all your characters’ resistance to Electricity by an amount equal to your skill in Air Magic."
msgstr "增加所有角色的电系抗性。增加的抗性等于空气魔法技能等级。魔法持续时间等于空气魔法技能等级乘以1小时。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:18
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:18
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:19
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Moderate recovery rate, 3 sparks"
msgstr "恢复速度中等，有3个光球"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:18
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:18
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:19
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster recovery rate, 5 sparks"
msgstr "恢复较快，有5个光球"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:19
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fastest recovery rate, 7 sparks"
msgstr "恢复最快，有7个光球"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:16
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:20
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Feather Fall prevents your characters from being hurt when falling more than ten feet by slowing the speed of the fall.  Feather Fall affects your entire party with one casting and has a duration based on your skill in Air Magic. "
msgstr "它能当角色从高于十英尺高处跳下时减慢降落速度，避免受伤。此魔法只要一个角色施法，其他角色均可受益。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:16
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:70
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:106
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:111
