#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:58
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 1 hour + 15 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "持续时间为1小时加上15分钟乘以魔法等级"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:21
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:21
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:21
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:22
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Lightning"
msgstr "霹雳闪电"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:21
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:22
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Sorcerer’s Darling, Lightning Bolt discharges electricity from the caster’s hand to a single target.  It always hits and does 1-8 points of damage per point of skill in Air Magic."
msgstr "它是深受巫师青睐的武器之一。可以向单一目标发射电光霹雳，而且百发百中。攻击力为自身魔法等级的1-8倍。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:19
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:23
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Jump launches your party up in the air, landing you 60 feet from where you started.  Your party takes no falling damage from the jump."
msgstr "它能使角色一跃到达六十英尺的高处，而且在掉下时毫发无损。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:23
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Slow recovery rate (faster for high skill ranking)"
msgstr "恢复较慢"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:23
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:23
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:23
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:24
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Implosion is a nasty spell that affects a single target by destroying the air around it, causing a sudden inrush from the surrounding air, a thunderclap, and 10 points plus 1-10 points of damage per point of skill in Air Magic."
msgstr "这是一个肮脏的魔法，它通过破坏周围的空气，造成周围空气的突然涌入，形成霹雳，来伤害单个目标。它的攻击力为10点加上自身魔法等级的1-10倍。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:24
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:25
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Grants the power of flight to your characters!  This spell is very expensive and only works outdoors, but it is very useful.  Fly will drain one spell point every five minutes it is in use (I.E. when you aren't touching the ground)."
msgstr "使你的角色具备飞行的能力。这个魔法消耗非常大，并只限在室外使用，但能使你受益颇多。使用时每5分钟消耗1点魔法值。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:26
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Calls stars from the heavens to smite and burn your enemies.  Expert and Master ranking in this spell both increase the number of stars called and speed recovery.  The damage for each star is 20 points plus 1 per point of skill in Air Magic, and Starburst only works outdoors.  Try not to get caught in the blast…"
msgstr "召唤天空中的群星痛击敌人并把他们付之一炬。达到此魔法的专家和大师等级可以增加召唤的星数并缩短恢复时间。它的攻击力为20点加上自身魔法等级。这项魔法只能在室外使用，有可能伤及自身。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:26
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Slow recovery rate and 8 stars"
msgstr "恢复较慢，有8颗星"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:26
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster recovery rate and 12 stars"
msgstr "恢复较快，有12颗星"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:26
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fastest recovery rate and 16 stars"
msgstr "恢复最快，有16颗星"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:27
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:27
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:27
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:28
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Automatically awakens all of your characters from a normal sleep and will awaken them from a magical sleep if they haven't had the sleep condition for too long.  The greater your skill in Water Magic, the longer the sleep condition could have been present before this spell becomes ineffective."
msgstr "可以自动把所有角色从睡梦中唤醒，如果是因为中了魔法而睡着，只要时间不是太久，也可以觉醒。可以唤醒的最长睡着时间视你的水系魔法技能等级而定。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:27
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:27
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:27
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:28
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if asleep less than 3 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "可以唤醒的最长睡着时间为3分钟乘以魔法等级"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:27
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:27
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:27
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:28
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if asleep less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "可以唤醒的最长睡着时间为1小时乘以魔法等级"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:27
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:27
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:27
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:28
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if asleep less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "可以唤醒的最长睡着时间为1天乘以魔法等级"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:29
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Targets a single monster with a field of extreme cold for an instant.  It only does 2-6 points of damage, but it always hits.  The more skill you have in Water Magic, the faster you will recover from casting Cold Beam.  Masters of Water can cast this spell without cost."
msgstr "可以向单一目标发射冰冻飞弹。它的攻击力只有2-6点，但百发百中。你的水系魔法越高，发射后的恢复时间越短。水系魔法的大师可以不耗点数发射此魔法。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:30
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases all your characters’ resistance to Cold by an amount equal to your skill in Water Magic.  This spell lasts for one hour per point of skill in Water Magic."
msgstr "增加所有角色的冰系抗性。增加的抗性等于水系魔法技能等级。魔法持续时间等于水系魔法技能等级乘以1小时。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:28
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:28
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:28
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:31
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Poison Spr"
msgstr "毒液喷发"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:31
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Sprays poison at monsters directly in front of your characters.  Damage is low, but few monsters have resistance to poison, so it usually works.  Each shot does 2 points of damage plus 1-2 per point of skill in Water Magic."
msgstr "可以向你正前方的怪兽喷射毒液。尽管攻击力较差，但因为大多数怪兽不具防毒能力，所以非常有效。每次发射的攻击力为2点加上自身魔法等级的1-2倍。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:31
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Moderate recovery rate and 1 shot"
msgstr "恢复速度中等，可以发射一束"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:31
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster recovery rate and 3 shots"
msgstr "恢复较快，可以发射三束"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:31
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fastest recovery rate and 5 shots"
msgstr "恢复最快，可以发射五束"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:31
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:32
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Only useful outdoors, Water Walk lets your characters walk along the surface of water without sinking.  This spell can be very useful, but constantly drains one spell point every 20 minutes while in contact with water."
msgstr "只能在室外使用。可以使你的角色在水面行走自如。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:33
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fires a single bolt of ice at a single target.  It always hits and does 1-7 points of damage per point of skill in Water Magic."
msgstr "可以向单一目标发射寒冰霹雳。攻击力为自身魔法等级的1-7倍。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:34
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Gives a chance to imbue a normal item with magical powers.  The chance of success is 10% per point of skill in Water Magic.  Experts manage better enchantments, and only masters can enchant weapons."
msgstr "使角色点化普通物品使其具有魔力。成功率为10%乘以魔法等级数。只有达到大师级水平才可以点化武器。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:34
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Weak enchantments only"
msgstr "点化威力较弱"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:34
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Stronger enchantments"
msgstr "点化威力较强"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:34
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Allows enchantment of weapons"
msgstr "可以点化武器"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:35
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Acid burst squirts a jet of extremely caustic acid at a single victim.  It always hits and does 9 points of damage plus 1-9 per point of skill.  The big advantage of this spell is few monsters are resistant to acid."
msgstr "可以向单一目标发射强酸。它的攻击力为9点加上自身魔法等级的1-9倍，并且百发百中。绝大多数怪兽不具有抗酸能力。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:36
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Town Portal teleports the party to the central fountain of the last town visited.  Town Portal has a 10% chance per point of Water Magic skill of working when cast.  "
msgstr "该魔法可把队伍远距离传送到上次去过的镇子中央喷泉边。成功概率为10%乘以魔法等级。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:36
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Outdoors only"
msgstr "只在室外有效"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:36
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Indoors OK"
msgstr "可以在室内使用"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:36
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works anywhere and gives choice of destination"
msgstr "在任何地点均有效，并可直达目的地"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:37
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fires a ball of ice in the direction the caster is facing.  The ball will shatter when it hits something, launching 7 shards of ice in all directions except the caster’s.  The shards will ricochet until they strike a creature or melt.  Each shard does 12 points of damage plus 1-2 per point of skill in Water Magic."
msgstr "可以向正前方的目标发射冰球。当冰球击中目标会散出七块碎片向四周发散，但不会危及角色自身。每块碎片的攻击力为12点加上自身魔法等级的1-2倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:37
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:37
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:37
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:38
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Lloyd's"
msgstr "时空道标"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:38
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Lloyd’s Beacon lets you place a marker at a location you want to teleport back to in the future.  Just how far in the future depends on your skill and ranking in Water Magic.  Cast this spell whenever you wish to either place a marker or return to one.  "
msgstr "该项魔法可以让你在将来想要远程传送回来的地点上设置一个标记（道标）。道标持续而不消失的时间的长短根据你的水系魔法等级和头衔（普通/专家/大师）而定。当你想传送回某个旧道标处，或是想设置一个新道标，或是想更新一个旧道标时，请施展该魔法。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:38
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "1 Beacon, decays in 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "有1个道标，持续时间为1小时乘以魔法等级"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:38
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "3 Beacons, decays in 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "有3个道标，持续时间为1天乘以魔法等级"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:38
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "5 Beacons, decays in 1 week per point of skill"
msgstr "有5个道标，持续时间为1周乘以魔法等级"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:39
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:39
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:39
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:40
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Slaps a monster with magical force, forcing it to recover from the stun spell before it can do anything else.  Stun also knocks monsters back a little, giving you a chance to get away while the getting is good.  The greater your skill in Earth Magic, the greater the effect of the spell."
msgstr "可以使你用魔法击打怪兽使其失去知觉，但不能取它性命。你的魔法等级越多，该魔法的威力越大。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:39
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:40
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:39
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:40
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:39
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:40
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:40
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Normal effect"
msgstr "威力一般"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:39
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:39
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:39
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:40
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Stronger effect"
msgstr "威力较大"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:39
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:39
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:39
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:40
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Strongest effect"
msgstr "威力最大"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:41
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Creates and fires a single magical arrow.  Unlike most spells, this spell is inaccurate and has the same chance of hitting as a regular arrow (using your Earth Magic skill as a bonus to hit).  Also unlike most spells, Magic Arrow is free to cast when you become a Master of Earth.  The arrow does 3-8 points of damage."
msgstr "可以产生并发射魔法箭。不同于其他魔法，它的准确性极差。当你达到该魔法的大师级水准，就可以不消耗点数而发射魔法。每箭的攻击力为3-8点。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:42
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases all your characters’ resistance to magic by an amount equal to your skill in Earth Magic."
msgstr "增加所有角色的魔系抗性。增加的抗性等于土系魔法技能等级。魔法持续时间等于土系魔法技能等级乘以1小时。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:42
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:42
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:42
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:43
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Swarm"
msgstr "致命毒蜂"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:43
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Summons a swarm of biting, stinging insects to bedevil a single target.  The swarm only does 5 points of damage plus 1-3 per point of skill in Earth Magic, but it never misses and the damage is physical, making resistance to this spell unlikely."
msgstr "可以使你召唤大批蜇人蜂袭击单一的目标。每群蜂群的攻击力为5点加上自身魔法等级的1-3倍。该魔法百试不爽，并且无人能抵御该魔法攻击。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:44
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases the armor class of a character by 5 + 1 point per point of skill in Earth Magic."
msgstr "提高某个角色的防御等级，增加点数为5点加上魔法等级。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:45
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fires a rotating, razor-thin metal blade at a single monster.  This spell can miss, and damage and chance to hit rely heavily on Earth Magic skill.  The blade does 1-5 points of damage per point of skill in Earth Magic."
msgstr "可以向单一目标发射旋转刀刃。该魔法会射偏，土系魔法技能高度影响其杀伤力和击中怪物的几率。每片刀刃的攻击力为自身魔法等级的1-5倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:45
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:45
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:45
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:46
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Stone - Flesh"
msgstr "解除石化"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:45
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:46
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Removes the stoned condition from a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Earth Magic the longer the condition could have been present before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr "如果及时发射此魔法可以破解石化魔法，恢复原形。魔法技能等级越高，它可以破解的受害时间就越长（只要没有超过恢复临界点）。但超过了有效救治时间，又没有普渡众生魔法，要破解魔法只能去神庙救治。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:46
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if stoned less than 3 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "可以破解的最长石化时间为3分钟乘以魔法等级"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:45
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:45
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:45
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:46
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if stoned less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "可以破解的最长石化时间为1小时乘以魔法等级"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:45
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:45
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:45
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:46
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if stoned less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "可以破解的最长石化时间为1天乘以魔法等级"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:46
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:47
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Releases a magical stone into the world that will explode when it comes into contact with a creature or enough time passes.  The rock will bounce and roll until it finds a resting spot, so be careful not to be caught in the blast.  The explosion causes 1-8 points of damage per point of skill in Earth Magic."
msgstr "可以向目标发射魔法石，石头只有击中目标才会爆炸，并且可能伤害你自己。爆炸威力为魔法等级的1-8倍。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:48
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Turn - Stone"
msgstr "石化大法"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:48
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Temporarily turns a target to stone.  These stone statues are invulnerable to any sort of attack."
msgstr "可以使目标暂时变成石头。任何进攻对这些石头像都无能为力。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:48
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 20 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "持续时间为二十分钟乘以魔法等级"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:48
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:48
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:48
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:49
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Death Blsm"
msgstr "死亡之花"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:49
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fires a magical stone far into the air that creates a very large and powerful explosion when it lands.  The damage is 20 points plus 1 per point of skill in Earth Magic.  This spell can only be used outdoors."
msgstr "可以向空中发射魔法石，该石头落地后产生的爆炸威力极大，范围极广。攻击力为20点加上自身的魔法等级。只能在室外使用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:12
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:48
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:12
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:48
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:12
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:48
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:49
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Moderate rate of recovery"
msgstr "恢复速度中等"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:49
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster recovery, larger radius of effect"
msgstr "恢复较快，有效范围较大"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:49
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fastest recovery, largest radius of effect"
msgstr "恢复最快，有效范围最大"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:49
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:49
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:49
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:50
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Mass Distort"
msgstr "力压千钧"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:49
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:49
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:49
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:50
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases the weight of a single target enormously for an instant, causing internal damage equal to 25% of the monster’s hit points plus another 2% per point of skill in Earth Magic.  The bigger they are, the harder they fall."
msgstr "可以瞬间使目标的重量急剧增加，从而攻击其内部机能。攻击力为该目标生命值的25%加上魔法等级的2%。攻击对象越庞大，攻击力就越大。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:52
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fires an ectoplasmic bolt of negative spiritual energy at a single target.  Spirit arrow can miss, but a higher skill in Spirit Magic increases your chances of hitting.  The arrow causes 1-6 points of damage."
msgstr "可以向单一目标发射具有反精神能量的外质霹雳。该魔法有时会错过目标，但灵魂魔法的高超技能可以弥补其攻击成功率。它的攻击力为1-6点。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:52
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Moderate recovery"
msgstr "恢复速度中等"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:3
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:16
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:3
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:16
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:3
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:16
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:54
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:52
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster recovery"
msgstr "恢复较快"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:52
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Casting cost 0."
msgstr "不消耗魔法"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:52
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:52
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:52
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:53
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Blessed characters have an increased chance to hit monsters in hand to hand combat and with missiles.  A character’s bonus to hit is increased by 5 + 1 per point of skill in Spirit Magic."
msgstr "可以帮助角色在近身和远程攻击中提高击中怪物的几率。该角色的击中怪物几率增加点数为5点加上魔法等级。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:54
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Healing"
msgstr "回春妙手"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:54
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cheaply heals a single character of 3-7 hit points.  Skill increases the recovery rate of this spell."
msgstr "可以使一个角色的生命值恢复3-7点。该项技能越高，恢复时间越快。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:54
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Heals 3-7 points of damage"
msgstr "修补3-7点生命值"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:54
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Heals 5-9 points of damage"
msgstr "修补6-9点生命值"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:54
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Heals 7-11 points of damage"
msgstr "修补7-11点生命值"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:55
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Temporarily increases a single character’s Luck statistic by 10 points plus 2 per point of skill in Spirit Magic."
msgstr "暂时增加单个角色的运气点数。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:55
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases luck by 10 points plus 2 per point of skill"
msgstr "运气值增加10点加每个魔法等级2点"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:55
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases luck by 10 points plus 3 per point of skill"
msgstr "运气值增加10点加每个魔法等级3点"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:55
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:55
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:55
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:56
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Rmv. Curse"
msgstr "驱魔除咒"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:55
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:56
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Removes the cursed condition from a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Spirit Magic the longer the condition could have been present before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr "如果及时使用该魔法可以破解所受魔法。魔法技能等级越高，可以破解魔法的受害时间越长（没有超过恢复临界点）。但超过了有效救治时间，又没有普渡众生魔法，破解魔法只有去神庙治疗。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:56
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if cursed less than 3 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "可以救治的最长被诅咒时间为3分钟乘以魔法等级"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:55
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:55
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:55
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:56
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if cursed less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "可以救治的最长被诅咒时间为1小时乘以魔法等级"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:55
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:55
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:55
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:56
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if cursed less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "可以救治的最长被诅咒时间为1天乘以魔法等级"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:57
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Guard Angel"
msgstr "守护天使"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:57
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Sets up a compact with the Higher Powers to resurrect your characters  and return them to the last temple you visited upon their deaths.  The price for this service is half of the gold your characters have with them at the time of death.  Guardian Angel lasts for 1 hour per point of skill in Spirit Magic."
msgstr "为你的角色寻求神灵的保护，在死亡后把你的队伍带到你上次去的神庙治疗。你要花费死亡时身上携带的一半金币作为医疗费。该魔法持续为1小时乘以魔法等级。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:57
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Characters are restored to life with 1 hit point each."
msgstr "每个角色复生各剩一点生命值"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:57
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Characters are restored to life with half their hit points"
msgstr "每个角色复生各剩一半生命值"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:57
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Characters are restored to life with all their hit points"
msgstr "每个角色复生并且生命值加满"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:58
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Heroism increases the damage a character does on a successful attack by 5 + 1 point per point of skill in Spirit Magic."
msgstr "一旦角色成功击中目标，该魔法可提高其攻击力。增加点数为5点加上灵魂魔法等级。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:59
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Forces all visible undead monsters to flee until the duration of Turn Undead runs out.  This spell lasts for 3 minutes plus 3 minutes per point of skill in Spirit Magic."
msgstr "使所有视野范围内的亡灵怪兽全部望风而逃。该魔法的有效时间为3分钟加上3分钟乘以魔法等级。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:59
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:60
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Raises a character from the dead if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Spirit Magic the longer the character could have been dead before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only way to raise the character short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple.  Casting this spell will leave your character in the weak condition."
msgstr "如果及时施放该魔法可以有起死回生的作用。灵魂魔法技能等级越高，可以救治的死亡持续时间就越长（没有达到恢复临界点）。但超过有效救治时间，又没有普渡众生魔法，要破解所中魔法只有去神庙治疗。使用该魔法会使你的身体状态降到虚弱。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:60
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if dead less than 3 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "可以救治的最长死亡时间为3分钟乘以魔法等级"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:60
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if dead less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "可以救治的最长死亡时间为1小时乘以魔法等级"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:59
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:59
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:59
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:60
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if dead less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "可以救治的最长死亡时间为1天乘以魔法等级"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:61
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Shared Life combines the life force of your characters and redistributes it amongst them as evenly as possible.  All current hit points are totaled and 1 extra point per point of skill in Spirit Magic is added to this total.  Then the points are distributed back to the characters, with no individual character being allowed to have more points than his maximum total hit points."
msgstr "该魔法可以平均分配你的角色的生命值。所有角色的生命值相加，再加上每魔法等级1点额外的生命值，然后平均分配给每个角色。但是角色所得到的生命值不能超过其最大值。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:61
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Adds 1 hit point per point of skill to the pool"
msgstr "每个魔法等级增加1点全员总生命值"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:61
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Adds 2 hit points per point of skill to the pool"
msgstr "每个魔法等级增加2点全员总生命值"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:60
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:60
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:60
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:61
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Adds 3 hit points per point of skill to the pool"
msgstr "每个魔法等级增加3点全员总生命值"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:62
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Resurrects an eradicated (body destroyed) character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Spirit Magic the longer the condition could have been present before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only way to resurrect the character is to visit a temple.  Casting this spell will leave your character in the weak condition."
msgstr "如果你及时发射该魔法可以使你的灰飞烟灭（尸体也被毁）的角色重新生机勃勃。该项魔法技能等级越高，可以救治的灰飞烟灭持续时间就越长（没有超过恢复临界点）。否则只有去神庙治疗。发射该魔法会使你的身体处于虚弱状态。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:62
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if eradicated less than 3 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "可以救治的最长灰飞烟灭时间为3分钟乘以魔法等级"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:62
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if eradicated less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "可以救治的最长灰飞烟灭时间为1小时乘以魔法等级"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:62
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if eradicated less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "可以救治的最长灰飞烟灭时间为1天乘以魔法等级"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:64
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Temporarily increases a single character’s Intellect and Personality statistics by 10 points plus 2 per point of skill in Mind Magic."
msgstr "可以暂时提高一个角色的智力和个性。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:64
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases Intellect and Personality by 10 points plus 2 per point of skill"
msgstr "智力和个性的增加值为10点加上每个魔法等级2点"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:64
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases Intellect and Personality by 10 points plus 3 per point of skill"
msgstr "智力和个性的增加值为10点加上每个魔法等级3点"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:63
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:65
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Removes the afraid condition from a character if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Mind Magic the longer the condition could have been present before the “point of no return” is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr "如果及时发射该魔法可以摆脱恐惧心理。心智魔法技能等级越高，可以解除的恐惧心理持续时间就越长（没有达到恢复临界点）。但超过有效救治时间，又没有普渡众生魔法，要解除恐惧只有去神庙治疗。"

