msgid "Works if afraid less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "可以治疗的最长恐惧时间为1天乘以魔法等级"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:66
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fires a bolt of mental force damaging to a single targets’ nervous system.  Mind Blast does 5 points of damage plus 1-2 per point of skill in Mind Magic."
msgstr "可以向单一目标的精神系统发射心理的强力霹雳。它的攻击力为5点加上魔法等级的1-2倍。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:67
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Temporarily increases a single character’s Accuracy statistic by 10 points plus 2 per point of skill in Mind Magic."
msgstr "暂时提高一个角色的精确值。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:67
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases Accuracy by 10 points plus 2 per point of skill"
msgstr "精确增加值为10点加上每个魔法等级2点"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:67
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases Accuracy by 10 points plus 3 per point of skill"
msgstr "精确增加值为10点加上每个魔法等级3点"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:68
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cure Plyze"
msgstr "治愈麻痹"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:68
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:68
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures paralysis if you cast this spell in time.  The greater the skill and rank in Mind Magic the longer the character could have been paralyzed before the \"point of no return\" is reached.  After that, the only way to remove the condition short of Divine Intervention is to visit a temple."
msgstr "如果你及时发射该魔法可以治疗麻痹。心智魔法技能等级越高，可以解除的麻痹持续时间越长（没有达到恢复临界点）。但超过有效救治时间又没有普渡众生魔法，要解除麻痹只有去神庙治疗。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:68
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if paralyzed less than 3 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "可以救治的最长麻痹时间为3分钟乘以魔法等级"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:68
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:68
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:68
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:68
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if paralyzed less than 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "可以救治的最长麻痹时间为1小时乘以魔法等级"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:68
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:68
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:68
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:68
