msgstr "可以救治的最长患病时间为1天乘以魔法等级"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:72
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:72
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:72
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:73
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Psy - Shock"
msgstr "魂飞魄散"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:72
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:73
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Similar to Mind Blast, Psychic Shock targets a single creature with mind damaging magic, only to a much greater effect.  Psychic Shock does 12 points of damage plus 1-12 per point of skill in Mind Magic."
msgstr "与惊心动魄魔法相同，它可以对单个目标进行心智打击，而且它的威力更大。其攻击力为12点加上魔法等级的1-12倍。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:74
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Telekinesis lets you manipulate an object at a distance at a strength equal to your character’s skill in Mind Magic.  Switches can be thrown, objects picked up, and doors opened with this spell, all from a nice safe distance from those nasty traps."
msgstr "你可以远距离操纵某物体。从远处就能完成一些例如扳动开关、拣拾物品、开门等动作，从而避开那些险恶的陷阱。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:74
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Strength of effect is 1 point per point of skill"
msgstr "每个魔法等级有1点力量效果值"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:74
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Strength of effect is 2 points per point of skill"
msgstr "每个魔法等级有2点力量效果值"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:74
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Strength of effect is 3 points per point of skill"
msgstr "每个魔法等级有3点力量效果值"

