msgstr "可以救治的最长患病时间为1小时乘以魔法等级"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:82
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:82
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:82
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:83
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works if diseased less than 1 day per point of skill"
msgstr "可以救治的最长患病时间为1天乘以魔法等级"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:84
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Temporarily increases a single character’s Might and Endurance statistics by 10 points plus 2 per point of skill in Body Magic."
msgstr "可以暂时提高单个角色的力量值和耐力值。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:84
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases Might and Endurance by 10 points plus 2 per point of skill"
msgstr "力量和耐力增加值为10点加上每个魔法等级2点"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:84
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases Might and Endurance by 10 points plus 3 per point of skill"
msgstr "力量和耐力增加值为10点加上每个魔法等级3点"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:84
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:85
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Flying Fist throws a heavy magical force at a single opponent that does 30 points of damage plus 1-5 per point of skill in Body Magic."
msgstr "可以向单一目标发射强力魔法攻击。攻击力为30点加上魔法等级的1-5倍。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:86
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures hit points of all characters in your party at once.  The number cured is equal to 10 plus 2 per point of skill in Body Magic."
msgstr "可以恢复所有角色的生命值。所恢复点数为10点加上自身魔法等级的2倍。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:88
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Creates food for all of your characters if you have less real food than would be created by this spell."
msgstr "如果你缺少食物，使用此魔法可以增加食物。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:88
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Creates 1 day + 1 day per 10 points skill"
msgstr "提供1天加上每10个魔法技能等级1天的食物"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:88
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Creates 1 day + 2 days per 10 points skill"
msgstr "提供1天加上每10个魔法技能等级2天的食物"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:88
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Creates 1 day + 3 days per 10 points skill"
msgstr "提供1天加上每10个魔法技能等级3天的食物"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:89
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Gldn Touch"
msgstr "点物成金"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:89
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Converts a single item you select in your inventory into gold equal to 40% of the item’s actual value.  There is a 10% chance per point of skill in Light Magic that this spell will succeed.  If the spell fails, the item is broken."
msgstr "使你所携带物品中所选定的一项变成金币。其数量为该物品实际价值的40%。每点魔法等级有10%的点化成功率。如果魔法失效，物品将毁坏。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:89
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Converts item to 40% gold value"
msgstr "使物品变成原值40%的金币"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:89
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Converts item to 60% gold value"
msgstr "使物品变成原值60%的金币"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:89
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Converts item to 80% gold value"
msgstr "使物品变成原值80%的金币"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:89
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:90
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Removes all spells on all creatures in the caster’s sight, both helpful and harmful.  Recovery is reduced by an amount equal to skill in Light Magic  ."
msgstr "可以解除视野中所有生物所中的魔法禁咒，此项魔法有利也有弊。恢复所减少的点数等于自身的魔法等级。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Halves the walking speed and doubles the recovery rate of a single monster.  Slow makes sure a monster will attack you half as often, and will have a harder time catching up to you if you choose to run.  The duration of this spell is 3 minutes per point of skill in Light Magic."
msgstr "可以使单个怪物的行走速度减半，恢复速度增加一倍。这样怪兽攻击你的概率会降低一半，并且很难赶上你。它的有效时间为1分钟乘以魔法等级。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:88
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:88
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:88
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:92
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Dest Undead"
msgstr "亡灵杀手"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:88
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:92
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Calls upon the power of Heaven to undo the evil magic that extends the lives of the Undead, inflicting 16 points of damage plus 1-16 per point of skill in Light Magic upon a single, unlucky target.  This spell only works on the Undead."
msgstr "可以招唤天堂的神力破解亡灵怪物所具有的邪恶魔力。攻击力为16点加上自身魔法等级的1-16倍。此魔法只对亡灵怪物有效。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:92
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:92
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:92
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:93
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Day -o- Gods"
msgstr "天佑一日"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:93
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Simultaneously casts Power, Meditation, Speed, Lucky Day, Precision, and GA on all your characters for one easy payment.   Day of the Gods is cast at your skill in Light Magic."
msgstr "只需付出少许代价就可以施展神力相助、点化智慧、幸运之日、加速神术、百发百中和守护天使6项魔法。效果取决于角色的光明魔法等级。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:93
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:95
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "All spells cast at twice skill in Light Magic"
msgstr "施展的所有魔法效果取决于角色的光明魔法等级乘以2"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:92
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:92
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:92
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:93
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:95
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:105
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "All spells cast at three times skill"
msgstr "施展的所有魔法效果取决于角色的魔法等级乘以3"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:92
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:94
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:95
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:92
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:94
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:95
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:92
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:94
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:95
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:93
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:95
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:105
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "All spells cast at four times skill"
msgstr "施展的所有魔法效果取决于角色的魔法等级乘以4"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:93
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:93
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:93
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:94
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Pris Light"
msgstr "死亡之光"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:93
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:93
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:93
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:94
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Inflicts 25 points of damage plus 1 per point of skill in Light Magic on all creatures in sight.  This spell can only be cast indoors."
msgstr "可以对视野范围内所有怪物发动攻击。攻击力为25点加上自身魔法等级。该魔法只能在室内使用。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:95
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Hour Power"
msgstr "神佑一时"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:95
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Simultaneously casts Haste, Heroism, Shield, Stone Skin, and Bless on all your characters at your skill in Light Magic."
msgstr "可以同时向你的所有角色提供攻击加速、天赐神力、护体盾牌、护体石肤和圣灵佑佐5项魔法。效果取决于角色的光明魔法等级。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:90
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:96
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Paralyze temporarily prevents a monster from moving or attacking for the (short) duration of this spell, which is 3 minutes per point of skill in Light Magic.  You are free to attack your helpless target 'til your heart's content--paralyzed monsters cannot retaliate."
msgstr "发射该魔法可以麻痹怪兽，使其不能移动或攻击。其有效时间为1分钟乘以魔法等级。在怪物被麻痹过程中你可以全力进攻，而它无还手之力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:63
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:66
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:96
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:107
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:63
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:66
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:96
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:107
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:64
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:66
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:96
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:106
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:107
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:96
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:107
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:108
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Slow recovery rate"
msgstr "恢复较慢"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:97
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Sun Ray is the second most devastating spell in Enroth, concentrating the light of the sun on one unfortunate creature.  Since Sun Ray must focus the light of the sun, it can only work outdoors and during the day.  Sun Ray does 20 points of damage plus 1-20 per point of skill in Light Magic."
msgstr "聚光魔球是游戏中威力第二大的魔法。它能集中太阳光束照射于单个目标。因为使用太阳光束，所以必须在室外并在白天施法。它的攻击力为20点加上魔法等级的1-20倍。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:97
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Very slow recovery rate"
msgstr "恢复极慢"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:97
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:97
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:97
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:98
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Divine Inter"
msgstr "普渡众生"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:98
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Once per day during the rising or setting of the sun, you may call upon the heavens to heal your characters of all damage, restore your spell points, and remove all adverse conditions.  The gods exact a price, however, aging the caster 10 years for each Divine Intervention.  Recovery from this spell is shortend with skill in Light Magic."
msgstr "每天在日升日落时，你可以招唤天堂的神力治愈所有角色的所有伤病，并恢复魔法值。神力的代价是：每次使用该魔法，施法者的年龄都会增加十岁。光明魔法等级越高，施法的恢复时间越短。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:98
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Only works once per day"
msgstr "每天可以使用一次"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:98
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Only works twice per day"
msgstr "每天可以使用二次"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:98
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Only works three times per day"
msgstr "每天可以使用三次"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:100
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Reanimate allows you to raise a lifeless creature from the dead (sort of).  The spell does not make them grateful or peaceful in any way, but you can always kill them again, if you want."
msgstr "该魔法可使死亡的生物苟延残喘。但怪物不会对你心存感激，与你和好。你可以随时随地再置它们于死地。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:100
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Creature gets 10 hit points per skill point (up to creature's maximum)"
msgstr "每个魔法等级可以给予怪物10点生命值（不超过它的最大生命值）"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:99
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:99
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:100
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Creature gets 20 hit points per skill point"
msgstr "每个魔法等级可以给予怪物20点生命值"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:99
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:99
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:99
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:100
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Creature gets 30 hit points per skill point"
msgstr "每个魔法等级可以给予怪物30点生命值"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:100
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:100
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:100
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:101
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "A poisonous cloud of noxious gases is formed in front of the caster and moves slowly away from your characters.  The cloud does 25 points of damage plus 1-10 per point of skill in Dark Magic and lasts until something runs into it."
msgstr "使你的角色前方生成一朵毒云，并慢慢在空中飘荡。它的攻击力为25点加上自身魔法等级的1-10倍。只有击中某物体才会消散。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:102
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Inflicts the cursed condition on all monsters in the sight of the caster."
msgstr "对视野范围内的所有怪兽发射魔法。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:102
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 2 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "持续时间为二分钟乘以魔法等级"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:102
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 4 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "持续时间为四分钟乘以魔法等级"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:103
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:103
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fires a blast of hot, jagged metal in front of the caster, striking any creature that gets in the way.  Each piece inflicts 6 points of damage plus 1-6 per point of skill in Dark Magic."
msgstr "向正前方的怪兽发射热力锯齿霰弹，可以扫清一切挡路的怪物。每片弹片的攻击力为6点加上自身魔法等级的1-6倍。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:103
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Moderate recovery rate and 3 fragments"
msgstr "恢复速度中等，有三块弹片"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:103
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:103
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:103
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:103
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster recovery rate and 5 fragments"
msgstr "恢复较快，有五块弹片"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:103
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fastest recovery rate and 7 fragments"
msgstr "恢复最快，有七块弹片"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:102
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:102
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:102
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:104
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Shrink Ray"
msgstr "缩身大法"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:102
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:104
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Shrinks even the grandest of monsters to more manageable sizes. Duration of this spell is 5 minutes per point of skill in Dark Magic.  A shrunken monster deals one half, one third, or one quarter its normal damage while shrunk."
msgstr "可以缩小巨型怪兽的身躯，使其变得容易对付。其持续时间为5分钟乘以魔法等级。被缩小的怪兽它的攻击力也根据身躯比例相应缩小一半，三分之一或四分之一。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:102
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:102
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:102
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:104
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Reduces monster size to one half normal"
msgstr "使怪兽身躯缩小一半"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:102
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:102
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:102
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:104
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Reduces monster size to one third normal"
msgstr "使怪兽身躯缩小到三分之一"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:102
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:102
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:102
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:104
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Reduces monster size to one fourth normal"
msgstr "使怪兽身躯缩小到四分之一"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:105
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Day of Prot"
msgstr "护身一日"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:105
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Simultaneously casts Protection from Fire, Electricity, Cold, Poison, and Magic, plus Feather Fall and Wizard Eye on all your characters at your skill in Dark Magic."
msgstr "同时对所有角色施展御火奇术、御电奇术、御寒奇术、御毒奇术和御魔奇术，外加凌空飞降和魔力神眼，总共7项魔法。效果取决于角色的暗黑魔法等级。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:105
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "All spells cast at twice skill in Dark Magic"
msgstr "施展的所有魔法效果取决于角色的暗黑魔法等级乘以2"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:106
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Finger Death"
msgstr "死神之手"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:106
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Attempts to immediately slay a single creature by stripping its soul from its body.  Finger of Death has a 3% chance per skill point in Dark Magic of working, with Experts and Masters getting 4 and 5% chances respectively."
msgstr "可以把单个怪物的灵魂剥离躯体，使它立即毙命。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:106
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "3% chance of success per point of skill in Dark Magic"
msgstr "成功率为3%乘以魔法等级"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:106
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "4% chance of success per point of skill in Dark Magic"
msgstr "成功率为4%乘以魔法等级"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:106
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "5% chance of success per point of skill in Dark Magic"
msgstr "成功率为5%乘以魔法等级"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:107
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "A powerful spell of Darkness, Moon Ray heals your characters and damages all monsters in sight.  It doesn’t do a lot of damage or cure conditions, but it is the only spell that harms all monsters in sight and works outside.  Moon Ray is restricted to working outdoors and at night.  All monsters take 1-4 points of damage per point of skill in Dark Magic, and all characters heal 1-4 points of damage per point of skill."
msgstr "这项威力强大的暗黑魔法可以治疗你的所有角色并攻击视野范围内的所有怪兽。尽管它的治愈能力和杀伤作用都不强，但它是唯一可以大面积攻击目标的魔法。该魔法只能在室外的黑夜中使用。攻击力为自身魔法等级的1-4倍，治疗力为魔法等级的1-4倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:107
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:107
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:107
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:108
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Drag Breath"
msgstr "神龙吐珠"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:108
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Dragon Breath empowers the caster to exhale a cloud of toxic vapors that target a single monster and damage all creatures nearby.  This spell is the most powerful damage spell in the lands, doing 1-25 points of damage per point of skill in Dark Magic."
msgstr "该魔法可以向单个怪兽喷出云状有毒气体并危及周围的所有生物。它是天下最具威力的攻击魔法，攻击力为自身魔法等级的1-25倍。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:109
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "This spell is the town killer.  It can only be cast once per day by Apprentices to Dark Magic,  and only outdoors at that.  Armageddon inflicts 50 points of damage plus 1 point of damage for every point of Dark skill your character has to every creature on the map, including all your characters.   "
msgstr "该魔法是惨绝人寰的屠城杀手。只有学习暗黑魔法的角色方能在一天中使用一次，并只能在室外使用。它可以攻击地图上出现的所有生物，包括你自己。攻击力为50点加上自身的魔法等级。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:109
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Can only be cast once per day"
msgstr "每天可以使用一次"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:109
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Can only be cast twice per day"
msgstr "每天可以使用二次"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:108
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:108
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:108
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:109
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Can only be cast three times per day"
msgstr "每天可以使用三次"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:110
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Dark Contain"
msgstr "暗黑之神"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Spells.txt.py:110
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "This spell attempts to trap the force of darkness into its victims, hence the name Dark Containment.  The target of the spell will suffer from random effects- though certain creatures are immune to this spell."
msgstr "该魔法试图把所有黑暗之力都注入受害者的体内。它的威力无法预料，施展时后果不堪设想。只有少数一些生物能侥幸逃命。"

