msgid "Rejuvination"
msgstr "返老还童药剂"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Win.STR.py:2
msgctxt "win.str"
msgid "Your valiant efforts and heroic deeds have saved the Kingdom from the scourge of devils and fanatical conspirators.  With the fall of their alien masters, the priests of the Temple of Baa scattered to the wind, leaving their followers to wonder at their absence, and the rest of Enroth to rejoice for the restoration of peace and order."
msgstr "由于你们顽强的努力和英勇的行为，王国脱离了恶魔和狂热阴谋家的魔掌。随着外星主子的覆灭，羊鸣教神甫随风而散，只留下那些无所适从的羊鸣教教徒。恩洛斯恢复了和平与秩序，人民欢欣鼓舞。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/ZNWC.STR.py:4
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ZNWC.STR.py:4
msgctxt "location"
msgid "Shelves"
msgstr "架子"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/ZNWC.STR.py:5
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ZNWC.STR.py:5
msgctxt "location"
msgid "You found something!"
msgstr "你找到一些东西！"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/ZNWC.STR.py:6
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ZNWC.STR.py:6
msgctxt "location"
msgid "Nothing here"
msgstr "这儿没什么东西"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/ZNWC.STR.py:7
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ZNWC.STR.py:7
msgctxt "location"
msgid "Not enough gold"
msgstr "金币不够"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/ZNWC.STR.py:8
