#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/intro.STR.py:2
msgctxt "intro.str"
msgid "Having cheated death during the Night of Shooting Stars, you find yourself as far from your village of Sweet Water as old Falagar’s magic could take you."
msgstr "在那个可怕的流星雨之夜，你诈死逃脱。醒来发现，法拉格用魔法将你送到了远离家乡甜水镇的陌生地方。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/intro.STR.py:4
msgctxt "intro.str"
msgid "Three years have passed while Falagar imparted what knowledge he could to train you in your chosen professions."
msgstr "你师从法拉格学艺已经三年了，他把你想学的东西已经倾囊传授给你。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/intro.STR.py:6
msgctxt "intro.str"
msgid "But the time came at last when he could teach you no more, and you have ventured into the world to seek your fame and fortune."
msgstr "现在，你得自己去闯荡世界、建功立业。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/intro.STR.py:8
msgctxt "intro.str"
msgid "Now, a world away from your lost home, you have stumbled across evidence of a terrible conspiracy involving a new religious cult."
msgstr "在这个远离家乡的陌生地方，你无意中获得了一起阴谋的证据，其中涉及到一股新的宗教势力。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/intro.STR.py:10
msgctxt "intro.str"
msgid "Five letters from King Roland to his wife Catherine, and a letter from the King of the Devils to a wicked traitor named Sulman, have turned up in an abandoned Goblin camp."
msgstr "在一个废弃的大耳族营地，你发现了罗兰德国王致妻子凯瑟琳的五封信和魔头给一个名叫舒尔曼的无耻叛徒的一封信。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/intro.STR.py:12
msgctxt "intro.str"
msgid "Your fate seems inextricably bound to these letters and that awful Night, and your role in the events to come may be larger than anyone could imagine."
msgstr "你的命运和这些信件及那个可怕的夜晚紧密相连，现在只有你才能拯救整个王国。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/intro.STR.py:14
msgctxt "intro.str"
msgid "The tools you have are but a small sum of gold, your wits, and a lot of potential. The roads ahead are infinite--the choices are all yours to make."
msgstr "虽然一开始你拥有的东西并不多：一点儿金币和你的智慧，但你面前的道路漫长，一切都全靠你自己了。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/intro.STR.py:18
msgctxt "intro.str"
msgid "Good Luck"
msgstr "祝你好运！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2450
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<bowing> %01, at your service."
msgstr "<鞠躬>%01愿为您效劳。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2575
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<sigh> Yes?"
msgstr "<叹气>干吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2600
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "有什么事？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2625
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello friend! <making a curious gesture with thumb and nose> Baaaa! The end of the world draws nigh!"
msgstr "你好，朋友！<用大拇指和鼻子做了个奇怪的姿势>咩！世界末日快降临了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2650
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello! My name is %01, and I am pleased to meet you, %02."
msgstr "您好！我名叫%01，很高兴见到您，%02。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2426
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "How're you doin', %02?"
msgstr "最近咋样，%02？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2451
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Always a pleasure, %06 %02."
msgstr "真高兴见到您，%02%06。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2476
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<sigh> Back so soon?"
msgstr "<叹气>这么快又回来了？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2501
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What is it, %02?"
msgstr "有什么事，%02？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2601
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Back again, %02?"
msgstr "你又来了？%02。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2626
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, %16. The Signs are dark indeed, aren't they?"
msgstr "啊，%16。各种迹象都预示着不祥的未来，不是吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2651
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A fine %05, %02, is it not?"
msgstr "不错的%05，不是么？%02。"

