#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:2
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:2
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Might is the statistic that represents a character's overall strength, and the ability to put that strength where it counts.  Characters with a high might statistic do more damage in combat."
msgstr "力量值反映角色整体强壮程度、实力，以及发挥该实力的能力。角色力量值越高，在战斗中的对敌人造成的杀伤越大。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:3
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Intellect represents a character's ability to reason and understand complex, abstract concepts.  A high intellect contributes to Sorcerer, Archer, and Druid spell points"
msgstr "智力反映角色推理和理解复杂抽象概念的能力。智力能提高巫师、弓箭手和德鲁伊的魔法值。"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:4
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Personality represents both a character's strength of will and personal charm.  Clerics, Paladins, and Druids depend on personality for their spell points."
msgstr "个性反映角色的意志力和个人魅力。个性能决定牧师、圣武士和德鲁伊的魔法值。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:5
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:5
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Endurance is a measure of the physical toughness and durability of a character.  A high endurance gives a character more hit points."
msgstr "耐力衡量角色的身体韧性和耐久性。耐力越高，角色的生命值越大。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:6
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:6
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Accuracy represents a character's precision and hand-eye coordination.  A high accuracy will allow a character to hit monsters more frequently in combat."
msgstr "精确反映角色的准确性和手眼协调能力。高精确值将允许角色在战斗中更频繁地击中怪物。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:7
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:7
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Speed is a measure of how quick a character is.  A high speed statistic will increase a character's armor class and the rate with which the character recovers from attacks."
msgstr "速度是衡量角色的行动迅速程度的指标。速度越快，角色的防御等级越高，受到攻击后的恢复越快。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:8
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:8
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:8
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:8
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Luck has a subtle influence throughout the game, but is most visible in the ability of a character to resist magical attacks and avoid taking (as much) damage from traps."
msgstr "运气值在整个游戏中有微妙的影响，它更多表现在对魔法攻击的防御能力和对陷阱伤害的回避能力上。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:9
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:9
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Hit points indicate how much damage your character can sustain before falling unconscious or dying.  A character is unconscious at zero hit points or less.  Hit points return after 8 hours of uninterrupted rest."
msgstr "生命值表示你的角色在昏迷或死亡之前可以承受多大的伤害。生命值小于或等于0时角色会昏迷。好好休息8小时可恢复最大生命值。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:10
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:10
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Armor Class is a measure of how difficult it is for a monster to hit a character.  The higher the armor class, the better the chance of avoiding an attack."
msgstr "防御等级是衡量敌人击中角色难度的指标。防御等级越高，回避攻击的概率就越大。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:11
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:11
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Spell points are needed to cast spells.  Every spell has a spell point cost that is deducted from this statistic when it's cast.  Spell points return after 8 hours of uninterrupted rest."
msgstr "魔法值用于施展魔法。通常施展每个魔法都需要扣除一定的魔法值，好好休息8小时可恢复最大魔法值。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:12
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:12
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Condition shows the worst 'effect' your character is suffering, such as poisoned, diseased, or dead.  Many conditions seriously hurt your character's ability to fight, and should be cured as soon as possible."
msgstr "状态显示角色正在遭受的负面影响，如中毒、患病、死亡等。许多状态都会严重削弱角色的战斗能力，必须尽快治疗。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:13
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:13
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "The Quick Spell is the spell that will be cast when you use the 's' key to cast a spell, or control-click on a monster.  You can set the quick spell by opening your spell book ('c'), clicking on the spell you want to set, then clicking on the set spell tab at the bottom of the spell book."
msgstr "备用魔法是指按S键或按住Ctrl键单击目标，就可快速发射的魔法。想要设置备用魔法，可以打开魔法全书，选择一种魔法，然后点击魔法全书下方“设为备用魔法”的按钮。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:14
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:14
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:14
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:14
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Age shows the current age of your character.  The first number is the temporary age number, and the second is your real age.  Certain monsters and magical effects can raise your temporary age above your real age."
msgstr "年龄显示角色的当前岁数。第一个数字是角色的暂时年龄，后面一个是真实年龄，某些怪兽和魔法可以使角色的暂时年龄大于真实年龄。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:15
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:15
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:15
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:15
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Level is a measure of the training your character has gone through.  A high level contributes to hit points and spell points."
msgstr "等级表示角色的训练程度。等级越高，生命值和魔法值越高。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:16
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:16
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:16
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:16
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Experience is a simple indicator of your character's overall understanding of the world.  With enough experience points (and a little gold), you can train your characters in training grounds throughout the land to increase their level and gain skill points to spend on skills."
msgstr "经验值表明角色的江湖阅历。达到一定的经验值（再花一点钱），就可在遍布各地的训练所进行训练，提高角色等级，并获取用于提高各项技能等级的技能点数。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:17
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:17
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Attack Bonus is the sum of all factors (skill, spells, Accuracy, etc.) that influence your character's chance to hit monsters with an equipped weapon.  "
msgstr "攻击点数会影响你的角色用武器击中怪物的几率，它取决于技能等级、魔法、精确等各种因素。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:18
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:18
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:18
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Attack Damage is the sum of all factors (Might, spells, certain weapon skills at expert or master, etc.) that influence the damage your character does with an equipped weapon."
msgstr "攻击杀伤力会影响你的角色用武器攻击怪物造成的伤害，它取决于力量、魔法、某些达到专家或大师级的兵器技能的等级等各种因素。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:19
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:19
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:19
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:19
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Shoot Bonus is the sum of all factors (skill, spells, Accuracy, etc.) that influence your character's chance to hit monsters with an equipped bow."
msgstr "射击点数会影响你的角色用弓箭击中怪物的几率，它取决于技能等级、魔法、精确等各种因素。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:20
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:20
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:20
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:20
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Shoot Damage is the sum of all factors (spells, weapon bonuses, etc.) that influence the damage your character does with an equipped bow."
msgstr "射击杀伤力会影响你的角色用弓箭攻击怪物造成的伤害，它取决于魔法、武器加成等各种因素。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Global.TXT.py:90
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:21
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Global.txt.py:90
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:21
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:21
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:21
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Fire"
msgstr "火系抗性"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:21
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Fire Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage from fire.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce fire damage, it does not make your character immune."
msgstr "火系抗性代表你的角色面对基于火系的攻击，降低其伤害的能力。虽然很高的火系抗性可以大大减少火系伤害，但并不能使你的角色免疫。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Global.TXT.py:74
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Global.txt.py:74
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:22
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Electricity"
msgstr "电系抗性"

#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/stats.txt.py:22
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Electricity Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage from electricity.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce electricity damage, it does not make your character immune."
msgstr "电系抗性代表你的角色面对基于电系的攻击，降低其伤害的能力。虽然很高的电系抗性可以大大减少电系伤害，但并不能使你的角色免疫。"

