#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/MM7history.txt.py:20
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/HISTORY.TXT.py:20
msgctxt "history"
msgid "Acting at the behest of our new allies in Deyja, my lords have brought a set of the valuable soul jars necromancers need to complete the Ritual of Eternity to Kastore, chief advisor to Lord Ironfist.  The Warlocks of Nighon are capable alchemists, but poor defenders.  Even still, engaging them in combat would be dangerous, so it is with relief that I can report my lords were able to make a deal with the Warlocks to obtain the soul jars without a fight.\n\nThe ready availability of the soul jars will strengthen our allies tremendously.  Overall, this is a fine thing, but I cannot help but detect a note of discord in Archibald's court.  Reports coming from Deyja are saying that orders given by Archibald and his \"advisors\" frequently conflict, and Archibald doesn't always prevail when decisions need to be made.  It's almost as though there were two factions vying for control of Deyja, and Archibald merely represents one of them.  I hope this isn't true.  Being linked with a strong ally protects us from attack, but when that strong ally begins to look weak, watch out!  "
msgstr "我的主人现在正为他的新盟友迪雅卖命。死灵法师升职时进行永生仪式必须有灵魂之坛，我的主人就去邪术师那里拿来了大批灵魂之坛，交给了卡斯托（阿基巴德的首席大臣）。尼根的那帮邪术师光会炼丹制药，竟然手无缚鸡之力。尽管如此，得罪了他们可没有什么好下场。我竭力劝说主人还是和和气气地和他们商量为好，如果不翻脸也能成功的话，那岂不是一件大好事，结果真是天遂人愿。\n\n既然得到了这么多灵魂之坛，我们的盟友实力已经大大增强，这对我们来说也是件好事。但有传闻阿基巴德与他的四个大臣貌合神离，据说双方经常发生争执，发布的命令也时常自相矛盾，甚至有时阿基巴德还听命于他的四个手下。看来迪雅已经分裂成了两派，阿基巴德再也不是迪雅说一不二的最高领袖了。难道这次我的主人真的错了，不会的吧，他从来料事如神，高人一筹，相信他，没错的！"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/MM7history.txt.py:21
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/HISTORY.TXT.py:21
msgctxt "history"
msgid "The High Temple of Light, the heart of our enemies, has been sacked!  On %30, my lords, at the behest of their allies in the court of Archibald Ironfist, brought the temple's altar stone to the court, and presented it to Kastore, the chief advisor to Lord Ironfist himself.  There, he combined the sister stone from the High Temple of Darkness and produced a...larger stone?  Well, far be it from me to understand the strange ways of wizardry, but the important thing is that our enemies have been humiliated, and their enchanted altar stone taken.  Hopefully, this will put a damper on any plans they had for using that stone.\n\nWell, there still has been no reaction from Bracada on the theft of the stone, but I doubt they will just take it lying down.  No, they are crafting some vengeful plan even now, or my historical experience is completely wrong.  The question is not whether they will strike, but when.  And where?  Here?  The town?  Or perhaps Deyja itself.  Perhaps my lords should hire a court astrologer or some spies for advice."
msgstr "高级光明神庙是敌人的中心枢纽所在地，那个地方遭到了沉重地打击。在%30，我的主人成功地拿到了那个神庙祭坛上的石头，把它交给了卡斯托，他是阿基巴德的首席大臣。他把这块石头与高级暗黑神庙里祭坛上的石头拼合在一起，就成了一块更大的石头。我不知道这帮巫师葫芦里卖的什么药，反正我的主人又立了件大功，他拿到了那块祭坛上的石头，大大打击了敌人的嚣张气焰，这下他们再也不能用那块石头干坏事了。\n\n但布拉卡达方面似乎对此事无动于衷，一副毫不在意的样子。但凭我多年来研究历史所积累的经验来看，我敢打赌他们绝不会善罢甘休的，现在肯定在酝酿复仇的计划。敌人迟早会来的，只是什么时候，什么地方，是攻击哈蒙代尔还是迪雅，看来我的主人真该找个算命的问问。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/MM7history.txt.py:21
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/HISTORY.TXT.py:21
msgctxt "history"
msgid "The Temple of Light"
msgstr "光明神庙"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/MM7history.txt.py:22
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/HISTORY.TXT.py:22
msgctxt "history"
msgid "%30\n\nLord Ironfist ordered an attack upon alchemist Clive Clanker's laboratory, which my lords have carried out with skill and precision.  Even now his Necromancers search the laboratory for traps and treasures left behind by alchemists.  \n\nPutting an even greater strain on court relations is a successful raid from the Wizards of Bracada against the soul jar treasury in the Pit.  This disaster is sure to cause conflicts within the already tense court of Deyja.  Without soul jars,  necromancers will be unable to complete the Ritual to become Liches.\n\nI think our allies are about to fall to fighting.  Already, sorcerous duels are being fought on the surface above the Pit between members of the two factions.  I hope my lords can figure out who will be on the winning side and join them before the dust settles.  Because picking the wrong side is sure to have consequences."
msgstr "%30\n\n阿基巴德已经下令进攻炼金术士科兰克的实验室，这全是我的主人的功劳。他早就深入虎穴，潜入实验室，破坏了实验室最具威力的防御设施——反远距离传送封锁装置，不然阿基巴德的时空之门魔法简直是废物一个，哪会象如今这样猖狂。\n\n不幸的是布拉卡达的法师们对位于地狱城里的灵魂之坛宝库发动了一次成功的突袭。这无疑使迪雅本来闹得不可开交的内部矛盾更加雪上加霜。没有灵魂之坛，死灵法师就无法通过永生仪式转化为巫妖。\n\n看来我们的盟友快自身难保了。两派法师已经在地狱城里开始自相残杀了。我希望我的主人能早作决定，只有锄弱扶强，才可以保全自己，这可是天经地义的事。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/MM7history.txt.py:22
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/HISTORY.TXT.py:22
msgctxt "history"
msgid "Clanker's Laboratory"
msgstr "实验之室"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/MM7history.txt.py:23
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/HISTORY.TXT.py:23
msgctxt "history"
msgid "%30\n\nThere is discord in Deyja, and a faction split amongst the necromancers has occured.  Archibald Ironfist has turned up in Clive Clanker's old laboratory.  Until recently, the laboratory had been happily chugging along, selling enchanted weapons and equipment to anyone who had enough money--including the pirate \"empire\" of Regna.  Having employed the pirates as mercenaries during the Succession War in Enroth, Archibald knew of their wealthy alchemical suppliers.  The fact that this wealth existed made for an excellent smoke screen covering the real reasons behind Archibald's assault.\n\nThe recent tensions between Archibald and his new advisors has been well documented.  Factionism and discord have created an intolerable situation in Deyja, so bad that one side had to leave.  Archibald's \"science\" necromancers attacked Clanker's laboratory not for the alchemical treasures, but for the living space.  We have traded one strong enemy for two weaker ones.  I hope this trade is for the better.  Perhaps Archibald will be amenable to peace overtures?"
msgstr "%30\n\n迪雅的君臣不和越闹越僵，终于一发不可收拾，爆发了内讧。阿基巴德·艾恩法斯特已经逃到了科兰克的实验室，把那个地方作为据点，企图东山再起。这个实验室本来是卖魔法物品和装备的。阿基巴德在恩洛斯做国王时在王位继承战中曾经找海盗当雇佣兵，他们的装备就是从这个实验室买的，所以阿基巴德知道这个地方的底细。这样看来阿基巴德似乎是因为垂涎实验室的丰富魔法物品才占领了这个地方，但我想他是“醉翁之意不在酒”。\n\n迪雅死灵法师之间的自相残杀已经愈演愈烈，“一山难容二虎”，注定有一方必须离开迪雅。阿基巴德率领“科研派”死灵法师攻占科兰克实验室并非为了里面的宝物，而是为了能有一个落脚之地，以图以后能东山再起。敌人闹成这样对我们来说可是件天大的好事，这样就可以各个击破，避免更大的伤亡了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/MM7history.txt.py:23
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/MM7history.txt.py:24
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/HISTORY.TXT.py:23
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/HISTORY.TXT.py:24
msgctxt "history"
msgid "Assassination"
msgstr "自相残杀"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/MM7history.txt.py:24
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/HISTORY.TXT.py:24
msgctxt "history"
msgid "%30\n\nArchibald Ironfist, former leader of our allies in Deyja, has moved to Clive Clanker's old laboratory.  Until recently, the laboratory had been happily chugging along, selling enchanted weapons and equipment to anyone who had enough money--including the pirate \"empire\" of Regna.  Having employed the pirates as mercenaries during the Succession War in Enroth, Archibald knew of their wealthy alchemical suppliers.  The fact that this wealth existed made for an excellent smoke screen covering the real reasons behind Archibald's manipulation of my lords to further his ends.\n\nThe recent tension between Archibald and his new advisors has been well documented.  Factionism and discord have created an intolerable situation in Deyja, so bad that one side had to leave.  Archibald's \"science\" necromancers attacked Clanker's laboratory not for the alchemical treasures, but for the living space.  Perhaps this is for the better. It is clear Kastore's faction is the stronger of the two, and he clearly intends further dealings with my lord.  Something big is in the air, something that will surely show itself soon."
msgstr "%30\n\n迪雅的君臣矛盾越闹越僵，终于一发不可收拾，爆发了内讧。阿基巴德·艾恩法斯特已经逃到了科兰克的实验室，把那个地方作为据点，企图东山再起。这个实验室本来是卖魔法物品和装备的。阿基巴德在恩洛斯做国王时在王位继承战中曾经找海盗当雇佣兵，他们的装备就是从这个实验室买的，所以阿基巴德知道这个地方的底细。这样看来阿基巴德似乎是因为垂涎实验室的丰富魔法物品才占领了这个地方，但我想他是“醉翁之意不在酒”。\n\n迪雅死灵法师之间的自相残杀已经愈演愈烈，“一山难容二虎”，注定有一方必须离开迪雅。阿基巴德率领“科研派”死灵法师攻占科兰克实验室并非为了里面的宝物，而是为了能有一个落脚之地，以图以后能东山再起。如今显然卡斯托这一边占了上风，我的主人一向见风使舵，痛打落水狗，而且卡斯托也很赏识他，我们是不会放弃这个合作的好机会的。我们两家联手，就可以纵横天下，所向披靡了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/MM7history.txt.py:25
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/HISTORY.TXT.py:25
msgctxt "history"
msgid "%30\n\nGood King Roland Ironfist, brother to Archibald Ironfist, has been rescued from the clutches of the Devils after many long years!  To think of what he went through as a prisoner of those monsters for such a long time is beyond imagining.  Everyone had given up hope that he was still alive.  The find was almost accidental.\n\nMy lords had been sent on a mission to destroy the nest in the name of humanity.  Archibald Ironfist, deposed lord of Deyja and one of the most hated men in history, offered aid for reasons of his own.  During the mission, my lords found King Roland in an iron cage deep within the nest and released him.  Further, Archibald volunteered to return Roland to Queen Catherine himself.\n\nArchibald and his brother are reunited.  Though their rivalry is bitter, they have never attempted fratricide.  However, Roland's wife, Queen Catherine of Erathia, does have a history of slaying obnoxious relatives.  She has sworn to execute Archibald should she ever be lucky enough to capture him.  I wonder what she will do now?"
msgstr "%30\n\n阿基巴德·艾恩法斯特的兄弟，善良的国王罗兰德·艾恩法斯特深陷牢笼数年后，终于重获自由。真难想象他被恶魔们囚禁了这么多日子还能活着出来。大家都以为他已经以身殉国了。这实在是一个意外的惊喜。\n\n这次又是我的主人大显神威。他接受了一个任务要以人类的名义把恶魔克里根族斩尽杀绝。然而有趣的是阿基巴德·阿基巴德，这个穷困潦倒的迪雅的领袖、天下第一大魔头，不知出于何种目的竟然帮助我的主人完成这个任务。在这次行动中主人意外地发现了深陷牢笼的罗兰德国王，把他营救了出来。阿基巴德自告奋勇地亲自把国王送回凯瑟琳王后那里，看来到底是兄弟情深啊。\n\n现在两个艾恩法斯特重归与好了。尽管过去他们一度是死对头，曾经拼个你死我活，可是往事如烟，过去的就让它过去吧，骨肉之情是难以割舍的。但不知道凯瑟琳王后会怎么想，她和阿基巴德可是不共戴天的仇敌，凯瑟琳曾发誓要亲手让阿基巴德死于她的剑下。这下我可有热闹看了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/MM7history.txt.py:25
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/HISTORY.TXT.py:25
msgctxt "history"
msgid "Roland's Rescue"
msgstr "救援国王"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/MM7history.txt.py:26
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/HISTORY.TXT.py:26
msgctxt "history"
msgid "%30\n\nIt seems that Queen Catherine has made her decision.  Rather that execute Archibald, she has decided that Clanker's Laboratory should become his permanent home.  He is barred from leaving his island on pain of death.  Archibald appears to have accepted these terms and set aside his ambitions forever...but forever is such a long time.  I doubt that we've seen the last of him.\n\nOur relations with Erathia have improved dramatically.  Queen Catherine says she is eternally grateful for the return of Roland and the destruction of the Devils.  With all the good will going around, war seems but a distant, bad dream.  For his part, Roland has also expressed his profound gratitude, and says he will be returning to Enroth after he recovers physically from his long imprisonment.\n\nStill, there is a tension in the air.  All of these seemingly unconnected missions for the mysterious advisors, the collection of unusual artifacts, and the assassinations must be leading somewhere.  I have a feeling things will become clear soon."
msgstr "%30\n\n看来凯瑟琳王后心中早就安排好了。她饶恕了阿基巴德的性命，但把他软禁在科兰克的实验室，终生不得离开那个小岛半步，否则格杀勿论。阿基巴德答应了这个要求。他做了一辈子的枭雄，现在也该把雄心壮志放一放，过两天悠闲的田园生活了。唯一感觉不爽的是万一这家伙比我们命长，我们就永远看不到他寿终正寝的那一天，那岂不是太遗憾了。\n\n如今埃拉西亚和我们可说是同舟共济、荣辱与共了。凯瑟琳王后说就凭着我们主人孤身营救罗兰德国王，一人单挑整个克里根族这两件功劳，埃拉西亚将永远感恩戴德。罗兰德国王也深表谢意，并打算一旦身体康复，就动身返回恩洛斯。\n\n不过我心中的迷团仍未解开。我的主人为了完成那几个大臣所交给的任务，跋山涉水，风餐露宿，又是找寻神器，又是除暴安良，这背后肯定有一个大秘密。看来真相大白的日子已经不远了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/MM7history.txt.py:26
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/HISTORY.TXT.py:26
msgctxt "history"
msgid "Archibald's Exile"
msgstr "小岛流放"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/MM7history.txt.py:27
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/HISTORY.TXT.py:27
msgctxt "history"
msgid "%30\n\nOur special advisors in the Court of Bracada have turned out to be quite special indeed.  They say they are from another world, and have crossed the space between the stars looking for signs of the Ancients and their servants.  They say they came here because their magical devices detected the ruins of Ancient civilization, and the equipment to open the gate to the stars and walk amongst them as easily as you and I would cross a room.  They say they intended to return the lost glory of the Ancient's civilization to our world.\n\nBut when they arrived, four members of their team renounced their long held dream of finding the Ancients.  They chose instead to conquer our world with the help of our own ruined Ancient equipment.  And they chose Archibald Ironfist and his Necromancers as their instrument and puppet.  \n\nThey say they need but one more piece to repair the road to the stars, and that piece is in the vehicle they used to get to our world.  Their enemies, the \"advisors\" to Archibald, also require this piece to finish their own project--the repair of the Heavenly Forge.  If the enemy receives this artifact, they would use the forge to duplicate their powerful weapons and conquer our world.  If Ressurectra and her team receives the artifact, they will use it to open the gate to the stars and bring the blessings of the Ancient's magic to all the people of our world.\n\nNow it is up to my lords to retrieve this artifact from their vehicle and return it to one of the two factions of outsiders.  I think Ressurectra means well, but my judgement has been wrong in the past.  "
msgstr "%30\n\n布拉卡达的那几个大臣果真不是平常人。他们说自己来自另一个世界，常年遨游在太空中，寻找具有古代文明的星球。由于他们的魔法装置发现我们这个星球存在过古代文明，所以才来到了这里。他们有一个远距离传送站，在时空间穿梭就象我们登堂入室一样容易。他们说要在这个世界重新恢复古代文明的荣耀。\n\n但当他们到达我们这里，他们中的有些人背叛了他们执著一生的理想。竟然要统治奴役我们。不过面对花花世界，谁看着不眼馋呢！而阿基巴德和他手下那帮死灵法师正好成了他们统治世界的工具。\n\n他们还告诉我们为了修复时空之门，必须回到送他们来这里的那艘飞船上取一项至关重要的东西。而他们那些背叛的同胞，也就是阿基巴德的大臣们，也要得到这个东西，以便重建天堂铸造厂。一旦建成的话，他们就可以打造威力无比的上古兵器，不费吹灰之力地占领整个星球。但如果瑞瑟雷克特他们拿到这个东西，他们就能打开时空之门，让全世界享受古代伟大文明的魔法佑护。\n\n现在回飞船去取回那个神器的任务又落在我的主人的身上。他必须选择到底把神器交给谁，说实话，我对瑞瑟雷克特挺有好感，真希望神器能交给她。可是我又不是主人肚子里的蛔虫，怎么会知道他的想法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/MM7history.txt.py:27
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/MM7history.txt.py:28
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/HISTORY.TXT.py:27
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/HISTORY.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "history"
msgid "The Visitors"
msgstr "星外访客"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/MM7history.txt.py:28
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/HISTORY.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "history"
msgid "%30\n\nOur special advisors in the Court of Deyja have turned out to be quite special indeed.  They say they are from another world, and have crossed the space between the stars looking for signs of the Ancients and their servants.  They say they came here because their magical devices detected the ruins of Ancient civilization, and the equipment to open the gate to the stars and walk amongst them as easily as you and I would cross a room.  They say they intended to return the lost glory of the Ancient's civilization to our world.\n\nBut when they arrived, Kastore and his faction had tired of their search, and renounced their long held dream of finding the Ancients.  They preferred instead to take command of our world and lead it to greatness with the benefit of their superior wisdom and science. The others, obsessed with their original mission, refused to see reason and continued their pointless quest.\n\nTheir enemies say they need but one more piece to repair the road to the stars, and that piece is in the vehicle they used to get to our world.  Kastore's faction also requires this piece to finish their own project--the repair of the Heavenly Forge.  If Kastore's faction receives this artifact, they would use the forge to duplicate their powerful weapons and assume command of our world.  If Ressurectra and her team receives the artifact, they will use it to open the gate to the stars with unknown consequences, possibly opening a hole into the void or offering monsters from other stars like the Devils a way to invade our world.\n\nNow it is up to my lords to retrieve this artifact from their vehicle and return it to one of the two factions of outsiders.  I think Kastore means well, but my judgement has been wrong in the past. "
msgstr "%30\n\n迪雅的那几个大臣果真不是平常人。他们说自己来自另一个世界，常年遨游在太空中，寻找具有古代文明的星球。由于他们的魔法装置发现我们这个星球存在过古代文明，所以才来到了这里。他们有一个远距离传送站，在时空间穿梭就象我们登堂入室一样容易。他们说要在这个世界重新恢复古代文明的荣耀。\n\n但当他们到达我们这里后，卡斯托和他们中的一些人厌倦了这种漫无目的的搜寻，抛弃了曾经执著追求的理想，决定用他们超人的智慧和高度发达的科技来使我们过上好日子。而另外有些人却不改初衷，坚持这样漫无目的地寻找下去。\n\n他们还告诉我们他们那些顽固的同胞为了修复时空之门，得回到送他们来这里的那艘飞船上取一项至关重要的东西。卡斯托也要得到这个东西，以便重建天堂铸造厂。一旦建成的话，他们就能打造威力无比的上古兵器，不费吹灰之力地占领整个星球。但如果瑞瑟雷克特拿到这个东西，他们就能打开时空之门，可到时候不知会产生什么结果。要是把其它星球的怪兽或者恶魔传送过来那可大事不妙。\n\n现在回飞船去取回那个神器的任务又落在我的主人的身上，他必须选择到底把神器交给谁。说实话，我对卡斯托挺有好感，真希望神器能交给他。可是我又不是主人肚子里的蛔虫，怎么会知道他的想法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/MM7history.txt.py:29
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/HISTORY.TXT.py:29
msgctxt "history"
msgid "The citizens of Harmondale have begun to perceive my lords' justice as…a bit harsh.  As of %30 100 citizens have been summarily executed for their crimes against my lords in the streets.  I would like to point out that though the citizens refer to my lords as \"The Terrible\" (e.g. %31 the Terrible), my lords' stern justice has reduced crime in the city streets tremendously.  Many criminals choose to stay indoors rather than walk about the streets for fear my lords will recognize them and bring swift justice down upon their cowardly heads.  History will vindicate my lords' wise policy, I am sure."
msgstr "哈蒙代尔的百姓觉得我主人的正义感似乎有些过头了。就因为%30他一下子处死了一百个人。现在主人已经被冠于暴君的称号了（比如暴君%31）。但是“治乱世必施苛政”，这是古已有之的。如今那些盗贼强盗已经吓得不敢出门了，生怕被别人认出来就地正法，大家必须承认哈蒙代尔这两天确实太平多了。历史会证明一切的，我的主人万岁！"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/MM7history.txt.py:29
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/history.txt.py:29
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/HISTORY.TXT.py:29
msgctxt "history"
msgid "The Terrible"
msgstr "铁石心肠"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:804
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:3
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crude Longsword"
msgstr "长剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:804
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:3
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Though notched and dented, this longsword is still an effective weapon."
msgstr "虽然有缺口和凹痕，但这把长剑仍然是一种有效的武器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:805
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:4
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elven Saber"
msgstr "精灵之刀"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:805
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:4
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Saber"
msgstr "刀"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:805
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:4
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A common elven weapon, this saber is a deadly, if unremarkable, weapon."
msgstr "常见的精灵武器，虽不起眼，但依然可致命。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:806
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:5
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Keen Longsword"
msgstr "勇气之剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:806
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:5
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Although this longsword appears quite old, the edge of the blade is unusually sharp.  It was quite probably enchanted to remain that way during its creation."
msgstr "虽然这把长剑看起来相当古老，但剑刃却异常锋利。很可能是被施了法术，才能保持这种状态。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:807
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:6
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Graceful Sword"
msgstr "优雅之剑"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:6
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An high quality longsword, monogrammed initials near the base of the pommel indicate it was forged by master weaponsmith Mekorig the Blind circa 780-800."
msgstr "这是一把高质量的长剑，剑柄底部附近的字母缩写表明它是由武器名匠盲师麦克林大约在780至800年间锻造的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:808
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:7
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Duelist Blade"
msgstr "决斗之剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:808
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:7
msgctxt "items"
msgid "These rare blades were forged sometime before the Silence, and have been used by noble duelists who want to die in style for centuries.  No two are quite alike, but all share bloody histories."
msgstr "这些罕见的宝剑是在寂静时代之前的某个时候锻造的，几个世纪以来一直被那些想死得体面的贵族决斗者所使用。不同的决斗之剑长得都不尽相同，但都有着血腥的历史。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:809
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:8
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This simple two-handed sword with a leather grip is a common design in Erathia."
msgstr "这种简单的双手剑带着皮革手柄，是埃拉西亚的一种常见设计。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:810
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:9
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An effective, deadly design employed by less well disciplined armies throughout time.  The smith of this particular two-handed sword thoughtfully added a blood groove down the center of the blade."
msgstr "使用了高效而致命的设计，历来被目无法纪的军队所采用。铸剑的铁匠在这把特殊的双手剑剑身中心用心地添加了一条血槽。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:811
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:10
msgctxt "items"
msgid "It is thought by some master swordsmen that a wavy blade is a bit stronger than a straight one, and does more damage when it strikes an opponent.  That may or may not be true, but one thing is certain--this particular sword's craftsmanship is amongst the finest you've ever seen."
msgstr "一些剑术大师认为，波浪形比直线形的剑刃要强，伤害更大。不管这种说法对不对，有一点是肯定的——这把特殊的剑的工艺是你见过的最好的之一。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:812
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:11
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A polished broadsword commonly used by all forces in Erathia."
msgstr "打磨抛光了的宽刃剑，在埃拉西亚随处可见。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:814
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:13
msgctxt "items"
msgid "More a falchion than a broadsword, this magnificent weapon retains a keen edge in spite of its age."
msgstr "古老的宽刃剑，但仍然非常锋利。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:815
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:14
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The swept-back style of the cutlass helps opponents underestimate the weapon's true reach.  Many unexperienced swordsmen have lost their lives to this deceptive design."
msgstr "这把短刀有着外表所看不出的力量，许多没有经验的剑客都由于轻视它而丧命。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:816
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:15
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Goblin Cutlass"
msgstr "大耳怪短刀"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:816
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:15
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A strange mix of brass and some other, reddish metal provide this weapon with its strange color and unusual strength.  Goblin craftsman are typically unconcerned with appearance, but when it comes to killing, they can be counted on to get it right.  "
msgstr "这把短刀由黄铜和一些红色的金属制成，因此泛出一种奇异的光泽。它由大耳怪制造，见血封喉。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:19
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:21
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:16
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Regnan Cutlass"
msgstr "雷格那短刀"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:818
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:17
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A crude dagger found in the hands of thieves and ruffians everywhere."
msgstr "被盗贼和恶徒广泛使用的武器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:819
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:18
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dwarven Dagger"
msgstr "矮人匕首"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:819
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:18
msgctxt "items"
msgid "More like a short sword to a dwarf, this dagger is an excellent example of superior dwarven engineering and inferior artistic creativity."
msgstr "这是把矮人经常使用的匕首，造型精美。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:820
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:19
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sharktooth Dagger"
msgstr "利齿匕首"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:820
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:19
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The 'blade' of this dagger is really a sharks' tooth taken from the waters of the Quiet Ocean and mounted on a fancy handle.  It is very sharp and light."
msgstr "这把匕首是用鲨鱼的牙齿打造的，又轻又锋利。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:821
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:20
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Assassin's Dagger"
msgstr "刺客匕首"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:821
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:20
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The crosspiece of this dagger folds in to make concealment easier.  A spring in the pommel snaps the crosspiece out very quietly when the dagger is drawn from its sheath."
msgstr "这把匕首非常易于隐藏，把它从刀鞘里抽出来时也无声无息。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:822
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:21
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A weapon from the Time of Wonders, it is no longer possible to achieve a sharper or stronger edge."
msgstr "这是从奇迹时代流传下来的兵器，年代久远，质量上乘。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:823
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:22
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The long dagger combines the extra reach of the sword with the stealth of the dagger."
msgstr "它是普通的长匕首。宽度与剑相同，锋刃较长，便于隐藏。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:824
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:23
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Erathian Long Dagger"
msgstr "埃拉西亚长匕首"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:825
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:24
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Exquisite Long Dagger"
msgstr "神奇长匕首"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:825
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:24
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The spare, yet appealing design of this long dagger is typical of pre-Silence artifacts.  This particular style was very popular at the time, but since more than a thousand years have passed, few remain.  Like everything from the time of the Silence, it looks as new as the day it was made."
msgstr "这种长匕首的备用设计很吸引人，它是寂静时代前神器的典型代表。这种特殊的样式在当时非常受欢迎，但是经过一千多年的历史，此类设计已非常罕见。正如所有来自寂静时代的物品一样，它看起来像刚被打造出来时一样新。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:826
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:25
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crude Axe"
msgstr "大斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:826
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:25
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This primitive axe is more like a simple tool than a weapon."
msgstr "与其说是兵器，不如说是一件工具。杀伤力极其微弱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:827
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:26
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The flared edge of the blade is a common style used by low budget human armies and bandits."
msgstr "是战斗中使用的斧子。野人和散兵游勇经常使用此类兵器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:828
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:27
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Typical Dwarven manufacture:  Strong, practical, and plain."
msgstr "是由矮人族打制的上乘兵器。它锋利无比，造型优美，比例协调。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:829
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Steel Axe"
msgstr "钢斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:829
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "items"
msgid "One of several crates full of such axes stolen from the Dwarves by the Warlocks of Nighon.  Each of these weapons has been tempered and enchanted by the Stone City foundry, and stamped with their mark."
msgstr "这是尼根的邪术师们从矮人族那里偷来的战斧，上面有石头城铸造厂的印记，货真价实。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:830
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:29
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Minotaur Axe"
msgstr "人马战斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:830
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:29
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Double bladed axes like these are powerfully enchanted by Minotaur sorcerers in a secret process known only to them.  These axes are light where they should be heavy, and slice through metal armor as easily as they slice through cloth."
msgstr "这是牛头怪巫师用高超的工艺打造的双刃魔法战斧。它非常轻巧，而且经魔法点化，所以锋利无比 ，可切金断玉。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:831
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:30
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Poleaxe"
msgstr "屠斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:831
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:30
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This style of long hafted axe has better reach and more power than the normal one-handed axe."
msgstr "这把长柄屠斧比一般的战斧更为锋利，而且攻击范围很大。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:832
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:31
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Warrior's Poleaxe"
msgstr "勇士屠斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:832
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:31
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This poleaxe has a sharper blade equipped with all the latest in military technology:  Blood grooves, whistle-holes, and a counterbalanced, smaller blade behind the haft for tricky, disembowling, backstrokes."
msgstr "造型精美的长柄战斧，体现出兵器铸造工艺的最高水平。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:833
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:32
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Headsman's Poleaxe"
msgstr "刽子手屠斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:833
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:32
msgctxt "items"
msgid "So named for the execution device favored by headsmen, the Headsman's Poleaxe sports a longer blade to reduce messy and embarassing execution mistakes.  "
msgstr "这是刽子手经常使用的斧子，斧柄颀长，可顷刻致人死命。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:834
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:33
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crude Spear"
msgstr "长矛"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:834
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:33
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Though constructed with a head of sharpened rock lashed to a rough stick, this spear can cause serious damage. (+1D9 if used two-handed)."
msgstr "尽管只是一根削尖的棍子，但仍有致命的威力。与其它长矛一样，既可单手又可双手使用（双手使用时+1D9）。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:835
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:34
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Soldier's spear"
msgstr "战士之矛"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:835
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:34
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Spears like this are found in all armies where their versatility as both pole and melee weapons are demonstrated regulary."
msgstr "这是在军队中普遍使用的精良长矛，远攻和近战同样适宜。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:836
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:35
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elven Spear"
msgstr "精灵之矛"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:836
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:35
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elven weapons are almost always as graceful as they are practical.  The spear's style and elegance have not come at the expense of practical qualities such as the sturdy attachement of head to haft, nor the choices of metal and haft grip."
msgstr "这把精灵制造的武器简直是一件艺术品，上面有各种镶嵌物品和雕刻，不过，它仍然是可怕的武器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:837
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:36
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Cruel Spear"
msgstr "冷酷之矛"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:837
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:36
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The triangular shape of the spear head leads to especially painful wounds that do not heal easily or well.  Runic enchantments inscribed along the haft suggest enchantments that enhance the cruel effect of the triangular head."
msgstr "矛尖的三角形设计增加了杀伤力，被这柄长矛刺中后很难恢复。此外，它被赋予神秘的魔法，所以是一件致命的武器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:838
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:37
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sublime Spear"
msgstr "神圣之矛"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:838
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:37
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A smithy symbol and date stamp indicate this spear was made in the magical forges of Governor Padish 12 years before the Silence."
msgstr "矛柄上的锻造符号和日期印记表明，这支长矛是在寂静时代前12年由帕第什总督的魔法铸造厂制造的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:839
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:38
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Like all Halberds, this weapon is basically an axe with a very long haft.  It's a versatile weapon--doubling as a spear when fighting room is tight, or a staff when personal defense is needed.  This one is of ordinary worksmanship and materials."
msgstr "它集战斧和长矛于一身，杀伤力巨大，也可以用来防御。它质量一般，造型古朴。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:840
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:39
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Weighted Halberd"
msgstr "重戟"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:840
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:39
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The haft of this halberd has been cored, and filled with a lead rod.  When the weapon is swung, the lead rod slides to the blade end of the halberd with a loud crack, adding force and weight to the blow."
msgstr "此兵器坚硬无比，锋刃经特殊处理，特别沉重。如果由力大无比的勇士使用，可杀死最难对付的怪兽。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:841
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:40
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Mighty Halberd"
msgstr "力量之戟"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:841
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:40
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A small stamp on the blade of this weapon indicates it was constructed in the famous Mekorig Foundry by the master himself, Mekorig the Blind.  You would be hard pressed to find a finer Halberd anywhere in the world "
msgstr "此兵器锋刃上的标记说明它是由闻名遐迩的麦克林兵器锻造厂老板麦克林亲手打造的。它乃是天下一流的长戟。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:842
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:41
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A variant of the farmer's pitchfork, the trident had been used by spear fishermen since time began.  Now it is the traditional weapon of sea-going warriors throughout the world."
msgstr "它是根据农夫的草叉改造的，长久以来广为渔人们所使用，现在已经成为海上战斗的标准武器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:843
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:42
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Barbed Trident"
msgstr "带刺三叉戟"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:843
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:42
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Improving on the basic trident design, the tips of the tines have rough, backwards facing barbs.  This designs causes much more damage as the weapon is pulled from the victim."
msgstr "这是根据普通的三叉戟改良后的武器，叉刃上有尖刺，杀伤力惊人。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:844
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:43
msgctxt "items"
msgid "War Trident"
msgstr "战斗三叉戟"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:844
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:43
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A style favored by the Imerial Regnan Navy, the two side tines of the war trident are thin and sharp to make slashing as easy as stabbing.  To further impress enemies, the tines are gilded in brass, and the haft painted yellow, giving the appearance that the Regnans are fighting with golden weapons."
msgstr "这种三叉戟质量上乘，由雷格那的帝国海军专用。叉尖用黄铜打造，叉柄涂成金黄色，看上去就象是黄金打造的"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:845
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:44
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crude Bow"
msgstr "弓箭"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:846
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:45
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A higher quality long bow designed after the elven long bow, but without the elven skill."
msgstr "是由埃拉西亚森林中的精灵打制的兵器。它显示了埃拉西亚的精灵高超的工艺水平。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:847
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:46
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elven Longbow"
msgstr "精灵之弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:847
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:46
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Etched initials at the base of the bow indicate this bow was made by master bowyer Ivan Selving's workshop during the Timber Wars of the late 600's."
msgstr "弓箭上的蚀刻图案表明此弓是在600年代晚期在埃拉西亚精灵们的木材战争中由著名的造弓大师伊万·塞尔文打制。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:848
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:47
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Composite Bow"
msgstr "精准弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:848
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:47
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Composite bows are made of a variety of materials and pieces, instead of a single piece of wood.  They are generally more flexible and powerful than regular bows."
msgstr "此弓由多种不同的材料打制而成，质地轻巧，百发百中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:849
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:48
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Griffin Bow"
msgstr "狮鹫之弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:849
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:48
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The grisly materials used in this bow--a griffin's skull and tough spine--make for a surprisingly tough and powerful bow.  Needless to say, the materials are hard to harvest, and griffins fight back much harder than Yew trees."
msgstr "这把弓由狮鹫的头骨和脊椎骨打制而成，有惊人的攻击力。不过，因为捕猎狮鹫极为危险，所以这种弓产量非常少。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:850
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:49
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Although crossbows have many advantages--locking string catches, superior shot strength, easy to learn--they don't compare to the longbow when speed and range are critical.  "
msgstr "十字弓是致命的远距离杀伤性武器，而且易于使用，但是速度和射程比不上长弓。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:851
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:50
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Heavy Crossbow"
msgstr "重型十字弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:852
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:51
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ideal Crossbow"
msgstr "完美十字弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:853
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:52
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Barely more sophisticated than a normal club, the mace is slightly more effective and much more durable."
msgstr "仅是一把粗头棍而已。工艺平凡，质地粗糙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:854
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:53
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Spiked Mace"
msgstr "力量钉锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:854
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:53
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This weapon is designed to inflict good damage to both armored and unarmored opponents."
msgstr "质地坚硬，可穿透铠甲致敌死命。造型虽略显笨拙，但工艺出色。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:855
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:54
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Zealot Mace"
msgstr "狂热钉锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:855
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:54
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A common mace from Karigor, it displays the same superior quality of all weapons and equipment from that island."
msgstr "这是卡力格岛上出产的武器，制造精良。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:856
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:55
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dwarven Morningstar"
msgstr "矮人流星锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:856
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:55
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A variation of the mace, the morningstar hits slower but much harder.  The spikes on the ball guarantee recipients will feel the blow, regardless of armor or hide."
msgstr "这把流星锤是根据钉锤改造的，速度较慢，但威力惊人，可以穿透非常厚实的铠甲，对敌人造成巨大的伤害。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:857
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Supreme Flail"
msgstr "战斗连枷"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:857
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A heavier, more menacing weapon than a morningstar, flails are almost as dangerous to their wielder as they are to opponents.  Flails like this one are of the highest quality, thoroughly enchanted by the Warlock Guild of Nighon."
msgstr "这是件重型武器，挥舞起来极为可怕，但使用不当的话会伤着自己。它的制造工艺极为先进，并且被尼根的邪术师行会附着了神秘的魔法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:858
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:57
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A crude, tool-like weapon, this hammer includes a wrist chain to prevent it from dropping from your hand."
msgstr "这是件形状简陋的兵器，柄上有一条手链以防止从手上脱落。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:58
msgctxt "items"
msgid "War Hammer"
msgstr "战争之锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:860
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:59
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dwarven Hammer"
msgstr "矮人之锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:860
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:59
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The top of the line for the hammer family of weapons.  This Dwarven hammer was constructed in the forges of Stone City, and every feature is perfect--balance, weight, handle material, head construction--all the best possible with modern metalurgical techniques."
msgstr "矮人之锤是石头城铸造工厂打造的锤中极品。它无论在手感、重量、设计或平衡性上都堪称完美。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:861
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A primitive weapon usable by even the stupidest of monsters.  This club is constructed of Erathian oak."
msgstr "是天下最愚蠢的怪兽才会使用的原始兵器，它是用埃拉西亚橡木制造的。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:62
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Steel club"
msgstr "钢制粗头棍"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:863
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:62
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The symmetry and length of the knob at the end of the club is the only feature that distinguishes this club from a mace.  The balance is good, the construction is solid, but it IS still a club, and you can't expect that much from it.  Probably of Goblin manufacture."
msgstr "顶端球状物的长度和对称性是这支粗头棍区别于钉锤的唯一特点。平衡性很好，结构很牢固，但它仍然是一根粗头棍，你不能对它有多大的期待。这大概是大耳怪制造的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:864
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:63
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The staff is the common weapon of the oppressed."
msgstr "这种手杖是底层人士的常用兵器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:865
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:64
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Iron Core Staff"
msgstr "铁心手杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:865
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:64
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This staff has been filled with iron to give a harder punch than an ordinary staff, while appearing to be nothing more than a fancy walking stick.  The wood is polished Ash, carved with a tasteful design."
msgstr "它的内部是铁制的，所以比一般的手杖杀伤力更高，但看上去却象普通的木杖。它的表面由精良的木材制成，还雕刻了精美的花纹。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:866
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:65
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wizard Staff"
msgstr "法师之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:866
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:65
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A weird combination of wood, glass and aluminum form the staff, while a crystalline skull tops it.  The whole weapon is bound together with glue and strong enchantments to make one of the lightest, strongest staves in the world."
msgstr "这把法师之杖是由木材、玻璃、铝和水晶制成的，质地非常轻巧。上面还附加了强力的魔法，所以威力巨大。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:868
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:67
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The finest of personal weapons made during the Time of Wonders, Blaster Rifles can deal death faster than any weapon you have ever seen."
msgstr "它是在奇迹时代制造的最完美的供个人使用的武器。它攻击速度奇快，可以顷刻致人于死地。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:869
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:68
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Leather armor is the lightest and most easily worn armor, but it offers less protection that the heavier armors.  The leather in this suit was improperly cured and still stinks of the chemicals used in its production."
msgstr "它是所有铠甲中制作最简单，最轻便的一种。保护性最差，质地一般。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:870
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:69
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This suit of leather armor is held together with bronze studs instead of leather straps.  This construction makes it a bit stronger, but also a bit heavier."
msgstr "比普通皮甲重，保护性也强一些。它的制造工艺相当不错。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:871
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:70
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Officer's Leather"
msgstr "魔法皮甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:88
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:90
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:71
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Regnan Leather"
msgstr "雷格那皮甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:873
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:72
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Royal Leather"
msgstr "皇室之甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:873
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:72
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Only a few suits like this one have been made, and all were special orders for members of the royal family of Erathia--the Gryphonhearts.  This one had to come from one of three places:  Stolen from the palace armory, taken on the battlefield, or robbed from a grave."
msgstr "这种皮甲是专门为埃拉西亚的格芬哈特皇室制造的，所以极为稀有。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:874
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:73
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Chain mail is an armor formed of small, interlocking loops of metal.  It looks like someone forgot to oil the rings, or maybe left it out in the rain because rust has begun to form in the armpits and under the collars."
msgstr "锁甲由一片片互相连接的小钢叶组合而成。这件铠甲质量一般，由普通铁皮做成，相当沉重，而且已经开始生锈。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:875
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:74
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This suit of chain mail is made of steel and is actually lighter than similar suits made of plain iron.  Thin rings were used in its construction, but the steel composition makes them very strong."
msgstr "这是一件精钢制成的铠甲，比一般铁制的铠甲轻得多，而且防御力大大增强。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:876
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:75
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Fine Chain Mail"
msgstr "精制锁甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:876
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:75
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Very high quality steel is reinforced with fine studded leather to soften blows while minimizing weight.  The leather portions are quite artistic and pleasing to the eye."
msgstr "这件锁甲穿着轻便，保护性极强，质地柔软，外观也非常令人满意。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:877
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:76
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Resplendent Chain Mail"
msgstr "光辉锁甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:877
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:76
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A distinctive suit of armor meant to aid recognition of officers during battle.  Besides just looking good, the armor is amongst the lightest, most supple chain mail available.  "
msgstr "这是件外观精美的锁甲，非常轻巧，在战斗时通常由军官穿着。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:878
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:77
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Golden Chain Mail"
msgstr "黄金锁甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:878
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:77
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A very rare suit of armor turned out by the Heavenly Forges of Governor Padish before the Silence.  The armor was originally worn strictly by the Governor's highest military officers as a badge of office.  It is not just for show; this chain mail is lighter, stronger, and more supple than any other chain in the world."
msgstr "一件非常罕见的铠甲，在寂静时代以前由帕第什总督的天堂铸造厂所制。此铠甲原本只有总督的最高级军事官员才可穿着，作为其职务的象征。它并不只是为了炫耀，这种锁甲比世界上任何其他锁甲更轻、更强、更柔韧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:879
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:78
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Plate armor is the strongest armor available.  It is much heavier than other suits of armor, and requires considerable practice to get used to wearing.  This suit is made of iron, and the workmanship is unremarkable."
msgstr "它由钢片连接而成，防御性非常好。但因为比较重，穿着者显得笨拙不堪。这种铠甲质地一般，不是由名厂打造的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:880
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:79
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Splendid Plate Armor"
msgstr "光辉钢甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:880
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:79
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Forged in an Erathian armory, this suit of plate armor bears a recent stamp:  B.R., Steadwick Foundry, 1151.  The initials are those of Byron Rockermann, Royal armorsmith of Erathia.  His work is competent and elegant."
msgstr "这是件精良的钢甲。右臂的印记表明它是最近在埃拉西亚的皇家武器铸造厂打造的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:881
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:80
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Noble Plate Armor"
msgstr "贵族钢甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:881
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:80
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A suit of armor so fine could only have come from the forge of the Master himself--Mekorig the Blind.  Indeed, this one bears the initials of his son, Kasev Mekorig near the heel.  The joints move easily, and the metal has a curious triple plated construction that makes it thin and light, yet incredibly strong.  Padding in comfortable, too."
msgstr "这件钢甲是盲师麦克林本人制成的，是一件不朽的杰作，穿上这件铠甲就如同穿平常衣物，几乎感觉不到重量，而且它的防御力惊人，堪称天下第一甲。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:882
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:81
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Goblin Shield"
msgstr "大耳怪盾牌"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:882
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:81
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A simple, old shield with crude markings on its face.  Ugly, but practical."
msgstr "非常简单实用的盾牌。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:883
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:82
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This shield is made of wood framed by iron.  It is heavy, but well constructed and in good condition."
msgstr "这种木制盾牌有一层铁皮镶边，虽然比较重，但质量一流。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:884
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:83
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Horseman's Shield"
msgstr "骑士盾牌"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:884
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:83
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Narrow and tapered at the bottom, this shield is intended for battle on horseback, but will work just fine on foot.  Construction is tight and materials are tough--it should be able to resist a direct spear thrust."
msgstr "这是一面专门为骑兵打造的盾牌，但实际上也同样适用于步兵作战。它质地精良，可以抵挡锋利的长矛。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:885
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:84
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sterling Shield"
msgstr "力量盾牌"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:886
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:85
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Phynaxian Shield"
msgstr "菲尼克斯盾牌"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:105
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:107
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:86
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wooden Buckler"
msgstr "木制小圆盾"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:887
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:86
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A small wood buckler designed to protect against arrows without encumbering its wielder.  The quality is amaturish, but it's in good condition and will serve its purpose."
msgstr "这种木质小型盾牌对防御弓箭很有效。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:889
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:88
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Metal Shield"
msgstr "精制盾牌"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:889
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:88
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The pretty red design on the surface of this shield means it's from Deyja, and the paint isn't paint.  Emulsifiers and preservatives help to retain the original color…"
msgstr "根据表面的红色图案可以推断出这种盾牌产于迪雅。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:890
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:89
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Alloyed Shield"
msgstr "合金盾牌"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:890
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:89
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The exact mixture of metals in these strong shields has been lost for hundreds of years.  Attempts to rediscover the process used to make them have been miserable failures.  There is absolutely nothing enchanted or magical about these shields--any enchantment they carry was added after they were created.  "
msgstr "制造这种合金的技术已经失传很久了，而且它在当初打造时就被赋予了魔法。所以没有人知道应该如何打造这种盾牌。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:891
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:90
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Majestic Shield"
msgstr "皇家盾牌"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:891
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:90
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The dark, golden color of these shields is actually a flaw.  About fifty of these shields were turned out by the Heavenly Forge as it began to fail.  Although imperfect, they are second only to shields built by the Forge in its prime."
msgstr "在多年以前，天堂铸造厂里处理了大约50件次品，其中包括这面盾牌。但就算是天堂铸造厂的次品，在市场上也被视为极品。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:892
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:91
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Horned Helm"
msgstr "守护头盔"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:892
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:91
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This cheap helm is better suited for a costume party than a battle.  The horns have been glued onto a rigid leather cap dyed black to make it look scarier.  The material is brittle and flaky, and will probably come apart at just the wrong time."
msgstr "一件普通的头盔，装饰性大于实用性。由木质骨架和毛皮包裹而成。由于里面无任何填充物，所以保护性相当差。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:893
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:92
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Conscript's Helm"
msgstr "神奇头盔"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:893
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:92
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The simple style and uniformity of these helms is meant to strike terror into the hearts of enemies when they see row upon row of bronze, spiked helms marching toward them.  "
msgstr "这件头盔设计简单，造型传统，适合在军队中使用。当敌人看到成百上千个头盔同时闪闪发光时，一定会吓破了胆。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:112
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:114
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:93
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Full Helm"
msgstr "防御头盔"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:895
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:94
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Phynaxian Helm"
msgstr "菲尼克斯头盔"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:895
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:94
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Worn by Phynaxian Dragoons during the expansion of their empire a few hundred years ago, these helms are tough, flexible, and light.  They are made of two strips of dragonhide bound together with stalt metal studs."
msgstr "在几百年前的帝国扩张过程中，菲尼克斯王国的龙骑兵佩戴了这种头盔，它们坚韧、灵活、轻便，是由两根龙皮条用斯多克金属钉绑在一起制成的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:896
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:95
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Mogred Helm"
msgstr "英勇头盔"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:896
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:95
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Half made from the skull of the ferocious Mogred beast in Karigor, these helms grow more uncommon every year as the Mogreds approach extinction.  Two poisonous spines used to grow from the red spots on the front of the helm."
msgstr "以卡力格最凶猛的莫格里德怪兽的头盖骨为原料制成。如今这种怪兽数量越来越少，该头盔也越加珍贵。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:897
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:96
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Peasant Hat"
msgstr "农夫之帽"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:897
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:96
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A common, cloth hat with a feather stuck in the band to add a dash of style."
msgstr "一顶普通的布帽，边上插有羽毛。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:898
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:97
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Traveller's Hat"
msgstr "旅行者之帽"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:898
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:97
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A simple hat meant to keep sun and dust off a traveller's head."
msgstr "为旅行者挡风遮雨的帽子。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:899
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:98
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The latest in fashion, this hat harkens back to more of a working class style.  It isn't really the hat that's in style, it's the working man that young nobles are trying to emulate--who in turn seeks to emulate the nobleman…"
msgstr "一顶造型优美，非常时髦的布帽。在上等阶层中非常流行。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:900
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:99
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This is a cheap crown of the sort that primitive goblins wear to mock human customs.  The metal is bronze, and the gem is made of glass."
msgstr "一些大耳怪和穷演员为了嘲弄皇室才做了这么顶破破烂烂的头冠。它由黄铜制成，而宝石则是玻璃做的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:901
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:100
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Noble Crown"
msgstr "贵族之冠"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:100
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A fine, if somewhat ostentatious crown made with gold leaf and large, high quality amythests.  It suits nobles of your station well."
msgstr "镶嵌了金条和紫水晶的漂亮头冠，在年轻人中非常流行。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:903
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:102
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A peasant's belt.  This one is made of poorly cured leather and rusting iron studs."
msgstr "农夫用的皮带，做工粗糙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:904
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:103
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Fine Belt"
msgstr "精制皮带"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:904
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:103
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A well crafted belt of well tanned leather and fine stitching.  The buckle is made of polished silver."
msgstr "做工精良的皮带，扣子上镶了一层水银。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:905
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:104
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Strong Belt"
msgstr "神奇腰带"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:905
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:104
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A tough, yet high quality leather belt.  This one was probably made in western Erathia.  "
msgstr "做工精良的皮带，可能是在埃拉西亚的西部生产的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:906
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:105
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Silver Belt"
msgstr "银腰带"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:906
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:105
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A very nicely made silver belt, this one is old, but well cared for.  There's no trace of tarnish on any of the links--just a bit of wear around the buckle."
msgstr "这条皮带由上好的白银制成，柔软而有弹性。它年代久远，但仍然和新的一样。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:907
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:106
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Gilded Belt"
msgstr "奇幻腰带"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:106
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Gaudy to an extreme, this belt is made of sold 14 karet gold.  Each link has a different, low quality image stamped on its face.  Tasteless, but valuable."
msgstr "这是一条奢华的皮带，用黄金打造而成，上面还雕刻了各种图案。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:908
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:107
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A simple traveller's cloak."
msgstr "旅行者所使用的披风。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:909
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:108
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Huntsman's Cloak"
msgstr "猎人披风"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:909
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:108
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A huntsman's cloak colored green to make the wearer difficult to see in the forest.  Not much to look at, but it serves its purpose."
msgstr "猎人使用的披风，为了便于伪装而涂成了绿色。虽不雅观，但很实用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:910
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:109
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ranger's Cloak"
msgstr "巡逻披风"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:109
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Woven from plant fibers found in the Tularean Forest, these cloaks are the traditional garb of the Elven Rangers."
msgstr "这件披风用图拉利昂森林里的植物纤维制成，是精灵游骑兵的传统装备。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:911
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:110
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elegant Cloak"
msgstr "精制披风"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:911
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:110
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This cloak is of the quality preferred by wealthy nobles and royalty.  It is hard to find better."
msgstr "这是贵族们爱穿的华丽披风。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:912
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:111
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Glorious Cloak"
msgstr "圣洁披风"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:912
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:111
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Almost all cloaks like this one come with some sort of enchantment.  The Warlocks of Nighon employ legions of mentally enslaved people to perform the tedious weaving and ritual spell casting necessary to make these cloaks."
msgstr "这类披风上通常附有魔法，它们都是尼根的邪术师们动用大量人力物力才制造出来的精品。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:913
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:112
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Low quality iron gauntlets with cloth linings to prevent blisters.  "
msgstr "一双造型古朴，结构简单的铁质手套。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:130
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:914
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:132
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:113
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Steel Gauntlets"
msgstr "钢手套"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:914
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:113
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This pair of gauntlets is made of steel and decorated with brass tracery along the outside of the palm and back of the hand.  It is in good repair and well oiled."
msgstr "这种钢质手套在设计上已经有了大的改进。它的手背和手腕部分非常坚硬，手指部分用钢片连接以提高灵巧性。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:915
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:114
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Silver Mesh Gauntlets"
msgstr "银手套"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:915
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:114
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A marvelous achievement, these gauntlets were forged and woven by the Dwarves of Stone City.  The offer both flexibility and strong protection.  The only trouble is that the wearer's skin is sometimes caught in the mesh, leading to painful pinches."
msgstr "这双精美的手套由石头城的矮人打造，非常耐用。唯一的缺点是有时手会不太舒服。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:916
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:115
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragon Hide Gauntlets"
msgstr "龙之手套"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:917
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:116
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Mogred Gauntlets"
msgstr "神奇手套"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:917
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:116
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Made from the hide of the Mogred beast on Karigor, these gauntlets are tough, supple, and magic resistant.  The two red spots used to have poisonous spines growing from them."
msgstr "以卡力格最凶猛的莫格里德怪兽为原料制成的手套。它非常牢固，而且可以抵抗魔法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:918
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:117
msgctxt "items"
msgid "These boots are made of soft leather for a more comfortable fit, but they offer little protection in combat."
msgstr "这是一双皮制的靴子，防御力很差。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:919
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:118
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Steel Plated Boots"
msgstr "钢靴"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:919
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:118
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This pair of leather boots has been fitted with steel plates on the top of the foot and at the shin."
msgstr "这是一双镶上钢板的靴子，非常牢固。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:920
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:119
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ranger Boots"
msgstr "巡逻之靴"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:920
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:119
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A quality set of Erathian leather boots.  This pair has the usual features of Erathian leather craftsmanship:  Soft, water resistant, and quiet.  "
msgstr "埃拉西亚出产的优质皮靴，不但轻便、柔软，而且防水性能也很好。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:921
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:120
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Knight's Boots"
msgstr "骑士之靴"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:922
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:121
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Paladin Boots"
msgstr "圣武士之靴"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:922
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:121
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Made in the forge of Byron Rockermann, these silver and steel boots are amongst the best in the world.  The are enormously strong, yet fit comfortable and flexibly in all the right spots."
msgstr "这是一双由精钢和白银制成的皮靴，堪称世间极品。它穿着舒适，保护性无与伦比。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:923
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:122
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Brass Ring"
msgstr "铜戒指"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:923
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:122
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A tarnished brass ring.  Polished up, you might be able to sell it for something…but don't expect much."
msgstr "这是一枚造型精美的指环，你可以把它卖掉换几个小钱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:140
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:924
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:142
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:123
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Pearl Ring"
msgstr "珍珠戒指"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:924
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:123
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A large, imperfect pearl adorns this otherwise unremarkable gold ring."
msgstr "镶有珍珠的白金戒指。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:925
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:124
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Platinum Ring"
msgstr "白金戒指"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:925
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:124
msgctxt "items"
msgid "At first glance silver, this ring is actually made of platinum.  The gemstone is a small, flawed diamond."
msgstr "这是一枚白金戒指，上面镶嵌了一块钻石。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:926
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:125
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Emerald Ring"
msgstr "翡翠戒指"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:926
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:125
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A large, cut emerald adorns an otherwise plain silver ring."
msgstr "镶有翡翠的银戒指。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:927
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:126
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sapphire Ring"
msgstr "水晶戒指"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:927
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:126
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Three small sapphires are mounted at the top of this silver and gold ring.  Rings of this quality are often enchanted."
msgstr "镶有许多蓝宝石的戒指，通常附着了魔法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:928
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:127
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Warlock's Ring"
msgstr "邪术师指环"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:127
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This complex and gaudy arrangement of amythests on platinum can be appealing, if you like that sort of thing."
msgstr "镶有紫水晶的指环，非常精致。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:929
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:128
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Enchanted Ring"
msgstr "迷人指环"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:929
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:128
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A rare gem-within-gem of emerald and garnet is set upon a fine gold ring."
msgstr "镶着一颗稀有宝石的指环，精巧迷人。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:930
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:129
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dazzling Ring"
msgstr "神奇戒指"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:930
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:129
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A beautiful rosetta of rubies and emeralds on gold backing.  The ring itself is platinum."
msgstr "镶有翡翠和红宝石的白金戒指。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:931
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:130
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wizard Ring"
msgstr "魔法指环"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:931
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:130
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Three perfect garnets set into silver belie the enchantments used to create this ring.  Handling the ring for long makes your hand tingle."
msgstr "这枚指环上镶嵌着三颗宝石，这些宝石里蕴藏了惊人的魔法力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:932
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:131
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Angel's Ring"
msgstr "天使戒指"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:932
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:131
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A very strange brown stone (petrified wood?) is mounted on a metal that looks like gold, but is much lighter."
msgstr "这枚戒指看上去似乎是由黄金制成的，但它实际上比黄金轻得多，里面蕴藏了神秘的力量。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:933
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:132
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Eyeball Amulet"
msgstr "神眼护身符"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:933
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:132
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This strange amulet has a glass eye on the end of a cheap brass chain.  A novelty, but probably not worth much."
msgstr "镶上一颗玻璃眼珠的新奇的护身符，但看来值不了几个钱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:934
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:133
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Bronze Amulet"
msgstr "青铜护身符"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:934
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:133
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A baroque bronze amulet with an ill define image stamped on the face.  Cheap, and tasteless."
msgstr "青铜制成的护身符，上面有一些奇怪的图案，便宜而缺乏品位。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:935
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:134
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Witch's Amulet"
msgstr "银手护身符"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:935
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:134
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A plaster cast of a baby's hand was used to form this strange silver amulet.  There is some unidentifiable symbol stamped in the center of the amulet."
msgstr "这是一枚银制的护身符，上面有许多奇怪的图案。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:936
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:135
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Death's Head Pendant"
msgstr "死亡护身符"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:936
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:135
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Straight out of Deyja, this is just the sort of thing you would expect from Necromancers.  The silver skull in the center is modeled from a real, shrunken skull, and the tiny rubies in the eyes glow in the dark."
msgstr "这是由迪雅的巫师制造的护身符。上面有一个小小的由纯银制成的骷髅雕像，据说是根据真人的头盖骨打造的。那两颗红宝石做成的眼睛在黑夜里会闪闪发光。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:937
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:136
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sun Amulet"
msgstr "太阳护身符"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:937
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:136
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A glorious gold amulet with the ancient symbol of the sun in the center.  The amulet is from Karigor, and the craftsmanship is flawless."
msgstr "这件黄金制成的护身符上刻有古代的太阳图腾。它来自卡力格，做工精美，堪称极品。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:938
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:137
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wand of Fire"
msgstr "烈火之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:938
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:939
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:940
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:941
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:942
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:137
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:138
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:139
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:140
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:141
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The magical process that was used to enchant this wand turned it sky blue.  It's made of wood and glass.  To use this wand, you must equip it as though you were equipping a weapon."
msgstr "这是一把造型精美的魔杖。你必须将它当作武器一样装备好才能使用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:939
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:138
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wand of Sparks"
msgstr "火光之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:940
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:139
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wand of Poison"
msgstr "毒药之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:942
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:141
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wand of Harm"
msgstr "攻击之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:943
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:142
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Fairy Wand of Light"
msgstr "光明仙杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:943
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:944
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:945
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:946
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:947
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:142
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:143
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:144
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:145
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:146
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A wooden wand painted green and banded with brass.  The wand is capped with a large, flawed emerald.  To use this wand, you must equip it as though you were equipping a weapon."
msgstr "这是一把造型精美的魔杖。你必须将它当作武器一样装备好才能使用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:944
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:143
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Fairy Wand of Ice"
msgstr "寒冰仙杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:945
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:144
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Fairy Wand of Lashing"
msgstr "狂暴仙杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:947
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:146
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Fairy Wand of Swarms"
msgstr "神奇仙杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:948
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:949
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:950
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:951
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:952
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:147
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:148
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:149
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:150
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:151
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Made from the hollowed out horn of a unicorn and capped with a spiked brass ball, wands like these are born of cruelty and evil.  The enchantment it holds is useful;  the only real question is whether you believe your cause justifies the use of an item so wickedly created.  To use this wand, you must equip it as though you were equipping a weapon."
msgstr "这是用独角兽的角打造的魔杖，上面镶嵌了一颗黄铜制成的小球。这把魔杖上流露出一股邪恶的气息。你必须将它当作武器一样装备好才能使用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:949
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:148
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Alacorn Wand of Acid"
msgstr "酸雨权杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:950
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:149
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Alacorn Wand of Lightning"
msgstr "闪电权杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:953
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:954
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:955
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:956
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:957
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:152
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:153
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:154
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:155
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:156
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A wand of polished ebony capped with the shrunken, bejeweled head of a fallen enemy.  These wands can hold very strong enchantments.  To use this wand, you must equip it as though you were equipping a weapon."
msgstr "这是一把抛光乌木魔杖，杖头顶端饰有一颗萎缩的、镶嵌着宝石的敌人头颅。这根魔杖可以附着强大的魔法。你必须将它当作武器一样装备好才能使用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1754
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:153
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Arcane Wand of the Fist"
msgstr "怒拳之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:958
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:959
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:960
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:961
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:962
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:157
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:158
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:159
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:160
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:161
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The precious egg of a phoenix was snatched from the fire before it could hatch to make the headstone of this wand.  The rest of the wand is made of steel and plated with gold.  To use this wand, you must equip it as though you were equipping a weapon."
msgstr "这把魔杖的顶部由一枚凤凰的蛋制成，手柄则由精钢制成，表面还镀上了一层黄金。你必须将它当作武器一样装备好才能使用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:962
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:161
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Mystic Wand of Incineration"
msgstr "炽天神杖"

