msgctxt "items"
msgid "Grey Potion"
msgstr "灰色药剂"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:223
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Catalysts are mixed with potions to modify the strength of the potion.  The potion will take the strength of the catalyst you mix with it.  Be careful not to mix a strong potion with a weak catalyst!  To use, pick up the catalyst and right-click over another potion."
msgstr "催化剂和药剂混合后可以增强药剂的威力，所以记住不要把强力药剂和比较差的催化剂混合！（要制造药剂，请拿起草药/试剂，然后右键单击一空药剂瓶）"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:224
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Heals 10 plus the potion strength hit points.  To drink, pick the potion up and right-click over a character's portrait.  To mix, pick the potion up and right-click over another potion."
msgstr "可恢复生命值，恢复点数为10点加上药剂能量值。要饮用这瓶药剂，请拿起药剂，然后右键单击角色小头像，或左键单击全身像。要混和药剂，请拿起药剂，然后右键单击另一瓶药剂。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:225
