msgid "Water Resistance"
msgstr "御水药剂"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:260
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Increases temporary Water resistance by three times the strength of the potion for 30 minutes per point of strength of the potion.  To drink, pick the potion up and right-click over a character's portrait.  To mix, pick the potion up and right-click over another potion."
msgstr "暂时增加队员的水系抗性，增加的值为药剂的能量值的3倍，持续时间为药剂的能量值乘以30分钟。要饮用这瓶药剂，请拿起药剂，然后右键单击角色小头像，或左键单击全身像。要混和药剂，请拿起药剂，然后右键单击另一瓶药剂。"

