#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1303
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:502
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Puck"
msgstr "精灵"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1303
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:502
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Speed +40, Swift) Ancient and fey, Puck's enchantments cause it to practically fly for enemy's throats.  No one knows when or where Puck was forged, but the Faerie origins are unmistakable."
msgstr "（速度+40，迅捷类属性）这是一把古代的神剑，速度奇快无比，敌人往往在还没有反应过来之前就被刺破了喉咙。这把剑的来历是个迷，但它肯定是由精灵制造的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1304
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:503
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Iron Feather"
msgstr "铁翎"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1304
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:503
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Might +40, 6-15 points of Electrical damage) An impossibly light two-handed sword, the Iron Feather boosts the Might of its owner to make wielding the huge weapon even easier.  The combination almost makes it possible to use the sword in one hand--the huge size of the blade being the only problem.  "
msgstr "（力量+40，附加6-15点电系伤害）这把双手剑不但非常轻，而且能够增加使用者的力量，所以挥舞起来格外得心应手。如果不是因为剑身太长，它简直可以单手使用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1305
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:504
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wallace"
msgstr "华里斯"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1305
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:504
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Armsmaster skill +10, Personality +40) Wallace has somehow found its way into the hands of rebels and rabble rousers for centuries.  The weapon magnifies both the ability and the confidence of its wielder, frequently leading its owners to take risks they might otherwise have avoided.  Though none of its owner's ambitions have been fulfilled, no one has ever declined to carry Wallace once they have heard its siren song."
msgstr "（武器使用术+10，个性+40）华里斯剑能增强使用者的信心和力量，但也往往使他们过于自信，导致最终的失败。它几百年来一直流落在民间，经常被冒险家和叛乱者所使用，虽然世人都知道它是把不祥之剑，但没有人能抵挡它的诱惑。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1306
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:505
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Corsair"
msgstr "海盗"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1306
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:505
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Stealing skill +5, Disarm skill +5, Luck +40) Corsair is one of the finest weapons ever turned out by the Regnan armories.  Ever true to their nature, Regna's smiths fashioned a weapon that would aid their imperial \"tax collection\" efforts on the high seas and coastal towns.  To this date, Regna has not forged a weapon that didn't advance their selfish goals at the expense of others."
msgstr "（偷窃术+5，拆卸术+5，运气+40）海盗之剑是雷格那的武器制造厂出产的精品。有了这把剑之后，它们进行海上抢劫时就更加肆无忌惮了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1307
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:506
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Governor's Armor"
msgstr "总督之甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1307
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:506
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Half damage from missile attacks, +10 to all statistics) Owned by Colonial Governor Padish at the Time of the Silence, this fantastic armor has resurfaced in many of the great treasure hoardes throughout history.  Like most creations turned out by the Heavenly Forge, it is nearly indestructible, and its like can no longer be made by any forge in the land."
msgstr "（远程攻击伤害减半，所有属性+10）它是寂静时代的殖民地总督帕第什穿过的铠甲，几百年来一直是学武之人梦寐以求的宝物。就像天堂铸造厂的其他杰作一样，它几乎是坚不可摧的，而且大陆上的任何铸造师都无法再次将它制造出来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1308
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:507
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Yoruba"
msgstr "余尔波"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1308
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:507
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Immunity to disease, insanity, paralysis, poison, sleep, and stone conditions, Endurance +25) Named after its owner and creator, Yoruba is an extremely tough, magic resistant suit of plate mail.  Because of the armor's prohibitive expense, it was built in piecemeal fashion--and it shows.  Different pieces are made of different materials, with the most expensive ones in the breastplate.  There are two puncture holes in the breastplate that the original owner never repaired, possibly for sentimental reasons."
msgstr "（免疫疾病、痴狂、麻痹、中毒、睡眠和石化，耐力+25）这是由著名的工匠余尔波打造的铠甲，非常坚固，而且可以防御魔法。它是用各种不同的材料拼制而成的，其中胸甲所使用的材料特别珍贵，但上面却有两个受损部位没有被修理过，其中可能有一段悲伤的典故。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1309
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:508
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Splitter"
msgstr "爆裂"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1309
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:508
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Explosive impact, Fire Resistance +50) Though powerful, Splitter is never wielded by a single owner for long.  The blade gives off great blasts of fire when struck, and the magical protection against fire the weapon offers isn't enough to completely shield a user from the blast."
msgstr "（攻击有爆炸效果，火系抗性+50）这柄战斧虽然威力无穷，但使用者大多不得善终。虽然它为使用者增加了火系抗性，但砍中敌人后的爆裂还是会伤害到使用者本人。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1310
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:509
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ghoulsbane"
msgstr "嗜血"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1310
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:509
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Undead slaying, Immunity to paralysis, 3-18 fire damage) Ghoulsbane was commissioned by the Church of the Sun more than 150 years ago as part of their effort to destroy the ever growing population of undead created by the Church of the Moon.  Though powerful, it is only one weapon, and the undead are legion.  The Church of the Sun fell in 1083 A.S."
msgstr "（屠亡灵类属性，对麻痹免疫，附加3-18点火系伤害）嗜血战斧是150年前由太阳教制造的，专门用来对付月亮教的亡灵怪物。但由于使用者势孤力单，而亡灵怪物却杀之不尽，所以太阳教最终被月亮教所灭。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1311
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:510
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Gibbet"
msgstr "基尔比特"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1311
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:510
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Undead slaying, Dragon slaying, Demon slaying) A humorless weapon, to say the least, Gibbet was forged by Mekorig the Blind to help end the Age of Monsters, and promote the Age of Man.  A noble idea, but one that hasn't worked out very well.  Gibbet often goes missing for years, only to be rediscovered in some dragon's hoard by ambitious adventurers.  The power of the weapon often inspires such adventurers to move the weapon to another dragon hoard, where it once again goes missing for years."
msgstr "（屠亡灵、屠龙和屠恶魔类属性）基尔比特之矛是由麦克林打造的，\n\n是一把毫无幽默感的武器，它是由盲人麦克林铸造的，目的是帮助结束怪物时代，促进人类时代的到来。这是一个高尚的想法，但效果并不好。绞架经常会失踪多年，只有雄心勃勃的冒险者才能在某些龙的宝藏中重新发现它。这把武器的力量经常会激励这些冒险者将武器转移到另一个龙的宝藏中，在那里它又一次失踪了好几年。\n\n它是件可怕的武器，专门用来消灭妖魔鬼怪。只恨世上的妖魔鬼怪太多，而一件武器的作用终究有限。它已经失踪了许多年，直到最近才被探险者们重新发现。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1312
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:511
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Charele"
msgstr "莎莉特"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1312
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:511
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Built at the behest of Hareck I during the formation of the Regnan \"Empire\", Charele was named after his wife, Queen Charele.  It was left in Regna's only Erathian outpost during the chaos following Hareck's poisoning death in 590 A.S."
msgstr "这是当年雷格那皇帝海里克一世下旨打造的武器，以他的妻子莎莉特命名。590年海里克死后，它一直被留在雷格那的一座堡垒里。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1313
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:512
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ullyses"
msgstr "尤莉西斯"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1313
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:512
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Accuracy +50, 9-12 water damage) The Archer's dream.  Ullyses requires no arrows, firing bolts of ice formed when the string is drawn back.  Its origins are unknown, but the style suggests Elvish make."
msgstr "（精确+50，附加9-12点水系伤害）这是弓箭手梦寐以求的神弓。它拉开弦就能射出冰箭，所以不需要用普通的箭。这把弓的来历不明，但从打造的技艺上来看应该是精灵的杰作。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1314
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:513
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hands of the Master"
msgstr "王者之手"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1314
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:513
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Unarmed skill +10, Dodging skill +10) The Hands of the Master are meant for Monks, but a few Thieves have put them to use with excellent results.  Most of the owners have gone on to fame and fortune, but the last one obviously didn't do so well."
msgstr "（空手搏斗术+10，闪躲术+10）王者之手是僧侣梦寐以求的宝物，另外，盗贼使用它以后也能大大增加技艺。拥有过它的人大多数都功成名就，但它的最后一个主人看来就没有这么幸运了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1315
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:514
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Seven League Boots"
msgstr "神行之靴"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1315
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:514
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Speed +40, of Water Magic) So named for their boost to their wearer's reflexes and pace, the Boots true function is to ease the use of Water Magic in order to speed travel.  Anyone using the boots is destined for greatness, but not necessarily honor.  Much mischief can be attributed to previous owners of these boots."
msgstr "（速度+40，水系魔法类属性）它名不虚传，能大大增加使用者的行走速度，而且可以使他更有效的使用水系魔法。拥有过它的人大多都非常有名。不过，它有时也会为人们带来灾难。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1316
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:515
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ruler's Ring"
msgstr "王者指环"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1316
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:515
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Of Mind Magic, of Dark Magic) The Ruler's Ring was made in 744 A.S. by Joshua Stom, chief alchemist for the Warlocks of Nighon.  Although not an inheritly evil artifact, the ring was created to control and conquer, nothing more."
msgstr "（心智和暗黑魔法类属性）王者指环是多年以前由尼根的邪术师制造的，长久以来一直被用于战争和破坏。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1317
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:516
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Mash"
msgstr "麦斯"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1317
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:516
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Might +150, Intellect -40, Personality -40, Speed -40) It is said that Mash was the answer to the First Ogre's prayer to the Gods for a weapon that would make it stronger than anything else.  Annoyed, the Gods cursed the First Ogre with Mash, and all Ogres have since borne the mark of that act--strong, but slow, dull, and stupid.  In any event, Mash is yours now."
msgstr "（力量+150，智力-40，个性-40，速度-40）据说麦斯是食人妖为了追求绝对的力量而打造的，但他们的行为触怒了神，神就用麦斯杀死了这些食人妖。长久以来，许多人都讥笑它的粗重和迟钝，但没人敢怀疑它的威力。不管怎么说，它现在是你的了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1318
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:517
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ethric's Staff"
msgstr "埃斯里克之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1318
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:517
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Of Dark Magic, Meditation skill +15, Decrease Hit Points over time, Evil) Much more a tool than a weapon, Ethric's Staff was fashioned by the world's first lich--Ethric the Mad.  The staff magnifies Dark magic, drawing from the life force of its user.  Since Ethric's life force was magically sustained, this wasn't a problem for him.  Mortals, however, will slowly feel their life force drain away while they hold the staff."
msgstr "（暗黑魔法类属性，冥想术+15，逐渐流失生命，邪恶之士专用）与其说是武器，不如说是工具，埃斯里克之杖是由世界上第一个巫妖——疯子埃斯里克打造的。它通过吸取使用者的鲜血来提高暗黑魔法的威力。由于埃斯里克的生命是由魔法维持的，所以这对他来说不是问题。然而，凡人在握住该手杖时会慢慢感觉到他们的生命力正在流失。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1319
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:518
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hareck's Leather"
msgstr "海里克之甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1319
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:518
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Stealing skill +5, Disarm skill +5, Water Walking, Luck +50, All Resistances -10)This leather armor was specially built by the Regnan armory for Hareck the First, Lord of Regna, and Emperor of the Endless Ocean.  The armor did everything a glorified pirate like Hareck could hope for, except protect him from poison.  The mighty first Emperor of Regna died just after dinner while wearing the armor, poisoned by his wife's hand. "
msgstr "（偷窃术+5，拆卸术+5，凌波微步魔法效果，运气+50，所有抗性-10）这件铠甲是为雷格那的皇帝海里克一世度身定做的。不过，海里克最终是被他的妻子毒死的。所以，铠甲再坚固也不要以为它是万能的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1320
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:519
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Old Nick"
msgstr "尼克"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1320
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:519
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Disarm Skill +5, 8 points of Poison damage, Elf Slaying, Evil) Secretly passed from one Assassin to another for centuries, Old Nick happily vanished from history's sight during the Battle for Morning--a joint Human-Elvish attack on the Assassin's guild nearly 200 years ago.  It is said that Old Nick has killed more people than the Plague.  Now that you've found this evil weapon, you're going to throw it down a well...aren't you?"
msgstr "（拆卸术+5，附加8点毒系伤害，屠精灵类属性，邪恶之士专用）这是刺客代代相传的匕首，但在200年前人类和精灵联合向杀手行会发起的晨曦之战中失落了。据说尼克匕首杀过的人比瘟疫害死的人还多。知道了这些以后，你会不会立刻将它扔到井里？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1321
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:520
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Amuck"
msgstr "阿姆克"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1321
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:520
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Might +100, Endurance +100, Armor Class -15) The original name of Amuck has been lost in time, but the blade retains a magically keen edge and all of its original power.  Fantastic strength and vitality are conferred upon the owner at the expense of a proper sense of fear.  Wielders of Amuck don't much bother dodging blows in battle."
msgstr "（力量+100，耐力+100，防御等级-15）这柄战斧年代久远，但它的锋芒丝毫没有被岁月所掩盖。它能大大增加使用者的力量和耐力，而且由于它挥舞起来密不透风，所以不怕弓箭的袭击。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1322
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:521
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Glory Shield"
msgstr "神圣之盾"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1322
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:521
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Of Spirit Magic, Shield skill +5, Body Resistance -10, Mind Resistance -10) One of five such shields known to exist, the Glory Shield was built during the Time of Wonders.  It was especially tuned to promote Spirit magic, but that same attunement leaves the wielder somewhat open to Mind and Body based attacks."
msgstr "（灵魂魔法类属性，盾牌+5，体系抗性-10，心系抗性-10）这是奇迹时代打造的盾牌，这样的盾牌全世界只有五面。它能大大增加灵魂魔法的威力，但会降低对肢体魔法和心智魔法的防御力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1323
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:522
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Kelebrim"
msgstr "克里布林"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1323
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:522
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Immunity to stone condition, Half damage from missile attacks, Endurance +50, Earth Resistance -30) One of the first shields to issue from the Kelebrim Foundry, this one bears the simple stamp \"Kelebrim\" on the inside under the hand strap.  It has very powerful enchantments meant to protect from Medusa gazes, but like many grand enchantments, it comes with a flaw.  Kelebrim weakens it's owners resistance to Earth magic."
msgstr "（免疫石化，远程攻击伤害减半，耐力+50，土系抗性-30）从盾牌上的标记来看，这是克里布林铸造厂出产的精品。它被赋予强大的魔法防御力，但有一个缺点：它会降低使用者的土系抗性。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1324
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:523
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Taledon's Helm"
msgstr "塔里顿头盔"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1324
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:523
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Of Light Magic, Personality +15, Might +15, Luck -40, Good)Owned by Taledon, Divine High Priest and High Holy Conduit of the Church of the Sun from 870 A.S., this powerful helm probably contributed to his untimely death in 881.  It is said that an object may take so much enchantment--try to put too much in, and something negative squeezes out.  In this case, the negative made the wearer profoundly unlucky.  Taledon, arguably the most powerful figure of his time, veteran diplomat, soldier, and priest, was crushed beneath the wheels of a runaway peasant's wagon while crossing the street in Steadwick."
msgstr "（光明魔法类属性，个性+15，力量+15，运气-40，正义之士专用）这是由当年太阳教的大主教塔里顿使用的头盔。有传言说正是由于这件头盔过于强大，遭到了天忌，所以造成了这位集外交家、战士和神职人员于一身的伟人过早的离开了人世。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1325
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:524
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Scholar's Cap"
msgstr "学者之帽"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1325
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:524
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Learning skill +15, Endurance -50) The Scholar's Cap vastly improves the ability of the mind to absorb and retain experiences.  The effect is so intense that wearers frequently forget to care for their bodies while swimming in the sea of their thoughts.  "
msgstr "（学习术+15，耐力-50）学者之帽能大大增强人的领悟力，从而得到额外的经验值。但它也往往导致人们思考时过于专心，以致于忘记保护自己的身体。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1326
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:525
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Phynaxian Crown"
msgstr "菲尼克斯皇冠"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1326
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:525
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Of Fire Magic, Water Resistance +50, Personality +30, Armor Class -20) This is the lost (WAS the lost) crown of the short lived Empire of Phynax.  When worn, the crown's jewels smolder with   barely restrained Fire magic, and cast reddish light upon the face of the wearer.  The crown amplifies any skill in Fire magic the wearer may have, and fiercely resists water based attacks."
msgstr "（火系魔法类属性，水系抗性+50，个性+30，防御等级-20）这是昙花一现的菲尼克斯王国的皇冠。戴上它以后，它就会闪闪发光，大大增加火系魔法的威力，同时还能减少水系伤害。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1327
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:526
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Titan's Belt"
msgstr "泰坦腰带"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1327
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:526
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Might +75, Speed -40) Like so many similar items, the Titan's Belt increases the might of its wearer at the expense of speed.  The only difference with this relic is the magnitude of the trade off."
msgstr "（力量+75，速度-40）泰坦腰带能大大增强佩带者的力量，但会降低他的速度。由于这是古代流传下来的宝物，所以价值连城。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1328
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:527
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Twilight"
msgstr "昏暗"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1328
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:527
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Speed +50, Luck +50, All resistances -15, Evil) The sinister Twilight Cloak has been used by spies and assassins for centuries.  The nature of the enchantment is so beneficial to those professions that the loss of magical resistance is easily overlooked."
msgstr "（速度+50，运气+50，对所有魔法的防御力-15，邪恶之士专用）这是几个世纪以来杀手们梦寐以求的宝物。由于它上面附加的魔法威力太强大了，所以没人会在乎损失的那些魔法防御力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1329
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:528
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ania Selving"
msgstr "安娜雅·塞尔文"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1329
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:528
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Accuracy +150, Bow skill +5, Armor Class -25) Master smith Ivan Selving named this crossbow after his only daughter Ania, calling it his second best creation ever.  Archers using this crossbow rarely miss their targets, but their concentration and slow, careful movements make them easy targets in turn."
msgstr "（精确+150，弓箭术+5，防御等级-25）伟大的工匠依万·塞尔文以他女儿安娜雅的名字为这把弓命名，因为他认为这是除了女儿以外最珍惜的东西。这把弓的命中率奇高，但它会使弓箭手的行动迟缓。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1330
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:529
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Justice"
msgstr "正义"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1330
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:529
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Undead slaying, of Mind magic, of Body magic, -40 Speed, Good) Forged in the halcyon days at the beginning of the Church of the Sun, Justice is a powerful weapon for Good.  At the cost of a speed, Justice is one of the mightiest relics a Paladin or Cleric can wield for the Path of Light."
msgstr "（屠亡灵类属性，心智和肢体魔法类属性，速度-40，正义之士专用）正义是太阳教在创立之初所铸造的武器，他们希望用它来维护正义。虽然它会降低使用者的速度，但威力却相当惊人，最适合圣武士和牧师使用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1331
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:530
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Mekorig's Hammer"
msgstr "麦克林之锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1331
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:530
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Of Spirit magic, Might +75, Air Resistance -50) This is the very hammer the great Mekorig the Blind used to turn out so much of the world's finest enchanted equipment during his many years as Master of the Mekorig Foundry.  The hammer's connection to the elements leaves the wielder vulnerable to elemental magic, but it is a small price to pay for the enhanced Self ability and Might the hammer provides."
msgstr "（灵魂魔法类属性，力量+75，风系抗性-50）这是伟大的铸造师麦克林最得意的杰作之一，上面附加了非凡的魔法力。它虽然会降低使用者对元素魔法的防御力，但和所增加的威力相比，这就显得微不足道了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1332
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:531
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hermes' Sandals"
msgstr "赫尔密斯草鞋"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1332
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1440
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:531
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:639
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sandals"
msgstr "草鞋"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1332
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:531
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(+100 Speed, +50 Accuracy, +50 Air Resistance, Regenerate HP, Regenerate SP, Feather Falling) Rumored to be the footwear of a god, the winged sandals confer enormous power on the wearer."
msgstr "（速度+100，精确+50，风系抗性+50，逐渐恢复生命值和魔法值，凌空飞降效果）这双带翅膀的草鞋据说是某个神所使用过的，穿上它的人将身轻如燕。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1333
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:532
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Cloak of the Sheep"
msgstr "羊鸣披风"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1333
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:532
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Immunity to disease, insanity, paralysis, poison, sleep, and stone conditions, Intellect -20, Personality -20) The cloak worn by the High Priest of Baa, though useful it seems to sap the will of the wearer slowly away."
msgstr "（免疫疾病、痴狂、麻痹、中毒、睡眠和石化，智力-20，个性-20）这是羊鸣教的高级神甫穿过的披风，虽然它威力强大，但会消磨使用者的意志。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1334
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:533
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elfbane"
msgstr "精灵杀手"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1334
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:533
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Of Shielding, Elf Slayer, Goblin) This sword was created by the goblins for their Chief at the time, Grogar.  Unfortunately, the goblins lost the war and Elfbane was lost for quite some time.  Enchanted to both slay elves, and protect its wielder from arrows, Elfbane truly lives up to its name.  A curious side effect of the enchantment renders the weapon unusable by all but a goblin."
msgstr "（护盾类属性，屠精灵类，大耳怪专用）这是大耳怪们为了对付精灵而铸造的宝剑，但是它们最终败给了精灵，这把剑也因此失踪了许多年。精灵杀手名不虚传，不但对精灵有特殊攻击效果，而且可以防御弓箭，不过只有大耳怪们能够使用这把宝剑。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1335
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:534
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Mind's Eye"
msgstr "心眼"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1335
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:534
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(+15 Intellect, +15 Personality, Regenerate SP, Human) Mind's Eye was created by Mekorig for the Great Druid, Larette Weisman.  While enhancing both intellect and personality, Mind's Eye regenerates the wearer's mana and also provides head protection.  Unfortunately, Mind's Eye will only fit on the head of a human."
msgstr "（智力+15，个性+15，逐渐恢复魔法值，人类专用）这是铸造师麦克林为大德鲁伊劳里达·威斯曼打造的头盔。它不但能提高使用者的智力和个性，而且还能恢复魔法值和提高防御力。不过，只有人类能够戴上它。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1336
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:535
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elven Chainmail"
msgstr "精灵锁甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1336
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:535
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(of Recovery, +15 Speed, +15 Accuracy, Elven) Elven chainmail was more common before the wars against the humans and the goblins.  Centuries of combat combined with the degradation of armorsmithing skills have reduced the number of sets of Elven Chainmail to almost none.  The effect of using lighter materials and custom designing the armor to only fit elves grants the wearer more freedom of movement, allowing faster, more accurate attacks."
msgstr "（恢复类属性，速度+15，精确+15，精灵专用）精灵锁甲很久以前是精灵们非常钟爱的铠甲，但经历了常年的战乱以后，这种铠甲越来越少，而且由于技术的退步，已经没有人能够打造了。精灵锁甲非常轻巧，因此它能够增加使用者的速度和精确。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1337
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:536
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Forge Gauntlets"
msgstr "大地手套"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1337
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:536
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(+30 Fire Resistance, +15 Might, +15 Endurance, Dwarven) Forge Gauntlets were created by Mekorig for his assistants to aid them in helping him.  Extending the already amazing dwarven might and endurance, the gauntlets also grant exceptional resistance to fire-- necessary in a forge as hot as Mekorig's."
msgstr "（火系抗性+30，力量+15，耐力+15，矮人专用）这是铸造师麦克林为矮人打造的手套。它能让矮人的力量和耐力更为强化。此外，它还有防御火系攻击的效果。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1338
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:537
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hero's Belt"
msgstr "英雄腰带"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1338
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:537
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(+5 Armsmaster skill, +15 Might, Regenerate HP, Male) Designed for Saint Perci, this belt confers martial prowess, exceptional strength, and regeneration.  Saint Perci used the belt quite extensively, but even with its help he wasn't able to stave off death at the hands of the Wromthrax the dragon."
msgstr "（武器使用术+5，力量+15，逐渐恢复生命值，男性专用）这是大贤者帕斯使用过的腰带，它能增加佩带者的力量，提高他的武器使用术，还能为他恢复生命值。虽然这条腰带威力无穷，但是帕斯最终还是死在巨龙劳斯莱克的爪下。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1339
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:538
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lady's Escort"
msgstr "旅行之宝"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1339
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:538
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Water walking, Feather falling, of Protection, Female) A magical 'escort' designed by the mage Terrax for one of his female friends who had to travel quite far to reach him.  The ring protects the wearer from elements, falling, and drowning.  Unfortunately, she traveled to Erathia and the ring disappeared soon after."
msgstr "（带有凌波微步魔法和凌空飞降魔法的效果，保护类属性，女性专用）这是魔法师泰拉克斯为一位经常要长途跋涉来见他的女士制作的指环，它能防止不慎失足和落水。但这位女士不久以后就去了埃拉西亚，而这枚指环从此下落不明。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1340
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:539
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Clanker's Amulet"
msgstr "科兰克护身符"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1340
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:539
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A mighty tool for alchemists, this amulet was the secret to Clanker's success.  "
msgstr "这是炼金术士必备的道具，是科兰克成功的奥秘。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1341
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:540
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lieutenant's Cutlass"
msgstr "中尉之刀"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1341
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:540
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A fine steel weapon, this cutlass is sharpened and ready for action."
msgstr "这是一把锋利的短剑，杀人不见血。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1342
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:541
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Medusa's Mirror"
msgstr "美杜莎之镜"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1342
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:541
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The user of this mirror is completely immune to stoning effects.  Would have been nice to have this earlier.  "
msgstr "它可以抵挡石化魔法的攻击，要是早点拿到就好了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1343
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:542
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lady Carmine's Dagger"
msgstr "卡米尔女士的匕首"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1343
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:542
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Nicks and scratches on this nasty blade show that it has seen plenty of action.  "
msgstr "从这把匕首上磨损的痕迹看来，它经历过不少血腥的战斗。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1344
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:543
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Villain's Blade"
msgstr "邪恶之刃"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:543
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sword"
msgstr "长剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1344
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:543
msgctxt "items"
msgid "William Setag would frequently slay prisoners with this blade to heal his own minor cuts and bruises.  The weapon is cold to the touch, and tingles in your hand."
msgstr "威廉姆·塞塔格曾经用这把剑杀害过许多囚犯。握住这把剑的时候，你会感到手心发冷，不由得浑身颤抖。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1345
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1346
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:544
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:545
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The Perfect Bow"
msgstr "完美之弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:57
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:58
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:59
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:60
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:61
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:59
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:60
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:61
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:62
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:63
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:515
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:534
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:545
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:544
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:545
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Bow"
msgstr "弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1345
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:544
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  Although of high quality, this bow doesn't seem to perform nearly as well as it should.  The string is too hard to pull back, it doesn't remain steady enough while aiming, and it seems a little off-balance."
msgstr "要寻找的物品：虽然这把弓的品质不错，但用起来并不那么顺手。由于弓弦太紧，所以射箭的时候颇为费力，瞄准的时候也不太稳。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1346
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:545
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This bow seems to know its wielder's strength and adjusts itself accordingly.  You never have to struggle to pull the string back, and it's always easy to hold your shot until you're ready to fire.  Dozens of small advantages like this in the design of the bow make for the finest weapon of its type you have ever seen."
msgstr "这把弓非常神奇，它可以根据使用者的力量自动调整弓弦，所以任何人使用时都会感到得心应手。除此之外，这把弓在所有的细微之处都做得一丝不苟，所以它绝对是你的最佳选择。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1347
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:546
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Shadow's Mask"
msgstr "幻影面具"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1347
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:546
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A mask designed to hide the identity of the wearer, it has also been magically enhanced to offer good protection and to aid thiefly pursuits."
msgstr "这个面具经过了魔法的点化，有很好的保护作用。不过，它的主要用途还是隐藏使用者的身份以及提高跟踪的能力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1348
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:547
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ghost Ring"
msgstr "鬼魂指环"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1348
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:547
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An odd ring that feels strangely warm to the touch.  It enhances the wearers connection to the spirit."
msgstr "这枚奇异的指环给人一种温暖的感觉，它能提高人的精神能力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1349
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:548
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Faerie Ring"
msgstr "精灵指环"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1349
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:548
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A rare and very powerful ring made by Faeries.  Few mortals ever see such as this!"
msgstr "这是一枚由精灵制造的指环，非常罕见，它能给人带来神奇的力量。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1350
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:549
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sun Cloak"
msgstr "骄阳披风"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1350
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:549
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This cloak signifies the highest rank attainable by a Priest of the Sun.  No more than nine of these cloaks were ever made--one for each member of the High Council of the Sun."
msgstr "这是太阳教高级议会的成员们穿过的披风，一共只制作了九件，俱为精品。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1351
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:550
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Moon Cloak"
msgstr "月光披风"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1351
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:550
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This cloak signifies the highest rank attainable by a Priest of the Moon.  No more than nine of these cloaks were ever made--one for each member of the High Council of the Moon."
msgstr "这是太阳教高级议会的成员们穿过的披风，一共只制作了九件，俱为精品。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1352
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:551
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Zokarr's Axe"
msgstr "佐卡尔战斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1352
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:551
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The family heirloom of the Zokarr monarchs.  This weapon grants the wielder a greater affinity with earth magic."
msgstr "这是佐卡尔家族世代相传的宝物，它能提高使用者对魔法的领悟力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1353
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:552
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Vampire's Cape"
msgstr "吸血鬼披风"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1353
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:552
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Small wonder such a cloak as this would be found on a vampire.  The cloak prevents sunlight from reaching the body, but is unable to protect the face."
msgstr "这是吸血鬼最爱穿的披风，它可以挡住阳光对身体的照射，美中不足的是它不能保护头部。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1354
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:553
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Minotaur's Axe"
msgstr "牛头怪之斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1354
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:553
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A fine trophy!  The axe is made for a Minotaur and is very heavy, but the magical strength it imparts makes it easy to use for anyone."
msgstr "真是件不错的战利品！这是牛头怪铸造的战斧，虽然较为笨重，但由于附上了魔法，所以挥舞起来并不费力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1355
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:554
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Grognard's Cutlass"
msgstr "格拉内达短刀"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1355
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:554
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A finely crafted and specially enchanted goblin weapon.  Though originally crafted to slay elves, this weapon does a perfectly good job on members of the other races."
msgstr "这是一把做工精良、附上魔法的大耳怪短剑。它是专门用来对付精灵的，但实际上任何种族的敌人见了这把利剑都会胆战心惊。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1373
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:572
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The DeathBlade"
msgstr "死亡之剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1403
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:602
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Heart of the Wood"
msgstr "古树之心"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1403
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:602
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  A jewel like none you have ever seen."
msgstr "要寻找的物品：这是一块奇异的宝石。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:629
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1404
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1418
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:603
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:617
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lich Jar"
msgstr "灵魂之坛"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:629
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1404
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1418
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1431
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:631
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:603
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:617
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:630
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Jar"
msgstr "坛子"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1404
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:603
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  A jar holding your physical and spiritual essence.  Don't lose the jar."
msgstr "要寻找的物品：这个坛子里面装着灵魂，请小心轻放。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1405
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:604
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Case of Soul Jars"
msgstr "装灵魂之坛的盒子"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1405
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:604
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Case of Jars"
msgstr "盒子"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1405
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:604
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  A rosewood case lovingly crafted to contain a set of Lich Jars.  This case appears to be full."
msgstr "要寻找的物品：装满灵魂之坛的盒子。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1406
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:605
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Parson's Quill"
msgstr "帕尔森国王的羽毛笔"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1406
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:605
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quill"
msgstr "羽毛笔"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1406
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:605
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  King Parson's hand employed this quill to sign the treaty ending the first Timber War."
msgstr "要寻找的物品：帕尔森国王就是用这支羽毛笔签署了第一次木材战争的和平协议。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1407
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:606
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wetsuit"
msgstr "潜水服"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1407
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:606
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Strange Suit"
msgstr "奇怪的衣服"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1407
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:606
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  This environmental suit handles not only respiration, but protection from the extreme pressure of deep sea diving.  It does not look like any other items may be worn while wearing the suit.  You must remove ALL equipment to wear the suit."
msgstr "要寻找的物品：这件潜水服不但能使你在水中呼吸，而且能减轻海水的压力。你一定要解除身上所有的装备才能穿上它。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1408
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:607
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Oscillation Overthruster"
msgstr "振荡器"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1408
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:607
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ancient Part"
msgstr "古物"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1408
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:607
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  This device has no visible symbols or parts.  Why it is so valuable is beyond your comprehension."
msgstr "要寻找的物品：它的表面上看不出任何标记，你不知道为什么有人把它看得如此珍贵。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1409
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:608
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Signet Ring"
msgstr "戒指印章"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1409
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:608
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  A highly stylized 'D' and 'P' intertwined by a snake with a crown above its head are engraved into the face of this ring.  This must certainly be Davrick's."
msgstr "要寻找的物品：这枚戒指上雕刻着一条戴皇冠的蛇，它紧紧的缠绕着“D”和“P”这两个字母，应该是属于德弗里克的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1410
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:609
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Letter from Johann Kerrid to the Faerie King"
msgstr "乔安·卡里德写给仙帝的信"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:742
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:743
