#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:54
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:3
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good luck in the contest!"
msgstr "祝你们在竞赛中取得胜利！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:55
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:4
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I wish Brent knew how to make a red potion."
msgstr "但愿布兰特知道怎么调配红药剂。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:56
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You'd better watch out."
msgstr "小心点儿。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:57
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't cause any trouble."
msgstr "别惹麻烦。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:58
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Congratulations!"
msgstr "祝贺你们！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:59
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks for trading with us!"
msgstr "感谢你们和我们做交易。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:63
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:64
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:12
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you are the new Lords of Harmondale?  How may I serve you?"
msgstr "你们是哈蒙代尔的新领主吗？我可以为你们做些什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:65
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Come to study with us under the Masters?"
msgstr "过来学些知识吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:66
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome to the capitol of Steadwick! 'Ware the griffins!"
msgstr "欢迎来到斯坦德威克！请当心狮鹫！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:67
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You are welcome in Pierpont, the Elven capitol."
msgstr "欢迎来到精灵之都匹尔邦特。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:68
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings!  Head up the stairs to Pierpont and enjoy!"
msgstr "匹尔邦特欢迎你们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:69
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Beware the Walking Dead in the region!"
msgstr "请小心丧尸。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:70
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yer welcome here I think…then again…"
msgstr "欢迎欢迎。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:71
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Come to learn from the best Wizards in Erathia?"
msgstr "想跟着埃拉西亚最好的法师学几招吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:72
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings.  Lots of golems around these days!"
msgstr "欢迎！店里最近来了许多新的人偶。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:73
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Study with the best and visit all the buildings here!"
msgstr "四处看看吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:74
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tranquility and rest await you here in Celeste."
msgstr "在塞莱斯特好好休息吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:75
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome!  Be sure you don’t have a \"falling out\" while you here!"
msgstr "欢迎你们，我的朋友。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:76
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome to the Pit!  Who says being dead is bad?"
msgstr "欢迎来到地狱城！谁说死后就不能享受人生？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:77
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Pit is the only place I know of that lets us live in peace!"
msgstr "在地狱城里我们过得很快乐！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:78
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings! Necromancy is evil?  It’s a relative, don’t you think?"
msgstr "巫师就一定是坏人吗？我可不这么认为。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:79
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome to Mulder!  Enjoy your time with us."
msgstr "欢迎来到尼根，祝你们过得愉快。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:80
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:29
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Have you journeyed far?  "
msgstr "旅行了很久吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:81
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:30
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello!  Did you come through the tunnels from Stone City?"
msgstr "欢迎！你们是从石头城的地道来这儿的吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:82
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:31
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello there?  Checked your purse lately? Let me check it for you…"
msgstr "你们好，这可是个花钱的地方。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:83
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:32
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Some Wacko around here has the boat schedule, I'm sure!"
msgstr "欢迎你们，我的朋友。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:84
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:33
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As a citizen of the city of Tidewater, I welcome you."
msgstr "欢迎你们，我的朋友。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:85
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:34
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings, heard any word of Regnan Pirates?"
msgstr "欢迎欢迎！你们听说过雷格那海盗吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:86
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:35
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I heard there was a gate built to the Ancients!  I wonder what they look like."
msgstr "我听说有通往古代世界的门。真想去看看。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:87
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:36
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard rumors of goblins and undead armed with ancient weapons threatening to conquer Erathia!  How dreadful!"
msgstr "我听说许多大耳怪和亡灵装备了古代的神兵利器，准备统治全世界！太可怕了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:88
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:37
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Congratulations on completing the gate!  Erathia is in your debt!"
msgstr "祝贺你们打开了时空之门！埃拉西亚的人民将永远记住你们！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:89
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:38
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Congratulations on completing the forge!  Victory will surely be ours!"
msgstr "祝贺你们建成了天堂铸造厂！胜利将属于我们！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:90
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:91
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:92
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:93
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:94
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:95
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:96
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:97
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:98
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:99
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:100
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:101
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:102
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:103
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:39
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:40
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:41
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:42
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:43
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:44
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:45
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:46
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:47
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:48
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:49
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:50
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:51
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCNEWS.TXT.py:52
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello!"
msgstr "你们好！"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:5
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:33
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:34
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:50
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Oh, please don't dismiss me!  I'll work harder!"
msgstr "哦，别解雇我，我会好好干的！"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:6
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "What's wrong?  Isn't my work good enough?"
msgstr "出什么事了，是我工作不努力吗？"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:7
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Have mercy, master!  I'm doing my best!"
msgstr "求求你了，主人。别解雇我，我会尽力的。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:8
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I studied under Thomas Grey in the School of Sorcery for years to learn to tell one magic item from another.  I'll work for you for 500 gold to start, plus a %17 percent share of all the gold we find. "
msgstr "我在魔法学校拜托马斯·格雷为师修炼了八年，钻研如何鉴定魔法物件。你只要付我500个金币并分给我所发现的金币的%17％，我就加入你的队伍。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:8
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Why are you dismissing me?  Don't you find my identification services useful?"
msgstr "为什么不要我了，我的鉴定术没用吗？"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:9
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I know shortcuts and back roads throughout the land.  I'll be your guide for a mere 100 gold to start and a %17 percent share of all the gold we find."
msgstr "我对整个大陆的地形了如指掌，知道所有的近路和小道。你付我100个金币并分给我所发现的金币的%17％，我就为你领路。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:9
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:10
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:11
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "But I cost so little!  Can't you afford %17 percent?"
msgstr "我的要价已经很低了，你连%17％都付不起吗？"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:10
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I know shortcuts and back roads throughout the land.  I'll be your guide for 200 gold to start, plus a %17 percent share of the gold we find."
msgstr "我对整个大陆的地形了如指掌，知道所有的近路和小道。你付我200个金币并分给我所发现的金币的%17％，我就为你领路。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:11
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I know shortcuts and back roads throughout the land.  I'll be your guide for a mere 300 gold to start, plus a %17 percent share of the gold we find."
msgstr "我对整个大陆的地形了如指掌，知道所有的近路和小道。你付我300个金币并分给我所发现的金币的%17％，我就为你领路。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:12
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "What, you're just going to dump me?  Here?  "
msgstr "什么，你就把我丢在这儿了？"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:13
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "What did I do to deserve this treatment?  I thought we had a deal?"
msgstr "为什么要这样对待我，咱们再好好谈谈吧！"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:14
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:15
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:16
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Heal Party"
msgstr "救死扶伤"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:14
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:15
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:16
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "How can you even think of firing me?  Who will heal your wounds?"
msgstr "怎么不要我了，谁会为你们疗伤呢？"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:17
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:18
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Without me around to tell you how to think, you'll learn a lot slower!  Don't fire me!"
msgstr "没有我的指点迷津，你的进步会慢得多！别解雇我。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:19
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Two point bonus to Armsmaster skill for all characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使所有角色的兵器技能提高2点。%01拿走你每次所得金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:19
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:20
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "You would give up the benefit of my good advice just like that?  For shame!"
msgstr "你将失去我的忠告，再考虑考虑吧！"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:20
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Three point bonus to Armsmaster skill for all characters..  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使所有角色的兵器技能提高3点。%01拿走你每次所得金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:21
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Two point bonus to Elemental (air, earth, fire, water) spell skills for all characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使所有角色元素魔法（水、火、土、气）技能等级提高2点。%01拿走你每次所得金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:21
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I can lend a little magic to boost your Elemental spell skills and ease your magical burden for 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find.."
msgstr "我会为你指点迷津，稍微提高你的魔法技能，让你免受没有魔法之苦。我的要价是500个金币并分给我你所发现的金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:21
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:22
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:23
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Why throw away the boundless reserves of magic I have to offer when I am so cheap to keep around?"
msgstr "雇佣我的花费这么低，你又可以学习无穷的魔法技能，为什么不要我了？"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:22
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Three point bonus to Elemental (air, earth, fire, water) spell skills for all characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使所有角色元素魔法（水、火、土、气）技能等级提高3点。%01拿走你每次所得金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:22
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I can lend a good deal of magic to magnify your Elemental spell skills for 1000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "我会为你指点迷津，大大提高你的元素魔法技能，传你几手绝招。我的要价是1000个金币并分给我你所发现的金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:23
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Four point bonus to Elemental (air, earth, fire, water) spell skills for all characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使所有角色元素魔法（水、火、土、气）技能等级提高4点。%01拿走你每次所得金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:23
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I can lend my considerable magic reserves to sharply increase your Elemental spell skills and effects for the low, low price of 2000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "我会为你指点迷津，大大提高你的元素魔法技能，传你几手绝招。我的要价是2000个金币并分给我你所发现的金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:24
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:25
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Fire me?  You must be joking!  You'll lose a lot of money without me around!"
msgstr "不要我了，开玩笑吧！没有我，你的金币就少得多了！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/2DEvents.txt.py:177
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/2DEvents.txt.py:178
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:25
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Merchant"
msgstr "商人"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:25
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "As a long time member of the Merchant's Guild, and a former rug merchant myself, I know all the tricks of the trade like the back of my hand.  I can give you advice while bargaining with other Merchants to improve the prices you get.  My fee is but 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "作为一个资深的商人行会成员和一个精明的商人，我对经商的伎俩了如指掌。我会帮助你和别人讨价还价，得到一个合理的价位。我的要价是200个金币并分给我所发现的金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:26
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Who will warn you of danger if not me?  You're making a big mistake, boss!"
msgstr "我不在谁为你报警呢？主人，你可犯了个大错误！"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:27
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Four point bonus to Alchemy skill for all characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使你的所有角色的炼金术提高4点。%01拿走你每次所得金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:27
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "In my studies I've gathered quite a knowledge of reagents and catalysts.  I'm sure I could assist you in creating and mixing potions, if you'll only hire me.  400 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "我整天在钻研炼丹技术，对各类药品了如指掌。如果你雇佣我，我可以在研制药品方面助你一臂之力。我的要价是400个金币并分我你所发现金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:27
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Well!  After all I've done for you you're going to fire me?!  Just like that?"
msgstr "我做了我应该做的，你还要解雇我，真不讲道理！"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Eight point bonus to Alchemy skill for all characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使你的所有角色的炼金术提高8点。%01拿走你每次所得金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I have dedicated my life to the study and mastery of alchemy.  I can increase the potency of the potions you mix.  I only charge 600 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "钻研炼金术已成为我生命的一部分，我可以轻而易举地提高你的药品的效力。我的要价是600个金币并分我你所发现金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:29
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:30
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "You'll be sorry the next time a trap goes off because I wasn't around to save you!"
msgstr "将来你掉进陷阱时候就会想起我的！"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:31
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:32
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Sure has been fun following you around!  See ya!"
msgstr "跟着你挺有趣的，后会有期。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:35
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:36
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "You're going to lose a lot of money without me, mark my words!"
msgstr "记住，没有我你会失去一大笔钱。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:37
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Prepare Meal"
msgstr "提供食物"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:37
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:38
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Back to stale bread and water, eh?  <grumble> fine by me."
msgstr "没有我，你就只能靠馊面包和凉水度日了?  "

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:38
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Prepare Feast"
msgstr "提供食物"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:38
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I have studied in the finest cooking schools in Erathia, and I am willing to prepare your meals for a paltry 400 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find.  "
msgstr "我曾在埃拉西亚最好的厨师学校学习过。如果你们付我400个金币并分给我所发现的金币的%17％，我就给你们做饭。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:39
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Well, I guess I can understand.  <sniff> you don't need me anymore."
msgstr "啊，我知道，我对你已经没有用了。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:40
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I thought we had a deal!  You're just going to cast me aside like trash! How could you?"
msgstr "我们本来有协议的，你怎么能象丢垃圾一样把我扔在这儿呢？"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:41
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Increases protection from air, earth, fire, water, body, and mind by 20 constantly.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使你的所有角色的水系、火系、土系、风系、体系、心系抗性提高20点。%01拿走你得到的所有金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:41
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Dangerous Sorcerers abound throughout the land of Erathia.  Most use spells that do some sort of elemental damage, like fire or lightning.  Others use body or mind magic to assault their foes.  I know a spell that will help protect you from these, and I can keep it going all the time.  I'll cast it for you if you take me along.  All I want is 1000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "埃拉西亚到处是危险的巫师，大多会施展可怕的元素魔法，有的还喜欢施展心智魔法和肢体魔法来攻击敌人。但我知道抵御这些魔法的魔法，并能使这种魔法持续有效。如果让我与你们同行我会施展该项魔法。我的要价是1000个金币并分给我所发现的金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:41
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Not afraid of hostile magic anymore eh?  Ok, your choice.  Don't say I didn't warn you!"
msgstr "你不怕那些神奇的魔法了吗？我提醒过你了，好好想想吧！"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:42
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Even if you can cast Wizard eye on your own, keeping me around would save you the spell energy.  Did you think of that?"
msgstr "就算你会魔力神眼魔法，有我在身边可以节省魔法能量，你想到这一点吗？"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:43
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Wind Walk"
msgstr "飞行奇术"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:43
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "You're would give up the power of flight over a few measly gold pieces?  Think it through carefully, my friend."
msgstr "就为了这么点钱就放弃学习飞行奇术魔法？好好考虑一下吧，朋友。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:44
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Cross Water"
msgstr "凌波微步"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:44
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "You're would give up the power to walk on water over a few measly gold pieces?  Think it through carefully, my friend."
msgstr "就为了这么点钱就放弃学习凌波微步魔法？好好考虑一下吧，朋友。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:45
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Gate to Town"
msgstr "时空之门"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:45
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "There are spells that duplicate some of the natural magical features of Erathia.  One of those, Town Portal, I've learned to cast at master level.  I'll  cast it for you up to once per day if you hire me.  My price is 2000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "有些魔法能够复制埃拉西亚的自然魔力，时空之门就是其中之一。我对这项魔法的理解已达到大师级水平。如果雇佣我，我每天一次为你们施展该项魔法。我的要价为2000个金币并分给我所发现的金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:45
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "You're would give up the power to travel instantly for a few measly gold pieces?  Think it through carefully, my friend."
msgstr "就为了这么点钱就放弃学习时空之门魔法？好好考虑一下吧，朋友。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:46
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Bless Party"
msgstr "圣灵佑佐"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:46
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I checked with the gods, and they said they would be angry with you if you dismissed me.  Just thought I would let you know…"
msgstr "我已经向众神祈祷过了，他们说一旦你解雇我，他们会大发雷霆。好好考虑一下吧！"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:47
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Play Tune"
msgstr "军号声胜"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:47
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "You'll miss my inspiring battle tunes!  It makes a big difference during battle!"
msgstr "你竟要解雇我这个鼓舞士气的号手，在战斗中你可要倒霉的！"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:48
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "You don't find me useful?  Well, just remember that I save you time, and time is money!    "
msgstr "既然我已没什么用了，好吧！请记住我为你效力的这段日子。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:49
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Arrr.  Ye be firing this poor old sailor unjustly ye be.  Won't ye reconsider?"
msgstr "啊，你忍心不要我这个可怜的老水手吗？请再考虑一下吧！"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:51
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I predict you'll regret dismissing me!"
msgstr "我想你以后会后悔的！"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:52
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I cook your food and save you money, and this is the thanks I get?"
msgstr "我为你做饭，还为你省钱，就得到这个结果？"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:53
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Your party is considered to have the most beneficial arrangement of races in any social situation while %01 is in your party.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "有%01加入你的队伍，你们在任何种族都会成为最受欢迎的人。%01拿走你得到的所有金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:53
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:54
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Wait!  Let's talk about this!  I know you don't really want to dismiss me.  We can work it out!"
msgstr "等等！听我说！我知道你并不想解雇我，我明白的！"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:55
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Disarm Traps and Stealing skills are increased by eight points for each character and Reputation is decreased by one full category.  %01 costs you nothing!"
msgstr "每个角色的陷阱拆卸术和偷窃术提高8点。声誉一直下降。%01不会花你一文钱。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:55
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Need traps disarmed?  Perhaps something retrieved without the owner's knowledge or consent?  I've been doing it ever since I was released from jail three years ago.  If you need help, I'll come with you for free!  I need the practice.  "
msgstr "想破解机关和陷阱吗？这可是门技术活。自从我出狱后三年来我一直干这个行当。如果你需要的话，我就跟你们走，我不取分文，只想增加点经验。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:55
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "What?  I didn't do nothin!  "
msgstr "怎么回事？我可一直在努力工作啊！"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Hour of Power"
msgstr "神佑一时"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Casts Hour of Power once per day for a duration of six hours.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "每天施展一次神佑一日魔法，持续时间为6个小时。%01花费你得到的所有金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Few people outside of the Wizard's realm possess the knowledge to cast Hour of Power.  I can cast it once per day for your party if you'll hire me.  I only charge 2500 gold initially, and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "不在法师圈子里混的人根本不知道神佑一日魔法。只要你们雇佣我，我会每天施展一次这种魔法。只要给我2500个金币并分我所发现金币的%17％就够了"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "You're would give up all the spells I cast on you for a few measly gold pieces?  Think it through carefully, my friend."
msgstr "就为了这么点钱就放弃学习高深的魔法咒语？好好考虑一下吧，朋友。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:57
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Two point bonus to Self (body, mind, spirit) spell skills for all characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使所有角色自我魔法（肢体、心智、灵魂魔法）技能等级提高2点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:57
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I can assist your spell casting by slightly boosting your spells of the Self for 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find.."
msgstr "付我500个金币并分我所发现金币的%17％，我会稍微提高你的肢体魔法技能。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:57
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:58
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:59
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "By firing me, you're not just losing a friend and spiritual advisor, but your link to the Gods!  I know you don't really mean it.  You won't dismiss me."
msgstr "我不在，你不但失去了一个好朋友，一位精神导师，而且失去了与众神沟通的纽带。你不会这样做的吧！"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:58
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Initiate"
msgstr "修士"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:58
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Three point bonus to Self (body, mind, spirit) spell skills for all characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使所有角色自我魔法（肢体、心智、灵魂魔法）技能等级提高3点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:58
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "My prayers can magnify your Self spell skills for 1000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "付我1000个金币并分我所发现金币的%17％，我会大大提高你的肢体魔法技能。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:59
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Four point bonus to Self (body, mind, spirit) spell skills for all characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使所有角色自我魔法（肢体、心智、灵魂魔法）技能等级提高4点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:59
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I can greatly increase the effect of your Self spells for a small initial donation of of 2000 gold and then %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "只要付我2000个金币并分我所发现金币的%17％，我会使你的肢体魔法技能急剧上升。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Monk"
msgstr "僧侣"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Increases the unarmed and dodging skills by two for all characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使所有角色空手搏斗术和闪躲术提高2点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I can help train your minds and bodies to perfect your unarmored, unarmed combat techniques.  I only require 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "我能使你的精神和身体得到全面的严格训练。使你的空手搏斗术迅速提高。我只要500个金币并分我所发现金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "You, uh, haven't snatched the pebble from my hand yet, grasshopper.  Will you cut short your training so casually?"
msgstr "我的本事你才学了点皮毛。这么快就放弃了吗，小子？"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:61
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Increases the identify item and identify monster skills by six for all characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使所有角色鉴定物品和鉴定怪物的能力提高6点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:61
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I have considerable knowledge of the items and creatures of Erathia.  I'd be willing to help you out in your travels for 750 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "在埃拉西亚我鉴定物品和鉴定怪物的能力已达到炉火纯青的地步。只要付我750个金币并分我所发现金币的%17％，我会在路途中助你一臂之力。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:61
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "You will miss my excellent advice and knowledge the minute I am gone, mark my words!"
msgstr "记住，你将失去我的忠告和渊博的知识！"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:62
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Hunter"
msgstr "猎手"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:62
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Increases the identify monster skill by four for all characters.  %01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使所有角色鉴定怪物的能力提高4点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的%17％。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:62
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "I've hunted most every type of creature in Erathia, and I know a little something about all of them.  Though I'm retired from hunting, I'll share my knowledge with you for 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "在埃拉西亚我捕获的怪兽数量最多，对它们的习性也有所了解。尽管我现在不打猎了。但只要付我500个金币并分我所发现金币的%17％，我会在路途中提一些忠告的。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCPROF.TXT.py:62
msgctxt "npcprof"
msgid "Well, this old hunter knows not to beg.  Go on and dismiss me if you want."
msgstr "好吧，老猎人可不会向别人乞求什么。要是你要解雇我，尽管这样做吧。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:2
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Emerald Island is southeast of Erathia, and far away from pirates and other ruffians.  It would be ideal, if not for the constant swarms of dragonflies that infest the island.  Fortunately, the large number of armed and skilled people this contest has attracted should thin their numbers a bit.\n\nLord Markham has supplemented the normally sparse village with a weapon, armor, and alchemist shop for your convenience during the contest.  A temple and basic magical guilds are also available.  I would suggest making sure that you are completely ready before you start off on the contest."
msgstr "欢迎来到翡翠岛！我是你们在这个岛上的向导。我会向你们介绍这里的风土人情和本次竞赛的详细内容。你们在岛上最好安分守己点，免得发生不愉快的事。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:951
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I love being out on this side of the island, the view of the ocean is much better than from town, don't you agree?"
msgstr "我总爱在这里眺望大海，大海的景色可比镇子里强多了，多美啊！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:953
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Here you go, I hope it reminds you of your trip to Emerald Island."
msgstr "这贝壳归你们了，希望看到它就能使你们想起翡翠岛之旅。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:954
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I really can't go any less than 100 gold; I need to make a living, too."
msgstr "连100个金币也没有，我可不能卖给你们，毕竟我要靠它吃饭啊！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:956
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks for the hat, friend!"
msgstr "伙计，你们真识相，把帽子交出来了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:957
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You should have accepted my offer…"
msgstr "你们要为你们的行为付出代价。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:963
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sorry mates, this vessel's moored until a winner has been declared in the contest."
msgstr "对不起，只有比赛的优胜者才能命令这艘船启航。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:983
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:45
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Keep in mind I have a 1000 gold reward for the group to bring back information on the contestants that have disappeared."
msgstr "注意了，谁能告诉我有关失踪的参赛者们的消息，我会奖赏1000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:984
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:46
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No news on the missing people yet?"
msgstr "还没有失踪者的消息吗？"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:54
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have decided that you no longer desire my information about the places on Emerald Island.  If you later decide that you'd like to hear what I have to say, then select Tour On."
msgstr "你们已经决定不再要我提供关于翡翠岛的信息了吗？要是你们以后想再要听我的忠告，请选择“开始指导”。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1005
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:67
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Refreshing! (+50 Endurance temporary)"
msgstr "精神振奋（耐力暂时+50）"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1015
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:77
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We must finish our quest before I can name thee Crusaders, friends."
msgstr "你们必须完成任务，我才能授予你们十字军称号。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1020
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:82
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though thy deeds remain impressive indeed, crusaders, I cannot declare thee Heroes until you have rescued the girl!"
msgstr "十字军们，这件任务可是十万火急啊！你们不把姑娘救出来，我可不能授予你们英雄称号。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1024
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:86
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you so much for helping me away from William's clutches."
msgstr "你们把我从威廉姆的魔爪中救了出来，真是太感谢你们了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:127
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1065
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:127
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:127
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must first be an expert in this skill before you can become a master!"
msgstr "你们要成为这项技术的大师，就得首先成为专家。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:128
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1066
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:128
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:128
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must first be a master in this skill before you can become a grandmaster!"
msgstr "你们要成为这项技术的宗师，就得首先成为大师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:132
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1070
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:132
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:132
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You are already a grandmaster in this skill."
msgstr "你们已经是这项技术的宗师了。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:190
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Priests.  You have come to me seeking that I be your guide on the Path of Light.  But be warned, to learn its ways, you must learn the ways of your own soul.  I would suggest that we meditate on this for awhile, but you look like you're in a hurry.  South of Bracada is an island called Evenmorn, and upon that island are the old temples of the Sun and the Moon.  Both are inhabited by the remnants of the two religions, their once proud churches reduced to two old temples fighting for a small island.\n\nThe Church of the Sun was the founding religion for our current faith, the Path of Light.  I propose we help them out and tip the balance in favor of the Church of the Sun.  Using the map that Daedalus Falk sent you to find in order to become priests, convince a sea captain to bring you to the island.  There, bring aid and comfort to the Church of the Sun by purifying the altar in the Church of the Moon.  This will so weaken the Moon cult that the Church of the Sun will be able to overcome them in battle.  Return to me when you have done this.   "
msgstr "啊，你们要我指点如何走上光明之路。不过我得事先提醒你们，一旦你们选择了光明之路，就得花费毕生精力全身心地投入修炼，心无旁鹜，永不放弃，你们还是慎重考虑一下吧。布拉卡达南面有个叫做埃弗蒙的小岛。岛上有两个古老的神庙。一个是太阳神庙，一个是月亮神庙。太阳教和月亮教本来是两个势力很大的教派，但由于他们两家势同水火，是天生的死对头，经过连年征战，大家两败俱伤，如今只剩下岛上的这两座神庙了，然而他们仍旧争斗不休。\n太阳神庙是信仰我们光明之路的，我想派你们去助他们一臂之力。你们可以用在执行成为神甫任务时达德拉斯·福克交给你们的航海图，租船下海，到达那个小岛。你们只要捣毁月亮神庙的神坛，他们就会一蹶不振，太阳神庙就可以轻而易举地对付他们了。如果你们顺利完成任务，就可以回我这儿来了。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:199
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Priests.  [Falk gazes coldly at you] Well it is that you have come to see the wisdom of the Path of the Dark.  Never regret your decision, and never look back.  South of Bracada is an island called Evenmorn, and upon that island are the old temples of the Sun and the Moon.  Both are inhabited by the remnants of the two religions, their once proud churches reduced to two old temples fighting for a small island.\n\nThe Church of the Moon was the founding religion for our current faith, the Path of Darkness.  I propose we help them out and tip the balance in favor of the Church of the Moon.  Using the map that I sent you to find, convince a sea captain to bring you to the island.  There, bring aid and comfort to the Church of the Moon by defiling the altar in the Church of the Sun.  This will so weaken the Sun cult that the Church of the Moon will be able to overcome them in battle.  Return to me when you have done this.   "
msgstr "（福克冷冷地看着你们）你们想加入黑暗之路，领略我们深奥的魔法。不过我得事先提醒你们，一旦选择了黑暗之路，就得苦心修炼，永无退路。布拉卡达南面有个叫做埃弗蒙的小岛。岛上有两个古老的神庙。一个是太阳神庙，一个是月亮神庙。太阳教和月亮教本来是两个势力很大的教派，但由于他们两家势同水火，是天生的死对头，经过连年征战，大家两败俱伤，如今只剩下岛上的这两座神庙了，然而他们仍旧争斗不休。\n\n月亮神庙是信仰我们黑暗之路的，我想派你们去助他们一臂之力。你们可以用在执行成为神甫任务时我交给你们的地图，租船下海，到达那个小岛。你们只要捣毁太阳神庙的神坛，他们就会一蹶不振，这样月亮神庙就可以轻而易举地对付他们了。如果你们顺利完成任务，就可以回我这儿来了。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:207
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome back, students.  The golem lesson was just an exercise, but to advance to Archmage, you really have to do something for the profession.  Copies of the fabled Divine Intervention spell are very rare, and unfortunately the School doesn't have one.  There's been a history of bad luck regarding the spell.\n\nIt has been around for time immemorial, but the spell has never found its way into our hands.  Always just out of reach, we often send guild members to find it, but every one has failed.  Sometimes they have it in their hands, but lose it on the way back, other times, the book seems to vanish, only to resurface 20 years later in some old dungeon, or on a deserted island.  Right now, we think it's in the Breeding Zone in the Pit.  Find the spell, and return with it.  Break the curse!"
msgstr "很高兴你们又回来了。人偶这个任务充其量只是个小考验而已，要成为大法师，你们可得花费更多的心血。在我们魔法学院，普渡众生魔法已经失传很久了，这个魔法自从诞生之日起就多灾多难，惹出不少风波。\n\n很久以前，我们就四处派人寻找这个魔法，可惜都没有成功。有人说在某个荒岛上见到过这种魔法，又有人说在某个地穴里发现过它。现在我们已经打听清楚了，它就在地狱城的再生之地里。你们如果能上那里去把这本魔法书带回来，我就提拔你们为大法师。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:212
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fear not death?  I can perform the Ritual on any Wizard.  You need a Soul Jar.  Years ago the Wizards stole a shipment of Jars en route from Nighon to Deyja.  The jars are very hard to destroy, so they hid them, thinking we would never be able to find them.\n\nFortunately for us, dead men do indeed tell tales.  Better, in fact, than living ones--dead men never forget, never refuse to talk, and never lie.  So, we found the one who buried the Jars, and made him die.  He was very cooperative after his death, and said he hid them somewhere in the Walls of Mist for the Wizards in Celeste. \n\nRetrieve these jars and I will perform the Ritual on all Wizards amongst you.  The rest may become Honorary Liches, for what that's worth, in thanks for finding the extra Jars for us."
msgstr "你们无畏死亡，想成为巫妖？好吧，我可以帮助你们进行永生仪式，不过你们得先完成我的任务。去找一个灵魂之坛。许多年以前在尼根到迪雅的路上有伙法师把整整一船灵魂之坛都偷走了。这些坛子异常牢固，摔不破砸不烂，他们只好把坛子藏起来，想叫我们永远也得不到坛子。\n幸好我们具有把死人点化成亡灵的高超本领，亡灵可比活人强多了，他们记性特别好，而且问什么说什么，老实极了。我们找到一个为法师们埋坛子的家伙，把他变成了亡灵，他就老实交代灵魂之坛藏在了塞莱斯特的迷雾之墙那里了。\n如果你们能把坛子找回来，我就会帮你们做永生仪式，把你们转化为巫妖，快去好好干吧。"

