#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:57
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:20
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:43
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:52
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:57
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 1 hour + 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "持续时间为魔法等级乘以1小时后再加1小时"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:22
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "This spell can't be cast while hostile monsters are nearby.  Invisibility works on the minds of nearby creatures, making them unable to notice the party unless spoken to or attacked.  Any sort of attack, regardless of whether or not it hits or misses, will break this spell."
msgstr "使队伍隐身。如果对敌人进行攻击，魔法效果就会解除。敌人在附近时不可使用此魔法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:23
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:27
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:23
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:27
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:23
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:27
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fast recovery rate"
msgstr "快速恢复"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:24
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:31
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:137
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:24
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:31
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:137
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:24
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:31
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "No spell point drain"
msgstr "不消耗额外魔法值"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:25
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Calls stars from the heavens to smite and burn your enemies.  Twenty stars are called, and the damage for each star is 20 points plus 1 per point of skill in Air Magic, and Starburst only works outdoors.  Try not to get caught in the blast…"
msgstr "召唤天空中的群星痛击敌人并把他们付之一炬。达到此魔法的专家和大师等级可以增加召唤的星数并缩短恢复时间。它的攻击力为自身魔法等级加上20点。这项魔法只能在室外使用，有可能伤及自身。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Sprays poison at monsters directly in front of your characters.  Damage is low, but few monsters have resistance to water magic, so it usually works.  Each shot does 2 points of damage plus 1-2 per point of skill in Water Magic."
msgstr "可以向你正前方的怪兽喷射毒液。尽管攻击力较差，但因为大多数怪兽不具防毒能力，所以非常有效。每次发射的攻击力为2点加上自身魔法等级的1-2倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:28
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:28
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Slow rate of recovery, 1 shot"
msgstr "恢复较慢，可以发射一束"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:28
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:28
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster recovery rate, 3 shots"
msgstr "快速恢复，可以发射三束"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:28
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:28
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster recovery rate, 5 shots"
msgstr "快速恢复，可以发射五束"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:28
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:28
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fastest recovery rate, 7 shots"
msgstr "恢复最快，可以发射七束"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:29
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:29
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:29
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Water Resist"
msgstr "御水奇术"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:29
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases all your characters’ resistance to Water magic by an amount equal to your skill in Water and lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr "增加所有角色的水系抗性。增加的抗性等于水系魔法技能等级。魔法持续时间等于水系魔法技能等级乘以1小时。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:30
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fires a single bolt of ice at a single target.  It always hits and does 1-4 points of damage per point of skill in Water Magic."
msgstr "可以向单一目标发射寒冰霹雳。攻击力为水系魔法等级的1-4倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:32
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:32
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:32
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Recharge"
msgstr "魔力填充"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:32
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:32
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:32
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Recharges any magic item that uses charges.  Every time this spell is cast, the item permanently loses 50% - 1 per point of skill in Water magic of its charges. "
msgstr "恢复魔法道具的使用次数。但道具的最大使用次数会减少。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:32
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Item loses 50% - 1 per point of skill in water magic"
msgstr "道具的最大使用次数会减少（50%-水系魔法等级乘以1%）"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:32
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Item loses 30% - 1 per point of skill in water magic"
msgstr "道具的最大使用次数会减少（30%-水系魔法等级乘以1%）"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:32
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Item loses 20% - 1 per point of skill in water magic"
msgstr "道具的最大使用次数会减少（20%-水系魔法等级乘以1%）"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:33
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:33
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:33
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Acid burst squirts a jet of extremely caustic acid at a single victim.  It always hits and does 9 points of damage plus 1-9 per point of skill.  "
msgstr "可以向单一目标发射强酸。它的攻击力为9点加上自身魔法等级的1-9倍，并且百发百中。绝大多数怪兽不具有抗酸能力。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:34
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Gives a chance to imbue a normal item with magical powers.  The chance of success is 10% per point of skill in Water Magic.  Grandmasters can manage better enchantments."
msgstr "队员能点化普通物品使其具有魔力。成功率为10%乘以水系魔法等级数。达到宗师级水平后点化效果会大大提高。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:34
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:34
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:34
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Moderate strength enchantments"
msgstr "点化效果一般"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:34
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:34
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:34
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Strong enchantments"
msgstr "点化效果非常好"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:35
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Town Portal teleports the party to the central fountain of any town the player has visited.  Town Portal has a 10% chance per point of Water Magic skill of working when cast, and cannot be used while hostile monsters are nearby.  "
msgstr "该魔法可把队伍远距离传输到上次去过的镇子中央喷泉边。成功概率为10%乘以水系魔法等级。敌人在附近时不能使用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:35
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:35
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:35
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Does not work while hostile monsters are nearby"
msgstr "敌人在附近时不能使用"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:35
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:35
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:35
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works while hostile monsters are nearby"
msgstr "敌人在附近时也能使用"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:36
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fires a ball of ice in the direction the caster is facing.  The ball will shatter when it hits something, launching 7 shards of ice in all directions except the caster’s.  The shards will ricochet until they strike a creature or melt.  Each shard does 12 points of damage plus 1-3 per point of skill in Water Magic."
msgstr "可以向正前方的目标发射冰球。当冰球击中目标会散出碎片向四周发散，但不会危及队员自身。每块碎片的攻击力为12点加上自身魔法等级的1-3倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:36
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:36
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:36
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Moderate recovery rate and 7 shards"
msgstr "恢复速度一般，可发出7块碎片"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:36
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:36
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:36
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster recovery rate and 9 shards"
msgstr "快速恢复，可发出9块碎片"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:37
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Lloyd’s Beacon lets you place a marker at a location you want to teleport back to in the future.  Just how far in the future depends on your skill in Water Magic.  Cast this spell whenever you wish to either place a marker or return to one.  These beacons will decay after 1week per point of skill in Water magic after they are cast."
msgstr "该项魔法可以使你选定将来的远程传送的地点。地点的远近根据你的水系魔法等级和点数而定。时空之门的持续时间为每个魔法等级1周。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:40
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:40
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:40
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Halves the walking speed and doubles the recovery rate of a single monster.  Slow makes sure a monster will attack you half as often, and will have a harder time catching up to you if you choose to run.  The duration of this spell is 1 minute per point of skill in Earth Magic."
msgstr "使敌人行动力减半，同时恢复时间加倍。这样一来，它们攻击你的次数将大大减少，在你逃跑时，它们也很难追到你。该魔法的持续时间为土系魔法等级乘以1分钟。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:40
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:67
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:69
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:40
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:67
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:69
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:40
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:67
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:69
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 5 min per point of skill"
msgstr "持续时间为魔法等级乘以5分钟"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:40
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:40
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:40
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Monster slows to 1/4 speed"
msgstr "怪兽的速度只有原来的四分之一"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:40
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:40
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:40
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Monster slows to 1/8 speed"
msgstr "怪兽的速度只有原来的八分之一"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:41
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:41
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:41
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Earth Resist"
msgstr "御土奇术"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:41
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases all your characters’ resistance to Earth magic by an amount equal to your skill in Earth and lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr "增加所有角色的土系抗性。增加的抗性等于土系魔法技能等级。魔法持续时间等于土系魔法技能等级乘以1小时。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:42
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Summons a swarm of biting, stinging insects to bedevil a single target.  The swarm only does 5 points of damage plus 1-3 per point of skill in Earth Magic, but it never misses."
msgstr "可以使你召唤大批蜇人蜂袭击单一的目标。每群蜂群的攻击力为5点加上自身土魔法等级的1-3倍。该魔法百发百中。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:43
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases the armor class of all characters by 5 + 1 point per point of skill in Earth Magic."
msgstr "提高某个队员的防御等级，增加点数为5点加上魔法等级。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:44
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:44
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:44
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fires a rotating, razor-thin metal blade at a single monster.  The blade does 1-9 points of damage per point of skill in Earth Magic."
msgstr "可以向单一目标发射旋转刀刃。每片刀刃的杀伤力为土魔法等级的1-9倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:45
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:55
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:59
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:68
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:71
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:80
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:82
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:45
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:55
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:59
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:68
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:71
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:80
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:82
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:45
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:55
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:59
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:68
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:71
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:80
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:82
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "No time limit"
msgstr "无时间限制"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:47
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:47
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:47
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Telekinesis lets you manipulate an object at a distance.  Switches can be thrown, objects picked up, and doors opened with this spell, all from a nice safe distance from those nasty traps."
msgstr "可以操纵远处的事物，如远距离开门、开宝箱或得到物品。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:48
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fires a magical stone far into the air that creates a very large and powerful explosion, sending shards of explosive earth raining to the ground.  The damage is 20 points plus 1 per point of skill in Earth Magic for each shard.  This spell can only be used outdoors."
msgstr "可以向空中发射魔法石，该石头落地后产生的爆炸威力极大，范围极广。杀伤力为20点加上自身的魔法等级。只能在室外使用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:48
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:48
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:48
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster recovery rate, double effect of skill"
msgstr "快速恢复，效果加倍"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:51
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Allows the party to see an opponent's current health as an exact number."
msgstr "使你能看到敌人的生命值。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:51
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:51
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:51
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 10 minutes per point of skill."
msgstr "持续时间为魔法等级乘以10分钟"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:51
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:112
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:51
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:112
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:51
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 30 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "持续时间为魔法等级乘以30分钟"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:51
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:51
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:51
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Shows spells"
msgstr "显示当前敌人的魔法"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:52
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:52
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:52
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 1 hour plus 5 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "持续时间为魔法等级乘以5分钟再加上1小时"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:52
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:52
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:52
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 1 hour plus 15 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "持续时间为魔法等级乘以15分钟再加上1小时"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:53
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fate can be used on a character to increase his chance to hit, or on a monster to decrease its chance.  The chance is modified by 20 + 1 per point of skill in Spirit Magic, and lasts until the target attacks, or 5 minutes go by."
msgstr "如果在队员身上使用此魔法，他（她）击中怪物的几率就会上升；在敌人身上使用此魔法则会导致其击中怪物几率下降。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:53
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Bonus or penalty 20 + 1 per point of skill"
msgstr "上升或下降的幅度为20点加上灵魂魔法等级"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:53
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Bonus or penalty 20 + 2 per point of skill"
msgstr "上升或下降的幅度为20点加上灵魂魔法等级的2倍"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:53
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Bonus or penalty 20 +4 per point of skill"
msgstr "上升或下降的幅度为20点加上灵魂魔法等级的4倍"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:53
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:53
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Bonus or penalty 20 + 6 per point of skill"
msgstr "上升或下降的幅度为20点加上灵魂魔法等级的6倍"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:54
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Forces all visible undead monsters to flee until the duration of Turn Undead runs out.  This spell lasts for 3 minutes plus one minute per point of skill in Spirit Magic."
msgstr "使所有视野范围内的亡灵怪兽全部望风而逃。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:135
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:135
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:54
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 3 minutes plus 1 per point of skill"
msgstr "该魔法的有效时间为魔法等级乘以1分钟再加上3分钟"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:54
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 3 minutes plus 3 per point of skill"
msgstr "该魔法的有效时间为魔法等级乘以3分钟再加上3分钟"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:70
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:54
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:70
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:54
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:70
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 3 minutes plus 5 per point of skill"
msgstr "持续时间为魔法等级乘以3分钟"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Preservation more tightly binds the soul to the body, delaying death due to massive hit point loss, but will not stop a character from going unconscious.  If hit points are still too low when the spells wears off, such a wounded character will then die."
msgstr "使灵魂和肉体紧密结合，可以防止各类即死魔法。还可以保护队员，使他（她）遭受巨大的损伤时不会死亡，只会昏迷。但是如果魔法持续时间过后生命值太低的话，该名队员还是会死去。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:56
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:56
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works on entire party"
msgstr "对整个队伍都有效"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:58
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "This spell attempts to weaken the link between the body and soul, causing 10 + 2-8 points of damage per point of skill in Spirit Magic.  Because of the nature of the spell, the caster must be very close to the victim to set of the magic.  If the target is out of range when the spell is cast, the spell will fail without draining spell points."
msgstr "通过使敌人的灵魂和肉体分离来打击敌人，该魔法只能攻击近距离的敌人。杀伤力为灵魂魔法等级的2-8倍加上10点。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:60
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:60
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Adds 4 hit points per point of skill to the pool"
msgstr "加上施法者的灵魂魔法等级的4倍"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:61
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Resurrects an eradicated (body destroyed) character.  Recovery rate is very slow, but will be faster for characters with a higher skill in Spirit Magic.  The resurrected character will be in the weak condition after this spell is cast."
msgstr "就算队员的躯体已经灰飞烟灭，也可以死而复生。该魔法最初的恢复时间很长，但随着灵魂魔法等级的提高，恢复时间会缩短。复活的队员身体状态会非常虚弱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:64
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:75
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:64
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:75
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:63
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:75
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Works no matter how much time has passed"
msgstr "无时间限制"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:64
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fires a bolt of mental force damaging to a single targets’ nervous system.  Mind Blast does 3 points of damage plus 1-3 per point of skill in Mind Magic."
msgstr "可以向单一目标的精神系统发动攻击。它的杀伤力为3点加上魔法等级的1-3倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:65
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:65
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:65
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Mind Resist"
msgstr "御心奇术"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:65
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases all your characters’ resistance to mind magic by an amount equal to your skill in Mind and lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr "增加所有角色的心系抗性。增加的抗性等于心智魔法技能等级。魔法持续时间等于心智魔法技能等级乘以1小时。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:63
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:63
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:66
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Caster reads the target's mind, finding out exactly how much gold and what items the target has."
msgstr "与施法对象的心灵产生共鸣，可以知道他带有什么宝物以及身上有多少钱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:67
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:67
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:67
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Spell lasts until party leaves the map target is in"
msgstr "在队伍离开地图前该魔法一直有效"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:68
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:68
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:68
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cure P-lyze"
msgstr "治愈麻痹"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:69
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:69
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:69
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Causes a single monster to go mad with battle lust, attacking the nearest living creature until the spell wears off."
msgstr "使施法对象充满杀意，疯狂攻击邻近的任何生物。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:69
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:69
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:69
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration is 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "在队伍离开地图前该魔法一直有效"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:73
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Takes control of target's mind for 10 minutes per point of skill in Mind Magic.  Enslaved creatures will fight monsters that are hostile to the caster for the duration of the spell, and will not fight with the caster even if attacked by the caster or his friends.  This spell will not work on the Undead."
msgstr "控制敌人的心智，使之攻击同伴。持续时间为心智魔法等级乘以10分钟。但如果你的队员对被控制的敌人发动攻击，魔法会自动解除。该魔法对亡灵怪物无效。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:76
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:76
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:76
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures 5 hit points plus 2 per point of skill"
msgstr "所恢复的生命值为肢体魔法等级的2倍加5点"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:76
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures 5 hit points plus 3 per point of skill.  Ranged casting ok."
msgstr "所恢复的生命值为肢体魔法等级的3倍加5点"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:76
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:76
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:76
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures 5 hit points plus 4 per point of skill"
msgstr "所恢复的生命值为肢体魔法等级的4倍加5点"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:76
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:76
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:76
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures 5 hit points plus 5 per point of skill"
msgstr "所恢复的生命值为肢体魔法等级的5倍加5点"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:77
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:77
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:77
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Body Resist"
msgstr "御体奇术"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:77
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Increases all your characters’ resistance to body magic by an amount equal to your skill in Body and lasts one hour per point of skill."
msgstr "增加所有角色的体系抗性。增加的抗性等于肢体魔法技能等级。魔法持续时间等于肢体魔法技能等级乘以1小时。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:79
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:79
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:79
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Gives the regeneration ability to a single character.  Regeneration will slowly heal back hit points over time while the spell is active."
msgstr "对单个队员有效。在魔法持续时间内使该队员的生命值慢慢恢复。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:79
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Slowly heals hit points over time, Duration 1 hour per point of skill"
msgstr "治疗速度较慢。持续时间为肢体魔法等级乘以1小时"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:79
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster hit point recovery / minute"
msgstr "治疗速度较快"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:79
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fastest hit point recovery / minute"
msgstr "治疗速度最快"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:81
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:81
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:81
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Hammerhand"
msgstr "重拳出击"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:81
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Hammerhands magically enhances the skill of an unarmed combatant, allowing his strikes to land more precisely against an opponent's weak spots.  Hammerhands inflicts Body Magic damage equal to the physical damage caused by the unarmed attack."
msgstr "增强空手攻击的能力。可以让目标角色的攻击更为精准地落在敌人的弱点上。所造成的额外的体系伤害等于该角色空手攻击的物理伤害。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:83
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Pro V. Magic"
msgstr "御魔奇术"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:83
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Protection from Magic affects the entire party at once, granting immunity to certain spells and monster abilities that cause debilitation conditions.  These are:  Poison, Disease, Stone, Paralyze, and Weak.  Every time this spell saves a character from an effect, it weakens.  The spell can survive 1 attack per point of skill in body magic--after that, Protection from Magic is broken."
msgstr "使整个队伍不受中毒、疾病、石化、麻痹和虚弱的影响。该魔法每提高一个等级，就可以多回避一次攻击。回避攻击到了一定的次数后，该魔法将失去效果。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:83
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:83
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Grants immunity to death and eradication effects"
msgstr "不受即死及灰飞烟灭魔法的影响"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:85
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:85
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:85
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cures hit points of all characters in your party at once.  The number cured is equal to 10 plus 5 per point of skill in Body Magic."
msgstr "恢复所有队员的生命值。所增加点数为10点加上施法者肢体魔法等级的5倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:87
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:87
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:87
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fires a bolt of light at a single target that does 1-4 points of damage per point of skill in light magic.  Damage vs. Undead is doubled."
msgstr "对单个敌人发射光明之焰。杀伤力为自身魔法等级的1-4倍。亡灵怪物损伤加倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:91
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:91
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Summon"
msgstr "光影召唤"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Summons a Lesser Light Elemental to fight for the party.  It will stay until the spell duration runs out or it is destroyed.  You can have no more than 1 elemental summoned at once."
msgstr "召唤元素出来帮助战斗。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Duration 5 minutes per point of skill.  1 elemental at one time"
msgstr "其有效时间为魔法等级乘以5分钟。能召唤1个低级元素"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Summons a normal elemental.  Duration 15 minutes per point of skill. 3 elementals at once"
msgstr "其有效时间为魔法等级乘以15分钟。能同时召唤3个中级元素"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:91
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Summons a greater elemental.  5 Elementals maximum."
msgstr "能同时召唤5个高级元素"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:92
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Temporarily increases all seven stats on all your characters by three times your skill in Light magic.  This spell lasts until you rest."
msgstr "提升所有队员的属性值。该魔法一直持续到队伍休息。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:92
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:94
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:95
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:92
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:94
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:95
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:92
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:94
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:95
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "All spells cast at five times skill"
msgstr "施展的所有魔法效果取决于角色的魔法等级乘以5"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:94
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:94
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:94
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Day -o- Prot"
msgstr "神明护体"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:94
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:94
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:94
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Simultaneously casts Protection from Fire, Air, Water, Earth, Mind, and Body, plus Feather Fall and Wizard Eye on all your characters at four times your skill in Light Magic."
msgstr "为队伍同时加上对空气魔法、肢体魔法、土系魔法、火系魔法、心智魔法和水系魔法的防御。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:95
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:95
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:95
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Hour -o- Pwr"
msgstr "神佑一时"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:95
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:95
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:95
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Simultaneously casts Haste, Heroism, Shield, Stone Skin, and Bless on all your characters at four times your skill in Light Magic."
msgstr "可以同时以施法者光明魔法等级的4倍等级向你的所有队员施展攻击加速、天赐神力、护体神盾、护体石肤和圣灵佑佐魔法。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:96
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Sun Ray is the second most devastating spell in the game, concentrating the light of the sun on one unfortunate creature.  Since Sun Ray must focus the light of the sun, it can only work outdoors and during the day.  Sun Ray does 20 points of damage plus 1-20 per point of skill in Light Magic."
msgstr "聚光魔球威力巨大，但是恢复时间非常缓慢。它能集中太阳光束照射于单个目标。因为使用太阳光束，所以必须在室外并在白天施法。它的攻击力为20点加上魔法等级的1-20倍。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:97
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Three times per day you may call upon the heavens to heal your characters of all damage, restore your spell points, and remove all adverse conditions.  The gods exact a price, however, aging the caster 10 years for each Divine Intervention.  Recovery from this spell is shortend with skill in Light Magic."
msgstr "你可以招唤天堂的神力治愈所有角色的所有伤病，并恢复魔法值。神力的代价是：每次使用该魔法，施法者的年龄都会增加十岁。光明魔法等级越高，施法的恢复时间越短。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:99
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:99
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Reanimate allows you to raise a lifeless creature from the dead (sort of).  The zombie will fight against monsters hostile to the caster until it is killed (again) or until the party leaves the map.  The zombie will have 10 hit points per point of skill in dark magic, up to its normal maximum."
msgstr "把死尸化为僵尸。僵尸会为你作战，直到战死或你离开地图。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:99
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Creature gets 20 hit points per skill point (up to creature's maximum)"
msgstr "每个魔法等级可以给予僵尸20点生命值"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:99
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:99
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:99
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Creature gets 40 hit points per skill point"
msgstr "每个魔法等级可以给予僵尸40点生命值"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:99
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:99
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:99
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Creature gets 50 hit points per skill point"
msgstr "每个魔法等级可以给予僵尸50点生命值"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:101
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:101
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:101
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Vamp Weap"
msgstr "嗜血武器"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:101
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Enchants a weapon with the Vampiric ability.  Damage inflicted on monsters struck by this weapon will be given to the weapon's wielder as extra hit points, up to his normal hit point maximum."
msgstr "使武器能够吸血。对敌人造成的伤害会变成自己的生命值（不超过自己的最大生命值）。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:102
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Area Effect (Shrinks a group of monsters)"
msgstr "可以对一组怪物同时使用"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:103
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:103
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:103
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster recovery rate and 7 fragments"
msgstr "快速恢复，可发射七个热力锯齿霰弹"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:103
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:103
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:103
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fastest recovery rate and 9 fragments"
msgstr "恢复最快，可发射九个热力锯齿霰弹"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:104
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:104
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:104
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Cntrl Undead"
msgstr "操纵亡灵"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:104
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Takes control of an Undead target's mind for 10 minutes per point of skill in Mind Magic.  Controlled Undead will fight monsters that are hostile to the caster for the duration of the spell, and will not fight with the caster even if attacked by the caster or his friends."
msgstr "操纵亡灵，使之攻击你的敌人。就算你攻击被操纵的亡灵，魔法也不会消除。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:104
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:104
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:104
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Faster recovery rate, duration 5 minutes per point of skill"
msgstr "快速恢复，持续时间为魔法等级乘以5分钟"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:104
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:104
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:104
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Fastest recovery rate, lasts until party leaves map"
msgstr "恢复最快。魔法一直有效，直到队伍离开地图"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:105
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:105
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:105
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Pain Reflect"
msgstr "同生共死"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:105
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "When a monster hits a character with Pain Reflection active, the monster takes damage equal to what it inflicted in the character."
msgstr "对自己的队员使用此魔法后，如果有敌人对该名队员造成损伤，那么这个敌人自己也会受到同样的损伤。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:105
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:105
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:105
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Affects entire party"
msgstr "对整个队伍有效"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:106
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "This evil spell immediately slays a single hireling, reducing the reputation of the party significantly.  The caster's spell points are completely returned, and all conditions, hit points, and magical aging are immediately healed."
msgstr "杀死一个随从，使自己的状态全满。其恢复时间很长，而且会大大降低你的声誉。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:107
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Dragon Breath empowers the caster to exhale a cloud of toxic vapors that target a single monster and damage all creatures nearby.  This spell is the most powerful damage spell in the land, doing 1-25 points of damage per point of skill in Dark Magic."
msgstr "该魔法可以向单个怪兽喷出云状有毒气体并危及周围的所有生物。杀伤力为自身魔法等级的1-25倍。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:108
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "This spell is the town killer.  It can only be cast three times per day and only outdoors.  Armageddon inflicts 50 points of damage plus 1 point of damage for every point of Dark skill your character has to every creature on the map, including all your characters.   "
msgstr "这是个惨绝人寰的魔法，只能在室外使用。它攻击地图上出现的所有生物，包括你自己。攻击力为50点加上自身的暗黑魔法等级。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:108
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:108
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:108
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "Can only be cast four times per day"
msgstr "一天中能使用四次"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Spells.txt.py:109
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Spells.txt.py:109
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SPELLS.TXT.py:109
msgctxt "spells"
msgid "This horrible spell sucks the life from all creatures in sight, friend or enemy.  Souldrinker then transfers that life to your party in much the same fashion as Shared Life.  Damage (and healing) is 25 + 1-8 per point of skill."
msgstr "吸取视野内所有生物的生命值，平均分配给自己的队员。杀伤力（分配的生命值）为施法者的暗黑魔法等级的1-8倍加上25点。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:3
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Intellect represents a character's ability to reason and understand complex, abstract concepts.  A high intellect contributes to Sorcerer, Archer, Ranger, Thief, and Druid spell points"
msgstr "智力反映角色推理和理解复杂抽象概念的能力。智力能提高巫师、弓箭手、游骑兵、盗贼和德鲁伊的魔法值。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:4
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Personality represents both a character's strength of will and personal charm.  Clerics, Paladins, Rangers, Monks, and Druids depend on personality for their spell points."
msgstr "个性反映角色的意志力和个人魅力。个性能决定牧师、圣武士、游骑兵、德鲁伊和德鲁伊的魔法值。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/STATS.TXT.py:21
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Fire Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage from fire attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce fire damage, it does not make your character immune."
msgstr "火系抗性代表你的角色面对基于火系的攻击，降低其伤害的能力。虽然很高的火系抗性可以大大减少火系伤害，但并不能使你的角色免疫。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Global.TXT.py:9
