msgstr "进入地狱城"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:8
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:2
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "A large dragon obviously makes his residence in these caves.  The dead bodies near his home might have been adventurers seeking the dragon's treasure."
msgstr "山洞里住着一条巨龙，到处都有探险者的骨骸，看来他们是因为觊觎巨龙的宝藏而引来杀身之祸。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:9
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:3
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The enormous size and lavish decoration of Lord Markham's Manor provide a striking contrast to the humble peasant homes and huts nearby."
msgstr "马克汉姆的府邸豪华奢侈，与附近平民的简陋小屋形成了鲜明的对比。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:10
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:4
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "From the looks of the trash and decaying garbage on the ground outside, many generations of bandits have used this cave to hide from the law."
msgstr "洞穴的外面堆满了垃圾杂物，但里面却是盗贼们逃避法律制裁的安乐窝。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:11
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:5
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Once a stately mansion, this old house has long been abandoned by the original owners.  The current residents don't seem to keep the place up very well."
msgstr "这幢大楼一定有过辉煌的历史，但现在已经被废弃了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:12
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:13
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:14
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:230
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:6
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:7
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:8
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The entrance to this barrow is pleasing to the eye, yet at the same time forbidding.  The air is very quiet near the entrance."
msgstr "入口处阴森森的，连空气都似乎静止不动了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:15
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:9
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The door is unlocked and unguarded from the outside.  The iron on the doorknob is rusting, and you can see a small hornet's nest in the corner above the door."
msgstr "从外面看来，这扇门没有上锁，也没有什么防卫，连门环都已经生锈了。你看见门的上方有一个蜂巢。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:16
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:10
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "A nasty odor wafts from the entrance of this cave, propelled by an unseen subterranean breeze.  It smells like decaying meat mixed with brimstone and…peppermint?  Whatever.  Looks dangerous."
msgstr "洞穴的深处吹来一阵凉风，夹杂着令人作呕的气味，闻起来象是硫磺和烂肉，好象还有薄荷！看来里面充满了危险。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:17
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:11
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The unassuming home of someone unimportant…or, at least someone who wishes to appear that way."
msgstr "看来是某个小人物的住处（也许主人希望访客有这种感觉）。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:18
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:12
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "This tomb must be the resting place of an eccentric recluse.  The tomb doesn't appear to have been disturbed in quite some time."
msgstr "这一定是某个性情古怪的隐士的住处，看来很久没人打扰过他了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:87
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:94
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:174
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:194
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The front door to your new home stands before you."
msgstr "城堡的大门前。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:88
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:176
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The grand entrance to Castle Gryphonheart stands before you.  A pair of tame griffins can frequently be seen circling above the castle."
msgstr "你站在格芬哈特城堡雄伟的大门前，一对驯服的狮鹫在城堡上空盘旋。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:89
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:178
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Castle Navan is the traditional seat of Elvish power.  Centuries of plant growth around the castle contribute to its sylvan character."
msgstr "那文城堡是精灵们的大本营，周围种满了千年古树。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:90
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:180
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Who knows why the Necromancers felt the need to build a castle deep within the bowels of the earth?  Castle Gloaming is ugly, sinister, and very, very secure."
msgstr "谁也不知道为什么巫师们要在大地的深处建造这座黄昏城堡，它看上去阴森、恐怖而且神秘。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:91
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:182
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Floating above most clouds gives Castle Lambent more sunlight per year than any other location.  The elegant architecture takes full advantage of the weather."
msgstr "光辉城堡飘浮在彩云之间，终年阳光灿烂，城里的建筑富丽堂皇。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:92
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:192
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The dripping of water and a strange, unidentifiable squeaking are the only noises that seem to come from the entrance to this cave."
msgstr "洞穴中偶尔发出滴水的声音以及一种奇怪的吱吱声。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:93
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:193
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "A large dragon obviously makes his residence in these caves.  Perhaps this is where those missing adventurers are..."
msgstr "山洞里住着一条巨龙，也许那些失踪的探险者都在这儿。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:95
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:195
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "These caves are the traditional hideout of goblins and bandits.  Whatever lives there now doesn't make the place smell too good…"
msgstr "这些洞穴是大耳怪和盗贼的巢穴，充满了难闻的气味。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:96
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:196
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Foul water pours from a large drain pipe coming from the Erathian Sewer.  It is said the Thieves' Guild can be found in here."
msgstr "你看到污水从埃拉西亚下水道里不断流出，据说盗贼行会就在附近。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:97
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:197
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "This mighty fort does a superb job guarding the East Bridge from invaders.  It doesn't look like visitors are welcome inside the fort."
msgstr "这座要塞守卫着东部大桥，看来这里不欢迎访客。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:98
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:198
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Fresh human or elvish footprints lead into this cave, and weeds and brush have been cleared from the entrance recently."
msgstr "你看到有人类或精灵的足迹指向洞穴深处，洞口的灌木和杂草也被清除了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:99
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:199
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Faint sounds of distant explosions and mad laughter can be heard from beyond the door.  There is a sharp, acidic smell in the air."
msgstr "门后隐约传来爆炸的声音以及疯狂的笑声，空气中弥漫着一股难闻的气味。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:100
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:200
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "A frightening spectacle of shadowy claws and twisted demonic figures beckons you inside.  You can hear a woman singing in the distance, but can't quite make out the words."
msgstr "一些阴森可怕的身影从不远处向你招手，你隐约听见有女人唱歌的声音，但听不清歌词。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:101
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:201
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The last of a series of watchtowers that once guarded the border of Deyja, Watchtower 6 is battle scarred, but still standing tall."
msgstr "6号哨塔长久以来一直守护着迪雅，它虽然饱受战火的摧残，但依然高高耸立。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:102
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:202
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The sharp, electric smell of magic fills the air outside the School--the result of hundreds of years of magical experiments and juvenile pranks happening in the same building."
msgstr "学院外的空气中弥漫着一股魔法的神秘气息，几百年来，这里盛行魔法试验和恶作剧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:103
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:203
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Though recently abandoned by the Dwarves, you can still easily see the craft and care they put into this mine."
msgstr "虽然此地最近被矮人们遗弃了，但他们精良的雕刻作品仍然随处可见。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:104
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:204
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The proving grounds of the Wizards, the Walls of Mist floats on the clouds like a mirage of the sky.  It is an entirely magical construct."
msgstr "这是法师们聚集的地方，终年烟雾缭绕，充满了魔力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:105
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:205
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The Temple of the Light is one of the most beautiful and serene places in the world.  Any follower of the Light can feel their troubles slipping away as they walk in these hallowed halls."
msgstr "光明神庙是世界上最美丽宁静的地方，善良的人们在这里会忘记所有的烦恼。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:106
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:206
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Traitors and prisoners of war are frequently thrown in this horrible pit as object lessons in cruelty.  All Necromancers must also enter the pit and escape before they can complete their apprenticeships."
msgstr "叛徒和战俘都被扔进此地受刑，这也是巫师们“进修”的场所。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:107
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:207
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The Temple of the Dark is still in use by the forces of evil.  Sacrifices are held monthly, and foul rites are performed routinely on the front steps."
msgstr "暗黑神庙被邪恶势力所控制，他们经常在此进行各种可怕的祭祀。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:108
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:208
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The sound of unholy chanting and the screams and moans of the undead can be heard quite clearly from the entrance.  "
msgstr "大门后隐约传来亡灵的呻吟和邪恶的祷告声。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:109
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:209
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Overgrown and weather beaten, the Grand Temple of the Sun has seen better days.  It appears someone is still taking care of the place."
msgstr "高级太阳神庙饱经风霜，曾经有过光辉的岁月，看来直到现在还有人在守护着它。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:110
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:210
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The Warlocks of Nighon call this extinct volcano their home.  A network of natural and carved tunnels spread away from the mountain, permitting travel throughout Nighon and across the sea."
msgstr "尼根的邪术师将这座火山视为他们的家。这里有四通八达的地道延伸到整个尼根，甚至还可以过海。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:111
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:211
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "A huge, magical maze stretches before you as far as the eye can see.  Looking at it for long dazzles the eyes and confuses the mind."
msgstr "你的眼前出现了一座巨大的迷宫，你望了一会儿，只觉得头昏脑涨。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:112
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:212
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Stone City is one of the great bastions of the Dwarven race in the world.  The front gate looks very secure."
msgstr "石头城是矮人们的乐园，城堡的大门看上去坚实稳固。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:113
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:213
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Words cannot convey the horror.  One of the pipes must be an entrance…"
msgstr "你的心中产生了一种莫名的恐惧。应该有一条通道是入口。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:114
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:214
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The Mercenary Guild is home to every swordsman who fails at banditry.  Visitors are unwelcome."
msgstr "雇佣兵行会里经常有各种剑客出入。这里不欢迎访客。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:115
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:215
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "These caverns have been the hideout of pirates and ne'er-do-wells for centuries."
msgstr "许多世纪以来这些洞穴一直是海盗和歹徒的藏身之所。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:116
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:216
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "A trail of ominous brown stains leads downstairs and into darkness…"
msgstr "一些污垢一路指向楼梯下的黑暗地窖。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:117
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:217
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "A mighty fortress housing the fantastic and murderous Titans.  No one has ever entered and returned to tell the tale."
msgstr "这是泰坦的城堡，谁也不知道里面有什么，因为进去的人从来没有回来过。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:118
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:218
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Once the proud center of a false religion, the Temple has fallen into disrepair.  "
msgstr "这里曾经是邪教的神庙，但现在只是一片废墟。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:119
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:219
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "It doesn't look like much, but getting in isn't easy.  Careful not to stray from the path."
msgstr "这里看上去非常平静，但实际上绝不简单，小心不要走错路。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:120
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:220
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "This incredible starship is but a small sample of the wonders of the Ancients."
msgstr "这艘神奇的飞船是古代文明的杰作。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:23
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:158
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:221
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "A thunderous howl pierces your ears, provoking a feeling of dread. Whatever produced that sound is drawing near, with each step rocking the earth beneath your feet."
msgstr "雷鸣般的吼声刺穿你的耳朵，激起你的恐惧感。发出的声音越来越近，每一声都摇动着脚下的大地。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:21
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:159
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:222
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "As you go deeper into this vast network of tunnels, your instinct tells you that many dangerous creatures dwell within. You vow to remain vigilant."
msgstr "当你深入到这个广阔的隧道网中后，你的本能告诉你，这里面有很多危险的生物。你告诉自己要保持警惕。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:160
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/TRANS.TXT.py:223
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "This tunnel leads to Stone City."
msgstr "这条隧道通向石城。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:118
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:2
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am Lord Markham, the benefactor providing the castle that is the prize of the this contest."
msgstr "我是马克汉姆爵士，本次寻宝大赛的主办者。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:118
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:2
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Nice to see you again, how are you doing on the hunt?"
msgstr "啊，你们回来了，情况进展得怎么样了？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:119
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:3
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Have you collected everything on the list yet?"
msgstr "你们拿到物品单上所列的东西了吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:120
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:4
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome to Emerald Island, my name is Margaret and I'll be your docent for your stay here."
msgstr "欢迎来到翡翠岛。我叫马格莉特，是你们在岛上的向导。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:120
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:4
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What would you like to know?"
msgstr "你们想知道点什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:121
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello again, how are you doing?"
msgstr "嗨，又见面了，干得怎么样了？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:123
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, you've returned, no doubt to listen to my proposal."
msgstr "啊，你们又回来了。觉得上次还不过瘾。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:125
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello again… friend."
msgstr "嗨，咱们又见面了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:126
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:126
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I don't believe we have anything to talk about."
msgstr "我见到你们就心烦，快走吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:127
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings again, friends."
msgstr "咱们又见面了，伙计。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:129
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:129
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm Roger and I sell guild memberships for the Body and Spirit Guilds on Emerald Island."
msgstr "我叫罗格。负责为肢体魔法行会和灵魂魔法行会招募会员。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:130
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Aye, good to see you again, mates!"
msgstr "嗨，咱们又见面了，伙计。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:131
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello, my name is Donna, I live here with my daughter Sally."
msgstr "你们好，我叫唐纳，和我女儿塞莉住在一起。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:131
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:263
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:15
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:147
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello again, what can I do for you?"
msgstr "嗨，咱们又见面了，能为你们效劳吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:132
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hi again, did you need something?"
msgstr "嗨，咱们又见面了，能为你们效劳吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:156
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:156
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:40
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings Rogues, how may I be of service?"
msgstr "你们好，要为你们效劳吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:164
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:48
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I just want to go home."
msgstr "我要回家。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:165
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:49
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now what do you want?"
msgstr "你们想干什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:168
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:52
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello again, do you need anything?"
msgstr "很高兴又见到你们，有什么要我效劳的吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:175
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:59
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have a reason... [Snick wheezes] for troubling me, I hope?"
msgstr "你们没什么要紧事最好别来麻烦我！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:179
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:63
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Back for more teaching, kid?"
msgstr "伙计们，有想来学点新东西？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:193
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:77
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[Thomas Grey offers a peculiar half smile and folds his arms] I am still at your service, my lords!"
msgstr "（托马斯·格雷微微一笑）愿为你们效劳，我的朋友。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:194
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:78
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am honored to be graced with your presence, my lords."
msgstr "很高兴能为你们效劳，我的朋友。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:201
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:201
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:85
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am yours to command, master."
msgstr "悉听号令，我的主人。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:203
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:203
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:87
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You rang, my lords?"
msgstr "你们好，我的主人！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:209
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:93
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Avlee is listening, my Lords."
msgstr "有什么事吗，我的朋友？"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:97
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You again?  You know, I was just asking my generals why the attack on Fort Riverstride was such a disaster when someone on my staff noticed the traps on the map YOU gave us were in the wrong places!  [the King chuckles, smiling] Imagine my generals' relief when we all realized that it wasn't incompetence that killed 74 elves, but treachery! Hahahahaha! [King Parson slaps his knee, then abruptly stops laughing and stares at you.]\n\nI would execute the lot of you, but the war is over. In the interests of harmony, you can live.  For now."
msgstr "你们还有胆子回来见我。你知不知道，我们还在奇怪，对利文斯德要塞的进攻为什么会一败涂地，然后就突然发现，正是你们提供的利文斯德要塞地图把陷阱都标在了错误的位置上。（国王微微冷笑）将官松了口气，原来我们死了74个精灵，是因为你们这群叛徒，而不是我们自己无能。哈哈哈哈哈！（国王边笑边拍打膝盖，突然停止大笑，紧盯着你们）对你们这些人，就是千刀万剐都难解我心头之恨。可惜现在战争已经结束了，再对你们动手又要被埃拉西亚抓到把柄了。好了，这次就饶了你们的狗命，快滚吧，别让我再见到你们。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:100
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My lords, it is always a pleasure to see you.  I must once again urge you to consider our uh, I mean Judge Fairweather for the important post of Arbiter.  Take your time making the decision, but do be quick about it, eh?\n\nRemember, all you have to do is visit Judge Fairweather in Bracada and choose him for the job; then take him to the Arbiter's house here in Harmondale.  I am sure he will put a swift end to this nasty war."
msgstr "啊，我们又见面了，哈蒙代尔的领主们。我希望你们能认真考虑一下我的建议，挑选费尔维泽作为交战双方的调解人，形势的发展已经不允许我们再拖下去了，希望你们能尽快作出令人满意的决定。\n\n其实你们要做的只是到布拉卡达来要求费尔维泽为这次战争的调解人，把他请到哈蒙代尔和双方会晤就行了。我相信凭他的能力，会马上平息这场迫在眉睫的战争。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:101
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A pleasure to meet you, my lords.  My name is Ambassador Scale, and I represent Deyja, the land of the Necromancers northwest of Erathia.  Now, I know what you're thinking--Necromancy!  Yuck!  Isn't that death magic?  Well, it IS, but we merely pursue knowledge for it's own sake; rather noble if you ask me.  We're not so bad.  You should speak with some of the fellows--they really know how to party.  [The Ambassador forces a smile] Ha ha ha!\n\nI invite you to visit Deyja.  When Judge Grey died, you became the ones who must choose his successor.  We have someone in mind who will encourage our enemies to...um...bring this terrible war to an end.  Yes.  I urge you to choose Judge Sleen.  \n\nIt would mean so much to us, and we could do so much for you!  Think about it, but don't think too long!"
msgstr "很高兴见到你们，哈蒙代尔的领主。我就是来自迪雅的使者斯克尔。你们应该听说过迪雅吧，它是与埃拉西亚西北部比邻的死灵法师王国。你们要是对我们至高无上的亡灵魔法有兴趣，我倒可以帮忙，哈哈哈。\n现在公证人格瑞已经死了，你们必须尽快找一个继任者。我想你们应该来我们迪雅，有一个叫德冯·斯利恩的很合适担当这个职位，凭他的能力足以和解这场一触即发的战争。 \n\n如果你们能听从我的劝告的话，将大大有利于迪雅和哈蒙代尔两国关系的发展，对我们大家都有好处，好好考虑一下吧。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:102
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The new lords of Harmondale, I presume.  I am Judge Sleen.  Let me be frank--my sympathies lie with Deyja and the Necromancers.  We want you to choose me for the job of Arbiter for the war between Erathia and Avlee.  Since both of those countries are the enemies of Deyja, I will be a fair judge.  However, choosing to be the ally of Deyja means CHOOSING WHAT OTHERS CALL \"DARKNESS\".\n\nThis darkness business is pure rot.  Necromancy is nothing but the study death and what happens with the spirit after death.  Sure, the results can be a little grisly, but so is making sausage and the practice of law.  And nobody would say those jobs don't have their value.\n\nChoose me and be our ally.  Because if you cannot prove your friendship through this simple act, what else can you be but our enemy?  Remember, though, that once you choose me, you cannot later change your mind.  Your choice is permanent."
msgstr "你们是哈蒙代尔的新主人吧。我就是 德冯·斯利恩。老实跟你说吧，我是死灵法师这一边的人。迪雅之所以要你选我当调解人，是因为埃拉西亚和埃里都是我们的敌人，我自然不会偏向任何一方的。而且办成此事，你就选择了黑暗之路，就是我们迪雅的朋友了。\n\n死灵法师的名声虽然不好听，其实我们钻研的是天下至高无上的魔法。生与死，灵魂与肉体，这就是大自然生生不息的力量的源泉，是物质存在的最高形式。如此高深的魔法本质，自然不是常人所能理解的。虽然我们的魔法曲高和寡，但仍然值得为其奉献一生，甚至不惜用生命来捍卫它。\n你们选择了我当调解人，也就成为我们死灵法师的朋友，可以与我们一起探索深奥的亡灵魔法。但要记住，你们一旦作出决定，是不容更改的。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:102
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Still considering your choice, I see.  Let me remind you of what's at stake:  [The Ambassador holds up a finger]\n\nThe length of the war--The longer it lasts, the better off we'll all be.  Erathia and Avlee will be weaker, and unable to interfere in our affairs.\n\nYou will be allying with us.  There are things we can teach you...\n\nMost importantly, YOU WILL CHOOSE THE PATH OF DARKNESS.  This choice cannot be withdrawn."
msgstr "还在考虑吗，你们现在到底还顾虑什么？\n\n如今的战争持续时间越长对我们越有利。最好埃拉西亚和埃里两败俱伤，这样我们就可以渔翁得利了。\n\n你要是想成为我们的盟友，就快按照我们说的去办。\n\n最要紧的是，这样你就选择了黑暗之路，这可是一个不容更改，决定你们一生的抉择。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:105
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello.  I've been expecting you.  I am Judge Fairweather.  I think it's important you understand that I DO work for Bracada, but I am neutral on the Erathia - Avlee war.  Obviously, we want you to hire me as the Arbiter over this conflict, and I will be a fair judge.  We need you to understand, however, that choosing me as the Arbiter will be CHOOSING THE PATH OF LIGHT.\n\nIt is the right choice.  I will put an end to this destructive war as quickly as possible, and minimize deaths.  All you have to do is make a decision.\n\nPlease choose the path of light, and reject evil.  Be our ally.  Just remember that whatever choice you make will be a permanent one."
msgstr "啊，你们终于来了，我已经等了很久了。我就是费尔维泽，尽管我是埃拉西亚的人，但在这场战争的调解中会秉公断事，铁面无私的。而且你们要明白，选择我当调解人就是选择了光明之路。\n\n如果你们能选我，我会使交战双方尽快停止战斗，尽可能的减少伤亡。现在一切都掌握在你们的手中。\n看来你们应该选择光明之路，成为我们的盟友，要记住，你们的这次决定是不容更改的。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:105
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No decision yet?  Why do you waver in the face of what is clearly the moral choice?  Think about it:\n\nChoosing me puts an end to the war quickly.  Many people will have you to thank for saving their lives.\n\nYou will be allying with Bracada, and rejecting Deyja.  All the Light has to offer will be yours to learn.\n\nMost importantly, you will be CHOOSING THE PATH OF LIGHT.  This choice is permanent, and cannot be withdrawn."
msgstr "还没有考虑好吗？选择事态发展已经非常紧急了，还磨蹭什么！\n\n快点选择我当调解人吧，只有我能平息这场战争，这样天下百姓都会感激你的。\n你们应该尽快选择光明之路，和我们布拉卡达结成朋友，不要去理睬迪雅，谁不想堂堂正正做个好人呢？\n\n记住，最要紧的是你们必须选择光明之路。这个决定别无选择，不容更改。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:108
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "New Lords from Harmondale, I see.  Well, I am pleased to meet you at last.  I am sure the relationship between our two governments will be a long and mutually beneficial one.  You've made the right choice in allying with us.  There is much we need to talk about, but my advisors first insist that you walk the Wizards' Path before our relationship can progress.\n\nI know this test seems silly, but I assure its purpose is not.  You can take the test whenever you feel ready.  And if you fail today, you can always come back and try it another day."
msgstr "啊，你们就是哈蒙代尔的新主人，很高兴见到你们。我已经听说你们的功绩了，确实很了不起。我想布拉卡达和哈蒙代尔之间将迎来一个和平友好的新时代。既然你们已经选择了我们光明之路，我们就是盟友了。但我的大臣们认为你们还必须完成法师之路的考验，不然他们还会心存忧虑，不知你们的本领到底怎样。\n\n不过我对你们一直很有信心。放心吧，这个考验对你们来说应该是轻而易举的。什么时候准备好了，就可以来找我。不用着急，我不会催你们的。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:111
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[Resurectra smiles, and curtseys] Lords.  I am Resurectra, chief advisor to King Magnus.  We are pleased you chose Judge Fairweather as the arbiter in the Erathia-Avlee conflict.  It's a sign of your good intentions.  However, if we are to have further dealings, you must first complete the King's test.  We do not have time for the the uncommitted or the faint of heart.\n\nAfter you are done with his test, return to me, and we will talk.  Rest assured you will find your alliance with us profitable."
msgstr "（瑞瑟雷克特微笑）我的朋友们，你们好。我就是瑞瑟雷克特，格文·马格努斯国王的首席大臣。你们选择了费尔维泽调解埃拉西亚和埃里之间的战争，确实干得非常出色。不过你们要想和我们进一步合作的话，还必须经受国王对你们的考验，只有这样我们才相信你们有足够的信心和勇气来与我们合作。\n要是你完成了国王交给你们的任务的话，可以再到我这儿来，我会向你们交代下一步行动的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:228
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:229
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:112
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:113
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Always a pleasure to see you, Lords."
msgstr "很高兴又见到你们，哈蒙代尔的领主们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:233
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:117
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have nothing to say to you!"
msgstr "我跟你们没什么好说的。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:123
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Pleased to make your acquaintance.  My name is Kastore, chief advisor to Lord Ironfist.  [Kastore makes a sweeping gesture toward the other advisors] My associates and I agree that you've shown excellent taste so far over your choice of Judge Sleen in the Erathia affair.  I think future relations between Deyja and Harmondale will be quite rosy and profitable for all involved.\n\nHowever, I never trust someone I just met.  Before we can do business, you'll have to prove that you're...our kind of people.  Lord Ironfist has a test he likes to put new Necromancer recruits through.  If you can pass it, return to me and we'll talk more."
msgstr "很高兴能认识你们。我就是卡斯托，艾恩法斯特爵士的首席大臣。你选择了德冯·斯利恩解决埃拉西亚和埃里之间的纠纷，干得真不错。看来哈蒙代尔和迪雅的关系将进入一个和平相处的新阶段。\n但是我们只是初次打交道而已，我对你们还不怎么了解。艾恩法斯特爵士经常向一些新来的死灵法师委派任务，以考察他们的本领和勇气。如果你能完成他所交给的任务的话，我们就可以开始进一步的合作了，快去吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:243
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:244
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:127
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:128
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Glad to have you back, allies."
msgstr "很高兴你们能回来，我的朋友。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:134
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now that you've finished my associate's tasks, I am ready to give you a much more dangerous, but very critical mission.  Our plans hinge on your success.  I know I can count on you.\n\nOh, I almost forgot to mention!  Archibald is no longer in charge.  He left in a huff after we disagreed with how we should proceed with our plans.  He's moved into Clanker's laboratory now, and taken some of the less...motivated necromancers with him.  No loss there.  Kastore is King of the Pit, now."
msgstr "好了，看来你们已经完成了其它大臣交给你们的任务，现在该论到我了。我这个任务是最危险的，也是最至关重要的，它关系到全局的成败，不过我对你们很有信心。\n\n哦，还忘了告诉你们。现在阿基巴德不再是迪雅的统治者了，他竟敢阻挠我们的计划，所以被赶跑了。现在他住在科兰克实验室里，还带走了一帮死灵法师。现在这个地狱城的主人是卡斯托了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:250
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:134
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome, friends."
msgstr "欢迎你们，我的朋友。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:136
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello, my friends…you are still my friends, aren't you?  My \"advisors\", my \"lieutenants\" [Archibald spits out the words], have the Pit, and their dreams of conquest.  I have come to realize they did not need me, nor did they want to study our art.  \n\nThey want a world where there are no Kings, no loyalty, and no honor.  Just them and their slaves.  Well, they can have it!  After the soul jars were stolen, my lieutenants just shrugged, as though it was wagon wheels, or chickens that went missing, not the keys to immortality!  We were so close to devising a way to keep the body from decay after the Ritual was performed!  Now this--a setback that will cost decades.\n\nSo, we have moved here--thanks to you--to continue our studies.  For what it's worth, I have renounced my claim to the throne of Enroth.  I don't think anyone believes me, but that shouldn't matter.  This island is quite secure, and we have fixed the breech that let you infiltrate it in the first place. "
msgstr "你们好，我的朋友，但愿你们现在仍是我的朋友。唉，我如今是一无所有了。我的手下背叛了我，把我赶出了地狱城，现在我只好流落到这个地方。我到今天才发现，我只是他们手中的傀儡，一旦没用了，他们可以把我象垃圾一样丢在一边。\n\n他们根本不想要什么国王，也不管什么正义、和平。他们就想能够奴役整个世界，说不定他们会成功的。自从我们的灵魂之坛被偷后，他们竟根本不把这当回事。要知道，我们历尽千辛万苦，才研究出保留不死之身的办法，好不容易得到了这些灵魂之坛，可以进行永生仪式了。这下全完了。看来是天不助我，要从头开始又得花几十年的时间。\n还好，我们还有现在这个唯一的安身之地。整个恩洛斯的人都被我得罪光了，现在我是有家难回，只能待在这儿了。幸好这个岛还很安全，我们可以在这个暂避一时，继续钻研我们的魔法。"

#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/npcgreet.txt.py:137
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Find what you're looking for?  Don't worry--I'm not too angry that you invaded.  Most of my minions will regenerate, one way or the other.  There's not even much treasure left.\n\n[Sigh] Well, if you're here to fight us in the name of the Light, don't bother.  I've given up the conquest business.  My former allies [Archibald spits on the ground] have abandoned our great achievements in the arts of Necromancy, and now seek merely to conquer the world.  I have little doubt they will succeed.  It won't go well for you and your masters if they do.\n\n[Archibald looks at you more closely, now] Then again, perhaps they won't.  You have the smell of fate about you, as though you are destined for great things.  Perhaps you will stop them.  But smart money still bets against you."
msgstr "找到你们要的东西了吗？你们一路杀到这里，真是辛苦了。虽然你们杀了我不少手下，我不会怪你们的，我会有办法使他们复生的。不过你们可能会很失望，这里并没有什么金银财宝。\n你们是奉光明教派的命令来这里讨伐我的吧！不过我已经退出江湖，不再理会什么光明、暗黑教派了。我的手下背叛了我，竟然认为死抠书本，钻研什么亡灵魔法的真谛是浪费时间，他们想的只有利用魔法来奴役整个世界。不过他们现在的实力确实很强，说不定有一天他们会如愿以偿的，到那时候你们和你们的光明教派可就倒霉了。\n现在世界的命运就掌握在你们手中。我看得出来，你们命中注定是干大事的料。一切就全靠你们了，只有你们才能阻止这帮无耻的家伙的阴谋。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:270
