msgstr "如果队伍在身上和在银行中的金币少于100个金币，那么铁沙漠中在铁锈镇的喷泉将可以给你200个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:219
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Autonote.txt.py:257
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid "Well at the Dragon Hunters Camp in Garrote Gorge gives 200 gold if the total gold on party and in the bank is less than 100."
msgstr "如果你的队伍在身上和在银行中的金币少于100个金币，那么在绞刑峡谷的猎龙人营地中的井水将会给你200个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:220
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Autonote.txt.py:258
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
