#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:5
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Though of primitive craftsmanship, the great weight of this weapon's blade gives it excellent striking power."
msgstr "虽然做工相当的原始，但这柄武器厚重的刀刃给予它强大的杀伤力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:4
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:6
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dark Elven Longsword"
msgstr "黑暗精灵长剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:4
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:6
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The weapon of a merchantman from the Dark Elven city of Alvar. It's wavy edged blade holds a good edge."
msgstr "这是黑暗精灵城市阿尔瓦来的商旅通常爱用的武器。它单薄的刀刃十分的锋利。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:5
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:7
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Templar's Sword"
msgstr "圣殿骑士剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:5
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:7
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A sword for a true swordsman. Its lack of ornamentation bespeaks of the singular purpose of its design."
msgstr "一柄给真正剑客使用的武器。它单纯而毫不装饰的外观诉说着兵器真正的用途。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:6
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:8
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Champion's Sword"
msgstr "勇士之剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:6
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:8
msgctxt "items"
msgid "These are made exclusively for members of the Erathian Order of the Blade. Since by tradition they are buried with their fallen wielders on hallowed and guarded grounds, they are rare articles indeed."
msgstr "这些是专门打造给埃拉西亚剑客团体成员的武器。由于传统上这种武器是会随着持有者一起陪葬在守卫森严的墓地中，所以在市面上极端的稀有。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:7
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:9
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This blade's great weight and length give its blows greater reach and damage. Otherwise, it is unexceptional in quality."
msgstr "这柄剑的重量和长度让每次攻击的距离和威力都更为增加，不过，在品质上就没有多大的特色了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:8
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:10
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dark Elven Bastard Sword"
msgstr "黑暗精灵巨剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:8
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:10
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Often carried by Elven caravan guards, these slightly under-proportioned blades are nearly, but not quite, light enough to brandish single-handedly."
msgstr "这种武器通常是由精灵商队的守卫所携带，这种武器的重量几乎可以让人以单手来持用，不过，很可惜的，在重量上还是稍嫌太重了一些。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:9
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:11
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Minotaur Battlesword"
msgstr "牛头人战斗剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:9
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:11
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Only those possessed of great strength and balance can gracefully swing these mighty blades let alone control them in the heat of combat."
msgstr "只有最强壮、反应最灵敏的人才能够挥舞这种兵器，更别提在战斗中操纵自如了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:10
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:12
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragonning Blade"
msgstr "龙剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:10
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:12
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A deep biting, perfectly balanced weapon designed for one purpose - the slaying of dragons."
msgstr "这柄拥有强大杀伤力，十分容易使用的武器只有一个目的：屠龙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:11
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:13
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Headsman's Reaver"
msgstr "行刑人之剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:11
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:13
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crafted from purified erudine alloy and then tempered in a pool of roiling lava, this sword's practically undullable and perfectly balanced blade backs up its intimidating appearance."
msgstr "这种兵器是由纯净的依鲁丁合金所打造，并且在炎浆中反复的锤打所完成的。它的刀锋几乎永远不会变钝，而在重量本身也相当的平衡，再搭配上相当具有威胁性的外表，是非常不错的武器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:12
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:14
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Iron Broadsword"
msgstr "铁阔剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:12
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:14
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Some swordsmen swear that the soft metal of an iron sword gives them certain combat advantages. Those swordsmen never seem to be very old."
msgstr "有些剑客声称铁质长剑的柔软度让他们在战斗中拥有某些的优势。不过，很有趣的是，这些人看起来都相当的年轻。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:13
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:15
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Trollish Claymore"
msgstr "巨魔大剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:13
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:15
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Though of primitive design and craftsmanship, these Troll forged weapons are effective in strong hands."
msgstr "虽然这种武器的设计和做工相当的原始，这些巨魔所打造的武器在壮汉的手中会拥有非常大的威力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:14
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:16
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lizardman Broadsword"
msgstr "蜥蜴人阔剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:14
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:16
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The Lizardmen produce a weapon capable of giving sturdy service."
msgstr "这种蜥蜴人所制造的武器可以伴随冒险者相当长的一段时间。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:15
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:17
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Knightly Broadsword"
msgstr "骑士阔剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:15
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:17
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The weight of this sword's untapered blade would make it unwieldy if not for its exacting counterbalance."
msgstr "如果不是因为这柄剑末端的稳定重量，如此宽阔的大剑势必会很难操作。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:16
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:18
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Archangel Broadsword"
msgstr "大天使阔剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:16
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:18
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This blade of pure erudine steel can cut armor like butter and gleams with a starlight glow. There are finer swords available, but their numbers can be counted on a single hand."
msgstr "这柄刀刃由纯依鲁丁合金所铸造的武器，可以如同切牛油一般轻易的割穿盔甲，并且会发出特殊的光芒。也许世界上还有更好的兵器，但数量必定十分有限。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:17
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:19
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Rusty Cutlass"
msgstr "生锈短剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:17
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:19
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This weapon may once have been of some quality, though it would be hard to tell through the apparent years of corrosion."
msgstr "这种武器可能曾经还有不错的品质，但从锈蚀斑斑的外表实在看不出确实的年代来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:20
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Goblin Scimitar"
msgstr "大耳怪弯刀"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:20
msgctxt "items"
msgid "After the Gowdar Deep Goblins were wiped off the face of Jadame in the Goblin-Ogre Wars, thousands of these weapons appeared on the common market."
msgstr "在大耳怪和巨魔的战争中，葛达大耳怪被彻底消灭之后，有数以千计的这种武器出现在市场上。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:19
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:21
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Issued to Regnan seamen as a basic side arm, these blades have gained a sturdy reputation."
msgstr "这种武器是分派给雷格那的水手作为随身携带的武器，在口耳相传之下获得了不少的赞誉。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:20
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:22
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Regnan Falchion"
msgstr "雷格那偃月刀"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:20
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:22
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The extremely forward balance of this weapon's blade gives it extra striking power, but requires great strength and skill from its wielder."
msgstr "这柄武器在重量上特别偏重前端，也因此拥有更大的打击力，但使用者相对的必须要拥有更大的力量和技巧才行。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:21
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:23
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Captain's Cutlass"
msgstr "船长短剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:21
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:23
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Given to Regnan captains upon gaining their first command, these superior weapons help them to dominate their foes and subordinate."
msgstr "这是雷格那船长们在第一次接获指派之后所获得的武器；这种超凡的兵器足以让他们击败敌人和不服气的下属。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:22
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:24
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crude Dagger"
msgstr "简陋匕首"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:22
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:24
msgctxt "items"
msgid "As much a cutting tool and eating implement as a weapon, this dagger of soft steel will take an edge, but will lose it through very little use."
msgstr "这种匕首可以当做工具、餐具，或是不怎么有威力的武器。不过，用不了多久它就会变钝。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:23
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:25
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crystal Dagger"
msgstr "水晶匕首"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:23
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:25
msgctxt "items"
msgid "These daggers are often carried by members of the Necromancers' Guild. The crystals used for the blades are found in the Shadowspire mountains. They are incredibly sharp, but have a tendency to shatter."
msgstr "这些匕首通常是由死灵法师公会的成员所携带的兵器。用来当做刀刃的水晶是在阴影塔山区中所找到的。它们相当的锋利，但却很容易破碎。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:24
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:26
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Merchantman's Dagger"
msgstr "商人匕首"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:24
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:26
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This dagger is a typical example of those produced by the weaponsmiths of Alvar. It is made of hardened steel and has excellent balance."
msgstr "这柄匕首是阿尔瓦的武器工匠所打造的兵器典范；它是由强化的钢铁所制造的，并且拥有非常良好的操控性。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:25
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:27
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Master's Dagger"
msgstr "大副匕首"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:25
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:27
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Daggers of this quality are rare indeed. Made of erudine and rare woods, finished in gold, and set with a sizable ruby, this would be a rich man's extravagance if it were not also so effective a weapon."
msgstr "这种品质的匕首相当罕见。它是由依鲁丁合金和少见的硬木所制造，外面包覆黄金，镶嵌有一枚尺寸不小的红宝石。如果不是因为它拥有相当的杀伤力，可能会单纯的成为富人的收藏。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:26
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:28
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Fanged Blade"
msgstr "利牙刀刃"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:26
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:28
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The grip on this blade has clearly been rewrapped many times. It is said that such blades were used by the first Vampires who appeared millennia before the Silence. Could this possibly be one of those ancient weapons?"
msgstr "这柄武器的握把部分很明显的经过了多次的重新缠绕。据说这种武器是出现在大寂静之前数万年的吸血鬼所爱用的东西。难道这就是其中的一柄古物吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:27
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:29
msgctxt "items"
msgid "With a blade in length between sword and dagger, these weapons are meant for the knife fighter who desires a bit of extra reach. This particular weapon is of mediocre workmanship in soft steel."
msgstr "因为介于长剑和匕首之间的长度，这种武器适合于那些需要比较长距离攻击的战士们使用。这柄武器是利用软钢打造而成，手工还算精细。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:28
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:30
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Alvarian Poignard"
msgstr "艾佛立安匕首"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:28
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:30
msgctxt "items"
msgid "At many social functions in Alvar, it is deemed inappropriate to carry a sword. It is common for Elven warriors to carry a smaller blade in case things become uncivil."
msgstr "在阿尔瓦的许多活动中，携带刀剑是不礼貌的。所以，为了预防状况变得失控，许多精灵战士会随身携带较小的刀械。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:29
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:31
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Regnan Fighting Knife"
msgstr "雷格那战斗匕首"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:29
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:31
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Not wishing to be encumbered by a shield, many Regnan pirate raiders fight with a cutlass in one hand and one of these shorter blades in the other."
msgstr "许多雷格那的海盗们不愿意受到盾牌的拖累，宁愿一只手拿着短剑，一只手拿着这种比较短的武器来作战。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:30
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:32
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Twilight Kris"
msgstr "黎明匕首"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:30
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:32
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This wavy bladed long dagger of the best quality steel is the product of the Twilight weaponsmiths. The bat wing guard set with a blood red ruby marks it as the weapon of a Vampire."
msgstr "这种长匕首是黎明武器店的产品之一。这柄武器拥有蝙蝠翅膀形状的护手，也镶嵌有血红的宝石，证明它是个吸血鬼爱用的武器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:31
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:33
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dueling Long Dagger"
msgstr "决斗长匕首"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:31
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:33
msgctxt "items"
msgid "While they present a united front to the rest of the world, there is much internal strife among the Vampires of Shadowspire. By custom, very serious differences are settled in battle using these deadly blades of exquisite craftwork."
msgstr "虽然阴影塔的吸血鬼们团结起来对抗外界，但他们之中还是有许多的争端。根据传统，这些争端都是利用这些锋利的武器在决斗中解决的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:32
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:34
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Stone Axe"
msgstr "石斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:32
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:34
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Not much more than fire-hardened sticks lashed to sharp stones, these crude implements make for poor tools and weapons."
msgstr "这种武器只不过是烤硬的棍子绑上锋利的石头而已，不管是当做武器或是工具都太过简陋了些。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:33
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:35
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Battle Hatchet"
msgstr "战斗斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:33
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:35
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Often carried by mounted knights as a secondary arm, battle hatchets are preferred by some who carry them to the exclusion to any sword."
msgstr "这种战斗斧通常是由骑士携带，充作备用武器。不过，有些时候也有骑士偏好它们胜过使用刀剑。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:34
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:36
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Battleaxe"
msgstr "战斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:34
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:36
msgctxt "items"
msgid "These heavy axes are meant to be carried one-handed for use against both armored and unarmored foes."
msgstr "这种沉重的斧头是用来单手持用，对付穿戴盔甲或是没有穿戴盔甲的敌人。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:35
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:37
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dwarven Battleaxe"
msgstr "矮人战斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:35
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:37
msgctxt "items"
msgid "While the blacksmiths of the Jadamean Dark Dwarves are not as skilled as their Erathian counterparts, they still produce a product superior to most of what is otherwise available."
msgstr "虽然贾丹姆大陆上的黑暗矮人在金属铸造方面比不上它们的埃拉西亚同胞，但他们所打造的武器相对来说依旧非常不错。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:36
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:38
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Minotaur Battleaxe"
msgstr "牛头人战斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:36
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:38
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Forged by the Minotaurs for their wars with the Ogres, these axes are forged of a secret alloy formula. Their edges are difficult to dull and even harder to sharpen."
msgstr "这些武器是牛头人所打造，为了对抗巨魔所设计的。它们是利用秘密的合金配方所铸造出来的，因此，它们的刀刃十分难以磨钝，更难以磨利。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:37
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:39
msgctxt "items"
msgid "As much an implement for working wood as a weapon, this crude axe can still deliver a telling blow."
msgstr "虽然这种东西看起来比较像是工具，但这柄简陋的斧头其实还是可以造成相当的伤害。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:38
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:40
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Footman's Axe"
msgstr "步兵斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:38
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:40
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Capable of splitting armor, these two-handed axes are a favorite among soldiers facing mounted knights."
msgstr "这种双手巨斧可以劈开盔甲，是许多战士面对骑士时的最爱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:39
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:41
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Minotaur War Axe"
msgstr "牛头人巨斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:39
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:41
msgctxt "items"
msgid "These two-handed axes are commonly used by Minotaurs who have the strength necessary to handle their great weight."
msgstr "这种双手巨斧是牛头人相当爱用的兵器。因为只有他们拥有足够的力量来使用这种武器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:40
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:42
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elite Minotaur Axe"
msgstr "精锐牛头人斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:40
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:42
msgctxt "items"
msgid "These axes of superior workmanship are issued only to members of The Blackened Horn, the elite warriors who guard Minotaur holy sites."
msgstr "这种做工极为精致的斧头只派发给牛头人圣地防御部队的黑角部队使用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:41
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:43
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Minotaur Herdsman Axe"
msgstr "牛头人战将斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:41
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:43
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Minotaur herdsmen lead their troops into battle wielding these devastating war axes of superlative balance and workmanship."
msgstr "牛头人的战将拿着这种杀伤力惊人的斧头率领整个部队冲锋陷阵。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:42
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:44
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ogre Fighting Stick"
msgstr "巨魔战斗棒"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:42
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:44
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A fire-hardened and sharpened sapling studded with thorns, spears like these are used by Ogre troops for drill and basic combat training. "
msgstr "这是经过火烤变硬、削尖的棍子，上面还插上尖刺。这类的长矛通常是巨魔部队用来演习和进行基本战斗训练用的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:43
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:45
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Steel Spear"
msgstr "钢矛"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:43
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:45
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Basic spears are found stockpiled in the armories of many races, and for good reason - they are effective and deadly weapons. This particular one is of Minotaur origin."
msgstr "许多种族的兵器库里面都不会缺少长矛这种兵器，这是有原因的：它们是相当有效的致命武器。这种武器是牛头人所善用的武器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:44
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:46
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elven Long Spear"
msgstr "精灵长矛"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:44
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:46
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The fine craftsmanship and balance of this alloy steel headed spear mark it as the work of the weaponsmiths of Alvar."
msgstr "这柄做工精细，拥有坚硬的合金枪尖的长矛是阿尔瓦精灵武器工厂的产品。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:45
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:47
msgctxt "items"
msgid "War Spear"
msgstr "战矛"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:45
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:47
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This spear is built for battle. Far to heavy to be wielded by the part-time militiaman, it is built for the professional warrior who prefers the spear to other weapons."
msgstr "这柄长矛是真正的战场上所使用的。它非常的沉重，一般的民兵无法有效的使用这种武器，是专门用来让擅用长矛的专职士兵发挥威力的兵器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:46
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:48
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragon Harpoon"
msgstr "龙鱼叉"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:46
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:48
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The back-barbed stalt steel head of this weapon is designed to deal grievous damage to even the most ancient of dragons. Naturally, it is the spearfighter's choice for dispatching all foes."
msgstr "这种武器的背刺斯多克钢头可以对飞龙造成巨大伤害，连最古老的龙类都无法逃脱它的威胁。它很自然地成为了长矛手消灭敌人的利器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:47
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:49
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Improvised Voulge"
msgstr "战戟"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:47
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:49
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This simple poleaxe appears to have been made by attaching the blade of a farm implement to a poorly crafted spear."
msgstr "这种简陋的长柄斧看来似乎是将农家的工具绑上粗制滥造的长矛而成。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:48
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:50
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A versatile weapon combining the qualities of an axe and a spear, the halberd is designed to perform in formation and individual close quarter fighting."
msgstr "这种武器结合了斧头和长矛的特点，是用来在战阵中使用，或是在窄小空间的格斗中派上用场。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:49
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:51
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Beaked Halberd"
msgstr "锋芒戟"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:49
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:51
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This improved halberd has a spiked blade opposite its axe face to provide both balance and a means of penetrating plate armor."
msgstr "这个经过改进的戟在斧刃的另外一边装上了一个尖刺，除了提供了更好的平衡之外，也拥有穿透钢甲的实力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:50
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:52
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Minotaur Campaign Pole-axe"
msgstr "牛头人战斗长柄斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:50
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:52
msgctxt "items"
msgid "When the Minotaurs went to war with the Frost Giants of faraway Vori, their king Balthazar commissioned this polearm to arm his troops. He reportedly said, \"Since they will be gone so long, arm them with something versatile.\""
msgstr "当牛头人和遥远的沃里的霜雪巨人开战的时候，他们的国王巴尔萨煞下令将这些武器派发给他们使用。他常常说，“由于他们要离开很长的时间，应该把最耐用的武器派到他们手上。”"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:51
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:53
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Labyrinth Grapple"
msgstr "迷宫抓勾"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:51
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:53
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Minotaurs have very little tolerance for intruders in their hallowed mazes. This fact is well evidenced in the attention paid to weapons constructed for the labyrinth guards."
msgstr "牛头人极端无法容忍有外来者入侵他们的迷宫。这点光从迷宫守卫所使用的武器就看的出来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:52
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:54
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hayfork"
msgstr "草叉"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:52
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:54
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Though a common farming implement, this hayfork is of sturdy construction and could be an excellent, if improvised, weapon."
msgstr "虽然这原来是农家爱用的工具，但这柄草叉只要经过相当的改良，就能够成为相当耐用的精良武器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:53
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:55
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Infantry Fork"
msgstr "步兵战斗叉"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:53
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:55
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A highly specialized piece of equipment intended to equalize contests between foot soldiers and mounted, armored opponents, these modified spears are effective if slightly clumsy weapons."
msgstr "这种武器是专门用来让步兵和骑士之间的战斗能够更为平衡所设计的。这种经过修改的长矛相当的有用，但却是有点笨拙的武器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:54
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:56
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lizardman Trident"
msgstr "蜥蜴人三叉戟"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:54
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:56
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The blacksmiths on the Dagger Wound Islands craft a wide variety of spearheads. This trident is one of their most unusual designs. The barbed tines cause extra damage during straight thrusting attacks."
msgstr "匕伤岛上的武器工匠会打造各式各样的矛头。这个三叉戟就是他们最不寻常的设计之一，在叉上的倒刺让最普通的突刺攻击都能够造成巨大的伤害。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:55
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:57
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Regnan Trident"
msgstr "雷格那三叉戟"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:55
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:57
msgctxt "items"
msgid "No Regnan ship leaves port without a cache of tridents. Boarding attacks against their galleys seldom succeed against massed walls of their erudine tines."
msgstr "所有雷格那的船舰在离港的时候都会携带三叉戟。在这些依鲁丁尖刺形成的铁壁防御下，敌人的登船攻击很难成功。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:56
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:58
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Triton Trident"
msgstr "崔顿三叉戟"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:56
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:58
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The first thing one notices when first handling this trident is that it is unusually cool to the touch. The second is a sense that the dragon turtle bone tines seem to seek vulnerabilities in their targets' defenses as if guided by an unseen hand."
msgstr "使用者第一次拿到这柄三叉戟的时候会首先注意到它触手生冰。第二个注意到的会是龙龟骨胳的尖刺似乎由一双看不见的手所引导，寻找敌人防卫最弱的地方攻击。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:57
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:59
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hunting Bow"
msgstr "猎弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:57
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:59
msgctxt "items"
msgid "These lightweight bows of simple construction are meant for bringing down small game animals - not for direct combat. "
msgstr "这种重量很轻的弓设计简单，也就是专门为了攻击小型的猎物所用的，其实并不适合在战斗中使用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:58
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:60
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Recurve Bow"
msgstr "弯弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:58
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:60
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Recurved bowstaves allows an archer to pull a heavier bow than they might otherwise be able to. Greater pull weight means greater arrow speed for increase range and damage."
msgstr "弯曲的弓身让弓箭手可以拉开平常无法拉开的沉重弓弦。拉力越大，代表箭的射程和杀伤力也就越大。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:59
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:61
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Snakewood Bow"
msgstr "蛇木弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:59
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:61
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The human soldiers of Enroth carry bows made from the native snakewood tree. The strong, flexible wood makes a sturdy bow."
msgstr "恩洛斯的人类士兵们时常携带由当地蛇木所制造的弓箭。这种强韧有弹性的木头适合用来制造坚固的弓箭。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:60
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:62
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elven Warbow"
msgstr "精灵战弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:60
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:62
msgctxt "items"
msgid "By laminating together layers of wood, steel, and bone the bowsmiths of Alvar have created a bow of perfect balance, strength and accuracy. The process consumes a lot of time, craft and expensive materials which explains the steep price these bows command."
msgstr "借着把一层层的骨胳、钢铁、木头结合在一起，阿尔瓦的弓箭工匠们创造出了拥有极佳平衡、强度和准确度的弓箭来。这过程需要耗费很多的时间、精神以及昂贵的原料，这也就是为什么这类武器都要花费相当多金钱的原因。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:61
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:63
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Devilbone Bow"
msgstr "恶魔骨弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:61
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:63
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dark Elven bowsmiths have discovered that unusual characteristics of the Kreegan spinal column make it the best material for heavy bowstaves. A clever arrangement of composite pulleys make it possible for those of less than superhuman strength to pull these mighty weapons."
msgstr "黑暗精灵的制弓工匠发现了克里根人的脊椎拥有不寻常的特性，最适合用来制作重型长弓的弓身。在额外增加了一些滑轮之后，即使是不具超人力量的使用者也可以拉开弓弦。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:62
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:64
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Light Crossbow"
msgstr "轻型十字弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:62
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:64
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Because of their ease of use, crossbows like these are stockpiled in militia armories everywhere. Their low pull strength and mediocre workmanship however, make them only moderately effective."
msgstr "由于十字弓使用的便利性，各地的民兵都很爱购买和储存这类的武器。它们不需要太大拉力就可以使用的特性和粗劣的作工让它们只能算是中等的武器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:63
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:65
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Blood Drop Crossbow"
msgstr "血滴十字弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:63
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:65
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A light crossbow of good quality, these weapons feature a grooved table, basic sights and a smooth releasing nut."
msgstr "这是品质相当好的轻型十字弓，拥有相当完整的整套工具，以及不错的瞄准平衡度。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:64
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:66
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hunting Crossbow"
msgstr "狩猎十字弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:64
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:66
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Built for use in the field, this medium crossbow is designed for hunting, but is equally effective as a battle weapon."
msgstr "这种中型的十字弓适用于战场，虽然原始的设计是用来狩猎，但其实也很适合战斗中使用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:65
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:67
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Caravaner's Crossbow"
msgstr "篷车十字弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:65
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:67
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The Merchants of Alvar like to see their caravan guards well armed. This well-crafted heavy crossbow has a cranked drawing mechanism."
msgstr "阿尔瓦的商人们喜欢让麾下的守卫们拥有相当不错的武器防具。这种沉重的十字弓拥有相当不错，用来拉开弓弦的设备。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:66
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:68
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Regnan Crossbow"
msgstr "雷格那十字弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:66
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:68
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The pirates of Regna Island have spent centuries perfecting their crossbow design. The resulting weapon has a crystal lensed sight and bowstaves of pure stalt - which would make the bow impossible to cock if not for the crank draw of erudine alloy."
msgstr "雷格那岛上的海盗花费了好几个世纪的时间来改良它们十字弓的设计。设计出来的这种武器带有水晶透镜瞄准器和纯斯多克弓弦。如果不是由于依鲁丁合金的曲轴牵引，根本无法扣动这种弓。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:67
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:69
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A slight improvement over the common club, maces are better balanced, more durable, and deliver greater damage."
msgstr "这是普通粗头棍的改良型武器，杀伤力稍稍强一些，外观也比较好看。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:68
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:70
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Flail"
msgstr "链枷"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:68
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:70
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Though evolved from the farm implement which shares its name, the flail's great reach and striking power make it a fearsome weapon."
msgstr "虽然这是从农庄的同名产品中改良产生的，链枷的长距离攻击威力让它成为相当不错的武器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:69
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:71
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Temple Mace"
msgstr "神殿钉锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:69
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:71
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The sunray corona circling the head of this well made mace serves as a devotional declaration for Temple of the Sun clerics; it also greatly increases the damage of its blows. "
msgstr "在这柄钉锤上所刻画的日冕不只骄傲的宣布它是太阳神庙牧师所使用的武器，更大幅增加了它的威力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:70
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:72
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Reverend Sceptre"
msgstr "神圣权杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:70
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:72
msgctxt "items"
msgid "As much a symbol of office as weapon, these finely crafted maces are carried by inner circle Sun Temple priests. Its highly decorated shaft belies the effectiveness of the gilded erudine-steel head."
msgstr "这种钉锤除了是象征地位的物品之外，也是太阳神庙高级的神甫所携带的武器。它的握柄装饰有许多的华丽花纹，却无法掩饰它的锤头是由依鲁丁合金所打造的强大杀伤力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:71
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:73
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Trollish War Mace"
msgstr "巨魔战斗锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:71
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:73
msgctxt "items"
msgid "While most races have concentrated on developing bladed weapons, the Trolls have always been content to refine the simple bludgeon. This brutal weapon forged as a single piece of stalt alloy is the finest example of their craft."
msgstr "虽然大多数种族都专注于开发带刃的武器，但巨魔一族一直以改进重击武器为目标。这种由斯多克合金锻造而成的野蛮武器是他们工艺的最好例子。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:72
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:74
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sledgehammer"
msgstr "大榔头"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:72
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:74
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This hammer is more a construction tool than a weapon. Still, it could deliver a telling, if clumsy, blow."
msgstr "这柄锤子其实比较适用于建筑攻城，不过依旧可以造成敌人的伤害，只是使用起来比较笨拙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:73
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:75
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Field Hammer"
msgstr "战场之锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:73
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:75
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This hammer was designed as secondary infantry arm designed to finish off armored opponents who have fallen to the ground."
msgstr "这种锤子是设计来成为步兵部队的次要武器，用来了结那些掉落到地面的敌人。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:74
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:76
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Warhammer"
msgstr "战锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:74
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:76
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An improved version of the field hammer, this weapon is heavier, better balanced and more durable. While it requires strength to wield, it is a terrible sight to armored and unarmored foes alike."
msgstr "这是战场上战锤的改良版，重量比较重、使用起来比较方便，也更耐久。虽然这需要相当的力量才能够操控，但对于敌人来说都是种相当可怕的威胁。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:75
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:77
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sun Hammer"
msgstr "太阳之锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:75
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:77
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Clerics of the Sun are prohibited from using bladed weapons. That they carry such fine warhammers is the natural result of this restriction. As an added measure of devotion, a reverse image of their sun symbol is embossed on the striking face."
msgstr "太阳教派的牧师不能够使用开锋的武器。也因此，他们才会携带和研发这么精良的战锤。为了强调他们信仰的力量，锤头上还隽刻有太阳的符号。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:76
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:78
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Trollish Maul"
msgstr "巨魔巨锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:76
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:78
msgctxt "items"
msgid "It is necessary to handle this weapon to appreciate its perfect grip and balance. The hammer's head is carved from a single mineral crystal. Trollish weaponsmiths spend a lifetime mastering the shaping technique to produce a head that retains incredible hardness without being shatter prone."
msgstr "实际拿着这柄武器才会体验到它的平衡感和极佳的握感。这个武器的锤头是用一整块水晶所打造的。巨魔的工匠们花费一辈子的时间才能够打造出拥有强大硬度，却又不会随便破碎的锤头来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:77
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:79
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A wooden head and handle studded with short iron spikes, the simple club's best attribute is that it can be constructed from found materials."
msgstr "这柄粗头棍的木顶上装了短铁刺，增加了一些攻击力。这个武器所能够显示出来的最佳特色就是可以从身边随手拿到的物品中取得零件。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:78
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:80
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Thornbark Club"
msgstr "刺皮粗头棍"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:78
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:80
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The Trolls of the Ironsand Desert make these clubs by fire-hardening the fantastically tough root wood of the thornbark tree."
msgstr "铁沙漠的巨魔利用刺木的坚硬根部经过火烤之后制造出相当不错的武器来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:79
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:81
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Overlord's Club"
msgstr "霸王粗头棍"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:79
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:81
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Troll tribal chieftains must win their position through trial by combat. The winner keeps his club as a symbol of office. The losers' clubs often find their way into the weapon marketplace."
msgstr "巨魔的酋长必须经过一连串的搏斗才能够晋升到目前的地位。失败者的粗头棍常常会出现在市场上供人购买。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:80
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:82
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Journey Staff"
msgstr "旅者之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:80
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:82
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Many dangers face the Jadamean traveler. Even the least battle-minded carry some sort of weapon. These iron ended walking sticks are a common choice."
msgstr "贾丹姆大陆上的旅行者经常会面临许多的危机。即使最不想要作战的人们也会携带一些防身的弓句。这种铁头的手杖就是相当不错的选择。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:81
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:83
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Orb Staff"
msgstr "圆球之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:81
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:83
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This staff is topped with a head of polished turquoise to give it greater striking force."
msgstr "这柄手杖顶端装有打磨过的绿松石，让它拥有更强大的攻击力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:82
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:84
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Priestly Staff"
msgstr "牧师之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:82
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:84
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This finely decorated staff is the product of Lizardman craft. Wrapped with exotic leathers, and ended with a bronze footcap and striker, these staves are carried by Lizardman priests as a symbol of station."
msgstr "这柄装饰华丽的手杖是蜥蜴人制造的产品。它包覆着珍贵的兽皮，两端分别是由青铜包覆的部分。这种手杖通常是由蜥蜴人的神甫携带，象征他们的地位。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:83
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:85
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Serpent Staff"
msgstr "蛇之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:83
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:85
msgctxt "items"
msgid "These rare staffs may appear unwieldy, but they are the product of sorcery. In combat they flex with animal intelligence to work in blows through their targets' defenses."
msgstr "这些少见的手杖看起来也许不太好用，但却是魔法的产物。在战斗中它们将会拥有一部份动物的智能和反应力，能够打穿敌人的防御。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:84
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:86
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Bone Staff"
msgstr "骨之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:84
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:86
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Fashioned from the spinal bones of wyverns and crowned by a dragon's lower spikeplate, these staves are the product of necromantic weaponcraft. It is unusual to find one of these deadly weapons that is not also carrying a powerful enchantment."
msgstr "这是由双足翼龙的脊椎骨和龙类的肩甲骨所组合成的手杖，也是由死灵魔法所打造出来的攻击武器。这种武器通常本身就会附有相当强烈的攻击法术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:85
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:87
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Leather Jerkin"
msgstr "皮背心"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:85
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:87
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This armor of thick, supple leather studded with brass offers minimal protection against blows."
msgstr "这个由厚重、耐用的兽皮所制作，上面钉上黄铜扣的盔甲可以提供最基本的防护。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:86
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:88
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hardened Leather Vest"
msgstr "硬皮背心"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:86
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:88
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This item of leather armor has been hardened to offer increased protection. It is comfortable and light though offers little coverage."
msgstr "这种皮甲经过特殊的硬化程序，可以提供更进一步的防护。虽然它的重量轻，穿起来也舒服，但却无法提供太多的防护。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:87
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:89
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Caravaner's Leather"
msgstr "皮衣"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:87
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:89
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This is the type of armor worn most often by those guarding Alverian merchant caravans. A hardened and internally braced breastplate covers an undersuit of tough but supple hide, offering the wearer full body protection with a minimal hampering of movement."
msgstr "这是防御阿尔瓦商队的守卫最常穿着的盔甲。经过硬化程序的胸甲内部还有镶嵌特殊的金属，内部还穿着一件较有弹性的兽皮，让使用者可以获得最大的防护，却不会对移动的敏捷度造成太大的危害。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:88
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:90
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Though seemingly too thin to offer solid protection, this armor of Regnan design holds a subtle enchantment which makes the leather nearly steel tough. Additionally, a secret process makes the suit resistant to salt water corrosion."
msgstr "虽然看起来太过瘦薄，无法提供足够的防御，但雷格那出产的这款盔甲拥有些许魔法防护，让它们几乎变得和钢铁一样的兼顾。另外，秘密的制程也让这种盔甲足以抗拒盐水的腐蚀。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:89
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:91
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Alvarian Leather"
msgstr "阿尔瓦皮甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:89
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:91
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Leather armor sets of this quality are of the finest produced by the Alvarian Armorers' Guild. The stalt-alloy edged panels are virtually inpenetrable; their clever interlockings give the wearer excellent freedom of movement."
msgstr "这种品质的皮甲是阿尔瓦盔甲公会所能够打造的最佳皮甲。这个皮甲所拥有的斯多克合金边板几乎无法穿透，而内部彼此闭锁的防御机制却还可以让穿戴者依旧行动自如。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:90
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:92
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Rusty Mail Vest"
msgstr "生锈锁甲背心"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:90
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:91
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:92
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:93
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:94
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:92
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:93
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:94
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:95
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:96
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:517
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Chainmail"
msgstr "锁甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:90
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:92
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This corroded ring mail vest has seen better days. It has been field repaired in many places and even has a large patch of thinner mail salvaged from a piece of chain cowl."
msgstr "这套腐蚀的锁甲以前曾经有过更好的外观。它曾经经过多次的修补和维护，甚至可以看的出来有些地方用过比较糟糕的锁甲来弥补原先的破洞。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:91
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:93
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Steel Chainmail"
msgstr "钢铁锁甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:91
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:93
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Constructed of strong steel this is the type of armor worn by the rank and file foot soldiers of many armies."
msgstr "这种盔甲是由钢铁所打造，适合各种部队中的步兵列阵的时候穿戴。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:92
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:94
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Minotaur Chainmail"
msgstr "牛头人锁甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:92
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:94
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Of a design originally created by the Minotaurs for their Vori campaigns, this type of chainmail, with its good coverage and fine construction, has proven popular among other races. Now the armorsmiths of Bathazar Lair construct it in sizes for any with ready gold to spend."
msgstr "这种设计原先是牛头人为了沃里战役所开发出来的。但由于这种锁甲拥有极佳的包覆性和作工，稍后也相当获得其它种族的欢迎。现在巴尔萨煞巢穴的盔甲工匠们愿意为了花的起钱的大爷们打造足够让人大吃一惊的盔甲。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:93
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:95
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Siertal Chainmail"
msgstr "席尔多锁甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:93
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:95
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The Alvarian Dark Elves guard their siertal-alloy formula carefully. Chainmail made from this metal is both light and capable of turning the hardest blades."
msgstr "阿尔瓦的黑暗精灵们相当慎重其事的保守他们席尔多合金配方的秘密。利用这种合金所制作的锁甲不只质轻，更可以抵抗最坚硬的武器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:94
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:96
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Erudine Chainmail"
msgstr "依鲁丁锁甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:94
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:96
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Another master product of the Alvarian Armorers' Guild, this hybrid suit of plate and mail is made of siertal-alloy finished erudine with an attention to craftsmanship worthy of the precious materials."
msgstr "这是另外一款由阿尔瓦盔甲工匠们生产的高文件产品，这种结合了钢甲和锁甲，以及席尔多合金，外包依鲁丁的盔甲不只结合了最好的原料，更是工艺技术的结晶。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:95
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:97
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Rusty Breastplate"
msgstr "生锈前胸钢甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:95
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:97
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This piece of plate armor salvaged from a larger suit is so corroded it is a question whether it is equipment for a warrior or junk for the scrap man."
msgstr "这套盔甲是从本来更大的盔甲上抢救下来的，由于腐蚀的太过严重，所以很难看出来这到底是战士的装备还是捡破烂人的宝物。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:96
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:98
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Banded Plate"
msgstr "合钢甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:96
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:98
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Bands of steel cover the mid-torso of this chain and plate chest armor. While lighter and simpler to construct than continuously formed plate, this armor offers less protection than heavier plate."
msgstr "这个结合了锁甲和钢甲的盔甲在身体的中段是由钢条所结合的保护。虽然这比一整块的钢板所打造的钢甲要轻，构造简单，但也比那样的钢甲防护力要低。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:97
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:99
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Minotaur Plate"
msgstr "牛头人钢甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:97
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:99
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An example of the work produced by the Minotaur armorers of Balthazar Lair, this plate armor provides excellent mid-section protection. The arms are left free in the Minotaur-style."
msgstr "这是巴尔萨煞的牛头人盔甲工匠所打造的产品最典型的范例。这种钢甲提供了极佳的防护力，而双臂则是以牛头人平常的惯例展露在外面，以提供较佳的运动性。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:98
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:100
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dark Knight Plate"
msgstr "黑骑士钢甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:98
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:100
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Though lined with felt and red velvet, and decorated with enamel and gilding, this armor is no showpiece. The siertal-alloy plates are light, but tough enough that they must have been worked with tools with erudine working faces."
msgstr "虽然上面装饰着极尽华丽的各种天鹅绒、珠宝等等，但这套盔甲绝不是什么装饰品。这套由席尔多合金所打造的钢甲不但轻，坚硬度更是极高，当初一定是使用依鲁丁材质的工具才能够打造。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:99
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:101
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragoning Plate"
msgstr "龙钢甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:99
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:101
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The technique for making plate armor of erudine sheets is not known on Jadame. In fact, it is only produced by the master armorer, Derrick Goreth of Erathia who spent a lifetime constructing his famed White Light Forgeworks."
msgstr "贾丹姆大陆上没有人知道应该如何利用依鲁丁矿石打造钢甲。事实上，只有埃拉西亚大陆上的盔甲大师德瑞克·哥拉斯花了一辈子在白光熔炉中研究才找出了打造这种盔甲的方法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:100
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:102
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Trollish Shield"
msgstr "巨魔盾牌"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:100
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:102
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A simple wooden shield of Trollish make, the design is often copied by apprentice armorsmiths just learning their craft."
msgstr "这是巨魔所打造的简单木盾，应该是刚学习这门技艺的学徒所打造的练习产品。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:101
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:103
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Thornbark Shield"
msgstr "刺木盾"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:101
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:103
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Made from thornbark tree heartwood and rimmed with iron, this shield is sturdy, if a bit heavy."
msgstr "利用刺木心，外面包覆以铁质物品的盾牌，虽然有些沉重，但还算是蛮耐用的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:102
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:104
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Regnan Tournament Shield"
msgstr "雷格那格斗盾"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:102
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:104
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Every ten moons, the Regnans hold a great festival which includes a tournament of arms. The noble class contestants spare no expense in the commissioning of shields that are light, but tough enough to shelter them from harm."
msgstr "每十个月，雷格那人就会举办包括了比武大会的狂欢仪式。贵族们会不惜重金采购质轻，又足以保护他们不受伤害的盾牌。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:103
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:105
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Veteran Shield"
msgstr "老将之盾"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:103
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:105
msgctxt "items"
msgid "In the Demon Wars of Erathia, the Humans found that only erudine armor was proof against the fiery attacks of their foes. Bit by bit, pieces of this armor - like this shield - have made their way to Jadame."
msgstr "在埃拉西亚的恶魔战争中，人们发现只有依鲁丁材质的装甲可以让他们不受恶魔攻击的伤害。慢慢的，这种装甲一部份一部份的开始流入贾丹姆大陆上，这个盾牌就是一个例子。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:104
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:106
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragon Hunter's Shield"
msgstr "猎龙人之盾"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:104
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:106
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The town of Kriegspire in Enroth had a problem with Dragons. These shields were their answer. Magically bound layers of erudine, stalt-steel and hydra leather, make a nearly unbreakable material resistant to most Dragon breath weapons."
msgstr "恩洛斯克里格斯镇上的人们一直对于龙类的肆虐感到困扰，这个盾牌就是他们的解决方案。用魔法结合的一层层的依鲁丁、斯多克钢材和九头蛇皮，构成了几乎牢不可破的结构，可以抵抗大多数龙类的喷吐攻击。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:105
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:107
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This small shield is gripped in the off-weapon hand. The wielder is much dependent on agility to make use of its scant defensive coverage."
msgstr "这种小型的盾牌是利用不拿武器的那只手所操作的护具。使用者必须利用自己敏捷的反应来弥补这种护具较小的覆盖面。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:106
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:108
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Caravaner's Small Shield"
msgstr "车队小盾"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:106
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:108
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Caravan guards traveling Merchant of Alvar trade routes must often cover long distances on foot. This shield, like the rest of their equipment is well made and lightweight."
msgstr "和阿尔瓦商人一起旅行的车队守卫经常必须要步行很长的距离。因此，这个盾牌就如同他们的其它装备一样，不但坚固耐用，重量也不能够很重。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:107
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:109
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Calvary Shield"
msgstr "骑兵盾牌"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:107
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:109
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A favorite among mounted knights, these steel shields are strong enough to turn aside the points of pikemen."
msgstr "这是骑士们最喜欢的装备之一，这种钢盾坚硬的程度足以阻挡枪兵的攻击。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:108
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:110
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Death Head Shield"
msgstr "亡首之盾"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:108
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:110
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The Necromancers' Guild likes to arm its undead armies well. Their elite infantry carry these erudine alloy shield of great strength."
msgstr "死灵法师公会喜欢让自己的不死部队们拥有不错的武器。他们的精锐步兵通常会携带这种极端坚固的依鲁丁所打造的盾牌。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:109
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:111
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Eldritch Shield"
msgstr "艾尔崔奇盾"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:109
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:111
msgctxt "items"
msgid "There are only twelve of these shields in known existence. Their bodies are made of an alloy that appears to seethe with the color of coal fire. Their rims are made of another unknown metal that is soft enough to catch blades, but doesn't gouge or scratch."
msgstr "据说这世界上只有十二面这样的盾牌。盾牌的本体似乎吸收了火焰的颜色，盾牌的边缘则是另外一种未知的金属，虽然可以吸收刀刃的撞击力，却不会留下什么样的痕迹。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:110
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:112
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This cap of soft iron and unhardened leather provides a small measure of protection from blows to the head."
msgstr "这种由软铁和皮甲所构成的帽子对于敌方针对头部的攻击可以提供不错的防护。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:111
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:113
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lizardman Helm"
msgstr "蜥蜴人头盔"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:111
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:113
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Iron and leather helms of this sort are produced by blacksmiths everywhere. This one is of Lizardman manufacture and sports genuine ram horns."
msgstr "由钢铁和兽皮所制造的这种帽子各地的工匠都会制作。这是由蜥蜴人的工匠所打造的，上面还装饰有山羊角。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:112
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:114
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Steel helms of this design are commissioned in large numbers by the Merchants of Alvar who issue them to mounted caravan guards."
msgstr "这种设计的钢帽是阿尔瓦的商人们特别设计，大量制造给他们的车队守卫所使用的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:113
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:115
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Battle Helm"
msgstr "战盔"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:113
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:115
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This full helmet is of superior materials and workmanship. The structurally weaker areas around the eye and nose slits are reinforced with siertal."
msgstr "这顶全盔不只拥有相当强韧的材质，更拥有相当不错的作工。在眼边和鼻子边缘的结构性弱点也经过了席尔多矿石的强化。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:114
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:116
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragon Helm"
msgstr "龙盔"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:114
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:116
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The faceplate of this superior helmet hinges on nearly invisible seams so that when closed it provides a snug fit and full face coverage. Only the most well-aimed blows have a chance of penetrating through."
msgstr "这顶头盔的面具部分拥有几乎难以注意到的接缝，让它能够提供十分紧密的保护和全脸的防御。只有最精准的攻击才能够穿透这么严密的防御。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:115
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:117
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A loose fitting hat made of sturdy cloth."
msgstr "利用材质耐用的布料所缝制的布帽子。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:116
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:118
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Festival Hat"
msgstr "庆典之帽"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:116
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:118
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hats decorated with cheap glass gems are worn by Regnans on festival occassions--of which they have many."
msgstr "这是雷格那人装饰有便宜玻璃宝石的帽子，专门用来在他们的节日庆典中穿戴。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:117
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:119
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Merchantman's Hat"
msgstr "商人之帽"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:117
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:119
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This pleated cap of velvet, lined and edged with black rabbit fur is decorated with a small enameled medallion. "
msgstr "这个天鹅绒缝制的帽子，旁边还装饰有黑色的兔毛，以及一个小型的护身符。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:118
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:120
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A simple belt of cured leather. It is decorated with iron studs and closes with a pinned hasp."
msgstr "这是卷曲兽皮所制造的简单腰带。上面装饰着铁片，利用简单的扣子戴在身上。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:119
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:121
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sturdy Belt"
msgstr "强韧腰带"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:119
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:121
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A thick leather belt. The studs and buckle are made of brass."
msgstr "厚重的腰带，这些突起和扣环都是用黄铜所打造的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:120
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:122
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wyvern Leather Belt"
msgstr "双足翼龙皮带"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:120
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:122
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wyvern leather is very tough and difficult to obtain. It is prized by Shadowspire leathercrafters because it becomes black when tanned--a color favored by their vampire and necromancer clientele."
msgstr "双足翼龙的皮相当的坚硬，也很难找到。阴影塔地区的盔甲工匠非常喜欢这种材质的原料，因为在经过硬化程序之后，这种兽皮会自动变成黑色的，而当地的吸血鬼和死灵法师们都非常喜欢这种颜色的装备。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:121
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:123
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Steel Belt"
msgstr "钢皮带"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:121
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:123
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This well crafted belt is made of enameled steel. It has two cleverly concealed side hinges and has a latching clasp in back."
msgstr "这个作工精良的腰带是由钢铁所打造的。旁边拥有两个相当精细的活动装置，并且还有一个扣环固定住整套装备。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:122
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:124
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Artificer's Belt"
msgstr "精致腰带"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:122
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:124
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Finely crafted belts of dragon leather are made to hold enchantments. This one is worked in gold and circled by thin bands of siertal."
msgstr "经过工匠细心打造的龙皮多半可以承载相当程度的魔法。这块龙皮是由黄金所缠绕，还包括了一些席尔多合金强化它的结构。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:123
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:125
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Traveler's Cloak"
msgstr "旅者斗篷"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:123
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:125
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This warm cloak of dyed wool also offers a small amount of protection from weapon attacks."
msgstr "这套由染色羊毛所制成的斗篷同时也能够防御些许武器的伤害。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:124
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:126
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Moon Temple Cloak"
msgstr "月神殿之斗篷"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:124
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:126
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The blue dye used to color the glove leather cloaks worn by Moon Temple clerics is derived from the frond petal flowers which grow only in the Mount Nighon region of Erathia."
msgstr "用来给月亮神庙的牧师们所穿着的这款斗篷染色的蓝色染料是从只生长在尼根山脉的花朵中所提炼出来的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:125
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:127
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Alvar Cloak"
msgstr "阿尔瓦斗篷"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:125
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:127
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Made in Alvar, cloaks of this quality are often seen on the shoulders of the more wealthy members of the Alvarian Merchant Guild."
msgstr "这种品质的斗篷是在阿尔瓦上制作的，通常穿著者会是阿尔瓦商人公会中较为富有的成员。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:126
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:128
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Necromancer Cloak"
msgstr "死灵法师斗篷"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:126
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:128
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Clearly a cloak made for a practitioner of the dark arts. This fine cloak is worked with arcane designs embroidered in darkened silver thread."
msgstr "很明显是这套斗篷是专门制作给黑暗类别的魔法使用者所穿着的。这件作工精细的斗篷上还有用银线所绣上的魔法符号。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:127
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:129
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Vampire Cloak"
msgstr "吸血鬼斗篷"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:127
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:129
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This high collared, jet black cloak of wyvern leather is lined in red velvet--a style much favored by the elder vampires of Shadowspire."
msgstr "这件高领，深黑色的斗篷是用双足翼龙的皮所制作的，同时还有红色的天鹅绒作边衬：这种风格是阴影塔地区的古老吸血鬼们特别喜爱的走向。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:128
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:130
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Leather Gloves"
msgstr "皮手套"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:128
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:130
msgctxt "items"
msgid "These gloves of poorly cured leather are worn by workmen everywhere."
msgstr "这种粗陋的皮手套是各地的工人十分爱用的配件之一。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:129
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:131
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Troll Gauntlets"
msgstr "巨魔铁手套"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:129
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:131
msgctxt "items"
msgid "These leather gloves of Trollish make are studded with iron spikes at the knuckles."
msgstr "这种由巨魔所制作的皮手套在指节的部分还搭配有钢铁的尖刺。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:130
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:132
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Made of hinged plates of steel, these gauntlets offer good protection, but have a tendency to pinch."
msgstr "这种铁手套是由钢板所结合而成的，虽然防护力很好，但戴起来不太舒服。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:131
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:133
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Minotaur Gauntlets"
msgstr "牛头人铁手套"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:131
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:133
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Siertal-alloy makes these gauntlets light and tough. Superior workmanship make them comfortable and flexible."
msgstr "席尔多合金让这些铁手套不只质轻，更十分的坚韧。超人一等的作工让它们成为舒适又有弹性的装备。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:132
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:134
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crusader's Gauntlets"
msgstr "十字军铁手套"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:132
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:134
msgctxt "items"
msgid "These gauntlets are master crafted from pure erudine marking them as the product of Derrick Goreth's White Light Forgeworks."
msgstr "这些铁手套是由纯粹的依鲁丁金属所打造的，只有白光熔炉的德瑞克能够打造的出来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:133
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:135
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Walking Boots"
msgstr "行路靴"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:133
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:135
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Built more for comfort than combat, these boots of soft leather offer good protection from mud and sharp stones, but are not meant to turn weapon blows."
msgstr "这些软皮靴是用来平日穿着的，能够有效的保护穿戴者不受泥巴和尖锐石头的伤害，但对于武器的攻击就没有多大的防御力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:134
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:136
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hardened Leather Boots"
msgstr "硬皮靴"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:134
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:136
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The leather of these boots has been stiffened for greater protection. They are thick soled and lined with a thin layer of softer leather."
msgstr "这些靴子的皮革经过硬化处理，可以提供较大的防御力。为了方便行动，它们还搭配了较软的皮革来一起制作。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:135
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:137
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Regnan Boots"
msgstr "雷格那之靴"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:135
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:137
msgctxt "items"
msgid "These steel capped boots are commonly worn by Regnan warriors. The leather parts are treated to make them waterproof."
msgstr "这些套上钢铁的靴子是雷格那战士的标准配备。皮革的部分也经过特殊的处理，让它们成为防水的装备。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:136
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:138
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Alvarian Boots"
msgstr "阿尔瓦之靴"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:136
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:138
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Made by the Alvarian Elves, these boots are internally reinforced by bands of siertal-alloy. Their soles are softer than most boots making them quieter stepping."
msgstr "这些靴子是由阿尔瓦的精灵所制作的，内部有席尔多合金的板条作为强化之用。鞋跟的部分则是比其它的靴子都要来得软，所发出的声音也因此比较低。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:137
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:139
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragonning Boots"
msgstr "猎龙靴"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:137
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:139
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragon hunters require unusually hardy protective gear, their boots not excepting. These boots are constructed with erudine-alloy shells lined with wyvern leather."
msgstr "猎龙人必须拥有超坚硬的护具才行，靴子当然也不例外。这些靴子是由依鲁丁合金外面包覆双足翼龙皮所制造出来的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:138
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:140
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Bronze Ring"
msgstr "青铜戒指"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:138
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:140
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A simple bauble of very little value."
msgstr "一个没有多大价值的装饰品。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:139
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:141
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Gold Ring"
msgstr "金戒指"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:139
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:141
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A ring of soft gold rendered with half-hearted craftsmanship as a means of conveniently carrying a small amount of wealth."
msgstr "一个由软质黄金所打造的戒指，作工看来有些漫不经心，似乎主要的目的就只是为了随身携带部分的财富。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:140
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:142
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A silver ring set with a good quality pearl."
msgstr "一个镶嵌有品质不错珍珠的银戒指。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:141
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:143
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Gemstone Ring"
msgstr "宝石戒指"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:141
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:143
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This gold ring is decorated with a variety of tiny gems giving it a multicolored sparkle."
msgstr "这款镶嵌有多彩宝石的黄金戒指散发出非常炫丽的颜色。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:142
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:144
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Amethyst Ring"
msgstr "紫晶戒指"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:142
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:144
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A ring set with three amethysts. The largest is an excellent stone - richly and evenly purple with a perfect cut."
msgstr "这个戒指上面镶嵌有三颗紫水晶。最大的那一颗是个几近完美的子水晶，深邃的紫色结合了完美的作工。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:143
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:145
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Necromatic Ring"
msgstr "死灵戒指"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:143
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:145
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Though made of semi-precious silver, this ring is highly valuable because it is well suited to holding enchantments of medium power."
msgstr "这个戒指是由高贵的银所打造的，但真正的价值还是在于它可以收纳威力中等的魔法咒语在其中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:144
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:146
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ruby Ring"
msgstr "红宝石戒指"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:144
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:146
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This simply elegant ring is set with a single, oval ruby of high quality - pigeon blood red, perfectly cut and clear of imperfections."
msgstr "这个简单又高雅的戒指上面镶嵌有一枚鹅蛋大的的红宝石，切割精准，没有任何的缺陷。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:145
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:147
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Vampire's Ring"
msgstr "吸血鬼戒指"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:145
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:147
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Worn only by elder Vampires of great power, it is said that a part of their life force is invested in the ring's creation. This would certainly explain their ability to hold powerful enchantments."
msgstr "这种戒指只有拥有强大力量的吸血鬼才有资格配戴，据说它们在创造这种戒指的时候将自己的生命力跟着融入其中。这自然解释了这种戒指能够吸纳强大魔法的特性。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:146
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:148
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sun Opal Ring"
msgstr "太阳白石戒指"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:146
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:148
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sun opals shine with a mild inner light. They are extremely rare and coveted by elemental magicians."
msgstr "太阳蛋白石闪烁着微弱的光芒。这种宝石的数量不只稀少，更是元素系魔法师最钟爱的魔法物品。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:147
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:149
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Focal Ring"
msgstr "焦点戒指"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:147
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:149
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The \"stone\" of this platinum ring is actually a tiny interplanar portal which draws power from realms beyond. The strength limit of the enchantments such rings can hold is the skill and knowledge of the enchanter."
msgstr "这个白金戒指上的“宝石”实际上是一个微小的星际传送门，它从其他空间中汲取力量。这种戒指的威力仅受到持有者本身的技术和知识的限制。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:148
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:150
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Brass Charm"
msgstr "青铜护身符"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:148
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:150
msgctxt "items"
msgid "These stamp formed and lacquered baubles are cheap trinkets sold to pilgrims as keepsake mementos."
msgstr "这些看起来很便宜的护身符是专门卖给不识货观光客的纪念品。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:149
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:151
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Jade Amulet"
msgstr "翠玉护身符"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:149
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:151
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A large polished jade stone decorates and adds value to this simple amulet."
msgstr "一个巨大的，经过打磨的翠玉让这个护身符价值更为增加。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:150
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:152
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Blood Talisman"
msgstr "血脂护身符"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:150
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:152
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Made by necromancers to hold dark magics, other sorcerers have recognized their worth for other uses."
msgstr "这是由死灵法师制作来容纳邪恶魔法用的容器，但其它的法师则看出了不同的用途。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:151
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:153
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Shadow Sect Medallion"
msgstr "阴影教派护身符"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:151
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:153
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Formed in white and yellow gold, inlaid with jade, and studded with peridots, these amulets are worn by members of the secret Shadow Sect hidden beneath their clothing."
msgstr "这个护身符结合了白色和黄色的黄金，内部包覆了翠玉，和橄榄石。这是神秘的暗影教派成员所配戴的特殊物品，平常都是隐藏在衣物之下。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:152
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:154
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Locus Amulet"
msgstr "轨迹护身符"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:152
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:154
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The pinnacle of artificer tradecraft, these amulets wrought in platinum and set with a perfect sapphire can contain enchantments of nearly unimaginable potency."
msgstr "这是宝石工匠最自豪的完美产品。以白金打造的护身符结合上蓝宝石的特质，可以吸纳几乎毫无上限的魔法力量。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:153
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:155
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Witch's Wand of Fire"
msgstr "女巫火焰之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:153
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:154
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:155
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:156
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:157
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:155
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:156
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:157
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:158
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:159
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The primitive materials of this wand is infused with dark spiritual energy. To use this wand, you must equip it as though you were equipping a weapon."
msgstr "这柄魔杖所使用的原料虽然原始，但却结合了黑暗灵魂的强大能源。要使用这柄魔杖，您必须将它像是武器一样的装备起来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:154
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:156
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Witch's Wand of Sparks"
msgstr "女巫火花之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:155
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:157
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Witch's Wand of Poison"
msgstr "女巫剧毒之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:156
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:158
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Witch's Wand of Stunning"
msgstr "女巫震撼之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:157
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:159
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Witch's Wand of Harming"
msgstr "女巫伤害之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:158
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:160
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Shaman's Wand of Light"
msgstr "萨满光之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:158
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:159
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:160
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:161
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:162
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:160
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:161
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:162
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:163
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:164
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Something rattles ominously within the gog skull topping this wand - product of Ogre mage magic. To use it, you must equip it like a weapon."
msgstr "在这柄魔杖顶端的哥魔骷髅中似乎有什么东西在不停的跃动：这是食人妖法师魔法的结晶。要使用这柄魔杖，您必须将它像是武器一样的装备起来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:159
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:161
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Shaman's Wand of Ice"
msgstr "萨满冰之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:160
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:162
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Shaman's Wand of Lashing"
msgstr "萨满鞭笞之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:161
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:163
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Shaman's Wand of Mind"
msgstr "萨满心灵之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:162
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:164
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Shaman's Wand of Swarms"
msgstr "萨满虫群之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:163
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:165
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wizard Wand of Fireballs"
msgstr "巫师火球之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:163
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:164
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:165
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:166
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:167
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:165
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:166
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:167
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:168
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:169
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A wand of highly polished thornbark wrapped with platinum wire. To use it, you must equip it like a weapon."
msgstr "这柄魔杖是由打磨过的刺木所制作，绑上白金线所完成的。要使用这柄魔杖，您必须将它像是武器一样的装备起来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:164
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:166
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wizard Wand of Acid"
msgstr "巫师强酸之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:165
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:167
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wizard Wand of Lightning"
msgstr "巫师闪电之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:166
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:168
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wizard Wand of Blades"
msgstr "巫师刀锋之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:167
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:169
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wizard Wand of Berzerking"
msgstr "巫师狂暴之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:168
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:170
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Serpent Wand of Blasting"
msgstr "盘蛇爆炸之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:168
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:169
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:170
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:171
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:172
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:170
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:171
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:172
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:173
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:174
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Made from the braided bodies of three snakes, this wand pulses like a slow heartbeat. To use it you must equip it like a weapon."
msgstr "这柄魔杖由三条蛇的身体纠缠在一起所结合而成，持有者可以感觉到整柄魔杖仿佛在手中缓缓的跃动。要使用这柄魔杖，您必须将它像是武器一样的装备起来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:169
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:171
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Serpent Wand of the Fist"
msgstr "盘蛇猛拳之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:170
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:172
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Serpent Wand of Rocks"
msgstr "盘蛇岩石之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:171
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:173
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Serpent Wand of Paralysis"
msgstr "盘蛇瘫痪之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:173
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:175
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Necrotic Wand of Implosion"
msgstr "死灵内爆之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:173
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:174
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:175
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:176
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:177
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:175
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:176
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:177
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:178
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:179
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A unicorn horn capped with a gold set ruby and crowned with a sculpted skull, this wand could only be the creation of the Necromancers' Guild. To use it you must equip it like a weapon."
msgstr "这柄魔杖是由独角兽的角加上一枚嵌在黄金台座中的红宝石，以及雕刻出来的骷髅所制作而成的。很明显的是那死灵法师公会的杰作。要使用这柄魔杖，您必须将它像是武器一样的装备起来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:174
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:176
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Necrotic Wand of Distortion"
msgstr "死灵干扰之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:175
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:177
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Necrotic Wand of Shrapnel"
msgstr "死灵锐金之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:176
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:178
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Necrotic Wand of Shrinking"
msgstr "死灵缩小之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:177
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:179
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Necrotic Wand of Incineration"
msgstr "死灵炙焰之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:178
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:180
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Zircon"
msgstr "风信子玉"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:180
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:181
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:182
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:183
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:184
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:185
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:186
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:187
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:188
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:189
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A gem quality stone. It has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一枚宝石，它没有任何的魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:179
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:181
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Iolite"
msgstr "珠玉"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:180
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:182
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Citrine"
msgstr "黄水晶"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:201
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:203
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An ingredient with alchemical properties, widowsweep berries can be used to mix red potions. (To use, pick it up and right-click over an empty potion bottle.)"
msgstr "这是种拥有独特魔力的魔法药材。柳条浆果可以用来制造红色药剂。（要制造药剂，请拿起草药/试剂，然后右键单击一空药剂瓶）"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:202
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:204
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wolf's Eye"
msgstr "狼之眼"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:202
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:204
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An ingredient with alchemical properties, wolf eyes can be used to mix red potions. (To use, pick it up and right-click over an empty potion bottle.)"
msgstr "这是种拥有独特魔力的魔法药材。狼之眼可以用来制造红色药剂。（要制造药剂，请拿起草药/试剂，然后右键单击一空药剂瓶）"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:203
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:205
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Phial of Gog Blood"
msgstr "哥魔血"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:203
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:205
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An ingredient with alchemical properties, gog blood can be used to mix red potions. (To use, pick it up and right-click over an empty potion bottle.)"
msgstr "这是种拥有独特魔力的魔法药材。哥魔血可以用来制造红色药剂。（要制造药剂，请拿起草药/试剂，然后右键单击一空药剂瓶）"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:204
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:206
