msgid "You can mix catalysts with other potions to affect their strength. Mix a potion with a catalyst and the potion will take on the strength of the catalyst. (To mix two potions, pick up one and right-click it over the other.) "
msgstr "触媒是用来和药剂的主要成分混和，用来加强它们的力量。药剂将会吸收触媒的力量。小心不要将强烈的药剂和较弱的触媒混和在一起！（要混和药剂，请拿起药剂，然后右键单击另一瓶药剂）"

