msgstr "永久增加50点精确值。（要饮用这瓶药剂，请拿起药剂，然后右键单击角色小头像，或左键单击全身像。要混和药剂，请拿起药剂，然后右键单击另一瓶药剂）"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:271
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:273
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Adds 50 to permanent Might.  (To drink, pick the potion up and right-click over a character's portrait.  To mix, pick the potion up and right-click over another potion.)"
msgstr "永久增加50点力量值。（要饮用这瓶药剂，请拿起药剂，然后右键单击角色小头像，或左键单击全身像。要混和药剂，请拿起药剂，然后右键单击另一瓶药剂）"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:272
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:274
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Removes all unnatural aging.  (To drink, pick the potion up and right-click over a character's portrait.  To mix, pick the potion up and right-click over another potion.)"
msgstr "消除所有非自然的老化。（要饮用这瓶药剂，请拿起药剂，然后右键单击角色小头像，或左键单击全身像。要混和药剂，请拿起药剂，然后右键单击另一瓶药剂）"

