#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:501
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:503
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elsenrail"
msgstr "光剑爱森瑞尔"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:501
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:503
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Accuracy +40, 10-20 points of Light damage) The Forge of Chaos was destroyed in the making of the Swords of Balance. Legend says the Blade of Light, Elsenrail, and the Blade of Dark, Glomenthal, will play major roles in the last act of the universe."
msgstr "（精确+40，附加10-20点光明系伤害）混沌熔炉在铸造平衡之剑的过程中已经被摧毁了。根据传说，光明之剑爱森瑞尔和黑暗之剑葛罗曼沙将会在宇宙历史最终章的时候扮演重要的角色。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:502
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:504
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Glomenthal"
msgstr "暗之剑葛罗曼沙"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:502
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:504
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Might +40, 10-20 points of Dark damage) The Forge of Chaos was destroyed in the making of the Swords of Balance. Legend says the Blade of Light, Elsenrail, and the Blade of Dark, Glomenthal, will play major roles in the last act of the universe."
msgstr "（力量+40，附加10-20点暗黑系伤害）混沌熔炉在铸造平衡之剑的过程中已经被摧毁了。根据传说，光明之剑爱森瑞尔和黑暗之剑葛罗曼沙将会在宇宙历史最终章的时候扮演重要的角色。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:503
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:505
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Terminus"
msgstr "特敏那斯圣剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:503
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:505
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Armsmaster skill +7, Air Resistance +30) As a child, before he carved his barbarian kingdom in Vori, Lars Eilief found this sword deep in an ice cave. When he died, it was set adrift with him on his funeral barge. How it ended up in Jadame is a mystery."
msgstr "（武器使用术+7，风系抗性+30）在拉斯·爱力夫创建他的沃里蛮人王国之前，他在孩提时于一座冰封洞窟的深处找到了这柄剑。当他死掉的时候，这柄剑被放在他的葬礼船上和他的尸体一起随波逐流。这柄剑最后怎么会出现在贾丹姆大陆上实在让人费解。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:504
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:506
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Judicious Measure"
msgstr "拓土之剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:504
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:506
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Endurance +40, Luck +40, Ogre Slaying) Before there was a Regnan Empire, the ancestors of the Trolls of Ironsand lived on Regna Island. With this blade and a horde of sea raiders, Hareck I ousted the Trolls and formed his pirate nation."
msgstr "（耐力+40，运气+40，屠食人妖类属性）在雷格那帝国建立以前，铁沙漠的巨魔们居住在雷格那岛上。靠着这柄剑和一群骁勇善战的海盗，海里克一世驱逐了所有的巨魔，并且建立了他的海盗帝国。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:505
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:507
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elderaxe"
msgstr "长者之斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:505
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:507
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Might +20, Swift, 6-12 points of Cold damage, Minotaur) When the Dark Dwarves carved the first Minotaur labyrinth into the heart of Mt. Ashenbane they forged this axe for Xaxius, the first herdmaster."
msgstr "（力量+20，迅捷类属性，附加6-12点冰系伤害，牛头人装备）当黑暗矮人在爱审班山脉深处建造了第一个牛头人迷宫的时候，他们也替萨沙恶斯打造了这柄武器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:506
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:508
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Volcano"
msgstr "火山之斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:506
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:508
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(10-20 points of Fire damage, Fire Resistance +40) The mad artificer, Cornelius of Blackshire, built this axe for the purpose of clearing the trees around his country estate. \"A single blow will both fell a tree and render it into firewood!\" he was heard to exclaim. That he was soon found slain and the axe gone missing is proof that someone saw a better use for the tool."
msgstr "（附加10-20点火系伤害，火系抗性+40）黑岸的可努力雅司，也是大家所熟知的疯狂神器师；他铸造这柄斧头的原因只是为了清除住家附近的所有树木。“只要砍一下，不只可以把树砍倒，更可以将它们变成柴火！”据说有人曾经听到他这样说。稍后，他被人发现死在森林里面，这柄斧头也跟着消失不见。很明显的，有人找到了这柄斧头更好的用途。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:507
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:509
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wyrm Spitter"
msgstr "飞龙喷矛"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:507
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:509
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Endurance +20, Dragon Slaying, Swift) Arguably the best dragon hunter of all times, Sir Ryan Smedly carried this mighty spear with him on all his expeditions, claiming that with it in hand, he could best any dragon in single combat. This proved true, but nevertheless he was slain by no less than a dozen dragons who ambushed him at Shadowmarsh Pass."
msgstr "（耐力+20，屠龙类、迅捷类属性）莱恩·史麦力爵士可能是史上最强的猎龙人。据说他在任何时候都会携带着这柄力量强大的长矛，宣称只要有了这柄武器，他可以单打独斗的胜过任何的飞龙。他并没有夸大其词，但是，他最后遭到十几只的飞龙围攻，死在阴影隘口。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:508
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:510
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Guardian"
msgstr "守卫之矛"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:508
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:510
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(+10 to all attributes, 10-20 points of Body damage) The great Vampire, Korbu was known to use living men to guard his crypt during daylight hours. Compelled by a spell of enslavement, these sorry souls would walk their rounds carrying these mighty halberds. When Korbu mysteriously vanished, and the slave spell failed, a few of these weapons appeared in the larger world."
msgstr "（所有属性+10，附加10-20点体系伤害）伟大的吸血鬼可布据说曾经以活人来在白天的时候看顾他的墓穴。这些可悲的灵魂受到法术的操弄，会毫无意识的拿着这威力强大的长戟在墓穴附近走动。当可布神秘的失踪之后，有些奴隶恢复了神智，把这些武器带进了贾丹姆大陆上。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:509
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:511
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Foulfang"
msgstr "恶牙匕"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:509
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:511
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Vampiric, 10 points of Poison damage, Vampire) At the conclusion of the Vampires' War of the Chalice, Korbu exacted horrific retribution on his defeated enemy, Calden Fain. It is better for the world that knowledge of the necromantic arts which rendered Fain--body and soul--into this living blade, is lost."
msgstr "（吸血类属性，附加10点毒系伤害，吸血鬼专用）在吸血鬼的圣杯之战结束时，可布将它的敌手卡登·费恩施以永不超生的魔咒。幸好，有关于如何将费恩的身体与灵魂永远禁锢入这柄武器中的魔法已经永远的失传了，不会有人再拿它来执行残酷的刑罚。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:510
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:512
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Scepter of Kings"
msgstr "众王令牌"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:510
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:512
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Personality + 40, Regenerate Hit Points) Uri Hossana, King of the Western Elves, also called \"The Drunken King,\" was deposed the day he carelessly misplaced his scepter of office while on a hunting trip. This proved to be the last blunder of an incapable ruler. His advisors relieved him of his crown and left him to fend for himself in the Howling Marsh. He was never seen again."
msgstr "（个性+40，逐渐恢复生命值）乌力·何沙纳，也是西方精灵之王，另一个称号则是“喝醉的国王”，在他于狩猎的时候弄丢了象征地位与权力的令牌之后，终于被放逐了。这也是这位无能的领导者最后一次的错误。他的顾问拿下了他的皇冠，并且让他在尖啸森林中自生自灭。从此之后再也没有人见过他。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:511
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:513
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Breaker"
msgstr "破坏之棒"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:511
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:513
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Might +20, Endurance +20, 10-20 points of Body damage) Trollish folklore is full of the fables of Sevenstrong Burlfist who with Biter, his faithful wolf companion, and his mighty club, Breaker, endlessly quested for the Silver Rose. Fables? One must wonder, if Breaker exists, then why not too, the Silver Rose?"
msgstr "（力量+20，耐力+20，附加10-20点体系伤害）在巨魔的传说中常常会提到一名英雄和他的忠实恶狼伴侣一起寻找银玫瑰的故事。传说？如果破坏之棒存在的话，那么银玫瑰也应该存在咯？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:512
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:514
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Staff of the Swamp"
msgstr "沼泽之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:512
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:514
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(of Shielding; Immune to disease, paralysis, and poison) Nemerit, an otherwise unremarkable witch of the last era, was renown for her staff artificing skill. She created a staff for every conceivable use. It is said she carried this staff on reagent collecting trips into the swamplands."
msgstr "（护盾类属性，对疾病、麻痹、剧毒免疫）一个没有什么特色的女巫妮茉莉却因她擅长对手杖注入魔力而出名。她制造了各种各样功能的手杖。据说她会携带这柄手杖进入沼泽之地搜集药材。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:513
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:515
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Longseeker"
msgstr "百步穿杨弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:513
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:515
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Accuracy +50, Swift, Bow skill +4) Legends tell of many great archer heroes, but none greater than Brennan Morland of whom it was said once pierced a gold sovereign at 300 paces in an archery tournament. Now, holding his bow you must wonder if the legend owes more to the bow than the man."
msgstr "（精确+50点，迅捷类属性，弓箭技能+4）传说中有许多伟大的弓箭手英雄，但没有人比布伦南·莫兰更伟大，据说他在一次射箭比赛中在三百步外射中了一枚金币。现在，握着他的弓，你一定会想，这个传说是否更多归功于弓而不是他本人。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:514
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:516
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Serendine's Preservation"
msgstr "塞兰登之救赎"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:514
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:516
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Regenerates Spell Points, Endurance +30) A mage known as much for frailty of body as for magical prowess, Serendine of Freehaven built this armor to make the most of his strengths and the least of his weaknesses."
msgstr "（逐渐恢复魔法值，耐力+30）法师知道自己的优点是在魔法，体魄上面就不是他们的长处。自由海文的色兰登制造了这个盔甲就是要善用自己的长处，补足自己的短绌。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:515
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:517
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Glomenmail"
msgstr "葛蓝门锁甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:515
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:517
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(+10 to all statistics, +10 to all resistances, Dark Elf) Dark and Light Elven dealings have been peaceable, if uneasy, for centuries. Before that there was nothing but war. Few suits of this Dark Elven war armor have survived the ravages of time. Those that have are understandably, coveted."
msgstr "（所有属性+10，所有抗性+10，黑暗精灵专用）黑暗和光明精灵之间的关系虽然有些紧张，却也和平的延续了好几个世纪。在那个之前双方都只有决一死战的恶劣关系。黑暗精灵的这种护甲只有极少数逃过了岁月的侵蚀，其它的都已经被打造变卖成更有用处的工具了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:516
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:518
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Supreme Plate"
msgstr "超凡钢甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:516
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:518
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Swift, +15 Speed, +15 Accuracy, Knight) Each grandmaster of the Blackshire Armorers' Guild creates a masterpiece suit of plate as proof of his right to hold his station. It is not unusual for a guild member to spend ten to twenty years in the creation of one of these suits."
msgstr "（迅捷类属性，速度+15，精确+15，骑士专用）黑岸盔甲公会的大师每个人都会打造一件足以代表他的实力和地位的盔假。公会的成员常常会花费十到二十年的时间只为了打造出这样一件盔甲来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:517
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:519
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Eclipse"
msgstr "日蚀之盾"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:517
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:519
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: (of Spirit, of Body, of Mind, Cleric) When the First Temple of the Sun was burned in the War of Dove and Crow fought between the Sun and Moon temples, the holy altar was melted. The altar's metal was later collected and incorporated into this shield carried by Sun Priest Derico during his final deciding campaign of the war."
msgstr "任务物品：（魂、心、体属性，牧师专用）当第一座太阳神庙在太阳与月亮教派斗争的鸽鸦之战中遭到烧毁时，神圣的祭坛也被容画了。这座祭坛的金属稍后被收集起来，重新打造成一具盾牌，成为太阳主教德瑞可面对最后战争时的最强护具。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:518
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:520
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Fleetfingers"
msgstr "空空手套"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:518
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:520
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(+8 to Disarm Trap, Bow, and Armsmaster skills) That she would actually have a name for her gloves, is evidence of the flamboyant, if deserved, conceit of Darcie Darby--most widely known for her theft of the bejeweled Rod of Right, part of the royal regalia of Enroth."
msgstr "（陷阱拆卸术、弓箭、武器使用术+8）达丝·德比的手套现在都以她的名字来命名，可见她拥有不小的实力。她最为人所称道的事迹就是偷走镶满珠宝的恩洛斯皇家统治令牌。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:519
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:521
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Herald's Boots"
msgstr "前锋之靴"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:519
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:521
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Speed + 30, Swift, Immunity to Sleep) When Jerico Ironfist secured the throne in the First War of Enrothian Succession, he sent forth heralds to spread the news. They were given pairs of these boots so the news would be spread quickly and thus soonest end widespread civil unrest."
msgstr "（速度+30，迅捷类属性，对睡眠效果免疫）当杰瑞可·艾恩法斯特在第一次的恩洛斯王位继承之战后获得了王位之后，他派出信差们到各地去散播这个消息。每一名信差都获得了这双靴子，以便让他们能够以最快的速度散播消息，终止大众和整个王国的不安。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:520
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:522
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ring of Planes"
msgstr "空间之戒"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:520
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:522
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(+40 to Fire, Earth, Water and Air resistances) When the cartographer Alvia Morrania went to chart the terrain of the elemental planes she went well prepared. This ring of general protection was among the many special items commissioned by the Enrothian courts in support of her expedition."
msgstr "（火系、土系、水系、风系抗性+40）当地理师爱维雅·摩蓝尼雅去绘制元素界的地形时，她的准备相当的充分。这个戒指是恩洛斯议会支持她探险所提供的许多道具之一。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:521
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:523
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Drogg's Helm"
msgstr "德格之盔"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:521
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:523
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Personality +15, Intellect +15, Regenerates Hit Points) In the history of the barbarian tribes of Vori, it is rare to find a long reigning chieftain. Rarer still is one who held his position through magic rather than might. Drogg was such--a warrior mage who survived many years of rival challenges. It is said that he wore his helmet, even in sleep. Now that you possess it, you understand why."
msgstr "（个性+15，智力+15，逐渐恢复生命值）在沃里的蛮人部族历史中，实在很难找到有哪一个酋长能够统治比较长的时间。通过魔法而非蛮力来保障自己的地位更是极为少见的事情。德拉格却就是这样的一名酋长。他是一名战士也是一名法师，在许多敌人的挑战下生存了下来。据说他即使在睡眠中都戴着这顶头盔。当你获得了这顶头盔之后，你很快了解了其中的原因。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:522
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:524
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crown of Final Dominion"
msgstr "制霸之盔"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:522
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:524
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Intellect +50, of Dark Magic, Lich) So named by its creator and only sovereign wearer, Mederon, the first and last Lich Emperor of Nighon. The everlasting dynasty he hoped to found lasted barely a dozen years. Mederon escaped the fate of his kingdom. It is said he still lives as a madman and searches the world for his lost crown."
msgstr "（智力+50，暗黑魔法类属性，巫妖专用）这个名字是由尼根的第一个，也是最后一任巫妖皇帝麦德隆所命名的。他希望能够永续存在的皇朝只存续了几十年。麦德隆自己则是逃过了如同王国一般毁灭的命运。据说他直到目前为止依旧疯狂地四处搜寻他失落的皇冠。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:523
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:525
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Archangel Wings"
msgstr "大天使之翼"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:523
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:525
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Feather Falling, Intellect + 30, All magic resistances + 10) When Angels fall from grace, they lose their wings. Since this is an event of extreme infrequency, angel wings are a very rare commodity. Archangel wings are almost never seen. When used as a material, they imbue the resulting item with fantastic powers."
msgstr "（凌空飞降效果，智力+30，所有魔法类别抗性+10）当天使堕落的时候，他们会失去那一双羽翼。由于这是极为少见的情形，天使羽翼也就成为非常珍贵的商品。大天使的羽翼几乎从未有人见过。结合羽翼的力量所创造出的物品将会获得极为强大的力量。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:524
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:526
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Snake"
msgstr "蛇剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:524
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:526
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Slows target, Water Resistance -50, Personality -15) The pommel of this sword is gruesomely butted by a shrunken medusa's head. Though greatly diminished, the medusa's power flows along Snake's blade and into its targets--a good design, but poorly implemented, for some of the negative energies flow into the sword's wielder as well."
msgstr "（降低敌人速度，水系防御-50，个性-15）这柄剑的剑锷部分是由一个缩小的蛇发女妖头所制成的。虽然尺寸变小了，但蛇发女妖的威力依旧通过蛇状的刀刃源源不绝的流入敌人的身体中。虽然这是个很好的点子，但是在实行上却有相当大的困难，因为某些负面的能源也会跟着流入持用者的体内。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:525
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:527
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Havoc"
msgstr "毁灭之剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:525
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:527
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Speed +70, Accuracy +70, Armor Class -20) Havoc's enchantment makes it able to readily defeat any target's defenses. Unfortunately, its aggressive spirit makes it indifferent to parrying movements."
msgstr "（速度+70，精确+70，防御等级-20）毁灭之剑的魔力让它可以轻易穿透任何敌人的防御，很不幸的，它积极主动的个性也让持有者防御的动作变得毫无意义。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:526
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:528
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Finality"
msgstr "最终之剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:526
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:528
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(10-20 points of Fire damage, Slow, Speed -20) When the arch assassin, Demetri Razen was finally brought to justice, it was found that his skin was granted unusual hardness by a permanent enchantment. Normal blades would not cut him, so Finality was forged to deliver the death blow sentenced by the Enrothian courts. "
msgstr "（附加10-20点火系伤害，迟缓大法效果，速度-20）当传说中的刺客迪米区·锐森被捕之后，众人发现他的皮肤被一个永久的魔法赋予了不同寻常的硬度。一般的刀剑无法刺穿他的身体，因此恩洛斯法庭铸造了这把最终之剑来执行他们的正义与律法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:527
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:529
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hell's Cleaver"
msgstr "地狱邪斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:527
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:529
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Might + 70, Accuracy +70, Personality -50, Intellect -50) So called because of its power to demonize its wielder, nevertheless, there are many who would willingly pay the price for the power offered by \"Hell's Cleaver.\""
msgstr "（力量+70，精确+70，个性-50，智力-50）地狱邪斧的称号其来有自，因为他能够让使用者彻底的恶魔化。当然，也有许多人心甘情愿地付出这样的代价，接受地狱邪斧所赋予他们的强大力量。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:528
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:530
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Spiritslayer"
msgstr "灵魂断碎矛"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:528
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:530
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Vampiric, Might +50, Luck -40) Many under the rule of Luthiner the Severe saw the existence of his spear Spiritslayer as proof of the existence of evil. The injuries caused by the spear go beyond the physical as Spiritslayer takes a strike as an opportunity to drink its target's very essence."
msgstr "（吸血类属性，力量+50，运气-40）许多在暴君路西那底下苟延残喘的人们都将这柄灵魂断碎矛当做他邪恶的象征。因为灵魂断碎矛所造成的伤害不只是物理性的，他还能够吸取目标的精髓，削弱对方的力量。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:529
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:531
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Trident of Rulership"
msgstr "统治三叉戟"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:529
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:531
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Water Breathing, +70 Water Resistance, -70 Fire Resistance) The Trident of Rulership was never meant to be on dry land, yet when the once mighty, ocean to ocean, Triton empire collapsed, many of its greatest artifacts including those of its royal treasure were looted and made their way to the surface."
msgstr "（水中呼吸效果，水系抗性+70，火系抗性-70）统治三叉戟本来就不是为了在陆地上使用的。但是当统治七海的崔顿帝国崩溃之后，许多他们所制造的宝物，包括了皇家宝库内的神兵利器通通都流通到市面上供人采买。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:530
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:532
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Blade of Mercy"
msgstr "慈悲之刃"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:530
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:532
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Might +40, 4-10 points Electrical damage, Accuracy -40, Necromancer) Though generally considered unfashionable among current necromantic customs, live sacrifice was once widely practiced. To reduce the cruelty inflicted on his victims, the Necromancer Ferredine the Merciful created a blade capable of bringing about a quicker and less suffered end."
msgstr "（力量+40，附加4-10点电系伤害，精确-40，死灵法师专用）虽然一般来说对目前的死灵法师已经不那么风行，但是活人献祭也曾经是相当流型的一股风潮。为了要降低倒霉的对象所感受到的痛苦，死灵法师慈悲费络丁创造了这个可以让猎物不要太过痛苦的刀刃。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:531
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:533
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Staff of Elements"
msgstr "元素之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:531
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:533
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(of Air Magic, of Fire Magic, of Water Magic, of Earth Magic, -40 Armor Class) By imposing upon its wielder a deepened state of concentration, the Staff of Elements increases his or her affinity with elemental magic to a profound degree. Of course, it is not always a good thing to have one's attention taken away from one's immediate concerns."
msgstr "（空气、火系、水系、土系魔法类属性，防御等级-40）元素之杖借着让持有者进入更深的沉思状态中，可以大幅增加他们的元素系魔法能力。当然，把人的注意力太过集中在另外一个方面，有时也会造成不好的影响。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:532
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:534
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Tournament Bow"
msgstr "争斗之弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:532
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:534
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Accuracy +100, Bow skill + 5, Armor Class -20) This bow was built to the specifications of the great Elven tournament archer, Terin Tourfeather. More concerned with fancy shooting than with the realities of the battlefield, the bow's detrimental effects were of no concern to Tourfeather--more workaday wielders should pay more heed."
msgstr "（精确+100，弓箭技能+5，防御等级-20）这把弓是专门打造给伟大的精灵射手，太林·土尔非勒索使用的。虽然这柄弓主要的目的在美观和装饰上，但这并不会让不用上战场的太林感到困扰。现在的人才比较需要担心这个问题。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:533
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:535
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lightning Crossbow"
msgstr "闪电十字弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:533
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:535
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Swift, Accuracy -50, Dark Elf) An ingenious combination of the mechanical and magical went into the creation of this self-cocking crossbow which launches its quarrels with incredible force. That the same launching force causes it to kick like a mule means only the most skilled can use it to any good effect."
msgstr "（迅捷类属性，精确-50，黑暗精灵专用）结合了魔法和机械装置的完美点子，这柄十字弓可以不停的自动以机器的力量卷动弓弦，快速的射出力量强大的箭矢。但这强大的后座力也造成只有最具有技巧的人才能够使用这具十字弓。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:534
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:536
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Last Stage Cuirass"
msgstr "结局皮甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:534
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:536
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Personality +80, Intellect +70, -30 Mind and Spirit resistances) The final stage of degeneration from their human form leaves a Lich completely soulless and thus immune to certain magics. Such liches often curse their personal items with vulnerabilities to these magics to dissuade others from using them."
msgstr "（个性+80，智力+70，心系和魂系抗性-30）从人类退化成巫妖的最后一个阶段让巫妖的灵魂完全消失，导致对某些魔法完全免疫。这些巫妖往往会诅咒某些自己所使用的物品，让其它的人无法使用这些宝物。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:535
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:537
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Herondale's Lost Shield"
msgstr "鹰谷失落之盾"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:535
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:537
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Immune to Fear, Stone, Paralysis, and Sleep; Personality -15, Luck -15) The great knight Gerrald Herondale abandoned this shield after it took the brunt of a dark and deadly curse. Though it still retained its great powers, the shield was also weighed down with malevolent energies."
msgstr "（对恐惧、石化、麻痹、睡眠免疫，个性-15，运气-15）加拉德·鹰谷是一名伟大的骑士，他在这面盾牌受到诅咒之后立即抛弃了这个宝物。虽然这个盾牌依旧拥有强大的力量，但同样的也受到更多诅咒的拖累。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:536
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:538
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ring of Fusion"
msgstr "融合之戒"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:536
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:538
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(of Water, Alchemy skill + 5, Intellect +40, Endurance -20) A lost relic of the Freehaven Alchemists' Guild, until its disappearance, this ring was the signet of the guildmaster. It was meant to be worn only during the mixing of the most powerful potions for it drew much energy from the user."
msgstr "（水系魔法属性，炼金术+5，智力+40，耐力-20）在这个戒指神秘失踪之前，他一直是自由海文炼金术士公会领袖的印玺。只有在进行最强大的药剂混合的时候才会配戴这个戒指，因为这会吸取使用者太多的力量。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:537
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:539
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lucky Hat"
msgstr "幸运之帽"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:537
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:539
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Luck + 90, Personality -50) The only reason someone would wear this hat is for the luck it conveys. It is the farthest thing from flattering!"
msgstr "（运气+90，个性-50）这可不是夸大其词！这个东西唯一值得配戴的原因是它所增加的运气属性！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:538
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:540
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Berserker Belt"
msgstr "狂暴腰带"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:538
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:540
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Might +100, Immune to Fear, Accuracy -30, Armor Class -15) An experiment of the Blackshire Artificers' Guild, this belt was designed to turn its wearer into the perfect warrior--mighty and fearless. No more were made when in field tests it became apparent that \"foolhardy\" and \"careless\" were not virtues of the perfect warrior."
msgstr "（力量+100，对恐惧免疫，精确-30，防御等级-15）这是黑岸物品创造师公会的一个实验品，这条腰带原本应该将配戴者变成一个完美的战士，力量强大，而且不会感到畏惧。但是，在没有经过战场实地实验的状况下，大家就意识到了“漫不经心”、“愚笨”并非是完美战士的美德。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:539
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:541
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Mace of the Sun"
msgstr "烈阳钉锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:539
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:541
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Though at first it appears to be the same type of mace carried by Sun Temple clerics everywhere, this item seems to thrum with conflicting energies."
msgstr "虽然一开始看起来这似乎是一般太阳教牧师所携带的钉锤，但其内部似乎有互相冲突的力量在彼此激荡着。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:540
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:542
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ebonest"
msgstr "黑木之矛"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:540
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:542
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: Charles Quixote's personal spear of Dragon slaying, Ebonest is a fine weapon indeed. When used against a Dragon, it seems to aim unerringly for the chinks between its target's tough scales."
msgstr "任务物品：这是查尔斯·吉轲德个人所携带的杀龙之矛，的确是柄相当不错的物品。当它用来对付飞龙的时候，看起来似乎会毫无错失的直接瞄准飞龙鳞甲之间的空隙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:541
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:543
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sword of Whistlebone"
msgstr "惠索朋之剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:541
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:543
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: That the Whistlebones would settle upon such a fierce weapon for their heirloom speaks much of their commitment to the family business of Dragon hunting."
msgstr "任务物品：惠索朋之剑会成为他们子孙继承的一柄武器自然是有原因的。可见他们一家人对于猎龙的这个工作是多么的热爱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:542
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:544
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Axe of Balthazar"
msgstr "巴尔萨煞之斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:542
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:544
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: No Minotaur kings wear a crown. Instead as their badge of office they carry great axes of the finest workmanship. This axe was lost when Balthazar was betrayed by the Vori Frost Giants. That it is strongly enchanted is clear; when used in battle its blows deliver both normal damage and impart a numbing bite of freezing cold."
msgstr "任务物品：牛头人的帝王从来不会配戴王冠。除了他们的徽章之外，他们会配戴作工极佳的巨大斧头。当巴尔萨煞遭到沃里的霜雪巨人背叛的时候，这柄斧头就跟着失踪了。旁人很明显的可以看出来这柄武器拥有强烈的力量，当挥舞这柄武器的时候，除了一般的伤害之外，它还会造成极度低温的伤害。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:543
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:545
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Noblebone Bow"
msgstr "魔骨之弓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:543
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:545
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Bows of Kreegan bone are highly sought after; the material is strong and takes enchantments easily. The most sought after bone comes from Kreegans of the devil race's former ruling class."
msgstr "克里根人的骨头是很多人梦寐以求的材料，因为他们不只强韧，更可以轻易的接受强烈的魔法。众人最想要的骨胳就是这些来自于克里根魔族统治阶层的骨胳。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:603
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:605
msgctxt "items"
msgid "False Report"
msgstr "假信"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:603
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:605
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Report"
msgstr "心"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:603
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:605
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: A letter given to you by Arion Hunter for delivery to the Dread Pirate Stanley on Regna."
msgstr "任务物品：这是艾瑞安·韩特交给你的信件，他要求你将信传递给雷格那岛上的的恐怖海盗史坦力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:604
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:606
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Urn of Ashes"
msgstr "骨灰坛"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:604
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:606
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Urn"
msgstr "坛"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:604
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:606
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: A funerary urn entrusted to your care by the Troll, Overdune Snapfinger. It contains the ashes of his brother, Vilebite."
msgstr "任务物品：这是巨魔欧瓦都·弹指交到你手上的骨灰坛。里面装的是他兄弟维尔拜的骨灰。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:605
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:607
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Nightshade Brazier"
msgstr "龙葵灯炉"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:605
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:607
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Brazier"
msgstr "炉"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:605
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:607
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: This brazier emanates the unsettling vibrancy of dark magic. It smells strongly of pitch and sulfur."
msgstr "任务物品：这个火炉里面脉动的是黑暗类魔法蠢蠢欲动的力量。闻起来有很浓的柏油和硫磺的味道。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:606
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:608
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragon Leader's Egg"
msgstr "飞龙领袖的蛋"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:606
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:608
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: This Dragon egg is nearly ready to hatch. The small life inside makes its presence known with an occasional rustle."
msgstr "任务物品：这枚龙蛋已经快要孵化了。里面的小生命不时地沙沙作响，让外面的人注意到它的存在。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:607
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:609
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Heart of Fire"
msgstr "火之心"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:607
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:608
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:609
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:610
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:609
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:610
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:611
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:612
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Heartstone"
msgstr "心之石"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:607
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:609
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: The Heart of Fire is a gem of pure elemental force clear of imperfections and weighing at least a hundred carets. No doubt, a magic item made from it would be incredibly potent."
msgstr "任务物品：火之心是枚拥有纯净元素之力、毫无瑕疵、重量超过一百克拉的宝石。毫无疑问，利用这个宝石所打造的魔法物品将会拥有极大的威力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:608
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:610
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Heart of Water"
msgstr "水之心"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:608
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:610
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: The Heart of Water is a gem of pure elemental force clear of imperfections and weighing at least a hundred carets. No doubt, a magic item made from it would be incredibly potent."
msgstr "任务物品：水之心是枚拥有纯净元素之力、毫无瑕疵、重量超过一百克拉的宝石。毫无疑问的，利用这个宝石所打造的魔法物品将会拥有极大的威力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:609
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:611
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Heart of Air"
msgstr "风之心"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:609
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:611
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: The Heart of Air is a gem of pure elemental force clear of imperfections and weighing at least a hundred carets. No doubt, a magic item made from it would be incredibly potent."
msgstr "任务物品：风之心是枚拥有纯净元素之力、毫无瑕疵、重量超过一百克拉的宝石。毫无疑问的，利用这个宝石所打造的魔法物品将会拥有极大的威力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:610
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:612
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Heart of Earth"
msgstr "地之心"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:610
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:612
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: The Heart of Earth is a gem of pure elemental force clear of imperfections and weighing at least a hundred carets. No doubt, a magic item made from it would be incredibly potent."
msgstr "任务物品：地之心是枚拥有纯净元素之力、毫无瑕疵、重量超过一百克拉的宝石。毫无疑问的，利用这个宝石所打造的魔法物品将会拥有极大的威力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:611
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:613
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Conflux Key"
msgstr "汇流之钥"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:611
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:613
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: Using the four elemental heart gems, Xanthor made you this interplaner key of extreme power. He tells you it will open the crystal gateway which connects Ravenshore to the mysterious Plane Between Planes."
msgstr "任务物品：利用四枚元素宝石，萨索尔制造了这个拥有极大力量的空间传送钥匙。他告诉你这将可以打开将渡鸦海滨与神秘的界间之地之间的水晶传送门。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:612
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:614
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lost Book of Kehl"
msgstr "失落的凯尔之书"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:612
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:627
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:653
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:614
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:629
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:655
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Book"
msgstr "书"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:612
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:614
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: The formerly \"Lost\" Book of Kehl. Some say he was the greatest necromancer of the last age. Staring at the intricately embossed cover is a disquieting experience as the design seems to writhe with evil energy."
msgstr "任务物品：这个是原先失落的凯尔之书。有些人说他是前一个世代最强的死灵法师。当您看着这本书的装饰华丽的封面时，似乎觉得那上面的设计和花纹在邪恶的能源笼罩之下开始缓缓的融化。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:613
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:615
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sarcophagus of Korbu"
msgstr "可布的石棺"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:613
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:615
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sarcophagus"
msgstr "石棺"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:613
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:615
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: Though painstakingly carved from a single slab of gray stone, Korbu's sarcophagus is inexplicably, much lighter in weight than seems possible. Removal of the snug fitting lid produces a powerful exhalation of myrrh and stale crypt air."
msgstr "任务物品：可布的石棺是利用一整块灰色的石板所雕刻出来的，但它的重量却出乎意料之外的轻，让人觉得几乎是件不可能的事情。当您打开了相当紧密的石棺盖之后，冲鼻而起的是一种墓穴里面凝滞、腐败的味道。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:614
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:616
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Puzzle Box"
msgstr "机关盒"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:614
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:616
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Box"
msgstr "盒子"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:614
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:616
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: No matter how you move the shifting panels of this small inlaid box, its lid remains shut. When you shake it, you can hear something rattling around inside. It sounds like a large nut or bead."
msgstr "任务物品：不管您怎么样移动这个小盒子上的花纹，盖子还是无法打开。当您摇动这盒子的时候，里面似乎有什么东西再晃动。这听起来像是某种较大的坚果或是弹珠在摇动。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:615
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:617
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Vial of Grave Earth"
msgstr "墓土之瓶"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:615
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:617
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Vial"
msgstr "瓶子"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:615
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:617
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: This is the vial of dirt you stole from the vampire crypt in Shadowspire."
msgstr "任务物品：这是您从阴影塔的吸血鬼墓窖中偷出来的一瓶土。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:616
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:618
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Drum of Victory"
msgstr "胜利之鼓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:616
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:618
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Drum"
msgstr "鼓"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:616
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:618
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: This magical items properties are unknown to you. When you tap the drum's head with one of its sticks, the resulting beat resonates with echoes that seem to reflect from the ceiling of the sky."
msgstr "任务物品：这个魔法物品的功用和特性你一无所知。当您利用一根鼓棒敲打鼓面的时候，回声似乎从天花板一路传递到天空去。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:617
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:619
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Anointed Herb Potion"
msgstr "神选之药剂"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:617
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:619
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: Though possessing no magical properties, this potion's ingredients have been gathered under the most stringent ritual conditions. The thornbark powder, for example, was ground in a silver mortar from bark stripped during the peak of a high noon eclipse. The whole concoction has sat in the seer's personal shrine for more than a hundred years."
msgstr "任务物品：虽然这个药剂并没有什么特殊的魔法能力，但它的所有药材都是在最严格的仪式下采摘的。举例来说，刺木灰就是在正午日蚀的时候利用刚摘下来的树皮磨碎而成的。整个药剂在先知的个人神坛里面已经有超过一百年的历史。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:618
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:619
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:620
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:621
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Power Stone"
msgstr "力之石"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:618
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:619
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:620
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:621
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Stone"
msgstr "石头"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:618
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:620
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: A facet carved stone of dark glassy rock. When tapped it produces a high bell tone."
msgstr "任务物品：一个黑色的光滑多面岩石，在敲打它的时候会发出较高的铃声。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:619
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:621
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: A facet carved stone of dark glassy rock. When tapped it produces a medium bell tone."
msgstr "任务物品：一个黑色的光滑多面岩石，在敲打它的时候会发出中等的铃声。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:620
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:622
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Pirate Leader's Key"
msgstr "海盗首领之钥"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:620
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:622
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: The key you took from Blackwell Cooper's body."
msgstr "任务物品：这是您从海盗首领身上所拿到的钥匙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:621
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:622
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:623
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:624
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Prison Key"
msgstr "监狱钥匙"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:621
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:622
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:623
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:624
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: A key of the type commonly used for dungeon cell door locks."
msgstr "任务物品：这一类的钥匙通常会被拿来用作地牢监狱的钥匙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:624
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:626
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Gem of Restoration"
msgstr "恢复宝石"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:624
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:626
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: This large ruby is of perfect quality, clear throughout with an even pigeon blood red. It contains a powerful enchantment and pulses with a slumbering heartbeat rhythm."
msgstr "任务物品：这个巨大的红宝石毫无瑕疵，显现出一种纯净的鸽血颜色。里面隐藏着一个强大的法术，让整个红宝石也跟着如同心脏一般的脉动。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:627
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:629
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Prophecies of the Sun"
msgstr "太阳预言"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:627
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:629
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: The writing inside this book reads like the ranting of a madman. Still, someone must have thought highly of it. The text is entirely hand scribed in a florid style. Inset illuminations bring to life scenes from the story which are, in turn, disturbing, outlandish or seemingly drawn from nightmare."
msgstr "任务物品：这本书里面的记载看起来像是疯子的呓语一般。但依旧有人很重视这本书。书的文字内容是利用一种相当流畅的文句和娟秀的字体所写成的。里面的插画也让整个仿佛从恶梦中描述出来的场景和奇特故事变得栩栩如生。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:628
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:630
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Remains of Korbu"
msgstr "可布的尸骸"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:628
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:630
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Remains"
msgstr "尸骸"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:628
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:630
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: The remains of Korbu who some claim was the most powerful vampire of all times. He's not much to look at now, however. His skeleton has been almost completely dismantled--either by design or the ravages of time, and a wooden stake is nestled entirely within the ribcage."
msgstr "任务物品：这是史上最伟大吸血鬼可布的骨骸。不过，他现在看起来可不怎么样。他的尸骨已经完全的被拆散了，这可能是岁月的蹂躏或是后人刻意的安排。它的胸骨上还牢牢的定着一根白木桩。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:631
msgctxt "items mm8"
msgid "Lich Jar"
msgstr "巫妖之瓶"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:629
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:631
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: A well made jar."
msgstr "任务物品：一个制作的相当好的瓶子。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:630
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:632
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ring of Keys"
msgstr "钥匙环"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:630
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:632
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: Both the keys and ring are made of a metal you've never encountered before. The gemstones inset in the key heads are familiar to you. They are elemental heartstones like those incorporated in the conflux key Xanthor made for you."
msgstr "任务物品：这柄钥匙和钥匙环都是用你以前从来没有看过的金属所制作的。镶嵌在钥匙上的宝石看起来相当的眼熟。它们原来就是萨索尔安装在汇流钥匙上的同类元素宝石。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:631
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:633
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Idol of the Snake"
msgstr "蛇之圣像"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:631
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:633
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Idol"
msgstr "圣像"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:631
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:633
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: An Idol of the ancient snake god who was worshipped by the Serpentmen who used to dwell on the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr "任务物品：古老的蛇神圣像是曾经居住在匕伤岛上的蛇人所膜拜的对象。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:632
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:634
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Big Brass Ring"
msgstr "巨型铜戒指"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:632
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:634
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: A large ring of polished brass. It seems to be part of a door knocker."
msgstr "任务物品：这是个打磨光亮的黄铜环，看起来似乎是个门环。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:633
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:635
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Naga Hide"
msgstr "蛇女皮"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:633
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:635
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "皮"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:633
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:635
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The skinned and scraped hide of a naga."
msgstr "剥下来，经过打磨的半蛇女的皮。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:634
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:636
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dire Wolf Pelt"
msgstr "猛狼皮"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:634
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:636
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Pelt"
msgstr "皮"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:634
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:636
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The skinned and scraped hide of a dire wolf."
msgstr "拨下来，经过打磨的猛狼皮。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:635
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:637
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: A well crafted instrument."
msgstr "任务物品：一个制作精巧的乐器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:636
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:638
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Royal Wasp Jelly"
msgstr "蜂王胶"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:636
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:638
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Jelly"
msgstr "胶状物"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:636
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:638
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A jar of royal wasp jelly."
msgstr "一瓶蜂王浆。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:637
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:639
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragonbane Flower"
msgstr "灭龙花"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:637
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:639
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: A fresh dragonbane flower. The petals are thick and waxy."
msgstr "任务物品：一朵新鲜的灭龙花，花瓣看起来又厚，又新鲜。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:638
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:640
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Bone of Doom"
msgstr "毁灭之骨"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:638
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:640
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: The arm bone of the legendary necromancer, Zacharia. It is infused with the death magician's evil energy."
msgstr "任务物品：这是传说中的死灵法师萨查力亚的臂骨。里面蕴含着这邪恶魔法师的黑暗力量。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:639
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:641
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Druid Circlet of Power"
msgstr "德鲁伊力量之环"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:639
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:641
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Circlet"
msgstr "皇冠"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:639
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:641
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A legendary item rumored to be from the time of the Ancients.  Only someone with the power of a Grand Druid can wear this item."
msgstr "传说中是古人时代所遗留下来的物品，只有拥有大德鲁伊教徒力量的人可以配戴它。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:640
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:642
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Arcane Key"
msgstr "魔法之钥"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:640
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:642
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:642
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:644
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: A gem containing an unfocused magical energy."
msgstr "任务物品：一枚拥有力量涣散魔法的宝石。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:641
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:643
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wyvern Horn"
msgstr "双足翼龙之角"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:641
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:643
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A horn taken from a wyvern."
msgstr "从双足翼龙身上夺下来的角。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:642
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:644
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ogre Key"
msgstr "巨魔之钥匙"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:643
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:645
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Pirate Hat"
msgstr "海盗帽"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:643
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:645
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: A sea raider captain's hat. Inside the band are stitched the words \"D. P. Stanley.\""
msgstr "任务物品：一个海盗船长的帽子。在帽环里面刻着“史坦力”的名字。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:644
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:646
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Tobersk Fruit"
msgstr "托伯斯克果"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:644
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:646
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Fruit"
msgstr "水果"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:644
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:646
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The fruit of the tobersk bush which only grows on the Dagger Wound Islands. It is the main export item of the islands' Lizardmen."
msgstr "托伯斯克树只有在匕伤岛上才会生长。这就是它的果子，也是岛上蜥蜴人的主要出口品。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:645
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:647
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Tobersk Pulp"
msgstr "托伯斯克果汁"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:645
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:647
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Pulp"
msgstr "果汁"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:645
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:647
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Pulp made from Dagger Wound Islands grown tobersk fruit."
msgstr "这是利用匕伤岛特产托伯斯克树所挤压出的果汁。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:646
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:648
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Tobersk Brandy"
msgstr "托伯斯克白兰地"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:646
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:648
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Brandy"
msgstr "白兰地"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:646
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:648
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Brandy made from the processed pulp of Dagger Wound Islands grown tobersk fruit."
msgstr "这是利用匕伤岛上托伯斯克果果汁所酿造成的白兰地。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:647
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:649
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Heartwood of Jadame"
msgstr "贾丹姆大陆心之木"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:647
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:649
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wood"
msgstr "木头"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:647
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:649
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The cooler climate of the Murmurwood forest causes the trees there to grow with a tight grain. These lumbered planks are of the clear grained heartwood."
msgstr "呓语森林较低温的天候让这里的树木生长的比较紧密，这些木板很明显的是从木心所制造出来的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:648
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:650
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Flawed Amulets"
msgstr "缺陷之护身符"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:648
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:650
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A crate of from the Shadowspire artificers. Small flaws in workmanship have made them incapable of holding enchantments."
msgstr "一箱从阴影谷神器打造师那边来的箱子。这箱物品在作工上细微的一些缺陷让它们无法接受任何的魔法力量。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:649
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:651
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dried Sunfish"
msgstr "风干翻车鱼"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:649
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:651
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A crate of dried sunfish harvested from the Ifarine Sea. Some find the chewy, salty fish a delicacy."
msgstr "这是一箱风干的、来自伊法力海中的翻车鱼。有些人认为这种腌渍的食物相当有嚼感。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:650
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:652
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Silver Dust of the Sea"
msgstr "海之银尘"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:650
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:652
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A crate full of bagged Silver Dust. Made by the Necromancers' Guild, it is said to have value to some sea travelers."
msgstr "装满一袋袋银尘的箱子。这是由死灵法师公会所制作出来的，据说对于某些海上旅行者来说有些用处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:651
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:653
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Forged Vouchers"
msgstr "伪造凭证"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:651
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:653
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Vouchers"
msgstr "凭证"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:651
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:653
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Forged credit documents used by the ogre mage Zog to embezzle gold from Alvarian merchant customers."
msgstr "这是食人妖法师索格伪造的金钱记录，好让它可以从阿尔瓦的商人顾客手中盗取金钱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:652
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:654
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ground Wyvern Horn"
msgstr "地面双足翼龙之角"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:652
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:654
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A powerful potion reagent used by the Necromancers of Shadowspire."
msgstr "这是阴影塔地区的死灵法师所爱用的一种强力药材。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:653
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:655
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Prophecies of the Snake"
msgstr "蛇之预言"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:653
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:655
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: One of many books of prophecy circulating recently, the Prophecies of the Snake may indeed tell the future of Jadame."
msgstr "任务物品：这是近来时常出现在各地的预言书，“蛇之预言”也许真的能够预测贾丹姆大陆的未来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:654
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:656
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ogre Ear"
msgstr "巨魔之耳"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:654
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:656
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ear"
msgstr "耳"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:654
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:656
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Used to keep track of kills, some bounty hunters collect these gruesome reminders of battles past."
msgstr "这是相当恶心的纪念品。有些赏金猎人收集这些恶心的东西来纪念过去的战斗。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:655
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:657
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wasp Stingers"
msgstr "黄蜂刺"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:655
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:657
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Stinger"
msgstr "刺"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:655
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:657
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The stinger of a giant wasp."
msgstr "巨大黄蜂的尾刺。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:656
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:658
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Green Apple"
msgstr "绿苹果"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:656
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:658
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Jadamean green apples are crunchy, slightly tart and a good source of nutrition.  (To use the apple, pick it up and left-click over a character's portrait in the inventory screen.)"
msgstr "贾丹姆大陆的苹果十分的翠嫩多汁，并且是营养的良好来源。（使用时请拿起苹果，然后右键单击角色小头像，或左键单击全身像）"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:659
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This flawless horseshoe is made of silver.  (To use, pick the horseshoe up and right-click over a character's portrait.)"
msgstr "这块马蹄铁由银制成，尽善尽美。（使用时请拿起马蹄铁，然后右键单击角色小头像，或左键单击全身像）"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:658
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:660
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Enchanted Amulet"
msgstr "附魔护身符"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:658
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:660
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A pretty bauble favored by the Pirates of Regna for it appearance, not for any magical enchantment it may have."
msgstr "这是雷格那海盗所喜欢的小珠宝，上面并没有任何的魔法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:659
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:801
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:661
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:803
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wheel of Frelandeau"
