#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:662
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: A log of Vori eldenbrie cheese. Though many have tried to duplicate its subtle, smoky flavor, only the master Frost Giant cheese masters of the frozen Vori wastes know the secrets of its formulation."
