#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Launcher.txt.py:7
msgctxt "launcher"
msgid "Your current video driver does not fully support alpha blending; please contact your hardware manufacturer for the latest driver(s).  Might and Magic VIII®: Day of the Destroyer must be run in software mode until the video drivers are updated."
msgstr "您当前的显卡驱动程序不完全支持阿尔法混合（alpha blending），请更新驱动程序，不然只能在软件加速模式下运行魔法门8：毁灭者之日。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Launcher.txt.py:8
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Launcher.txt.py:8
msgctxt "launcher"
msgid "Your current video card does not support non-square textures.  Might and Magic VIII®: Day of the Destroyer requires non-square textures and must therefore be run in software mode."
msgstr "当前的显卡不支持非正方形纹理（non-square textures），因此只能用软件加速模式运行魔法门8：毁灭者之日。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Launcher.txt.py:12
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Launcher.txt.py:12
msgctxt "launcher"
msgid "Your desktop settings must be set to High Color (16-bit) for Might and Magic VIII®: Day of the Destroyer to function in a window."
msgstr "如果您想在窗口模式下运行魔法门8：毁灭者之日，必须将桌面颜色设置成增强色（16位）。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Launcher.txt.py:13
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Launcher.txt.py:13
msgctxt "launcher"
msgid "WARNING: Might and Magic VIII®: Day of the Destroyer has detected that you have less than 8MB of Video Memory.  Your Video card supports the hardware features necessary to run Might and Magic VIII®: Day of the Destroyer but may not have enough memory to function properly.  If you have problems with operation or performance run Might and Magic®: Day of the destroyer in software mode."
msgstr "警告：魔法门8：毁灭者之日检测到您的显卡内存少于8MB。您的显卡支持运行魔法门8所需的硬件功能，但可能没有足够的内存来正常运行游戏。如果您在操作或性能方面遇到问题，请在软件加速模式下运行魔法门8。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/Launcher.txt.py:14
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/Launcher.txt.py:14
msgctxt "launcher"
msgid "WARNING: Might and Magic VIII®: Day of the Destroyer has detected that you have less than 4MB of Video Memory.  Your Video card supports the hardware features necessary to run Might and Magic VIII®: Day of the destroyer but may not have enough memory to function properly.  If you have problems with operation or performance run Might and Magic VIII®: Day of the Destroyer in software mode."
