#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:3
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:3
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If the pirates make it through our warriors we are certainly doomed!  "
msgstr "如果海盗穿过了我们战士的防御网，我们就真的完蛋了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:4
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:4
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Our thanks for defeating the pirates!  Now if you could only do something about the mountain of fire!"
msgstr "多谢你们击败了海盗！真希望你们可以对着火的山脉作些事情！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:5
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There is no way back to the village of Blood Drop!  I have no way of knowing if my family lives or not!"
msgstr "没有办法回到血滴镇去！我根本不知道自己的家人是死是活！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:6
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You came through the Portals of Stone?  They are working?  We can return to our families!"
msgstr "你刚穿过岩石传送门？他们可以运作？我们可以回去了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:7
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Argh!  Either get in the fight, or get out of our way!"
msgstr "啊！要嘛就是和我们打一场，要嘛就是滚开！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:8
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Someone should clear out the caves that the dire wolves use for their lair.  If we had one less thing to worry about, things might get a little better!"
msgstr "应该有人去把猛狼占据的洞穴清一清。只要能让我们有比较少的问题担心，一切应该都至少会好一点！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:9
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have heard rumors that the end of the world is near.  One look at that crystal in the center of town, and I am tempted to believe them!"
msgstr "我听说世界末日已经快到了。看看镇中央的水晶，我想我就忍不住要相信他们！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:10
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There was a pack of those vile wererats behind my house again last night.  Someone should do something about the vile little creatures. Between those vermin and the dire wolves it amazing that our children are safe!"
msgstr "昨天晚上又有一群鼠人出现在我家后面。应该有些人去处理这些死家伙。我们的小孩必须面对猛狼和这些鼠人，生活环境实在太差了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:11
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Please don't hurt us!  Arion Hunter says we are friends now!"
msgstr "别伤害我们！爱立安·韩特说我们现在是朋友了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:12
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We will be forever in your debt!  You have saved Ravenshore and all of Jadame!"
msgstr "我们永远欠你一笔，你救了渡鸦海滨和贾丹姆大陆！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:13
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Would you like to fire the cannons in defense of Dagger Wound Island?"
msgstr "你愿意发射大炮来保护匕伤岛吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:14
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Help us!  If we do not push the pirates off the island all will be lost!"
msgstr "帮帮我们！如果我们无法把海盗赶开，一切都会完蛋了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:15
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With the Pirate Outpost defeated our homes are once again safe!  Thank you!"
msgstr "在攻破了海盗前哨站之后，我们终于安全了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:16
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ogres have become more of a problem in our daily lives.  If someone were to deal with the Ogres in their fortress, maybe things would get better!"
msgstr "食人妖已经对我们造成了相当严重的威胁。如果有人可以处理要塞里面的食人妖，也许一切会变得好一些！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:17
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Warrior Wasps have built a large nest southeast of here.  They could become a threat to the city if the nest grows too large."
msgstr "兵蜂在这里东南方的地方有一个巨大的巢穴。如果蜂巢变得太大，可能会对这座城市造成相当大的威胁。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "News from the different regions of Jadame has been very slow in getting to Alvar.  I wonder if the merchants know what is going on in the world?"
msgstr "贾丹姆大陆其它区域的消息要到达阿尔瓦速度实在很慢。不知道商人们是否知道其它地方发生了什么事情？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:19
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The sea of fire has destroyed our village!  Who knows how long we can still live here."
msgstr "火海摧毁了我们的村庄！不知道我们还可以活多久！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:20
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With the destruction of the village, all we need now is a Cyclops raiding party to attack us!  Then our fate would be sealed and we would certainly perish!"
msgstr "在村庄被毁之后，我们竟然还又遇到了独眼巨人强盗，我们根本没有希望活下去了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:21
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A strange cave has opened north of the village.  It appeared shortly after the sea of fire devastated the village.  Strange creatures have been seen entering and leaving this cave.  I wonder what is inside it?"
msgstr "村庄的北边出现了一个奇怪的洞穴，是在火海吞没村庄之后才出现的，我们看到了许多奇怪的生物进入和离开这座洞穴。不知道里面有些什么东西？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:22
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Under Sir Charles Quixote's guidance we will rid this region of the threat of Dragons once and for all!"
msgstr "在查尔斯·吉科德爵士的率领之下，我们将会把此地的龙患彻底清除！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:23
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Nagas have become more and more of a problem while we are hunting.  It's not bad enough that we have to stay watchful for Dragons attacking us from the sky, now we have to worry about Nagas ranging out from their vault."
msgstr "在我们狩猎的时候，蛇人已经变成越来越大的问题，我们不只必须要提防天上降下来的飞龙，还必须要提防从地洞中钻出来的蛇人。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:24
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sir Charles Quixote sent us out to train under the guidance of Jeric Whistlebone.  Some day I hope to be as great a knight as he!"
msgstr "查尔斯·吉科德爵士派我们出来在惠索朋旗下受训，我希望有一天能够成为像他一样伟大的骑士。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:25
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There have been strange flashes of light from the north for many nights now.  Zanthora the Mad Necromancer is most certainly brewing up trouble for someone.  I certainly hope it is not for us of the Guild of Necromancers!"
msgstr "许多天以前北边出现过一怪异的光芒。疯狂死灵法师冉索拉一定又在计划些什么。我希望那是用来对付死灵法师公会，而不是我们的！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:26
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There was another vampire attack last night.  I wish we didn’t have to put up with them!  But the Guild of Necromancers has their alliance with the Nosferatu, and we cannot retaliate.  "
msgstr "昨天晚上又有一场吸血鬼的突袭，真希望我们能够报复。但是死灵法师公会又和吸血圣王有签订盟约，所以我们根本不能怎么样。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:27
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There has not been a battle with the Temple of the Sun in years.  I hope they are not planning another assault upon the Guild.  It took years for us to recover from the last battle!"
msgstr "我们已经有许多年没有和太阳神庙作战了，我希望最近也不会有。上次我们光是从大战中恢复就花了好多年的时间。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:28
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Glory to all who bathe in the cleansing light of the Sun! Do you walk in the path of its light?"
msgstr "愿所有走在光之道路中的人都获得荣耀！相信您也是光之道路的拥护者吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:29
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:29
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There was a tremendous wind storm that devastated most of the forest to the north of here!  It has driven basilisks, will o' wisps and unicorns closer to the temple!  "
msgstr "北方的森林遭到极大的风暴袭击！这已经把石化蜥蜴、鬼火和独角兽都赶到更靠近神庙的地方！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:30
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:30
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Be gone!  We have no use for you here, unless we uses you to feed the wyverns!"
msgstr "滚吧！我们不需要你，除非你想要被双足翼龙给吃掉！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:31
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:31
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We have not had any travelers from Balzathar Lair since the canyon filled with water.  I wonder if any of them survived the flood!"
msgstr "在这个峡谷里面都充满了水之后，我们在巴尔萨煞实在很少看见什么旅行者了。不知道这些牛头人还有没有活着的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:32
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:32
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Better watch out!  The Dread Pirate Stanley doesn't like strangers snooping around our island!"
msgstr "最好小心一点！恐怖海盗史坦力不喜欢岛上有人走来走去。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:33
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:33
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If we can conquer Dagger Wound Island, then nothing will stop us from raiding Ravenshore and even the city of Alvar itself!"
msgstr "如果我们可以征服匕伤岛，那么就再也没有事情可以阻止我们劫掠阿尔瓦，甚至是渡鸦海滨了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:34
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:34
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I saw torches last night at the old ruined fort across the bay last night.   I wonder what people were doing out there?"
msgstr "我昨天晚上看见湾区对面的老废墟里面有火光闪动，不知道发生了什么事情？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:35
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:35
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks for helping us empty the lair!  "
msgstr "多谢帮助我们把水排干！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:36
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:36
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now that the water is gone, we can begin putting our lives in order.  But what if the flood comes back?  Are we still safe?"
msgstr "现在水已经干了，我们可以把一切事情都恢复到淹水前的情况了。但是，洪水如果再来怎么办？我们安全吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:37
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:37
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Our herd leader, Masul, will certainly wish to speak with you if you haven't already found him.  Seek him out and he may reward you for helping us."
msgstr "如果你还没有找到我们的领袖马苏尔，请赶快去找他。他应该会奖赏你协助我们的努力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:40
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:40
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Nothing to see here… move along."
msgstr "这里没什么好看的，快走吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:41
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:41
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Walk in the Light, friends."
msgstr "走在光之道路上，朋友们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:42
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:42
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome to our holy retreat. If you have business with our order, seek out the head priest, Oskar Tyre. His office is in the temple."
msgstr "欢迎来到我们的圣殿。如果你有重要的事情，请找寻我们的首席主教，奥斯卡·提尔，他的办公室就在神殿里面。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:43
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:43
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What are you bothering me for? Talk to the Guildmaster, Sandro. He deals with guests. Not me!"
msgstr "你吵我干什么？去找公会会长山德罗，他负责应付客人，快滚！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:44
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:44
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Out of my way, cretin! You interrupt my thoughts, and I'm thinking about important matters!"
msgstr "别档路，俗人！你干扰了我的思绪，我正在思考重要的事情！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:45
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:45
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hope that this war against the Dragons never ends!  Charles Quixote pays mercenaries like myself very well for our services."
msgstr "我希望这场和龙的战争永远不要结束。查尔斯付给我们这些佣兵的钱相当丰厚！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:46
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCNews.txt.py:47
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:46
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/NPCNEWS.txt.py:47
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Our king, Deftclaw, has given you his protection, but watch your step. Cause any trouble, and I will make a snack out of you."
msgstr "我们的国王达夫克劳承诺要和你结盟。但是你最好给我小心一点，惹起任何麻烦，我都会把你给当点心吃掉。"

