#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:3
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:2
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm glad I found you! Of all the other guards, you are the only one I've seen! Regnan Pirates attack the island. We must inform the caravan master, Dadeross. He's visiting the village chieftain. Find him! I'll return to the wagons to guard them."
msgstr "真高兴我找到了你！这么多守卫里面，我只有找到你一个人！雷格那海盗正在攻击这座岛屿，我们必须要赶快通知车队的领袖达德洛斯。他目前正在拜访村庄的酋长。快点找到他！我要回到车队去保护车队中的人。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:4
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome to Dagger Wound Island, Journeyman of Alvar.  I am Brekish Onefang, Clan Leader.  I wish I was greeting you during better times.\n\nThe mountain of fire has caused serious damage to my village and its people.  Many buildings have been damaged, and the bridges that connect the smaller islands to the main island have been destroyed!  Many people are missing or stranded on these smaller islands!  We must help them!"
msgstr "阿尔瓦的旅人，欢迎来到匕伤群岛。我是布拉克许·单牙，这里的酋长。抱歉在这动乱之际与你见面。\n火焰构成的山脉已经对我的村庄和人民造成了重大的伤害。有许多建筑被破坏，联络主大陆和各岛屿之间的桥梁也都被破坏了！我的许多同胞不是失踪，就是被困在这些小岛上面！我们一定要帮帮他们才行！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:7
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Be quick with your business. I must prepare to escape these islands!"
msgstr "你动作最好快一点，我得要离开这座岛了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:8
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The mountain of fire will surely destroy us!"
msgstr "火焰的大山一定会摧毁我们全部的人！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:10
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:10
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What are you doing here? Get my letter to Fellmoon!"
msgstr "你还在这里干什么？把我的信交给费尔蒙！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:12
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome to the Ravenshore guildhouse of the Merchants of Alvar. I am Elgar Fellmoon. How may I help you?"
msgstr "欢迎来到渡鸦海滨的阿尔瓦商人公会之家，有什么我可以为各位效劳的吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:12
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:28
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:34
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:58
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:68
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:88
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:89
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:11
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:27
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:33
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:57
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:67
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:87
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:88
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes?"
msgstr "有事吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:13
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:13
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Have you done as I've asked of you?"
msgstr "你照着我所说的作了吗？"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Okay…you've beaten my guards. Truce.\n\nI'm Arion Hunter. I suppose you could call this all my operation. What do you want?"
msgstr "好吧……你们已经打败了我的守卫。先别动手。\n我就是艾瑞安·韩特。我想你可以说这里就是我的全部事业。你到底想要怎么样？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:14
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What is it now?"
msgstr "现在又怎么了？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:15
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:15
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Halt! None may pass into the inner chambers unless accompanied by a guild member."
msgstr "等等！除非有公会会员陪伴你，否则没人可以走进里面的房间。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:16
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome to the Guildhouse of the Merchants of Alvar. I am Bastian Loudrin, the high guildmaster. From here we run the Alvarian trade empire."
msgstr "欢迎来到阿尔瓦商人公会之家。我是巴斯沈·卢德林，公会的会长。我们从这里管理整个阿尔瓦的商人帝国。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:16
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome back to the Guildhouse of the Merchants of Alvar."
msgstr "欢迎来到阿尔瓦商人公会之家。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We have identified those we believe would join an alliance to stand against the crisis. These are: the Minotaurs of Ravage Roaming, the Clerics of the Temple of the Sun in Murmurwoods, the Dragons of Garrote Gorge, the Necromancers' Guild in Shadowspire, and Charles Quixote's Dragon hunting camp in Garrote Gorge.\n\nNow none of us believe that you can get all of them to work together, but with us and the Trolls already with the alliance, it should suffice if three of the five join us.\n\nPerhaps you should begin by speaking with Sahil Ittalle who lives at the north end of the town. He is our guild's historian and the best person to brief you on our potential allies' various dispositions."
msgstr "我们已经调查出了在这场危机中有可能加入我们同盟，对抗末日的势力。他们是：残破镇的牛头人、低语森林太阳神庙中的牧师、绞刑峡谷的龙、阴影塔地区的死灵法师公会，绞刑峡谷的查尔斯·吉柯德的猎龙人营地。\n我们之中没有人认为你可以把这所有的势力都统合起来，但是以目前的状况来看，我们和巨魔都已经是这个同盟的当然成员，你其实只需要让这五个势力中的三个加入就好了。\n也许你应该先去和住在这座城市北边沙希尔·伊塔力谈谈。他是我们公会中的历史学者，也是最能够让你了解这些势力之间彼此关连的人。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:17
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good day."
msgstr "你好。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am Overdune, I hunt meat for the village of Rust. Or I did so before the lake of fire came to destroy our homes."
msgstr "我是欧瓦都，我的工作是替铁锈镇狩猎食物。确切地说，在火湖摧毁我的家园之前，这曾经是我的工作。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You are back. How goes it with you?"
msgstr "你回来了，日子过得怎么样呢？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:19
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:19
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Leave me be. I morn the death of Vilebite, my son."
msgstr "别管我了，我在哀悼我儿子维尔拜的去世。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:20
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Th-thank you for giving my son Vilebite his rest."
msgstr "多…多谢你们让我的儿子维尔拜得到安息。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:20
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Come in…you are always welcome here."
msgstr "进来吧，我们永远欢迎你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:21
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is only because you are under Bastian Loudrin's protection that I have allowed you this audience. Know you stand before Deftclaw Redreaver, Ultimate Flightleader of the Dragons of Jadame. I am not to be tarried with. Speak your business!"
msgstr "如果不是因为你在巴斯沈·卢德林的保护之下，我根本不可能见你。你要知道，在你面前的是达夫克劳·红斧，是贾丹姆上最强大的飞龙领导者。我可不是那种能够陪你聊天打屁的家伙。有事快说！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:21
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You disturb me again? This had best be important."
msgstr "你胆敢再度打搅我？这最好是很重要的事情。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:22
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:102
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:22
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:35
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:84
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:102
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:21
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:34
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:83
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:101
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr "你想要什么？"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sir Charles Quixote at your service. Welcome to my camp headquarters. From here I oversee this hunting expedition.\n\nAre you here to trade? Most of what my goods are committed to orders already. I do, however, have some baby dragons for sale. And I suppose I could part with some of the lower grade adult hides."
msgstr "查尔斯·吉柯德爵士听候您的差遣。欢迎来到我们营地的总部。我一向都在这里管理此次狩猎远征的任务。\n你是来这边推销货品的吗？我大多数的东西其实都已经交给骑士团了。不过，我这边还有一些幼龙可以卖给你，而且我也有一些品质比较差的成龙皮可以卖给你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:23
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "How may I help you?"
msgstr "我能够帮上忙吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:24
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:24
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You just caught me. I'm almost ready to leave for Ravenshore, but how may I help you?"
msgstr "你刚好遇上我正要离开前往渡鸦海滨的时机，不过，你有什么需要我帮忙的地方吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:25
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It was a long journey, but here I am. Good to see you again."
msgstr "这场旅程十分漫长，但我终于来了。很高兴能够看到你们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:25
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "How are you?"
msgstr "你们好吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:26
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hail the alliance! How goes it with you?"
msgstr "联盟万岁！你们的工作进度如何？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:26
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome!"
msgstr "欢迎！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:27
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "And so I have made haste to Ravenshore. Already I grow weary of life among the prey animals. You had best be quick about the business of this alliance!"
msgstr "我就这样离开了渡鸦海滨。我已经厌倦了居住在肉食生物之间的生活，你最好赶快告诉我有关这个什么鬼联盟的细节！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:27
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, what is it?"
msgstr "什么事？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:28
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It has been a long time since I have traveled. I forget how beautiful parts of this land can be. I look forward to resolving the current crisis--the very least reason being that I can then take a long deserved sabbatical."
msgstr "从我上次旅行到现在已经过了很久的时间了。我已经忘记了这块土地多么的漂亮。我很期待可以解决目前的危机，至少到了那个时候我可以好好地做一场礼拜。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:29
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is good to see you again, friends. Thanks to you, things go well at Balthazar Lair. Already my herd has made great progress towards restoring our homes and shops. Perhaps you have visited the restored city?"
msgstr "老朋友们，真高兴可以再次看见你们。由于你们的帮助，巴尔萨煞巢穴这边一切都进行得非常顺利。我的同胞们在恢复整个巢穴的旧观上已经有了相当大的进展，大部分的住所和商店都已经重建完成了。也许你想要拜访一下我们重建完成的城市？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:29
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings, friends."
msgstr "你好，朋友们！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:29
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Things go well for us in our war against the Temple of the Sun. Before I left, I saw the Shadowspire border made secure. Daily our troops force theirs back to their main temple in Murmurwoods.\n\nAgain, on behalf of the Necromancers' Guild, I thank you. Now, let us get on with the business at hand."
msgstr "我们在对抗太阳神庙的进展上十分地顺利。在我离开之前，我发现阴影塔地区的边界已经获得了保障。我们的部队每天都将对方的势力一步步地逼回低语森林里面他们的大本营。\n我再一次的代表死灵法师公会感谢你。现在，让我们讨论一下手边的事务吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:30
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:29
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello, guild friends."
msgstr "你好，公会之友！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:31
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:30
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings. I am Masul, Herdmaster of Balthazar Lair. On behalf of my herd, I thank you for saving us. I was sure that we were destined to perish. Now it seems we will survive. I look forward to rebuilding our lair."
msgstr "你好，我是巴尔萨煞巢穴的领导者，马苏尔。我代表我的同胞感谢你。我本来以为我们注定要遭遇到灭亡的命运。现在，看起来我们将有机会度过这一切。我很期待和同胞们一起携手重建这个地方。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:31
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:30
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "How may I serve the saviors of my herd?"
msgstr "我该如何帮助拯救我同胞的救世主呢？"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:31
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wha…who is it? Who is it! You may think my injuries make me easy prey raiders! But know my axe is sharp, and…and…hey…\n\nYou're not the raiders! Who are you?"
msgstr "啥？这是谁？是谁？你们这些强盗真是狗运好，我的伤口让我没有太多反击的能力！但是我的斧头依旧很锋利，他们绝对不会……\n你不是那些强盗！你到底是谁？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:32
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:82
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:96
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:97
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:113
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:31
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:81
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:95
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:96
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:112
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello, again."
msgstr "你好，又见面了。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:32
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hail to you. I am Sandro. Thant and I are the high guildmasters of the Necromancers' Guild. With our fortunes diminished in Erathia and Enroth, it could be argued that we speak for the guild worldwide.\n\nWe have heard that you are envoys from Bastian Loudrin. What is his need of us?"
msgstr "诸位好，我是山德罗。谭特和我都是贾丹姆死灵法师公会的会长。随着我们在埃拉西亚和恩洛斯的势力减少，可以说我们代表了全世界的死灵法师公会。\n我们听说你是巴斯沈·卢德林派出来的信使。他需要我们的协助吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:33
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:32
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What is it? Be quick! We are very busy."
msgstr "到底要干嘛？快点！我们很忙呢！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:35
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:34
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Who are you? I don't recognize you, but I'm sure that whatever your business, it will add to my troubles."
msgstr "你是谁？我根本不认识你。我只知道不管你想要什么东西，都只会增添我的麻烦。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:36
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:35
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, Sandro has asked you to strike a blow against the Sun Temple! Though I hate the guild. I would be willing to help you. Half a serving of revenge is better than none."
msgstr "这样啊，山德罗要求你打击太阳神庙！虽然我讨厌公会，但我还是愿意帮助你。报复一部份的仇家总比都不报复要好得多了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:36
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:35
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, do we move against the Sun Temple? Shall we get for Sandro his Nightshade Brazier?"
msgstr "我们要去攻击太阳神庙了吗？我们要去帮山德罗把龙葵灯炉拿回来了吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:37
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:36
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, you are sent by his high holiness…Oskar Tyre thinks to activate his agent. Though I would wish him no good, I will do as he asks. Yes, I have knowledge of the guild's Skeleton Transformer and believe I can destroy it. Very well, let us do this thing against the Necromancers' Guild. I will at least be able to strike against one of my enemies!"
msgstr "啊，你是我们的主教所派来的……奥斯卡·提尔总算想到要指挥他的手下了。虽然我对他没有什么好感，但我还是会服从他的命令。没错，我的确知道公会的骷髅转换器在哪里，我也相信我可以摧毁它。好的，就让我们一起来完成这个破坏死灵法师公会的任务吧！我至少可以伤害一半的仇敌！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:37
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:36
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Are you now ready to destroy the guild's Skeleton Transformer? I will join you and we can be about the task!"
msgstr "你已经准备好要摧毁骷髅转换器了吗？让我们赶快动身，摧毁那个重要的工具吧！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:37
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hah! So both Sandro and Oskar Tyre seek to use me against the other. I have thought of the possibility of this occurring. I believe that if I were to strike against one, it would become impossible for me to strike the other.\n\nSo I guess we have a choice--help the guild or the temple. Which? I don't know, as my hatred for both is equal. I suppose I'll have to do with a half measure of revenge."
msgstr "哈！原来山德罗和奥斯卡·提尔都要求你来找我对抗另外一方。我以前就思考过这样的可能性。我认为如果要打击其中一方，就不可能打击另外一方。\n我看，现在已经到了一个抉择的时刻了，到底要帮助神庙还是帮助死灵法师？我自己其实不知道，因为我对两方的痛恨是同样的。我想，只对付其中一方就已经够满足了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:38
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:37
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, have you decided to steal the Nightshade Brazier from the Temple, or to destroy the guild's Skeleton Transformer? Either way…I will join you. But let us do it. I would slack my thirst for revenge."
msgstr "你决定好是要从神庙里面偷取龙葵灯炉，还是摧毁公会的骷髅转换器了吗？不管怎么样……我都会加入你。但是赶快下定决心吧，我的复仇之火在等待更多的燃料呢！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:39
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:38
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you are sent by Bastian Loudrin? Well, then. What would he have us hear?"
msgstr "你是巴斯沈·卢德林派来的？你有什么要告诉我们的吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:39
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:38
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Light upon you. What need you of our temple?"
msgstr "愿光明照耀你。你对太阳神庙有什么需要吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:40
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:39
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hail, Heroes of Jadame!"
msgstr "嗨，贾丹姆大陆的英雄！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:41
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:40
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah well, very good to see you. Quite a lot of trouble is behind us, no? What brings the \"Heroes of Jadame\" to my camp?"
msgstr "啊，真高兴看见你。我们度过了很多麻烦，对吧！那么，有什么风把“贾丹姆大陆的英雄”吹到我的帐棚里来了？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:41
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:72
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:40
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:71
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello again."
msgstr "你好。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:42
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:41
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Together we have done a great deed. I look forward to telling my heir the tale. How can I help you, heroes?"
msgstr "我们一起完成了很多伟大的工作。我迫不及待地想要把所有的故事都告诉我的继承人。你找我有什么事吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:42
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:41
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome. My cave is open to you."
msgstr "欢迎。我的洞穴随时都欢迎你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:43
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:42
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Light has shined upon us indeed. Our temple is always open to the \"Heroes of Jadame.\" How may I help you?"
msgstr "光明的确照耀在我们身上。我们的神庙永远都会开放给“贾丹姆大陆的英雄”。我能帮上您的忙吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:43
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:42
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes, friends?"
msgstr "是的，老友，有什么事情吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:44
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:43
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "How good of you to grace us with your presence. Heroes of Jadame. Saviors of Balthazar Lair. Both fitting titles for you who have done so much for me herd and for all of Jadame!"
msgstr "真高兴您能够大驾光临。贾丹姆大陆的英雄，巴尔萨煞巢穴的拯救者。这两个称号都十分适合你们，因为你协助拯救了我们所有的同胞，以及整个贾丹姆大陆！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:44
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:43
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hail, Saviors of Balthazar Lair!"
msgstr "嗨！巴尔萨煞巢穴的救星！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:45
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:44
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hail! In the name of the guild, I welcome you. Know that we consider you our friends, Heroes of Jadame. What would you have of us today?"
msgstr "嗨！我以公会之名欢迎你。请记得我们把你当做朋友，贾丹姆大陆的英雄。你今天有什么需要我们帮忙的地方吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:45
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:44
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings, heroes."
msgstr "你好，英雄们！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:46
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:45
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you're looking for my master, Xanthor, he is not here. Can I help you?"
msgstr "如果你要找我的主人萨索尔，他并不在这里，有什么我可以帮上忙的地方吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:46
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:45
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Can I help you?"
msgstr "我可以帮忙你吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:47
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:46
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmph. So you are the heroes of the alliance. Not much to look at, I must say. Still, I suppose you have survived much to see this day. I only hope you are up to the task I think fate has for you. If not, we are all surely doomed!"
msgstr "嗯，原来你就是联盟的英雄。我倒是觉得你们看起来不怎么样。不过，我想你一定经历了不少危险才能够拥有这样的称号。我只希望你拥有足够的能力面对命运交付给你的任务，否则我们就完蛋了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:114
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:47
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:114
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:46
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:113
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You are back? Have you need of advice? Or are you finding the task at hand too difficult?"
msgstr "你又回来了？你需要忠告吗？或者你觉得任务太过困难了？"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:47
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There. It is built. Take this Conflux Key. As I have explained, it will allow you to use the crystal in the town square as a gateway--much as you've used the elemental gateways to reach the elemental planes. The crystal gateway will take you to the place between the planes.\n\nOn this \"Plane Between Planes\" you must find the source of the cataclysm. What it is, I don't know, but whatever it is, it is there. Go now! The fate of the land, I'm afraid, lies on your shoulders. Be worthy of the task!"
msgstr "来看吧，这已经打造好了。请收下这个汇流之钥。如同我之前所解释过的一样，这样你就可以将城镇广场上的那座水晶作为传送通道，就像你利用元素界传送门进入元素界一样。这个水晶传送门将会让你进入界间之地。\n在这个界间之地中，你将会找到一切灾变的根源。这灾变到底是什么，我并不知道，但它一定就在那个地方。到了那个时候，恐怕拯救整个世界的重任就落在你的肩膀上了。请不要辜负我们！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:48
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:47
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must go through the crystal gateway! It leads to the plane between planes. The cause of the cataclysm lies through it--seek out the source!"
msgstr "你必须赶快进入水晶传送门！那将可以带你前往水晶传送门！水晶传送门会通往界间之地。大灾变的根源就在那个地方，赶快找出来！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:49
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:48
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have conducted yourselves greatly. I must say I had my doubts about your abilities, but no longer. You are truly worthy of the praise that all lavish upon you."
msgstr "你已经完成了很多重要的任务，我必须说在前头，之前也许我对你的能力有怀疑，但现在这怀疑都已经烟消云散了。你的确是名不虚传。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:49
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:48
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "How can I help you, friends?"
msgstr "我能够帮上忙吗？"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:49
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I sense some small presence in this chamber. Greater than gnats, but so much less than myself. Where is it….\n\nAh, there it is. What have we here? Some of the beings of Jadame? Yes. Destroy them? Surely within my rights…but, no. It has been a slow millennia. Perhaps they will provide some diversion.\n\nSpeak then, lower ones! What would you have of Escaton the Destroyer of Worlds?"
msgstr "我感应到这个房间里面出现了别的存在，比跳蚤要大，但却比我要小得多了。他们在哪里呢……\n啊，原来在这里。这到底是什么呢？是贾丹姆大陆的生物吗？是的。要摧毁他们吗？这当然是我的责任……但是，还是算了。这几千年来实在过得很缓慢。也许他们可以提供一些娱乐。\n低级生物，说吧！你想要知道毁灭者爱斯卡顿的什么东西？"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:49
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah the gnatlings are returned. I must consider why I allow them their continued existence. But this I will do some other time.\n\nSpeak then, while you still may, puny ones."
msgstr "啊，那些跳蚤又回来了。我必须要考虑一下，究竟要不要让他们继续存在。算啦，还是下次再说好了。\n小家伙，在你们还有机会开口的时候，说吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:52
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:51
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Who is there? Am I finally to be released?"
msgstr "谁在这里？我终于可以被释放了吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:52
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:51
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Are you here to free me?"
msgstr "你是来这边释放我的吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:53
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:52
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Help me! I have been able to live thus far, but for how much longer can I?"
msgstr "帮帮我！我勉强在这边存活下来，但是我不知道自己还可以支撑多久！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:53
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:52
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you now release me from my torment?"
msgstr "你现在愿意帮我从折磨中释放出来吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:54
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:53
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, mortals…good. You are not of my tormentors. Release me from this place! I will not harm you."
msgstr "啊……凡人。真是太好了，你不是折磨我的那些人。把我放出去，凡人，我不会伤害你的！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:54
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:53
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Release me from this cell, mortals!"
msgstr "凡人，把我放出去！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:55
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:54
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Free me quickly! I have survived so far, but it is only a matter of time before I am extinguished!"
msgstr "赶快把我放出去，我好不容易活到现在，但是可能撑不久了！快点！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:55
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:54
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My fires dampen. Release me!"
msgstr "我的火焰开始变潮湿了！快点放走我！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:56
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:55
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings. I am Sahil Ittalle, the historian of the Alvarian Merchant Guild. How can I help you today?"
msgstr "你好，我是阿尔瓦商人公会的历史学者，有什么我可以帮忙你的地方吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:56
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:55
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes? Can I help you?"
msgstr "嗯？我可以帮得上你的忙吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:57
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:56
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, you must be the alliance council's heroes. Well met. Catherine and I are here to help. What can I do for you?"
msgstr "啊，你一定是联盟议会口中的那位英雄了！我和凯瑟琳是来帮忙你的，有什么我可以帮上忙的地方吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:57
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:87
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:56
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:86
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings!"
msgstr "你好！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:58
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:57
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It was a harrowing journey to reach your shores, I assure you! But the events of the cataclysm force all to extreme duties. I'm sure you understand. But down to issues. How can I help you?"
msgstr "光是到达你们的海岸边就让我们吃尽了苦头，但是大灾变让我们大家都必须要冒非常大的危险。有什么我可以帮上忙的地方，请尽管说！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:59
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:58
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings! I am Asael Fromago, the world's preeminent connoisseur of fine cheeses. Oh, some might say that Elkanah Juusto of Edenbrook holds the title, but he is a dilettante--a mere dabbler!"
msgstr "你好！我是福罗马哥，世界上最杰出的奶酪鉴赏家。喔，也许会有人说埃登布鲁克的艾尔卡纳·朱斯托比我更适合这个称号，但是他不过是个欺世盗名的骗子！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:59
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:58
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings! How may Asael Fromago, master of cheeses, serve you?"
msgstr "你好，有什么奶酪之王福罗马哥可以帮上忙的地方吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:60
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:99
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:60
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:99
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:59
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:98
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hail, adventurer!"
msgstr "嗨，冒险者！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:61
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:61
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:60
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yeah? What do you want?"
msgstr "啊？你想要什么东西？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:62
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:62
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:61
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "How are you today?"
msgstr "你今天过得如何？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:63
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:63
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:62
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes? What is it?"
msgstr "怎么样，有什么事情吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:64
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:64
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:63
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings. How may I help you?"
msgstr "你好。有什么我可以帮忙的地方吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:65
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:64
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Who are you? Clearly you are not of this realm. And how have you survived? I am amazed you have not been destroyed by the madness that has taken over my fellow earth dwellers!"
msgstr "你是谁？你一定不是这个次元的人。你怎么可能活下来？我很惊讶你们没有被我疯狂的土元素同胞们给摧毁！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:65
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:64
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good to see you again."
msgstr "真高兴可以再度看见你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:66
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:65
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings. Though I have not yet succumbed to the madness, be aware! I feel its tug on my mind. I don't know how long I can hold out."
msgstr "你好。虽然我还没有被那狂病感染，但是请小心！我知道有股力量在拉扯我的心灵。我不知道自己还可以支撑多久。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:66
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:65
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello again. You are still safe in my presence. The madness has not overtaken me."
msgstr "真高兴再度看见你，你在我的身边是安全的，因为我并没有感染那疯狂的疾病。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:67
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:66
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The madness pulls at me, but still I maintain my sanity. If you have business with me, speak quickly. Even now I feel a compulsion to attack you!"
msgstr "那可怕的力量在不停地拉扯着我，但是我依旧维持着清醒。如果你有什么事情需要我帮忙，请赶快说出口。即使是现在，我都可以感觉到有股力量在吸引我攻击你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:67
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:66
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am still in my own mind, but for how long I don't know. What do you want?"
msgstr "我依旧神智清醒，但是我不知道还可以维持多久，你有什么事情需要我帮忙吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:68
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:67
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fear not, plane-travelers. For reasons I do not understand, the madness that affects my brethren does not affect me. How can I help you?"
msgstr "别害怕，各元素界间的旅行者。不知道什么原因，那股疯狂的力量没有影响到我。有什么事情请尽管开口。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:69
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:68
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Madness reigns these watery realms, but it does not rule me. Somehow I am not affected. How can I help you?"
msgstr "疯狂的力量在这个水的世界中肆虐，但是我依旧没有受到影响，有什么我可以帮上忙的地方吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:69
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:71
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:68
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:70
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "How can I help you?"
msgstr "我可以帮上你的忙吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:70
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:69
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "T-the madness p-pulls at my very soul. Each day is a st-struggle to maintain sanity. I w-will h-help you while I c-can, but be prepared to fl-flee!"
msgstr "这股疯狂的力量在拉扯着我的灵魂。每天我都必须要不停挣扎，才能够维持清醒。我—我愿意尽全力帮助你，但—但是—请随时做好逃跑的准备！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:70
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:69
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I s-still maintain my-myself. W-what is it y-you want?"
msgstr "我—我目前还是清醒的。你—你需要我的帮助吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:71
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:70
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome to my sanctuary. I have proofed this chamber against the maddening magic which affects my fellow citizens. You are safe as long as you stay here. How may I help you?"
msgstr "欢迎来到我的圣堂。我已经证明了这个地方可以阻挡那股影响我同胞的疯狂力量。你只要在这边就是安全的。我能够帮上你的忙吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:72
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:71
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I don't know what has befallen us, but it is awful! All my friends and family are affected by violent madness. Somehow I am not affected. But how can I help you?"
msgstr "我不知道我们怎么搞的，但这真是恐怖极了！我的所有朋友和家人都受到了这股疯狂力量的影响。我不知道为什么自己不受影响。有什么我可以帮忙你的地方吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:73
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:72
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, I understand you're out for adventure. I'd be glad to join you!"
msgstr "我知道你是出来冒险的，我愿意加入你！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:73
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:72
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome back! Have you decided to take me with you in your travels?"
msgstr "欢迎回来，你现在愿意让我加入你的冒险队伍了吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:74
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:73
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is so boring around here! I mean, why did I spend all that time training if I'm not going to use my skills? Say, perhaps you could take me with you. Clearly you're headed someplace exciting!"
msgstr "在这边真是太无聊了！我是说，为什么我把所有的时间都花在训练上，而不能够去参加冒险实际体验生活？啊，也许你可以带我一起去，我知道你会前往一些有趣的地方！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:74
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:73
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, have you come back to take me on your adventure?"
msgstr "啊，你回来是准备让我加入你的队伍吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:75
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:74
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know the elder Dragons would never approve, but I don't care! I want adventure, and you're the best chance I'll see. Can I go with you?"
msgstr "我知道老一辈的飞龙可能不会同意，但是我才不管呢！你是我唯一冒险的机会，快带我走吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:75
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:74
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, can I come with you now? Can I?"
msgstr "我现在可以和你一起走吗？可以吗？"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:75
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Would you believe the Necromancers' Guild cast me out? I, Karanya Memoria? Fah! They were just jealous of my great potential. Not that this has stopped me from seeking dark knowledge--I do so now by my own path.\n\nSay, perhaps we could join forces!"
msgstr "你相信死灵法师公会把我赶出来了吗？我，卡蓝雅·麦莫瑞亚？呵！他们只是嫉妒我的潜力而已。现在没有任何力量可以阻止我寻找黑暗的力量了。我现在可以靠着自己来寻求这些知识。\n嗯，也许我们可以携手共创未来！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:76
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:75
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello."
msgstr "你好。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:77
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:76
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings, travelers! Ah, how I envy your lives of adventure. You know, I too know the call of the open road. I myself once sought new experiences--strange lands, strange people, and whatnot. Sadly, those days are over for me."
msgstr "啊，你好，旅行者。我真羡慕你的生活。曾经有一度我能够理解大自然的呼唤，我想要认识陌生人，见识陌生的土地。啊，真可惜我现在已经过了那个年纪。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:77
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:76
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good to see you again!"
msgstr "真高兴可以再度看见你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:78
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:77
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings, and well met! I am Jasp Thelbourne--an Elf of daring deeds. This is no idle boast. You may have heard of the Idol of Seven Skunks? It was I who recovered it from the Temple of Eep for the Alvarian Merchant Guild."
msgstr "真荣幸见到各位！我是敢作敢为的精灵杰斯波·赛尔鹏。这可不是我自说自夸。你也许听过七鼬鼠圣像，正是在下替阿尔瓦商人公会从伊普神庙里取回了圣像。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:78
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:77
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello, again. How can Jasp Thelbourne, renowned adventurer do for you?"
msgstr "再度见面真是荣幸，有我杰斯波·赛尔鹏可以效劳的地方吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:79
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:78
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I grow weary of the endless demands placed on my by my so-called \"master,\" the accursed Thant. He would have me stay here in Shadowspire as a guard. A \"guard,\" feh! I am meant for greater things. An adventure like yours is what I seek. Will you have me in your fellowship?"
msgstr "我已经厌倦了我所谓的“主人”——那个该死的谭特不停提出的要求。他会让我留在阴影塔这边担任守卫。守卫！啐！我不应该只能作这种杂事。你们所经历的冒险才是我所寻找的东西。你愿意让我加入吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:79
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:78
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, I'm still here, but I make preparations to leave as soon as an opportunity presents itself. Have you reconsidered? Will you take me now?"
msgstr "好吧，我还在这里。但是只要有机会，我就会准备要离开。你考虑过了吗？这次愿意带我走吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:80
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:79
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings. I am Nathaniel Roberts. Without false modesty, I can say I am a mighty master of dark magic. It is your good fortune I have grown bored of Shadowspire and seek a company of adventurers such as yourselves to ally myself with. If you are agreeable, I will allow you to accompany me."
msgstr "诸位好，我是纳山尼尔·罗伯兹。我可不想要假装谦逊，但是我是黑魔法的大师。你很幸运我刚好对阴影塔地区感到十分厌烦，想要找群有趣的冒险者一起到处逛逛。如果你愿意的话，我想我可以勉强忍受和你们同行。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:80
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:79
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, you have reconsidered my offer. Will you now agree to become my followers?"
msgstr "你们重新考虑过我的提议了。愿意担任我的崇拜者和属下吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:81
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:80
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, a party of \"adventurers\"…hmmm. I suppose most dragons would just attack them outright, but then again I, Flamdring, have never been \"most dragons,\" no. Join them? Yes, perhaps I will. Perhaps I will."
msgstr "啊，原来是一群所谓的冒险者……嗯，我想大多数的飞龙一定会立刻攻击你们。但是，我，佛蓝林并不是“大多数”的飞龙。到底要不要加入他们呢？哼哼，也许我会的，也许我会的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:81
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:80
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah the adventurers return. Again the question arises: To join them or no? Yes, perhaps so…"
msgstr "啊，这群冒险者又回来了。同样的问题又再度出现了：要加入他们吗？要吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:82
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:81
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "How are you? I am Hevatia Deverbero, a member in full standing of the Necromancers' Guild."
msgstr "你好吗？我是海瓦提亚·代佛贝罗，我是死灵法师公会的忠实成员。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:83
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:82
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings, and may the Light shine on you. What can a humble priest of the Sun do for you today?"
msgstr "你好，愿光明照耀诸位。谦卑的太阳主教今天能为你做些什么吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:83
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:82
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello again. May the Light shine on you."
msgstr "你好，愿光明照耀诸位。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:84
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:83
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes? Well, don't stand there tongue tied! I'm a busy man!"
msgstr "有什么事吗？别站着不说话！我可是很忙的！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:85
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:84
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello, and good hunting to you. I am Sethrc Thistlebone, a warrior of this village, such as it is."
msgstr "你好，祝你们狩猎愉快。我是赛斯瑞克·希索朋，村庄里面的战士。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:85
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:84
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello, and good hunting!"
msgstr "你好，祝狩猎顺利！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:86
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:85
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings. Welcome to my home. I am Rionel, axe warrior of Balthazar Lair."
msgstr "你好。欢迎来到我家，我是巴尔萨煞巢穴的用斧者瑞欧耐尔。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:86
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:85
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome to my home."
msgstr "欢迎来到我家。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:87
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:86
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greeting! I am Adric Stellare, a former lieutenant of the Alvar Guard. I grew tired of the regimented lifestyle. Now I seek adventure."
msgstr "你好！我是艾瑞克·史塔拉尔，原先是阿尔瓦商人公会守卫的队长。但是我厌倦了这么单调的生活模式。现在我想要寻找冒险的可能性。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:88
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:87
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am Infaustus, elder vampire and adventurer. I will talk with you if you are brief. I am busy making preparations to leave. I go to seek my fortune across the lands of Jadame."
msgstr "我是因佛史塔斯，是名年纪相当大的吸血鬼，以及相当专业的冒险者。如果你废话不多，我愿意和你谈谈。我正忙着准备离开这里，我准备要在贾丹姆大陆上寻找我的未来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:89
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:88
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Very impressive performance. Reaching me was not easy. Perhaps you are the adventurers I seek. You see, I wish to explore the world, and these days, even a Dragon would be smart not to travel alone."
msgstr "表现相当不错。要找到我可不简单。也许你们就是我正在寻找的冒险者。你知道吗，我正准备要好好探索这个世界。但是，在目前的状况下，即使是只飞龙也不应该单独旅行。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:90
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:89
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hail, adventurers! I am Tempus, hunt leader and a knight of some renown in my native Erathia. What can I do for you?"
msgstr "嗨，旅行者们！我是坦帕斯，在埃拉西亚人中我是相当有名的骑士。我能够为各位效劳吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:90
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:89
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hail!"
msgstr "嗨！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:91
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:90
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings! I am the mighty Thorne Understone. I know we have not met before--I never forget a face--but perhaps you recognize my name from ballads. You know, several have been written about me."
msgstr "你好！我是伟大的索恩·石下。我知道我们之前没有见过面，因为我从来不会忘记曾经遇过的人，也许你会记得在别的地方听过我的名字。你知道的，有很多的歌曲里面都有提到我的名字。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:91
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:90
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello again. What can the mighty Thorne do for you? Maybe I could sign my name on your shield as a keepsake. A lot of my fans seem to like that sort of thing."
msgstr "你好，伟大的索恩·石下能够替你作什么吗？也许我可以替你在盾牌上签名，让你可以保留下来。我有许多崇拜者都喜欢这样做。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:92
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:91
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hail! I am Ulbrecht, a hero of the Vori campaigns. Be welcome in my home."
msgstr "嗨！我是乌布理契，沃里战役的英雄。欢迎来到我家。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:92
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:91
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is good to see you again."
msgstr "真高兴再见到你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:93
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:92
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I wake after a sleep of thirty-four years, and already I have company! I see you have traveled far. Perhaps you can tell me what has transpired while I slumbered."
msgstr "哇！我刚从三十四年的冬眠中醒来，没想到就遇到了同伴，也许你可以告诉我到底发生了什么事情。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:96
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:93
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:92
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:95
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings."
msgstr "欢迎。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:94
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:93
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am Duroth the Eternal. By besting the guards you have earned the right of speaking to me. What do you want?"
msgstr "我是永恒土洛斯。由于你击败了我的守卫，所以你获得了和我见面的机会。你有什么想要从我这边获得的？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:94
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:93
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What brings you again to Duroth the Eternal?"
msgstr "你为什么要来找永恒土洛斯？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:95
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:94
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings! I am Weldrick Falconeye, Dragon training specialist. What can I do for you today?"
msgstr "欢迎各位！我是威瑞克·鹰眼，专业的飞龙训练师。今天有什么我可以替你效劳的地方吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:95
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:94
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello again…need any Dragons trained?"
msgstr "你好……有什么飞龙需要我照顾吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:97
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:96
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sethrik Fist at your service. Fine coffins made to order."
msgstr "赛斯瑞克·费斯特听候您的差遣。我提供相当不错的棺材。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:98
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:97
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The call of madness it burns…burns! My mind…ahrgg! Wait! A moment of clarity…quickly! State your business! I can hold out for but a moment."
msgstr "他们说这是某种疯狂的力量……他在我的脑中烧灼……啊！我的头！等等！我突然恢复清醒了……快点！快说你要干嘛！我可以暂时支撑一段时间。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:98
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:97
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What…is…it…you…w-want?"
msgstr "你……想要……干嘛？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:100
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:100
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:99
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ahoy, matey!"
msgstr "嗨，讨海人！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:101
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:100
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What do you want? My research requires great concentration--a concentration you are breaking with you're intrusion!"
msgstr "你想要干嘛？我的研究需要非常的专注，而你的入侵正好打断了它！到底你要干嘛？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:101
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:100
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You again? What is it?"
msgstr "又是你？你要干嘛？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:103
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:102
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Are you the new recruits? Of course you are! Why else would you be seeking me out? I'm ex-Captain Terrence, here to help you on your way to becoming proper Regnan sailors."
msgstr "你是新加入的吗？当然棉！不然你们来找我干嘛？我是前船长泰伦斯，我是来这边协助你成为堂堂正正的雷格那海盗的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:103
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:102
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, the new recruits again! What can I do for you?"
msgstr "啊，又是你们这些菜鸟！我可以帮上什么忙？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:104
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:104
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:103
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "How are you? What can a simple fisherwoman do for you today?"
msgstr "你们今天过得如何？讨海人今天又有什么可以为你效劳的地方？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:106
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:106
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:105
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings, do you seek guidance from the Light?"
msgstr "你好，你想要寻找光明的指引吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:109
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:109
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:108
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Halt! These areas are off limits to guests! Guild members only!"
msgstr "等等！这些区域是客人不准进入的地方！只有公会成员可以进来！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:110
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:110
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:109
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You may not enter here, puny ones! Stand back or become our prey!"
msgstr "小家伙，你们不准进来！如果不离开，你就会变成我们的食物！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:111
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:111
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:110
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Halt! Only members of our knightly brotherhood may pass this point. Others who attempt to pass will face our wrath!"
msgstr "等等！只有骑士团的成员可以通过，不然就必须面对我们的怒气！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:112
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:112
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:111
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Stop! You may not enter the storeroom!"
msgstr "等等！你不能够进入仓库！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:113
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:112
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hail! I'm Jeric Whistlebone. Welcome to my camp. We're on a hunting safari. You're welcome to look around, but don't interfere with our operation. This is no place for amateur fumbling about!"
msgstr "你好！我是杰瑞克·惠索朋。欢迎来到我的营帐。我们正在狩猎的营地中。欢迎你进来到处看看，但是别干扰我们的工作。这可不是初学者可以随便打探的地方！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:115
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:114
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings. I am the Oracle of Jadame. The mysteries of the Hidden World are open to me. Through long years of training, I have gained a small measure of control over time and space. I can reach my hand through the void and bring things to me--both items and knowledge."
msgstr "你好。我是贾丹姆大陆的神使。隐藏之世界的秘密对我来说是完全开放的。在经过了这么多年的训练之后，我已经可以控制时空部分的力量。我可以利用心灵穿越时空，把一些东西带回来，知识和真正的物品都包括在内。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:115
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:114
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings, and may the Balance always tilt in your favor."
msgstr "你好，愿天平永远朝向你的方向摇摆。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:116
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:116
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:115
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Halt! Only guild members and their guests can pass this point. Further, any guild members with you must be at least, conscious. You have old Leland with you, but he's in no condition to oversee you."
msgstr "等等！只有我们的成员和宾客才能够通过这里。而且，这个成员必须至少是清醒的。你虽然身边有李蓝的陪伴，但是他现在可没办法照顾你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet1.txt.py:117
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCGreet2.txt.py:117
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npcgreet.txt.py:116
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Help me!"
msgstr "救救我！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is as I have read in the prophecy of the Unmaking! \"...and a Mountain of Fire shall rise from the sea, like a wound drawn by the quick stroke of a dagger…\".\n\nYou must find a way off of these islands, if not for the caravan, at least for yourself!  Someone must take news of what has happened here to the Merchant Council in Alvar!  They must know of the cataclysm and of the Regnan raid!"
msgstr "这就像是我在末日预言中读过的一样！“……火之大山将会从海中升起，就像是匕首一划所造成的伤口一样……”\n你一定要找到离开这些岛屿的方法，即使不为了车队，也为了你自己！一定要有人离开这里，把这边的消息告诉阿尔瓦商团公会的议会！他们必须要知道大灾变的状况和雷格那海盗的入侵才行！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:9
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "In time long past, my people used the Portals of Stone to travel quickly from island to island, but we have lost the knowledge of their operation. Only the pair connecting the village to the southwestern fields still functions. Now that the bridges are gone, we're trapped on the island!"
msgstr "在很久以前，我们的同胞会利用岩石传送门在岛与岛之间快速的往来，但是我们已经遗忘了要怎么操作这些东西。只有一座连接这个村庄和西南岛的传送门还依旧可以运作。现在桥梁都已经毁坏了，我们等于被困在这座岛屿上了！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah yes…\"the portals.\" I have been studying them and the lost culture that built them for years.\n\nThey were built by the civilization that had its day long before the Lizardmen came to inhabit these islands. They were a means of instantaneous travel between the islands. Sadly, the power stones needed to operate them are in short supply."
msgstr "啊，是的……传送门。我研究它们和建造它们的神秘文化好多年了。\n他们是在蜥蜴人来到这里之前许多旧有的文明之下所建造的。他们是用来在不同的岛屿之间传送用的工具。很遗憾的，能够启动这些传送门的能源之石目前数量非常的稀少。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:13
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So Clanleader Onefang gave you that power stone he was holding onto! It will power the portal on the southwestern tip of the island. To use it, hold an image of the stone in your mind as you step onto the portal."
msgstr "啊，单牙酋长把他所拥有的能源之石给了你！这将可以启动岛上西南方的传送门。你只需要把这块石头的影像铭记在脑海中，然后就可以启动传送门。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The ruins of a temple built by the lost civilization lies on the island just northwest of the main island. I have not explored it however, for dangerous reptiles have made it their lair. I do suspect that the temple leads to an underwater tunnel which surfaces near the boat docks on the northwest island.\n\nWith the bridges out, that tunnel may be the only way to reach the docks and a boat to safety!"
msgstr "建造传送门的失落文明所盖的神庙废墟就在主岛屿西北方的地方。不过，因为里面有很多危险的爬虫类，所以其实我并没有探索过里面到底有什么东西。不过，我倒是怀疑庙里面可能有个水下隧道，通往西北方岛上的那座港口。\n在桥梁都被摧毁之后，那座隧道也许成为了唯一抵达港口或是船只的路径！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There is one Prophecy, the Prophecy of the Snake, that I have been unable to find a copy of.  I think it may be most revealing about the future of Jadame.\n\nFredrick Talimere, the Cleric, has told me of the snake ruins, and of the Abandoned Temple.  He is in agreement with me, that there may be a copy of this prophecy, somewhere in the temple.  Could you find it for me?"
msgstr "有一个预言，叫做蛇之预言，我一直找不到它的任何抄本。我觉得那个预言也许预示了贾丹姆大陆的未来。\n牧师费德瑞克·塔力米尔曾经跟我提到过这些蛇人的废墟，以及一个废弃神庙。他同意我的看法：也许在这些建筑物中会有这个预言的抄本。你能够替我找到它吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:22
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must bring my letter to Elgar Fellmoon in Ravenshore!"
msgstr "你一定要将这封信带给在渡鸦海滨的艾德加·费尔蒙！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:23
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Take this crystal to Fredrick Talimere. I know that it has something to do with the portals of stone. Perhaps he can tell you how it functions."
msgstr "把这个水晶带去给费德瑞克·塔力米尔。我知道这和岩石传送门一定有些关系。也许他可以告诉你这个石头和那些传送门有什么关系！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:24
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Bring the portal crystal to Fredrick Talimere. He will know what it does."
msgstr "把这个传送门水晶交给费德瑞克·塔力米尔。他会知道这有什么用的。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Merchant Council had sent our greatest warrior, Cauri Blackthorne, to consult with the Sun Temple priests about the disasters that have struck all of Jadame.\n\nCauri left for the Temple of the Sun in Murmurwoods shortly after rumors of the cataclysms were heard here in Alvar.  She was to return after consulting the priests.  We are very concerned that she has not returned.\n\nAs for your promotion, only Cauri can accurately test your skills and assess your worthiness for promotion.  If you find her, provide her with any assistance she may need and return here with news of her status and location."
msgstr "商团议会已经派出了我们最强悍的战士，考瑞·黑王座来和太阳神庙讨论即将降临贾丹姆大陆的大灾难。\n考瑞在来到阿尔瓦并听说了大灾变的谣言后，就动身前往低语森林。她在和牧师们讨论过后，应该要赶快回来。我们很担心她至今尚未归来的原因。\n至于你所关心的晋升问题，只有考瑞拥有足够的资格测试你的能力和技巧。如果你找到了她，你应该要提供她相关的协助，并且告诉我们她的状况和目前的情形。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for your assistance with the Basilisk Curse.  Usually I am prepared to handle the vile lizards, but this time there were just too many of them.\n\nThe Temple of the Sun asked me to check on a few pilgrims that were looking for the Druid Circle of Stone in this area.  When I found the first statue, I realized what had happened to the pilgrims.  \n\nI myself did not know of the increase in the number of Basilisks in this area.  They seem to be agitated by something.  I was going to investigate the Druid Circle of Stone when the Basilisks attacked me."
msgstr "多谢你们协助我处理石化蜥蜴的诅咒。通常我自己可以处理这些可恶的蜥蜴，但是这次他们的数量实在太多了些。\n太阳神庙要求我来这边寻找几名探索德鲁伊圣石圈的教徒。当我找到了第一座雕像的时候，我明白了这些教徒到底发生了什么事情。\n我自己并不知道石化蜥蜴在此地的数量大幅增加了。他们似乎是受到什么东西的鼓动。当石化蜥蜴攻击我的时候，我正准备要前往德鲁伊圣石圈。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "::Cauri looks over the Dark Elf(s) in your party::\n\nTo rescue me, you must have researched my path, and investigated the places I had been.  This demonstrates the intelligence needed to succeed in dealing with the world and business.\n\nTo get to where I was attacked, you must have the skills needed to fight the Basilisks and other threats, demonstrating your prowess as a warrior.  Skill in battle is needed when proper negotiations break down.\n\nTo ask me for promotion demonstrates desire, and without desire success will always escape your grasp.\n\nYou have all of the traits necessary to hold the title of Patriarch.  I will notify to Council upon my return.  It would be my pleasure to travel with you again.  You can find me in the Inn in Ravenshore."
msgstr "考瑞看着你队伍中的黑暗精灵：\n由于你们救出了我，因此，你们必然研究过我曾经踏过的道路，调查过我曾经去过的地方。这展现了你拥有可以处理周遭细微事物的超凡能力。\n要抵达我被困住的地方，你们必须拥有击败石化蜥蜴和其它威胁的能力，证明了你们身为战士的资格。当沟通失败的时候，有时你们必须要拥有战斗的力量。\n要求我让你们晋升则展现了足够的欲望。如果你们没有足够的欲望，成功永远都会逃出你的掌握。\n你们拥有了所有黑暗精灵长所需要的特点，当我回到议会之后，我将会通知他们。如果能够和诸位再度一起旅行，这将会是我的荣幸。你们可以在渡鸦海滨的旅馆找到我。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:29
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I need to investigate the Circle of Stone further for the Temple of the Sun.  Hopefully not all of the pilgrims met the fate of these. Hopefully there are survivors!\n\nSomething has agitated the creatures in this area, and I think the source can be found in the Circle."
msgstr "我必须要协助太阳神庙再进一步地调查这圣石圈。希望不是所有的信徒都遭遇到了相同的命运。希望还有人活下来！\n有什么力量刺激了这区域的怪物，我想来源应该就在圣石圈之中。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:30
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You know…I have a power stone that will activate the portal to the abandoned temple. And you have one that will allow us to reach the island where that portal is!\n\nIf we joined forces, we could reach the temple with ease. What say you?\n\nFredrick Talimere offers to join your party."
msgstr "你知道吗……我有一个可以启动废弃神庙中传送门的能源之石，而你拥有另一个可以把我们传送到该处的能源之石！\n如果我们合作，我们可以轻易地抵达该座神庙。你说呢？\n\n费德瑞克·塔米尔提议加入你的队伍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:33
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:33
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You come to me claiming to have a message from one of my caravan masters. Well, where is it then? If it was so important, perhaps you should have been better about not losing it along the way!"
msgstr "你来这里声称手中握有我的一名车队队长所写的亲笔信。哼哼，这信到哪里去了？如果这信那么重要，相信你不可能会在路上把它弄丢吧！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:34
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What is this? A letter from caravan master, Dadeross? Let's see…hmmm…\n\nWell, it seems that serious events are afoot. It is a pity--what has happened on Dagger Wound. Serious action may need to be taken, but I require more information…\n\n…and I think I know how to get it! Perhaps you would be interested in helping me? I will compensate you, of course. And, here. Take this as payment for delivering Dadeross' letter."
msgstr "这是什么？我的车队队长寄来的信？达德洛斯？让我看看……嗯嗯……\n看来的确有很严重的事情发生了。真可惜，匕伤群岛上发生了这么可怕的事情。我们必须要采取行动，但是我必须要有更多的情报才行……\n……我想我知道该怎么弄到那么多情报！也许你们可以帮助我？当然，我会补偿你的。来，这是送来达德洛斯信件的一点小报酬。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:35
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The local smugglers have the fastest boats in Ravenshore. If these were available to my agents, they could make quick scouting missions up and down the coast so we could see the extent of the cataclysm mentioned in Dadeross' letter.\n\nHere. Bring this letter to the smuggler leader, Arion Hunter. I'm sure it will \"persuade\" him to lend his services. You'll find his hideout westward up the coast.\n\nOh, I almost forgot. The smugglers--they're wererats--and you know how they can be. Hunter can be reasoned with, but don't be surprised if his crew is less than civil."
msgstr "此地的走私贩子拥有渡鸦海滨最快的船。如果我的信差们可以拥有这些船，他们将可以在沿岸执行快速的侦察任务，让我们可以知道达德洛斯信中所提到的大灾变到底是什么样状况。\n来。把这封信带给走私贩子的首脑，艾瑞安·韩特。我很确定这可以“说服”他提供相关的服务。你将可以在西方的海岸边找到他的老巢。\n喔，我几乎忘了先提。这些走私者都是鼠人，你也知道他们的恶形恶状。韩特可以被说服，但是他的手下可能就没有那么文明了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:36
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:36
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Listen. We need those boats! Deliver my letter to Arion Hunter. Did you forget? His lair is to the west, up the coast!"
msgstr "听着。我们需要这些船！把这封信交给韩特，难道你忘记了吗？他的巢穴就在西边的海岸边！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:37
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Very good, and here is the payment we agreed upon. Hunter's boats will be useful to us through the crisis.\n\nYes, \"crisis,\" I say! Since your initial visit, several other caravans have missed their scheduled stops. There are also the rumors. Twice I've heard of the appearance of a burning lake of fire rising out of the desert.\n\nVolcanoes! Lakes of fire! I fear the mysterious crystal has something to do with it. In any event, the guildmasters in Alvar must be informed!"
msgstr "很好，这就是我们之前同意的报酬。韩特的船只将可以供我们在整场危机的过程中使用。\n是的，我的确就是指这次的“危机”！自从你上次拜访此处之后，有好几个班次的商队都没有照着原先的时间抵达指定的地点。而且还有一些奇怪的谣言。我听说有燃烧的火湖突然之间出现在沙漠中。\n火山！火湖！我担心这个神秘的水晶和这件事情有关。不管如何，阿尔瓦商人公会的会长都必须要知道最新阶段的发展。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:38
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As you may be aware, our guild headquarters is located in the city of Alvar. If you've never been there, the easiest way to reach it is to follow the river up through the canyon to the north.\n\nGo to the guild house and find Bastian Loudrin. Tell him about the crystal, and the rumors. Lourdrin will know what to do."
msgstr "可能你也注意到了，我们公会的总部座落在阿尔瓦。如果你从没去过那个地方，要到那边最简单的方法是沿着河往上走，往北边穿过峡谷。\n去那里的公会聚会所找一个叫做巴斯沈·卢德林的人。告诉他有关这个水晶的状况，以及其它的许多传言。卢德林会知道该怎么做。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:39
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:39
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must reach Bastian Loudrin in Alvar. Go! He must be informed of recent events!"
msgstr "你一定要去阿尔瓦找巴斯沈·卢德林。快点！他一定要知道最近发生了什么事情！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:41
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You did all that to my guards just to deliver a letter! Let me see that…\n\n…hmmm…Fellmoon wants my boats? Never! I…what!…he threatens my Irabelle…I…I…sigh…\n\nV-very well. You can tell Fellmoon he can have my boats. I guess there's no refusing the Merchants of Alvar what they want."
msgstr "你……你把我所有的守卫都……只为了送这封信！让我看看……\n……嗯嗯，费尔蒙想要我的船？绝不可能……我……什么？他用我的伊拉贝尔威胁我……我……唉……\n好，好吧。你可以告诉费尔蒙尽管用我的船吧。我想这世界上没有任何人可以拒绝阿尔瓦商人公会所提出的要求。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:42
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:42
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My cargoes are not the kind that want inspecting by harbor officials so my boats have to be, and are, the fastest on the coast of Jadame. They can even outrun a Regnan galley! From here they run west to Ravage Roaming and east to Shadowspire."
msgstr "我的货柜是那种你不想要让港口官员检查的东西，所以，我的船必须要是贾丹姆大陆上最快的船才行。他们甚至可以跑得比雷格那海盗的大船要快！他们的通常航道从这边开始，西到残破镇，东到阴影塔。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:43
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ancient Troll legends tell of a time when we did not live here in this desolate region.  They tell of a place that was quiet and tranquil.  We were driven from this place by the Curse of the Stone.  So for many hundred years we have dwelt here upon the Sand of Iron.  Now it seems we will be forced from this place as well.  The growing sea of fire has destroyed most of my village.  Many friends and family have perished.  This may indeed be the end of my Clan.\n\nThere is a saying amongst my people, \"a thing lives only as long as it is remembered.\"  As long as I remember our homeland, then it will always be there for us to return too.  It just needs to be found."
msgstr "古代的巨魔传说中，曾经有一段时间，我们并不是居住在这个孤立、残破的地区。传说中提到了一个宁静、祥和的地方，我们被石头的诅咒所驱赶。所以我们在铁沙漠中居住了好几百年的时间。现在看起来，我们又必须被迫离开这个地方。这个不停扩展的火湖摧毁了我们村庄大部分的地区。我的朋友和家人都在这场灾难中过世了。这很有可能就是我们部族的末日。\n我们的同胞还有一句俗谚，“必须有人记得，一样东西才会继续存在。”只要我还记得我们的家园，它就会继续等待我们的回归。我们只需要找到这个传说中的地方就好了。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:44
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Perhaps if you could locate our previous homeland, and check to see if the Curse of the Stone still exists.  If it does perhaps there is a way to remove it.  Any Troll in your party who completes this task would be promoted to War Troll of our Clan. Many honors are bestowed with this title, and you would be forever known to us as a legendary hero.\n\nOne of our warriors, Dartin Dunewalker, set out to find this place.  He left thinking he would find clues among the stone fields of Ravage Roaming.  Perhaps you can find him there and work together--or at the least, find clues that will lead you to our goal."
msgstr "也许，如果你可以替我们找到我们古代家园，替我们看看到底石之诅咒是否还继续存在于该处。如果诅咒还没有消除，请找到消除它的方法。如果你完成了这个任务，在你队伍中的巨魔将会被晋升为我们部族中的战斗巨魔。这是个拥有极高荣誉的称号，你们会永远被我的族人撰写在传说之中。\n我们的一名战士达丁·都沃克出发去寻找这个地方。他留下的一些笔记让我们知道他认为在残破镇的岩石区可以找到一些相关的线索。也许你可以在那边找到他，并且和他一起努力。或者，至少找到可以让你完成任务的线索。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:49
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:49
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks for finding our Ancient Home, once the treat to Jadame has been handled we can begin to move there!"
msgstr "多谢你替我们找到了古代巨魔之家，一旦我们让贾丹姆大陆脱离了目前的危机，我们就可以搬到那里去了！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:51
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Disaster in Dagger Wound, too? This is indeed disturbing. If one were to believe all the rumors, one would think that all of Jadame is in upheaval and chaos.\n\nI wish I knew more. I rely on our caravan masters for news, but all who were supposed to arrive here this month have not. What I do hear, troubles me. Hurricanes, floods, and now a volcano! The worst I've heard is that a sea of fire has appeared in the Ironsand Desert--and this from many sources.\n\nI wonder if this crystal in Ravenshore has something to do with it. Its appearance at the onset of the calamity seems to be more than a coincidence."
msgstr "匕伤群岛上也有恐怖的危机发生了吗？这真是让人感到困扰。如果有人相信目前到处流传的所有谣言，那么他们将会以为贾丹姆大陆已经陷入了全面的危机和混乱之中。\n我真希望我能够知道更多的消息。我本来都是倚靠我的车队提供相关的情报，但是这个月预计要到达的车队有很多都延迟了。而我所听到的消息让我感到十分的困扰。飓风、洪水，现在还有火山！我所听到最糟糕的消息是铁沙漠中央出现了一个滚烫的火湖，而且还有许多消息来源证实了这个消息。\n不知道在渡鸦海滨的这个水晶是否和这一切有关系。看起来这一切混乱同时出现并不单纯只是巧合。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:52
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All of this upheaval is seriously impacting our guild's business. I need more information, but I'm being buried in gossip and rumor.\n\nMany tell me of this sea of fire in the Ironsand Desert. I've heard the tale enough that I almost believe it. Confirmation or denial of the lake's existence would be of great help to me.\n\nIf you would serve me, go to the Ironsand Desert and seek this lake. If it is indeed there, find me someone who saw it appear. Bring him back here so I can hear his story myself."
msgstr "这一切混乱的状况都对我们公会的运作造成了很大的影响。我需要更多的情报，但是目前却被谣言和绘声绘影的传说所掩盖了。\n许多人告诉我铁沙漠中央出现了一个火焰之湖。我听说了有关这个火湖的许多谣言，几乎让我相信了这个怪异的传说。如果你能够证明或是否定这个传说，对我将会有很大的意义。\n如果你愿意帮我一个忙，请去铁沙漠寻找这个火湖。如果火湖的确出现在沙漠中，请替我找到一个目击火湖出现的证人。把他带回这里来，让我可以亲自听听火湖的故事。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:53
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I must know more about what is going on in the Ironsand Desert. I can't use more rumors. I have enough of those already.\n\nI need you to actually go there. The desert is several days travel to the east."
msgstr "我必须要知道铁沙漠中到底发生了什么事情，谣言我已经听得够多了。\n你必须要往东走几天的路，前往铁沙漠去彻底调查真正的状况。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:54
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, so it is true. Imagine…a lake of fire. But where is my eyewitness? I need to speak with someone who saw its formation. This is important…for reasons I'm unwilling to discuss with you now.\n\nFind me someone who saw the birth of the lake of fire! Try searching the Troll village, Rust."
msgstr "啊，原来这是真的。想像一下……一个火焰构成的大湖。但是我的目击证人在哪里？我必须要和亲眼目击火湖出现的证人谈谈。这很重要，原因我现在还没办法告诉你。\n替我找个真正看到火湖出现的证人！试着去巨魔的村庄——铁锈镇找找看吧！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:55
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must form an alliance to stand against our threatened oblivion! Seek support from the Necromancers' Guild, Temple of the Sun, Minotaurs of Ravage Roaming, Dragons of Garrote Gorge, and the Dragon hunting party of Charles Quixote in Garrote Gorge. I'm sure that you will find it impossible to get all of them to agree to work together, but still, you must make your best effort.\n\nIf we are to survive in this time of prophecy, my sages tell me that at least three of the groups I mentioned must agree to work together. Go and do this thing. If you value this world and your lives, go!"
msgstr "你必须要组织一个联盟，对抗我们眼前的末日威胁！你必须要去找寻太阳神庙、死灵法师公会、残破镇的牛头人、绞刑峡谷的龙、绞刑峡谷的猎龙人查尔斯·吉柯德。我知道你没办法让他们全部团结在一起，但是，你依旧必须要先尽力尝试才行。\n如果我们要逃过这一切危机，不让预言成真，我的智者告诉我至少要让前面所提到的势力中有三个同意加入这个联盟。如果你珍惜这个世界和自己的生命，赶快去完成这个任务吧！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:56
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have done what I feared was impossible. Though these times are fraught with uncertainties, that you have united key factions of Jadame goes a long way towards securing our continued existence.\n\nWell, I have done what I can. I leave the defense of the land to the alliance council. I hope they find the accommodations I have provided them in Ravenshore to be adequate--the guild house there is not our most luxurious. Still, I though it would be best if the council was located near the crystal.\n\nI wish them, and you, good luck!"
msgstr "你完成了我原先认为是不可能的任务。虽然这些日子中，整个世界面对了许多的不确定性，但是你能够让关键的势力团结在一起面对末日，已经迈出了极大的一步。\n嗯，我已经完成了我的任务。我必须要将保护整个世界的工作交给联盟议会。我希望他们能够接受我在渡鸦海滨这里替他们所布置的会议室。毕竟这座屋子并不是我们最豪华的居所，但是，我希望议会能够靠近这个神秘的水晶。\n我希望他们，还有你们，都能够获得足够的好运！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:57
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes, I was here when the lake of fire first appeared. A strange gateway appeared on the desert plain outside the village. The fire you see spilled forth from it. The fire spread like water poured on the ground.\n\nA wave of flames rushed over the edge of the village. Most of my people were lost instantly. What remains of this village is as you see it.\n\nI was in the hills overlooking the village when this all happened. I saw it all, but I can hardly believe it."
msgstr "是的，当火湖出现的时候，我就在那附近。一个怪异的传送门出现在村庄外面的沙漠中。你目前所看见的火焰就是从里面流　出来的。那些火焰看起来就像是水流泼在地面上一样地扩散。\n一波强烈的火焰盖过了我们的村庄，我大多数的同胞立刻就丧生了。现在这座村庄就是当时灾变之后仅剩的残骸。\n当这一切发生的时候，我正好在外面的山丘上观看这一切。这些怪异的状况我都目击了，但我实在很难相信这一切。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:58
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I would come with you, If it were not for my father. So deep is his mourning for my brother, Vilebite, that he cannot care for himself.\n\nMy father believes that Vilebite's soul cannot rest until his remains are at rest in the village tomb. Unfortunately, Gogs infested the tomb when the lake of fire appeared.\n\nHere! Take my brother's ashes. I'm sure my father's grief will lessen if they are placed in the tomb. Do this for me and I will travel with you to Alvar."
msgstr "如果不是因为我的父亲，我会愿意和你一起去的。他因为我的兄弟维尔拜而太过悲伤，没有办法照顾自己。\n我的父亲相信在维尔拜的尸骨安葬在村庄的墓穴中以前，他的灵魂没有办法安息。很不幸地，当火湖出现的时候，哥魔立刻就占据了我们的墓穴。\n来！这是我兄弟的骨灰。如果它们能够被安放在墓穴中，我相信我的父亲会好过一些。替我完成这个任务，我就愿意和你一起前往阿尔瓦。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:59
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:59
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will go with you only after my brother's ashes are safely in the village tomb."
msgstr "在我兄弟的骨灰被安放在村庄的墓穴中之后，我才能够跟你一起走。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:60
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:60
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have done my family a great service. With his ashes safe in the holy sanctuary of the village tomb, Vilebite can lie in peace. My father, too is greatly improved. We have talked and I believe that he can now take care of himself while I accompany you to Alvar."
msgstr "你帮了我家人一个大忙。在你把我兄弟维尔拜的骨灰放进墓穴中之后，他终于可以安息了。我父亲的情况也大为改进了。我已经和他谈过话了，我相信他可以在我和你前往阿尔瓦的过程中照顾自己。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:61
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:61
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Vilebite was a good son. I will miss him. But at least I can take comfort knowing that he is at peace. Thank you for your kind and heroic deed."
msgstr "维尔拜是个好儿子，我会想念他的。至少现在我知道他的骨灰已经放进墓穴中，他可以安息了。多谢你替我们完成这么危险的工作。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:71
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You found Blazen Stormlance?  What about MY spear Ebonest?  You have that as well?\n\nFANTASTIC!\n\nI thank you for this and find myself in your debt!  I will promote all knights in your party to Champion and teach what skills I can to the rest of your party. "
msgstr "你找到了布拉森·暴风枪？我的艾邦斯特屠龙枪呢？你也找到了它吗？\n太棒了！\n感谢你替我作的这一切，我欠你很多！我愿意将你队伍中的所有骑士晋升为勇士，并且教导其馀的队员我所专精的技能。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:72
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What is this?  You ally with my mortal enemies and then seek to do me a favor?\n\nI wonder what the Dragons think of this. But so be it.  I am in your debt for returning Ebonest to me.  I will promote any Knights in your party to Champion, however they will never be accepted in my service.  The rest I will teach what I can. \n\nI do not wish to see you again!"
msgstr "这是怎么一回事？你和我的死敌联盟，现在又想要帮我的忙？\n不知道飞龙们对这件事情会有什么样的看法。管它的。反正你把艾邦斯特屠龙枪还给我，我就欠你一次。我愿意将你队伍中的任何骑士晋升为勇士，不过他们没有资格在我的麾下工作。我则会教导其它人我所会的技能。\n我不想要再看到你们！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:73
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "\"An alliance to unite Jadame,\" you say. If it wasn't Lordrin who was proposing it, I would normally have slain you for my supper.\n\nWhile intriguing, I cannot consider the idea now. We are under daily attack by the accursed knights of Charles Quixote. If he were not a problem, I could do as Lordrin asks.\n\nPerhaps you could help me with Quixote?"
msgstr "你们刚刚说，“结盟，将贾丹姆大陆统一在一起。”如果不是卢德林提议这件事情，我早就把你宰了当早餐。\n虽然这个点子很有趣，但是我现在没有空闲考虑这个建议。我们每天都受到查尔斯·吉柯德旗下的骑士攻击。如果他们不再骚扰我们，我就可以考虑卢德林的建议。\n也许你们可以帮我料理吉柯德？"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:74
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Last month one of Quixote's raiding parties invaded our caves. They slew many and took with them the egg containing my unborn heir. While those foul slayers hold the egg, we cannot attack their encampment.\n\nIf you were to return the egg to me, I could destroy Quixote. Do this for me and I will join your alliance."
msgstr "上个月吉柯德派了一小群人入侵我们的洞穴。他们杀死了很多龙，并且夺走了我们那些还没孵化的龙蛋。只要这些死家伙还挟持龙蛋，我们就不能够攻击他们的营地。\n如果你们能够将龙蛋归还给我们，我就可以直接了当地杀死吉柯德。只要你替我完成这个任务，我就加入你的联盟。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:75
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:75
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you want me to join your alliance, you will have to help me against Charles Quixote. Bring me the Dragon egg he stole from me!"
msgstr "如果你想要我加入联盟，你就得要协助我对付吉柯德，还不快把龙蛋带来给我！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:83
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmmm…things must be serious if trader Loudrin is involving himself in matters other than his own fortunes...and I must say that there is a taint of doom in the air.\n\nIf only for continued good business between my operation and his, I would normally entertain this notion of Loudrin's. Unfortunately, matters here are tying up all of my resources. I have none to spare for support of this alliance you speak of.\n\nSay, perhaps we can help each other? If you were to take care of a little matter for me, I could consider honoring your request."
msgstr "嗯嗯……如果卢德林这个奸商都开始关切他的财富之外的事情，事态一定变得非常严重……我也必须承认，空气中也似乎有着末日即将到来的味道。\n如果在一般的状况下，我很愿意加入这个联盟，只为了维持我和卢德林之间的良好关系。很遗憾的，我目前手上的资源都被困住了，没有办法抽出多馀的资源来协助他处理这个所谓的联盟。\n或者我们可以彼此帮一把？如果你能够帮我个小忙，我可以考虑接受你的建议。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:84
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "One of my customers, an Ogre that goes by the charming moniker of \"Zog the Jackal,\" has seriously betrayed my trust. I gave him an item of great value on promise of future payment. This rather large payment never arrived. I sent a messenger to demand return of the item--a Dragon's egg of great potential. This messenger was slain!\n\nNeedless to say, this matter concerns me greatly. I have allotted both money and men for the purpose of revenge. If, however, you were to recover the egg for me from Zog's fortress in Ravage Roaming, I would be glad to pledge service to your alliance."
msgstr "我的一名顾客，有个很有魅力的称号——食人妖“豺狼索格”，它背弃了我的信任。我给了他一个很有价值的物品，他也答应未来会付尾款，但是这尾款再也没有出现过。我派了一名信差去要求归还这个物品，龙蛋是个非常稀少的宝物！但这个信差竟然被杀害了。\n不用说，这件事情让我很困扰，我花费了很多的人力和金钱想要复仇。如果，你能够从索格在残破镇的要塞中替我找回龙蛋，我将会很高兴加入你的联盟。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:85
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Have you recovered the Dragon egg from Zog's Ravage Roaming fortress? Oh, never mind. I can see from your abashed expression that you have not.\n\nI stand firm on our deal. Bring me that egg, or I'll have nothing to do with your alliance!"
msgstr "你从索格在残破镇的要塞拿回了龙蛋吗？喔，别开口，我从你挫败的表情中看得出来你又失败了。\n我很坚持原先的提议。你不把龙蛋带来，我就不会加入你的联盟。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:88
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You would like my herd to join into an alliance? How could I refuse you? Not only have you saved us from certain death, we have suffered directly from the cataclysm the alliance is being created to fight!\n\nYou have my pledge. With the greatest haste I myself will travel to Ravenshore to take a seat on the alliance council."
msgstr "你想要我的同胞加入你的联盟吗？我怎么可能拒绝你？你不只让我们逃出了死亡的命运，联盟所对抗的灾难还让我们受到了重大的损失！\n我们都听从你的命令。我自己将会全速赶到渡鸦海滨，加入联盟议会的行列中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:89
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:89
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It was the worst of horrors! I was on guard in the main labyrinth just north of here when the waters came. A great wave as high as my head flooded through the passages. I managed to reach this high chamber. I waited for others, but there were none. I fear that many of the herd are dead or trapped inside the lair."
msgstr "那实在恐怖极了！我当时正在此地北边的主迷宫中站岗。和我人一样高的巨浪突然之间涌进隧道之中。我勉强冲到这个高地，我花了很多时间等待其它人，但他们一直没有出现。恐怕我的同胞有很多人已经去世，或者是还被困在巢穴中。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:90
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Balthazar Lair has many levels. There are other chambers as high as this one., so there may be others who have survived.\n\nI have thought long on this. Though many of the tunnels are flooded, it may be possible to drain them using the doors and air vents as valves. In fact, the whole lair could be drained through the lower level escape tunnel. Help my herd! You would have our eternal gratitude."
msgstr "巴尔萨煞巢穴拥有很多不同的高度，有其它的洞穴和这个洞穴一样高，所以可能有很多其它人都活了下来。\n有关于这次的事件，我想了很久。虽然有很多隧道都已经淹入水中，但是你还是可以利用门和通气管道当做排水的通道。事实上，整个巢穴中的积水可以通过打开底层的逃生管道而把水排干。救救我的同胞！你将会赢得他们永恒的敬意！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:91
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:91
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I just feel it. There are still survivors of my herd trapped in the lair. If you can figure out how to drain the water from flooded passages, you may be able to reach them. Help them, I beg of you!"
msgstr "我可以感觉到。巢穴中还有活下来的人。只要你能够搞清楚如何把水排出去，你就可以救出他们！求求你们，救救我的同胞！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:92
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:92
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Balthazar, the greatest leader in the history of our herd, led our warriors in a mighty battle against the Dark Dwarf vermin that erupt from the earth and spread like a plague. It was not a battle that went well for us. Though Balthazar and some warriors escaped, many were lost along with Balthazar's Axe--his regalia of office, and a powerful artifact as well."
msgstr "巴尔萨煞是我族中历史上最伟大的领袖，他带领着我们和像是病毒一样从地面钻出，并且四处扩散的黑暗矮人搏斗。这场战斗并不顺利。虽然巴尔萨煞和一些战士逃了出来，但是巴尔萨煞之斧（也是他的地位象征）以及许多战士都一起在这场战争中失踪了。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:117
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have brought everything needed to perform the transformation!  So be it!  All necromancer’s in your party will be transformed into Liches!  May the dark energies flow through them for all eternity!  The rest of you will gain what knowledge I can teach them as reward for their assistance!  Lets begin!\n\nAfter we have completed, good friend Lathean can handle any future promotions for your party."
msgstr "你已经把转换仪式所需要的所有道具都带回来了！那就这样吧！你队伍中所有的死灵法师都会变成巫妖！愿黑暗之力从此永远在他们的体内流动！你们其它人将可以从我这边学到相关的技能，算是我的报答！开始吧！\n在我们的工作完成之后，我的好友拉席安将会负责诸位未来的晋升。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:123
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:123
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must be a member of this guild to study here."
msgstr "你必须要成为公会的一员才能够在此学习。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:137
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Games are played with the house Arcomage deck. We will supply the opponent.  Victory conditions vary per inn. Build your tower, destroy your opponent's tower, or collect enough resources before your opponent does. \n\nLarge yellow numbers in column are the generators. This is how many new units of a particular resource you will receive on your next turn. Small black numbers in column are the resources. This is how many units you have available to spend on your current turn.\n\nCards: Each have their own cost to play, indicated in a small circle in the lower right corner of the card. The cost will be deducted from your resources according to the color of the card.  Left click on a card plays the card. Right click on a card to discard without playing.\n\nRed represents your Quarry Generator which produces your Brick resources, blue represents your Magic Generator which produces Gem resources, green represents your Zoo generator which produces Beast resources. \n"
msgstr "你们将用我们的牌来进行游戏。我们会给你们选个对手。每个旅店玩牌的胜利条件各不相同。反正就是要把自己的城堡造好，摧毁对方的城堡，或者赶在对手之前收集到足够的资源。\n黄色的大数字是产量计数器，它代表你们下个回合可以得到的资源的数量。黑色的小数字表示现有资源，也就是本回合你们可以使用的资源数量。\n牌：每张牌右下角小圆圈里面的数字表明它的资源消耗量。消耗的资源种类由每张牌的颜色而定。左键点击一张牌即可出牌。右键点击一张牌表示弃牌。\n红色的“采石场”生产砖头，蓝色的“魔法阵”生产宝石，绿色的“地下城”生产怪物。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:157
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Bastian Loudrin has been a great friend to the guild. Sadly, I must refuse his request at this time. Even as we speak, my guild is embroiled in a battle for its very survival. For you see, the Temple of the Sun has declared a holy war on us. Most of our members are away in the fields either leading armies or raising zombies to serve in them.\n\nI wish I could say otherwise, but the accursed temple holds the upper hand. If only the balance would tilt in our favor."
msgstr "巴斯沈·卢德林一直是我和公会的好友。很遗憾的，我这次必须要拒绝他的要求。即使是现在，我的公会也正努力地奋战，担心一场失败会危及我们的生存。因为，你也知道，太阳神庙已经对我们展开了一场圣战。我大部分的同志不是正在战场上作战，就是正在唤醒僵尸来协助这场战争。\n我希望我不用说得这么明白，但是那个该死的神庙目前占了上风，如果我们能够反败为胜就好了。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:158
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If we had the Nightshade Brazier back in our possession, Shadowspire's defense would not be an issue. We could bring this war to the doors of the Sun Temple. We would annihilate them!\n\nKnowing its importance, the clerics keep the brazier in a secure chamber deep within their temple. Dyson Leland believes he can gain access to that chamber. Bring him to the temple, recover the brazier and return it to me. You want me in your alliance? Well, do this for me, and I will be in your debt.\n\nIf you have any questions about the Nightshade Brazier ask Thant. It was he who created the thing."
msgstr "只要我们能够把龙葵灯炉夺回来，阴影塔的防卫就不会再有任何的问题了。我们可以把这场战争带到太阳神庙的大门前。我们将可以将他们通通消灭！\n由于他们知道这样东西的重要性，牧师们将这样东西放到他们神庙的最深处。戴森·李蓝认为他可以进入这个内殿。你只需要把他带到神庙去，找回那个炉子，带回那个炉子给我。你想要我加入你们的联盟吗？你只要能够替我完成这个任务，我就欠你一次。\n如果你们对于这个龙葵灯炉还有任何的问题，请去问谭特。是他创造了这个宝物。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:159
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:159
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will not join you until the security of the guild is secure. Bring me the Nightshade Brazier from the Temple of the Sun in Murmurwoods. We will talk again of alliance after that is done."
msgstr "在我们公会的安全获得保障之前，我不会加入你的联盟。请你将太阳神庙中的龙葵灯炉从低语森林带过来给我。在那之后，我们再来讨论有关联盟的这件事情。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:160
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Early on our conflict, the Sun Temple attempted to infiltrate our ranks with a spy. Such foolishness--thinking they could so easily deceive a host of dark magicians!\n\nIt was child's play to unmask their agent--one \"Dyson Leland.\" Since then we have turned him against his former masters, or so it would seem. Frankly, I don't entirely trust in his loyalty. Still, he has proven useful. As long as he does, we will continue to let him live."
msgstr "在我们的冲突刚开始的时候，太阳神庙派了一名信徒来渗透我们的阵营。真是太愚笨了，他们竟然认为自己可以欺骗一群黑魔法师！\n要揭穿这个戴森·李蓝的身份实在太简单了。从那之后，我们就让他成了出卖自己同伴的人。至少表面上是这样。说实话，我并不相信这个家伙的忠诚。不过，他依旧有他的用处。至少在这点还成立的时候，我们会让他继续活下去。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:161
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "How can anyone's quest for power bring him to participate in the horrors of the Dark Path? And yet, here is a whole house of them! Oh, they will call themselves \"seekers of knowledge,\" but these magicians of death are abomination! Loathsome corruption incarnate!\n\nOnly through my own fear can the foul Necromancers' Guild call itself \"my master.\""
msgstr "怎么可能有任何人愿意为了力量而忍受黑暗之路的恐怖？但是，这里竟然有这么样的一群人！喔，他们竟然还胆敢叫自己“知识的追求者”，这些家伙根本是种低贱的传染病！寄生虫！\n只因为我对于自己的恐惧，这个该死的死灵法师公会才能够认为自己是我的主人。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:162
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When I was young, all I wanted to do was to join the Order of Light--to be a selfless servant of the good. As soon as I was of age, I entered the Temple of the Sun with a heart filled with the fire of purity.\n\nWhat a fool I was. If there is goodness in the world, I have not seen it. There is certainly none in the halls of the Sun Temple! Hiding behind the righteousness of sanctity, Order members perform the worst crimes of greed and self-indulgence. If it were not so horrid, it would pass for something like irony."
msgstr "当我还年轻的时候，我满脑子想的都是如何加入光之教派的事情。我想要成为善良之道无私、奉献的仆人。当我到了适当的年纪之后，我的心中充满了洁净的火焰，义无反顾地踏进了太阳神庙。\n我真是蠢到家了。如果世界上还有任何的善良和正义，我恐怕早就错失了他们。太阳神庙的圣殿中根本没有所谓的善良！这些躲在善良大旗底下的走狗，以善良之名干尽一切肮脏的罪恶、自私、独断。如果不是因为他们的行为太过肮脏，我可能还会觉得这样的状况非常讽刺。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:163
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A few months ago, I was called to a private audience with the Sun Temple head priest, Oskar Tyre. He sent me out on a mission of infiltration against the Necromancers' Guild. \"Become as they are,\" he said. \"Gain their trust. While you bide your time waiting to deliver a killing blow, feed us their secrets.\"\n\nA too simple plan from too simple a leader! Oh, I did as he said, bathing myself in evil so I might seem evil. But it was as if the guild could see into my heart. I was unmasked as a spy. Under threat of death, I now follow their orders. "
msgstr "几个月之前，太阳神庙的大主教——奥斯卡·提尔秘密召见我。他派我去渗透死灵法师公会。“成为他们的一份子，”他说。“获取他们的信任。当你准备好给予他们致命一击的时候，把秘密告诉我们。”\n这是一个头脑简单的人想出的简单计划！喔，我的确照着他所说的去作了，尽可能地让自己沐浴在邪恶之中，让自己成为邪恶之人。但是，彷佛公会可以直视我的内心一般，我间谍的身份被揭穿了。他们威胁要杀死我，所以我现在听从他们的命令。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:164
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:164
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Join with you? An interesting idea. But what can you offer me? After all I have been through I find myself consumed with a thirst for revenge. I would go with you, but am unwilling to spend my efforts lightly. Give me an opportunity to hurt one of my enemies--the cursed Temple of the Sun or the abominable Necromancers' Guild--and I will travel with you gladly."
msgstr "加入你？这个点子真有趣。但是你能够给我什么呢？在我经历了这一切之后，我心中只剩下了复仇的火焰。我愿意和你一起走，但是我不愿意轻易浪费自己的力气。给我一个机会，让我可以打击我的敌人，不管是该死的太阳神庙或是邪恶的死灵法师公会都好，我就愿意和你一起走！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:165
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:165
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now that the Nightshade Brazier covers Shadowspire in its fortifying darkness. Thant goes to lead his minions."
msgstr "现在，龙葵灯炉已经回来了，阴影塔已经开始在黑暗中统筹军队。谭特得要带领他的部队准备出发了。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:166
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Certainly the elemental unrest concerns us greatly. Why one need travel only a short distance north from our temple to see a great maelstrom of unnatural duration and fury. But sadly we have other matters pressing.\n\nThe sick horror that is the Necromancers' Guild must be blighted from this land! We wage holy war on the evil in Shadowspire. Our entire spirit and power goes into the campaign we wage against Sandro and his minions. Until that is done we cannot entertain participation in your alliance."
msgstr "元素的骚动的确让我们非常关切。为什么呢？你只要从我们的神庙往北走一小段距离，你就可以看到一个强烈到让人吃惊的漩涡。真可惜，我们目前手上有很紧迫的事情必须处理。\n死灵法师公会这群该死的寄生虫必须被清除！我们已经对阴影塔地区的邪恶展开了一场圣战。我们的全心全灵都投入了和山德罗以及他手下的战斗中。在这工作完成之前，我们无法加入你的联盟。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:167
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Then again, we could spare some resources for your alliance if the war would turn in our favor. Perhaps you could be our agent of fortune?\n\nInside the Necromancers' Guild is a device known as the \"Skeleton Transformer.\" It converts living creatures into the skeletons which the dark mages use for the bulk of their reinforcements. If it were destroyed, we would quickly have the upper hand.\n\nWe have an agent, Dyson Leland, placed in their guild. Find him and help him to wreck their skeleton making device. Do this and I will consider your request more favorably."
msgstr "不过，如果我们占了上风，我们应该可以派出一些人力和物力协助你们。也许你愿意助我们一臂之力？\n在死灵法师公会内部，有个被称为“骷髅转换器”的装置。它可以将活生生的生物转换成骷髅，变成黑暗法师们的士兵。如果我们可以摧毁这个装置，我们就可以很快地在这场战争中占上风。\n我们在公会中安排了一个卧底间谍戴森·李蓝。去找到他，并且协助他摧毁这个制造骷髅的机器。你只要完成这个任务，我就会更认真地考虑你的提议。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:168
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:168
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You come here again with talk of alliance? I have told you what you must do. Go to the Necromancers' Guild in Shadowspire, find Dyson Leland and help him to destroy their Skeleton Transformer!"
msgstr "你来这边再度讨论有关联盟的问题？我已经告诉你该怎么做了。赶快去阴影塔地区寻找戴森·李蓝，协助他摧毁那个骷髅转换器！快点！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:169
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent work! With the Skeleton Transformer destroyed, I am more than confident that the light of righteousness will cleanse Shadowspire of evil. The Necromancers' Guild is as good as no more.\n\nAs I agreed, you may now consider the Temple of the Sun an ally against the elemental cataclysm. I myself will sit on your alliance council in Ravenshore. I will make my departure arrangements with all due haste."
msgstr "干得好！在摧毁了骷髅转换器之后，我相信我们更有把握可以在光明的照耀之下摧毁阴影塔地区的邪恶。死灵法师公会已经如风中残烛了。\n如同我之前同意的，太阳神庙现在已经加入对抗元素灾变的阵营。我自己将会前往渡鸦海滨加入议会。我会尽快安排好一切，赶快赶到渡鸦海滨去。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:170
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:170
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you take the prophecy so lightly that you shirk the role it has cast for you? These are dire times calling for dire actions from all. Go forth across the land and forge the unity represented by the alliance. Go, unless you favor the oblivion that threatens us!"
msgstr "难道因为你太过轻视预言，导致你忽视了自己在预言中的地位？时机紧迫，我们也必须采用非常手段。赶快统合所有的势力，让他们团结成强大的联盟。快去，除非你对眼前的毁灭视而不见！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:171
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:171
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Using Arion Hunter's boats we have managed to gather some information. I sent one to Ravage Roaming and another to the Dagger Wound Islands. It is reported that strange portal gateways have appeared in both regions. The gateway in the islands stands on the slopes of the large volcano that rose from the sea southeast of the main island. The Ravage Roaming portal is in the middle of the large lake. It is said that the water which formed the lake flooded out of the gateway."
msgstr "你可以利用艾瑞安·韩特的船只来收集更多的情报。我派了一艘船去残破镇，另外一艘船去匕伤群岛。根据报告，这两个地区都出现了神秘的传送门。岛上的传送门就出现在主岛东南方的火山山坡上。残破镇的传送门就在一个大湖的中央。据说构成那座湖的水是从传送门之中源源流出的。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:172
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Within hours of our first meeting, a most fortuitous development occurred. We were contacted by a great sage, Xanthor, of the Ironfist courts of Enroth!\n\nUsing his great magic, he projected his image into this very chamber. He and Roland and Catherine Ironfist were at sea off our shores when the cataclysm occurred. They survived the resulting storms and now would like to land in Ravenshore to aid the alliance. Unfortunately, they are blocked by the Regnan pirate fleet. We must help them to land. Xanthor claims much knowledge of what has happened here. We need his council!"
msgstr "就在我们第一次聚会之后几个小时，有件最幸运的事情发生了。恩洛斯的艾恩法斯特王朝中的伟大智者萨索尔和我们联络了！\n他利用他强大的法力将自己的影像投射在这个房间中。他和罗兰德以及凯瑟琳·艾恩法斯特在大灾变发生的时候，他们正好在我们国度的外海。他们勉强躲过了接下来的大暴风，现在愿意前来渡鸦海滨协助联盟。但很不幸地，他们被雷格那海盗的舰队阻挡在外海上。我们必须要协助他们登陆。萨索尔声称他对于在此地发生的事情十分了解。我们需要他的指引！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:173
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Our sources believe the main Regnan fleet is in a hidden port somewhere on Regna Island. If you could sink the fleet in dock you could greatly cripple their ability to patrol the seas off our shore. Unfortunately, we don't have a fleet of our own strong enough to make a landing on Regna.\n\nBrekish Onefang has gotten message to us that the Regnans have built an outpost on an atoll off the main Dagger Wound Island. He believes this outpost is resupplied by mysterious means. His scouts never see ships land there, but they are always well stocked. Perhaps you should go there and solve the mystery. Perhaps the answer will convey you to Regna?\n\nRegardless of the means, the Regnan fleet must be sunk if the Ironfists are to land in Ravenshore."
msgstr "我们的情报来源相信雷格那海军的舰队就躲在雷格那岛上的某个港口中。如果你可以将港口中的所有船只都弄沉，你将可以大幅破坏他们巡逻邻近海域的能力。很不幸地，我们自己没有足够强大的舰队可以强行登陆雷格那。\n布拉克许·单牙已经送了一个消息给我们，通知我们雷格那人已经在匕伤群岛的主岛上兴建了一个前哨站。他的哨兵们从来没有看见过任何的船只停靠该处，但是他们的补给却总是很充足。也许你们应该去那边好好调查，解开谜团。也许解答会让你找到前往雷格那的路？\n不管如何，雷格那的舰队都必须受到重创，艾恩法斯特王朝的船只才能够在渡鸦海滨停靠。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:174
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your good work sinking the Regnan fleet has already had the desired results. Just yesterday morning, Catherine and Roland Ironfist arrived along with their sage, Xanthor. With them in the alliance, we are made stronger--immeasurably so.\n\nI will admit that the time of this crisis has contained some of my darkest moments. Thanks to your efforts I believe that the worst of this is over. I have hopes that we will indeed survive this."
msgstr "你弄沉雷格那舰队的完美表现已经获得了相当不错的回报。昨天早上，凯瑟琳和罗兰德·艾恩法斯特和他们的智者萨索尔一起抵达了此地。在我们拥有了他们的协助之后，我们的力量可说是大幅地增加。\n我必须承认，这次的危机中包含了我自己遭遇到的最黑暗的时刻。多谢你的努力，我相信最糟糕的状况已经过去了。我现在认为我们应该可以成功地逃脱末日的威胁。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:175
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:175
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must sink that Regnan fleet! It is imperative that the Ironfists be allowed to land safely. Their sage Xanthor has knowledge of the crisis that we cannot do without."
msgstr "你一定要弄沉那些雷格那的舰队！艾恩法斯特家族一定要成功进入我们的港口！他们的智者萨索尔对于我们所面对的危机拥有我们所需要的知识！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:176
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:176
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "For all their claims of empire and their airs of civilization, the Regnans are the worst scum of Jadame. Why I cannot find myself the least bit surprised that they would take advantage of the crisis to expand their pirating operations. What concerns me most is their new outpost on Dagger Wound. I am sure they mean to use it as a base of attack on the continent. Why, it even puts them in striking distance of Ravenshore!"
msgstr "雷格那人虽然老是夸耀自己的帝国和文明，但他们只不过是贾丹姆大陆上最大群的强盗集团。他们利用这次危机来扩张自己的海盗帝国，我一点也不赶到惊讶。让我最担心的是他们在匕伤群岛上的前哨站。我认为他们一定会利用该处当做攻击主大陆的基地。哼，那里甚至让他们可以直接攻击渡鸦海滨！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:177
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have only met with him briefly, but I am convinced that Xanthor is remarkably knowledgeable about the workings of the elemental planes. Apparently he learned much from the Ironfists' elemental allies during their recent campaigns against the devils of Erathia.\n\nEven now he studies the strange crystal in the town square. You may find him there, or perhaps in the nearby residence we have provided him."
msgstr "我只有和他见过一次面，但是我相信萨索尔对于元素界的一切状况有相当的认知。很明显地他在最近和艾恩法斯特王朝的敌人于埃拉西亚作战的时候，从元素界学到了很多事情。\n现在他正在研究城镇广场上的那个奇异水晶。你大概可以在那里找到他，他也可能会暂时居住在附近的房屋中。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:178
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We of the council have great faith in this Xanthor. He has told me that he is formulating a plan for dealing with the elemental crisis. If anyone can find a solution to our problems, it is he.\n\nIf you would help us further, be of service to this great sage. Consult with him about the crystal and see what you might do for him."
msgstr "我们这些议会的成员对于萨索尔拥有相当大的信心。他告诉我们他有个计划，要处理这一切的危机。如果说有任何人可以找到我们所面对问题的解答，那就一定是他了。\n如果你愿意进一步协助我们，请去帮助那名伟大的智者。询问他有关水晶的问题，看看你能够替他做些什么。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:179
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:179
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We look to Xanthor to formulate our next actions. Go to him and see how you can help."
msgstr "我们希望萨索尔能够指引我们下一步该做什么。去找他，看看你能够帮上什么忙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:180
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:180
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "That we have been joined by the royal court of Enroth has been nothing but good. I was worried they would be afflicted with the need for pomp which infects many other monarchs. I am gladdened to report that this is not the case with this king and queen. They disembarked and set directly to work on our problem. As key members of our alliance, you will find access to them easy. We have put them up in houses here in Ravenshore."
msgstr "我们获得了恩洛斯皇室的协助带来了非常正面的发展。我本来很担心他们会像一般的皇室一样地骄傲自大，但是他们这对佳偶并不是这样的。他们一来就开始直接协助我们解决问题。由于他们是这次联盟的主要力量之一，你可以轻易地找到他们。我们已经让他们暂时居住在渡鸦海滨的房子中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:181
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:181
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "From what Xanthor has told us, I'm sure all of the elemental planes are dangerous. Still, I would advise you to take particular caution when exploring the Plane of Fire. Its denizens, according to reports from the Ironsand Desert, are being particularly belligerent."
msgstr "从萨索尔所告诉我们的事情看来，所有的元素界都已经陷入了危机中。但是，我依旧建议你在探索火元素界的时候要特别小心。根据铁沙漠所送来的报告，火元素界的居民特别地狂野和危险。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:182
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:182
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All I know of the Plane Between Planes is what I learned from the Alvarian loremasters. Still, if the Destroyer's base is there, proceed with the greatest caution! It is said the plane is made of the stuff of chaos from which all the other planes are formed as if from clay. While chaos has a form, it is fluid. Whatever you see there will not be as it seems. And what is there may be subject to continuous change."
msgstr "我对界间之地的所知都是从阿尔瓦商人的历史学者口中所得知的。如果毁灭者的基地在那边，你最好小心一点！据说该空间中充满了其它次元创造时所拥有的混沌力量。混沌的外形并不固定。不管你在那边看到什么东西，都不见得会是他真正的形状。该地会不断持续的变化。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:183
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:183
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What the Alvar loremasters told me of the Plane Between Planes applies here. While I am sure the prisons of the elemental lords are prisons in every sense of the word, I am equally sure that they will not appear as one would expect."
msgstr "阿尔瓦商人的历史学者所告诉我有关界间之地的事情的确很符合该地的描述。虽然我很确定元素之王的监狱是用来监禁他们的地方，但是我完全不确定他们的外形到底是什么样子。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:184
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:184
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Merchant Guild of Alvar owes you a great debt. As a small measure of repayment, we have decided to make this merchanthouse permanently available to you. Please take this gift from us as a token of our profound gratitude for your valorous deeds."
msgstr "阿尔瓦的商人公会欠你很大的人情。虽然这只是一点小意思，但是我们想要让你可以随时使用这个商人公会之家。请把这个小礼物当做我们对你英勇行为的一点回报。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:185
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know being part of your alliance is important work. Still, I do miss the hunt! I keep imagining all the good fun my men are having while I'm here pushing around papers.\n\nHurry up with this alliance business! I want to get this mess taken care of with dispatch! Without the thrill of the hunt, my life is missing its usual spark."
msgstr "我知道加入你的联盟是很重要的一件事情。但是我依旧怀念四处狩猎的日子！当我在这边处理许多许多的文档的时候，我不禁会想起同伴们目前在享受的乐趣。\n快点推动联盟的事物！我想要赶快脱离这一切！没有了狩猎的趣味，我的生命就变得非常无趣。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:186
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:186
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Judging from the tactics employed by the Regnan pirates, I suspect that Blackwell Cooper is involved. Cooper is an old…shall we say, \"associate,\" of mine. Why, if I were a gambling man, I'd bet gold that he is leading the Regnan expeditionary force on Dagger Wound."
msgstr "从雷格那海盗所运用的战术看起来，我想黑井·古伯可能有牵涉在里面。古伯是……我应该这么说吧，他是我的一个“朋友”。如果我有赌钱的习惯，我会压注在他率领匕伤群岛上的雷格那部队这件事情上。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:187
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:187
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know I hold the council's minority opinion on the subject, but really, I don't see why we have to involve some charlatan magician in this matter! Surely this crisis is solvable, like most things, with judicious application of a length of well-forged steel."
msgstr "我知道我的意见在议会中算是少数，但是说实话，我实在看不出来干嘛要找个江湖卖艺人来教导我们拯救世界？！危机的确是可以解决的，一切都有解决之道，只要你手中拥有够强的武器，没有不能够解决的问题。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:188
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:188
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fah! If you ask me, this idea of Xanthor's is foolhardy! I say if we're facing attack by elemental armies, we should be raising an army to meet them. Frankly, all this talk of prophecy leaves me uneasy. This council is too much under the sway of the Ironfist's pet wizard. I say we take the fight to the elemental planes and introduce the invaders to the sharp edges of our blades!"
msgstr "啐！如果你问我，这个萨索尔所说的话根本是放屁！我认为我们应该直接面对元素界的攻击，我们应该筹组一个军队去打击他们。说实话，这些什么预言的鬼东西让我感到浑身不自在。这个议会根本受到艾恩法斯特王朝的巫师所操纵。我认为我们应该直捣元素界，让那些该死的入侵者尝尝我们的刀锋！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:189
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:189
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I tell you, this Xanthor is sending you on a wild goose chase. \"Plane Between Planes,\" indeed! What hogwash! The worst of it is that we make no preparations for war in the event the crazy scheme fails, which I expect it will. This mad following of prophecy flies in the face of good military sense!"
msgstr "我告诉你，萨索尔只是派你出去抓瞎而已！“界间之地”，真是无稽之谈！最要命的是，如果这些疯狂的计划失败了，我们根本没有做好作战的准备。而且我认为这些计划注定会失败。照着预言办事，在军事战术上来说简直是胡扯蛋！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:190
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:190
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have had more of my share of doubts about this Xanthor, but it is the mark of a man how readily he admits his errors. It is clear to me now that he has given nothing but good and effective advise. If he tells you to rescue the elemental lords, then that is what you must do. Go! And good luck!"
msgstr "我对于这个叫做萨索尔的家伙的确有一些怀疑，但是他愿意承认自己错误的态度让我比较放心。对我来说，他目前所给的建议都是有效的建议。如果他告诉你去拯救元素之王，那么你就应该这样做。快走吧！祝你好运！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:191
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good to see you again, Heroes of Jadame. A good job there, saving the world, and all. You certainly have my thanks, and I'm sure, the thanks of many.\n\nI'm sure you've got plenty of other opportunities at this point, but let me know if you want a job hunting Dragons. Probably not much of a challenge for the likes of you, but the offer stands!"
msgstr "贾丹姆大陆的英雄，真高兴再度见到你们。你们拯救全世界的表现实在太好了。我非常感激你们，我相信其它的人也是一样。\n我很确定你现在应该拥有很多的工作机会。不过，如果你对猎龙有兴趣，请记得跟我说一声。也许这对你这种人来说不是什么大挑战，但是请记得有我的这个承诺！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:192
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Small ones, hurry with your alliance preparations! My patience with this land lacking in caves and prey grows dangerously thin. Not only must I sleep in a barn, these people do not even raise cattle. I must live off of fish! Fah!\n\nIf you value my good temper, be quick!"
msgstr "小家伙，快点去料理你口中联盟的事情！我对于这块土地的关切由于没有洞穴和猎物，已经开始渐渐消退了。我现在不只必须睡在谷仓里面，这些家伙甚至连牛也不养。我还必须靠着吃鱼过活！啐！\n如果你知道最好不要惹我生气，那动作就给我快一点！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:193
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:193
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Reaching Regna Island is no small challenge. One of my scouts has reported to me that Regnan boats lie thick on the sea. He also said he saw that the Regnans have a craft that can travel beneath the water. It is said they supply their Dagger Wound outpost with the craft. Perhaps you can use it to reach Regna. The pirates will either miss your passage or take you for one of their own."
msgstr "要前往雷格那岛并不简单。我的一名斥候回报，海上雷格那人的活动相当频繁。但是他也回报了目击雷格那人有可以在水面下潜航的船只。据说他们利用这艘船只补给匕伤群岛上的前哨站。也许你可以利用这艘船来抵达雷格那。这些海盗可能会因此无法发现你的行踪，或者是把你当做他们的一份子。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:194
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:194
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know this is not the time to think of revenge, but I would pass onto you something I learned about my enemy, Charles Quixote. The Minotaur king, Masul, mentioned that Quixote keeps a sword of great power with him in his keep. It is called, \"Snake.\" Perhaps your acquiring of it would help the alliance cause?"
msgstr "我知道这不是想要复仇的时候，但我愿意把我对敌人的了解跟你分享。牛头人的国王马苏尔提到，据说吉柯德在要塞里面放了一把被称为“蛇”的神剑。也许这柄剑可以协助联盟的工作？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:195
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:195
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My Dragon patrols have located two of the elemental gateways. One lies on the side of a large volcano southeast of the largest Dagger Wound Islands. The other is located in the center of the large lake in Ravage Roaming. I know not where they lead, but you will have to cross a lot of water to reach either."
msgstr "我的飞龙巡逻队们已经找到了两个元素界的传送门。岛上的传送门就出现在主岛东南方的火山山坡上。残破镇的传送门就在一个大湖的中央。我不知道他们的确实位置，但是你都必须要跨越很多的水才能够抵达这两座传送门。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:196
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:196
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "An Erathian Dragon visited my cave shortly before you arrived there. He reported to me that a new type of Dragon, one seemingly made of crystalline rock, has been seen in Erathia. I'm not sure why I tell you this. Perhaps the giant crystal in the town square reminds me of the story. "
msgstr "在你们抵达这里不久之前，一名埃拉西亚的飞龙来我的洞穴里面拜访我。他告诉我在埃拉西亚上出现了一种新的龙类，一种似乎是由水晶所构成的飞龙。我不知道为什么我要告诉你这件事情。但也许城镇广场上的那座巨大的水晶让我想起这件事情。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:197
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:197
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Interesting that the Destroyer himself sends you to undo his works. I guess I am not surprised. The workings of the greater Powers are mysterious at best."
msgstr "真有趣，毁灭者竟然会派你出去解决他们造成的危机。我想我并不会觉得惊讶。超凡力量的行为模式总是让人难以理解。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:198
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:198
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have done this land and Dragonkind a great service. For this, we owe you. Know that we will tolerate your presence in our caves, further, we will not hunt you as prey."
msgstr "你替这块大地和我们龙类都作了非常好的服务。我们非常感激你，为了这样，我们容许你进入我们的洞穴中，不会将你当做猎物看待。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:199
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Did you know that our temple in Murmurwoods is the first in this land of Jadame? It is our mission to bring the Light to all corners of the world--even here. We were surprised to see that our enemies, the Necromancers' Guild had preceded our arrival with their own. But no matter, they will soon be dealt with.\n\nSay, don't you think this merchant house would make a fine Sun Temple? I will bring it up with Fellmoon after the crisis is over."
msgstr "你知道我们在低语森林的神庙是贾丹姆大陆上的第一座吗？我们的任务是将光明带到世界上的每个角落，即使在这里也不例外。我们很惊讶看见死灵法师公会竟然比我们先到了。不过没关系，我们会料理他们的。\n你觉不觉得这座屋子将来可以作为太阳神庙？当这次危机结束之后，我会跟费尔蒙提这件事情的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:200
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:200
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you're off to Regna, you might want to look for the Mace of the Sun. When my brothers and I made the crossing from Erathia, we were attacked by the Regnan fleet. All but one of our ships escaped. Sadly, the lost ship was the one carrying the mission leader, Brother Howe. He had the weapon in his possession. I saw Brother Howe slain by the pirates, but perhaps they still have the mace."
msgstr "如果你准备去雷格那，你可以会想要先找到烈阳钉锤。当我和弟兄们从埃拉西亚渡海过来的时候，我们受到了雷格那舰队的攻击。我们只有一艘船没有逃出来。很遗憾地，那艘船就是该次任务的领导者豪威弟兄的旗舰。他带着我之前所提到的武器。我目击了豪威弟兄被海盗杀死，但也许他们还保留着那柄武器。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:203
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You know…I have a power stone that will activate the portal to the abandoned temple. And you have one that will allow us to reach the island where that portal is!\n\nIf we joined forces, we could reach the temple with ease. What say you?"
msgstr "你知道吗？我刚好有一个能源之石，可以启动废弃神庙中的传送门。而你手上的能源之石则是可以让我们启动前往该传送门所在岛屿的传送门！\n如果我们合作，我们可以轻易地抵达该座庙宇。你觉得怎么样？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:204
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:204
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Looks like your party's all full up, so I can't travel with you now. But the offer still stands. If you need me, I'll be at the Adventurer's Inn."
msgstr "看起来你的队伍都已经满了，我现在暂时不能够加入你们。以后，只要你愿意，我还是可以和你们一起旅行的。如果你有需要，我会在冒险者旅店等你们。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:207
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Very well. You have done as I have asked of you. Now I will return the favor. I will travel with you to meet your merchant guildmaster, and perhaps beyond if you will have me. There is little for me here.\n\nShall we be off?"
msgstr "很好，你已经照着我所说的作了。现在换我回报了。我愿意和你一起去找你的商人公会会长，也许如果你有进一步的需要，我也愿意和你一起走。我在这边帮不上什么忙了。\n我们现在就走吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:208
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:208
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It seems that you're party is too full for me to join. I will therefore travel alone to the Adventurer's Inn. Meet me there when you have room. Until then, farewell."
msgstr "看起来你的队伍已经太满，我没办法加入了。因此我将会自己单独前往冒险者旅店。当你的队伍有空间的时候再去冒险者旅店找我。在那之前，先跟各位说再会棉。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:209
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:209
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Would you like Arius the Minotaur to join you?"
msgstr "你愿意让牛头人艾瑞斯加入你们吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:210
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:210
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will be happy to journey with you when your party is not so full. I will travel to the Adventurer's Inn. If you need me, I'll be there."
msgstr "我很愿意在你们队伍稍稍有点空位的时候再来加入你们。我会和你一起前往冒险者旅店。如果你们有需要的话，再过来找我。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:211
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:211
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you have Rohani Oscleton the Dark Elf join you?"
msgstr "你们愿意让黑暗精灵罗哈尼·欧斯克理顿加入队伍吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:212
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:212
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm glad you've decided to take me, but your party is too full. I guess I'll start my adventure by traveling to the Adventurer's Inn. See you there!"
msgstr "很高兴你们愿意让我加入，但是你的队伍已经太多人了。我想我最好先去冒险者旅店开始我的冒险，掰掰棉！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:213
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:213
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, I am ready to travel. Shall we go?"
msgstr "我准备好要走了。现在动身吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:214
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:214
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmmm. It seems your party is full. I will travel to the Adventure's Inn. You will find me there ready to join you when you have room. Good luck."
msgstr "嗯，看起来你的队伍已经满了。当你有额外的空间之后再去冒险者旅店找我，我会随时准备动身的。再会。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:215
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:215
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you take Ithilgore the Dragon into your party?"
msgstr "你愿意让飞龙伊斯希尔歌尔加入你的队伍吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:216
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:216
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though your party is full, I will still join your cause. I will travel to the Adventurer's Inn. Meet me there if you want me to travel with you."
msgstr "虽然你的队伍已经太多人了，但是我依旧同意你对冒险的看法。如果你需要人手，请去冒险者旅店找我，我会在那边等你的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:217
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:217
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you take Karanya Memoria the Necromancer into your party?"
msgstr "你愿意让死灵法师卡蓝雅·麦莫瑞亚加入你的队伍吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:218
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:218
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I cannot travel with you now; your party is too full. If you want me to journey with you, you will find me at the Adventurer's Inn."
msgstr "虽然你的队伍已经太多人了，但是我依旧同意你对冒险的看法。如果你需要人手，请去冒险者旅店找我，我会在那边等你的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:219
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:219
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you accept Maylander the Cleric as a follower?"
msgstr "你愿意让牧师麦兰德跟随你们吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:220
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:220
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmm, I prefer to travel with a smaller party than you have. Tell you what…I'll travel to the Adventurer's Inn. If you want me I'll be there. 'Til then, farewell."
msgstr "嗯，我比较喜欢和人数比较少的队伍一起旅行。这样吧，如果你的队伍人数变少的话，请到冒险者旅店来找我，我会在那边等你的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:225
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:225
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now that my herd is safe, I will gladly join you. I'm sure Herdmaster Masul will not object to me helping the saviors of my people. Shall we?"
msgstr "在我的同胞已经脱离险境之后，我很愿意加入你。我很确定马苏尔不会反对我帮助同胞们的救星，你愿意让我加入吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:226
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:226
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can see that your party is too large to include me in its ranks. Still, my thirst for adventure has been whetted by your offer. I will travel to Ravenshore and seek my fortune there. Perhaps you will find me at the Adventurer's Inn there. I will look for you there!"
msgstr "我看得出来你的队伍已经容不下额外人手的加入。但是，你的提议已经扇起了我胸中冒险的火焰。我将会前往渡鸦海滨寻找我的未来，也许你可以在该处的冒险者旅店找到我。我会在那边等你的！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:227
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:227
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you take Jasp Thelbourne the Dark Elf into your party?"
msgstr "你愿意让黑暗精灵杰斯波·赛尔鹏加入你的队伍吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:228
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:228
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, I'd be happy to go with you now, but your party is too full. But, I will make my services available to you. I will go to the Adventurer's Inn. Seek me there if you would have me."
msgstr "虽然我愿意和你一起走，但因为你队伍的人数已经额满了，我没办法加入你们。如果你需要我的服务，请到冒险者旅店来找我，我在那边随时恭候大驾。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:229
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:229
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you take Gethric Mercutura the Vampire into your party?"
msgstr "你愿意让吸血鬼盖斯瑞克·摩枯妥拉加入你的队伍吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:230
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:230
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, but your party is too full. But now, it is settled. It is a life of adventure I seek! I will travel to the Adventurer's Inn. If you will have me, I will be there."
msgstr "啊，但是你的队伍已经额满了。不过，对我来说没有什么太大的问题。反正我所寻求的是一场冒险的生活。我将会前往冒险者旅店，如果你需要我，我将会在那边等你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:231
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:231
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you take Flamdring the Dragon into your party?"
msgstr "你愿意让飞龙佛蓝林加入你的队伍吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:232
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:232
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Join them? Yes? But no, their numbers are too great. But adventure I still seek. Well then, to the Adventurer's Inn I must go, for there gather those who would seek their fortunes."
msgstr "加入他们？好吗？但是不行，他们的人数已经太多了。但我还是想要冒险。那么我就必须前往冒险者旅店，所有想要拥有冒险者生涯的人都会聚集在那边。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:233
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:233
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you travel with Hevatia Deverbero the Necromancer?"
msgstr "你愿意和死灵法师海瓦提亚·代佛贝罗一起旅行吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:234
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:234
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your party is too full for me to join. I will go to the Adventure's Inn. You can take me into your group there if you have the room."
msgstr "虽然我愿意和你一起走，但因为你队伍的人数已经额满了，我没办法加入你们。如果你需要我的服务，请到冒险者旅店来找我，我在那边随时恭候大驾。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:235
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:235
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you take Verish the Cleric into your party?"
msgstr "你愿意让牧师瓦瑞西加入你的队伍吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:236
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:236
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know I would serve the Light well by joining you, but your party is too full. I will go to the Adventurer's Inn. Meet me there if you have the room."
msgstr "我知道如果我加入你的阵营，我将会继续在光明之下服务人群，但是你的队伍人数已经太多了。当你的队伍有空间的时候，请到冒险者旅店去找我。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:237
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:237
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you take Nelix Uriel the Knight into your party?"
msgstr "你愿意让骑士耐力克斯·巫瑞尔加入你的队伍吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:238
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:238
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can't go with you. Your party is too full. But you know? Things here are wrapping up and I have little to do. I'll travel to the Adventurer's Inn and seek my fortune there. Maybe we'll meet up there."
msgstr "我没办法和你一起走，你的队伍人数已经太多了。但是你知道吗？事情有些太过集中，我现在暂时没有其他的外务可作。我会到冒险者旅店去，如果你有需要的话，请到该处找我。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:239
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:239
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you take Sethrc Thistlebone the Troll into your party?"
msgstr "你愿意让巨魔赛斯瑞克·希索朋加入你的队伍吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:240
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:240
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmm…you're party is too full, but still I wish to help you. I will go to the Adventure's Inn. If you need a strong clubber, you will find me there."
msgstr "虽然我愿意和你一起走，但因为你队伍的人数已经额满了，我没办法加入你们。如果你需要额外的火力，请到冒险者旅店来找我，我在那边随时恭候大驾。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:241
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:241
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you care to travel with Rionel the Minotaur?"
msgstr "你愿意和牛头人瑞欧耐尔一起旅行吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:242
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:242
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can't go with you now. Your party is full. I will still make myself available to you. If you need me, I'll be at the Adventurer's Inn."
msgstr "虽然我愿意和你一起走，但因为你队伍的人数已经额满了，我没办法加入你们。如果你需要额外的火力，请到冒险者旅店来找我，我在那边随时恭候大驾。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:243
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:243
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you take Adric Stellare the Dark Elf into your party?"
msgstr "你愿意让黑暗精灵艾瑞克·史塔拉尔加入你的队伍吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:244
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:244
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes, I will gladly join you. Unfortunately, your party is too full. Tell you what. I'll go to the Adventurer's Inn. If you want to travel with me, you'll find me there."
msgstr "虽然我愿意和你一起走，但因为你队伍的人数已经额满了，我没办法加入你们。如果你以后想要找我一起旅行的话，请到冒险者旅店来找我，我在那边随时恭候大驾。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:245
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:245
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you take the Vampire Infaustus into your party?"
msgstr "你愿意让吸血鬼因佛史塔斯加入你的队伍吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:246
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:246
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I would go with you, but your party is too full. I prefer to travel with fewer people. I go now to the Adventurer's Inn. There I will find my companions."
msgstr "虽然我愿意和你一起走，但因为你队伍的人数太多了，我没办法加入你们。如果你以后想要找我一起旅行的话，请到冒险者旅店来找我，我在那边随时恭候大驾。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:247
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:247
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you ask Brimstone the Dragon to join you?"
msgstr "你要让飞龙布尔斯通加入你的队伍吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:248
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:248
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, but your party is too full. Still, you are clearly the ones I seek. I will go to the Adventurer's Inn. Join with me there when you have room."
msgstr "啊，但是你的队伍人太多了。不过，我在找的就是你。我会去冒险者旅店，当你的队伍有额外的空间时，再去那里找我。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:249
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:249
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Many our the Shadowspire Guild thanks for recovering the Lost Book of Khel! Perhaps I can join you in your travels to provide my own personal assistance?"
msgstr "我们死灵法师公会中有很多人都很感谢你替我们找回了失落的凯尔之书！也许我可以加入你的队伍，让我来保护你？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:252
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:252
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I wish I could join with you now, but your party is too full. I will wait for you in the Adventurer's Inn. Until then, good luck!"
msgstr "虽然我愿意和你一起走，但因为你队伍的人数太多了，我没办法加入你们。如果你以后想要找我一起旅行的话，请到冒险者旅店来找我，我在那边随时恭候大驾。祝你们好运！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:253
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:253
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you take Tempus the Knight into your party?"
msgstr "你愿意让骑士坦帕斯加入队伍吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:254
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:254
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I cannot travel go with you. Your party is much too large for my preferences. I like to work with a smaller, more mobile group. Tell you what. I will go to the Adventurer's Inn. Join me there once you get rid of some of your dead weight."
msgstr "虽然我愿意和你一起走，但因为你队伍的人数太多了，我没办法加入你们。如果你以后想要找我一起旅行的话，请到冒险者旅店来找我，我在那边随时恭候大驾。祝你们好运！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:255
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:255
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will your travel with Thorne Understone the Troll?"
msgstr "你愿意和巨魔索恩·石下一起旅行吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:256
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:256
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Great. Listen. I have some business I need to attend to before I can go with you. We'll meet at the Adventurer's Inn. I will join you there."
msgstr "太好了，听着。在我能够和你一起走之前，我还有一些事情要先去处理。请到冒险者旅店去找我，我会在那边等你的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:257
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:257
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Will you take Ulbrecht the Minotaur into your party?"
msgstr "你愿意让牛头人乌布理契加入你们的队伍吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:258
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:258
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I would go with you now, but your party is too full. I will make preparations then travel to the Adventurer's Inn. Meet me there when you have room for me. Until then, good luck!"
msgstr "虽然我愿意和你一起走，但因为你队伍的人数太多了，我没办法加入你们。如果你以后想要找我一起旅行的话，请到冒险者旅店来找我，我在那边随时恭候大驾。祝你们好运！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:261
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:261
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you take Artorius Veritas the Vampire into your party?"
msgstr "你愿意让吸血鬼阿图瑞斯·维瑞塔斯加入你的队伍吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:262
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:262
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can't go with you, your party is too full. I will go to the Adventurer's Inn. Join me there."
msgstr "我不能够和你一起走，你的队伍人太多了。我会先去冒险者旅店，去那边找我。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:263
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:263
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you take the Dragon, Duroth the Eternal into your party?"
msgstr "你愿意让飞龙永恒土洛斯加入你的队伍吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:264
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:264
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will join you, but not now. I have to see to some matters which will take me some days to deal with. After I'm done I will go to the Adventurer's Inn. Meet me there."
msgstr "我愿意加入你，但不是现在。我有些事情必须要先去处理，在我处理完之后，我会赶去冒险者旅店，请在那边和我会面。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:265
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:265
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you agree to travel with Nathaniel Roberts the Necromancer?"
msgstr "你愿意和死灵法师纳山尼尔·罗伯兹一起旅行吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:266
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:266
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fah! You are more a mob than an adventuring party. I'm looking for a smaller group. I will seek them at the Adventurer's Inn. If you want to journey with me…well, perhaps you'll find me there."
msgstr "我不能够和你一起走，你的队伍人太多了。我会先去冒险者旅店，去那边找我。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:267
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will gladly join you. My desire for revenge has been a thirst long in need of slaking. You have provided me with the cup. Let us go and fill it!\n\nDyson Leland offers to join your party. Do you accept?"
msgstr "我很愿意加入你。我对于复仇的渴望眼看着终于可以平复了。你已经提供给我适当的机会，让我们去满足他吧！\n戴森·李蓝愿意加入你的队伍，你接受吗？"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:268
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your group is too full for me to join, but here is my plan…I will make my escape from the guild and meet you at the Adventurer's Inn. It may take me some time to get there, as I must travel with caution.\n\nMeet me there when you can. My revenge has waited for over a year. It can wait a few more weeks. Wish me luck!"
msgstr "你的队伍人太多，我没办法加入。但我有另外一个计划……我先逃离死灵法师公会，然后和你在冒险者旅店碰面。我可能要花一点时间才能够到该处，因为我必须小心行事。\n到时你就来冒险者旅店找我。我的复仇已经等了超过一年的时间，再多等几个礼拜也没关系。祝我好运！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:307
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:307
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have a dagger and I bet I can kill you before you draw yours! Speed can kill and the dagger is the fastest weapon! With what I can teach you, you can carry another weapon in your off hand. Two are better than one. The Expert skills of the dagger can be yours if you have a dagger skill level of 4 and can pay my modest fee of 2000 gold."
msgstr "我打赌在你抽出匕首之前，我可以先杀死你！速度是战斗中最重要的变数，而匕首是最快的武器！你可以从我的教导中学会如何用你的另一只手使用武器。两个总比一个好。只要你拥有匕首技能且技能达到4级，再付我2000金币，就可以成为匕首专家。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:311
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:311
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mastery of the axe and skilled hands can split an opponent's head like a pudding. With my instruction you can have this ability! You blows will cause more damage than before, devastating your opponents! But first you must have an Expert skill level of 7 with the axe and pay my price of 5000 gold."
msgstr "大师级的战斧技能可以把敌人的脑袋像布丁一样砍落。在我的指导之下，你将会拥有这样的能力！你的攻击将会比之前造成更大的杀伤力，彻底击垮你的敌人！但是首先你必须要拥有专家级战斧技能，且技能达到7级，并支付5000个金币才行。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:322
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:322
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, now that things seem to be settled with our little war with the Temple of the Sun. Sandro has said that guild members may turn their attention to other matters. Since arriving in Jadame, I have seen little of it save for the lands of Shadowspire. Say...perhaps you could use my services!"
msgstr "现在，在我们和太阳神庙之间的争执已经似乎结束的时候，山德罗说死灵法师公会的成员可以把注意力转移到其它地方去。从我到达贾丹姆大陆之后，我就没有看过除了阴影塔之外的地区。也许……你们会需要我的帮忙？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:323
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:323
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I wish I could join with you. Sadly, our war with the Temple of the Sun takes up all of our time. The guild cannot spare me now."
msgstr "真希望我可以加入你们，但是和太阳神庙的战争占据了我们全部的时间，也许等到这一切结束吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:324
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:324
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes! I would love to join with you. Now that our holy war against the foul Necromancers' Guild seems to be going well, I find I have little to do around here. I will go with you if you will take me."
msgstr "是的！我很愿意加入你们。因为现在我们对抗死灵法师公会的圣战是如此地顺利，我想我在这边没有什么事情可以作了。如果你愿意接受我的话，我们就可以一起去冒险。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:397
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:397
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I wish I could. Unfortunately, we make holy war with the foul Necromancers' Guild. All of the Sun Temple's resources, including myself, are dedicated to that cause."
msgstr "真希望我可以。很不幸的，我们正在和邪恶的死灵法师公会宣战。所有太阳神庙的资源，包括我自己，都全心投入在其上。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:398
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:398
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Adventure with you? Yes I will. In fact, before he left, Charles Quixote suggested just that. \"Nelix,\" he said, \"if those alliance heroes come by, you ought to consider going with them.\" Apparently, he thinks highly of you. Well, his recommendation is enough for me. Shall we go?"
msgstr "和你冒险？我当然愿意。事实上，在查尔斯·吉柯德离开前，他刚好还跟我说过这件事情。“如果联盟的英雄出现在你面前，你应该要考虑和他们一起走。”很明显地，他对你们的评价很高。对我来说，有他的评价就够了。我们可以走了吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:399
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:399
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Go with you? I think not. Why would I want to join up with a bunch of amateurs when I have all the action I can handle here? Don't make me laugh. What can you offer me that a life of Dragon hunting does not?"
msgstr "和你们走？我可不愿意。我为什么要和一群菜鸟一起旅行？别开玩笑了。你能够提供给我什么猎龙的生涯所不能够提供的呢？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:400
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:400
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Go with you? I like the idea, but I must stay here. I am one of the last veteran warriors left here. I must stay to protect the village."
msgstr "和你们一起离开？我很想要，但是我必须留在这里，因为我是这里唯一的老经验战士了。我必须要留在这里保护大家。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:401
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:401
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes, that sounds good. Though the village could use me to protect it, I think the best I could do for it would be to go with you. My people will be destroyed if the cataclysm is not ended. If I can do something to stop it, I should."
msgstr "没错，这听起来相当有趣。虽然村人们需要我保护他们，但是，我想如果我跟你们一起去的话，可能才更能够保护他们。如果大灾变不赶快结束，我的同胞们会全部完蛋。我应该尽一切可能去阻止他们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:402
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:402
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Join your group? I would be glad to. Not only have you done a great service for my herd, it has become clear to me that your actions will decide our very survival."
msgstr "加入你的队伍？我当然很愿意。你们不只替我的同胞解决了很大的难题，很明显地，你们成功与否，更会决定这个世界是否继续存在。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:409
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:409
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Join you? I must decline the offer. Though you have done a great service for my herd, I am not yet sure of your leadership. I want to help fight the cataclysm, but I'm not sure your way is the right one."
msgstr "加入你的队伍？我必须要拒绝你。虽然你替我的同胞作了非常多的服务，但是我对你的领导能力还不太有信心。我想要对抗大灾变，但是我不确定你的方法是正确的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:410
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:410
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't think your exploits have gone unnoticed! Clearly you are adventurers of the highest caliber. I would consider joining your team…that is, if you will have me."
msgstr "别以为你们的丰功伟业没人注意到！很明显你们是目前最受人注意的冒险队伍。如果你们愿意让我加入的话……我当然愿意加入你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:411
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:411
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I see you too are adventurers. But…well, can I be frank? Though I don't doubt your potential, clearly you are not the most experienced group I've seen. I'd be happy to join you if you were more…shall we say, \"seasoned?\""
msgstr "我看得出来你们也是冒险者。但是……说实话，虽然我对你们的潜力很有信心，但是你们并不是我所看过最有经验的队伍。如果你们能经历更多的“磨练”，我想我会对你更有信心。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:436
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:436
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lisha Sourbrow teaches Expert uses of the Mace from her home in Ravenshore."
msgstr "丽莎·所尔波罗在她位于渡鸦海滨的家中教导专业级的钉锤技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:437
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:437
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Robert Morningstar, teaches Mastery of the Mace to the knights in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "罗伯特·晨星是钉锤的大师级导师，他在绞刑峡谷的猎龙人营地中训练骑士。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:439
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:439
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Qillain Moore used to serve the knight, Charles Quixote, but disagreed with his crusade to slay all the Dragons in the Garrote Gorge area. Moore still teaches Expert uses of the Shield from his home in the city of Alvar."
msgstr "奎蓝·摩尔曾经和骑士们一起并肩作战，但是他不同意查尔斯·吉柯德杀光所有飞龙的作法。因此，他目前居住在阿尔瓦城中，如果你找得到他，可以从他身上学到盾牌的专家级技巧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:448
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:448
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Bone teaches the Expert skills of Plate armor from his hut on Dagger Wound Island."
msgstr "朋恩在匕伤群岛上教导专家级的钢甲使用技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:454
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:454
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Reshie teaches the Expert skill of Air Magic from his home on the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr "瑞西在匕伤群岛的家中教授专家级空气魔法技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:460
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:460
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ostrin Grivic, Expert instructor of Earth Magic, lives in the village of Blood Drop on the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr "奥斯崔恩·葛瑞维克是土系魔法的专家级老师，目前居住在匕伤群岛上的血滴镇中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:463
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:463
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Straton Hawthorne can raise you to Expert level in the arts of Spirit Magic. He makes his home in the port city of Ravenshore."
msgstr "史拉顿·何索恩可以让你成为灵魂魔法的专家，他目前住在渡鸦海滨的港口城市中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:469
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:469
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Zevah Poised, Expert instructor of the arcane skills of Body Magic, lives with his people on the Islands of Dagger Wound in the Ifarine Sea."
msgstr "赛瓦·波斯德是肢体魔法的专家级教师，目前和他的同胞们居住在伊法力海中的匕伤群岛上。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:473
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:473
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Master Lunius Dawnbringer, dwells among the the Clerics of Murmurwoods.He can promote you to Master of Light Magic, if you can survive the dangers of the forest."
msgstr "卢理那斯·破晓者是光明魔法的大师，他目前居住在低语森林，靠近太阳神庙的地方。如果你能够穿越危险的森林，他就能够让你成为光明魔法的大师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:476
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:476
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Dark Magic Master Carla Umberpool followed the travels of Sithicus Shadowrunner, Grand Master of the Dark, and makes her home with the Necromancers of Shadowspire."
msgstr "暗黑魔法的大师卡拉·安伯普尔居住在阴影塔附近的城市中。她和她的老师一样四处旅行，不过目前暂时定居下来，和死灵法师们切磋技巧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:485
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:485
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Quick Jeni, is the Master of the Repair Item skill. She lives in the village around the Dargon Hunter's Fort in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "逵克·珍妮是大师级的修补术导师，她目前居住在绞刑峡谷猎龙人聚居处附近的小屋内。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:487
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:487
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Menasaur, the strongest Lizardmen on the Dagger Wound Islands, is the Expert instructor of the Body Building skill. "
msgstr "曼纳梭尔是匕伤群岛上最强壮的蜥蜴人，也是健身术技能的专家级教师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:491
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:491
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Gretchin Nevermore, instructs all Clerics of the Sun the Master arts of Meditation. He dwells in the Murmurwoods near the Temple of the Sun."
msgstr "葛拉琴·耐芙莫尔是冥想术的大师，他负责教导太阳神庙的牧师们冥想术。他住在太阳神庙附近的低语森林中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:496
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:496
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Kethric Tarent, teaches the Expert knowledge of Regeneration from his home in the Ironsand Desert, in the village of Rust."
msgstr "凯斯瑞·塔兰在他位于铁沙漠的铁锈镇中教导专家级的再生术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:499
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:499
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Chevon Wist, teaches the Expert knowledge of the Disarm Trap skill, which has proven useful to those who explore the ruined temples near his home on the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr "齐旺·维斯特是专家级的陷阱拆卸术导师，目前他在位于匕伤群岛的家中教导这项技能。在附近的人探索神庙废墟的时候，都认为这个技能相当的好用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:501
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:501
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Gareth Lifter, Grand Master of Disarming Traps, lives on the opulent island of Regna, where he teaches his fellow pirates in the best way to trap their chests of stolen booty."
msgstr "加拉司·理夫特是陷阱拆卸术的宗师，他在雷格那的小岛上教导这项技能。海盗们都是从他身上学到如何在抢来的货物上设下陷阱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:502
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:502
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes! Yes! An excellent idea. You are just the kind of companions I am seeking. I have heard of you and your adventures."
msgstr "没问题！太棒了。你就是我在找寻的冒险伙伴，我已经听说了很多有关你的事迹！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:503
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:503
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No. I am an elder vampire. To be clear, you're not worthy of me. I seek adventure, not to be your caretaker. I don't have the patience to teach you all the basics."
msgstr "不行。我是有一点身份地位的吸血鬼。说得明白一点，我想要的是冒险，不是照顾小孩，你们的技巧还不足以和我匹配，我懒得教导你们这些菜鸟。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:504
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:504
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes, you seem worthy of my company. Very well, I will go if you will have me."
msgstr "你们的确符合我的要求，如果你们愿意的话，我会加入你们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:505
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:505
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I think not. Now that I've had a chance to look at you, it is clear that you are not worthy of my company. I seek a group of greater renown."
msgstr "我想还是算了吧！在我仔细打量了你们一下之后，我发现你们的能力不足，我需要的是比较强悍有经验的冒险伙伴。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:506
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:506
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I must say I find the idea appealing. Hmmm, yes! The taste of the open road is just what I need. I have been long at this business of dragon slaying, and I must say it grows stale. A man must keep himself interested. I will go with you if you like."
msgstr "我觉得这个点子相当不错。嗯嗯，好的！开阔的空气和环境正是我所需要的。我已经在猎龙上花了太久的时间了，开始觉得有些无聊。男人必须随时转换工作才行。如果你们愿意的话，我会和你们一起走。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:512
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:512
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lasatin the Scarred, Master of the Armsmaster skill, lives on the Islands of Dagger Wound."
msgstr "疤面拉沙庭是武器使用术的大师级导师，目前居住在匕伤群岛上。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:514
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:514
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must be joking! I am a rightly famous knight. Why would I want to travel with such riff-raff as yourselves? Oh, it might be fun after a fashion, but I do have my reputation to think of."
msgstr "你一定是在开玩笑吧！我是一名威名远播的骑士。我怎么可能会和你这种名不见经传的家伙一起旅行呢？喔，也许会很好玩啦，但是我还要顾及自己的声誉呢。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:515
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:515
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes! That sounds great. From what I hear of your adventures you have a chance to know greatness. With my help, we could make that chance a certainty. Well, shall we? I'm always looking for a chance to add to my legend!"
msgstr "听起来真是太棒了！从我听说的状况看起来，你们应该有机会可以成功。如果有了我的帮忙，你们就一定会成功了。我们要出发了吗？我一向很愿意让自己的传奇再度加倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:516
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:516
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Join you? Ho-ho. What an amusing idea. Why would the great Thorne Understone travel with the likes of you?"
msgstr "加入你们？哈哈，我这种身份地位的人干嘛要加入你们？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:517
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:517
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tabitha Watershed, Expert Alchemist, teaches the skills of potions and poultices from her home in the merchant city of Alvar."
msgstr "塔必煞·瓦特沙是炼金术技能的专家级导师，她在阿尔瓦商业城中教授弟子。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:518
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:518
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Kethry Treasurestone, Master Alchemist, lives in the Murmurwoods, studying plants and mushrooms that grow in that peaceful forest."
msgstr "凯斯瑞·宝石是大师级的炼金术技能导师，他居住在低语森林这个区域中。目前他正在研究该处各种各样的植物。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:520
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:520
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Petra Mithrit, Expert in the skill of Learning, dwells near the Temple of the Sun in the Murmurwoods."
msgstr "派德拉·密斯瑞是学习术的专家级导师，他居住在低语森林的区域，靠近太阳神庙的地方。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:530
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:530
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Master Dragon Erthint is the Flight Leader of all of the Dragons that serve under Deftclaw Redreaver, and can instruct a Dragon in Mastery of his natural Dragon abilities. Erthint lives in the Dragon Caves of Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "大师级飞龙能力的教师鄂欣特居住在绞刑峡谷中的龙穴内。他是所有飞龙队伍的领导者，地位仅次于达夫克劳，因此拥有足够的资格和地位教导你相关的知识。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:535
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:535
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Here's your weapon. If you find more ore, I'll be happy to make you more weapons."
msgstr "这是你的武器，如果你找到了更多的矿石。我很愿意替你制造更多的武器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:537
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:537
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Here's your armor. If you find more ore, I'll be happy to make you more armor."
msgstr "这是你的盔甲，如果你找到了更多的矿石。我很愿意替你制造更多的盔甲。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:539
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:539
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Here is your item. If you find more ore, I'll be happy to make you more items."
msgstr "这是你的道具，如果你找到了更多的矿石。我很愿意替你制造更多的道具。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:544
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:544
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, \"adventure.\" Surely I have not had enough of it recently. Since our war with the Frost Giants, I have done little but train young warriors. Say, you wouldn't happen to want a traveling companion? Perhaps I could come with you. I have many skills you might find useful, and I swing a deadly axe!"
msgstr "啊，“冒险”。我最近的确比较缺乏这样东西。在我们和霜雪巨人的战争结束之后，我的任务就变成了训练我们的战士。对了，你不会刚好需要人和你一起旅行吧？也许我可以和你一起旅行。我有很多技巧对你有很大的帮助，而且我的斧头非常利喔！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:545
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:545
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes, adventure is a fine thing. Why I have had several. In fact, let me tell you about the time I….Say, it just occurred to me you are suggesting I adventure with you! A nice offer, but well…how can I say this politely? You're just not seasoned enough. I'm afraid I would grow bored with the kinds of challenges you are ready to face."
msgstr "是的，冒险是相当不错的事情。事实上，我自己还经历过很多次。让我告诉你其中几次比较精彩的……啊，我这才想到，原来你是在建议我和你一起冒险！这是个不错的建议……但是，我要怎么样顾及情面呢？你们的经验不够。恐怕我和你们一起旅行会很无聊的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:546
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:546
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, you suggest I come along with you to see the land for myself. An excellent suggestion. I am certainly well rested enough! Very well, I am ready to travel if you will take me."
msgstr "啊，你们建议我自己去见见世面。这个建议相当不错，我的确已经休息够了。太好了，如果你愿意接受我的话，我们就可以一起去旅行。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:547
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:547
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though I may not look it after my long sleep, know that you speak with one of the greatest vampires alive today. Go with you? I think not. Your inexperience would make you more of a hindrance to me than anything. I would do better on my own."
msgstr "虽然我刚经过一场冬眠，看起来也许不怎么样。但是，你知道吗？和你说话的是目前世界上最伟大的吸血鬼之一。和你们一起走？我可不这么认为。你们这种菜鸟只会成为我的负担而已，我最好自己一个人去旅行比较好。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:548
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:548
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Join you! Ha! I admire your audacity. Yes…admire it a great deal. Very well. You have my respect. I will go with you."
msgstr "加入你们？哈！我真是敬佩你们的大胆。没错……非常敬佩。嗯，最近有这种胆子的人不多了，我愿意和你们一起走。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:549
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:549
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Join you? What a fool's notion. I already travel with a certain number of fleas. I don't need any more parasites. Be gone!"
msgstr "加入你们？真是太愚蠢了，我已经带着身上这么多跳蚤旅行了，不需要再加上你们这些寄生虫了。快滚！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:551
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:551
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am pleased with these Ironfists and their sage, Xanthor. Though we have never worked together directly, their work in Enroth and Erathia against the Necromancers' Guild and the devils have clearly marked them as servants of The Light. I have full faith in their plans for saving us from the crisis."
msgstr "我对于艾恩法斯特家族和他们的智者萨索尔加入的这件事情感到很高兴。虽然我从来没有和他们直接合作过，但是他们在恩洛斯和埃拉西亚上打击死灵法师公会和恶魔的成就确实使他们成为了光明使徒的典范。我对他们解决危机的计划充满信心。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:552
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:552
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Sun Temple has had much time to study the gateway which appeared in Murmurwoods. I am positive it leads to the Plane of Air. On several occasions my brothers have seen air spirits around the gateway. Some of the braver have peered through it and have reported seeing a whirling realm of clouds."
msgstr "太阳神庙有很多的时间研究出现在低语森林中的传送门。我很确定它是通往风元素界的通道。我的弟兄们有几次曾经亲眼目击到有风元素从传送门离开。有些更勇敢的人们甚至曾经从传送门往内看过，他们发现了一个里面有云层快速卷动的世界。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:553
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:553
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As a Priest of the Light, I have my own ideas about the source of the crisis. I am positive that either the Temple of the Moon or the Necromancers' Guild is somehow involved. Great Light! What if they've banded together? What a horrid thought."
msgstr "身为光明之道的牧师，我对于危机有自己的定义。我很确定月亮神庙或是死灵法师公会有牵扯进去。天哪！万一他们联合起来怎么办，这真是太可怕了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:554
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:554
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm not sure you can trust the words of this so called, \"Destroyer.\" Certainly he is not the Destroyer of scripture. And all this talk of Kreegans and men living on many worlds. It flies in the face of the Truth my temple has shepherded from the beginning of time!"
msgstr "我不太确定我们是否可以相信这个所谓毁灭者所说的话。他一定不可能是圣书中所说的毁灭者，而他所谓的恶魔和人们居住在许多世界的说法更是完全与我们这座神庙所坚持的理念相违背！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:555
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:555
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is good to have you with us, Heroes of Jadame. Know that the Temple of the Sun also considers you servants of the Light. You are always welcome among us."
msgstr "贾丹姆大陆的英雄，有你们在这里真好。太阳神庙认为你们也是光明的使徒。我们永远都欢迎你们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:556
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:556
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I wish my first visit to Ravenshore was made under better circumstances. This town has a lot to offer and I wish I had time to explore it more. On the bright side, this merchant house has a great library. Have you seen it?"
msgstr "真希望我来拜访渡鸦海滨的第一次旅程能够在比较不一样的状况下。这座城镇有很多有趣的事情，我真希望自己有时间多逛逛。不过，至少这座商人之家拥有非常大的图书馆。你去过那边了吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:557
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:557
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Regnans have built and outpost on one of the Dagger Wound Islands. We fear they may attack Ravenshore. If this happens, we will evacuate the city. We will return once the garrison has rid Ravenshore of pirates."
msgstr "雷格那人在匕伤群岛上已经建造了一个前哨站。我们担心他们会从那边攻击渡鸦海滨。如果发生了这种悲剧，我们就必须先疏散渡鸦海滨中的居民才行。在渡鸦海滨的守军赶走了海盗之后，我们会再度回来的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:558
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:558
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When I became herd leader, I never expected my reign would be so full of rich experience. Certainly I never thought I'd meet anyone like Queen Catherine! Did you know that until she abdicated her rule in Erathia, she was ruler of both it and Enroth?"
msgstr "当我成为领袖的时候，我并没有意料到我的统治会带来这么多的经验。我根本没想过我会遇到凯瑟琳皇后！你知道吗？在她逊位之前，她本来是埃拉西亚和恩洛斯的统治者！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:559
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:559
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As you know, the gateway leading to the Plane of Water appeared near Balthazar Lair in Ravage Roaming. It lies in the middle of the lake created by the great flood that poured forth from it."
msgstr "如同你知道的一样，通往水元素界的传送门出现在残破镇的巴尔萨煞巢穴，也就是在一个大湖正中央。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:560
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:560
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You may have difficulty finding supplies in the lands beyond the crystal. When I left Balthazar Lair, I brought with me a quantity of the iron rations carried by my armies on campaign. Here, take what I have. They are light and nourishing. I hope you find them useful."
msgstr "在水晶之后的世界中你可能会很难找到足够的补给。当我离开巴尔萨煞巢穴的时候，我带了一些干粮，这些是我的部队和族人旅行时携带的粮食。它们很轻，营养也很充足。我希望能够帮上你的忙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:561
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:561
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Why if the imprisonment of the elemental lords is what started this crisis, then surely releasing them is the way to end it! They are beings of almost unimaginable power. Once freed of the Destroyer's control, they would be able to set things right again. This must be what the prophecy speaks of!"
msgstr "如果元素之王的被禁锢导致了这一切的灾变，那么，释放他们当然会结束这一切！他们是拥有强大力量的生物。一旦他们脱离了毁灭者的控制，他们一定可以把事情重新处理好的。这一定就是预言所提到的状况！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:562
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:562
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It cannot be said enough. My herd as well as all the beings of Jadame are forever in your debt. Thanks to your good work here and in the planes, Balthazar Lair can once again know greatness. You and your comrades are welcome here any time you wish to visit. A blessing on you all!"
msgstr "我们对你的感激真是无比的深重。我的同胞和贾丹姆大陆上所有的生物都是你所拯救的。多谢你在此地和在元素界中的努力，巴尔萨煞巢穴又有了继续发展的机会。你和你的同志们随时都可以来拜访我们，我们永远欢迎你们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:563
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:563
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can't help feeling that I could be doing better work elsewhere. I'm sure Thant can handle operation of the guild in my absence, but still, sitting here on my hands while we are at war with the Sun Temple tries my patience. You really must be quicker about your duties!"
msgstr "我实在忍不住要想：如果我在其它地方会不会比较有用。我很确定谭特可以替我掌管死灵法师公会，但是，当我们在和太阳神庙作战的时候，我竟然不能够亲自带领军队，实在让我很担心。你的动作最好快一点！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:564
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:564
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When one thinks of the Regnans, the phrase \"masters of magic\" doesn't normally come to mind. But I caution you, the Regnan pirates have held their island for many centuries. They have had much time to both acquire and study arcane knowledge. Some powerful magicians live there. If you must face them in combat, be prepared for anything."
msgstr "当我们想到雷格那人的时候，很少人会认为他们是魔法的大师。但是我必须要提醒你一点，雷格那人已经控制了他们的岛屿许多年，拥有足够的时间和资源去研究魔法方面的知识。有许多厉害的法师居住在该处。如果你必须和他们战斗，请做好准备。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:565
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:565
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is not true that we of the Necromancers' Guild do not respect mages of other schools. That they have chosen paths leading to lesser powers is of their own concerns. This Xanthor is formidable for a wizard not of the Dark Path. As much as is possible, I find his advise, passably worthy."
msgstr "我们死灵法师公会其实是很尊重其它学派法师的。他们自己愿意选择低下的力量作研究是他们自己的意愿。以一个不属于黑暗界的法师来说，萨索尔算是相当厉害的家伙。就我来看，我想他的建议还算是可以接受。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:566
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:566
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have learned that the Dark Dwarves of Alvar hold an item I have long coveted, but may be of particular use to you if you when you travel among the elemental planes. The Ring of Planes conveys upon its wearer powerful wards against damaging spells of earth, water, air, and fire."
msgstr "我听说阿尔瓦的黑暗矮人手中有一个我已经寻求很久的物品，也许可以协助你在元素界之间旅行。次元之戒可以让持有者对于地、水、风、火的攻击拥有相当的抵抗力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:567
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:567
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "In my studies I have learned something of this Plane Between Planes. It is written that its denizens are not born in the normal fashion. I have heard that creatures can be found there which manifest the energies of the nightmare dreams of humankind. I have little more information, but I imagine such a creature would be both powerful and malevolent."
msgstr "在我研究的过程中，我对于这个界间之地有了一些认知。居住在其中的生物并非是通过一般的方式诞生的，我听说在那边的生物是通过收集人类恶梦的能源而创造出来的。我没有更进一步的信息，但是，我认为这样的生物应该拥有相当可怕的力量。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:568
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:568
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A basic fact of magic is that Fire opposes Water, and Air opposes Earth. Within these parings, the one element has weaknesses regarding its opposite element. I expect the Destroyer exploits this principle in the construction of his prisons."
msgstr "魔法的基本常识是：火和水互克、风和地互克。在这些配对中，每个元素都有一些对应元素可以压制的弱点。我预料毁灭者将会照着这样的相生相克来建造他的监狱。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:569
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know I speak for the guild when I say we owe you a debt of gratitude. I discharge this debt by granting you and your companions safe passage through all lands under our control. No guild member will kidnap you for arcane experimentation, nor will any member consider you feed for his servants, living or otherwise. This guild edict will be in effect for a period of one year from today.\n\nAnd of course, you have my personal, thanks."
msgstr "当我说我们很感激你的时候，我代表的是全公会。我现在给予你在公会管辖下所有土地自由通行的权力，以便还你这个人情债。没有任何的公会成员会绑架你进行魔法实验，也没有任何公会成员会让你成为他麾下使徒的食物。这个公会的饬令将会有一年的有效期。\n当然，我本人也对你非常感激。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:570
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:570
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The master is not here at present. He went to consult with Elgar Fellmoon at the council chamber. Perhaps you will find him there."
msgstr "大人现在不在，他去议会大厅和艾尔加·费尔蒙讨论事情了。也许你可以在那边找到他。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:571
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The crystal placed by the Destroyer in the town square serves two functions. One, if we do nothing, it will destroy the world. Two, it acts as a gateway to another realm of existence--the Plane Between Planes--where the Destroyer most certainly has his base.\n\nThe crystal calls forth the elemental forces into our world and draws them to it. When these forces meet here at the crystal, the world will be destroyed in cataclysm. If we are to prevent this someone will have to use the crystal as a gateway to reach the Destroyer and either convince him to end his assault, or eliminate him."
msgstr "毁灭者在城镇广场上放置的水晶有两个主要用途。第一，如果我们袖手旁观，它将可以摧毁整个世界。第二，这是一个通往另一个次元——界间之地——的传送门，很明显，界间之地就是毁灭者的基地。\n这个水晶将元素界的力量召唤进我们世界中，并且吸引他们往这个水晶的方向集中。当这些力量在水晶中会合的时候，整个世界将会被大灾变给摧毁。如果我们想要阻止这一切，一定得有人通过这个传送门去寻找毁灭者，说服他终止这样的行为，或是消灭他。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:572
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Since the crystal is attuned to the elemental forces, it will only pass through those who are themselves so attuned. I believe it is possible to create a key that will simulate attunement for a small group such as yourselves. I can make the key, but require components of pure elemental forces to do so.\n\nSuch components exist in only one form that I know of. On each of the four elemental planes, you will find gemstones called the \"elemental hearts.\" Bring these to me and I will build the key to open the crystal gateway."
msgstr "由于这个水晶会和元素之力共振，所以他只容许拥有元素之力的人通过。我认为可以制造一个模拟元素共振的钥匙，让像你们这样的一小群人通过。我可以制造这把钥匙，但是我需要拥有纯粹元素之力的物品来制造它。\n这种物品我只知道以一种方式存在于这个世界。在每个元素界中，你们将可以找到一种被称为元素之心的宝石。将这些东西带给我，我将可以制造打开水晶传送门的钥匙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:573
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:573
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "To go through the crystal gateway and confront the Destroyer, you need the key I must build! To build this key, I need the elemental heart gemstones from the four elemental planes! Go and get these for me!"
msgstr "要穿过水晶传送门，面对毁灭者，你将会需要我的钥匙。而我需要四个元素界中的元素之心才能打造这个物品！快点去把它们找来给我！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:574
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:574
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am glad that you have had some measure of success in retrieving the elemental hearts, but what you have is not enough. I need one from each of the four elemental planes before I can build the key to the crystal gateway. Bring me the rest of the hearts so we can proceed."
msgstr "我很高兴你找回了部分的元素之心，但是，要成功的打造钥匙，我必须要有全部的四枚元素之心才行。把其它的元素之心带给我，这样我才可以继续我的工作。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:575
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Something about this crystal seems to put a compulsion on the denizens of the elemental planes. Why else would they make war on our plane? I have heard yours and other first hand reports. It seems almost as if these elementals are driven by a madness.\n\nAnd madness it is! For destroying Enroth would create a mighty planar unbalance which would certainly victimize their own planes. They might even conceivably be themselves destroyed in the cataclysm. At the very least, they risk changing the nature of their own planes. I cannot see how such change could possibly be for the better!"
msgstr "这个水晶似乎让元素界的生物感应到了一种奇怪的力量。否则他们干嘛在我们的世界上掀起战火？我已经看过你们的第一手报告，看起来似乎这些元素都被一种疯狂的力量所影响。\n这的确是非常的疯狂！因为摧毁恩洛斯将有可能在元素界之间造成不平衡的状态，危及他们自己的空间，他们甚至可能在这场大灾变中把自己也给卷入。即使在最乐观的状况下，他们所居住空间的也会受到影响。我根本不明白，这样的改变怎么可能带来任何的好处？"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:576
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "That the elemental lords are imprisoned on the Plane Between Planes explains much. I had wondered why the denizens of the Earth, Air, Water, and Fire Planes have become so hostile. Usually, they are content to keep to their own place in the order. I suppose it was necessary for the Destroyer to take the lords from their homelands. Without the lords calming presence, it would be much easier for him to compel the elementals as he has.\n\nIt is important for you to free the elemental lords. They can restore order to their planes and prevent the cataclysm!"
msgstr "元素之王被囚禁在界间之地元的事实证明了一切。我一直怀疑为什么地水风火元素界的生物会变得这么狂暴。因为在一般的状况下，他们通常只喜欢居住在自己的空间中。我认为毁灭者必须要将这些元素之王绑架后，才能让他更为轻易地操纵这些元素生物。\n你一定要救出这些元素之王才行。只有他们能够逆转大灾变，阻止末日的发生！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:577
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes, I have heard the name, \"Escaton.\" He is variously called in the legends of many cultures. I know not his nature, but it is his purpose to destroy worlds.\n\nYes, \"worlds,\" I say. More and more evidence points to the conclusion that Enroth is not the only place in this universe where there is life. Tales from before the Silence speak of many living among the stars. Yes, it sounds impossible to think that one could live on a light in the sky, but consider that these stars may be like our sun. If this is so, then why can't these suns shine on other places like Enroth? If this was the case, then there could be a \"destroyer of worlds.\" I believe that this is what we face."
msgstr "是的，我的确听过这个名字。“爱斯卡顿”。他在许多的文化和传说中拥有不同的名字。我不知道他到底是什么样的生物，但是他诞生的目的就是为了摧毁不同的世界。\n是的，我说的是各个不同的世界。有越来越多的证据指出恩洛斯并非是宇宙间唯一的世界。在大寂静之前的许多历史记载说明了有其他的生物居住在星辰之间。生物似乎不太可能生活在天空上，但是，也许这些星辰就如同我们的太阳一样。如果是这样的话，为什么那些太阳不会照耀在如同我们的恩洛斯一样的地方？如果是这样的话，的确有可能诞生一个“众多世界的毁灭者”。而我认为目前所面对的就是这样的一个生物。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:578
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No, I don't think I will be leaving when the Ironfists continue their journey back to Enroth. Perhaps I will join with them in some years, but for now, I find myself fascinated by these lands. Though it is destroyed, I would study the remains of the crystal gateway. Never in my knowledge has there been in this world an artifact of comparable power. Perhaps I will find some use for the crystal shards?\n\nNo matter. Regardless, when the Ironfists go, they will go without me."
msgstr "不，我不认为我会和艾恩法斯特家族一起回到恩洛斯。也许数年之后我会回到他们身边。但是目前我对于这些世界感到相当的有兴趣。虽然他们几乎都已经被摧毁了，但我愿意继续在这边研究水晶的碎片。就我所知，这个世界上从来没有任何这么强大力量的物品被创造出来。也许我可以替这些水晶找到一个作用？\n不管怎么样，艾恩法斯特家族离开的时候我不会跟他们一起走。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:579
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Without false modesty I must say that the Nightshade Brazier is the greatest creation of my dark arts. When its fires are properly tended, the accursed sun is incapable of shining within its area of influence. The soothing shadow of night takes up permanent residence over a vast region. Within these boundaries, vampires and other night creatures know freedoms they would not otherwise know. We are free of the crypts with no worries of the destroying light of day!\n\nAnd now the Temple of the Sun has taken my prize. It must be retrieved!"
msgstr "我不需要太过谦逊，因为龙葵灯炉的确是我很感到自豪的一个创造物。如果里面的火焰经过适当的处理，该死的太阳就没有办法在附近的区域中发出光芒。夜晚舒适的阴影将会笼罩一大部分的区域。在这区域中，吸血鬼和其它的黑夜生物将拥有前所未见的自由。我们将可以自由自在地在白天漫游，不用担心被阳光所毁灭！\n太阳神庙这次夺取了我的宝物，我们一定要将它夺回才行！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:580
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am Escaton the Destroyer also called \"Devil's Doom,\" \"The Spider in the Web Gate\" and \"Ruin.\" There are places where I am worshiped as a god. But to myself I think of myself only as a servant to my greater masters.\n\nKnow too that I have brought the cataclysm to your world, which must be destroyed. It is a doom you have brought on yourselves by failing to eliminate the devil Kreegans from your realms. "
msgstr "我是毁灭者爱斯卡顿，又被称作“恶魔末日”、“蛛网之门中的蜘蛛”、或是“废墟”。有些地方把我当做天神看待。但是，我自认为是更高力量主人的仆从。\n我这次的任务是将灾变带来到你们的世界中，因为这个世界必须被摧毁。这是由于你们无法把邪恶的克里根人彻底摧毁所带来的末日。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:581
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:581
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My masters are those who created me. They gave me form and function. I have thus proven indestructible. I destroy worlds infested by Kreegans."
msgstr "我的主人是那些创造我的人。是他们给予了我外形和能力。我是无法摧毁的。我的任务是摧毁那些被克里根人所占据的世界。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:582
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:582
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "On your world they speak of a Silence which has lasted for a thousand years and more. I am old beyond that and my masters are ancient to me."
msgstr "在你们世界上有一段传说持续了千年之久的寂静，我是在那之前许久诞生的。而我的主人们对我来说更是古老许多。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:583
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:583
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are more worlds than yours--a myriad of them. These worlds were once held in a great web whose threads could be traversed like bridges over rivers. What you call the Silence was marked by the breaking of the web which was built by my masters."
msgstr "宇宙中不只你们一个世界。这些世界曾经一度由如同蛛网一般的丝线所连接，各种生物可以利用这些丝线如同桥梁一般地四处通行。你们称作的大寂静是我的主人们所创造的丝线断裂的年代。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:584
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "At one time my ancient masters were caretakers of more worlds than there are apples in a bushel. Before the Kreegans--before the Silence--they were worlds of wonder. My masters were kings and queens of a golden civilization. I was made, not because I was needed, but because I could be made--a protector of that which needed no protection...a symbol of might to a mighty people.\n\nBut now, and for a millennium, the Kreegan blight has eaten away the splendor of the worlds. And so have my masters fallen. They are warlords and generals, and I am their greatest soldier."
msgstr "在远古的时代，我的主人们是许多许多世界的照顾者。在克里根人降临，也就是在大寂静之前，这个宇宙中充满了让人惊奇的奇迹。我的主人是伟大文明的皇后和国王。我之所以被制造出来，不是因为他们需要我，而是因为他们有能力制造我。我是个保护不需要保护的宇宙的守护者……是伟大生命力量之象征。\n但是现在，从许多许多年以前开始，克里根的瘟疫吞噬了世界的光辉。我的主人们也跟着倒下。他们是战将和君主，我则是他们最勇猛的士兵。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:585
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:585
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your world will be destroyed by the elemental forces that created it. The crystal in Jadame's central city compels those who live on the elemental planes to open their worlds onto yours. When their worlds meet at the crystal, the reaction will unleash irrepressible destruction across the lands, sky and sea. All things living will live no longer."
msgstr "你的世界将会被创造它的元素之力所摧毁。贾丹姆大陆主城中的水晶吸引元素界的生物进入你们的世界。当他们的世界在水晶处会合的时候，整个连锁反应将会释放出巨大的力量横越过大地、天空和海洋。所有活着的生物都将死亡。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:586
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The cataclysm was brought into being when I performed the ritual Convocation of Cataclysm which brought into being the crystal. It is a weapon of last resort created by my masters to defend themselves against the Kreegans.\n\nI do have other weapons. But when I became aware of the Kreegans infestation on your world, I deemed the use of ultimate force necessary. Your world has fallen so far--it seemed certain you would not be able to defend yourselves against my enemies. Though I underestimated your abilities, and the Kreegans were ultimately destroyed, I still feel that I was right to err on the side of caution."
msgstr "当我进行灾变召唤仪式时，大灾变就开始了。这是我的主人们创造出来对付克里根人的最后武器。\n我的确有其他的武器。但是，当我发现克里根人进入你的世界之后，我就认为最后武器的使用是无可避免的。你们的世界曾经陷入了极大的危机，看起来你们似乎没有自卫的能力。虽然我小看了你们的能力，而克里根人最后也被摧毁了，为了保险，我依旧觉得必须导正这一切。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:587
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:587
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My masters, afraid the Kreegans would learn ways to corrupt me, have made me incorruptible. I am unable to undo the Convocation of Cataclysm once it has been performed. This command of theirs is part of my very being. I am powerless but to obey."
msgstr "我的主人担心克里根人会找到可以感染我的方法，因此让我成为不受外界力量影响的战士。一旦灾变召唤仪式开始了，我就不可能逆转这个动作。这是我被创造出来的工作之一，我根本无法反抗他们。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:588
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Convocation of Cataclysm, as powerful as it is, cannot of itself destroy a world. Each of the elemental planes is ruled by a lord. These lords can fight the compulsion placed on their lesser subjects. For this reason, I have removed the lords from their realms. They are my \"guests\" for the time being.\n\nOnce the cataclysm has run its course, I will return them so that they might rebuild your realm and theirs."
msgstr "灾变召唤仪式虽然非常强大，但却不可能单靠己身而摧毁整个世界。每个元素界都在一个元素之王的统治之下。这些元素之王可以反抗对他们属下的引诱。因此，我已经将这些元素之王从他们的世界中抓了出来。他们目前是我的“客人”。\n一旦大灾变结束之后，我将会把他们放回去，好让他们重建自己的世界和你们的世界。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:589
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "In the time since the Silence, your world has lost knowledge of the Kreegan's origin. That they resemble the devils of myth has been enough for you, and indeed, \"devils\" is what most call them. The truth is they came from the beyond. Before they attacked us, my masters had no knowledge of them.\n\nThe Kreegans infest our worlds and spread if they can. It would seem in an endless universe that they could expand in another direction than ours. But they have not made this choice so we must defend ourselves from them."
msgstr "从大寂静之后，你的世界已经忘记了克里根人的起源。对你们来说，他们和恶魔一样的这个事实就已经够了。的确，大多数的人也叫他们作恶魔。他们是从宇宙的边缘出现的。在他们攻击我们之前，我的主人们根本不知道他们的存在。\n克里根人感染我们的世界，并且尽可能地扩张。如果他们选择往另外一个方向发展，这个宇宙其实是无限大的。但是他们并没有做出这样的选择，所以我们必须防御他们的攻击。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:590
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am aware that the king and queen of Enroth have rid your world of Kreegans. Still, your world is to be destroyed. Once I am called, I must perform the Convocation. Once the Convocation is begun, it must continue.\n\nI was called while Kreegan still lived on your world. It matters not that they were dust by the time I arrived."
msgstr "我知道恩洛斯的国王和皇后毁灭了这些恶魔。但是，我必须要摧毁你们的世界。一旦我受到了召唤，我就必须要执行仪式。一旦仪式开始了，大灾变就必须继续下去。\n我被召唤的时候是那些克里根人还存在于这个世界上的时候，即使他们在我到达的时候都已经化成灰烬了也没有影响。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:591
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:591
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If it were not for the Kreegans and the state of war they impose, my masters could rebuild the Web of Worlds and lift what you call \"The Silence.\" My masters have attempted to rebuild the Web many times, but the Kreegans always destroy it. Now they have concluded that the Kreegans must be entirely eliminated or the golden civilization will never rise again. It is to fulfill this purpose that I have been created."
msgstr "如果不是因为克里根人和他们四处宣战的天性，我的主人们老早就把世界之网给重建好了。我的主人们已经试图重建世界之网许多次，但是每次都被这些克里根人给摧毁了。现在他们已经意识到，如果不把克里根人彻底摧毁，黄金的年代就永远不会到来。因此，我才被创造出来。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:592
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As far as I'm able to feel such, I am amazed that your world was able to eliminate its Kreegan infestation. They are quite a bit more…advanced than you. The king and queen of Enroth must be strategists of the highest order. Too bad that they were not able to finish their task sooner.\n\nIf I could regret, I would regret having to needlessly annihilate your world."
msgstr "从我有限的思考模式看起来，我很惊讶你们能够消灭克里根人。他们比你们要先进许多……恩洛斯的国王和皇后一定是超凡的战略家才有可能达成这个任务。真可惜他们不能早点完成这个任务。\n如果我拥有后悔功能的话，我会觉得如此摧毁你们的世界真是遗憾。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:593
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes, your world does need saving! The cataclysm, if not stopped, will destroy it utterly.\n\nA quandary for you: I, as bringer of the cataclysm know how it can be ended. Further, I acknowledge that since there are no longer Kreegans on your world it need not be destroyed. But, as servant to my masters, I am compelled to let the cataclysm continue by not divulging my knowledge to you.\n\nStill I will ask you some questions. Perhaps there is something for you in the answers?"
msgstr "是的，你的世界的确需要被拯救！大灾变如果不被阻止，将会彻底摧毁这个世界。\n我可以给你一个提示：我身为大灾变的召唤者，当然知道该如何阻止大灾变。另外，我也知道由于你的世界上已经没有克里根人的存在，这个世界不需要被摧毁。但是，身为主人的仆从，我必须要让大灾变继续进行，避免因为我对你透露消息，而让大灾变被终止。\n所以，我会问你一些问题，也许这些问题的答案就是你所找寻的线索。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:594
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though I must destroy your world, what I need do I have already done. Until the cataclysm has culminated, there is nothing to stop me from indulging you with my conversation. This cannot continue forever. Nothing does.\n\nSometimes questions create more questions. Sometimes they provide answers. I wonder what my questions will provide you?"
msgstr "虽然我必须要摧毁你的世界，但是我该做的都已经做了。在大灾变结束之前，我没有别的任务让我不能和你讲话。不过，这也不能够持续到永远。没有事情可以持续到永远。\n有些时候，问题会创造出更多的问题来。有些时候他们反而可以提供解答。不知道我的问题可以提供给你什么样的信息？"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:595
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My masters have made me a holder, and not a giver, of knowledge. Still perhaps you have given yourself knowledge through my questions? I have given you all the questions I will, so you must look at what you have. Perhaps you should question the answers.\n\nA \"prison\" implies a prisoner. Who? \"Inside?\" Inside of what? And \"egg.\" What kind of egg? A bird's egg? Perhaps something like an egg?"
msgstr "我的主人创造我是让我成为知识的保管者，并非给予者。但是，也许你们可以通过这些问题知道更多的知识。我已经把我所有知道的问题都告诉了你们，你们必须要看看自己有些什么。也许你们应该对这些答案提出进一步的问题才对。\n\n“监狱”代表着有犯人。谁？“里面”？在什么里面？还有“蛋”，什么样的蛋？鸟的蛋？也许是形状像是蛋的物品？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:597
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:597
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes. Your answer seems to fit the riddle nicely. Perhaps that is the correct answer."
msgstr "是的，你的答案似乎挺正确的。也许就是正确的答案。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:598
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:598
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "That doesn't seem right at all."
msgstr "听起来一点也不对。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:599
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:599
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Jails, prisons and cells come in many forms. We hear of so called \"prisons of the mind.\" But I wonder. The riddle seems to speak of a physical prison. What think you?"
msgstr "监狱、牢房有许多种类的形式。听说有种所谓“心灵的监狱”。我不知道。这个谜题中暗示的似乎是个有形的监狱。你觉得呢？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:601
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:601
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The vagaries of language are many. Still, your answer seems to apply well to the question."
msgstr "语言是十分变幻莫测的。不过，你的回答似乎就是这个谜题的答案。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:602
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:602
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I suppose that could work…no, on second thought, it seems entirely wrong."
msgstr "我想这也许是对的……不对，再想想，你完全错了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:603
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:603
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Inside. Inside what? And what is inside? And while we're asking...why?"
msgstr "里面。在什么里面？什么在里面？我们又是为了什么在研究这个问题？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:605
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:605
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What else indeed could the answer be? I'm sure if one were to apply some thought, one could think of something. Still in these matters, it is best to have confidence in one's clearest thought. I suppose your answer could be correct."
msgstr "答案还可能是什么呢？我很确定，如果你多想想，一定可以想出别的答案来。但在这样的情况下，其实第一个想到的东西多半就是正确的。我想这答案应该是正确的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:606
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:606
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I don't see how that could be the answer. Really I can't."
msgstr "我觉得这不是正确答案。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:607
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:607
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "\"Egg,\" yes. or perhaps, \"eggs.\" Eggs are a source of life, a seed of sorts. They are also of an unusual shape not found in many places elsewhere. Perhaps placing the answer in context will give a clue or some direction."
msgstr "“蛋”，是的。蛋是生命的源头，是许多生物的种子。它们也拥有非常特殊的形状，这样的形状不是到处都可见的。也许你把所有的答案放在当前情况下想一想，就能够获得一些线索或方向。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:608
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I would judge that you've answered the riddles correctly. I suppose in asking them to you I have in some way helped you. As far as I and my nature are concerned, this is sufficient.\n\nAs a reward for your performance, take this small bauble. I have more than one and therefore, more than I require. And see? I can give it to you because I don't know you have the knowledge to use it."
msgstr "你已经正确回答了所有的谜题。我觉得在询问你的过程中，我已经通过某些方法帮了你的忙，这应该足够了。由于我天性的限制，我也没法多说了。\n\n为了奖励你们的努力，请收下这个小玩意儿。我拥有不只一个，因此我不需要这么多。你知道吗？我能够把它给你，是因为我不知道你懂得如何使用它。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:609
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:609
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for releasing me. I go now to restore order to my realm and to do what I can for yours. Know that Shalwend, Lord of Air, holds you in his favor. Farewell."
msgstr "多谢你放出我，我现在得要回到我的世界恢复秩序，并且拯救你的世界。风元素之王永远感谢你。再会了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:610
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:610
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "\"The Destroyer\" is a fitting moniker for one who would imprison me in such a fashion. If it were not for you, I, Acwalander, Lord of Water, would have soon perished. My passing would have had an unbalancing effect across all the planes. Thank you. I go now to set things right."
msgstr "能够把我禁锢在这边的人，用毁灭者称呼他实在是相当正确的。如果不是因为你的援手，我——水元素之王很有可能就这么被毁灭。我的毁灭将会造成所有元素界的不平衡。多谢你，我得要去让一切恢复旧观了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:611
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:611
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am free! Now will he who was fool enough to jail me--this Destroyer--feel my wrath. That I, the Lord of Earth, am called \"Gralkor the Cruel\" is no mistake. The suffering I have felt will be his returned in multitudes!"
msgstr "我自由了！我将要让这个囚禁我的笨蛋，什么鬼毁灭者知道我有多生气！我所受的苦将会以百倍千倍报应到他身上！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:612
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:612
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Free at last. My torment is over, but what of my subjects? I know the Destroyer has them compelled to a terrible task. My presence will sooth them. I must go. I must…farewell…"
msgstr "我终于被释放了。我的苦刑已经结束了，但是我的子民们呢？我知道毁灭者强迫他们执行一个可怕的任务。我的出现将会让他们获得安宁。我得赶快走了。再会……"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:613
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:613
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No! Someone must remain here to guard the lair against the barbarian raiders. Come back after you've helped my herd. I may consider joining you then."
msgstr "不行！一定有人得留在这里，守卫巢穴不受野蛮人的入侵。在你拯救了我的同胞之后再回来找我，那时我也许可以加入你们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:614
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:614
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are many predators who would take advantage of the lair in this vulnerable time. I've already driven off looters…and worse. One of Zog's patrols stopped by soon after the flood. I fought them off, but some escaped. I am sure they will be back in greater numbers."
msgstr "在这个动荡的时代，有很多掠食者可能会入侵这个地方。我已经驱赶走了很多的土匪，还有更糟糕的……索格的巡逻队曾经误闯过这里，我杀死了大部分，但是还有一些逃掉了。我想他们可能会成群结队地跑回来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:615
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:615
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have no more rations to give. If you need more, you'll have to find food elsewhere."
msgstr "我已经没有干粮可以给你了。如果你需要更多，你得去别的地方找才行。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:616
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:616
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What with the damage caused by giant waves, falling rocks and the pirate raid, I don't know if our village will ever be the same. I know you have done great things for us, but not everything can be fixed once broken. I'm not sure what we'll do. Perhaps we will rebuild, or maybe we'll leave. Time and circumstance will decide."
msgstr "再经历过了巨浪、落石和海盗的劫掠之后，我不知道我们的村庄会不会再像以前一样。我知道你已经替我们做了很多，但并不是每样东西都可以恢复旧观。也许我们会重建，也许我们必须离开。也许时间到了我们就会知道。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:617
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:617
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good work dealing with those pirates. Now that they're gone, maybe Chief Onefang and his people can rebuild their lives. It really is a travesty what has happened here."
msgstr "多谢你们处理掉那些海盗。在那些海盗被赶走之后，也许单牙酋长和他的同胞们可以重建村庄。在这里发生过的事情实在是太糟糕了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:618
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:618
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sadly, the caravan was one of the first things the pirates looted in their raids. I have no idea what they're going to do with three-hundred cases of tobersk fruit! Naturally, I miss the fruit, but the worst of it is the damage they did to the carts. It looks like I'll be here for at least the next season overseeing their repair. I just hope the task is done before the next tobersk harvest so I can see some return out of this profitless venture."
msgstr "很遗憾的，海盗们一来到这边就开始抢劫这车队。我实在想不出来他们到底有三百箱的托伯斯克果干嘛！当然，我觉得水果被抢走了很可惜，但是他们对这些车子所造成的损害更让人痛心。看起来我至少要在这边待到下一季才能够修好这些车子。我只希望这整个整修工程能够在下一次托伯斯克果采收之前完成，好让我勉强捞回一笔来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:619
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:619
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You are indeed earning your way to this months bounty but have not yet reached the number of kills needed!"
msgstr "你的确杀死了这个月所指定的猎物，但是数量还不够多！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:631
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:631
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I pay 250 gold for every intact Dire Wolf Pelt that you return to me."
msgstr "你每给我一张猛狼皮，我就会给你250个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:637
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:637
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Dark Elves of Alvar pay well for leather made from Naga Hides. Once treated and tanned, the Naga Hides can last almost longer than a Dark Elf's lifetime! "
msgstr "阿尔瓦的黑暗精灵很喜欢蛇龙皮所制作的皮件。只要经过适当的处理和染色，蛇龙皮几乎和黑暗精灵的寿命一样长。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:638
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:638
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will pay you 500 gold for each Naga Hide you bring."
msgstr "你每带来一份蛇龙皮，我就愿意付500个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:651
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:651
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I pay 500 gold for every wasp stinger you bring me!"
msgstr "你每带一个黄蜂刺来，我就付给你500个金币！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:679
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:679
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings Master Bounty Hunter! The Guild of Bounty Hunters thanks you for your services to all of Jadame. We are at your disposal!"
msgstr "你好，赏金猎人大师！赏金猎人公会感谢你替贾丹姆大陆的付出。我们愿意听您的吩咐！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:689
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:689
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "1500 gold!"
msgstr "这是给你的1500个金币！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:692
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:692
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, the right ingredients always do the trick! Here is your potion."
msgstr "啊，药材正确就可以有正确的效果！这是你需要的药剂。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:701
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:701
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tobersk pulp is combined with the waters of the Alvar River and is distilled over time until the brew masters declare it ready for consumption. "
msgstr "托伯斯克果汁必须和阿尔瓦的水混合，慢慢地发酵出酒精，直到酒窖主人认为这过程已经完成为止。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:710
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:713
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:710
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:713
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "These Forged Credit Vouchers are used by agents of the Ogre Mage Zog to acquire gold from the Merchants of Alvar."
msgstr "食人妖法师索格的属下所用的伪造凭证可以从阿尔瓦商人手中领到一些金钱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:743
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:743
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am very sick, without a Cure Disease scroll I will surely perish from Yellow Fever!."
msgstr "我病的很重，如果没有治愈疾病的卷轴，我一定会因为黄热病而死的！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:744
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:744
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks for the cure! Be sure to deliver scrolls to those who still suffer from the Yellow Fever."
msgstr "多谢你给我这个卷轴，但此地的其它人并还没有好！请记得把这些卷轴也送给其它有黄热病的人们！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:745
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:745
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The epidemic continues! The people on the outer islands will perish!"
msgstr "传染病还是没有消退！外岛上的人们一定会全部患病的！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:746
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:746
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Without the Anointed Herb Potion we cannot remove the poison from our water supply!"
msgstr "如果没有圣草药剂，我们没办法把毒素从水井中消除！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:753
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:753
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you again for making it possible for me to return to my family! The Clan Leader shall hear of your help!"
msgstr "多谢你让我可以和家人团圆！我一定会和族长报告这件事情的！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:755
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:755
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have no more pelts, return when you have more!"
msgstr "你身上已经没有兽皮了，当你找到更多兽皮之后再回来吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:760
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:760
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Return to me with Ogre ears if you wish to be paid!"
msgstr "如果你想要钱的话，请带食人妖耳朵来找我！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:764
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:764
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks for the potion!"
msgstr "多谢你给我的药剂！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:766
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:766
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Return when you have more Wyvern Horns and I will pay you more!"
msgstr "当你找到更多的双足翼龙角的时候，我会付给你更多的金币！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:768
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:768
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I pay 1000 gold for Royal Wasp Jelly!"
msgstr "我愿意出1000个金币购买黄蜂蜂王胶！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:770
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:770
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Return when you have Wasp Jelly and then I will pay you!"
msgstr "在你找到了黄蜂蜂王胶之后再回来找我！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:776
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:776
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I ask for the Bone, and you return with nothing. Be gone!"
msgstr "我要你去找毁灭之骨，你什么也没找到！快滚！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:777
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:777
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I need not see you again until you have the Puzzle Box!"
msgstr "在你找到机关盒之前我不会再和你谈话！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:779
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:779
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have not gathered sufficient bounties to allow us to promote you!"
msgstr "你还没有获得足够的赏金来让我们晋升你！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:780
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:780
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You currently hold the rank of Novice Bounty Hunter, but lack sufficient bounty to be promoted to Journeyman."
msgstr "你目前是赏金猎人生手，没有足够的赏金点数被晋升为老手。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:781
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:781
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You currently hold the rank of Journeyman Bounty Hunter, but lack sufficient bounty to be promoted to Master."
msgstr "你目前是赏金猎人老手，没有足够的赏金点数被晋升为大师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:782
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:782
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You currently hold the rank of Master Bounty Hunter! This is the highest rank of our guild."
msgstr "你目前是赏金猎人大师，这是我们公会最崇高的称号了！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:783
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lying as they do on opposite ends of the Light to Dark spectrum, relationships between the Necromancers' Guild and the Temple of the Sun have never been the best, but now they battle openly. Oskar Tyre, head priest of the Temple says a holy vision drove him to declare war on the guild so as to rid Jadame of the taint of darkness.\n\nBoth groups are relative newcomers to our continent. The guild has set up its foothold in Shadowspire, and the First (and only) Sun Temple of Jadame is in Murmurwoods."
msgstr "他们就如同光明与黑暗两个光谱上的极端一样，死灵法师公会和太阳神庙之间的关系一直都不好，但现在是他们公开宣战的时段。奥斯卡·提尔宣称他看见了不寻常的启示，督促他将这股污染贾丹姆大陆的力量从世界上彻底消除。\n两群人都不是在我们的大陆上土生土长的。公会基地在阴影塔区域，第一个，也是唯一的太阳神庙则是在低语森林。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:784
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:784
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Through your delivery of the Nightshade Brazier into their hands, the Necromancers' Guild has come out on top in their war with the Temple of the Sun. The artifact's magic creates a permanent shadow of darkness which surrounds the Shadowspire region. Under this cover, vampires defend the land both day and night. This has allowed the guild to field larger forces of skeletons, zombies and other undead against the temple's armies. Each report I receive puts the heart of the battle closer and closer to the Sun Temple's doorstep."
msgstr "在你把龙葵灯炉送到死灵法师公会手上之后，他们已经在与太阳神庙的战争中占了上风。这个宝物的魔法会创造出永久性的黑暗，环绕着阴影塔地区。在这阴影的屏蔽之下，吸血鬼可以日夜不停地保护这块土地。公会则可以趁机驱使大群的骷髅人、僵尸和其它的不死生物对抗神庙的部队。我所收到的每一份报告都指出这场战争越来越靠近太阳神庙的门槛了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:785
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:785
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Because you have destroyed the Necromancers' Guild Skeleton Transformer, the Temple of the Sun has come out on top in their war with the guild. The skeletons created by the device made up the bulk of the guild's reinforcements. Without these, the necromancers' forces crumble before the temple's advance. Each report I receive puts the heart of the battle closer to the Necromancers' Guild doorstep."
msgstr "因为你已经摧毁了死灵法师公会的骷髅转换器，太阳神庙已经占了战争的上风。这个装置所制造出来的骷髅就无法继续加入战斗。没有了这些力量，死灵法师的部队在牧师的步步进逼下溃不成军。我所收到的每份报告都指出，这场战争越来越接近死灵法师公会的门槛。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:786
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:786
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The renown Dragon slayer, Charles Quixote of Erathia, has set up a hunting expedition in Garrote Gorge. This is no \"safari,\" in fact, it's the largest operation of this type I've heard of. The hunters have a permanent base from which they sell hides, eggs, baby dragons, and other items. Garrote Gorge has always had a large Dragon population, but I imagine they must be facing extinction--so efficient are Quixote's hunters."
msgstr "著名的屠龙者，从埃拉西亚来的查尔斯·吉柯德在绞刑峡谷指挥一场规模庞大的狩猎。这可不是什么野猎的旅程。事实上，这是我所听过最大规模的狩猎行动。猎人在峡谷中设立了一个永久性的基地，贩卖龙皮、龙蛋、幼龙和其它的物品。绞刑峡谷自古到今都是大量飞龙聚集的地方。但是吉柯德的猎人效率惊人，我想飞龙们可能已经面对灭绝的命运。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:787
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:787
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It seems Charles Quixote's Dragon hunting operation in Garrote Gorge has almost completely wiped out Garrote Gorge's Dragon population. I'm sure once their done, those mountains will be safer to travel. Still, I wonder what Jadame will be like without Dragons."
msgstr "看来查尔斯·吉柯德在绞刑峡谷的狩猎行动几乎已经把飞龙都杀光了。我很确定他们完成任务之后该处会变得比较安全。但是，我也很难想像贾丹姆大陆如果没有了飞龙会是什么样子。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:788
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:788
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "By recovering Deftclaw Redreaver's heir for him, you've allowed him to safely attack Charles Quixote's camp. Dragon hunters operate by isolating members of their prey. They just aren't prepared to face Dragons in number! Needless to say, the camp's production of Dragon goods has dwindled to a trickle. A pity. The guild used to turned a good profit off them."
msgstr "由于你替达夫克劳·红斧找回了它传承的下一代，你让它可以不受拘束地攻击查尔斯·吉柯德的营地。猎龙人是靠着各个击破的战术来对付他们的敌人。他们根本没办法应付大规模的飞龙攻击！不用说，该处的龙产品数量已经大幅地减少了。真可惜，他们本来都可以靠这项出产赚很多钱的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:789
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:789
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Minotaurs of Balthazar Lair in Ravage Roaming are a proud culture. Their recent defeat of the Vori Frost Giants has, if anything, made them even more fiercely independent--more sure of their ability to face any task alone. Still, I have told the guild that they would make great allies, both to face the current crisis and later as trade partners."
msgstr "位于残破镇的巴尔萨煞巢穴的牛头人是个骄傲的文明。他们前一阵子击败沃里的霜雪巨人后变得更加独立。因为他们更加确定自己单独承担任何任务的能力。不过，我已经告诉过公会，他们是非常不错的盟友，不管在面对危机和贸易时都一样。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:790
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:790
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "By rescuing the Balthazar Lair Minotaurs, you have ingratiated them to yourselves and by extension, to our guild. Even through the crisis, trade relations with them have improved immeasurably. Once maters of the cataclysm are resolved, I'm sure we will see a tidy profit--a direct result from your good work."
msgstr "在你救出了巴尔萨煞巢穴的牛头人之后，你已经让他们对你授与无比的信任。即使在危机结束之后，公会和他们的贸易可能性将会大幅提升。一旦危机解除，我想利润将会大幅提升，这都多亏你的努力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:796
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:796
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Did you know I was their captive for over six years? At first, I thought they were devils from hell, but now I am not so sure. They looked like devils surely, but did not act as demons. No, I think they were but another type of monstrous race, like ogres or goblins. Regardless, devils or not, I am glad the world is rid of them!"
msgstr "你知道我曾经被他们俘虏过六年的时间吗？一开始，我以为他们是地狱来的恶魔，但现在我比较不能确定了。他们看起来的确很像恶魔，但行为却不像。不，我想他们也许只是另外一种怪物种族，就像食人妖或是大耳怪一样。不过，不管他们是不是恶魔，我都很高兴他们已经被杀光了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:797
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:797
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Catherine and I have had dealings with these \"lords\" of the elemental planes. I've never trusted them, and now it seems I am right. They were our recent allies against the Kreegans, but a few months later, we find ourselves at war with them here! In both cases I understand neither their reasons for helping or hindrance. They are fickle beings at best...\"treacherous\" is perhaps a better word for them."
msgstr "凯瑟琳和我曾经和这些元素之王打过交道。我从来不相信他们，现在看来我是正确的。他们曾经是我们对抗克里根人的盟友，但几个月后，我们竟然在这边和他们作战！不管怎么样，我都无法理解他们帮助我们或是攻击我们的原因。也许“善变”和“不可信任”是很适合他们的两个形容词。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:798
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:798
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I must say I'm looking forward to returning to my lands of Enroth. It has been so long since I've seen them, or my son, Prince Nicolai. He was just a lad when I saw him last and now he is nearly grown. Sir Humphrey was a good choice for regent, but the land has been too long without its king at the reins of state."
msgstr "我必须说我很期待回到恩洛斯的家乡。我已经好久没有看过自己的故乡和我的儿子尼可拉王子。当我上次看到他的时候，他只不过是个小孩，但是现在他已经快变成大人了。韩福瑞爵士是个不错的摄政王，但我的故乡已经太久没有国王的管理了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:799
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:799
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "After we defeated the Kreegans in Erathia, I abdicated my throne into the regenthood of one of my generals, Morgan Kendal. I have left in his capable hands the task of choosing Erathia's new ruler. I'm sure this seems to be much to give up, but I am first and foremost, the queen of Enroth. We were sailing for there when the cataclysm struck, drawing us here."
msgstr "当我们击败了埃拉西亚的克里根人之后，我将自己的王位让给了我的一位将军，摩根·坎道尔。我让他选择埃拉西亚下一个适任的领袖。我知道这看起来像是很大的牺牲，但我可是恩洛斯的第一个皇后。当大灾变降临的时候，我们正好要回到故乡去，这场天灾地变则是将我们吸引了过来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:800
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:800
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Kreegans? They are no more; I am sure of it. After we put down Lucifer Kreegan, my armies scoured Eofol searching for any signs of their continued existence. We found none. No, the Kreegan infestation of our world is eliminated."
msgstr "克里根人？我很确定他们已经都被消灭了。在我们杀死了魔王路西法之后，我的部下彻底搜索了他的巢穴，调查任何可能的生命迹象。我们完全没有找到。这个世界上的克里根人已经全都被消灭了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:801
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:801
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I fought alongside elementals in our campaigns against the Kreegan. I found them stalwart and loyal. I know Roland disagrees, but I cannot call their hostility here a case of fickleness. No, I think something else drives them to attack us--magic perhaps? You should speak with our sage, Xanthor. He has been studying the Destroyer's crystal. I'm sure he's come up with some theory by now."
msgstr "我在对抗克里根人的战争中曾经和元素们并肩作战。我认为他们忠诚、服从。我知道罗兰德不同意我的想法，但是我不认为他们的敌意就是多变。不，我认为有其他的因素驱使他们攻击我们，也许是魔法？你应该跟我们的智者萨索尔谈谈。他已经研究毁灭者的水晶一段时间了。我很确定他现在应该已经找到了一些理论依据才对。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:806
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:811
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have traveled to these lands to catalog its array of available cheese. My task is nearly complete, but there are yet three cheeses I have yet to sample. These are Frelandeau, Eldenbrie and Dunduck. I would reward highly any who could locate these rare and reputedly tasty culinary gems for me."
msgstr "我已经走遍了全世界去品尝各式各样的奶酪。我的工作几乎已经完成了，但是我还有三种奶酪没有品尝过。他们是独角兽奶酪、艾顿布理奶酪、登达克奶酪。如果谁能够替我找到这些传说中美味无比的宝物，我一定会给予重酬！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:807
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:812
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You say you will find me the cheeses I desire, but here you are returned, empty-handed! Do not waste my precious time! Bring me cheese--Frelandeau, Eldenbrie and Dunduck! Do not return until you have them!"
msgstr "你说你会找到我要的奶酪，但是你现在竟然空手而回！别浪费我宝贵的时间！把独角兽奶酪、艾顿布理奶酪、登达克奶酪带回来给我！在你找到之前别回来！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:808
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:813
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Very good, you have found me some of the cheese I seek. But now I have my heart set on a full cheese tasting with all three cheeses eaten at once so I can savor them in comparison. Come back when you have then all. I will not take what you have now. I don't think I could resist sampling what you leave--and then the cheese tasting would be ruined!"
msgstr "很好，你已经找到一部份我要的奶酪了，但是我想要一次品尝所有的奶酪，以便彻底地分辨出他们的味道来。在你找到所有的奶酪之后再来找我。你先暂时把你所找到的奶酪带走，我想我抵抗不了这些奶酪的诱惑，可能会一不小心把他们全都吃光！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:814
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent! Give me the cheeses! I must consume them!\n\nAh….munch munch….frelandeau, exquisite….mmmm, and eldenbrie, wondrously smoky…and hmmm, dunduck…well, that's not very nice, is it?\n\nYou have made my Jadamean cheese cataloging safari a success! I can die a happy man! You have the humble thanks of a man of cheese. And here is your promised reward!"
msgstr "太好了！把所有的奶酪给我！我一定要吃吃看！\n啊……嚼嚼……独角兽奶酪，味道太精致了……嗯嗯，艾顿布理，烟熏味相当的不错……登达克……味道就不怎么好了，对吧？\n你帮我完成了贾丹姆大陆的奶酪品尝之旅！我死也甘愿了！我太感激你了！这是我答应给你的报酬！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:810
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:815
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are no people more dedicated to cheesecraft than the august cheese masters of Vori. Otherwise known to be rather barbaric, the Vori Frost Giants are true emblems of the potential of civilized development--at least as far as cheese making is concerned. Did you know that they have forty-two different words for \"cheese.\""
msgstr "这世界上没有比沃里的奶酪大师更投入奶酪制作的人了。虽然沃里的霜雪巨人在一般人的眼光中算是蛮族，但他们有相当的文明发展潜力，至少以他们的奶酪制作来说是这样的。你知道吗？他们拥有四十二种不同口味的奶酪！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:811
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:816
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Even as a lad I knew I had a special relationship with cheese. Why, my first memory is of nibbling a bit of farmer's cheddar from my mother's hand! From that day I knew it would be my passion to eat cheese, to know all of the endless variety of its tasty wonderment, and to search the world for rare and exotic cheese-stuff. And so have I made my life...and destiny."
msgstr "从我小的时候，我就知道自己和奶酪有着特殊的关连。我的第一个记忆就是从母亲手上啃食刚从农庄中弄出来的奶酪！从那一天开始我就知道自己对于奶酪会产生强烈的热情，会想要体验一切味觉的极致，踏遍整个世界，只为了寻找各种稀少和珍贵的奶酪。这，就是我的宿命。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:812
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:817
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With the cheeses you have brought me, I have now eaten all of the world's known cheeses. Now none can say that I, Asael Fromago, am not history's most eminent connoisseur of cheese! None can compare to my glory! Ha-ha-ha…"
msgstr "在吃过你带给我的奶酪之后，我现在已经吃过了所有世界知名的奶酪。现在，除了我之外，没有人可以自称为世界上最伟大的奶酪品尝者了！没有人可以跟我争夺这项荣耀了！哈哈哈……"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:828
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:833
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You know, it is said the Vault of Time was here before Ravenshore; the town was built around it. It is supposed to contain the treasure of the old Emperor Thorn who ruled the lands around here hundreds of years ago. Many come here to try and open the vault, but none succeed."
msgstr "你知道吗？据说时光金库在渡鸦海滨创建之前就存在了，这座城镇根本就是绕着该金库所创建的。金库里面应该藏着索恩帝王的财富。许多人来到这个地方想要开启该金库，但是都失败了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:829
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:834
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As if Quixote was not enough of a problem to plague us, we must also contend with Ilsingore, Ilsingore and Old Loeb--renegades among our kind! They think they can rebuild our race by scattering across Jadame and starting their own tribes. Fools! All they do is weaken us by removing themselves from our numbers. Yaardrake has fled to the Ironsand Desert. I know not where the others have gone."
msgstr "光是吉柯德就够让我们伤脑筋了。现在竟然又出了艾欣格和老罗伯这两个叛徒！他们认为可以靠着将部族四处扩散而重建我们的种族，并且聚集自己的部落。愚蠢！他们的所作所为只不过是让我们的数量更为分散，让我们的力量更为减弱而已。雅达克则是逃到了铁沙漠去，除了他们三个之外，我不知道还有其它飞龙离开了这个地方。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:830
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:835
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "While Garrote Gorge has the highest concentration of dragons in Jadame, I hear there is hunting to be had elsewhere. For instance, there is rumored to be a great old dragon out in the Ironsand Desert. Another is supposed to be somewhere in the badlands of Ravage Roaming."
msgstr "虽然绞刑峡谷地区是飞龙密度最高的地方，但是据说其它的地方也在进行飞龙的狩猎。举例来说，谣传铁沙漠中有一只巨大的古老飞龙。其它的飞龙似乎躲藏在残破镇的恶地中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:831
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:836
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When Charles Quixote brought us over from Erathia, we sailed past Regna Island. Since this was our first sight of Jadamean land on the voyage, it was an omen of our hunting expedition's future success that I saw an ancient dragon winging its way towards the island. How I wish I could get a spear in that one! It was the biggest dragon I'd ever seen!"
msgstr "当查尔斯·吉柯德带着我们从埃拉西亚渡海而来的时候，我们曾经航过雷格那岛。当我们第一次看到贾丹姆大陆的土地时，我发现了一个好兆头：一只巨大无比的飞龙朝向该处飞去。我真希望可以狠狠地刺上它一矛！那是我所看过最大的飞龙！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:832
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:837
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes, I was here the day the Destroyer walked through Ravenshore! I was at the blacksmith's getting a knife sharpened. He walked right past us like he owned the town. A crowd was following him at a distance. One of them threw a rock, but it bounced off a magic shield surrounding him. He didn't even seem to notice. Later I heard an explosion from the town square. I ran out to look, but the Destroyer was gone and that crystal and scattered bodies were all that remained."
msgstr "没错，当毁灭者走进渡鸦海滨的时候，我就在现场！我当时正在打铁铺请铁匠磨利我的小刀。他走过人群之中，彷佛君临天下。有群人远远地跟踪着他。其中一个人丢出一块石头，但它彷佛击中魔法防护罩一样地弹开了。他似乎根本没注意到。稍后，我听到城镇广场传来一阵爆炸。我跑去看，但毁灭者已经离开了，该处只剩下水晶和尸体。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:833
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:838
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yeah, I saw the \"Destroyer\" and well named he is! I thought he was a rich merchant, and he looked like easy prey, so I…well, I tried to rob him. I ran ahead of him and lay in ambush in an alley, waiting for him to pass. When he walked by, I made a grab for him. My mistake! I didn't even touch him! As soon as I got near him, I was thrown back by his magic. In fact, I was thrown over a house into the next street!"
msgstr "没错，我看见了“毁灭者”，这还真是个不错的名字！我以为他是名富有的商人，看起来是个相当容易撂倒的家伙，因此我……我试着抢走他的东西。我跑到他前头，躲在巷子里面想要偷袭他。当他走过去的时候，我扑上去！但这真是一个大错误，我甚至连碰都没有碰到他！我一靠近，就立刻被他的魔法给弹了开来。事实上，我被弹过一座屋子，飞到隔壁的街上去了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:834
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:839
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Those cursed ratmen--those so-called \"Priests of Eep\"--are nothing but trouble. More like a pack of thieves than holy men, they are! I'll warn you, traveler. Keep an eye on your equipment when they're around. They'll steal anything that isn't nailed down."
msgstr "那个该死的鼠人，也就是那些什么伊普的牧师，只会制造麻烦而已。他们不像神职人员，只是一群小偷而已！我警告你们，当他们靠近的时候，千万小心自己身上的财物。他们会偷走任何没有钉在地上的东西。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:835
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:840
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, if you're looking for cheese, I daresay you will find it in the churches of Eep. You know mice like cheese. Well, this rule also applies to the ratmen of Eep. It is said that they keep a horde of the stuff in each of their temples."
msgstr "如果你想要寻找奶酪，我建议你去伊普教堂找找看。你知道的，老鼠喜欢奶酪。鼠人也是一样。据说他们在每座神庙里面都有一大堆的奶酪。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:836
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:841
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "On top of all of our problems here, the lord of our plane, Gralkor the Cruel is missing. He is a being of great power and could no doubt fight the dark magic which assails this plane."
msgstr "除了我们所面对的一大堆问题之外，统治这个领域的元素之王也跟着失踪了。他是拥有强大力量的生物，一定可以抵抗驱使我们的这种黑暗的魔法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:837
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:842
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I wish I understood what has happened here. One day it was life as usual here…and this is normally a peaceful realm. Then suddenly everyone was howling with violent madness and was filled with a thirst to crush your land of Jadame. Even now my fellow Earth Plane denizens work single-mindedly to push the firmament of our realm into yours."
msgstr "我希望我自己了解到底发生了什么事情。那原本是和平常一样宁静的一天，这个空间原本十分的祥和。突然之间每个人都开始疯狂地嚎叫，胸中充满了欲望，想要破坏你们的贾丹姆大陆。即使是现在，我的土元素同胞们也在齐心一致地将这个空间推进你们的世界中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:838
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:843
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Perhaps the reason I am not affected by the madness is that I carry with me an amulet given to me by the lord of this plane, Shalwend. It is said in our legends that he and the other elemental lords made your world. No doubt if Shalwend was here he could stop the creeping madness, but he is missing! Where is our lord in our time of greatest need?"
msgstr "也许我没有被这种疯病影响的原因是我身上带着有此地的元素之王所送给我的护身符。据说是他和其它的元素之王联手创造了你们的世界。如果他在这边，他一定可以阻止这场疯狂的暴乱，但他不见了！当我们最需要它的时候，元素之王怎么会不见了呢！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:839
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:844
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It was clearly magic which caused the madness that has taken my fellow Plane of Air dwellers. On the day it struck there was instant chaos. All who were affected dropped what they were doing and began to howl. It was a chorus of horror! Only a handful of us maintain our sanity. Now, day by day, our glorious realm falls further and further towards a state of hellish decline."
msgstr "很明显的是魔法的力量让我们这个风元素界陷入了完全的疯狂中。当这个疯病出现的时候，一切立刻陷入了混乱之中。所有受到影响的生物都放下手边的事情，开始狂乱地嚎叫。这真是一场恐怖的暴动！我们之中只有极少数还保持了清醒的神智。一天又一天，我们的世界慢慢地被这种混乱的力量给吞食。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:840
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:845
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am not unschooled in the ways of magic. Clearly some spell of almost unimaginable power has affected those that live in this watery realm. My main curiosity is to know why this has occurred. Clearly no one would risk using such power if it was not to achieve some terrible end. All I know is that the Plane of Water makes war upon your realm. From here, I can discern no reason to it!"
msgstr "我对于魔法还算有相当的研究。很明显地拥有难以想像力量的魔法影响了水元素界。我自己非常想要知道到底为什么会发生这样的事情。很明显的，如果不是绝对必要，没有人会冒险使用这样的力量。我只知道水元素界目前正在和你们的世界作战。从那之后，我就完全找不出合理的解释了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:841
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:846
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "W-what has h-happened to my home w-waters? All are c-consumed by m-m-madness! And worse, our l-lord is m-missing! Where is our r-ruler, th-the mighty Acw-w-walander! W-without him w-we are d-doomed!"
msgstr "我—我的家—发—发生了什么事情？所—所有的人—都疯了！更糟糕的是，我—我们的统治者—失踪了！没—没有了他—我们就死定了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:842
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:847
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know to your eyes, this plane must seem a hell-scape. But I tell you, normally it is not so. Before the madness we lived here together in a state of peace and harmony. But then, one day the madness fell and our Lord Pyrannaste was nowhere to be found. Perhaps his absence caused the madness? It may be so, he has never before been gone from this realm in my memory."
msgstr "我从你的眼中就可以看出来，这个地方糟糕透了。但是我必须说实话，这里本来不是这样的。在那股疯狂力量来袭之前，我们本来都生活在和平与祥和的状况下。但是，突然有一天，我们的大王消失了，疯狂的力量也跟着来袭。也许他的消失带来了这个疯病？也许是这样的，因为我记忆中他似乎从来没有离开过这个地方。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:843
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:848
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though the madness affects almost all of those that live here, it has not robbed them of their cunning. As I am sure you are aware, they make war on your realm, but it is not with crazed abandon that they do so. Leaders have emerged among the affected, and these make shrewd military designs against you. Even now they mass near the gateway to Jadame in preparation for a massive assault."
msgstr "虽然此地的大部分生物都受到疯狂力量的影响，但是他们依旧是相当聪明的敌人。我也知道他们目前正在你们的世界上征战。而且，他们并非是在疯狂中设计这一切。在那群疯狂的生物中，拥有最强战术头脑的生物规划了一切的战术。他们现在就正聚集在传送门边，准备一举攻下你们的世界。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:844
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:849
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Snapfinger family tomb is one of the lowest in our village's burial catacombs. Since we are such an honored family, our crypt is the largest. It isn't the easiest place to find--even I have become lost looking for it! When I do, I find it by keeping a hand on the right-side wall. I eventually get there."
msgstr "弹指家族的墓穴是我们村庄的墓穴中最底层的几家。由于我们的家族拥有许多的荣耀，因此我们是最大的。那地方并不好找，我自己也曾经不小心迷过路！当我迷路的时候，我发现只要自己一直把手放在右边的墙上，最后就会到达该处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:847
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:852
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You never had it!"
msgstr "你根本没找到！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:848
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:853
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Here is your missing item."
msgstr "这是你弄丢的东西。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:854
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, that matter's done. I will make arrangements to travel to Ravenshore so I myself may sit on your council. Frankly, I could use a bit of change. I will leave my second in command, Reginald Dorray, in charge.\n\nAgain, good job."
msgstr "好的，就这么说定了。我会赶快做好安排，亲自前往渡鸦海滨的议会。说实话，我自己也想换换环境。我会让副手来接管我的工作。\n最后，我必须对你再一次说：干得好。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:850
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:855
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm sorry. I'd like to adventure, yes, but you're just not at my level."
msgstr "很抱歉，我是喜欢冒险。但是你们和我差太远了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:851
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:856
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sure, why not? I'm ready to go--just have to grab my gear! I'll show the guild who is worthy and who isn't!"
msgstr "当然，为什么不要呢？我已经准备好要走了，只是得先准备一下装备才行！让公会看看到底谁行谁不行！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:852
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:857
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No…no, that life is over for me. Besides, if I were to take up the mace again, it would be with other companions. I'm afraid--if I may speak bluntly--I just can't see myself traveling with a group as inexperienced as yours."
msgstr "不……不行，我的冒险生涯已经结束了。即使有人要我重新开始，也会是和别的伙伴。容我实说，你们的经验实在太过不足了一些，我很难想像自己和你们一起旅行的样子。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:853
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:858
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Say, that sounds grand! Yes, I will go with you, if you will have me."
msgstr "好，听起来好极了！如果你们愿意的话，我会和你们走！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:854
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:859
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I think not! Why would I travel with the likes of you? Perhaps you didn't catch my name, \"Jasp Thelbourne?\" Yes, that \"Thelbourne,\" rabble. No, whatever you're up to, I'm not interested."
msgstr "我可不这么想！为什么我要和你这种人一起旅行？也许你听错了我的名字，“赛尔鹏”？是的，就是那个赛尔鹏。不管你们要干嘛，我都没兴趣！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:855
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:860
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes, we'd make quite a team! We have all done such great deeds, how could not further greatness follow from our joining together? I'll go with you if you want."
msgstr "是的，我们一定会组成一个很好的队伍！我们已经完成了那么多丰功伟业，未来一定有更多的事业等待我们去完成！如果你愿意的话，我愿意和你一起走。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:861
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now that I need not fear my heir's destruction. I will visit my revenge on Quixote. His camp will face the assault of fire and claw. Those who have hunted us are now our prey animals.\n\nAs for your alliance…you have done me a great service. I will honor my debt. As soon as I've set my enemies to flight or the beyond, I will join the alliance council in Ravenshore."
msgstr "既然现在我已不需要担心我们下一代的生命安危了，我就准备去找吉柯德复仇。他的营地将会面临我们利爪和火焰的攻击。原先狩猎我们的骑士将会变成我们的猎物。\n至于你所提到的联盟……你们帮了我很大的忙，我会遵守约定。只要我把敌人都处理掉了，我就会前往渡鸦海滨加入议会的阵容。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:857
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:862
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I tell you, with all that's going on, it's like an honest merchant can't get business done! I mean, we've always had to deal with Ogre raiders, but now they've grown so bold as to have built a fort right here in Alvar! Now no caravans can take the west road to Murmurwoods. The worst of it is most of my trade with the Temple of the Sun there!"
msgstr "我告诉你，在这样的时节，诚实的商人实在赚不到钱哪！你看看，我们之前的确需要应付食人妖强盗，但是现在他们竟然大胆到就在阿尔瓦附近建造要塞！没有车队可以往西走去低语森林。最糟糕的是，我的生意大多是在该地的太阳神庙中！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:858
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:863
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have done us all a great service by clearing out the Ogre's fort. Now our caravans can freely travel to Murmurwoods. I thank you…and my purse certainly thanks you!"
msgstr "你消灭了那座要塞中的食人妖，这实在帮了我们大忙！现在我的车队可以自由前往低语森林了！我非常感激你，我的钱包也是！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:859
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:864
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sure we have wasps in Alvar--and rather large ones, too--but we tolerate them for good reason. Many of our customers desire wasp products. Say…if you want to get in on the action, the trader, Veldon, is a broker for wasp parts. He lives here in town, and I hear he is currently trying to fill a large order for wasp stingers."
msgstr "我们在阿尔瓦的确有黄蜂，而且还相当地大。但我们容忍他们是有原因的。我有许多顾客喜欢黄蜂的相关产品。如果你想要在这笔生意中参一脚，维尔顿是这行中相当出名的仲介商。他就住在这里，我听说他最近正准备要筹集一大笔的黄蜂刺。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:860
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:865
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not many people know this, but it is possible to train a Dragon. It's sort of like breaking a horse, except that it requires more special equipment and a lot of magic. Those tame Dragons outside the fort are an example of my work. Right now they are loyal to us, but I will bond them to their ultimate customer, Fennis Greenwood, a minor lord back in Erathia. Well, I will do so as soon as he pays us, that is."
msgstr "没有多少人知道这件事情，但是龙的确是可以训练的。这就有点像训练野马一样，只不过你需要更多的特殊道具和魔法。这座要塞外面的驯龙就是我的明证。现在他们对我们很忠诚，但是将来我会把控制权交给我们的顾客，埃拉西亚的贵族芬尼斯·绿林。当然，这得等到他付钱之后才行。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:861
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:866
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Zanthora is a strange character. Not to say that members of the Necromancers' Guild are not all strange, but she is truly mad. I hear that other guild members simply refuse to work with her--so terrible are her experiments. Still, they value her dark genius. To keep her around, they built her a lab of her own out on the marshy wastes outside of town."
msgstr "冉索拉是个奇怪的家伙。也许死灵法师公会的家伙都有点奇怪，但她真的是非常的疯狂。我听说其他的公会成员拒绝和她一起工作，因为她的实验实在太恐怖了。但是，他们依旧珍惜她邪恶的天份。为了让她在附近工作，他们就在镇外替她建了一个实验室。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:862
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:867
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "For the most part, the Necromancers' Guild has the local vampires under control…mostly. But there's one place you don't want to go! Most of them sleep in a communal crypt north of the guild. Watch out if you go there. They're a bit, shall we say…\"territorial.\""
msgstr "在大部分的情况下，死灵法师对当地的吸血鬼都拥有相当的管辖权。但是，有个地方是你绝对不想去的！他们都集体睡在公会北边的一个墓窖里。如果你去那边的话，请千万小心。因为他们的地域概念相当的清楚！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:863
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:868
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Necromancers' Guild? Hey, I think they're great. You should have seen this place before they came--nothing going on at all! Sure, we got vampires, skeletons and other undead running around. Still, I gotta say, things are sure a lot more lively around here!"
msgstr "死灵法师公会？嘿，我觉得他们很棒。你们应该看看他们来这边之前的状况，一片死寂！现在我们这边有吸血鬼、骷髅人和各种各样的不死生物。现在这个地方看起来活跃多了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:864
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:869
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As you might imagine, business is great. Oh, sure, the guild necromancers turn most of my customers into skeletons and zombies, but vampires are repeat business! Want a piece of the action? There's a wood dealer in town, Mylander, who is always looking for good Murmurwood lumber. If you have any he'll pay a pretty penny for it."
msgstr "你也应该可以想像，我的生意变得很好。当然，死灵法师公会几乎把我所有的客人都变成了骷髅和僵尸，但是吸血鬼的生意可不会断！你也想要参一脚吗？镇上有个木材商人麦兰德，他想要低语森林的木材。如果你能够把木材运过去，他会付相当不错的报酬。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:865
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:870
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hunting has become pretty hazardous of late, but still we must do it if we are to eat! Yesterday I was out along the western shore of the fire lake and found a tunnel that seems to go under the lake. I didn't explore it though. It was infested with gogs and worse...like everything else around here these days."
msgstr "最近狩猎变得相当困难，但是我们还是必须要狩猎才有饭吃！昨天我沿着火湖的西岸走，发现有一条隧道似乎穿过了火湖。不过，我并没有进去。那隧道里面充满了垢鬼和各种各样的怪物，就像我们村庄四周一样。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:866
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:871
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Even we who live here get lost. If you would not lose your way, follow the floating waystones. Ahhh…the madness returns….It returns!"
msgstr "即使像我们这种住在这里的家伙也会迷路。如果你迷路了，请跟着那些漂浮的指路石走。啊啊……我脑中又被疯狂的力量……给占据了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:867
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:872
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, I'm glad you're out saving the world. I mean, someone has to do it. Me, I'm for the easy life. As long as I got my boat and my pole, and the fish are biting, I don't see any reason to do much else. Good luck to you though!"
msgstr "啊，我很高兴是你们在拯救世界。我是说，总得要有人作吧。至于我呢，我是那种喜欢安逸生活的人。只要我有鱼竿和小船，我找不到理由要去辛苦工作。祝你们好运！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:868
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:873
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "That Stanley, now there's a Regnan with some spark! Why I hear he's the one that got us in good with that thar Zog the Jackal--some sort of Ogre or giant Troll or something, I think--a genuine barbarian king. Now we got us our ships on the seas and a bunch of club swinging devils on the land. I tell ya, the Great and Mighty Regnan Empire is headed for greatness, what with the likes of the Dread Pirate Stanley doing for us!"
msgstr "那个史坦力啊，那可是个相当不错的雷格那人！我听说是他和那个什么叫做豺狼索格的食人妖还是什么东西的达成的协议。现在我们海上有海盗船，路上又有强盗四处乱跑。我告诉你，雷格那帝国目前真是如日中天啊，只要有恐怖海盗史坦力在为我们努力，我们一定会继续这样下去的！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:869
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:874
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh sure, we Regnans have to put up with a bit of competition--I'm talking about smugglers, you know--but I understand the Dread Pirate Stanley is putting the clamp on that. Why I understand he kidnapped Arion Hunter's family just so he can pressure the wererat into staying off our turf. "
msgstr "喔，当然，我们雷格那人喜欢竞争。我指的是那些走私者。不过，我也知道恐怖海盗史坦力正在想办法阻止这些状况。我听说他绑架了艾瑞安·韩特的一家人，以便让这件事情作个了结。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:870
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:875
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yeah, I know the \"Dread\" Pirate Stanley is the hero of the moment around here, but I say, fah! Sure he's done a lot for Regna, but no man does anything that doesn't help himself. Why I hear old Stanley's been shaving off the top of every deal he's in--and that's a lot of deals! What I'd like to know is where he keeps his booty. Probably not on Regna, I reckon. It wouldn't be a fortnight before someone dug it up!"
msgstr "是啊，我知道那个什么“恐怖”海盗史坦力最近是这附近的英雄，但是啊，呸！他的确替雷格那作了很多事情，但是大多数都是为了他自己！我听说他最近在干的每一笔买卖中抽成，而且这些买卖数量很多！我只想知道他到底把财宝放在哪里。我猜也许不是在雷格那上。我可不愿意让其它人把那些宝物挖出来！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:871
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:876
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have come up with a scheme for finding hidden treasure. Before you barged in, I was hard at work formulating a spell for sensing gold hidden beneath the ground. If I am successful, I plan to have a Dragon carry me over the wastelands of Ravage Roaming where the Dread Pirate Stanley's treasure is rumored to be buried. My spell will find it and I will be a wealthy man."
msgstr "我想到一个计划可以找出那些隐藏的财宝。在你冲进来之前，我正在研究一个可以侦测地底下黄金的法术。如果我成功了，我计划找只龙载我飞越传说中史坦力埋藏宝藏的残破镇一带。我的法术将会找到那些财宝，让我变成超级有钱的人！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:872
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:877
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You mean the one just north of here? Well, none of us have anything to do with it. It's haunted!"
msgstr "你指的是北边的那个地方吗？我们都不愿意和它有所牵扯！里面闹鬼！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:873
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:878
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I don't know where they're at, but I know there's some of them ratmen around here somewhere. At night I hear all sorts of squeaking and scuffling outside. In the morning, pretty much everything that isn't under lock or bolted down is gone. If I knew where that Eep church was. I'd take some of my boys over for a little...talk."
msgstr "我不知道他们在干嘛，但是我听说附近有些鼠人。我在晚上会听到有各种各样搔爬和吱吱叫的声音。在早上的时候，所有没有锁上或是钉起来的东西都会被偷光光。如果我知道那个什么伊普教堂在什么地方，我一定会去找他们好好谈谈……"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:874
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:879
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I was out with one of the crews working along the new lake searching for things that were washed out of the lair. We think we found the source of the flood. There is a strange gateway out in the middle of the lake. We don't have any boats, so we didn't explore it, but even from the shore, it is clear to see that it leads to a watery realm."
msgstr "我本来和我的同事们在新形成的湖旁边寻找被从地底下冲出来的宝物。我们认为我们发现了洪水的来源，在湖的正中央有个传送门。我们没有船，所以我们不能够去看看。但即使从岸边也看得出来，那个传送门似乎通往一个有很多水的世界。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:875
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:880
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, if you haven't been to the fortress, that's the first place you should go. As you are aware from your orientation, the so-called fortress on this island is just a front to fool our enemies. You'll need to make your way to the real fort on the crescent island. Just take the underground passage marked on your orientation map."
msgstr "如果你们没去过那个要塞，你们应该先去那个地方。从你的情报上你应该知道，那座要塞只是用来愚弄外人的。你必须要前往那个新月形岛上的真正要塞。你必须要从你地图上的那个地下通道走过去才行。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:876
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:881
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know they call us \"pirates\" on Jadame, but really, we're just running our empire. It is not our fault that our Jadamean subjects refuse to acknowledge our rule and do not pay their taxes. Since they do not pay, we're forced to collect tribute in the form of booty. Actually we prefer it this way--saves us the trouble of having to actually rule the continent."
msgstr "我知道你们在贾丹姆大陆上的人都叫我们海盗，但是，其实我们是隶属于一个帝国的。贾丹姆大陆上的家伙不承认有我们的存在，不付税，这又不是我们的错。因为他们不付钱，我们必须要自己去收钱才行。事实上，我们比较喜欢这个方式，因为这样我们就不用真正去统治整个大陆。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:877
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:882
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We vampires cannot normally walk about in the daylight, but Thant the Necromancers' Guildmaster has created an artifact to deal with this. A vampire wearing one of his Nightshade Amulets can move about freely day or night. Sadly, there are few available. I myself do not have one so must stay indoors during the day."
msgstr "我们吸血鬼一般来说不能够在白天出没，但是死灵法师公会的谭特创造了一个法宝来处理这个状况。吸血鬼只要配戴着龙葵护身符，就可以自由自在地在白天行走。很遗憾的，护身符的数量并不多。我自己就没有，因此在白天必须要躲在屋内才行。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:878
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:883
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Normally, we vampires need one of Thant's Nightshade Amulets to travel freely during the day, but since you've brought us the Nightshade Brazier, glorious night covers Shadowspire around the clock! Now those of us who don't have the amulets can walk about during the day...well, at least as long as we stay in the area."
msgstr "在正常状况下，我们这些吸血鬼的确需要谭特的龙葵护身符才能够在白天行动，但是在你带回了龙葵灯炉之后，夜晚从此笼罩了阴影塔地区。现在我们不需要配戴护身符，只要待在这个区域里面就可以自由行动了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:879
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:884
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though it isn't my style, I must say a lot of folks around here like to cover themselves with all sorts of jewelry. They say it's fashion, but I just find it gaudy. Anyway, if you have any to sell go find Pavel in town. He does a brisk trade in all sorts of tacky junk."
msgstr "虽然这不是我的风格，但是附近的人都很喜欢配戴各种各样的珠宝。他们说这是流行，但我觉得这太过俗气。如果你有什么珠宝要卖，请找此地的帕佛谈谈。他是这里负责处理这些怪异商品的家伙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:880
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:885
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You looking for sunfish? Sorry, can't help you. Funny thing is, I had a whole catch of them just last week, but Pavel the merchant bought the whole lot. Maybe you can get them from him."
msgstr "你在找翻车鱼吗？抱歉，我帮不上忙。还真是不巧，我上个礼拜还有一大箱的翻车鱼，但是帕佛刚好把它都买走了。也许你可以从他那边买到一些。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:887
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Very good…or at least, as good as can be expected. You managed to bring three partners into the alliance--the minimum number my advisors told me would be sufficient to fulfill the \"…Jadame, must stand together…\" part of the prophecy. A pity it could not be more, but events of the cataclysm are clearly coming to a head. It is time to move onward.\n\nYou must travel to Ravenshore and meet with the alliance council gathered there. With them, decide what must be the next step we take in meeting the elemental crisis."
msgstr "很好……至少你已经尽力了。你让另外三个势力加入了联盟，这是我们所需要的最低人手。这样我们才能满足“贾丹姆大陆必须要团结在一起……”的预言。真可惜你无法弄到更多的援军，但大灾变已经迫在眉睫，我们的动作得要快一点。\n你必须要前往渡鸦海滨和在该处聚会的联盟议会碰面。在那之后，你将必须和他们讨论如何面对元素界所带来的大危机。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:883
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:888
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We have a small warehouse downstairs. You are free to use the chests there to store extra equipment. Put anything in there you don't want to wander off!"
msgstr "我们楼下有个小仓库。你们可以自由利用该处的箱子来储藏多馀的装备。如果你不想要带着东西到处乱跑，就储藏在这里吧！"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:891
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am free! Now will he who was fool enough to jail me--this Destroyer--feel my wrath. That I, the Lord of Earth, am called \"Gralkor the Cruel\" is no mistake. The suffering I have felt will be his returned in multitudes!\n\nI go now to gather with the other lords. Together we will set things right. Be warned! Our actions will destabilize the crystal gateway. Leave now for your home, lest you be trapped here forever. Inform Xanthor of what has happened here. Farewell"
msgstr "我自由了！我将要让这个囚禁我的笨蛋，什么鬼毁灭者知道我有多生气！我所受的苦将会以百倍千倍报应到他身上！\n我现在必须要去恢复我们空间的秩序，并且加入我的同伴们拯救你的世界。请小心！我们的行动会让水晶传送门变得不稳定。现在请你赶快离开，免得被永远困在这里。请通知萨索尔这里发生了什么事情。再会。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:892
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Free at last. My torment is over, but what of my subjects? I know the Destroyer has them compelled to a terrible task. My presence will sooth them. I must go to restore order to my realm and yours.\n\nBefore I return to the Plane of Fire, I will gather with the other lords. Together we will set things right. Be warned! Our actions will destabilize the crystal gateway. Leave now for your home, lest you be trapped here forever.  Inform Xanthor of what has happened here. Farewell"
msgstr "我终于被释放了。我的苦刑已经结束了，但是我的子民们呢？我知道毁灭者强迫他们执行一个可怕的任务。我的出现将会让他们获得安宁。我得赶快走了，我要去恢复各地的秩序了。\n我现在必须要去恢复我们空间的秩序，并且加入我的同伴们拯救你的世界。请小心！我们的行动会让水晶传送门变得不稳定。现在请你赶快离开，免得被永远困在这里。请通知萨索尔这里发生了什么事情。再会。"

#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:893
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh, what a mess you've made of things! When I asked you to find me a witness of events in the Ironsand Desert, I thought it would be obvious that you'd have to return him to me in good condition! I mean look at the poor Troll! Take him to the temple and get him fixed up.\n\nAnd please...try to remember you're working for the guild. We do have a reputation for conducting ourselves with at least passing competence."
msgstr "喔，你看你把事情弄成什么样子！当我要求你找个铁沙漠事件的目击证人时，我以为你会知道应该要把他好好的带回来！你看看这个可怜的家伙！赶快把他带到神庙去治疗。\n求求你……请你至少记得是在为公会服务，我们作事情有一定的水准。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:891
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:896
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You are employed by the Merchants of Alvar, yes? Well, I think you should speak with Dadeross, the leader of your caravan. My far seeing vision tells me he is on the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr "你是受雇于阿尔瓦的商人吗？那么我想你应该和达德洛斯谈谈。我的天眼通告诉我他就在匕伤群岛上。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:892
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:897
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmmm…I cannot look too far ahead--for the ether is thick today. All I see is that you must deliver the letter Dadeross gave you to the merchant, Elgar Fellmoon. Fellmoon lives in the city of Ravenshore."
msgstr "嗯嗯……我今天没办法看得太远，因为乙太今天的浓度实在太浓了。我只能看到，你必须要把达德洛斯给予你的信件交给商人艾尔加·费尔蒙。费尔蒙就居住在渡鸦海滨这座城市中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:893
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:898
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I see a vision of you in which you take a letter from Elgar Fellmoon in Ravenshore to Arion Hunter, the leader of the Ravenshore smugglers. After this, you return to Fellmoon. The end of the vision is a blur, so you must not have lived entirely through it. Still, it is your fate to do these things."
msgstr "我看到了一个景象，是你将一封信从渡鸦海滨的艾尔加·费尔蒙手上交到艾瑞安·韩特的手上。他也是渡鸦海滨的走私商人领袖。在这一切完成之后，你又回到费尔蒙身边。这个景象的结局非常的模糊，你应该没有完全过完这些影像。不过，你的命运就是要完成这些事情。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:894
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:899
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I don't need my vision to tell me what you must do next. Do as Fellmoon asked of you. Go seek Bastian Loudrin, the guildmaster of the Alvarian Merchant Guild. He is in the city of Alvar."
msgstr "我不需要我的预知能力就能够知道你接下来该作些什么。照着费尔蒙要求的去作，去找巴斯沈·卢德林，也就是阿尔瓦商人公会的会长。他目前人在阿尔瓦中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:895
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:900
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I see an important connection has not been made between the present and your future. You must return to Bastian Loudrin and continue your conversations with him. He will send you on the next step down your road."
msgstr "我看见了在你的现在和未来之间有一个很重要的连接还没有完成。你必须回去找巴斯沈·卢德林，继续和他的谈话。他将会告诉你下一步应该要怎么做。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:896
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:901
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "In my dreams last night, I saw you traveling to the Ironsand Desert to find a witness to the formation of a great lake of fire which formed there during the cataclysm."
msgstr "我昨天晚上做了个梦，梦里面我看见你在铁沙漠中旅行，寻找大灾变期间目击火湖形成的证人。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:897
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:902
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is clear to me that you must bring the Troll, Overdune, to the merchant guild in Alvar."
msgstr "很明显你必须要将巨魔欧瓦都带到阿尔瓦的商人公会去。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:898
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:903
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I see far through space today, but not through time. A great disaster has befallen the Minotaurs of Balthazar Lair in Ravage Roaming. I feel that your destiny is linked with their fate. You must rescue them from their peril."
msgstr "我能够穿透空间看得很远，但无法穿透时间。我看见了巴尔萨煞巢穴的牛头人们遭遇了巨大的灾难，我感应到你和他们的命运是相关连的，你必须要将他们从危难中拯救出来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:899
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:904
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There is great turmoil in the Balance. It has taken me some time to know its source, but I know it now. It is caused by the war between the clerics of the Temple of the Sun located in Murmurwoods, and the Necromancers' Guild of Shadowspire. It is your destiny to undo the turmoil by choosing one of these two to ally with."
msgstr "在宇宙万物的平衡之中存在着巨大的动荡，我花了一些时间才知道了原因。这是由低语森林的太阳神庙的牧师，以及阴影塔的死灵法师之间的战争造成的。你必须要选择一方，协助他们，平息这场战争。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:900
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:905
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There is great turmoil in the Balance. It has taken me some time to know its source, but I know it now. There is conflict between the Dragons and Knights who fight in Garrote Gorge. It is your destiny to ally with one of the two at the expense of the other."
msgstr "在宇宙万物的平衡之中存在着巨大的动荡，我花了一些时间才知道了原因。绞刑峡谷中的骑士和飞龙之间出现了冲突。你必须要选择一方，协助他们，平息这场战争。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:901
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:906
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have done good work in forging the alliances you have. It is now time for you to seek the council of those allies you have brought together. Seek them out in their council chamber within the merchant guild in Ravenshore."
msgstr "你在寻找盟友的工作上表现得相当好，现在该是你听取这些盟友意见的时候了。请到渡鸦海滨的商人公会之家里面，寻求他们所组成的议会之意见。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:902
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:907
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I see an important connection has not been made between the present and your future destiny. You must return to the council chamber in the Ravenshore merchant guild. The councilors will send you on the next step down your road."
msgstr "我看见了在你的现在和未来之间有一个很重要的连接还没有完成。你必须要回到渡鸦海滨商人公会之家的议会处听取他们的意见。他们将会派遣你到下一个需要你的地方去。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:903
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:908
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must do as the alliance council has asked of you. Find a way to Regna Island and sink the Regnan port fleet."
msgstr "你必须要照着议会的指示来进行工作，找到前往雷格那港口的方法，弄沉当地的舰队。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:904
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:909
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "In case you haven't heard, Ravenshore is under attack by the Regnan pirates. The town has been evacuated. You must eliminate the pirate threat before the alliance council will return to guide you."
msgstr "不知道你听说了没有，雷格那海盗正在攻击渡鸦海滨。这座城必须要在战火下疏散。在议会回来指导你下一步的工作之前，你必须要杀死这些海盗，避免他们继续威胁此地的人民。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:905
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:910
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now that you've sunk the Regnan fleet. Go and seek the wisdom of your alliance council. They will give you the next task that will make your destiny."
msgstr "现在你已经弄沉了雷格那的舰队。请回去找你的联盟议会寻求指示。他们会指引你下一步该进行些什么。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:906
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:911
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must speak to the Ironfists' court sage, Xanthor. He is housed in Ravenshore."
msgstr "你必须和艾恩法斯特王朝的皇家智者萨索尔谈话，他就住在渡鸦海滨这里。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:907
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:912
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I see an important link between the present and your future has not been forged. Seek out the sage, Xanthor who resides in Ravenshore. He will send you on your destiny's next task."
msgstr "我看见了在你的现在和未来之间有一个很重要的连接还没有完成。请找到住在渡鸦海滨的智者萨索尔。他将会告诉你接下来该怎么做。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:908
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:913
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is clear that you must do as Xanthor has asked of you. Go to the four elemental planes and find in each, an elemental heartstone."
msgstr "很显然的，你必须要照着萨索尔的指示来作。前往四个元素界，并且在每个元素界找到当地的元素之心。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:909
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:914
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now that you have the four elemental heartstones, you must now bring them to Xanthor in Ravenshore."
msgstr "你现在已经拥有了四个元素之心，你应该带四个元素之心去渡鸦海滨找当地的智者萨索尔。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:910
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:915
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your destiny lies through the crystal gateway in Ravenshore. It will take you to the Plane Between Planes. There you will find the source of the elemental cataclysm."
msgstr "你的命运就是必须通过渡鸦海滨的水晶传送门。它将会带你前往界间之地，在那里你会找到元素大灾变的起源。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:911
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:916
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have talked to the Destroyer, but have failed to gather from him the key which will unlock your future. Return to him and continue your conversations."
msgstr "你已经和毁灭者谈过了，但却无法从他的口中获知足够的线索来解决你未来的谜题，你必须要再回去才能够知道足够的线索。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:912
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:917
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your path is clear to my vision. You must seek out the four elemental lords and release them from their prisons. These prisons are in the Destroyer's realm--the Plane Between Planes."
msgstr "在我的预知能力中，你必须要找到四名元素之王，并且将它们从监狱中释放出来。他们的监狱就在毁灭者的世界，也就是界间之地。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:913
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:918
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Seek out Xanthor! Though he is but a piece in the game of Balance, the next move you make towards destiny it through a meeting with him."
msgstr "快去找萨索尔！因为他是这场平衡游戏中的一个棋子，命运的下一步就是应该让你和他会面。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:914
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:919
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Balance is restored. Now that your destiny is made, I can no longer guide you--my sight only pertains to what is connected to the fate of Balance. What you do now is up to you. Good luck to you, Heroes of Jadame!"
msgstr "平衡已经恢复了。现在你的命运已经达成了，我再也不能够指引你了。我的视线只能够看到和平衡有关系的未来。你现在要作什么都看你自己了。祝你好运，贾丹姆大陆的英雄！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:922
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:927
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have proven yourself and I will promote any Dragons that travel with you to Great Wyrm."
msgstr "你们已经证明了自己的能力，我将会把你们队伍中的飞龙晋升为神龙！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:923
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:928
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You cannot be promoted to Priest of the Sun until you have recovered the Prophecies of the Sun!"
msgstr "在你找回太阳预言之前，你不能够晋升为太阳主教！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:937
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:942
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have done us a great service, adventurers. On behalf of my herd, I give you our humblest thanks. Know that the Minotaurs of Balthazar Lair hold you in the highest regard. You will always be welcome among us."
msgstr "冒险者们，你们已经帮了我们很大的忙。我替我的子民们感谢你们。请记得巴尔萨煞巢穴的牛头人永远感激你们。我们永远欢迎你。"

