#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:9
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:8
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Bring Brekish Onefang's portal crystal to Fredrick Talimere."
msgstr "将布拉克许·单牙的传送水晶带回给费德瑞克·塔力米尔"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:11
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:10
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Deliver Fellmoon's blackmail letter to Arion Hunter, leader of the wererat smugglers. Report back to Fellmoon."
msgstr "将费尔蒙的黑函交给半鼠人走私集团的首领艾瑞安·韩特，并将结果回报至艾尔加·费尔蒙"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:13
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:12
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Report to Bastian Loudrin, the merchant guildmaster in Alvar."
msgstr "将消息报告至阿尔瓦商人公会会长巴斯沉·卢德林"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:15
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:14
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Form an alliance among the major factions of Jadame."
msgstr "在贾丹姆大陆的主要势力之间结盟"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:16
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:15
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Form an alliance with the Necromancers' Guild in Shadowspire."
msgstr "和阴影塔区域的死灵法师公会结盟"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:17
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:16
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Form an alliance with the Temple of the Sun in Murmurwoods."
msgstr "和低语森林的太阳神庙结盟"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:17
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Form an alliance with the Dragon hunters of Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "和绞刑峡谷的猎龙人结盟"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:19
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:18
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Form an alliance with the Dragons of Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "和绞刑峡谷的飞龙们结盟"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:20
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:19
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Form an alliance with the Minotaurs of Ravage Roaming."
msgstr "和残破镇的牛头人结盟"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:27
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:26
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find a witness to the lake of fire's formation. Bring him back to the merchant guild in Alvar."
msgstr "找到一个目击火湖形成的证人，并且将它带回阿尔瓦的商人公会。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:28
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:27
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find the skeleton transformer in the Shadowspire Necromancers' Guild. Destroy it and return to Oskar Tyre."
msgstr "找到阴影塔的死灵法师公会中的骷髅转换器，摧毁它之后回去找奥斯卡·提尔报到。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:30
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:29
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Bring the Nightshade Brazier to the Necromancers' Guild leader, Sandro. The Brazier is in the Temple of the Sun."
msgstr "将龙葵灯炉带给死灵法师公会的领导者山德罗。龙葵灯炉就在太阳神庙之中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:32
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:31
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Rescue the Minotaurs trapped in their lair in Ravage Roaming."
msgstr "救出被困在残破镇的巢穴中的牛头人。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:33
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:32
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Recover the Dragon Egg from Zog's fortress in Ravage Roaming and return it to Charles Quixote in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "从残破镇旁索格的要塞中找出龙蛋，并且带回去给绞刑峡谷的查尔斯·吉科德。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:35
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:34
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find the Dragon Egg and return it to the dragon leader, Deftclaw Redreaver."
msgstr "找到龙蛋，并且带回去给飞龙的领袖，达夫克劳·红斧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:38
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:37
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Sink the Regnan Fleet. Return to the Ravenshore council chamber."
msgstr "把雷格那的舰队弄沉，回到渡鸦海滨的议会报告。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:41
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:40
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find Cauri Blackthorne then return to Dantillion in Murmurwoods with information of her location."
msgstr "找到考瑞·黑王座。提示：大家只知道她最后一次拜访过的人是低语森林的丹提理安，从此之后便杳无音信。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:43
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:42
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Bring the Heart of Water from the Plane of Water to Xanthor."
msgstr "将水之心从水元素界带回来给萨索尔。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:44
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:43
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Bring the Heart of Air from the Plane of Air to Xanthor."
msgstr "将风之心从风元素界带回来给萨索尔。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:45
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:44
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Bring the Heart of Earth from the Plane of Earth to Xanthor."
msgstr "将地之心从土元素界带回来给萨索尔。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:46
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:45
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Bring the Heart of Fire from the Plane of Fire to Xanthor."
msgstr "将火之心从火元素界带回来给萨索尔。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:48
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:47
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find the cause of the cataclysm through the Crystal Gateway."
msgstr "穿过水晶传送门，找到大灾变发生的根源。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:50
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:49
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Rescue Pyrannaste, Lord of Fire."
msgstr "救出火之王。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:52
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:51
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Rescue Gralkor the Cruel, Lord of Earth."
msgstr "救出土之王。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:54
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:53
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Rescue Acwalander, Lord of Water."
msgstr "救出水之王。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:56
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:55
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Rescue Shalwend, Lord of Air."
msgstr "救出风之王。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:63
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:62
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Put Vilebite's ashes in the Dust village tomb then return to Overdune."
msgstr "将弹指兄弟维尔拜的骨灰葬到村庄的墓穴之中，并回来找弹指。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:70
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:69
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find the Ancient Troll Homeland and return to Volog Sandwind in the Ironsand Desert."
msgstr "找到古代巨魔之家，并回到铁沙漠找瓦络德·沙风解释。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:72
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:71
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find Blazen Stormlance and recover the spear Ebonest. Return to Leane Stormlance in Garrote Gorge and deliver Ebonest to Charles Quixote."
msgstr "找到布拉森·暴风枪以及那柄黑木之矛。完成任务之后去绞刑峡谷找连恩·暴风枪，并且将黑木之矛交给查尔斯·吉科德。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:74
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:73
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Inquire about a cure for Blazen Stormlance from Dervish Chevron in Ravenshore."
msgstr "去渡鸦海滨找代为瑞许·其佛龙询问有关治疗布拉森·暴风枪的药方。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:76
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:75
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Kill all Dragon Slayers and return the Sword of Whistlebone the Slayer to Deftclaw Redreaver in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "杀光所有的屠龙者，并且将惠索朋之剑交给绞刑峡谷的达夫克劳·红斧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:78
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:77
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find the Axe of Balthazar, in the Dark Dwarf Mines.  Have the Axe authenticated by Dadeross.  Return the axe to Tessalar, heir to the leadership of the Minotaur Herd."
msgstr "找到位于黑暗矮人矿坑中的巴尔萨煞之斧。然后请达德洛斯认证那柄斧头是真货，接着再把这柄斧头带回去给牛头人首领的继承人泰沙拉。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:82
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:81
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find the Sarcophagus of Korbu and Korbu's Remains and return them to Lathean in Shadowspire."
msgstr "找到可布的石棺和尸骸，并且将这些东西带回去给阴影塔地区的拉席安。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:84
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:83
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find the Lost Book of Khel and return it to Vertrinus in Shadowspire."
msgstr "找到失落的凯尔之书，并且带回去给阴影塔的维崔那斯。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:87
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:86
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find Dadeross, the Minotaur in charge of your merchant caravan. When you saw him last, he was going to talk to the village clan leader."
msgstr "找到达德洛斯，也就是负责管理你们商队的牛头人。上次你看见他的时候，他正准备要和村庄中的长老谈话。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:93
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:92
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Consult the Ironfists' court sage, Xanthor about the Ravenshore crystal."
msgstr "和艾恩法斯特王朝的智者萨索尔请教有关渡鸦海滨水晶的问题。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:103
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:102
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Deliver Cure Disease Scrolls to the six huts on the outer Dagger Wound Islands.  Return to Aislen on Dagger Wound Island."
msgstr "将治愈疾病的卷轴送到匕伤岛外围群岛的六个小屋中。接着回到匕伤岛上去找埃斯蓝。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:111
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:110
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find and return an Anointed Potion to Languid in the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr "找到神选之药剂，并且将它带回去给匕伤岛的蓝贵德。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:113
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:112
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Bring Hiss on the Dagger Wound Islands the Idol of the Snake from the Abandoned Temple."
msgstr "将废弃神庙中所找到的蛇之圣像带回去给匕伤岛的希斯。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:115
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:114
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Bring Thistle on the Dagger Wound Islands the basic ingredients for a potion of Pure Speed."
msgstr "将纯粹速度药剂所需要的药材带给匕伤岛上的系斯妥。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:117
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:116
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Bring Rihansi in Alvar the basic ingredients for a potion of Pure Luck."
msgstr "将纯粹运气药剂所需要的药材带去给阿尔瓦的瑞汉西。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:119
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:118
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Deliver fake report to the Dread Pirate Stanley in the Pirate's Rest Tavern on the Island of Regna."
msgstr "将假的报告带回去给雷格那岛上的海盗休息站酒吧给恐怖海盗史坦力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:121
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:120
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Rescue Arion Hunter's daughter from Ogre Fortress in Alvar."
msgstr "将艾瑞安·韩特的女儿从阿尔瓦的食人妖要塞中救出。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:123
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:122
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Bring Talion in the Ironsand Desert the basic ingredients for a potion of Pure Endurance."
msgstr "将纯粹耐力药剂的药材带给铁沙漠中的塔力安。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:125
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:124
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Bring Kelvin in Shadowspire the basic ingredients for a potion of Pure Intellect."
msgstr "将纯粹智力药剂所需要的药材带去给阴影塔地区的凯尔文。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:127
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:126
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Bring Castigeir in Murmurwoods the basic ingredients for a potion of Pure Personality."
msgstr "将纯粹个性药剂的药材带给低语森林的卡斯提盖尔。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:129
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:128
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Recover the shield, Eclipse, for Lathius in Ravenshore."
msgstr "替渡鸦海滨的拉西亚斯找到名为日蚀的盾牌。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:131
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:130
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Kill all Ogres in the Alvar canyon area and in Ogre Fortress and return to Keldon in Alvar."
msgstr "杀死阿尔瓦峡谷地区和食人妖要塞中的所有食人妖，然后回到阿尔瓦找凯尔顿。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:134
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:133
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Bring Galvinus in Ravage Roaming the basic ingredients for a potion of Pure Accuracy."
msgstr "将纯粹精确药剂所需要的药材带给残破镇的加文那斯。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:137
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:136
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find the Prophecies of the Snake for Pascella Tisk."
msgstr "替派赛拉·提斯克找到蛇之预言。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:139
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:138
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find Isthric the Tongue, brother of Rohtnax.  Return to Rohtnax in the village of Blood Drop on Dagger Wound Island."
msgstr "替罗特奈克斯找到他的兄弟利舌埃斯瑞克。完成任务之后回去匕伤岛的血滴镇找罗特奈克斯。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:141
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:140
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Kill all Dire Wolves in Ravenshore. Return to Maddigan in Ravenshore."
msgstr "杀死所有渡鸦海滨地区的猛狼，完成任务之后回去渡鸦海滨找马帝刚。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:144
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:143
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Deliver Fire Resistance Potions to the six southernmost houses of Rust.  Return to Hobert in Rust."
msgstr "将御火药剂送到铁锈镇六个最南边的屋子里面。完成任务之后回去找铁锈镇的贺伯特。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:152
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:151
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find a Dragonbane Flower for Calindril in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "替绞刑峡谷的卡林最尔找一朵灭龙花。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:154
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:153
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find a Dragonbane Flower for the Balion Tearwing in the Garrote Gorge Dragon Caves."
msgstr "替绞刑峡谷龙穴中的巴力安·泪翼找一朵灭龙花。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:156
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:155
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Kill all the Dragons in the Garrote Gorge wilderness area. Return to Avalon in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "杀死所有绞刑峡谷野外的飞龙，完成任务之后去找绞刑峡谷的阿瓦龙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:159
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:158
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Kill all the Dragon Hunter's in the Garrote Gorge wilderness area. Return to Jerin Flame-eye in the Garrote Gorge Dragon Caves."
msgstr "杀死所有绞刑峡谷野外地区的猎龙人，完成任务之后去找绞刑峡谷龙穴的杰林·炎眼。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:162
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:161
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find the Legendary Drum of Victory. Return it to Zelim in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "找到传说中的胜利之鼓，完成任务之后去找绞刑峡谷的赛林姆。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:164
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:163
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find Iseldir's Puzzle Box for Benefice of Shadowspire."
msgstr "替阴影塔的班耐费斯找寻机关盒。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:166
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:165
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find a Vial of Grave Dirt. Return it to Halien in Shadowspire."
msgstr "找到墓土之瓶，完成任务之后去找阴影塔地区的海林安。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:168
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:167
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find the Bone of Doom for Tantilion of Shadowspire."
msgstr "替阴影塔地区的坦尼林安找到毁灭之骨。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:174
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:173
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Challenge the Arcomage Champion in each tavern of Jadame."
msgstr "在贾丹姆大陆上每个酒吧进行魔幻牌挑战。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:175
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:174
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Win a game of Arcomage in all eleven taverns, then return to Tonk Blueswan in Ravenshore."
msgstr "在贾丹姆大陆上所有十一家酒吧中赢得至少一场魔幻牌游戏，然后返回渡鸦海滨找汤克·蓝天鹅。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:178
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:177
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find a wheel of Frelandeau Cheese. Bring it to Asael Fromago in Alvar."
msgstr "找到一块独角兽奶酪，并且带回去交给阿尔瓦的阿萨尔·福罗马哥。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:179
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:178
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find a log of Eldenbrie Cheese. Bring it to Asael Fromago in Alvar."
msgstr "找到一块艾顿布理奶酪，并且带回去交给阿尔瓦的阿萨尔·福罗马哥。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:180
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:179
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find a ball of Dunduck Cheese. Bring it to Asael Fromago in Alvar."
msgstr "找到一块登达克奶酪，并且带回去交给阿尔瓦的阿萨尔·福罗马哥。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:238
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:237
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find the treasure of the Dread Pirate Stanley."
msgstr "找到恐怖海盗史坦力的宝藏。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:286
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/quests.txt.py:285
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Return to Fellmoon in Ravenshore and report your success in blackmailing the wererat smuggler, Arion Hunter."
msgstr "回去找阿尔瓦的费尔蒙报到，并且解释你已经成功的勒索了走私贩子艾瑞安·韩特。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:3
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:3
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "This is you--The Acknowledged Hero of Jadame."
msgstr "这就是你，众人皆知的贾丹姆大陆英雄。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:4
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:4
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Devlin Arcanus"
msgstr "阿肯那斯"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:4
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:4
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "A newly initiated practitioner of the dark arts, Arcanus is taking his first steps down the path which he hopes will lead him to power and glory. Strong in mind if not body, he has concentrated his time in pursuit of magical knowledge."
msgstr "代为林·阿肯那斯刚刚开始研习黑暗类魔法，他选择了这条他认为可以带给他光耀与权力的道路并尽力去努力。虽然身体不很强壮，但他的意志强韧，将所有的时间都花在追求魔法知识上。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:5
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:5
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Fredrick Talimere"
msgstr "塔力米尔"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:5
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:5
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "After he left the sanctuary of his order, Fredrick Talimere found himself drawn to secular pursuits, particularly towards the study of cultures that have disappeared from the face of Jadame."
msgstr "在离开了原先的派系之后，佛得瑞克·塔力米尔发现自己非常喜欢研究某些特殊的学问，特别是那些从贾丹姆大陆上神秘消失的文化。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:6
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:6
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Simon Templar"
msgstr "赛蒙-谭普勒"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:6
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:6
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "When he was a lad, the elders of Simon Templar's village were quick to notice that intellectual pursuits were not in his future. Encouraging him to put down his pen and pick up the sword, they made him into the soldier he is today."
msgstr "当赛蒙·谭普勒还是个孩子的时候，村里的长辈们就发现他未来的路不是追求知识。他们鼓励他放下笔，拿起剑，成为了一名战士。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:7
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:7
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Overdune Snapfinger"
msgstr "欧瓦都-弹指"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:7
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:7
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "All Overdune Snapfinger ever wanted to be was a simple hunter. The destruction of his village of Rust by the elemental cataclysm changed all that. Now events have made him and adventurer whose life now is tied into the ultimate destiny of the world itself."
msgstr "欧瓦都·弹指原先只是想要成为一名普通的猎人。但是在村庄被元素的大灾变给摧毁之后，一切都改变了。现在，他变成了和世界的未来息息相关的冒险者。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:8
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:8
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Arius"
msgstr "艾瑞厄斯"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:8
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:8
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Born of a long line of Balthazar Lair blacksmiths, Arius saw nothing but the pounding of metal in his future--a prospect that did not sit well with him. Seeking new experience he left the underground city to find adventure in the larger world."
msgstr "艾瑞斯的祖先是巴尔萨煞一代相传已久的打铁匠，由于他其实并不喜欢终其一生永无止尽的打铁，因此他离开了地底城市，到地面去寻找更宽广的未来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:9
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:9
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Rohani Oscleton"
msgstr "欧斯克理顿"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:9
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:9
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Trained to be a merchant caravan guard, Rohani's destiny seemed set until you recruited her into your adventure. Talented in both magic and combat, her skills are now at your avail."
msgstr "罗哈尼·欧斯克曾受训成为商队的守卫，但在你召募她加入队伍之后，她的命运也随之而改变了。她擅长魔法和战斗，这些力量现在全为你所用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:10
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:10
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Elsbeth Lamentia"
msgstr "拉曼提亚"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:10
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:10
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Turned into a vampire against her will by none other than Thant, guildmaster of the Necromancers' Guild, Elsbeth fled her native Shadowspire. Seeking a new life, she found it as a freebooting adventurer."
msgstr "艾尔斯被斯·拉曼提亚是被死灵法师公会的首领谭特转变成吸血鬼的，但在那之后，她头也不回的逃离了世居的阴影塔。现在，她为了追求自由的生活，成为了一个单纯的冒险者。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:11
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:11
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Ithilgore"
msgstr "伊斯希尔歌"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:11
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:11
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "A youth among dragons, Ithilgore felt oppressed by the regimented society of the Garrote Gorge Dragons. When you came by, he jumped at the opportunity to explore the larger world freely."
msgstr "伊斯希尔歌其实在龙类之中算是相当年轻的，在龙类严厉的社会制度压迫下，他觉得喘不过气。因此，当你出现的时候，他抓住这个机会，开始和你们一起自由地探索世界。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:12
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:12
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Karanya Memoria"
msgstr "麦莫瑞亚"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:12
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:12
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Cast out of the Necromancers' Guild for pursuing forms of knowledge too dark for even their corrupt tastes, Karanya Memoria now pursues greater power without the guild's help…or hindrance."
msgstr "因为所探求的知识太过黑暗邪恶，连死灵法师公会都无法忍受卡蓝雅·麦莫瑞亚的邪恶力量。现在她在没有公会的阻碍和协助的情况下自由地追求更深入的知识。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:13
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:13
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Maylander "
msgstr "麦兰德"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:13
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:13
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "After making a reputation for himself in Erathia, Maylander, a cleric of the Sun Temple, came to Jadame on a sabbatical rest. The tug of the open road pulled too strongly at him however, and now he is in your services."
msgstr "在埃拉西亚扬名立万之后，麦兰德，一名太阳神庙的牧师，来到贾丹姆大陆准备退隐。但是，开放的道路对他的吸引力还是太大，现在他成为了你队伍中的一员。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:14
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:14
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Leane Stormlance"
msgstr "林恩-暴风枪"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:14
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:14
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "As a daughter of Blazen Stormlance, Leane's whole childhood was spent playing with swords as other girls play with dolls. Now a warrior of great repute, her sword is yours to command."
msgstr "身为暴风枪家族的一元，林恩·暴风枪在其它女孩玩娃娃的时候就开始了舞刀弄剑的童年。现在她已经成为了声名远扬的战士，听从你的指挥。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:15
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:15
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Volog Sandwind"
msgstr "瓦洛格-沙风"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:15
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:15
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "A warrior of Rust village, Volog Sandwind earned the nickname, \"One Eye Slayer,\" while championing the village's defense against raiding cyclopes. Now that you've found his village a new homeland, he has joined your cause."
msgstr "身为村庄中的战士，瓦洛格·沙风赢得了“独眼杀手”的称号，因为他抵抗独眼巨人入侵村庄的战绩无人能及。在你替他的村子找到另一个家园之后，他就加入了你的队伍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:16
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:16
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Thanys"
msgstr "坦尼斯"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:16
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:16
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Grateful to you for rescuing his herd at Balthazar Lair, Thanys has pledged his loyal service to you. Skilled in warcraft he is a worthy companion."
msgstr "为了感谢你在巴尔萨煞拯救了他的同胞，坦尼斯加入了你的麾下。他擅长作战，是你最好的伙伴。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:17
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:17
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Jasp Thelbourne"
msgstr "赛尔鹏"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:17
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:17
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Though at least slightly too full of his own self importance, Jasp Thelbourne is not entirely without bragging rights. An adventurer before you met him, he travels with you now seeking to enlarge his glory and reputation."
msgstr "虽然有点儿太过自信，但杰斯波·赛尔鹏还不是那种完全信口开河的人。在你遇到他前他是名孤单的冒险者，现在他则为了更大的荣誉和声名而努力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:18
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Gethric Mercutura"
msgstr "摩枯妥拉"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:18
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Though a rebellious nature is not uncommon among vampires, Gethric Mercutura joined your party in direct violation of his orders from the Necromancers' Guild guildmaster, Thant. Though this meant his immediate expulsion from the guild, he has never regretted the decision."
msgstr "虽然在吸血鬼之中，离经叛道的行为不少，但盖斯瑞克·摩枯妥拉加入你们队伍的行为算是直接违背了死灵法师公会会长谭特的命令。即使这代表着被逐出公会，他还是没有任何后悔之意。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:19
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:19
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Flamdring"
msgstr "佛蓝林"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:19
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:19
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "A rebel among rebels, Flamdring joined you by leaving the pack of Ithilgore--himself a renegade dragon. A dragon of medium size, he has agreed to adventure with you for as long as it holds his flighty attention."
msgstr "佛蓝林是叛逆中的叛逆，他离开了龙群，并且加入你的队伍中。他是只中型的飞龙，并且承诺只要你的行动还能够吸引他的注意力，他就愿意继续留下来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:20
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:20
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Hevatia Deverbero"
msgstr "代佛贝罗"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:20
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:20
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "When you allied with the Necromancers' Guild, certain guild members were instructed to place themselves available to your mission. Some did so reluctantly, but not Hevatia Deverbero. A seeker of knowledge she saw an opportunity to explore the world. "
msgstr "当你加入了死灵法师公会之后，一些成员接到命令要全力协助你。有些人心不甘情不愿，但海瓦提亚·代佛贝罗可不一样。由于她酷爱追求新知，所以非常想要利用这个机会探索世界。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:21
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:21
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Verish "
msgstr "瓦瑞西"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:21
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:21
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Impressed by your defeat of the Necromancers' Guild Verish, a priest of the Sun Temple, offered to join you, seeing your mission as one serving the greater Path of Light."
msgstr "由于对您击败死灵法师公会的成就感到十分佩服，瓦瑞西，这名太阳神庙的主教，决定加入你的阵容，继续替光明之道服务。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:22
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:22
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Nelix Uriel"
msgstr "乌瑞尔"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:22
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:22
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Charles Quixote saw in the alliance a chance to season some of his followers with a bit of adventuring. Quixote felt that Nelix Uriel was too much the dragon hunting specialist. With this in mind, he gave the knight leave to follow you on your great quest."
msgstr "查尔斯认为这个联盟可以让他的跟随者们获得更多的经验。他认为耐力克斯·乌瑞尔太过专注在猎龙这项单一的专长上面了，因此，他命令这名骑士加入你们伟大任务的行列。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:23
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:23
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Sethrc Thistlebone"
msgstr "希索朋"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:23
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:23
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Known in the village of Rust for his great sense of civic responsibility, Sethrc Thistlebone chose to join you for the greater good of his people. Now in your service he single-mindedly pursues an end to the elemental cataclysm."
msgstr "赛斯瑞克·希索朋在村子里就因为对其他人十分责任而出名，他选择加入你是为了自己同胞更美好的未来。现在他一心一意地为了结束这场元素末日危机而努力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:24
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:24
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Rionel"
msgstr "瑞欧耐尔"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:24
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:24
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "A great hero of the Minotaurs' campaign against the Vori Frost Giants, Rionel saw joining your quest as an opportunity to know further glory. An expert with both axe and bow, his skill at the arts of war make him a good companion in battle."
msgstr "瑞欧耐尔是牛头人对抗沃里的霜雪巨人战争中的大英雄，他认为加入你的队伍是获得更高荣耀的机会。他对弓和斧都相当擅长，是战斗中的好伙伴。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:25
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:25
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Adric Stellare"
msgstr "史塔拉尔"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:25
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:25
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "With humble beginnings as a caravan guard, Adric Stellare has risen to the heights of Alvarian society. Having had the opportunity to play many roles, he is skilled in magic and combat. As a member of the merchant guild, he is also an master trader."
msgstr "虽然起初只是车队的守卫，但艾瑞克·史塔拉尔后来成为了阿尔瓦社会中的上层人士。由于需要扮演许多角色，他对于魔法和战斗都十分擅长。身为商人公会成员，他同时也是名经验丰富的商人。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:26
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:26
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Infaustus "
msgstr "因佛史塔斯"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:26
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:26
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Though an elder vampire, Infaustus has had little cause to leave her native Shadowspire. When she realized this, she immediately began preparations to leave. Traveling with you is an opportunity for her to know more of Jadame."
msgstr "虽然因佛史塔斯是名年长的吸血鬼，但她没有多少理由离开家乡阴影塔区域。但当她意识到这点时，她立刻准备离开，因为认识这个世界对她来说是极为难得的机会。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:27
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:27
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Brimstone"
msgstr "布林斯通"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:27
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:27
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "When he rebelled against the Garrote Gorge dragons, Yaardrake was fortunate to convince the mighty Brimstone to join his cause. That you were able to slay so many of Yaardrake's compatriots however, left Brimstone less impressed with Yaardrake and more impressed with you."
msgstr "在反叛加洛特山谷的龙群时，雅达克很幸运地说服了强大的布尔斯通加入。你在战斗中屠杀了那么多雅达克的同胞，反而让布尔斯通对你的青睐胜过对雅达克的好感。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:28
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:28
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Vetrinus Taleshire"
msgstr "塔尔希尔"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:28
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:28
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Next in line to lead the Necromancers' Guild of Shadowspire, Vetrinus has nothing in his heart for the Temple of the Sun but contempt.  You are lucky to have such a powerful student of the dark magics traveling with you."
msgstr "维崔那斯·塔尔希尔是死灵法师公会首领的下一个继承人，心中对于太阳神庙只有痛恨而已。你很幸运，可以找到一名对于黑暗系法术如此擅长的人来支持你的旅程。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:29
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:29
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Dervish Chevron"
msgstr "其佛龙"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:29
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:29
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Holder of the title of Keeper of the Light, Dervish will soon lead the Temple of the Sun in Jadame.  You are lucky to have such stronger follower of the Path of Light with your party."
msgstr "在拥有了光之守护者的称号之后，代为瑞许·其佛龙很快就会成为贾丹姆大陆上太阳神庙的首领。你很幸运，可以找到一名如此强大的光明战士和你并肩作战。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:30
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:30
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Tempus "
msgstr "坦帕斯"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:30
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:30
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Among dragon hunters, Tempus is a legend. While most hunting parties consist of at least twenty seasoned knights, Tempus prefers to hunt his prey solo. You are fortunate to have in your service a knight of his great ability."
msgstr "在猎龙人之中，坦帕斯是个传奇。大多数的狩猎队伍都有二十名经验丰富的骑士，但他喜欢独自一人狩猎。你很幸运可以拥有这么厉害的骑士加入队伍一起探险。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:31
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:31
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Thorne Understone"
msgstr "索恩-石下"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:31
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:31
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "It is uncommon to hear songs of Trollish heroes in the Ravenshore taverns, but when they are sung, chances are their subject is Thorne Understone."
msgstr "在渡鸦海滨的酒吧中很少有机会可以听到巨魔唱歌。但当他们开口唱歌的时候，歌颂的对象十有八九跟你的这位队员，即索恩·石下有关。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:32
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:32
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Ulbrecht"
msgstr "乌布理契"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:32
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:32
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Many Minotaur heroes made their name in the war against the Vori Frost Giants, but some names stand out more than others. \"Ulbrecht,\" is such a name. Impressed by your great deeds he has raised his axe in your service."
msgstr "许多牛头人英雄都是在对沃里的霜雪巨人的战争中立下名号的，但有些人的名字，比如“乌布理契”，就是比别人的更响亮一些。他对于你的表现十分赞赏，因此加入了你的队伍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:33
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:33
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Cauri Blackthorne"
msgstr "考瑞-黑王座"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:33
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:33
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Guardmaster of the Merchants of Alvar, Cauri is one of the finest warrior of the Dark Elf people.  She runs errands for the Merchant Council, which they feel require a \"special\" touch.  Her skills will be of great use, if she is in your service."
msgstr "考瑞·黑王座是阿尔瓦商队的守卫领袖，也是黑暗精灵中最强悍的战士。当议会觉得任务需要“特别”照顾的时候，就一定会派出她来执行。如果她加入你的阵容，一定会提供相当大的帮助。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:34
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:34
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Artorius Veritas"
msgstr "维瑞塔斯"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:34
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:34
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Grievous wounds forced the ancient vampire, Artorius Veritas into a healing slumber which lasted thirty-four years. Recently awaken he chooses to travel with you to see the changes time has wrought on Jadame."
msgstr "之前所受到的重创让阿图瑞斯·维瑞塔斯这名吸血鬼沉睡了三十四年。他最近才苏醒过来，想和你一同看看在这段时间中贾丹姆大陆到底有多大的改变。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:35
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:35
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Duroth the Eternal"
msgstr "永恒土洛斯"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:35
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:35
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Few Dragons live to become as old as Duroth. Disgusted with the society built by the younger generation at Garrote Gorge, he left with his friend, Loeb to form a new nest built around the old ideals. Since that nest's fall he travels with you seeking a clearer truth."
msgstr "很少有龙能像土洛斯一样长命。由于十分唾弃加洛特山谷中由年轻一辈创建的社会，他和朋友罗伯一起离开，建立了一个基于传统理念的巢穴。在巢穴陷落后，他加入了你，以寻求真理。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:36
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:36
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Nathaniel Roberts"
msgstr "罗伯兹"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:36
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:36
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Though not an official member of the Necromancers' Guild, Nathanial Roberts has gained considerable skill in the dark arts. Tolerated by guild members for his willingness to perform certain favors, Roberts picks up his knowledge where he can get it."
msgstr "虽然纳山尼尔·罗伯兹不是死灵法师公会真正的成员，但他对于黑暗类魔法的掌握相当惊人。他借着愿意执行许多任务的诚意来换取学习黑暗类魔法的机会。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:37
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:37
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Dyson Leyland"
msgstr "戴森-李蓝"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:37
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:37
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Though a cleric schooled in the ways of the Sun Temple, his time in the Necromancers' Guild as a secret agent has left him with a dark nature. Though still on the Path of Light, he feels betrayed by his former order."
msgstr "虽然戴森·李蓝是太阳神庙的牧师，但是待在死灵法师公会中卧底的那段时间让他有了极不愉快的经验。现在他依旧还是太阳神庙的成员，却觉得同袍都背弃了他。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:38
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:38
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Blazen Stormlance"
msgstr "布拉森-暴风"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:38
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:38
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "Finest knight ever trained by Charles Quixote.  Blazen has a personal crusade against the Necromancers of Shadowspire and their attempts to creating skeletal dragons.  His skill will prove very useful, if you allow him to travel with you."
msgstr "布拉森·暴风枪是查尔斯·吉柯德曾经训练过最强的骑士。他对于阴影塔地区的死灵法师和他们创造骷髅龙的尝试一直深恶痛绝。如果你让他和你一起旅行，他的技能将会对你有很大的帮助。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:39
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:47
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:39
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:47
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "troll"
msgstr "巨魔"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:40
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:48
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:40
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:48
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "minotaur"
msgstr "牛头人"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:41
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:49
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:41
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:49
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "darkelf"
msgstr "黑暗精灵"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:42
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:50
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:42
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:50
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "vampire"
msgstr "吸血鬼"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:43
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:51
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:52
#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:53
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:43
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:51
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:52
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:53
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "dragon"
msgstr "飞龙"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:44
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:44
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "necromancer"
msgstr "死灵法师"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:45
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:45
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "cleric"
msgstr "牧师"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/roster.txt.py:46
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/roster.txt.py:46
msgctxt "roster"
msgid "knight"
msgstr "骑士"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:2
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:2
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Might is the statistic that represents a character's overall strength, and his or her ability to put that strength where it counts.  Characters with a high Might statistic do more damage in combat."
msgstr "力量值反映角色整体强壮程度、实力，以及发挥该实力的能力。角色力量值越高，在战斗中的对敌人造成的杀伤越大。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:3
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:3
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Intellect represents a character's ability to reason and understand complex, abstract concepts. Maximum spell points for Necromancers and Dark Elves are based on Intellect."
msgstr "智力反映角色推理和理解复杂抽象概念的能力。死灵法师和黑暗精灵的最大魔法值取决于智力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:4
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:4
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Personality represents both a character's strength of will and personal charm.  Maximum spell points for Clerics, Vampires and Minotaurs are based on Personality."
msgstr "个性反映角色的意志力和个人魅力。牧师、吸血鬼、牛头人的最大魔法值取决于个性。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:5
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:5
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Endurance is a measure of a character's physical toughness and durability. A high Endurance gives a character more hit points."
msgstr "耐力衡量角色的身体韧性和耐久性。耐力越高，角色的生命值越大。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:6
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:6
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Accuracy represents a character's precision and hand-eye coordination.  A high Accuracy will allow a character to hit monsters more frequently in combat."
msgstr "精确反映角色的准确性和手眼协调能力。高精确值将允许角色在战斗中更频繁地击中怪物。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:7
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:7
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Speed is a measure of how quick a character is.  A high Speed statistic will increase a character's armor class and the rate with which the character recovers from attacks."
msgstr "速度是衡量角色的行动迅速程度的指标。速度越快，角色的防御等级越高，受到攻击后的恢复越快。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:9
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:9
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Hit Points indicate how much damage your character can sustain before falling unconscious or dying.  A character is unconscious at 0 Hit Points or less, and dies when Hit Points reach -10  All Hit Points are restored after 8 hours of uninterrupted rest."
msgstr "生命值表示你的角色在昏迷或死亡之前可以承受多大的伤害。生命值小于或等于0时角色会昏迷。好好休息8小时可恢复最大生命值。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:10
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:10
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Armor Class is a measure of how difficult it is for a monster to hit a character.  The higher the Armor Class, the better the chance of avoiding an attack."
msgstr "防御等级是衡量敌人击中角色难度的指标。防御等级越高，回避攻击的概率就越大。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:11
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:11
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Spell Points are needed to cast spells.  Every spell has a Spell Point cost that is deducted from this statistic when it's cast.  Spell Points are restored after 8 hours of uninterrupted rest."
msgstr "魔法值用于施展魔法。通常施展每个魔法都需要扣除一定的魔法值，好好休息8小时可恢复最大魔法值。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:12
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:12
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Condition shows the worst \"effect\" your character is suffering, such as poisoned, diseased, or dead.  Many conditions seriously hurt your character's ability to fight or perform other actions, and should be cured as soon as possible."
msgstr "状态显示角色正在遭受的负面影响，如中毒、患病、死亡等。许多状态都会严重削弱角色的战斗能力，必须尽快治疗。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:13
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:13
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "The Quick Spell is the spell that will be cast when you use the \"s\" key to cast a spell.  You can set the quick spell by opening your spell book (\"c\" key), clicking on the spell you want to set, then clicking on the set spell tab at the left-bottom corner of the spell book."
msgstr "备用魔法是指按S键或按住Ctrl键单击目标，就可快速发射的魔法。想要设置备用魔法，可以按C键打开魔法全书，选择你想要设置的魔法，然后单击左下角设为备用魔法的按钮即可。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:17
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:17
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Attack Bonus is the sum of all factors (skills, spells, Accuracy, etc.) that influence your character's chance to hit monsters with an equipped weapon.  "
msgstr "攻击点数会影响你的角色用武器击中怪物的几率，它取决于技能等级、魔法、精确等各种因素。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:21
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:21
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Fire Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage taken from fire based attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce fire damage, it does not make your character immune."
msgstr "火系抗性代表你的角色面对基于火系的攻击，降低其伤害的能力。虽然很高的火系抗性可以大大减少火系伤害，但并不能使你的角色免疫。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:22
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:22
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Air Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage taken from air based attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce air damage, it does not make your character immune."
msgstr "风系抗性代表你的角色面对基于风系的攻击，降低其伤害的能力。虽然很高的风系抗性可以大大减少风系伤害，但并不能使你的角色免疫。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:23
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:23
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Water Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage taken from water based attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce water damage, it does not make your character immune."
msgstr "水系抗性代表你的角色面对基于水系的攻击，降低其伤害的能力。虽然很高的水系抗性可以大大减少水系伤害，但并不能使你的角色免疫。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:24
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:24
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Earth Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage taken from earth based attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce earth damage, it does not make your character immune."
msgstr "土系抗性代表你的角色面对基于土系的攻击，降低其伤害的能力。虽然很高的土系抗性可以大大减少土系伤害，但并不能使你的角色免疫。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:25
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:25
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Mind Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage taken from mind based attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce mind damage, it does not make your character immune."
msgstr "心系抗性代表你的角色面对基于心系的攻击，降低其伤害的能力。虽然很高的心系抗性可以大大减少心系伤害，但并不能使你的角色免疫。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:26
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:26
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Body Resistance represents your character's ability to minimize damage taken from body based attacks.  Though a high resistance can greatly reduce body damage, it does not make your character immune."
msgstr "体系抗性代表你的角色面对基于体系的攻击，降低其伤害的能力。虽然很高的体系抗性可以大大减少体系伤害，但并不能使你的角色免疫。"

#: mmmerge/Data/10LocLANG.T/stats.txt.py:27
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/stats.txt.py:27
msgctxt "stats"
msgid "Skill Points are awarded whenever your character trains for a new level.  You can spend Skill Points on your skills at any time."
msgstr "技能点数可在角色训练达到新等级时获得。你可以随时在技能上花费技能点数，以提升该技能的等级。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:2
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:2
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Vampire crypts are normally well hidden. That the Shadowspire vampires operate so openly is proof of their power in the region."
msgstr "吸血鬼的墓窖通常隐藏得很好，但在阴影塔这边则是例外，很明显的是因为他们在这边的影响力非比寻常的关系。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:3
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:3
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "A burial mound. Though obviously centuries old, the door's inlaid and gilded decorations are clean and untarnished. They must be preserved by magic."
msgstr "这是个墓冢，看起来已经有好几世纪的历史了，但是门上的装饰和纹章看起来似乎相当干净，没有受到任何岁月的侵蚀。他们似乎是受到魔法的保护。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:4
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:4
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "When he passed away, Lord Brinne was mourned throughout the land. His tomb is a holy place visited by pilgrims and other well-wishers."
msgstr "当布林恩爵士去世的时候，全大陆的人都哀悼他的逝去。现在，他的墓穴已经成为了朝圣者和其它膜拜者必经之地。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:5
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:5
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "You find a passage leading downwards. Do you enter?"
msgstr "你发现了一个通往底下的楼梯，要进去吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:6
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:6
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The volcano has apparently pulled this ancient building from the bottom of the sea. Who were it's mysterious builders?"
msgstr "火山的爆发很明显的把这座建筑从海底拉了上来，到底谁是这些建筑的神秘建造者？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:7
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:7
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The Alvarian Dark Dwarves are recent arrivals to the area. In a short time, however, they've built an extensive system of mines."
msgstr "阿尔瓦的黑暗矮人才抵达此处不久，但是就在这短短的时间内，他们已经挖掘出了一系列错综复杂的隧道。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:210
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:9
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "This cave is legendary in Trollish lore, and is a holy place. Other creatures, however, might just see it as a lair to occupy and defend."
msgstr "这个洞穴在巨魔的传说里面是神圣的地方。但是，对其他的生物来说，可能只把这个地方当做居住的地方而已。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:212
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:10
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "As with all places holy to the followers of Eep, this temple smells of damp fur and cheese. A chorus of squeaks, like chanting issues from within."
msgstr "如同所有伊普的追随者一样，这个神庙闻起来有着潮湿毛皮和奶酪的味道。里面又持续的传来小声的吱吱声，如同吟唱声一般。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:214
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:11
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "As with all places holy to the followers of Eep, this small temple smells faintly of fur and cheese."
msgstr "如同所有伊普的追随者一样，这个神庙闻起来有着潮湿毛皮和奶酪的味道。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:216
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:12
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "A church holy to the followers of Eep. It smells faintly of damp fur and cheese."
msgstr "这是伊普的神圣教堂，闻起来有着潮湿毛皮和奶酪的味道。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:218
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:13
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "A cave entrance. A slight breeze from within brings you the faint smell of brimstone."
msgstr "洞穴的入口。从里面吹来的一阵微风带来了硫磺的味道。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:220
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:14
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "A cave entrance. The lair of some monstrous beast?"
msgstr "这是洞穴的入口，难道是某种怪兽的巢穴入口？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:222
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:15
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The entrance to this cave has been crudely widened by a creature with claws capable of ripping the hard dark stone."
msgstr "通往这个洞穴的入口很明显的被某种爪子利到可以抓穿岩石的怪兽给拓宽了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:53
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:192
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "History holds that Lizardmen temples of this period were guarded by traps and not monsters. What then to make of the reptilian slithering receding into the darkness?"
msgstr "根据历史上的记载，蜥蜴人在这个年代所建造的神庙都是由陷阱而不是用怪兽所防御的。里面那传来的爬虫类在地上摩擦的声音。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:56
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:193
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The smell of freshly lumbered wood gives indication of this fort's recent construction. The large stacks of supplies show that the Regnan pirates are planning a lengthy stay."
msgstr "刚砍下木材的新鲜味道证明了这个地方是刚刚才被摧毁的。这里所储存的庞大数量补给品证明了他们准备在这里待上很长的一段时间。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:58
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:194
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Even in the freeport of Ravenshore, some goods must avoid official eyes. Such usually pass through this secluded cove in the care of the wererat smugglers."
msgstr "即使在渡鸦海滨的自由港之中，有些货物也必须要躲避官方的眼光。这些货物通常会经由这个洞穴来到鼠人走私者的手中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:60
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:195
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "By the number of wolf tracks marking the approach to this wolves' den, either the wolves are extremely active or hundreds of them live in these caves."
msgstr "从通到这个狼穴的足迹看来，要嘛就是这些狼出入相当频繁，再不然就是这里面有数百只的狼。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:61
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:196
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The Dark Elven Merchants of Alvar run a mighty trade empire spanning the reach of Jadame. This is their local guildhouse in Ravenshore."
msgstr "阿尔瓦的黑暗精灵商人们在全贾丹姆大陆都有相当大的生意，这里就是他们在渡鸦海滨的公会之家。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:62
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:197
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "From the conflux key come a keening pitch which resonates through the crystal. A hidden depth is revealed--a passage that draws you with inexplicable attraction."
msgstr "从汇流之钥中传出来一个特殊的声调，这个声调和水晶产生了共鸣，让里面出现了一个深邃的黑色空洞，吸引你进入。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:63
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:198
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The hive emits a hum which sets your teeth rattling in your jaw. The breeze you feel is not the wind, but the blowback of a thousand monstrous wings."
msgstr "蜂巢里面传来沉闷的低哼声，让你的牙齿忍不住不停的打颤。那不是什么巨大机器运作的声音，而是数以千计的翅膀不停拍动的声音。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:64
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:199
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Ogre armies need carry no winches to their fort building sites. Their strength of arm and back is sufficient to raise the massive beams and posts."
msgstr "食人妖的军队不需要携带任何的建筑工具。他们惊人的臂力就足以举起建造堡垒所需要的句大支柱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:65
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:200
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The Trolls of Rust have entombed their dead here for centuries--each generation digging deeper catacombs beneath those dug before."
msgstr "铁锈镇的巨魔已经在这个地点安葬他们的祖先有好几世纪之久了。每一代的巨魔都会将墓穴挖的更深，安葬更年轻的人。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:66
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:201
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "What use do the Cyclopes make of this sinister vault? Whatever they do, makes it smell like a butcher's shop."
msgstr "独眼巨人究竟拿这个地方作什么？不管怎么样，这里闻起来都很像可怕的屠宰场。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:67
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:202
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "A tunnel of solidified lava snakes downward. Can it possible provide safe passage beneath the lake of fire?"
msgstr "一个由岩浆所构成的通路不停往下延伸，这是否可能是安全通过火湖的道路呢？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:68
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:203
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Made ruin in some long forgotten war, parts of this castle are still whole. The dragon hunters have made good use of these."
msgstr "这个城堡在不知多久以前发生的战争中被彻底摧毁了，猎龙人则是相当聪明的利用了还完好的区域。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:69
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:204
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "By nature, dragons are solitary beings. Occasionally, a few will nest together, but here in Garrote Gorge they have built a mighty society."
msgstr "龙的天性是孤单独立的，有时他们也会聚集成一个集团。但在绞刑峡谷这边，他们有一个相当完整的社群。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:70
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:205
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The stonework façade of this ancient temple has crumbled into the sand of time. Still, its majesty--and mystery--remain."
msgstr "这个古老神庙的许多石头雕刻的雄伟之处都已经随着时间而剥落了，但是，它的神秘风格依旧留存了下来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:71
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:206
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Though this temple is newly built it already possesses a timeless quality."
msgstr "虽然这座神庙刚新盖不久，但是却还有一种神秘的气氛。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:72
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:207
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The dark rock of these stone monuments cannot be found nearby. The nearest source is the Shadowspire Mountains a hundred leagues away."
msgstr "这些纪念碑所使用的黑石在附近根本找不到，最近的出产地是阴影塔山区，距离这边有数百里之遥。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:73
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:208
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "This air vent seems to be the only entrance into the flooded Minotaur city, Balthazar Lair."
msgstr "这个通气口似乎是进入牛头人所居住的巴尔萨煞巢穴的唯一入口。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:74
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:209
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Zog the Jackal's preference for building on high ground has provided an unexpected boon in the form of protection from the raging flood waters."
msgstr "豺狼索格喜欢在高地建筑的偏好让他躲过了袭来的大洪水。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:75
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:210
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The Regnans have never been known for their subtlety. This thick walled and cannon studded castle is the very definition of 'forbidding.'"
msgstr "雷格那人一向是直来直往的，这座外墙上装满了大炮的城堡就很明显的是“禁止”两个字的具体化。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:76
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:211
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "From a distance, this moss covered and crumbling stronghold seems long abandoned. Fresh boot prints in the mud and the signal mirror tell a different story."
msgstr "从一段距离外看起来，这个满盖青苔的堡垒似乎已经被废弃很长的一段时间，但是靠近一看，那些新的脚印和讯号镜则是完全泄漏了真相。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:77
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:212
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "This strange craft seems capable of traveling both on and under the water's surface. A series of cranks operated the wheel of blades which propel it."
msgstr "这个怪异的船只似乎可以在水面上和水面下行进，一连串的拉杆和齿轮推动了后面的推进器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:78
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:213
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Brooding over the village below, the Necromancers' Guild exudes an atmosphere of domineering evil."
msgstr "死灵法师的公会俯瞰着村庄，制造了一种君临天下的邪恶气氛。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:79
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:214
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Though renown for her beauty, Zanthora's madness drives her to live apart from the company of others. In this forbidding castle she conducts her dark experiments."
msgstr "虽然以美丽而知名，但死灵法师冉索拉的疯狂使她远离众人。她就在这座禁忌的城堡里进行着她的黑暗实验。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:80
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:81
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:215
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "All buildings in the Plane of Air float. So why does this cloud castle seem particularly incongruous? Perhaps because its great size?"
msgstr "风元素界的所有建筑都会漂浮，但为什么这个云雾城堡看起来似乎特别违和？也许是因为它庞大的体积？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:82
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:216
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Tribute Tomb"
msgstr "献祭墓穴"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:83
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:217
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Not a stick of wood or other combustibles are visible in the walls and towers of this mighty keep of stone and iron."
msgstr "这座由铁和岩石所构成的庞大堡垒附近没有任何的树木。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:84
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:218
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "If there were any doubts of the Fire Elementals' hostile intentions towards Jadame, they are allayed by the presence of this rallying camp. "
msgstr "如果有任何人还在怀疑火元素对贾丹姆大陆是否真的存在攻击倾向，那么这些罗列的营帐可以让他们消除疑虑。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:85
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:219
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The Destroyer reigns from a macabre palace. What kind of being would choose to live inside the skull of a 400 foot tall giant?"
msgstr "毁灭者在一个恐怖的宫殿里统治着他的世界。什么样的人会选择住在400英尺高的巨人的头骨里面？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:86
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:220
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The magic power of earth whirls around this cocoon-like encasement of earth and rock. A cry of torment like a dying wind issues from within."
msgstr "土元素的力量如同暴风一样环绕着这个岩石所构成的建筑。里面不时传来如同最后一口气般的凄惨嘶嚎。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:57
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:221
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Though the view is obscured by shimmering waves of heated air, through the gateway you perceive a hellish landscape of endless bridgeways spanning an ocean of lava."
msgstr "虽然这里的景观被不停蒸腾上升的热气给阻挡了，但是你依旧可以看的出来这是一个浮在高热岩浆上的世界。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:59
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:222
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The gateway leads to an earthen tunnel which extends a few paces then tees off left and right. You can't say where the passages lead."
msgstr "这个传送门通往一个隧道，就在不远之处它就同时往两边转向，从这里完全看不出它们通向哪里。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:54
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:223
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "You see no solid ground in the airy realm through this gateway. In the hazy distance you can see oddly shaped buildings that seem to float in the sky."
msgstr "从这个传送门看过去，你看不见风元素界中有任何坚固的地方。在遥远的天际，似乎可以看见一个怪异形状的建筑飘浮在云端。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:55
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:224
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Looking through the gateway is like peering through a window into an underwater canyon. Creatures of all sizes swim menacingly in the distance."
msgstr "从这个传送门往外看，仿佛在看一座水底的峡谷。各种各样不同尺寸的生物就浮游在不远的地方，用咄咄逼人的眼光看着这边。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:52
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:155
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:245
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:501
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The back door to the mysterious abandoned temple built by the race which lived on Dagger Wound before the Lizardmen--it should be safe now, right?"
msgstr "在蜥蜴人来到匕伤岛之前，一个神秘种族居住于此。这里是该种族建造的神秘的废弃神庙的后门。这么长时间了，现在应该安全了吧？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:48
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:455
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "The maelstrom energies of air magic hold together an egg of cloud mist. You can hear a faint but clearly angry howling coming from the strange structure."
msgstr "风元素的能源环绕着一个由云雾所构成的蛋形建筑。你可以清楚的听见里面传来微弱的怒吼声。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:49
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:456
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Though the air temperature is quite warm, this pod of ice does not melt. The elemental power of water magic swirls about it, keeping it winter cold. "
msgstr "虽然附近的空气相当的温暖，但这个冰球并不融化。水元素的力量在旁边环绕，让它保持极度的低温。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:50
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:457
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "Forces of fire magic heat this cylinder of iron to red hot heat. The hiss of steam makes you wonder if the thing is full of boiling water."
msgstr "火元素的力量将这个圆柱加热到赤红的状态。旁边不停冒出的蒸汽让你怀疑里面是不是装有煮沸的水。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_TransTxt.txt.py:51
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/trans.txt.py:500
msgctxt "trans"
msgid "After you rescued them, the Minotaurs of Balthazar Lair built a new entrance to their city."
msgstr "在你救出了牛头人之后，巴尔萨煞的居民们又建造了一个新的入口通往它们的城市。"

#: mm8/Data/LocalizeConf.ini.py:2
msgctxt "localizeconf.ini"
msgid "Might and Magic® VIII"
msgstr "魔法门8"

