#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1714
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Mysterious woman asked you to travel in time and fulfill destinies of other heroes. Well..."
msgstr "神秘的女子请你准时出发，完成其他英雄的任务。好吧…"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1715
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Enter The Controlled Breach, find Runaway Chaos and bring it to the Uneasy Origin Matter."
msgstr "进入“可控裂缝”，找到“失控混沌”并将其带入“不稳定起源物质”。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1716
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find your friends."
msgstr "找到你的朋友。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_QuestsTxt.txt.py:1717
msgctxt "quests"
msgid "Find entrance to the main Breach structure."
msgstr "找到大裂缝中主建筑物的入口。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_SpcItemsTxtStats.txt.py:74
msgctxt "spcitems"
msgid "Throws sparks into enemy."
msgstr "向敌人投掷火花"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_StdItemsTxtNames.txt.py:26
msgctxt "stditems"
msgid "of great Might"
msgstr "大力类"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:53
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "The black potion of Divine Boost temporarily increases all your Seven Statistics. To mix this potion, you require the correct combination of eleven reagents: of which there are always three blue and three yellow ones. The remaining five differ in the many possible mixes that lead to obtaining this potion."
msgstr "黑色的神圣提升药剂可暂时增加角色的所有七属性。想配置这种药剂，你需要正确地混合11个试剂：3个蓝色和3个黄色试剂，剩下的5个试剂则有许多种可能的配方。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:54
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "The black potion of Divine Protection combines the effects of the white resistance boosting potions, temporarily increasing all your resistances. To mix this potion, you require the correct combination of twelve reagents: of which there are always three red and three yellow ones. The remaining six differ in the many possible mixes that lead to obtaining this potion."
msgstr "黑色的神圣保护药剂综合了所有白色防御抗性药剂的效果，即暂时增加角色的所有抗性。想配置这种药剂，你需要正确地混合12个试剂：3个红色和3个黄色试剂，剩下的6个试剂则有许多种可能的配方。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:55
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "The black potion of Divine Transcendence temporarily increases a character’s level. To mix this potion, you require the correct combination of ten reagents: three of each color plus an additional one of a random color."
msgstr "黑色的神圣超越药剂可暂时增加角色的等级。想配置这种药剂，你需要正确地混合10个试剂：每种颜色的试剂各3个，外加任意一种颜色的试剂。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:56
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Essence of Luck increases a character’s Luck by 15, while subtracting 2 from the other statistics. This potion requires six reagents to mix, four of any one color supplemented by one from each of the remaining colors."
msgstr "运气精髓药剂一次性增加15点角色的运气，其他六项属性各减2点。这种药剂需要至少6个试剂作为配方，这包括任意某种颜色的试剂4个，外加另两种颜色的试剂各一个。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:57
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "The magnificent Potion of the Gods increases all seven statistics of a character by 20, once. There are many ways to mix this potion, but all involve ten reagents: four of one type and three of the other two types."
msgstr "强大的众神药剂可令角色的所有七属性一次性各增加20点。有很多种方法可以配置这种药剂，但都需要10个试剂做配方：4个一种颜色的和3个另外两种颜色的试剂。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:58
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "The Potion of Doom increases a character’s Seven Statistics, Life, Spell Points, Armor Class and Resistances by 1 at the cost of magically aging them 5 years. This potion can be mixed in more than one way, but always requires eight reagents: two of one type and three of the other two types."
msgstr "末日药剂可增加1点角色的所有七属性、生命值、魔法值、防御等级和抗性，年龄增加5岁。有不止一方法可以配置这种药剂，但都需要8个试剂做配方：2个一种颜色的和3个另外两种颜色的试剂。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:59
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Pure Fire Resistance increases your character’s Fire Resistance by 40, once. It is among the most complicated potions to brew, requiring nothing short of twelve reagents. More than one way to brew this potion exists, but each one involves at least three red, four yellow and two blue reagents."
msgstr "永恒御火药剂一次性增加40点角色的火系抗性。这是最难配置的药剂之一，需要12个试剂作为配方。有不止一种方法配置该药剂，但是每种方法都至少需要3个红色、4个黄色和2个蓝色试剂。"

