#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:648
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:466
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This flawless horseshoe is made of silver. To use, pick the horseshoe up and right-click over a character's portrait."
msgstr "这块马蹄铁由银制成，尽善尽美。使用时请拿起马蹄铁，然后右键单击角色小头像，或左键单击全身像。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:807
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A high quality longsword, monogrammed initials near the base of the pommel indicate it was forged by master weaponsmith Mekorig the Blind circa 780-800."
msgstr "这是一把高质量的长剑，剑柄底部附近的字母缩写表明它是由武器名匠盲师麦克林大约在780至800年间锻造的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:814
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Master Broadsword"
msgstr "大师阔剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:817
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Exquisite Cutlass"
msgstr "精致短刀"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:818
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Improvised Dagger"
msgstr "简易匕首"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:822
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wonder Dagger"
msgstr "神奇匕首"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:823
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Shoddy Long Dagger"
msgstr "劣质长匕首"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:824
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This long dagger is outwardly reminescent of the smaller Erathian daggers made using shark teeth, but its edge is unmistakably steel. The construction is sturdy and reliable and the blade is every bit as deadly as the shark tooth -- except it holds an edge better and is easier to resharpen."
msgstr "这把长匕首外形让人联想起埃拉西亚人用鲨鱼牙齿制成的小型匕首，但它的刀刃分明是钢制的。整体构造坚固可靠，杀伤力丝毫不逊于鲨鱼牙齿——只是它更加锋利耐用，也更容易打磨。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:852
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This is as much a crossbow as it is a work of art -- a sculpture of a dark figure with curved horns for bowstaves. It would be less surprising if it were indeed just a decoration, but it has all the mechanical parts it needs, cleverly worked into the wooden frame. Its origins are unknown, though it is safe to assume it's a product of dark sorcery, and its performance matches its appearance."
msgstr "这把弩既是武器，也是艺术品——雕刻着一个黑暗身影，弯曲的兽角充作弓臂。若它只是一件摆设倒也不足为奇，但它其实具备所需的全部机关部件，巧妙地嵌入木制的弩身之中。它的来历不明，不过可以肯定与黑暗巫术脱不了干系，其性能也与外表相称。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:858
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Makeshift Hammer"
msgstr "简易锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:859
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Battle Hammer"
msgstr "战锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:859
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This relatively simple hammer's greatest advantages are its low striking area due to the size of the head, and the spike on the reverse which could be used to inflict rather nasty wounds."
msgstr "这把构造相对简单的锤子，最大的优点在于锤头较小、打击面窄，背面还带有一根尖刺，能够造成相当可怕的创伤。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:861
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Primitive Club"
msgstr "原始粗头棍"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:862
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Thorned Club"
msgstr "荆棘粗头棍"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:862
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This small club has been fitted with sharp, thorn-like spikes that somewhat make up for its compact size."
msgstr "这根小棍上装有锋利的荆棘状尖刺，多少弥补了它体型短小的不足。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:863
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Steel Club"
msgstr "钢制粗头棍"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:867
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:66
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A weapon of awesome power, almost certainly created during the Time of Wonders."
msgstr "它是在奇迹时代制造的具有强大威力的兵器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:872
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Light Dragon Leather"
msgstr "轻质龙皮甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:887
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crude Buckler"
msgstr "简陋小圆盾"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:888
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Bronze shields are lighter than iron shields of the same size, but aren't nearly as strong. This particular one is of a slightly larger variety and has been reasonably well protected from rusting."
msgstr "青铜盾牌比同等尺寸的铁盾轻，但坚固程度远远不及。这一面属于稍大的型号，防锈处理也做得还算到位。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:894
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elven Helm"
msgstr "精灵头盔"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:901
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A fine, if somewhat ostentatious crown made with gold leaf and large, high quality amethysts.  It suits nobles of your station well."
msgstr "镶嵌了金条和紫水晶的漂亮头冠，在年轻人中非常流行。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:902
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Royal Crown"
msgstr "皇室之冠"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:902
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crowns such as this are what you might find adorning the heads of genuine royalty. Not only do they look elegant without being gaudy, but they're perfectly suited to taking the strongest of enchantments."
msgstr "这类头冠正是真正的王室成员才会佩戴的那种。它优雅而不流于俗艳，还非常适合承载最强大的附魔。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:907
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Gaudy to an extreme, this belt is made of solid 14-karat gold.  Each link has a different, low quality image stamped on its face.  Tasteless, but valuable."
msgstr "这条腰带俗艳至极，由纯14K黄金打造而成。每一节链环上都印有不同的粗劣图案。虽然毫无品味，却颇有价值。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:908
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Fine Leather Cloak"
msgstr "精制皮革披风"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:910
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Woven from plant fibers found in the Tularean Forest, these cloaks are the traditional garb of the Elven Rangers. This black variety is reserved for higher ranking Rangers and symbolizes their status as leaders."
msgstr "由取自图拉利昂森林中的植物纤维制成，是精灵族巡逻队的传统装束。这种黑色款式专供高阶巡逻队员穿着，象征着他们的领袖地位。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:913
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Pinched Gauntlets"
msgstr "紧口手套"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:916
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragon hide -- as can be expected -- makes for an outstanding material for gauntlets, offering hand protection surpassing many simpler iron or steel designs. The only downside is that the leather is thick and rigid, somewhat limiting the dexterity of movements."
msgstr "不出所料，龙皮是制作手套的绝佳材料，其护手效果胜过许多普通的铁制或钢制款式。唯一的缺点是皮革厚重僵硬，多少会限制动作的灵活度。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:928
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This complex and gaudy arrangement of amethysts on platinum can be appealing, if you like that sort of thing."
msgstr "镶有紫水晶的指环，非常精致。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:953
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Warlock's Wand of Blasting"
msgstr "邪术师爆破之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:954
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Warlock's Wand of The Fist"
msgstr "邪术师猛拳之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:955
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Warlock's Wand of Rocks"
msgstr "邪术师岩石之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:956
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Warlock's Wand of Paralyzing"
msgstr "邪术师麻痹之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:957
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Warlock's Wand of Clouds"
msgstr "邪术师云雾之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:989
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An Antagarichan mountain crystal. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一块恩塔格瑞山地水晶。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法属性，卖掉也无妨。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:990
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An Antagarichan small topaz. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗恩塔格瑞小型黄宝石。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法属性，卖掉也无妨。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:991
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An Antagarichan large emerald. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗恩塔格瑞大型绿宝石。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法属性，卖掉也无妨。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:992
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An Antagarichan sapphire in a flat round brilliant cut.  As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗切割成扁平圆形明亮式的恩塔格瑞蓝宝石。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法属性，卖掉也无妨。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:993
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An Antagarichan green garnet in a unique flat square step cut. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗切割成独特扁平方形阶梯式的恩塔格瑞绿色石榴石。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法属性，卖掉也无妨。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:994
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An Antagarichan gemstone with a subtle rose hue. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗带有淡淡玫瑰色泽的恩塔格瑞宝石。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法属性，卖掉也无妨。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:995
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An Antagarichan diamond with a small flaw, polished to a spheroidal shape. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗带有细小瑕疵、打磨成椭球形的恩塔格瑞钻石。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法属性，卖掉也无妨。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:996
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An Antagarichan amethyst in an appealing round briliant shape. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗切割成迷人圆形明亮式的恩塔格瑞紫水晶。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法属性，卖掉也无妨。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:997
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An Antagarichan topaz, step cut and set in a bronze frame. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗阶梯式切割、镶嵌在青铜底座上的恩塔格瑞黄宝石。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法属性，卖掉也无妨。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:998
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An Antagarichan diamond, flawless and set in an intricate gold frame. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗毫无瑕疵、镶嵌在精美金座上的恩塔格瑞钻石。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法属性，卖掉也无妨。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:999
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An Antagarichan ruby in a gold frame with several smaller rubies adorning it. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗镶嵌在金座上、周围点缀着数颗小红宝石的恩塔格瑞红宝石。作为宝石级原石，它没有魔法属性，卖掉也无妨。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1184
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1284
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Summon Elemental"
msgstr "元素召唤"

