#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1373
msgctxt "items"
msgid "For testing… remove before final release."
msgstr "用于测试……最终发布前请删除。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1575
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Catalyst potion"
msgstr "催化剂药剂"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1607
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Conqueror Sword"
msgstr "征服者之剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1609
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Claymore"
msgstr "大剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1610
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Barbarian Flamberge"
msgstr "野蛮焰剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1611
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Vanquisher Sword"
msgstr "制胜者之剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1612
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Fine Broadsword"
msgstr "精制宽刃剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1613
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Massive Steel Broadsword"
msgstr "巨型钢刃剑"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1613
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A larger variety of the Erathian steel broadsword, not a bit inferior in quality to its smaller counterpart. The increased size requires more strength to wield, but it's guaranteed to leave a mark."
msgstr "这是埃拉西亚钢刃剑的加大版本，品质丝毫不逊于较小的那款。尺寸的增加需要更大的力量才能挥舞，但保证能让敌人印象深刻。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1617
msgctxt "items"
msgid "These splendid cutlasses were created in limited numbers by Alec Teling, master armorer to Hareck IX, and were issued only to admirals of Regnan fleets as a symbol of station. You are not likely to set your eyes upon a finer cutlass in your lifetime."
msgstr "这些精美绝伦的短刀由海里克九世的御用军械师阿莱克·特林打造，数量稀少，只授予雷格那舰队的海军上将，作为身份的象征。你终生都难以再见到比这更精良的短刀了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1623
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Fine Long Dagger"
msgstr "精制长匕首"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1627
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Barbarian Axe"
msgstr "野蛮之斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1627
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Made as a weapon of war instead of a tool, this  battle axe is usually employed by barbarians and undisciplined armies."
msgstr "是战斗中使用的战斧。野人和散兵游勇经常使用此类兵器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1629
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dwarven Noble Axe"
msgstr "矮人贵族之斧"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1632
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A stronger version of the basic Poleaxe, this weapon is frequently used by city guards and other fighters who don't expect to do battle in large, coordinated groups (like armies)."
msgstr "造型精美的长柄战斧。通常由一些城镇卫兵和小股作战部队使用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1638
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This spear bears characteristics of equipment from the Time of Wonders - beautiful, in perfect condition and lethal. This model was already produced centuries before the Silence and remained in production almost towards the end of the Heavenly Forges, in that period serving ceremonial and representative purposes. Later combat models are the only mass-produced spears that surpass these in any capacity (+1D9 if used two-handed)."
msgstr "这支长矛具有奇迹时代兵器的特征——精美、完好无损且极具杀伤力。这一款式早在寂静时代之前数百年就已开始制造，并一直生产到天堂铸造厂快要停产之时，在那段时期主要用于礼仪和代表身份的场合。此后只有大批量生产的战斗型长矛，才能在各方面胜过它（双手使用时+1D9）。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1641
msgctxt "items"
msgid "That this magnificent halberd is a product of the Mekorig Foundry comes as no surprise to you. From the intricate shape of the head to the sturdiness of the construction -- everything about this weapon screams quality (+1D6 if used two-handed)."
msgstr "这把精美的戟出自麦克林铸造厂，这一点你丝毫不感到意外。从戟头精巧的造型到整体构造的坚固程度——这件武器处处都彰显着上乘的品质（双手使用时+1D6）。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1651
msgctxt "items"
msgid "These crossbows feature a section of curved wood next to the bowstaves, which helps prevent recoil, increasing their accuracy. It comes at the cost of a greater weight than that of lighter crossbows."
msgstr "这些十字弓在弓臂旁装有一段弯曲的木质构件，有助于减少后坐力，从而提高精准度。但代价是比轻型十字弓更重。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1658
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Massive Hammer"
msgstr "大锤"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1661
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Root Club"
msgstr "树根粗头棍"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1670
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Reinforced Leather"
msgstr "强化皮甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1671
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A subtly enchanted suit of armor that is much stronger than its weight would suggest. Shoulder and waist pads offer added protection with no cost to freedom of movement."
msgstr "这套盔甲经过精妙的附魔处理，防护力远超其重量所暗示的程度。肩部和腰部的护垫在不影响行动自如的前提下提供了额外的防护。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1672
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Standard issue leather armor for officers in the Regnan Navy.  All such leather armor receives enchantments to strengthen and lighten it during its creation in the Regnan Armories. This particular suit is a somewhat heavier than usual variation with a bit more body coverage."
msgstr "雷格那海军军官的制式皮甲。此类皮甲在雷格那军械库制造时都会被施以魔法以增强强度并减轻重量。这一套是比常见款略重一些的变体，防护覆盖的部位也更多一些。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1674
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Chain mail is an armor formed of small, interlocking loops of metal.  This suit is low quality:  the metal used is plain iron, there are only two layers of rings, and it is heavy and stiff for its size. Despite beginning to corrode, it has so far remained intact."
msgstr "锁甲是由许多细小的金属圆环相互套接而成的盔甲。这套锁甲品质低劣：所用的金属是普通的铁，只有两层圆环，而且以其尺寸而言显得又重又硬。尽管已经开始锈蚀，但至今仍保持完整。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1675
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Basic Steel Chain Mail"
msgstr "基础钢锁甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1675
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A superior suit of chain mail, the metal used in this suit is steel, and the former owner was careful to keep the suit well oiled and free of rust. Its coverage of areas below the waist could have been better, though."
msgstr "一套上乘的锁甲，所用的金属是钢，前任主人一直细心地为其上油保养，使其免于生锈。不过，它对腰部以下部位的防护本可以做得更好。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1678
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A model of armor from before the Silence -- one could see it worn by the Governor and his closest associates as a badge of office. The formula for creating these suits is quite old, in fact it was adjusted not long before the Forges broke down. As such, this chain mail is superior to most other such armors in the world today -- though still surpassed by suits created in the years just before the Silence."
msgstr "这是寂静时代之前的一种铠甲款式——总督和他最亲近的随从都曾将其穿在身上，作为职位的象征。制作这类铠甲的配方相当古老，事实上，它是在铸造厂衰败前不久才被改良的。因此，这套锁甲远胜于当今世上大多数同类盔甲——不过仍不及寂静时代前夕制造的那些锁甲。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1679
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Plate Mail"
msgstr "板甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1680
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Steel Plate Mail"
msgstr "钢板甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1681
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Golden Plate Mail"
msgstr "黄金板甲"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1686
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This round shield is a design of the long gone Phynaxian empire that once ruled southern Erathia. Forged of stalt, it is extremely sturdy and susceptible to enchantments. It's so well-made that its only downside seems to be its rather compact size for a large shield, which somewhat limits its coverage."
msgstr "这面圆盾出自古老的菲尼克斯帝国，该帝国曾统治埃拉西亚南部，但早已消逝。它由斯多克锻造而成，异常坚固，且极易附魔。做工如此精良，唯一的缺点似乎是作为大盾而言体积略显紧凑，防护范围因此受到一定限制。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1687
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Splintery Buckler"
msgstr "木刺小圆盾"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1687
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A small wooden shield designed to protect mostly against arrows. The wood it is made of was never properly planed, making its surface full of splinters and chips. Its remaining lifetime in combat is likely much shorter than you'd like."
msgstr "一面主要用于防御箭矢的小型木盾。制作它的木材从未经过恰当的刨光处理，表面布满了木刺和裂片。它能在战斗中支撑的时间恐怕比你希望的要短得多。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1688
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Rusty Bronze Shield"
msgstr "生锈青铜盾牌"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1692
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wooden Helm"
msgstr "木制头盔"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1694
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This helm design has been used by the Elves of Erathia since before the Silence. Its wing ornaments belie superior strength and add a sense of distinction for the Elven leaders who got to go into battle wearing these helms."
msgstr "这种头盔款式自寂静时代之前起便被埃拉西亚的精灵族所使用。其翼形装饰之下暗藏着非凡的强度，也为身披此盔出征的精灵族首领增添了几分与众不同的气度。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1698
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dandy Hat"
msgstr "纨绔之帽"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1700
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wreath Crown"
msgstr "桂冠"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1703
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crude Leather Belt"
msgstr "粗制皮带"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1718
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Old Leather Boots"
msgstr "旧皮靴"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1718
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Common traveler's boots made with leather and hobnailed. Their previous owner didn't maintain them very well, and the leather appears discolored and warped in places."
msgstr "普通的旅行皮靴，钉有防滑鞋钉。前任主人保养不善，皮革多处已经变色并出现翘曲。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1738
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sparkling Wand of Fire"
msgstr "闪耀烈火之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1739
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sparkling Wand of Sparks"
msgstr "闪耀火光之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1740
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sparkling Wand of Poison"
msgstr "闪耀毒药之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1741
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sparkling Wand of Stunning"
msgstr "闪耀眩晕之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1742
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sparkling Wand of Harming"
msgstr "闪耀伤害之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1743
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Druid Wand of Light"
msgstr "德鲁伊光明之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1744
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Druid Wand of Ice"
msgstr "德鲁伊寒冰之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1745
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Druid Wand of Lashing"
msgstr "德鲁伊鞭笞之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1746
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Druid Wand of Mind"
msgstr "德鲁伊心灵之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1747
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Druid Wand of Swarms"
msgstr "德鲁伊蜂群之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1748
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Cruel Wand of Fireballs"
msgstr "冷酷火球之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1749
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Cruel Wand of Acid"
msgstr "冷酷强酸之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1750
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Cruel Wand of Lightning"
msgstr "冷酷闪电之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1751
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Cruel Wand of Blades"
msgstr "冷酷刀锋之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1752
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Cruel Wand of Berzerking"
msgstr "冷酷狂暴之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1758
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragon Wand of Implosion"
msgstr "龙内爆之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1759
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragon Wand of Distortion"
msgstr "龙扭曲之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1760
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragon Wand of Shrapmetal"
msgstr "龙霰弹之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1761
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragon Wand of Shrinking"
msgstr "龙缩小之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1762
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragon Wand of Incineration"
msgstr "龙焚烧之杖"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2041
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Graced with the might of thunder, Artemus fires bolts magically charged with electricity.  While powerful, the user of the bow should be careful--elemental magics seem drawn to the bow, and do more damage when they hit the wielder.  (Special Powers:  +20 Electricity damage, -10 to Elemental Resistances)"
msgstr "阿尔特弥斯蕴含雷霆之力，射出的箭矢带有魔法充能的电流。虽然此弓威力强大，但使用者需多加小心——元素魔法似乎会被此弓吸引，命中持有者时造成的伤害会更大。（特殊威力：电系伤害+20，元素抗性-10）"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2045
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This crown is a mighty relic that protects against elemental magic attacks of all kinds, but has a flaw that slows the wearer down tremendously.  (Special Powers:  +50 to Elemental Resistances and -40 Speed)"
msgstr "此头冠可以抵御各种元素魔法的攻击，但穿戴者的行动速度会大大降低。（特殊威力：四项元素抗性+50，速度-40）"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2057
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A large Enrothian diamond, flawless and brilliant. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗恩洛斯大钻石，完美无瑕，光彩夺目。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2058
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An Enrothian moonstone, appearing to glow from within. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗恩洛斯月亮石，仿佛从内部散发着光芒。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2059
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A sculpted piece of Enrothian amber. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一块雕琢过的恩洛斯琥珀。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2060
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An Enrothian ruby with a simple, efficient cut. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗切工简洁利落的恩洛斯红宝石。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2061
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An Enrothian amethyst. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗恩洛斯紫水晶。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2062
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A dark Enrothian emerald. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗深色的恩洛斯绿宝石。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2063
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A purple Enrothian topaz, valuable due to the unusual color. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗恩洛斯紫黄宝石，因其罕见的色泽而颇具价值。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2064
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A finely cut Enrothian sunstone. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗切工精细的恩洛斯太阳石。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2065
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A pale Enrothian emerald with a rare celadon hue. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗色泽浅淡、带有罕见青瓷色调的恩洛斯绿宝石。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2066
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A large Enrothian sapphire. As a gem quality stone it has no magical properties, so you might as well sell it."
msgstr "一颗恩洛斯大蓝宝石。作为一颗宝石，它没有任何魔法特性，卖掉它可能比较划得来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:2
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:124
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/scroll.txt.py:2
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SCROLL.TXT.py:42
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid " A Black Potion of Rejuvenation can be valuable in correcting the effects of aging.  To mix such a potion you need to find the correct combination of three of each of the base reagents. "
msgstr "\n黑色返老还童药剂能使人恢复青春。但是你要先得到三种基本试剂，用一定的方式才能调配出这种药剂。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:3
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/scroll.txt.py:3
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid " A Black Potion of Pure Might is any adventurer's dream.  The addition to permanent might can turn ANYONE into a fighting machine.  To mix this potion you need the correct combination of four of any red reagent type, plus two of any blue reagent type and one of the yellow reagents.  "
msgstr "黑色永恒力量药剂是任何冒险者的梦想。增加额外且永久性的力量可以让任何人变成战斗机器。要混合出这种药剂，您必须要利用四个红色药材，再加上两个蓝色药材，以及一个黄色的药材。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:4
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/scroll.txt.py:4
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid " A Black Potion of Pure Accuracy is any archer's dream.  The addition to permanent accuracy can turn ANYONE into a fighting machine.  To mix this potion you need the correct combination of four of any yellow reagent type, plus two of any red reagent type and one of the blue reagents.  "
msgstr "黑色永恒精确药剂是任何弓箭手的梦想。增加额外且永久性的精确可以让任何人变成战斗机器。要混合出这种药剂，您必须要利用四个黄色药材，外加两个红色药材，以及一个蓝色药材。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:5
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/scroll.txt.py:5
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid " The Black Potion of Pure Personality will add to a character's permanent personality. This will increase the total spell points based off Personality. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of one of any red reagent type, plus four of any blue reagent type and two of the yellow reagents.  "
msgstr "黑色永恒个性药剂将会永久性地增加你的个性，同时进而改变依据个性而变化的魔法值。要混合出这种药剂，您必须要正确地混合一个红色药材以及四个蓝色药材，还有两个黄色药材。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:6
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/scroll.txt.py:6
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid " A Black Potion of Pure Endurance is any adventurer's dream.  The addition to permanent endurance can turn ANYONE into a fighting machine, increasing their hit points far beyond normal.  To mix this potion you need the correct combination of two of any red reagent type, plus four of any blue reagent type and one of the yellow reagents.  "
msgstr "黑色永恒耐力药剂是任何冒险者的梦想。额外且永久性的耐力可以将任何人变成战斗机器，把他们的生命值提升到超越正常的地步。要混合出这种药剂，您必须要找出正确的混合比例。您需要两个红色药材，加上四个蓝色药材和一个黄色药材。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:7
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/scroll.txt.py:7
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid " The Black Potion of Pure Intellect will add to a character's permanent intellect, increasing the total spell points based off of intellect. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of one of any red reagent type, plus two of any blue reagent type and four of the yellow reagents.  "
msgstr "黑色永恒智力药剂将会永久地增加智力，并且增加那些以你的智力为依据的魔法值上限。要混合出这种药剂，您必须要正确地组合一个红色药材和两个蓝色药材和四个黄色药材。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:8
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/scroll.txt.py:8
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid " The Black Potion of Pure Speed could be the answer for a party who just doesn't get the jump on the monsters.  The addition to permanent speed could be just what is needed to allow you to recover and act before the monsters do.  You can never be too quick. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of four of any red reagent type, plus one of any blue reagent type and two of the yellow reagents.  "
msgstr "黑色永恒速度药剂是任何无法偷袭敌人的队伍所需要的终极答案。除了额外增加你的速度外，还可以加快你恢复的速度和行动的速度。没有人会嫌自己的动作太快。要混合出这种药剂，您必须要找出正确的混合比例，是四个红色药材和两个蓝色药材和一个黄色药材。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:9
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/scroll.txt.py:9
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid " The Black Potion of Pure Luck could be the answer for a party who is disarm trap skill challenged.  The addition to permanent luck could be just what is needed to allow you to duck before a trap goes off.  You can never have too much luck. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of two of any red reagent type, plus three of any blue reagent type and three of the yellow reagents."
msgstr "黑色永恒运气药剂是专门让那些陷阱拆卸术有缺陷的队伍所使用的药剂。额外的运气值可以让你在陷阱被启动之前能够成功地闪躲开来。永远没有人会嫌自己太幸运的。要混合出这种药剂，您必须要正确地混合两个红色药材和三个蓝色药材和三个黄色药材。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:10
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/scroll.txt.py:10
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid " The Black Potion of Slaying can turn any normal weapon into a weapon of dragon slaying.  To mix this potion you need the correct combination of three of any red reagent type, plus three of any blue reagent type and two of the yellow reagents."
msgstr "黑色屠龙药剂可以将任何武器转变成屠龙专用的武器。要混合出这种药剂，您必须要混合三个红色药材和三个蓝色药材和两个黄色药材。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:11
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/scroll.txt.py:11
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid " The Black Potion of Stone to Flesh allows you to remove the stoned condition on a character. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of three of any red reagent type, plus two of any blue reagent type and three of the yellow reagents."
msgstr "黑色解除石化药剂让你可以自行治疗石化。要混合出这种药剂，您必须要混合任三个红色药材和任两个蓝色药材和任三个黄色药材。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:12
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:134
