msgid " The White Potion of Divine Power is more powerful than the Magic Potion. To mix this potion you need the correct combination of three of any blue reagent type and any three of the yellow reagents."
msgstr "\n白色神圣力量药剂能使队员恢复大量的魔法值。你要先得到三种蓝色试剂、三种黄色试剂，然后用一定的方式才能调配出这种药剂。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:150
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SCROLL.TXT.py:68
