msgstr "灰色药剂——催化剂——可以相互混合，制成威力更强的药剂。对足够强力的催化剂施放天赋魔力法术，可以将其变成贤者之石。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:168
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:4
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Silvertongue,  My spies report there is a small group of would-be heroes traveling about the land trying to put an end to our little Plan for a New World.  They are reportedly seeking permission to visit the Oracle in Free Haven.  You must not permit this to happen--If the Guardian awakens before our plan has matured it will spell the end for both of us.  Deny them permission to visit the Oracle, even if it reveals you to be a traitor.  We need the time your delay will buy us.  Oh yeah...Praise Baa. \nZenofex"
msgstr "席尔瓦托恩：\n\n　　我的情报员报告说，有一伙不知天高地厚的年轻人，为了梦想成为英雄，竟要破坏我们开创新世界的伟大计划。他们目前正在为拜见自由天堂的神使而不懈地努力。你一定要阻止他们拜见神使——如果恩洛斯的守护者在我们的计划成熟之前苏醒，那我们俩都会完蛋。你在议会里一定要反对他们拜见神使，即使暴露身份也在所不惜。将他们拜见神使拖延得越晚越好，因为我们需要时间。好了，羊鸣教万岁！\n\n——诺菲克斯"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:169
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:5
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Jarvis,  We have determined that the Mayor of Mist is third on our list of enemies, below only Charles d’Sorpigal and Jennica Bradley.  We need you to DELICATELY gain jurisdiction to patrol Mist and the surrounding island, and then to deal with the Mayor accordingly.  If this goes smoothly, then remove Charles and Jennica as well.  Handle this job with great care and you will be rewarded.  Gerrard Blackames  "
msgstr "杰维斯：\n\n　　我们已经决定把浓雾镇的镇长列入我们的敌人名单，继查尔斯·德索匹格和杰尼卡·布莱德里之后排名第三号敌对人物。你必须想方设法巧妙地获得巡视浓雾岛及附近岛屿的司法权力，然后找机会干掉这老家伙。如果事情进行顺利，下面就该轮到查尔斯和杰尼卡了。活干的利索点，我们会给你报酬的。\n\n——杰拉德·布莱克墨斯"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:170
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:6
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Damian,  Congratulations on your new assignment.  The Shadow Guild wants you to ambush caravans passing from New Sorpigal to Ironfist or Free Haven.  Under no circumstances are you to divulge that you have any connection to us, or the deal is off and you will find out what happens to those who betray us.  Do as you are told and there won’t be any problems.  Prince of Thieves"
msgstr "戴米恩：\n\n　　祝贺你又有了新任务。阴影教要你伏击从新索匹格去往铁拳城堡和自由天堂的商队。在任何情况下你都不能泄露你与我们之间的关系，否则我们的交易取消，你也很快就能看到我们会如何处置叛徒。照我们说的去做，不会有问题的。\n\n——盗贼王子"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:171
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:7
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "My Dear Sulman, Sep 17, 1152\nYou have done well, and I hereby promote you to High Priest of the Second Circle.  There is a sum of gold waiting for you in the hands of Andover Potbello in New Sorpigal that he will turn over to you if you tell him the Sandman sent you and show him the Seal on this letter.  Sandman…I like that.    \nThe handling of the Roland affair was masterful, and I especially liked the snowstorm touch—it really put the Fear in him, didn’t it?  Superstitious fool!  His removal has moved our timetable ahead by at least two years and has spared us the trouble of assassinating him at a more delicate time.  All arrangements are in place. My minions have engineered the recall of Queen Catherine to her homeland in Erathia to attend the funeral of her father.  She will not return this year, and that only leaves her worthless brat Nicolai and that idiot Regent Wilbur Humphrey running things at the palace. \nThe people have begun to sense that something is wrong, that perhaps the gods are angry.  That perhaps…the Ironfists have lost the Mandate of Heaven.  Just a few more disasters and there may well be a full-scale rebellion! And we will be waiting at the breach, ready to step in and tell the sheep what to do and when to do it.  Already our temples spread across the land, offering aid to those displaced by disasters, and comfort to the bereaved...   \nYes.  Remain in New Sorpigal and stay out of sight.  When the time is right you will be contacted and given further instructions.  So take heart, and know that our plan proceeds smoothly and we will be ruling this world soon.  Your position in our hierarchy will be very high!\n--Zenofex"
msgstr "1152年9月17日\n\n亲爱的舒尔曼：\n\n　　你干得很不错，我在此提拔你为第二集团的大主教。我有一些金币要奖励你，在新索匹格镇的安多弗·波特皮洛手中。你告诉他是“沙人”派你来的，并把这封信上的印章给他看，他就会把金币给你。嗯，“沙人”……这个名字我喜欢。\n\n　　罗兰德那件事你干得真出色。我特别欣赏暴风雪恐吓这一招，把他吓个半死，这迷信的蠢货！把他除掉使我们的计划至少提前了两年时间，我们用不着费尽心思筹划着暗杀他了。一切都已经准备就绪了。\n\n　　我的手下假传消息让凯瑟琳回家乡参加她父亲的葬礼。今年她可回不来了。宫里只剩下乳臭未干的尼古拉和呆头呆脑的威尔伯·汉弗里主持大局。\n\n　　人们开始感到事情不妙，有的猜是众神发怒了，有的说是艾恩法斯特失去了“天堂之令”。说不定再制造一些灾难，人们就会大规模地起来造反了。\n\n　　在这些动乱期间，我们先等着出现裂缝，准备好介入进去，告诉绵羊什么时候要做什么。我们的庙已经遍布整个大陆，为受灾的流离失所的群众提供援助，为遇难者家属提供安慰……\n\n　　行，你先在新索匹格镇待一段时间，保持低调。到时候会有人联系你并给你进一步的指示。总之，鼓起劲来，记住我们的计划正在顺利进行当中，我们很快就会统治这个世界。那时候你的官职也会非常高的！\n\n——诺菲克斯"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:174
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:10
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Kergmond,   You lack the skill in arms, the dedication, and most importantly, the ability to command to succeed as a Knight.  Your constant failures leave me no choice but to discharge you from the Knights of Enroth.  I would suggest you find a new profession, as you will never master the arts of warfare.  Osric Temper"
msgstr "克尔德蒙德：\n\n　　你的武艺拙劣，缺乏奉献精神，更重要的是没有骑士那种领导并获得胜利的能力。你屡战屡败，我别无选择，只能将你从恩洛斯骑士团除籍。你不妨去找个新职业，战斗实在不是你的特长。\n\n——奥斯里克·坦普"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:178
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:14
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Snergle,  We have been unable to locate Rocklin anywhere.  Whatever hole he crawled into must have swallowed him.  I know you require his death to subjugate the rest of the dwarves, but we have searched all over Enroth and have not been able to locate him.  Lunstone"
msgstr "斯纳格：\n\n　　我们到处都找不到洛克林的踪迹，他准是躲进哪个洞里然后死在那儿了。我知道你需要得到他丧命的确切证据以使得整个矮人族服从你，但我们翻遍了恩洛斯的所有角落，连他的影子都没见到。\n\n——伦斯通"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:180
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Message Scroll Text. 514"
msgstr "消息卷轴文本。514"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:181
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:17
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Gerrard,  Congratulations on your new promotion.  Now, with the Fraternal Order of Silver under your control, you will have greater freedom in seeking out those not hard enough on evil in Enroth.  Eventually, we hope to assist you in removing the most lax of all in the fight against evil, the Ironfists.  Continue to do your work, and your dreams shall be realized.  Zenofex"
msgstr "杰拉德：\n\n　　祝贺你高升了。现在你完全控制了银色兄弟会，可以更容易找出那些镇压恩洛斯的邪恶势力不够得力的人了。最后，我们会帮助你清除最不得力的人，也就是艾恩法斯特家族。加油干吧，你会美梦成真的。\n\n——诺菲克斯"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:182
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:18
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Prince,  Anthony Stone has decided to remove you once and for all.  I’m sure you will be seeing his men soon.  For your safety, I’ve prepared a place in the sewers underneath Free Haven for you.  Leave the Guildhall immediately and come to the sewers.  Once the heat has cleared you will be free to return to the Guildhall.  Fetzil"
msgstr "王子：\n\n　　安东尼·斯通要把你干掉。你不久就会见到他的手下。为了你的安全，我在自由天堂下面的下水道里给你安排了一个藏身之处。快离开教派大堂藏到下水道里，等到风头过去的时候你才能出来。\n\n——费兹尔"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:183
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Message Scroll Text. 517"
msgstr "消息卷轴文本。517"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:190
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Message Scroll Text. 524"
msgstr "消息卷轴文本。524"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:192
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Message Scroll Text. 526"
msgstr "消息卷轴文本。526"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:194
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:30
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Brother, we soon will need whatever you can provide us in the way of weapons.  With Gharik gone, you have full control over the facilities of the Forge.  I need you to leverage that control into aid for us.  Soon, we will be able to strike at the heart of our enemies, and you will have a place with me as a ruler of Enroth.  Gerrard Blackames"
msgstr "　　兄弟，我们需要你在兵器方面的全力支援。加里克死后，你全权掌管了炼铁厂的一切设施。我需要你助我们一臂之力。很快我们就要对敌人的要害发动致命的一击。在我成为恩洛斯的统治者之后，你也会有一席之地的。\n\n——杰拉德·布莱克墨斯"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:196
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:32
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "…remember that our goal is to become the sole druidic order in Enroth.  Nothing can stand in our path as we attempt to cleanse our ranks and remove all opposition.  To this end we will use both the Monolith and what we can find in this old Temple of the Moon to undermine the power of Loretta and her druids everywhere.  We must endure our hardships to grow stronger.  Cedric Druthers"
msgstr "　　记住我们的的目标是成为恩洛斯仅有的德鲁伊教派。任何困难都不能动摇我们净化教派、铲除异端的决心。为实现这个目标，我们必须利用独立碑，以及月亮神庙中发现的一切，来削弱劳里达和她的德鲁伊的力量。为了将来的一统天下，我们必须卧薪尝胆。\n\n——塞德里克·德鲁泽"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:197
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:33
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Congratulations on successfully completing your transformation.  I hope you are doing well.  Even if you aren’t, I need the Memory Crystal researched and its information revealed.  I have no more time for delays or failures, and I expect you to meet with success where the others have failed.  I know you have a fetish for Crystals, and I expect that you will use your experience with them to finish this job quickly.  When you have the information, bring it to me at Castle Ironfist.  Perhaps we can use what you find to access the rest of the Crystals.  Archibald"
msgstr "　　祝贺你成功完成转化仪式。希望你一切顺利，不过就算不顺利，也要帮助我研究记忆水晶并揭示其中隐含的信息。我已经没有时间再忍受一次又一次的拖延和失败了，但哪怕别人都失败了，我也期待着你的成功。我知道你对水晶十分迷恋，我希望你能利用你对水晶的经验尽快完成这项工作。你破解了记忆水晶的信息后，立即将它带到铁拳城堡。或许我们可以用你的发现来破解其他的记忆水晶。\n\n——阿基巴德"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:200
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:36
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Desist your current experiments into creature evolution and construction.  I need your efforts directed into learning the purpose of and the information contained in this Crystal.  The Oracle apparently uses these for some purpose, and I need you to determine exactly what that is.  This task is more important than creating flightless birds and bull-men or whatever it is you are doing now.  Archibald"
msgstr "　　停止你关于生物进化和构造的一切实验。我要你尽全力参透这块水晶的作用和其中隐含的秘密。神使把水晶用于某些用途，我要你查清到底是什么。这项任务比你制造些不会飞的鸟、牛人什么的废物重要多了。\n\n——阿基巴德"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:201
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:37
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Please use your knowledge of arcane items and materials to divest this Crystal of the information it contains.  Use the full resources of Alamos if you have to, but do not fail me.  It is imperative that I know whatever information it is the Oracle is attempting to deny me.  Archibald"
msgstr "　　请凭借你对神秘事物的渊博知识查出这块水晶所包含的信息。你可以随意使用阿拉莫斯的任何资源，千万不要让我失望。我必须知道水晶里隐藏着的、神使不愿告诉我的秘密。\n\n——阿基巴德"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:202
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:38
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "East:  Shadow Guildhall West:  Shadow Guild Hideout North:  Free Haven Thieves’ Guild South:  Dragoons’ Caverns"
msgstr "东面：阴影教派大堂\n西面：阴影教隐蔽所\n北面：自由天堂的盗贼行会\n南面：龙骑兵岩洞"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:209
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:45
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "Here is the key to the combination door you requested.\n\nA.  Trap.\nB.  Opens door 4 and closes door 5.\nC.  Opens door 5 and closes door 4.\nD.  Opens door 1 and closes door 5.\nE.  Opens door 5 and closes door 1.\nF.  Opens door 2 and closes door 4.\nG.  Opens door 6.\nH.  Opens door 3 and closes door 2.\nI.    Opens door 2 and closes door 3.\nJ.   Opens door 2 and closes door 1.\nK.  Opens door 6 and closes door 5.\nL.   Opens door 3 and closes door 4.\nM.  Maintenance.\nN.  Opens door 1 and closes door 2.\nO.  Opens door 5 and closes door 6.\nP.  Reset.  \n\nSincerely, the Drawkcab Monks."
msgstr "\n以下是你上次向我索要的组合门的密码：\n\n　A. 陷阱。\n　B. 打开门4，关上门5。\n　C. 打开门5，关上门4。\n　D. 打开门1，关上门5。\n　E. 打开门5，关上门1。\n　F. 打开门2，关上门4。\n　G. 打开门6。\n　H. 打开门3，关上门2。\n　I. 打开门2，关上门3。\n　J. 打开门2，关上门1。\n　K. 打开门6，关上门5。\n　L. 打开门3，关上门4。\n　M. 维护。\n　N. 打开门1，关上门2。\n　O. 打开门5，关上门6。\n　P. 重置。\n\n祝好。\n\n——乔卡布僧侣"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:211
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/Scroll.txt.py:47
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "I have hidden this letter here hoping it will be found by someone loyal to the Crown.  That I am even able to write it is a miracle--my captors were too stupid to take my writing materials--and I need many more miracles to survive this predicament.  All of my men were lost in the battle against the devils, leaving only Tanir, Ragnar, and myself alive.  Lord Ragnar is in a bad way, and I fear he will not survive the night.  Better for him, perhaps.  Since we have not yet been killed, I'm guessing we are being saved for something special.  Whatever it is, as long as there is life, there is hope.  They will probably carry Tanir and I from this awful place to another awful place to ransom us or torture us for information.  Whatever our fate, you, my loyal subject, must work to ensure the survival of the kingdom and our world.  These devils are a threat much worse than Archibald ever was, and will require the most desperate measures to defeat.  Take those measures, even if it means releasing my evil brother from his tomb of stone.  Above all, seek the advice of the Oracle in Free Haven.  I hear my captors coming down the hall!  Tell my wife and son I love them, and DON'T TRUST SULMAN! He is a traitor.  Good Luck!  --Roland Ironfist, King of Enroth   "
msgstr "　　我把这封信隐藏在这里，期待有个对王国忠心耿耿的英雄能发现它。我能留下此信真是个奇迹——抓我的人竟如此愚蠢，没有搜去我的纸和笔——不过我可能需要更多奇迹以生存下去。我的所有部队都在战斗中为国捐躯，现在我身边只剩下坦耐尔和里格纳两人。里格纳爵士生命危在旦夕，恐怕熬不过今天晚上，这或许对他来说是种解脱。\n\n　　肯定有某种特殊原因使得他们到现在还没有对我们下毒手。不论是什么原因，只要活着，就还有希望。他们大概会把坦耐尔和我从这个糟糕的地方转移到另一个糟糕的地方，然后勒索我们，或者严刑拷打，试图从我们嘴里挖出点消息。无论我们会怎么样，我忠实的朋友，请你尽全力拯救我们的王国和世界。这些恶魔对我们的威胁，比阿基巴德要可怕得多，必须竭尽一切来对付他们。必要的话，把我那邪恶的弟弟从他的石墓中释放出来也在所不惜。记住，先去自由天堂向神使征求意见。\n\n　　抓我的人来了！告诉我的妻子和儿子，我爱他们，千万别信舒尔曼，他是叛徒！祝你们好运！\n\n——恩洛斯国王 罗兰德·艾恩法斯特"

