#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:141
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:142
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:141
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:142
