#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:364
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:364
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Advancing your skills to the level of Expert with your natural Dark Elf Ability grants you the use of the Travelers' Boon spell. This spell combines the effects of the spells Wizard Eye, Torch Light and Feather Fall.\nTo achieve an Expert Skill level your normal Skill level must be 4 and you must pay me 1000 gold."
msgstr "如果你的黑暗精灵能力晋升到专家级，你就可以使用“宝囊”能力，拥有光明之火、魔力神眼、凌空飞降的效果。要达到专家级，你必须拥有该技能，技能等级达到4级，并且支付1000金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:365
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:365
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mastery of your natural Dark Elf ability would make you that much stronger!\nWith Mastery you gain the ability to Blind your opponents during battle.\nTo reach the Skill level of Master you must have and Expert Skill level of 7 and pay me 4000 gold."
msgstr "如果你能够成为黑暗精灵能力的大师，你将会变得更强。在战斗中，你将可以施展盲目能力。要获得大师级的黑暗精灵能力，你必须已经是该技能的专家，技能等级达到7级，并且付我4000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:366
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:366
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You seek the skill of a Grand Master Dark Elf?\nNot many gain this title.\nGrand Mastery bestows the power of the spell Darkfire. This is a truly devastating magical attack!\nYou will need to prove you hold a Master skill level of 10 and pay a small fee of 8000 gold.\nOnce these requirements are met, Grand Mastery is yours!"
msgstr "你想要成为黑暗精灵能力的宗师？并没有太多人获得过这个称号。宗师级的黑暗精灵能力将让你可以发射暗火这种攻击力强大的能力。你必须已经是该技能的大师，技能等级达到10级，并且愿意付我8000个金币，就可以拥有宗师级的黑暗精灵能力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:367
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:367
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Advancing your skills to the level of Expert with your natural Vampire Ability grants you the use of the Levitate spell.\nTo achieve an Expert skill level your normal skill level must be 4 and you must pay me 1000 gold."
msgstr "吸血鬼能力增进到专家级后，你就可以获得使用飘浮的能力。要达到专家级，你必须拥有该技能，技能等级达到4级，并且付我1000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:368
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:368
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mastery of your natural Vampire ability would make you that much stronger!\nWith Mastery you gain the ability to Charm your opponents during battle.\nTo reach the skill level of Master you must have an Expert skill level of 7 and pay me 4000 gold."
msgstr "如果你能够成为吸血鬼能力的大师，你将会变得更强。在战斗中，你将可以施展魅惑能力。要获得大师级的吸血鬼能力，你必须已经是该技能的专家，技能等级达到7级，并且付我4000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:369
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:369
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You seek the skill of a Grand Master Vampire?\nNot many gain this title.\nGrand Mastery bestows the power of Mistform, which makes you immune to all physical attacks!\nOf course you will only be able to attack with spells in this form, but is well worth it!\nYou will need to prove a Master Skill level of 10 to me and pay a small fee of 8000 old.\nOnce these requirements are met, Grand Mastery is yours!"
msgstr "你想要成为吸血鬼能力的宗师？并没有太多人获得过这个称号。宗师级的吸血鬼能力将让你可以雾化，免疫任何物理攻击！虽然在雾化的时候只能用魔法攻击敌人，但还是很值得的。只要你达到了该技能的大师，技能等级达到10级，并且愿意付我8000个金币，你就可以拥有宗师级的吸血鬼能力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:370
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:370
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Advancing your skills to the level of Expert with your natural Dragon Ability grants you the use of the Flame Blast spell. This spell increases the power of your already might breath weapon.\nTo achieve an Expert skill level your normal skill level must be 4 and you must pay me 1000 gold."
msgstr "如果你想要让自己的飞龙能力增进到专家级，你就可以获得使用焰爆的能力，这个能力可以增进你已经十分强大的喷吐武器的威力。要达到专家级的技能等级，你必须拥有该技能，技能等级达到4级，并且付我1000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:371
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:371
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mastery of your natural Dragon Ability would make you that much stronger!\nWith Mastery you gain the ability of Flight, allowing you to carry your entire party!\nTo reach the skill level of Master you must have an Expert Skill level of 7 and pay me 4000 gold."
msgstr "如果你能够成为飞龙能力的大师，你将会变得更强。在飞行中，你将可以载运整个队伍！要获得大师级的飞龙能力，你必须已经是该技能的专家，技能等级达到7级，并且付我4000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:372
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:372
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You seek the skill of a Grand Master Dragon?\nNot many gain this title.\nGrand Mastery bestows the power of the Wing Buffet attack!\nThis attack pushes your opponents back, allowing you to unleash the full power of your Flame Blast!\nYou will need to prove a Master Skill level of 10 to me and pay a small fee of 8000 gold.\nOnce these requirements are met, Grand Mastery is yours!"
msgstr "你想要成为飞龙能力的宗师？并没有太多人获得过这个称号。宗师级的飞龙能力将让你可以使用翼击的能力，这个能力可以让你将敌人推开，以便展现你焰爆最强大的威力。只要你是该技能的大师，技能等级达到10级，并且愿意支付8000个金币，你就可以拥有宗师级的飞龙能力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:373
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1338
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:373
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:433
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ever sold an item that turned out to be better than your existing equipment?\nNothing worse than having a merchant snicker at you for not knowing what you're selling. With Expert Identify Item you can attempt to identify weapons and armor to prevent this embarrassment. If your skill level is 4 and you pay 500 gold, I will teach you."
msgstr "如今这世道奸商多得是。你们买卖东西要是连自己的东西值多少钱都不知道，非得吃大亏不可。要不再受骗上当，你们必须学习专家级物品鉴定术。你们只要物品鉴定术达到4级并付我500个金币，我可以传授你们专家级物品鉴定术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:374
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:374
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wands, scrolls, rings and potions can be important items, and not knowing what they are is just foolishness.\nWith Mastery of the Identify Items skill you can attempt to identify weapons, armor, and other miscellaneous items.\nFor a small fee of 2500 gold and demonstration of an Expert Skill level of 7, I can teach you Mastery of the Identify Items skill."
msgstr "魔杖、卷轴、戒指和药剂可能是非常重要的东西，但是，不明白他们是什么样的东西就太过愚蠢了。只要你拥有了物品鉴定大师级的技能，你可以尝试着鉴定武器、盔甲和其他的物品。只要你已经是该技能的专家，技能等级达到7级，并付我2500个金币，我就可以教导你大师级的物品鉴定术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:375
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:375
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Found and ancient item or relic and don’t know what it does or what its for?\nIgnorance, in this case, is not bliss. In fact, it could very well kill. With Grand Mastery of the Identify Item skill you can attempt to identify anything you have found including artifacts and relics.\nA Master skill level of 10 and 6000 gold is all that is required to learn this skill."
msgstr "找到了古代的宝物，却不知道它的功能吗？在这种情况下，无知并非是福气，搞不好还可能让你送掉小命。当你拥有了宗师级的物品鉴定术时，你将可以鉴定出你所找到的任何物品，包括了古物和神器。只要你拥有大师级的物品鉴定术，技能等级不低于10级，再支付6000个金币，就可以学到如何成为物品鉴定术的宗师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:376
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:376
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Shop owners are a greedy lot.\nWant to get better prices for what you buy and sell?\nThen you better have the Merchant skill and fast. I can teach you the Expert level Merchant skill if you have a skill level of 4 and pay 2000 gold.\nExpertise doubles your bonus towards prices."
msgstr "商店的主人都很贪心。你想要在买东西和卖东西的时候获得更好的价钱吗？那么你最好赶快学习经商的技能。我可以让你成为经商术的专家，只要你拥有这项技能且已达到4级，并且付我2000个金币就可以学到我的知识。专家级的技能可以让你在决定价格的时候拥有两倍以上的优势。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:377
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:377
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Shop owners are a greedy lot.\nWant to get better prices for what you buy and sell?\nThen you better have the Merchant skill and learn the ins and outs of trading. I can teach you Mastery of the Merchant skill if you have an Expert skill level of 7, a Personality of 50 and pay 5000 gold.\nMastery triples your bonus towards prices."
msgstr "商店的主人都很贪心。你想要在买东西和卖东西的时候获得更好的价钱吗？那么你最好赶快学习经商的技能。我可以让你成为经商术的大师，只要你这项技能已达到专家级，技能等级已达到7级，拥有50以上的个性，并且付我5000个金币就可以学到我的知识。大师级的技能可以让你在决定价格的时候拥有三倍以上的优势。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:378
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:378
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Shop owners are a greedy lot.\nWant to get better prices for what you buy and sell?\nThen you better have the Merchant skill and learn the ins and outs of trading. I can teach you Grand Mastery of the Merchant skill if you have a Master skill level of 10 and pay 8000 gold.\nGrand Mastery allows you to pay and receive the actual price for goods."
msgstr "商店的主人都很贪心。你想要在买东西和卖东西的时候获得更好的价钱吗？那么你最好赶快学习经商的技能。我可以让你成为经商术的宗师，只要你这项技能已达到大师级，技能等级已达到10级，并且付我8000个金币就可以学到我的知识。专家级的技能可以让你在决定价格的时候可以用真正的价格来买卖。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:379
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:379
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your equipment is only as good as the person who repairs it.\nIf you can't fix it, you could find yourself stuck in the wilderness with no armor or weapons.\nThis could be extraordinarily bad. Expertise with the Repair Item skill allows you not only the chance of repairing weapons, but armor as well.\nThis skill can be yours if you have a skill level of 4 and pay 500 gold."
msgstr "装备的良莠与否和修护它的人有关。如果你自己修不好这些东西，你可能会发现自己手无寸铁、身无寸缕地被困在荒郊野外。这可能会非常糟糕。修补术的专家不只可以加强你修复武器的能力，连盔甲也包括在内。如果你拥有这项技能，其等级已达到4级，并且付我500个金币，我就可以倾囊相授。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:380
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:380
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your equipment is only as good as the person who repairs it.\nIf you can't fix it, you could find yourself stuck in the wilderness with no armor or weapons.\nThis could be extraordinarily bad. Mastery of the Repair Item skill allows you not only the chance of repairing weapons and armor, but any broken miscellaneous item as well.\nThis skill can be yours if you have an Expert skill level of 7 and pay 2500 gold."
msgstr "装备的良莠与否和修护它的人有关。如果你自己修不好这些东西，你可能会发现自己手无寸铁、身无寸缕地被困在荒郊野外。这可能会非常糟糕。修补术的专家不只可以加强你修复武器和盔甲的能力，连破损的杂项物品也不例外。如果你这项技能已达到专家级，技能等级已达到7级，并且付我2500个金币，我就可以倾囊相授。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:381
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:381
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your equipment is only as good as the person who repairs it.\nIf you can't fix it, you could find yourself stuck in the wilderness with no armor or weapons.\nThis could be extraordinarily bad. A Grand Master of the Repair Items kill can fix ANYTHING that is broken.\nThis skill can be yours if you have a Master skill level of 10 and pay 6000 gold."
msgstr "装备的良莠与否和修护它的人有关。如果你自己修不好这些东西，你可能会发现自己手无寸铁、身无寸缕地被困在荒郊野外。这可能会非常糟糕。修补术的专家可以修好任何物品！如果你这项技能已达到大师级，技能等级已达到10级，并且付我6000个金币，我就可以倾囊相授。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:382
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:382
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you think you are adventurers, do you?\nThere's not enough meat on you to protect you from the slap of a Dark Dwarven child!\nBody Building is the only way to go.\nYou will be stronger and tougher than before!\nAn Expert of Body Building is tougher than the normal hero.\nI can teach you this if your skill level is 4, pay 500 gold and are ready to sweat!"
msgstr "你以为你自己算是冒险者吗？你身上的那些肉还不够让你阻挡小狗的一击！健身术技能是你需要的唯一保障。你将会比以前还要强壮！健身术技能的专家比一般的英雄还要结实！如果你拥有这项技能且技能等级不低于4级，只要付我500个金币，我就可以教导你如何专业地流汗！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:383
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:383
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you think you are adventurers, do you?\nThere's not enough meat on you to protect you from the slap of a baby Troll!\nBody Building is the only way to go.\nYou will be stronger and tougher than before!\nA Master of Body Building is much tougher than the average hero.\nI can teach you this if your Expert skill level is 7, pay 2500 gold and have and Endurance of 50! No pain no gain!"
msgstr "你以为你自己算是冒险者吗？你身上的那些肉还不够让你阻挡巨魔婴儿的一击！健身术技能是你需要的唯一保障。你将会比以前还要强壮！健身术技能的大师比普通英雄还要结实！如果你这项技能已达到专家级且技能等级不低于7级，又拥有50点以上的耐力，那么只要付我2500个金币，我就可以教导你如何专业地流汗！有付出才会有获得！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:384
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:384
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you think you are adventurers, do you?\nThere's not enough meat on you to protect you from the slap of a baby Dragon!\nBody Building is the only way to go.\nYou will be stronger and tougher than before!\nA Grand Master of Body Building is the toughest hero you can find.\nI can teach you this if your Master skill level is 9, pay 6000 gold and have and Endurance of 50! No pain no gain!"
msgstr "你以为你自己算是冒险者吗？你身上的那些肉还不够让你阻挡幼龙的一击！健身术技能是你需要的唯一保障。你将会比以前还要强壮！健身术技能的宗师是你所能够找到最结实的英雄！如果你这项技能已达到大师级且技能等级不低于9级，又拥有50点以上的耐力点数，那么只要付我6000个金币，我就可以教导你如何专业地流汗！有付出才会有获得！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:385
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:385
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not enough spell points for casting those Expert spells?\nMeditation is what you need.\nWith an Expert skill in Meditation you get a double bonus to your available spell points.\nThis could mean one more powerful spell when you most need it!\nExpertise can be yours if your skill level is 4 and pay me 500 gold."
msgstr "要施展那些专家级的魔法，却没有足够的魔法值吗？冥想术是你需要的技能。冥想术的专家可以使你的魔法值增加值加倍。这意味着你可以在需要的时候多施展几个强力魔法！如果你拥有这项技能且已达到4级，并且付我500个金币，我就会教导你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:386
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:386
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not enough spell points for casting those Master spells?\nMeditation is what you need.\nWith a Master skill in Meditation you get a triple bonus to your available spell points.\nThis could mean one more powerful spell when you most need it!\nMastery can be yours if your Expert skill level is 7 and pay me 2500 gold."
msgstr "要施展那些大师级的魔法，却没有足够的魔法值吗？冥想术是你需要的技能。冥想术的大师可以使你的魔法值增加值乘以三。这意味着你可以在需要的时候多施展几个强力魔法！如果你这项技能已达到专家级，技能等级已达到7级，并且付我2500个金币，我就会教导你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:387
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:387
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not enough spell points for casting those Grand Master spells?\nMeditation is what you need.\nWith a Grand Master skill in Meditation you get a quadruple bonus to your available spell points.\nThis could mean one or more powerful spells when you most need them!\nGrand Mastery can be yours if your Master skill level is 10 and pay me 6000 gold."
msgstr "要施展那些宗师级的魔法，却没有足够的魔法值吗？冥想术是你需要的技能。冥想术的宗师可以使你的魔法值增加值乘以四。这意味着你可以在需要的时候多施展几个强力魔法！如果你这项技能已达到大师级，技能等级已达到10级，并且付我6000个金币，我就会教导你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:388
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:388
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Things are sometime hidden in the dungeons and castles of this land.\n You may have missed something without even knowing it was there.\nPerception increases your chance of finding these hidden things. Expertise in the Perception skill doubles your chances.\nFor 500 gold and a skill level of 4 in Perception, I will teach you."
msgstr "有些东西会藏在这世界的地下城和城堡中。你可能在不知情的状况下疏忽掉了许多事物。洞察术可以增加你找到这些隐藏物品的机率。洞察术专家可以让你找到这些事物的机率乘以2。只要你拥有这项技能，技能等级已达到4级，并且付我500个金币的学费，我就会教导你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:389
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:389
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Things are sometime hidden in the dungeons and castles of this land.\n You may have missed something without even knowing it was there.\nPerception increases your chance of finding these hidden things. Mastery of the Perception skill triples your chances.\nFor 2500 gold and an Expert skill level of 7 in Perception, I will teach you."
msgstr "有些东西会藏在这世界的地下城和城堡中。你可能在不知情的状况下疏忽掉了许多事物。洞察术可以增加你找到这些隐藏物品的机率。洞察术大师可以让你找到这些事物的机率乘以3。只要你这项技能已达到专家级，技能等级已达到7级，并且付我2500个金币的学费，我就会教导你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:390
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:390
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Things are sometime hidden in the dungeons and castles of this land.\nYou may have missed something without even knowing it was there.\nPerception increases your chance of finding these hidden things. Grand Mastery of the Perception skill quintuples your chances. For 6000 gold and a Master skill level of 10 in Perception, I will teach you."
msgstr "有些东西会藏在这世界的地下城和城堡中。你可能在不知情的状况下疏忽掉了许多事物。洞察术可以增加你找到这些隐藏物品的机率。洞察术宗师可以让你找到这些事物的机率乘以4。只要你这项技能已达到大师级，技能等级已达到10级，并且付我6000个金币的学费，我就会教导你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:391
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:391
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "An Expert level in the Regeneration skill doubles the number of hit points that you recover over time.\nExpert teaching of this skill requires a normal skill level of 4 and a fee of 2000 gold."
msgstr "拥有专家级再生术的人可以让固定时间内所恢复的生命值变成两倍。只要你拥有这项技能，技能等级已达到4级，并且付我2000个金币的学费，我就会教导你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:392
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:392
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A Master skill level in the Regeneration skill triples the number of hit points that you recover over time.\nMaster teaching of this skill requires a Expert skill level of 7 and a fee of 5000 gold."
msgstr "拥有大师级再生术的人可以让固定时间内所恢复的生命值变成三倍。只要你这项技能已达到专家级，技能等级已达到7级，并且付我5000个金币的学费，我就会教导你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:393
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:393
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Grand Mastery of the Regeneration skill quadruples the number of hit points that you recover over time.\nGrand Master teaching of this skill requires a Master skill level of 10 and a fee of 8000 gold."
msgstr "拥有宗师级再生术的人可以让固定时间内所恢复的生命值变成四倍。只要你这项技能已达到大师级，技能等级已达到10级，并且付我8000个金币的学费，我就会教导你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:394
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:394
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tired of chests blowing up in your face?\nSick of poison gas clouds, fireballs, and lightning bolts sending party members to the Great Beyond?\nExpert Disarm Trap doubles your chance of disarming these traps before they go off.\nI will teach you Expert Disarm Trap if you have a skill level of 4 and can pay 500 gold."
msgstr "厌倦了箱子在你面前爆炸吗？痛恨毒气、火球和闪电把队友们给送上西天吗？专家级的陷阱拆卸术将可以让你解除这些陷阱的机会变成两倍。如果你拥有这项技能，技能等级已达到4级，并且愿意付我500个金币作为学费，我就会教导你专家级的陷阱拆卸术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:395
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:395
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tired of chests blowing up in your face?\nSick of poison gas clouds, fireballs, and lightning bolts sending party members to the Great Beyond?\nMaster Disarm Trap triples your chance of disarming these traps before they go off.\nI will teach you Master Disarm Trap if you have an Expert skill level of 7 and can pay 2500 gold."
msgstr "厌倦了箱子在你面前爆炸吗？痛恨毒气、火球和闪电把队友们给送上西天吗？大师级的陷阱拆卸术将可以让你解除这些陷阱的机会变成三倍。如果你这项技能已达到专家级，技能等级已达到7级，并且愿意付我2500个金币作为学费，我就会教导你大师级的陷阱拆卸术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:396
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:396
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tired of chests blowing up in your face?\nSick of poison gas clouds, fireballs, and lightning bolts sending party members to the Great Beyond?\nGrand Master Disarm Trap eliminates these pesky traps entirely before they go off.\nI will teach you Grand Master Disarm Trap if you have a Master skill level of 10 and can pay 6000 gold."
msgstr "厌倦了箱子在你面前爆炸吗？痛恨毒气、火球和闪电把队友们给送上西天吗？宗师级的陷阱拆卸术将可以让你每次都能够解除这些陷阱。如果你这项技能已达到大师级，技能等级已达到10级，并且愿意付我6000个金币作为学费，我就会教导你宗师级的陷阱拆卸术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:403
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:403
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Knowing what you are up against in combat can mean the difference between life and death.\nBeing able to identify the monsters and opponents you are fighting can make this difference. I can teach you Expert Identify Monster if you already have a skill level of 4 and pay 500 gold."
msgstr "了解你即将要面对的是什么样的敌人很有可能会是生与死之间的差别。能够了解你所面对的敌人会造成极大的差别。如果你拥有这项技能，技能等级已达到4级，并且付我500个金币的学费，我就可以教导你专家级的怪物鉴定术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:404
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:404
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "He who runs away today lives to run away another day.\nThis doesn't necessarily mean he is a coward, however.\nHe may just be very smart.\nHe may know how his opponent attacks and what spells he may use, if any.\nI can teach you Master Identify Monster if you have achieved an Expert skill level of 7 and can pay 2500 gold."
msgstr "今天逃跑的人明天才活得下来，这并不代表他一定是个懦夫，他也许只是聪明而已。他可能因为知道对手的攻击方式和可能会施展的魔法才会做出这样的判断。如果你这项技能已达到专家级，技能等级已达到7级，并且愿意付我2500个金币的学费，我就愿意教导你大师级的怪物鉴定术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:405
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:405
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you can probe your enemies defenses and know his weaknesses, you will always prevail.\nWith Grand Mastery of Identify Monster, you will know how your enemies attack and what their defenses are.\nThis knowledge will allow you to attack their weakest points. I can raise you to Grand Master of this skill if you have a Master skill level of 10 and pay 6000 gold."
msgstr "如果你能够知道敌人的防御和他的弱点，你一定可以生存下来。在拥有了宗师等级的怪物鉴定术之后，你将会知道敌人是如何攻击，如何防御的。这个知识让你可以攻击他最弱的地方。如果你这项技能已达到大师级，技能等级已达到10级，并且愿意付我6000个金币作为学费，我可以教导你宗师级的怪物鉴定术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:406
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:406
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Knowledge of a single weapon is great.\nHaving knowledge of all weapons is even better.\nExpert Armsmaster skill increases you chance to hit with any melee weapon you can wield. I can make you an Expert Armsmaster if you have a skill level of 4 and pay 2000 gold."
msgstr "拥有一种武器的知识很好，对每种武器都拥有相当的知识当然就更好了。达到武器使用术专家能让你使用任何近战武器时的击中怪物几率增加。如果你的技能等级为4级或更高，并且愿付2000个金币的学费，我就可以教导你专家级的武器使用术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:407
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:407
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Knowledge of a single melee weapon is great.\nHaving knowledge of all melee weapons is even better. Master Armsmaster increases the damage you do with any weapon you can wield. I can make you a Master Armsmaster if you have an Expert skill level of 7 and pay 5000 gold."
msgstr "拥有一种武器的知识很好，对每种武器都拥有相当的知识当然就更好了。达到武器使用术大师能让你使用任何近战武器时的杀伤力增加。如果你已经是专家，且技能等级为7级或更高，并且愿付5000个金币的学费，我就可以教导你大师级的武器使用术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:408
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:408
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Knowledge of a single melee weapon is great.\nHaving knowledge of all melee weapons is even better.\nArmsmaster skill decreases the recovery time of any melee weapon you are already skilled with and gives the chance for greater inflicted damage.\nGrand Master expertise doubles both your chance to hit and damage bonuses for the skill. I can make you a Grand Master Armsmaster if you have a Master skill level of 10 and pay 8000 gold."
msgstr "拥有一种武器的知识很好，对每种武器都拥有相当的知识当然就更好了。武器使用术能减少近战武器恢复时间，达到武器使用术宗师能加倍增加你使用任何近战武器时的击中怪物几率及杀伤力。如果你已经是大师，且技能等级为10级或更高，并且愿付8000个金币的学费，我就可以教导你宗师级的武器使用术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:412
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1380
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:412
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:475
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tired of the simple potions mixtures?\nWant to make something new and potent?\nWant to create compound potions?\nThis knowledge of Expert Alchemy can be yours if you demonstrate a skill level of 4 and pay 500 gold."
msgstr "怎么，觉得身上带的药剂都不管用，想弄些复合药剂？那么你们就得学习炼金术。如果你们的炼金术达到4级，并给我500个金币，我就传授你们专家级的炼金技术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:413
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1381
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:413
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:476
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Want to know how to use potions and compound potions to make white potions?\nI can raise you to Master knowledge of Alchemy if you have an Expert skill level of 7 and pay 2500 gold."
msgstr "想要研制白色药剂？只有掌握大师级的炼金术你们才会成功。如果你们的炼金术达到7级并给我2500个金币，我就传授你们这项技术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:414
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:414
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The black potion is the Alchemist's ultimate creation!\nThey can affect so many different things and are even wonderful to taste!\nGrand Mastery of Alchemy can be yours if you have a Master skill level of 10 in Alchemy, possess one of each of the best reagents and pay 6000 gold."
msgstr "炼金术士的终极创造物就是黑色药剂！它们可以影响好多的东西，甚至连喝起来都很美味。如果你这项技能已达到大师级，技能等级已达到10级，并且拥有最好的药材每种一样，付我6000个金币就可以学到炼金术的宗师级技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:415
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:415
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Learning allows you to gain more experience from your travels and encounters. Expert Learning doubles the bonus to gained experience, leading you down the path of greater wisdom.\nI will instruct you in Expert Learning if your skill level is 4 and you pay me 2000 gold."
msgstr "学习术让你可以从旅行和与敌人遭遇中学到更多的经验。专家级的学习术可以让你在获得经验点数的增益上变成两倍，让你获得更多的智能。如果你拥有这项技能，技能等级已达到4级，并且付我2000个金币作为学费，我就教导你专家级的学习术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:416
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:416
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Learning allows you to gain more experience from your travels and encounters. Master Learning triples the bonus to gained experience, leading you down the path of greater wisdom.\nI will instruct you in Master Learning if you have an Expert skill level of 7, pay me 5000 gold and have and Intellect of 50."
msgstr "学习术让你可以从旅行和与敌人遭遇中学到更多的经验。大师级的学习术可以让你在获得经验点数的增益上变成三倍，让你获得更多的智能。如果你这项技能已达到专家级，技能等级已达到7级，并且付我5000个金币作为学费，并且拥有50以上的智力，我就教导你大师级的学习术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:417
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:417
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Learning allows you to gain more experience from your travels and encounters. Grand Master Learning quintuples the bonus to gained experience, leading you down the path of greater wisdom.\nI will instruct you in Grand Master Learning if you have a Master skill level of 10, pay me 8000 gold and have and Intellect of 50."
msgstr "学习术让你可以从旅行和与敌人遭遇中学到更多的经验。宗师的学习术可以让你在获得经验点数的增益上变成四倍，让你获得更多的智能。如果你这项技能已达到大师级，技能等级已达到10级，并且付我8000个金币作为学费，并且拥有50以上的智力，我就教导你宗师级的学习术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:418
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:418
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Puddle Thain, is a most promising student.\nIf you seek Expert instruction in the uses of the Staff, you can find him in the city of Ravenshore."
msgstr "你可以在渡鸦海滨这座城市中从普多·泰恩处学到专家级的手杖技能。他曾经是是最有潜力的学生之一。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:419
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:419
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Celia Stone, Master of the Staff, dwells in Troll village of Rust in the Ironsand Desert.\nShe can instruct you to Mastery of the Staff is that is what you desire."
msgstr "铁锈镇的赛丽雅·斯通是手杖技能的大师，如果你想要的话，她可以教导你有关手杖技能的许多特殊技巧。巨魔的铁锈镇位于铁沙漠中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:420
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:420
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Grand Master Tristen Stillwater, instructs all students of the Staff.\nOnly he can help you in attaining Grand Mastery of this fine weapon.\nSeek him out in the city of Twilight at the base of the Shadowspire."
msgstr "宗师级的手杖技能导师崔斯坦·史帝尔瓦特在阴影塔地区的黎明城中。如果你想要获得有关手杖这种武器的宗师级知识，只有他能够帮助你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:421
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:421
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Aerie Luodrin currently dwells in Ravenshore.\nShe is a most dedicated student of the uses of the Sword and can instruct you to and Expert skill level with the weapon."
msgstr "你可以在渡鸦海滨城中找爱利·卢欧林学习专家级的长剑技能。她是长剑的专家，可以让你对长剑有更深的了解。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:422
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:422
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Unfortunately Jaycin Cardron, Master of the Sword, felt that his skills would be more, shall we say, \"profitable taught\" to the Dragon Hunter's of Garrote Gorge.\nIf you seek Master skill level with the Sword, you will have to go to him at the Garrote Gorge Dragon Hunter Camp."
msgstr "大师级的长剑技能的导师是杰新·卡卓，很不幸地，她认为在猎龙人营地中教导这项技能可以赚得更多。所以，你可以在绞刑峡谷的猎龙人营地中找到她。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:423
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:423
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Miyon Dragontracker, Grand Master of the Sword, has joined the knight, Charles Quixote in his quest to exterminate the Dragons of Garrote Gorge.\nYou can find Miyon at the Dragon Hunter's Fort."
msgstr "长剑技能的宗师级导师是麦友·追龙者，他现在在雷格那岛上教授这项技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:424
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:424
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Expert instructor of the Dagger, Lori Vespers, lives in the Dark Elf city of Alvar.\nSeek her out there."
msgstr "匕首技能的导师罗瑞·维斯波居住在黑暗精灵的城市阿尔瓦中。快去那边找他。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:425
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:425
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Master Jobber can instruct students of the Dagger to Mastery.\nHe lives in the city of Ravenshore."
msgstr "乔波教导大师级的匕首技能，他居住在渡鸦海滨这座城市中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:426
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:426
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Karla Nirses, the Grand Master of the Dagger trains all Regnan Pirates in the uses of the Dagger.\nShe dwells with them on the Island of Regna as they pay her well."
msgstr "卡拉·诺瑟斯是宗师级的匕首导师，通常出现在雷格那岛上训练所有的雷格那海盗使用匕首。由于海盗们付她相当多的学费，她就居住在雷格那岛上。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:427
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:427
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Herald Foestryke, one of Charles Quixote's finest knights, is the Expert teacher of the skills of the Axe.\nHe can be found at the Dragon Hunter's Camp in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "哈洛·佛斯太克是吉柯德手下最强悍的骑士，他在绞刑峡谷中的猎龙人营地教导专家级的战斧技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:428
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:428
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Jasp Hunter is the Master instructor of the axe.\nHe can teach you the skills that will lead to Mastery of the axe.\nHis home is in the seaside city of Ravenshore."
msgstr "杰斯普·韩特是大师级的战斧技能导师，他将可以让你学习到许多有关斧头的秘诀，他的家就在靠海的城市渡鸦海滨中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:429
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:429
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Grand Master Garic Senjac, is the Grand Master teacher of the ways of the Axe.\nHis home is in Balthazar Lair in the Ravage Roaming region."
msgstr "战斧宗师加瑞克·森杰克在残破镇的巴尔萨煞巢穴中教导宗师级的战斧技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:430
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:430
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Matric Townsaver defended the city of Ravenshore against many Regnan Pirate raids.\nHis skill and instruction of the uses of the spear allowed the townsfolk to push the Pirates back. He can instruct you to Expert skill level with the spear."
msgstr "麦崔克·陶恩赛佛协助渡鸦海滨的居民抵挡了许多次雷格那海盗的入侵，他的技能和手中的那柄长矛击退了无数次的雷格那海盗。他现在在渡鸦海滨的家中教导专家级的长矛技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:431
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:431
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ashandra Withersmythe is the Master teacher of the Spear.\nHer instruction of the ways of the Spear will lead you to Mastery of the weapon.\nShe lives in the merchant city of Alvar."
msgstr "雅山德拉·惠瑟史密斯是大师级的长矛技能导师，她居住在阿尔瓦商业城中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:432
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:432
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yarrow is the Grand Master of the Spear.\nHer keen eye and stalking ability have aided her in attaining this level of skill.\nShe uses the Spear to stalk the poisonous couatl of the jungles of the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr "雅罗是长矛技能的宗师，她锐利的视力协助她获得了这个等级的技能。她目前正利用自己的技能在匕伤群岛上猎杀那些羽蛇，你可以在匕伤群岛上找到她的踪迹。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:433
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:433
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Shivan Keeneye is an Expert shot with the Bow.\nHer teachings can lead you to an Expert skill level with this ranged weapon.\nShe lives in the village of Blood Drop on the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr "席瓦·锐眼是专家级的弓箭技能导师，她的专业教导可以让你获得专家级的弓箭技能。她目前居住在匕伤群岛上的血滴镇中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:434
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:434
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Master Oberic Nosewort teaches students of the bow in his home in Ravenshore.\nIf you seek Mastery of this weapon you must seek him out there."
msgstr "大师级的弓箭技能导师欧伯力克·诺斯沃居住在渡鸦海滨的城市中。如果你想要学习大师级的弓箭技能，你必须要去找他才行。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:435
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:435
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Solis, Grand Master of the Bow, lives in the Dark Elf city of Alvar.\nShe can teach you Grand Mastery of the Bow."
msgstr "弓箭技能的宗师索力斯居住在黑暗精灵的城市阿尔瓦中。她可以教导你弓箭最终极的技巧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:438
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:438
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Brother Hearthsworn, the Grand Master of the Mace, retired to the peace of the Ironsand Desert, seeking tranquility among the dunes of that region.\nHis home is in the village of Rust."
msgstr "贺斯沃弟兄是宗师级的钉锤导师，他退休后隐居在沙漠中追求心灵的宁静，他通常出现在铁沙漠中的铁锈镇中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:440
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:440
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sheldon Nightwood lives in the city of Twilight, beneath the Necromancers' Guild on the Shadowspire.\nShe can teach you Mastery of the Shield."
msgstr "大师级的盾牌技能教师谢尔顿·夜木居住在阴影塔地区的黎明城中。她会教导你用盾的大师级技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:441
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:441
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The knight, Peryn Reaverston, holds the title of Grand Master of the Shield.\nHe is currently in service to Charles Quixote and teaches knights in the proper uses of the shield.\nSearch him out in the Dragon Hunter's Camp in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "骑士派林·瑞佛斯通是宗师级的盾牌技能导师，他居住在绞刑峡谷的猎龙人营地中，正在教导查尔斯·吉柯德旗下的骑士如何正确地使用盾牌。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:442
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:442
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Lizardman Thadin is the Expert instructor of the use of Leather armor.\nHis instruction will give you an Expert skill level with this armor.\nYou can find him on the Island of Dagger Wound."
msgstr "蜥蜴人泰丁是专家级的皮甲技能导师，他的课程能够让你学到很多，目前他居住在匕伤群岛上。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:443
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:443
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Master Shamus Hollyfield dwells in the Minotaur city, Balthazar Lair, which is located in the Ravage Roaming region.\nHe can teach you Mastery of Leather armor."
msgstr "大师级的皮甲导师沙漠斯·荷力菲居住在巴尔萨煞巢穴，也就是牛头人的洞穴之中。牛头人的城市位于残破镇的区域。他可以教导你大师级的皮甲使用技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:444
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:444
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Medwari Elmsmire makes the finest Leather armor in the realm.\nShe also holds the title of Grand Master of Leather Armor and can instruct you at her home in the village of Rust in the Ironsand Desert."
msgstr "麦瓦力·爱姆斯麦尔是全大陆上最专精于皮甲使用的人，她同时也是宗师级的皮甲技能教导者，她的家就在铁沙漠的铁锈镇中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:445
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:445
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tobren Forgewright assisted the city of Ravenshore in the First Pirate War.\nHer forge glowed for four weeks straight as she made chain armor for the defenders of Ravenshore.\nShe still teaches Expert use of the armor from her home in the seaside port of Ravenshore."
msgstr "托伯伦·佛吉爱特在第一次的海盗战争中协助渡鸦海滨抵抗雷格那人的入侵。为了替守城者打造锁甲，她的打铁铺整整有四个礼拜昼夜不停地运作着。她也是专家级的锁甲技能导师，目前还居住在渡鸦海滨的海港边。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:446
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:446
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Halian Eversmyle learned all the skills he could from the Grand Master of Chain armor and then fled to the city of Alvar where he teaches Mastery of this armor to the Merchants of Alvar.\nHe will instruct you to Mastery as well."
msgstr "海立安·艾佛斯麦从宗师的手中学到了所有可用的技能，躲到阿尔瓦来教导锁甲技能混饭吃。他是大师级的锁甲技能导师，通常会出现在阿尔瓦。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:447
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:447
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Grand Master Seline Burnkindle teaches ways of using chain armor to its greatest advantage.\nShe lives among the Pirates of Regna."
msgstr "锁甲的宗师级导师赛林·伯更斗通常在她位于雷格那的家中授课。她会教导你如何善用锁甲的威力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:449
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:449
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Master Botham was one of the finest warriors in the First Pirate War.\nRavenshore owes him a debt of gratitude.\nBotham and his fellow swordsman led the charge against the first wave of Regnans.\nTheir Plate armor deflected all but the most serious blows.\nHe still teaches Mastery of Plate armor from his home."
msgstr "波散恩是第一次海盗战争中最强悍的战士，渡鸦海滨能够守住，都要靠他的强大战力。波散恩和他的同伴们努力抵抗住了第一波的海盗攻击。除了最重的打击之外，钢甲几乎挡住了所有其他的攻击。这位大师级的钢甲技能教师波散恩目前居住在渡鸦海滨的城市中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:450
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:450
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Seth Ironfist, Grand Master of Plate Armor, is the true force behind Charles Quixote's crusade against the Dragons of Garrote Gorge.\nWithout his instruction in the use of Plate armor, Quixote's knights would be mere fodder before the wrath Redreaver's Dragons."
msgstr "赛欣·艾恩法斯特是宗师级的钢甲技能教导者，他也是查尔斯·吉柯德对飞龙的圣战中真正的幕后功臣。如果没有他，这些骑士们早就被打成肉酱了。他目前正在绞刑峡谷的猎龙人营地中教导骑士们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:451
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:451
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Taren Temper, fled Erathia to make a new life for himself among those who know nothing of the Temper history.\nHe teaches Expert skills in Fire Magic from his home in Ravenshore."
msgstr "泰伦·谭普从埃拉西亚逃出来，躲到一个没人知道他过去的地方。他目前在他位于渡鸦海滨的家中教授专家级火系魔法技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:452
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:452
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Solomon Steele, Master of Fire, lives in the tranquil city of Alvar.\nHe can teach you Mastery of Fire Magic."
msgstr "所罗门·史提尔是火系魔法的大师，他居住在阿尔瓦的宁静城市中。他可以教导你大师级火系魔法技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:453
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:453
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Burn, Grand Master of Fire dwells in the oppressive heat of the Plane of Fire.\nPerhaps the Gate of Fire that has appeared in the Ironsand Desert will lead you to him.\nHe can instruct you in Grand Mastery of Fire Magic.\n"
msgstr "也许出现在铁沙漠中的火元素界传送门可以让你找到他。他将可以教导你火系魔法的宗师级技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:455
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:455
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hollis Stormeye, Master of Air, made her home in Balthazar Lair, home of the Minotaurs.\n"
msgstr "荷力司·暴风眼是空气魔法的大师，他居住在巴尔萨煞巢穴，也就是位于残破镇的区域。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:456
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:456
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Cloud Nedlon sought to make a deal with the Lords of Air.\nHe left to find a way into the Plane of Air, where he thought he would learn all that remained unclear to him about the ways of Air Magic.\nYou will have to travel to the Plane of Air to see if he was successful."
msgstr "克劳德·耐德龙似乎和风元素之王达成了某项协议，他通过传送门前往风元素界，希望在那边了解他对于空气魔法所有的不解之处。他是空气魔法的宗师，他居住在风元素界的区域中，看来你必须要靠着传送门来抵达他所在的区域。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:457
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:457
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ulbrecht Pederton single handedly stopped the Second Pirate War.\nHe charged down the beach to come to Ravenshore's defense as the pirates began to land.\nHe manipulated the sea itself and forced the Regnan fleet back into the ocean.\nUnfortunately this effort cost him the ability to use magic altogether.\nHe still, however, teaches the knowledge of Expert Water Magic.\nHe lives in Ravenshore to this day."
msgstr "乌尔布拉契·派德东单枪匹马地阻止了第二次的海盗战争。他冲到海边，正好雷格那海盗开始登陆。他呼唤海水的力量，逼迫雷格那舰队退回到海中。很不幸地，这次的牺牲让他失去了使用魔法的能力。不过，他目前还是专家级的水系魔法老师，居住在渡鸦海滨这座城市中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:458
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:458
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Gregory Mist, Master of Water, makes his home in the village of Rust in the Ironsand Desert.\nHe claims to have a plan to use his magic to change the hot desert into a verdant green plain.\nIf he has the time, he can teach you Mastery of Water Magic."
msgstr "葛丽果力·迷雾是水系魔法的大师级教师，他目前居住在铁沙漠的铁锈镇中。他宣称自己准备利用对水系魔法的知识将沙漠变成良田。如果他有时间的话，也许他可以教导你水系魔法的大师级技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:459
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:459
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Black Current was once a powerful mage in this region.\nHer ambition for power outgrew her caution and she attempted to conquer the Plane of Water.\nShe summoned a gate to the plane and stepped through.\nShe was never heard from again.\nShe was the Grand Master of Water Magic.\nIf she still lives you may find her in the Plane of Water."
msgstr "黑流是水系魔法的宗师级导师，目前出没在水元素界。她对于力量的野心让她想要征服水元素界。她打开了一扇传送门前往水元素界，之后就再也没人听过她的消息。如果她还活着，你可能可以在水元素界找到她的踪影。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:461
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:461
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Earth Magic Master Dorothy Sablewood helped end the First Pirate War.\nWith the aid of an unknown Air Mage, she erected walls of clay to keep the Regnan Pirates from leaving their boats.\nShe now teaches her skills from her home in Alvar."
msgstr "土系魔法的大师级教师陶乐熙·塞百物曾经协助了第一次海盗战争的守城者。在一名不知名的空气魔法师的帮助下，她建起了一座黏土墙，逼迫雷格那海盗们逃回海中。她目前居住在阿尔瓦城中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:462
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:462
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Grand Master Griven passed into the Plane of Earth after teaching his final lesson to Dorothy Sablewood.\nPerhaps he lives there to this day.\nWho knows what transpires in an elemental plane?"
msgstr "土系魔法的宗师葛瑞文在完成了他最后的课程之后，遁入了土元素界。谁知道元素界中到底发生了什么事情呢？或许他还活着呢！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:464
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:464
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Master Bethold Kern, serves the knight Charles Quixote in his crusade against the Dragons of the Garrote Gorge region.\nSearch him out there at the Dragon Hunter's Camp.\nIf you are lucky, he will have time to instruct you in Mastery of Spirit Magic."
msgstr "灵魂魔法的大师贝索德·科恩通常会出现在绞刑峡谷的猎龙人营地中。他目前正在教导骑士们如何对抗飞龙，如果你运气好的话，或许他会有时间教导你这方面的技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:465
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:465
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lasiter Ravensight, is the Grand Master of Spirit Magic.\nHe lives in the Murmurwoods close to the Temple of the Sun, where he continues his studies in to the essence of Spirit.\nHe can raise your skill in Spirit Magic to Grand Mastery."
msgstr "来西特·鸦眼是灵魂魔法的宗师级教师。他目前居住在靠近太阳神庙的低语森林中。他在那边继续研究一切有关灵魂魔法的知识。他可以让你对于灵魂魔法的认知提升到宗师级的等级。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:466
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:466
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Shane Krewlen, student of Mind Magic, can instruct you in the Expert skills of this arcane magic.\nSeek him out in the Dark Elf city of Alvar."
msgstr "商恩·克鲁兰是心智魔法的专家级教师，目前居住在黑暗精灵的都市阿尔瓦之中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:467
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:467
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Barthine Lotts, Master of Mind Magic, dwells in the Minotaur city of Balthazar Lair in the Ravage Roaming region.\nThrough her instruction can gain Mastery of Mind Magic."
msgstr "芭芭拉·拉兹是心智魔法的大师，目前他居住在巴尔萨煞巢穴的牛头人都市中，也就是位于残破镇的地区。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:468
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:468
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Gilad Dreamwright, Grand Master of Mind Magic, has joined many other Grand Masters of Magic in the Murmurwoods region.\nHere they work with the Temple of the Sun to further their combined skills and knowledge.\nGilad can instruct you to Grand Master skill level in Mind Magic."
msgstr "吉拉德·梦妖是心智魔法的宗师，目前他加入许多宗师魔法师的行列，他目前和太阳神庙一起合作，开发进一步的知识。他目前居住在靠近太阳神庙的低语森林中，可以教导你使用宗师级的心智魔法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:470
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:470
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tugor Arin, Master of Body Magic, practices his healing skills in the service of the knight Charles Quixote in the Garrote Gorge region.\nHis skills in Body Magic are put to good use healing the unfortunate young knights who are wounded in the crusade against the Dragons of Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "土加·爱林是肢体魔法的大师级教师，目前居住在绞刑峡谷的猎龙人营地中。在那边，他的肢体医疗魔法对于不幸被飞龙所伤害的年轻骑士来说非常有用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:471
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:471
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Grand Master Critias Snowtree, dwells in the peace of the Murmurwoods forest away from the trials and troubles of the world.\nOnly he can instruct you in the ways of Body Magic and raise you to Grand Mastery of this arcane skill."
msgstr "肢体魔法的宗师克理塔斯·雪树就居住在低语森林中，远离尘世的喧嚣和吵杂。只有他可以教导你如何达到肢体魔法的宗师级地位。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:472
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:472
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Archibald Dawnsglow, Expert instructor of Light Magic, practices his arts in the city of Ravenshore on the Ifarine Sea.\nHis parents gave his name not knowing that it was the same name as the leader of the Erathian Necromancers' Guild.\nArchibald desires to have his own name made in the Light, not in the darkness of his namesake."
msgstr "阿基巴德·曙光是光明魔法的专家级教师，目前正在伊法力海岸边的渡鸦海滨传授他的技巧。他的父母给了他这个名字，却不知道这刚好和埃拉西亚的死灵法师公会首领的名字一样。阿基巴德希望能够听到自己的名字在光明的历史上被人所传诵，而不是被黑暗界的怪物们礼拜。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:474
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:474
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Aldrin Cleareye, Grand Master of the Light, makes his home on the island of Regna.\nHe hopes to bring an end to the Pirates evil ways.\nHe can instruct you to Grand Masterey, if you survive the Pirates."
msgstr "艾德林·明眼是光明魔法的宗师，目前居住在靠近雷格那岛的地方。他希望能够让海盗们不要再继续行邪恶之道。如果你能够躲过海盗的防卫线，你就可以让他教导你宗师等级的技巧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:475
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:475
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Patwin Darkenmore, Expert teacher of the ways of Dark Magic, lives among the Dark Elves of Alvar.\n"
msgstr "帕特温·达肯摩尔是暗黑魔法的专家级导师，他目前居住在阿尔瓦的黑暗精灵城市中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:477
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:477
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sithicus Shadowrunner, Grand Master of the art of Dark Magic, and has established a home on the Island of Regna.\nHere the pirate captains get her blessing on the ships before a raid.\nShe can instruct you in Grand Mastery of Dark Magic."
msgstr "西西克斯·影跑者是宗师级的暗黑魔法教师，目前居住在雷格那岛上。在海盗们出征之前，都会祈求她的祝福。她可以教导你暗黑魔法的宗师级技巧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:478
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:478
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Kyra Sparkmen, Expert teacher of the Identify Item skill, lives in the city of Alvar.\n"
msgstr "其拉·史巴克曼可以教导学生专家级的物品鉴定术，他目前居住在阿尔瓦城中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:479
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:479
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Eithian, Master instructor of the Identify Item skill, serves the Merchants of Alvar, and currently lives on the Dagger Wound Islands. Many travelers bring their prizes to Eithian for identification.\nHe may have to time to instruct you to Mastery of this skill if you travel to him."
msgstr "爱西恩是物品鉴定术的大师级导师，目前他在阿尔瓦的商人旗下服务，居住在匕伤群岛上。许多旅人会将物品千里迢迢地带来给他鉴定。如果你到他的家里去，也许他会有时间教导你物品鉴定的技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:480
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:480
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Elzbet Roggen, Grand Master of the Identify Item skill, lives in the Shadowspire city of Twilight.\nShe can teach you what is needed to achieve Grand Mastery."
msgstr "艾尔斯伯·络真是物品鉴定术的宗师级导师，目前居住在阴影塔地区的黎明城中。她可以教导你宗师所需要知道的常识。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:481
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:481
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fishner Thomb, retired from service with the Merchants of Alvar and returned to his home Island of Dagger Wound in the Ifarine Sea.\nSeek him out there for his teachings in the Expert way of being a Merchant."
msgstr "费许那·汤伯是专家级的经商术教师，原先是在阿尔瓦商人旗下服务，在他退休之后，目前居住在伊法力海中的匕伤群岛上的家中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:482
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:482
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fenton Iverson, Master Merchant of Alvar, tests all who wish to advanced with the skills of a Merchant.\nYou will find Fenton in the merchant city of Alvar, where he can instruct you to Mastery of the Merchant skill."
msgstr "费顿·艾佛森是大师级的经商术教师，目前居住在阿尔瓦商业城中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:483
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:483
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Raven Quicktoungue, Grand Master Merchant of Alvar, dwells in the city of Ravenshore.\nThere, Raven can watch the interaction of numerous races as the trade with each other.\nOnly he can raise your knowledge to Grand Mastery of the merchant skill."
msgstr "瑞文·快舌是宗师级的经商术导师，目前居住在渡鸦海滨。由于他在这里可以和各个种族的人彼此协商和交易，所以相当快乐，如果他有时间的话，或许可以教导你宗师级的经商术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:484
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:484
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Evandar Lotts teaches the Expert skills of Repairing Items.\nHe dwells in the seaside city of Ravenshore."
msgstr "艾凡达·拉兹教导的是专家级的修补术，他目前居住在渡鸦海滨的靠海港口中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:486
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:486
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Quethrin Tonk, Grand Master of the Repair Item skill, dwells in the tranquil Murmurwoods.\nHis skills have proven invaluable to the Temple of the Sun."
msgstr "逵斯林·东克是修补术的宗师，他目前居住在低语森林中。太阳神庙认为他的技能非常非常的有用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:488
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:488
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Kenneth Otterton, holds the title of Crusader, and serves under the knight Charles Quixote in Garrote Gorge.\nRumor has it that he wrestled a Dragon to the ground single-handedly.\nOf course, other knights had to assist in the kill.\nKenneth also holds the title, Master Instructor of Body Building."
msgstr "肯尼斯·欧特顿是大师级的健身术技能导师，同时也拥有十字军的称号。他目前居住在绞刑峡谷的猎龙人营地中。据说他曾经单枪匹马地将一只龙压倒在地，当然，其它的骑士协助他杀死了这只龙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:489
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:489
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mikel Smithson, holds the title of Strongest in Jadame.\nHe is also the Grand Master of the Body Building skill.\nSeek him out in the village of Rust in the Ironsand Desert if you wish to perfect the strength of your bodies."
msgstr "米凯尔·史密森是健身术技能的宗师级导师，如果你想要进一步提升自己的健身术技能，请去铁沙漠的铁锈镇找他。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:490
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:490
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Alton Putnam, is an Expert in the art of Meditation.\nHe can instruct you if you seek him out in the seaside city of Ravenshore."
msgstr "艾顿·普特南是冥想术的专家级导师。如果你去他在渡鸦海滨的住宅，你可以请他教导你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:492
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:492
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lenord Nightcrawler, Grand Master of Meditation, serves as one of the foremost members of the Necromancers' Guild of Shadowspire.\nHe instructs all necromancers in the art of Meditation from his home in the village of Twilight."
msgstr "蓝诺德·夜行者是冥想术的宗师，也是死灵法师公会中最受尊重的成员之一。他教导所有死灵法师公会成员冥想术，目前居住在阴影塔地区的黎明城中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:493
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:493
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Silk Nightwalker, Expert teacher of the Perception skill, makes his home in the Dark Elf city of Alvar.\nInstructing the Merchants of Alvar in the skills needed to detect that which is supposed to remain secret occupies most of his time, however him may take the time to instruct you if luck is with you."
msgstr "希尔克·夜行者是洞察术的专家级导师，目前他居住在阿尔瓦的黑暗精灵城市中。他大部分的时间都花在教导商人们如何发现被秘密隐藏起来的物品，如果你运气好的话，他应该愿意教导你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:494
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:494
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Helga Steeleye, lives among the necromancers of Shadowspire in the village of Twilight.\nThe Necromancers' Guild is thankful for her Master level instructions in the skill of Perception."
msgstr "海尔加·钢眼是大师级洞察术导师，目前居住在阴影塔地区的黎明城中。死灵法师公会很感谢有他的技能指导。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:495
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:495
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Grand Master Balan Suretrail lives in the Minotaur city of Balthazar Lair.\nTo gain his instruction in the skill of Perception, you must seek him out in Ravage Roaming."
msgstr "洞察术的宗师级导师巴兰·栩尔雀儿就住在巴尔萨煞巢穴的牛头人都市中。要学习最高级的技能，你必须要找到他才行。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:497
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:497
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "William Sampson, Master of Regeneration, lives in the peace of the Murmurwoods.\nHe uses the libraries of the Temple of the Sun to further his knowledge of Trollish history."
msgstr "威廉·山普森是大师级的再生术导师，目前居住在低语森林中。他利用太阳神庙的大图书馆来研习有关巨魔的历史文档。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:498
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:498
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ush the Many Tailed, Grand Master of Regeneration and legendary warrior, lives among his people on Dagger Wound Island.\nLegends say he has lost his tail thirteen times in battle against the Regnan Pirates, and each time he has grown a new tail!"
msgstr "多尾乌许是再生术的宗师，目前他和同胞一起居住在匕伤群岛上的城市中。传说他在和雷格那海盗的战斗中曾经十三次失去了尾巴，每次却又都长出新的尾巴来！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:500
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:500
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Kelli Lightfingers, Master of Disarming Traps, has retired to her home in the merchant city of Alvar.\nThere she still teaches young merchants the skills of trapping and disarming chests.\nIf you are worthy she can raise your Disarm Trap skills to that of a Master."
msgstr "凯力·来特芬格是陷阱拆卸术的大师级导师，他在阿尔瓦的家中教导这项技能。如果他觉得你资格符合，那么他也会教导你这项技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:508
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:508
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tessa Maker, Expert in Monster Identification, seeks to improve her skills by cataloging the different Dragons of Garrote Gorge.\nShe is currently in the service of the knight, Charles Quixote."
msgstr "泰沙·马克是怪物鉴定的专家级教师，目前居住在绞刑峡谷内部的猎龙人营地。她目前正在尝试靠着将不同的飞龙分类来锻链自己的技巧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:509
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:509
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Matric Keenedge, Master of the skill of Identify Monster, is currently studying the creatures of the Murmurwoods.\nIf you seek Mastery of this skill you need to seek him out there."
msgstr "马崔克·锐锋是大师级的怪物鉴定术导师，目前居住在低语森林。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:510
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:510
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Blacken Stonecleaver, Grand Master of Monster Identification, has seen every creature on the continent of Jadame.\nHe can teach you his knowledge if you find his home in the city of Ravenshore."
msgstr "布拉肯·石刀是怪物鉴定术的宗师级技能导师，他已经看过了贾丹姆大陆上的所有怪物。目前他在自己位于渡鸦海滨的家中教导这些技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:511
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:511
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Knight Norbert Slayer, instructs all of Charles Quixote's knights in the Expert forms of\nArmsmastery.\nIf you travel to Garrote Gorge, you can attend one of his teachings."
msgstr "骑士诺伯特·杀手是专家级的武器使用术导师，他目前居住在绞刑峡谷的猎龙人营地中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:513
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:513
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Jasper Steelcoif, Grand Master of the Armsmaster skill, is one of the leaders of the Regnan Pirate Council.\nHe instructs all pirates in the use of weapons.\nIf you are brave enough to travel to Regna--and survive his instruction--you too, will have Grand Mastery of this skill."
msgstr "杰斯伯·史提尔克夫是武器使用术的宗师级导师，目前他出没在雷格那岛上，教导所有的海盗使用武器。如果你拥有足够的勇气前往雷格那岛，并且在他的课程之下生存，那么你也许会拥有宗师级的相关知识。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:519
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:519
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ich, Grand Master of Alchemy, has studied the art of brewing for decades.\nHe knows all there is to know about blending reagents into beneficial and harmful potions.\nSeek out his home in the lush jungles of the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr "伊奇是炼金术技能的宗师，他在匕伤群岛的居所中教导有意愿学习的人。他知道所有将药材混合所需要的知识和技巧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:521
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:521
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Garret Mistspring, Master of Learning, instructs all students of necromancy in the art of Learning.\nFor this the Necromancers' Guild rewards him well.\nHis home is in the hamlet of Twilight at the base of the Shadowspire."
msgstr "加瑞特·雾春是学习术的大师级教师，她在阴影塔地区的黎明城中教导学生。因为死灵法师公会对她的教导给予相当丰厚的报酬。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:522
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:522
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wanda Lightsworn, Grand Master of Learning, is in the hire of Charles Quixote, and instructs all of his knights in the skills of Learning.\nIt is the hope of Charles Quixote that this will give his forces and edge in battle against the Dragons of Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "汪达·来特史汪是学习术的宗师级导师，他居住在靠近绞刑峡谷的猎龙人营地中。查尔斯·吉柯德希望靠着他让他的骑士们获得战斗上的优势。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:523
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:523
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Flynn Shador, Expert Vampire, lives in the city of Twilight, serving as eyes and a safe house for any Vampires that travel to that region.\nHe can instruct you in the Expert abilities of a Vampire."
msgstr "佛林·沙达是专家级吸血鬼能力的导师，他目前居住在阴影塔地区的黎明城中。他也是旅行到该处的吸血鬼耳目和庇护所的提供者。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:524
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:524
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Douglas Dirthmoore, Master Vampire, will teach any whose skills measure up to his standards.\nOnce he is done with you, you will have Mastered the abilities native to all Vampires.\nHis home is in the Shadowspire village of Twilight."
msgstr "道格拉斯·德斯摩尔是大师级的吸血鬼能力教师，目前居住在阴影塔区域的黎明城中。当他教导了你相关的知识之后，你才能够达到吸血鬼能力大师级别。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:525
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:525
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though no one knows for sure, Payge Arachnia, Grand Master Vampire, is rumored to be the first Vampire on the continent of Jadame. She knows all there is to be known about living as a Vampire and can teach you the Grand Master abilities she possesses.\nSeek out her lair in Shadowspire."
msgstr "虽然没有人能够确定，但是据说佩吉·阿拉尼雅是贾丹姆大陆上的第一个吸血鬼，她也是吸血鬼能力的宗师级导师，目前她的巢穴位于阴影塔中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:526
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:526
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fedwin Dervish, can instruct you in the Expert ways of the Dark Elf.\nOnce you have learned from him, you will have begun a great journey to becoming a leader of your people.\nSearch him out in the Dark Elf city of Alvar."
msgstr "费德温·德维禧可以教导你专家级的黑暗精灵能力，你可以在黑暗精灵的阿尔瓦城中找到他。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:527
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:527
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lanshee Caverhill, Master Merchant of Alvar currently lives in the seaside port of Ravenshore.\nShe knows all about Mastering the natural abilities all Dark Elves have."
msgstr "蓝西·卡佛希尔居住在渡鸦海滨这座滨海的城市中，她可以教导你大师级的黑暗精灵能力。在你从她那边学到相关的知识之后，你才会开始迈向黑暗精灵领袖的伟大道路。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:528
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:528
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ton Agraynel, Master Merchant of Alvar, can instruct you in the Grand Master skills of a Dark Elf.\nYou will have to prove yourself worthy of his instruction, but the benefits are well worth the effort."
msgstr "堂·爱格瑞尼尔可以教导你宗师级的黑暗精灵能力，他就居住在阿尔瓦这座城市中。你必须要证明自己的能力才能够获得他的教导，但这一切都是值得的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:529
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:529
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ishton, Junior Flight Leader of the Dragons of Garrote Gorge, instructs all young Dragons to an Expert skill level with their racial Dragon abilities.\nHe dwells here, in the Dragon Caves of Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "伊斯顿是绞刑峡谷少年飞龙队的领袖，他可以指导所有年轻的飞龙学习专家级的飞龙能力。他就居住在绞刑峡谷中的龙穴内。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:531
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:531
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Klain Scarwing, is second in strength only to Deftclaw Redreaver himself.\nKlain holds the title of Grand Master Dragon and instructs all Dragons in the use of their natural abilities.\nSee him if you wish to attain Grand Master status.\nHe dwells here in the Dragon Caves of Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "克兰·疤翅居住在绞刑峡谷的龙穴中，他可以教导飞龙宗师级的技能。如果你想要获得宗师级的地位和知识，请去找它。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:532
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:532
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Cleric sent you back with the Gem of Restoration?\nI am free of this place!\nSearch me out if you wish for me to ever travel with you!\nIt would be my pleasure to join you in your journeys!\nI will wait for you at the Adventurer's Inn in Ravenshore."
msgstr "牧师们派你带着回复之宝石回来了？我终于脱离了这个地方的禁锢！如果你们想要我的帮助，再来找我就好了！能够和你们一起旅行是我的荣耀！我会在渡鸦海滨的冒险者旅店等你！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:533
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:533
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have not slain all of the vermin.\nI have reports here that tell of Dragons still in the region.\nReturn when you have slain them all!"
msgstr "你们没有杀光所有的飞龙。情报指出此地还有飞龙出没。在你杀光他们全部之后再回来找我。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:534
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:534
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have not slain all of the Dragon hunters.\nA Flight returned just moments ago and reported seeing them out on the plains.\nReturn when you have slain them all!"
msgstr "你们没有杀光所有的猎龙骑士。情报指出此地还有猎龙人出没。在你杀光他们全部之后再回来找我。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:536
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1623
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:536
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:719
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You need ore for me to create weapons.\nThe better the ore, the better the weapon I can make."
msgstr "你们必须给我更多的矿石来打造兵器，矿石质量越高，兵器就越好。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:538
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1625
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:538
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:721
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You need ore for me to create armor.\nThe better the ore, the better the armor I can make."
msgstr "你们必须给我更多的矿石来打造盔甲，矿石质量越高，盔甲就越好。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:540
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1627
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:540
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:723
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You need ore for me to create items.\nThe better the ore, the better the items I can make."
msgstr "你们必须给我更多的矿石来制造物品，矿石质量越高，物品就越好。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:541
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:541
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "To be declared Arcomage Champion, you must win a game of Arcomage in every tavern on, in, and under the continent of Jadame.\nThere are 11 such taverns sponsoring Arcomage events.\nWhen you have accomplished this, return to me to claim the prize."
msgstr "要成为“魔幻牌”的霸主，你必须在贾丹姆大陆地面上、下的所有酒吧里面赢得一次的胜利。有十一个酒吧有举办“魔幻牌”的竞赛。当你完成了这项壮举之后，回来找我领取奖赏。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:542
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:542
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must claim a victory at ALL 11 taverns.\nUntil you do, you cannot be declared Arcomage Champion."
msgstr "你必须要赢得所有的十一个酒吧中的比赛。在你完成之前，你没有办法成为“魔幻牌”霸主。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:543
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:543
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Congratulations!\nYou have become the Arcomage Champion!\nThe prize is waiting in the chest right outside my house."
msgstr "恭喜你！你已经成为了“魔幻牌”的霸主！奖品就在我屋子外面的宝箱里面等待着你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:550
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:550
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Grandmaster teacher in the ways of Body Magic, Tempus, can be found in the elven territory of Avlee.\nHis home is on an island somewhere in the central bay."
msgstr "肢体魔法宗师坦普斯住在埃里中部海湾里的小岛上。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:569
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know I speak for the guild when I say we owe you a debt of gratitude. I discharge this debt by granting you and your companions safe passage through all lands under our control. No guild member will kidnap you for arcane experimentation, nor will any member consider you feed for his servants, living or otherwise. This guild edict will be in effect for a period of one year from today.And of course, you have my personal, thanks."
msgstr "当我说我们很感激你的时候，我代表的是全公会。我现在给予你在公会管辖下所有土地自由通行的权力，以便还你这个人情债。没有任何的公会成员会绑架你进行魔法实验，也没有任何公会成员会让你成为他麾下使徒的食物。这个公会的饬令将会有一年的有效期。\n当然，我本人也对你非常感激。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:571
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The crystal placed by the Destroyer in the town square serves two functions. One, if we do nothing, it will destroy the world. Two, it acts as a gateway to another realm of existence--the Plane Between Planes--where the Destroyer most certainly has his base.The crystal calls forth the elemental forces into our world and draws them to it. When these forces meet here at the crystal, the world will be destroyed in cataclysm. If we are to prevent this someone will have to use the crystal as a gateway to reach the Destroyer and either convince him to end his assault, or eliminate him."
msgstr "毁灭者在城镇广场上放置的水晶有两个主要用途。第一，如果我们袖手旁观，它将可以摧毁整个世界。第二，这是一个通往另一个次元——界间之地——的传送门，很明显，界间之地就是毁灭者的基地。\n这个水晶将元素界的力量召唤进我们世界中，并且吸引他们往这个水晶的方向集中。当这些力量在水晶中会合的时候，整个世界将会被大灾变给摧毁。如果我们想要阻止这一切，一定得有人通过这个传送门去寻找毁灭者，说服他终止这样的行为，或是消灭他。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:572
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Since the crystal is attuned to the elemental forces, it will only pass through those who are themselves so attuned. I believe it is possible to create a key that will simulate attunement for a small group such as yourselves. I can make the key, but require components of pure elemental forces to do so.Such components exist in only one form that I know of. On each of the four elemental planes, you will find gemstones called the \"elemental hearts.\" Bring these to me and I will build the key to open the crystal gateway."
msgstr "由于这个水晶会和元素之力共振，所以他只容许拥有元素之力的人通过。我认为可以制造一个模拟元素共振的钥匙，让像你们这样的一小群人通过。我可以制造这把钥匙，但是我需要拥有纯粹元素之力的物品来制造它。\n这种物品我只知道以一种方式存在于这个世界。在每个元素界中，你们将可以找到一种被称为元素之心的宝石。将这些东西带给我，我将可以制造打开水晶传送门的钥匙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:575
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Something about this crystal seems to put a compulsion on the denizens of the elemental planes. Why else would they make war on our plane? I have heard yours and other first hand reports. It seems almost as if these elementals are driven by a madness.And madness it is! For destroying Enroth would create a mighty planar unbalance which would certainly victimize their own planes. They might even conceivably be themselves destroyed in the cataclysm. At the very least, they risk changing the nature of their own planes. I cannot see how such change could possibly be for the better!"
msgstr "这个水晶似乎让元素界的生物感应到了一种奇怪的力量。否则他们干嘛在我们的世界上掀起战火？我已经看过你们的第一手报告，看起来似乎这些元素都被一种疯狂的力量所影响。\n这的确是非常的疯狂！因为摧毁恩洛斯将有可能在元素界之间造成不平衡的状态，危及他们自己的空间，他们甚至可能在这场大灾变中把自己也给卷入。即使在最乐观的状况下，他们所居住空间的也会受到影响。我根本不明白，这样的改变怎么可能带来任何的好处？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:576
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "That the elemental lords are imprisoned on the Plane Between Planes explains much. I had wondered why the denizens of the Earth, Air, Water, and Fire Planes have become so hostile. Usually, they are content to keep to their own place in the order. I suppose it was necessary for the Destroyer to take the lords from their homelands. Without the lords calming presence, it would be much easier for him to compel the elementals as he has.It is important for you to free the elemental lords. They can restore order to their planes and prevent the cataclysm!"
msgstr "元素之王被囚禁在界间之地元的事实证明了一切。我一直怀疑为什么地水风火元素界的生物会变得这么狂暴。因为在一般的状况下，他们通常只喜欢居住在自己的空间中。我认为毁灭者必须要将这些元素之王绑架后，才能让他更为轻易地操纵这些元素生物。\n你一定要救出这些元素之王才行。只有他们能够逆转大灾变，阻止末日的发生！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:577
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes, I have heard the name, \"Escaton.\" He is variously called in the legends of many cultures. I know not his nature, but it is his purpose to destroy worlds.Yes, \"worlds,\" I say. More and more evidence points to the conclusion that Enroth is not the only place in this universe where there is life. Tales from before the Silence speak of many living among the stars. Yes, it sounds impossible to think that one could live on a light in the sky, but consider that these stars may be like our sun. If this is so, then why can't these suns shine on other places like Enroth? If this was the case, then there could be a \"destroyer of worlds.\" I believe that this is what we face."
msgstr "是的，我的确听过这个名字。“爱斯卡顿”。他在许多的文化和传说中拥有不同的名字。我不知道他到底是什么样的生物，但是他诞生的目的就是为了摧毁不同的世界。\n是的，我说的是各个不同的世界。有越来越多的证据指出恩洛斯并非是宇宙间唯一的世界。在大寂静之前的许多历史记载说明了有其他的生物居住在星辰之间。生物似乎不太可能生活在天空上，但是，也许这些星辰就如同我们的太阳一样。如果是这样的话，为什么那些太阳不会照耀在如同我们的恩洛斯一样的地方？如果是这样的话，的确有可能诞生一个“众多世界的毁灭者”。而我认为目前所面对的就是这样的一个生物。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:578
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No, I don't think I will be leaving when the Ironfists continue their journey back to Enroth. Perhaps I will join with them in some years, but for now, I find myself fascinated by these lands. Though it is destroyed, I would study the remains of the crystal gateway. Never in my knowledge has there been in this world an artifact of comparable power. Perhaps I will find some use for the crystal shards?No matter. Regardless, when the Ironfists go, they will go without me."
msgstr "不，我不认为我会和艾恩法斯特家族一起回到恩洛斯。也许数年之后我会回到他们身边。但是目前我对于这些世界感到相当的有兴趣。虽然他们几乎都已经被摧毁了，但我愿意继续在这边研究水晶的碎片。就我所知，这个世界上从来没有任何这么强大力量的物品被创造出来。也许我可以替这些水晶找到一个作用？\n不管怎么样，艾恩法斯特家族离开的时候我不会跟他们一起走。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:579
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Without false modesty I must say that the Nightshade Brazier is the greatest creation of my dark arts. When its fires are properly tended, the accursed sun is incapable of shining within its area of influence. The soothing shadow of night takes up permanent residence over a vast region. Within these boundaries, vampires and other night creatures know freedoms they would not otherwise know. We are free of the crypts with no worries of the destroying light of day!And now the Temple of the Sun has taken my prize. It must be retrieved!"
msgstr "我不需要太过谦逊，因为龙葵灯炉的确是我很感到自豪的一个创造物。如果里面的火焰经过适当的处理，该死的太阳就没有办法在附近的区域中发出光芒。夜晚舒适的阴影将会笼罩一大部分的区域。在这区域中，吸血鬼和其它的黑夜生物将拥有前所未见的自由。我们将可以自由自在地在白天漫游，不用担心被阳光所毁灭！\n太阳神庙这次夺取了我的宝物，我们一定要将它夺回才行！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:580
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am Escaton the Destroyer also called \"Devil's Doom,\" \"The Spider in the Web Gate\" and \"Ruin.\" There are places where I am worshiped as a god. But to myself I think of myself only as a servant to my greater masters.Know too that I have brought the cataclysm to your world, which must be destroyed. It is a doom you have brought on yourselves by failing to eliminate the devil Kreegans from your realms. "
msgstr "我是毁灭者爱斯卡顿，又被称作“恶魔末日”、“蛛网之门中的蜘蛛”、或是“废墟”。有些地方把我当做天神看待。但是，我自认为是更高力量主人的仆从。\n我这次的任务是将灾变带来到你们的世界中，因为这个世界必须被摧毁。这是由于你们无法把邪恶的克里根人彻底摧毁所带来的末日。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:584
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "At one time my ancient masters were caretakers of more worlds than there are apples in a bushel. Before the Kreegans--before the Silence--they were worlds of wonder. My masters were kings and queens of a golden civilization. I was made, not because I was needed, but because I could be made--a protector of that which needed no protection...a symbol of might to a mighty people.But now, and for a millennium, the Kreegan blight has eaten away the splendor of the worlds. And so have my masters fallen. They are warlords and generals, and I am their greatest soldier."
msgstr "在远古的时代，我的主人们是许多许多世界的照顾者。在克里根人降临，也就是在大寂静之前，这个宇宙中充满了让人惊奇的奇迹。我的主人是伟大文明的皇后和国王。我之所以被制造出来，不是因为他们需要我，而是因为他们有能力制造我。我是个保护不需要保护的宇宙的守护者……是伟大生命力量之象征。\n但是现在，从许多许多年以前开始，克里根的瘟疫吞噬了世界的光辉。我的主人们也跟着倒下。他们是战将和君主，我则是他们最勇猛的士兵。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:586
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The cataclysm was brought into being when I performed the ritual Convocation of Cataclysm which brought into being the crystal. It is a weapon of last resort created by my masters to defend themselves against the Kreegans.I do have other weapons. But when I became aware of the Kreegans infestation on your world, I deemed the use of ultimate force necessary. Your world has fallen so far--it seemed certain you would not be able to defend yourselves against my enemies. Though I underestimated your abilities, and the Kreegans were ultimately destroyed, I still feel that I was right to err on the side of caution."
msgstr "当我进行灾变召唤仪式时，大灾变就开始了。这是我的主人们创造出来对付克里根人的最后武器。\n我的确有其他的武器。但是，当我发现克里根人进入你的世界之后，我就认为最后武器的使用是无可避免的。你们的世界曾经陷入了极大的危机，看起来你们似乎没有自卫的能力。虽然我小看了你们的能力，而克里根人最后也被摧毁了，为了保险，我依旧觉得必须导正这一切。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:588
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Convocation of Cataclysm, as powerful as it is, cannot of itself destroy a world. Each of the elemental planes is ruled by a lord. These lords can fight the compulsion placed on their lesser subjects. For this reason, I have removed the lords from their realms. They are my \"guests\" for the time being.Once the cataclysm has run its course, I will return them so that they might rebuild your realm and theirs."
msgstr "灾变召唤仪式虽然非常强大，但却不可能单靠己身而摧毁整个世界。每个元素界都在一个元素之王的统治之下。这些元素之王可以反抗对他们属下的引诱。因此，我已经将这些元素之王从他们的世界中抓了出来。他们目前是我的“客人”。\n一旦大灾变结束之后，我将会把他们放回去，好让他们重建自己的世界和你们的世界。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:589
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "In the time since the Silence, your world has lost knowledge of the Kreegan's origin. That they resemble the devils of myth has been enough for you, and indeed, \"devils\" is what most call them. The truth is they came from the beyond. Before they attacked us, my masters had no knowledge of them.The Kreegans infest our worlds and spread if they can. It would seem in an endless universe that they could expand in another direction than ours. But they have not made this choice so we must defend ourselves from them."
msgstr "从大寂静之后，你的世界已经忘记了克里根人的起源。对你们来说，他们和恶魔一样的这个事实就已经够了。的确，大多数的人也叫他们作恶魔。他们是从宇宙的边缘出现的。在他们攻击我们之前，我的主人们根本不知道他们的存在。\n克里根人感染我们的世界，并且尽可能地扩张。如果他们选择往另外一个方向发展，这个宇宙其实是无限大的。但是他们并没有做出这样的选择，所以我们必须防御他们的攻击。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:590
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am aware that the king and queen of Enroth have rid your world of Kreegans. Still, your world is to be destroyed. Once I am called, I must perform the Convocation. Once the Convocation is begun, it must continue.I was called while Kreegan still lived on your world. It matters not that they were dust by the time I arrived."
msgstr "我知道恩洛斯的国王和皇后毁灭了这些恶魔。但是，我必须要摧毁你们的世界。一旦我受到了召唤，我就必须要执行仪式。一旦仪式开始了，大灾变就必须继续下去。\n我被召唤的时候是那些克里根人还存在于这个世界上的时候，即使他们在我到达的时候都已经化成灰烬了也没有影响。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:592
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As far as I'm able to feel such, I am amazed that your world was able to eliminate its Kreegan infestation. They are quite a bit more…advanced than you. The king and queen of Enroth must be strategists of the highest order. Too bad that they were not able to finish their task sooner.If I could regret, I would regret having to needlessly annihilate your world."
msgstr "从我有限的思考模式看起来，我很惊讶你们能够消灭克里根人。他们比你们要先进许多……恩洛斯的国王和皇后一定是超凡的战略家才有可能达成这个任务。真可惜他们不能早点完成这个任务。\n如果我拥有后悔功能的话，我会觉得如此摧毁你们的世界真是遗憾。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:593
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes, your world does need saving! The cataclysm, if not stopped, will destroy it utterly.A quandary for you: I, as bringer of the cataclysm know how it can be ended. Further, I acknowledge that since there are no longer Kreegans on your world it need not be destroyed. But, as servant to my masters, I am compelled to let the cataclysm continue by not divulging my knowledge to you.Still I will ask you some questions. Perhaps there is something for you in the answers?"
msgstr "是的，你的世界的确需要被拯救！大灾变如果不被阻止，将会彻底摧毁这个世界。\n我可以给你一个提示：我身为大灾变的召唤者，当然知道该如何阻止大灾变。另外，我也知道由于你的世界上已经没有克里根人的存在，这个世界不需要被摧毁。但是，身为主人的仆从，我必须要让大灾变继续进行，避免因为我对你透露消息，而让大灾变被终止。\n所以，我会问你一些问题，也许这些问题的答案就是你所找寻的线索。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:594
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though I must destroy your world, what I need do I have already done. Until the cataclysm has culminated, there is nothing to stop me from indulging you with my conversation. This cannot continue forever. Nothing does.Sometimes questions create more questions. Sometimes they provide answers. I wonder what my questions will provide you?"
msgstr "虽然我必须要摧毁你的世界，但是我该做的都已经做了。在大灾变结束之前，我没有别的任务让我不能和你讲话。不过，这也不能够持续到永远。没有事情可以持续到永远。\n有些时候，问题会创造出更多的问题来。有些时候他们反而可以提供解答。不知道我的问题可以提供给你什么样的信息？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:595
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My masters have made me a holder, and not a giver, of knowledge. Still perhaps you have given yourself knowledge through my questions? I have given you all the questions I will, so you must look at what you have. Perhaps you should question the answers.A \"prison\" implies a prisoner. Who? \"Inside?\" Inside of what? And \"egg.\" What kind of egg? A bird's egg? Perhaps something like an egg?"
msgstr "我的主人创造我是让我成为知识的保管者，并非给予者。但是，也许你们可以通过这些问题知道更多的知识。我已经把我所有知道的问题都告诉了你们，你们必须要看看自己有些什么。也许你们应该对这些答案提出进一步的问题才对。\n\n“监狱”代表着有犯人。谁？“里面”？在什么里面？还有“蛋”，什么样的蛋？鸟的蛋？也许是形状像是蛋的物品？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:596
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:596
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Where does one serve to pay,\nIs not free to leave,\nBut is free when one leaves?"
msgstr "有个地方，人们进入此地是为了偿还一些东西，\n此地不能自由离开。\n但是离开之后就获得了自由。这是什么地方？\n请输入数字：1、商店；2、王宫；3、行会；4、监狱"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:600
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:600
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What is there when\nYou enter a room,\nAnd cannot be outside,\nThough you leave the door open?"
msgstr "当你进入一个房间，你就感受到了它，\n你把门打开，它却无法离开。这是什么？\n请输入数字：1、外面；2、里面；3、房主；4、房主的宠物"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:604
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:604
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A moon colored box\nmeant to be opened from the inside\nprotects the sun colored\ntreasure of life.\nWhat is it?"
msgstr "如同月亮一样颜色的容器，\n存在的目的是为了被从里面打开，\n容器保护着里面如同太阳一样颜色的生命之宝藏。\n这是什么？\n请输入数字：1、蛋；2、锅；3、纸盒；4、箱子"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:608
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I would judge that you've answered the riddles correctly. I suppose in asking them to you I have in some way helped you. As far as I and my nature are concerned, this is sufficient.As a reward for your performance, take this small bauble. I have more than one and therefore, more than I require. And see? I can give it to you because I don't know you have the knowledge to use it."
msgstr "你已经正确回答了所有的谜题。我觉得在询问你的过程中，我已经通过某些方法帮了你的忙，这应该足够了。由于我天性的限制，我也没法多说了。\n\n为了奖励你们的努力，请收下这个小玩意儿。我拥有不只一个，因此我不需要这么多。你知道吗？我能够把它给你，是因为我不知道你懂得如何使用它。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:620
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:620
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yellow Fever is a very crippling disease that pops up every few years.\nUsually we arrange for medicine from the mainland, but now that the bridges are destroyed, no one can make it to the docks!"
msgstr "黄热病是种会让人残障的传染病，每隔几年就会突然冒出来。通常我们会从主大陆那边进口药物，但是在桥梁被摧毁之后，没有人可以过去买药了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:621
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:621
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Here, take these scrolls of Cure Disease.\nMaybe we can at least prevent an epidemic!\nThe six huts on the outer islands are infected.\nIf the teleporters between the islands are repaired, you can take these scrolls to the huts.\nUnfortunately you will have to find three more scrolls in your travels."
msgstr "来，收下这些治愈疾病的卷轴。也许我们至少可以阻止传染病的散布。在外岛的六座小屋都被感染了。如果在各岛屿之间来往的传送门被修复了，你可以把这些卷轴送到那些小屋去。很不幸的，你必须要在旅途上再找到额外三个卷轴才够你使用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:622
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:622
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Yellow Fever epidemic is over!\nThank you for your help!"
msgstr "黄热病的流行已经结束了！多谢你的帮助！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:623
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:623
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hear that Yellow Fever is once again spreading through the people.\nUsually the water supply here on the main island is the primary source of the disease.\nWe used to get an Anointed Herb Potion from the mainland when the disease popped up.\nWithout access to the dock however, we cannot get this needed cure.\nIf you find a way to the mainland, perhaps the smugglers of Ravenshore have the cure.\nIf you can procure the Anointed Potion, return to me with it!"
msgstr "我听说黄热病又再度开始流行了。通常在主岛上的这个水源是主要疾病的来源。我们通常可以从主大陆上购买一种圣草药剂，用来阻止疫病的流行。但是，由于我们无法前往港口，我们也没办法找到需要的药剂。如果你能够前往主大陆，或许在渡鸦海滨的私枭们会拥有这药剂。如果你可以买到这东西，赶快带回来给我！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:624
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:624
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you!\nI will go introduce this to the water supply!"
msgstr "多谢你！我会把这东西倒进水源中的！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:625
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:625
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Perhaps you can bring me the basic ingredients for a Potion of Pure speed?\nWith them I can make this incredible potion and finish my studies in alchemy!\nI will reward you well for your assistance!"
msgstr "或许你可以把永恒速度药剂的药材带来给我？只要有了那些药材，我就可以完成我在炼金术上的研究，制造出这种药剂来！我会给予你相当的报酬！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:626
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:626
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Guild of Bounty Hunters serves the public by paying qualified individuals a fee for eliminating the threat of certain creatures or bandits in the realm of Jadame.\nTo achieve the rank of Novice Bounty Hunter you will have to earn 10,000 gold worth of bounties."
msgstr "赏金猎人公会基于服务大众的精神，他们愿意付给一些符合资格的猎人相当数量的赏金；只要他们能够消灭指定的生物和达到指定的数量。要获得赏金猎人生手的称号，你必须至少赚到一万金币的赏金才行。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:627
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:627
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The ingredients!\nThank you!\nTake this as a reward!"
msgstr "这些就是我需要的药材！多谢你！这是你的报酬！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:628
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:628
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I believe I may know how to stop the destructive force of the mountain of fire!\nI have found an ancient spell that should give me the power to send the mountain of fire back into the sea! To complete the spell I need an ancient relic called the Idol of the Snake.\nWith this item of power I should be able to complete the spell."
msgstr "我认为我已经找到了如何阻止火山毁灭力量的方法了！我找到一个古老的法术，可以将火山推回海中！要完成这个法术的施放，我必须要找到一个被称作蛇之圣像的古物。只要有了这个古物，我就可以完成这个法术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:629
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:629
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for returning with the Idol.\nUpon further study I discovered that the entire spell was useless.\nStill, this is not your fault and you deserve some reward for returning to me!"
msgstr "多谢你把这个圣像找来给我。很不幸地，在我进一步研究了这个法术之后，我发现它根本没用。不过，这不是你的问题，我还是会付你承诺的报酬的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:630
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:630
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The packs of Dire Wolves that roam this region are a threat to travelers and commerce.\nThe Merchants of Alvar have instructed me to hire competent people to hunt down these wolves and to \"thin the pack\" in their words.\nYou look like skilled adventurers!\nI will reward you well if you can eliminate the entire pack and those in their lair."
msgstr "在这个地区肆虐的猛狼已经成了旅行者和商人们重大的威胁。阿尔瓦的商人们已经下令要我寻找出色的猎人来猎杀这些动物，并且有效地“降低威胁”。你看起来像是不错的对象！如果你能够杀死巢穴里面的所有猛狼，我会给予你相当的奖赏！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:632
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:632
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The pack has been wiped out? Excellent!\nOf course I will need to find a new business for myself.\nThank you for your efforts.\nPlease take this reward."
msgstr "整群猛狼已经被消灭了？太好了！当然，我得替自己找个新工作，不过，请先收下这个奖赏吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:633
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:633
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Merchants of Alvar took my family into what they termed \"protective custody\" and use this as the means to secure my services. However as the caravan with my family was returning to Alvar, they were attacked by Ogres and bandits.\nThe Ogre Zog, took my family from them!\nHe took them to his fortress in the Alvar region.\nNow, I am to spy on the Merchants of Alvar for him.\nAs long as I do so, my family lives.\nIf I stop, they die.\nCan you rescue them for me?"
msgstr "阿尔瓦的商人公会抓走了我的家人，以便确保我的忠诚。但是，在回去阿尔瓦的路上，他们的车队受到了食人妖和强盗的攻击。食人妖索格抓走了我的家人！他把我的家人带到了他在阿尔瓦地区的要塞中。现在，我被迫必须要替他注意阿尔瓦商人的动向。只要我服从他的命令，我的家人就可以继续活下来。如果我停了下来，他们就会死。你可以替我救出他们来吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:634
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:634
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I send periodic reports of the activities of the Merchants of Alvar to the Dread Pirate Stanley in the tavern, The Pirate's Rest on the Island of Regna. Now that the Merchants have \"bargained\" for my assistance, we must deliver a false set of reports to keep Stanley from being suspicious.\nTake this report to him in Harecksburg on the island of Regna!"
msgstr "我固定会送出有关阿尔瓦商人的情报给恐怖海盗史坦力，他人就在雷格那岛上的海盗休息站酒吧中。由于阿尔瓦的商人们已经“争取”到了我的协助，我们必须要送一份假情报给史坦力，避免他起疑。把这份报告拿去给他！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:635
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:635
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You delivered the report to Stanley?\nThis is will at least buy us sometime before he becomes suspicious of the activities here in Ravenshore and those of the Merchants in Alvar."
msgstr "你把假情报给了史坦力？这至少可以替我们争取一点时间，让他不会对渡鸦海滨和阿尔瓦商人公会的行动起疑。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:636
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:636
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hear that you are looking for an Anointed Herb potion to purify the water supply.\nThe Smugglers of Jadame deal with all kind of strange goods.\nIf anyone would know about or have this anointed herb potion, it would be them!"
msgstr "我听说你正在找寻一份圣草药剂来净化水源。贾丹姆大陆上的走私者拥有各式各样的诡异货物。如果世界上会有任何人拥有这样物品，那就一定是他们了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:639
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:639
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Many decades ago, the legendary Priest of the Sun, Camien Thryce, led a crusade against the Necromancers' Guild in Shadowspire.\nThe Guild was able to defeat Thryce's forces with the aid of the Vampires that also dwell in the Shadowspire region.\nCamien Thryce carried with him the clerical artifact called Eclipse with him into battle.\nThe shield was lost when Thryce was struck down by a Nosferatu in the final battle."
msgstr "许多年以前，太阳神庙的传奇主教卡米安·特来斯对阴影塔地区的死灵法师公会掀起了一场圣战。公会靠着居住在阴影塔地区的吸血鬼帮助而击败了太阳神庙。卡米安在战斗的时候携带着牧师的圣器“日蚀”盾牌投入战场。当特来斯在最后的战役中被一名血之尊皇击毙之后，这个盾牌也跟着消失了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:640
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:640
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have recovered the shield, Eclipse?\nThe Temple is grateful for you help in recovering this potent artifact.\nPlease, continue to carry the shield with our blessing."
msgstr "你找到了日蚀这个盾牌了吗？神庙永远感谢你替我们找回了这个重要的神器。请带着我们的祝福继续使用这个盾牌吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:641
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:641
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Have you rescued my family?\nI cannot guarantee that I will continue to provide my services unless they are safe!"
msgstr "你救出了我的家人了吗？在你保证他们的安全之前，我没办法提供你我的情报。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:644
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:644
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The forces of the Ogre Mage, Zog moved into this area right around the time that the bright flash traveled across the night sky.\nThey harass and even kill travelers who seek to reach the city of Alvar. It would be of great service to Alvar if you were to eliminate all of the Ogres that harass the roads to Alvar and the Ogres in the fortress near the city of Alvar.\nReturn to me when you have killed all of the ogres in this region, and I will reward you."
msgstr "食人妖法师索格和他的部队就在天空出现一道白光的时候出现在这里。他们骚扰此地的居民，并且杀害想要前往阿尔瓦的旅人。如果你们可以杀死所有在附近区域和要塞里面的食人妖，这对阿尔瓦来说将是个福音。当你杀死了所有的食人妖之后，请回来找我，我会给予你适当的奖赏。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:645
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:645
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have not defeated all of the Ogres!\nThe roads will not be safe until they are destroyed!"
msgstr "你没有杀死所有的食人妖！如果你不把他们全部都杀光，道路上就没有安全可言！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:646
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:646
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent!\nNow that the Ogres are cleared from the roads and no longer inhabit the fortress, the roads to Ravenshore, Ironsand and Murmurwoods are safe again!\nPlease take this 5000 gold as reward!"
msgstr "太好了！现在食人妖都已经被杀光，通往渡鸦海滨、铁沙漠和低语森林的道路又再度安全了！请收下我这5000个金币当做奖赏！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:647
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:647
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A Potion of Pure Luck would be of great assistance to any merchant.\nOne could stumble upon any number of great deals if his Luck was at its highest!\nBring me the basic ingredients for a Potion of Pure Luck and I will reward you well!"
msgstr "强化运气药剂将会对任何商人来说是个不错的辅助道具。如果一个人的运气值很高，他将可以遇到各种各样的好运！把强化运气药剂的药材带来给我，我将会给你相当丰富的报酬！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:648
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:648
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings Novice Bounty Hunter! The Guild of Bounty Hunters serves the public by paying qualified individuals a fee for eliminating the threat of certain creatures or bandits in the realm of Jadame.\nTo achieve the rank of Journeyman Bounty Hunter you will have to earn a total bounty of 30,000 gold."
msgstr "赏金猎人公会基于服务大众的精神，他们愿意付给一些符合资格的猎人相当数量的赏金；只要他们能够消灭指定的生物和达到指定的数量。要获得赏金猎人老手的称号，你必须至少赚到三万金币的赏金才行。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:649
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:649
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent!\nWith this I can brew another Potion of Pure Luck.\nTake this potion as your reward!"
msgstr "太好了！只要有了这些药材，我就可以做出另外一瓶药剂来。这瓶药剂就是你的奖赏！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:650
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:650
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wasp stingers!\nFrom cold remedies to herbal teas, a little bit of ground wasp stinger goes a long way!\nDon't trust those who sell that weak ground wyvern horn!\nOnly wasp stinger will do if you want the best!\nI'll pay you for every stinger you bring me!"
msgstr "黄蜂刺！从治疗感冒到在草药茶里面添加味道，黄蜂刺永远都十分的好用！别相信那些贩卖地面双足翼龙之角的家伙！只有黄蜂刺的效力最高最强！只要你带黄蜂刺来，我一定会付钱给你！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:652
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:652
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Trolls have a natural fear of fire!\nMany of us perished when the Gate of Fire opened and spilled out the lake of fire! Without appropriate protection, there was nothing we could do."
msgstr "巨魔天性就怕火！当火焰之门打开，吐出火焰的大湖时，有许多同胞就是因为这样而牺牲！没有适当的保护，我们根本无法生存下来！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:653
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:653
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The survivors in this region need Potions of Fire Resistance!\nWith them we can survive until a place is found for us to move to!\nTake these potions!\nUnfortunately they are all I have!\nDeliver them to the six southernmost houses that remain standing in the village of Rust!"
msgstr "这一区的幸存者需要御火药剂！有了这些药剂，我们可以暂时苟延残喘，等到找到新的住所为止！收下这些药剂！不过我也只有这些药剂了！把这些药剂送到铁锈镇最南边的六座屋子去！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:654
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:654
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have not delivered Potions of Fire Resistance to all of the houses!\nIf the lake of fire grows in size everyone will perish!"
msgstr "你还没有把御火药剂送到所有的屋子里面去！如果火湖往外扩张，所有的人都会死！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:655
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:655
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have at least pushed our demise away for a time, but a new home needs to be found for us!\nThank you for delivering the Potions of Fire Resistance!"
msgstr "你至少暂时帮我们把末日往后拖延了一阵子，但我们还是必须要找到一个新家才行！不过，还是多谢你替我们把御火药剂送过去！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:656
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:656
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Endurance.\nThat ability which keeps a warrior on his feet, or lets him down gently as he slides into unconsciousness.\nA Potion of Pure Endurance can boost a person's ability to take damage to a legendary strength!\nBring me the basic ingredients of a Potion of Pure Endurance and I will reward you well."
msgstr "耐力是让战士继续支撑的力量，至少也会让他倒下的时候不会那么的突然。强化耐力药剂可以让人的耐力大幅提升，进而承受极大的打击！把强化耐力药剂的药材带过来给我，我就会给予你适当的奖赏。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:657
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:657
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Greetings Journeyman Bounty Hunter! The Guild of Bounty Hunters serves the public by paying qualified individuals a fee for eliminating the threat of certain creatures or bandits in the realm of Jadame.\nTo achieve the rank of Master Bounty Hunter you will have to earn a total bounty of 70,000 gold."
msgstr "赏金猎人公会基于服务大众的精神，他们愿意付给一些符合资格的猎人相当数量的赏金；只要他们能够消灭指定的生物和达到指定的数量。要获得赏金猎人大师的称号，你必须至少赚到七万金币的赏金才行。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:658
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:658
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have brought me the ingredients as asked!\nI am indeed grateful.\nTakes this potion as your reward."
msgstr "你已经把我所需要的药材带来了！非常感谢你。收下这个药剂当做奖励吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:659
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:659
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Dragonbane Flower has many medicinal uses.\nIt also has some uses that are less than medicinal.\nFrom this flower we can distill a poison that is deadly to Dragons.\nWith it we should be able to make quick work of the Dragon vermin that infest this region.\nFind this flower and return to me with it.\nYou will not be disappointed by my reward."
msgstr "克龙之花有许多医药上的用途。它同时也拥有几种与医药并没有太大关系的用途。从这种花朵中，我们可以粹取出一种剧毒，可以有效地杀死飞龙。只要有了这种剧毒，我们应该可以很快地将此地区的飞龙通通杀死。找到这朵花，拿回来给我。我给你的奖赏不会让你失望的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:660
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:663
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:660
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:663
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I asked for the Dragonbane Flower and you return empty handed.\nWhy waste my time?"
msgstr "我请你帮我找克龙之花，你竟然空手回来。你干嘛要浪费我的时间？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:661
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:661
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes, this is indeed the Dragonbane Flower.\nOnce we have distilled the poison, we will wipe the Dragon population out!"
msgstr "没错。这就是我所需要的克龙之花，一旦我们提炼出毒液来，我们就应该可以很快地消灭这些飞龙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:662
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:662
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Dragonbane Flower has many medicinal uses.\nIt also has some uses that are less than medicinal.\nFrom this flower a poison is made that is deadly to dragons, but the poison's antidote is also found in its petals. Find this flower and return to me with it.\nYou will not be disappointed by my reward."
msgstr "克龙之花有许多医药上的用途。它同时也拥有几种与医药并没有太大关系的用途。从这种花朵中可以粹取出一种可以有效杀死飞龙的剧毒。但这种剧毒的解毒剂也可以通过花瓣来提炼。找到这朵花，拿回来给我。我给你的奖赏不会让你失望的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:664
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:664
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes, this is indeed the Dragonbane Flower.\nOnce the petals are ingested we will be protected from the poison that the Dragon Hunter's would use against us.\n"
msgstr "没错。这就是我所需要的克龙之花，一旦我们提炼出解毒剂来，我们就应该不会受到猎龙人所用的剧毒威胁。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:665
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:665
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You seek to gain the favor of Charles Quixote?\nHelp us in his crusade against the Dragons of Garrote Gorge. If all of the Dragons in the region and in the Dragon Cave are slain, Charles Quixote will be sure to hear of your name! Return to me when they are all dead!\nI will reward you well."
msgstr "你想要争取查尔斯·吉柯德的青睐？很简单，你只需要协助他对抗绞刑峡谷的飞龙。如果这个区域和龙穴里面的飞龙都被杀死了，查尔斯·吉柯德一定会对你另眼相看！当他们都死掉之后，回来找我！我会给予你相当的奖赏！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:666
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:666
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have slain the vermin!\nHere is the reward that I promised!\nI will also personally mention your assistance to Charles Quixote!"
msgstr "你已经杀光了那些害虫！这就是我之前所承诺的奖赏！我会亲自跟吉柯德报告你的努力的！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:667
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:667
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You seek the favor of Deftclaw Redreaver?\nDon't we all?\nIf you were to kill all of the Dragon hunters in the Garrote Gorge wilderness, I would be certain to mention you to him.\nI would also be in the position to offer you a generous reward!"
msgstr "你想要获得达夫克劳·红斧的青睐？我们不都是一样吗？如果你能够杀死绞刑峡谷野外所有的猎龙人，我一定会在他面前提到你的功绩。我也会提供给你丰富的奖赏！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:668
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:668
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The infernal dragon hunters of Charles Quixote are dead? Fantastic!\nWe can once again enjoy the peace of Garrote Gorge without fear.\nHere is your promised reward!\nI will go speak with Deftclaw Redreaver of your bravery this instant!"
msgstr "查尔斯·吉柯德的所有猎龙人都已经死了？太好了！我们又可以再度享受绞刑峡谷的宁静了。这就是我之前承诺你的奖赏！我会立刻去参见达夫克劳，告诉他有关你的勇敢表现！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:669
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:669
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Drum of Victory needs to be recovered if we are to ever defeat the Dragons in this region.\nIf you were to recover the Drum I would reward you well!"
msgstr "如果我们要击败这个地区的飞龙，一定要找回胜利之鼓。如果你替我们把胜利之鼓找回来，我会给你非常丰厚的奖赏！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:670
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:670
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Drum of Victory was brought here by Charles Quixote.\nIts deafening sound drives terror into the heart of any Dragon who hears it.\nUnfortunately is was lost in a battle against the Nagas when Charles Quixote was trying to establish his keep, here in Garrote Gorge."
msgstr "胜利之鼓是查尔斯·吉柯德所带来的。它震耳欲聋的声音会让每只听见的飞龙心中都感到无比的恐惧。很不幸的，当查尔斯意图在这里创建营地的时候，胜利之鼓在与蛇龙的战斗中不见了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:671
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:671
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have returned with the Drum of Victory!\nCharles will be grateful for its return!\nHere is your promised reward."
msgstr "你带回了胜利之鼓！查尔斯将会非常感谢你的！这是我答应你的奖赏！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:672
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:672
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "For years the Guild of Necromancers has searched for the Bone of Doom.\nThe powerful artifact would be of great use to them if recovered.\nIf you were to find this item and bring it to me, you will be rewarded beyond your wildest dreams."
msgstr "死灵法师公会已经找了毁灭之骨好一阵子了。这个威力强大的物品将会让他们发展很多新的法术。如果你能够替我找到这样宝物，并且将它带来给我，我将会给予你梦想中最庞大的奖励！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:673
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:673
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "In times almost forgotten a powerful Necromancer named Zacharia almost dominated all of Jadame.\nHis mastery of the dark arts of necromancy and the elemental magics were combined with an unnaturally strong afinity for Dark energy. His legions of undead helped him enslave all peoples, including the Dark Elves of Alvar.\nA plan was made by the Temple of the Sun to defeat Zacharia.\nUtilizing the combined might of all of the Clerics in the Temple they forged the sword named Solkrist.\nThe Patriarch of the Temple led the legions of the Sun against the forces of Zacharia.\nThe battle raged for years after which the forces of the Temple of the Sun found themselves at the base of the dreaded Shadowspire.\nThere the Patriarch battled Zarcharia in single combat. At the end of the battle both the Patriarch and Zacharia lay dead.\nThe Patriarch had cut the left arm from Zacharia's body just as the Necromancer's last spell stopped the Patriarch's heart.\nThe power of the sword Solkrist instantly slew the Necromancer.\nSolkrist disappeared forever in the mayhem after the fight, as did the arm of Zacharia.\nThe bone from this arm was so instilled with such Dark Magic that it was called the Bone of Doom."
msgstr "在几乎已经被众人所遗忘的过去，有一名强大的死灵法师萨查力亚几乎征服了全贾丹姆大陆。他对于黑暗类魔法和元素系魔法的研究都结合在黑暗力量的统御之下。他的不死军队协助他奴役所有的种族，包括了阿尔瓦的黑暗精灵。太阳神庙设法规划出攻击萨查力亚的战术，他们结合了太阳神庙中所有牧师的力量，创造出了一柄名为太阳圣剑的武器。神庙的大主教率领着太阳军团队抗萨查力亚的军队。这场战争持续了数年之久，最后太阳军团发现自己已经进入了恐怖的阴影塔地区。太阳神庙的主教一对一地单挑萨查力亚。在激战之后，俩人都壮烈战死了。正当萨查力亚的最后一个法术发出，让主教死亡之前，主教正好将萨查力亚的右臂给砍了下来。太阳圣剑的力量当场就杀死了萨查力亚。之后太阳圣剑和萨查力亚的右臂都同样消失在战后的混乱中。这个手臂中的骨头吸收了极为强大的黑暗力量，因此又被称作毁灭之骨。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:674
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:674
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, the Bone of Doom!\nThe legend of Zacharia will continue!\nHere is your reward!"
msgstr "啊，这就是毁灭之骨！萨查力亚的传说将会继续下去！这就是你的奖赏！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:675
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:675
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Some say that Iseldir's Puzzle Box is cursed and that use of it will make the owner go slowly mad.\nThis can't be true!\nAll of my studies have provided me with enough proof to determine that the box is the ultimate game in Jadame--not that ridiculous card game, Arcomage.\nThe last reported owner of Iseldir's Puzzle Box was Zanthora, who is also known as the Mad Necromancer of Shadowspire."
msgstr "有人说埃索朵的机关盒受到了诅咒，会让持有者慢慢地发疯。这绝对不是真的！我所有的研究都指出，这个机关盒是贾丹姆大陆上最好玩的游戏，那个愚蠢的魔幻牌纸牌根本不能和他比。根据情报显示，机关盒的最后一个持有者是冉索拉，也就是阴影塔地区的疯狂死灵法师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:676
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:676
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I ask you to recover the Puzzle Box and you return with nothing.\nSo you reward is nothing.\nReturn with the box!"
msgstr "我请你去帮我找机关盒，但是你什么都没有带回来。我也不可能给你任何奖赏。快离开吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:677
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:677
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Puzzle Box is mine!\nHours of mindless enjoyment at my finger tips!\nHere, take you reward for it is nothing compared to the box!"
msgstr "机关盒是我的了！我马上就可以享受无数个小时毫无意义的娱乐！我会给予你承诺的奖赏！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:678
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:678
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A Necromancer's greatest ability is his Intellect!\nWithout sufficient Intellect, a Necromancer can find himself without spell points when he needs them most! If you bring me the basic ingredients of a Potion of Pure Intellect, I will reward you with the potion that I create!"
msgstr "死灵法师最大的能力就是他的智力！如果没有足够的智力，死灵法师可能会在最需要法力的时候却没有足够的魔法值！如果你能够把强化智力的药剂所需要的药材带来给我，我会把调配出来的药剂送给你！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:680
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:680
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have returned with the ingredients, holding up you end of the bargain.\nHere is your Potion of Pure Intellect."
msgstr "你已经遵照协议把药剂的药材带了回来。这是我承诺你的强化智力药剂。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:681
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:681
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We seek to put to rest the soul of the Nosferatu called Korbu.\nWe have heard rumors that the vampires of Shadowspire seek to resurrect this ancient evil.\nThere is a Vial of Grave Dirt kept hidden in the Vampire Crypt in the region of Shadowspire that is instrumental in bringing Korbu back to life.\nFind us this vial and return it to us.\nWe will always be in your debt and we will reward you well."
msgstr "我们想要让一个叫做可布的血之尊皇安息。我们听说阴影塔地区的吸血鬼想要让这个远谷的邪恶复活。在阴影塔地区有一个吸血鬼墓窖，里面有一个坟土之瓶，必须要有这个物品才能够让可布复活。替我们找到这个瓶子，把它带回来给我们。我们会永远感激你，并且给予你适当的奖赏！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:682
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:682
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Korbu scattered vials of the dirt from his original grave to safe guard himself.\nThis way he could always gain access to the dirt and move his crypt if he needed to."
msgstr "可布四处散布他墓窖中的泥土，以防万一。如此他就可以随时接触自己坟墓中的泥土，并且随时迁移自己的墓穴。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:683
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:683
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, once we perform the Rites of Purification upon this dirt, Korbu will rest eternally.\nWe are in your debt and here is your reward as promised!"
msgstr "啊，一旦我们对这坟土执行了净化之仪式，可布就会永远地安息了。我们非常感激你，这是答应你的奖赏！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:684
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:684
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Personality--the cleric's truest strength.\nIf you were to provide me with the basic ingredients of a Potion of Pure Personality, I would be more than happy to brew one for you!\nBring me the ingredients!"
msgstr "个性是牧师最重要的力量。如果你能够提供给我强化个性药剂的药材，我将会替你酿制这药剂！把药材带来给我吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:685
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:685
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You are missing all or some of the needed ingredients.\nReturn when you have them all."
msgstr "你的药材没有找全，当你找齐药材之后再来找我吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:686
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:686
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, you learned the recipe or are very lucky!\nHere is your potion!"
msgstr "啊，你的运气真不错！这是我承诺你的药剂！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:687
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:687
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wyverns are one of the toughest creatures that roam the continent of Jadame.\nThe Ancient Wyvern can even slay the mightiest adventurer with one blow.\nThe horn of the Ancient Wyvern is said to have many medicinal any magical properties.\nThere are many people who pay well for ground wyvern horn."
msgstr "双足翼龙是贾丹姆大陆上四处乱跑的生物中最强悍的对手。远古双足翼龙甚至可以一击杀害最强壮的冒险者。远古双足翼龙的角据说拥有非常多的医药和魔法上的妙用。如果你能够弄到地面双足翼龙之角，会有许多人愿意支付不小的赏金。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:688
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:688
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will buy Wyvern horns from you for 1500 gold!\nI grind these horns up and sell them throughout Jadame.\nSomeday I hope to be able to ship them over sea to Enroth and Erathia.\nThat of course depends on whether the Pirates of Regna are still a problem to shipping or not!"
msgstr "我愿意付1500个金币！我会把这些角磨碎，卖给全贾丹姆大陆需要的人。我希望有一天能够将这些东西卖到恩洛斯和埃拉西亚去。当然，雷格那海盗也是很大的问题。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:690
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:690
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Accuracy can determine who lives and who dies in battle.\nIf you cannot hit your opponent you will surely perish!\nIf you bring me the ingredients of a Potion of Pure Accuracy, I will brew that potion for you."
msgstr "精确可以决定在战斗中谁生谁死。如果你不能够击中你的对手，你一定会死的！如果你可以把强化精确药剂所需要的药材带来给我，我就可以替你作出一瓶药剂来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:691
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:691
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have not found the treasure of the Dread Pirate Stanley!\n"
msgstr "你还没有找到恐怖海盗史坦力的宝藏！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:693
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:693
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The legendary Pirate Stanley is rumored to have stolen hundreds and thousands of gold pieces from the Merchants of Alvar.\nNo one has ever found where he has hidden his treasure.\nSome say it isn't even hidden on the Island of Regna."
msgstr "谣传伟大的海盗史坦力从阿尔瓦的商人公会手中偷走了数以百万计的金币。从来没有人能够找到他收藏钱财的地方。有些人说，他甚至没有把这些钱藏在雷格那岛上。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:694
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:694
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Years and years ago, I remember hearing that Stanley journeyed to Ravage Roaming to speak with the Ogre Mage Zog about a curse that had fallen upon him.\nApparently his memory was fading, and he was certain that an evil mage was responsible."
msgstr "很多很多年以前，我记得听说过史坦力曾经到残破镇去和食人妖法师索格讨论他所中的一个诅咒。很明显地，他的记忆已在逐渐减退，一定是某位邪恶的法师对他下的诅咒吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:695
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:695
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "He who finds the treasure of the Dread Pirate Stanley will be a rich person!\nWill that person be you?"
msgstr "找到恐怖海盗史坦力宝藏的家伙将会是个富有的人，那个人会是你吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:696
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:696
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tobersk fruit is native only to the Dagger Wound Island region.\nHere the mild winters and humid summers provide the perfect conditions for the Tobersk fruit to achieve the correct levels of sugar and juice.\nThe pulp masters in Ravenshore pay good money for the tobersk fruit."
msgstr "只有匕伤群岛会出产托伯斯克果。在此地，温和的冬天和潮湿的夏天让托伯斯克果可以成长到拥有足够的甜度和汁液。渡鸦海滨的商人愿意付重金来购买托伯斯克果。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:697
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:697
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tobersk brandy is favorite drink of the Lizardmen of Dagger Wound Island.\nSome call it an acquired taste.\nHow ever you look at it, it equals pure profit!"
msgstr "托伯斯克酒是匕伤群岛上蜥蜴人最喜欢的饮料。有些人认为这种饮料味道相当不错。不管如何，这种饮料都很有利润！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:698
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:698
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tobersk fruit is processed in Ravenshore into tobersk pulp.\nIts from this pulp that the master brewers in Alvar distill tobersk brandy."
msgstr "托伯斯克果是在渡鸦海滨处理成托伯斯克果汁。阿尔瓦的商人会从这些果汁中提炼出酒来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:699
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:699
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Here the mild winters and humid summers provide the perfect conditions for the tobersk fruit to achieve the correct levels of sugar and juice.\nHere you can purchase tobersk fruit so our pulp masters can labor over the fruit, processing it into tobersk pulp."
msgstr "只有此地会出产托伯斯克果。在此地，温和的冬天和潮湿的夏天让托伯斯克果可以成长到拥有足够的甜度和汁液。渡鸦海滨的商人愿意付重金来购买托伯斯克果，并且处理成托伯斯克果汁。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:700
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:700
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tobersk brandy is a favorite drink among the Lizardmen of Dagger Wound Island.\nSome call it an acquired taste.\nHow ever you look at it, it equals pure profit!\nBe gentle with the bottles as you travel back to the islands."
msgstr "托伯斯克酒是匕伤群岛上蜥蜴人最喜欢的饮料。有些人认为这种饮料味道相当不错。不管如何，这种饮料都很有利润！在你回到岛上的旅程中要小心携带这些瓶子喔！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:702
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:702
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Heartwood of Jadame is used by the vampires of the Shadowspire region in the construction of their coffins.\nThe Heartwood's durability provides the coffin's owner with many years of rest during the daylight hours."
msgstr "贾丹姆之心木是阴影塔地区的吸血鬼用来建造棺材的原料。心木的坚固材质可以让棺材的主人在白天获得充足的休息，并且可以耐用许多年。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:703
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:703
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Dried sunfish is a delicacy enjoyed by the High Clerics of the Temple of the Sun.\nThey pay good money for deliveries of this flaky, somewhat salty fish."
msgstr "风干翻车鱼是太阳神庙的牧师们非常喜爱的美食。他们愿意为了这种有些干扁的咸鱼付相当多的钱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:704
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:707
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:704
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:707
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Pirates of Regna like flamboyant jewelry!\nAmulets that fail to take enchantments cast by the Necromancers of Shadowspire fill this need quite well.\nThe Pirates pay some of their \"hard earned\" bounty to get these amulets."
msgstr "雷格那的海盗喜欢廉价的珠宝！无法接受死灵法师祝福的护身符正好满足了这个需求。海盗们会付相当多的金钱来购买这些护身符。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:705
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:705
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Heartwood of Jadame is used by the Vampires of the Shadowspire region in the construction of their coffins.\nThe Heartwood's durability provides the coffin's owner with many years of rest during the daylight hours."
msgstr "贾丹姆之心木是阴影塔地区的吸血鬼用来建造棺材的原料。心木的坚固材质可以让棺材的主人在白天获得充足的休息，并且可以耐用许多年。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:706
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:706
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Dried Sunfish is a delicacy enjoyed by the High Clerics of the Temple of the Sun.\nThey pay good money for deliveries of this flaky, somewhat salty fish."
msgstr "风干翻车鱼是太阳神庙的牧师们非常喜爱的美食。他们愿意为了这种有些干扁的咸鱼付相当多的钱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:708
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:708
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Purchase Silver Dust of the Sea made by the Necromancers of Shadowspire. It is used by the smugglers of Ravenshore to hide their boats.\nIt provides the boats with a limited form of invisibility."
msgstr "死灵法师所制造的海之银尘有相当大的需求。渡鸦海滨的私枭们会利用这种东西来隐藏他们的船只，这可以提供一段时间的隐形。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:709
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:709
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ground Wyvern Horn is reported to be one of the most potent reagents used by the necromancers of Shadowspire.\nUnlike the reagents used by alchemists, this reagent is only used by the highest ranking members of the Necromancers' Guild."
msgstr "地面双足翼龙之角据说是死灵法师所最需要的药材。这和炼金术士所使用的药材不一样，只有死灵法师公会中最高级的成员才能够使用这种药材。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:711
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:711
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Purchase Silver Dust of the Sea made by the necromancers of Shadowspire. It is used by the Smuggler's of Ravenshore to hide their boats.\nIt provides the boats with a limited form of invisibility."
msgstr "死灵法师所制造的海之银尘有相当大的需求。渡鸦海滨的私枭们会利用这种东西来隐藏他们的船只，这可以提供一段时间的隐形。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:712
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:712
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ground Wyvern Horn is reported to be one of the most potent reagents used by the necromancers of Shadowspire.\nUnlike the reagents used by alchemists, this reagents is only used by the highest members of the Necromancers' Guild."
msgstr "地面双足翼龙之角据说是死灵法师所最需要的药材。这和炼金术士所使用的药材不一样，只有死灵法师公会中最高级的成员才能够使用这种药材。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:735
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1666
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:735
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:762
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You win!\n+3 Skill Points"
msgstr "你获胜了！技能点数  +3"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:736
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1667
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:736
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:763
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You win!\n+5 Skill Points"
msgstr "你获胜了！技能点数  +5"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:737
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1668
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:737
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:764
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You win!\n+7 Skill Points"
msgstr "你获胜了！技能点数  +7"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:738
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1669
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:738
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:765
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You win!\n+10 Skill Points"
msgstr "你获胜了！技能点数  +10"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:742
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:742
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks for the cure, but others in the area are still sick!\nBe sure to deliver the cure to them as well!"
msgstr "多谢你给我这些药，但此地的其它人并还没有好！请记得把这些药也送给他们！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:747
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:747
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Where is the Idol?\nDo not waste my time unless you have it!"
msgstr "圣像在哪里？别浪费我的时间！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:748
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:748
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Black Potions are made of a complex blending of many of the three basic alchemical reagents. Red reagents include Widowsweep Berries, Wolf's Eye, and Phials of Gog Blood.\nSome blue reagents are Phoenix Feather, Phima Root, Meteor Fragment and Will O' Wisps Heart.\nAnd some yellow reagents are Datura, Dragon Turtle Fang, Poppy Pods and Thornbark."
msgstr "黑色药剂是由混合许多基本的药材所获得的。红色的药材包括了柳条浆果、狼之眼、垢鬼血。蓝色的药剂包括了火凤羽、费玛根、陨石片、鬼火心。黄色药材则包括了曼陀罗、龙龟牙、罂粟茎和刺木皮。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:749
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:749
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have repaired the Portals of Stone?\nThat is tremendous news!\nQuickly, find my brother, Isthric and tell him to return home!"
msgstr "你已经修好了岩石传送门？太好了！赶快叫我的兄弟埃斯瑞克回家来！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:750
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:750
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You found Isthric and told him how to return home?\nWe are indeed in debt to you, Merchant of Alvar!\nI will speak well of you to Clan Leader Brekish Onefang.\nPlease take these potions of Cure Wounds as a reward."
msgstr "你找到了埃斯瑞克了，并且告诉他要回家了吗？我们真的非常感激你！我会告诉我们的酋长布瑞克许·单牙。请把这些疗伤药剂收下，当作我对你的回报。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:751
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:751
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have found the Prophecies of the Snake!\nPerhaps the details of our future can be found in its writings!\nPlease take this reward for your assistance!"
msgstr "你找到了蛇之预言！也许我们的未来就记载在其中！请收下这些东西当作我对你的回报！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:752
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:752
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My brother Rohtnax lives!\nAnd you have repaired the Portals of Stone?\nI must return home to him, so that we can plan our family's survival!"
msgstr "我的兄弟罗特奈克斯还活着！你又把岩石传送门修好了？！我一定要赶快回到家去，这样我们才可以计划家族未来要如何生存！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:754
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:754
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have killed all of the dire wolves in the region!\nTravelers are once again safe. However, I now find myself in need of a new business!"
msgstr "你已经杀死了这个区域所有的猛狼！旅行者又都可以安全地四处旅行了，不过，我也必须找其他的工作啦！还是多谢你的帮助！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:756
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:756
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My family returned and told me of how you rescued them.\nTell the Merchants of Alvar, that they no longer need rely upon our \"bargain.\"\nI will keep my word to them and to you, my boats will always be at your service!"
msgstr "我的家人已经回来了，他们告诉我是你救出了他们。告诉阿尔瓦的商人，他们不再需要靠着“协商”来和我做生意了。我会对他们和对你信守诺言，我的船只随时听你的差遣！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:757
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:757
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You do not have any Naga Hides!\nYou waste my time!"
msgstr "你已经没有蛇龙皮了！你浪费了我的时间！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:758
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:758
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Where is Eclipse?\nReturn to me when you have found the shield!"
msgstr "日蚀到哪里去了？你找到之后再回来找我！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:759
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:759
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I pay 500 gold for Ogre Ears.\nThe Merchant Guild of Alvar supports me in paying this bounty to anyone who can kill and ogre."
msgstr "我愿意付500个金币买你找来的每一个食人妖耳朵。阿尔瓦商人公会负责支付我这方面的花费。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:761
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:761
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I only pay for Wasp Stingers!\nNothing more, nothing less!"
msgstr "我只会花钱买黄蜂刺！别的东西就别带来烦我了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:762
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:762
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks for the potion, but others in the area are without protection!\nBe sure to deliver a potion to them as well!"
msgstr "多谢你给我这些药，但此地的其它人并还没有好！请记得把这些药也送给他们！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:763
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:763
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I an defenseless against the onslaught of the sea of fire!\nI need a Potion of Fire Resistance!"
msgstr "我对这火海毫无抵抗的能力！我需要御火药剂！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:765
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:765
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks for providing Potions of Fire Resistance to the southernmost houses here in Rust.\nPerhaps we can survive until a new home can be found for us!"
msgstr "你至少暂时帮我们把末日往后拖延了一阵子，但我们还是必须要找到一个新家才行！不过，还是多谢你替我们把御火药剂送过去！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:767
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:767
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Royal Wasp Jelly is a delicacy!\nThe upper caste of Merchants enjoys this tasty treat with almost every meal!"
msgstr "蜂王胶是种非常高级的美味食品！地位够高的商人几乎每餐都会享用这种美味的食品。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:771
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:771
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Scattered around the land are the Challenges.\nIf your ability is great enough, and you best the Challenge, you will be award skill points to do with as you wish!"
msgstr "在大陆上各地有各式各样的挑战。如果你的能力够强，你可以通过这些挑战，你将可以获得技能点数来做你想做的事情！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:772
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:772
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Dragons of Garrote Gorge are susceptible to a poison that can be distilled from the rare dragonbane flower.\nThe flower also is the only means of an antidote for the Dragons."
msgstr "绞刑峡谷的飞龙很容易被一种稀有的克龙之花所提炼出来的毒素杀死。但是，这种花朵同时也可以提炼出解毒药剂来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:773
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:773
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With all of the Dragons in the wilderness defeated, we can move on the Dragon Cave and eliminate the Dragons once and for all!\nThanks again for your help in defeating them."
msgstr "在野外的所有飞龙都被杀死之后，我们可以进入龙穴杀死所有的飞龙了！多谢你帮助我们击败他们！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:774
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:774
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With all of the Dragon hunters in the wilderness defeated, we can move on their camp and eliminate them once and for all!\nThanks again for your help in defeating them."
msgstr "在野外的所有猎龙人都被杀死之后，我们可以进入猎龙人营地杀死所有的猎龙人了！多谢你帮助我们击败他们！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:775
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:775
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Return when you have the Drum of Victory.\nYou waste your time and mine otherwise!"
msgstr "在你找到胜利之鼓之后再回来找我！不要浪费你和我的时间！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:778
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:778
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You're new aren't you?\nTell Arion Hunter that I expect more of his rabble than the likes of you!\nGive me the reports and leave my sight!\nYou make me sick!"
msgstr "你是新来的吗？告诉艾瑞安·韩特，请他下次派比较称头一点的人来！把报告给我，快滚！你让我想吐了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:783
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lying as they do on opposite ends of the Light to Dark spectrum, relationships between the Necromancers' Guild and the Temple of the Sun have never been the best, but now they battle openly. Oskar Tyre, head priest of the Temple says a holy vision drove him to declare war on the guild so as to rid Jadame of the taint of darkness.Both groups are relative newcomers to our continent. The guild has set up its foothold in Shadowspire, and the First (and only) Sun Temple of Jadame is in Murmurwoods."
msgstr "他们就如同光明与黑暗两个光谱上的极端一样，死灵法师公会和太阳神庙之间的关系一直都不好，但现在是他们公开宣战的时段。奥斯卡·提尔宣称他看见了不寻常的启示，督促他将这股污染贾丹姆大陆的力量从世界上彻底消除。\n两群人都不是在我们的大陆上土生土长的。公会基地在阴影塔区域，第一个，也是唯一的太阳神庙则是在低语森林。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:791
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:791
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Who knows the fate of Jadame now.\nPerhaps you will find a way to save us from destruction?"
msgstr "谁知道贾丹姆大陆现在面对什么样的命运？也许你可以让我们免于毁灭的命运？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:792
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:792
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Jadame owes you a great debt!\nYou have saved the entire world from total destruction!"
msgstr "贾丹姆大陆非常感激你！你已经让我们的世界脱离了彻底毁灭的厄运！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:793
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:793
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With the bridges destroyed by the eruption of the mountain of fire, we cannot get to the boat dock!\nWe are cut off from the mainland!"
msgstr "由于我们的桥梁都已经被火山给摧毁了，我们现在没办法回去了！更由于我们没办法抵达港口，因此跟主大陆完全断绝了联络。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:794
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:794
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have repaired the Portals of Stone?\nWe are all in your debt.\nIf only it was safe to travel through the Abandoned Temple!\nWell, at least we can attempt to get to the boat dock through there."
msgstr "你修复了岩石传送门吗？我们都非常感激你。如果能够安全地通过废弃神庙就好了！好吧，至少我们目前可以试着从这边前往该处的港口。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:795
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:795
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We used to have a nice series of bridges between the small islands of this region and one large bridge to the main land.\nThe volcano destroyed all of these.\nNow we cannot travel anywhere except by boat, but we cannot even get to our boat dock!"
msgstr "本来在小岛和主大陆之间有很多彼此联系的桥梁，但是火山摧毁了这一切。现在我们如果不靠船，就什么地方都不能去，但是我们现在甚至不能够到港口去！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:802
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:802
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We used to travel freely between the islands using the bridges.\nThese bridges were destroyed when the mountain of fire erupted.\nMany families are trapped on the outer islands.\nWe don’t even know if the people who live there are still alive."
msgstr "我们曾经靠着这些桥梁在各岛屿间自由来往。当火山爆发的时候，这些桥梁都被摧毁了。许多家族都被困在外岛上。我们甚至不知道居住在该地的同胞是否还活着。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:803
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:803
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With the Portals of Stone repaired, we can at least check on the outer islands and those who live there.\nWe are in your debt for fixing the Portals of Stone."
msgstr "在岩石传送门修复之后，我们至少可以去外岛地区看看，找找可能的生还者。我们很感激你替我们修好了这个传送门。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:804
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:804
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The boat dock on the northernmost island is the only way to travel between Dagger Wound and the mainland.\nWith the bridges destroyed, we cannot get to the boat dock and those arriving from Ravenshore cannot get to the village of Blood Drop!"
msgstr "最北边岛上的港口是我们匕伤群岛唯一前往主大陆的方法。由于桥梁都被摧毁了，我们就没办法前往港口，而从渡鸦海滨来的人也没办法到达血滴镇！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:805
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:805
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We can get to the boat docks?\nBut we have to go through the Abandoned Temple?\nWell that's something.\nAt least we can get to the boats."
msgstr "我们现在可以去港口了？但是我们还必须先穿过废弃神庙。不过，无论如何，还是要感谢你的帮忙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:809
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent! Give me the cheeses! I must consume them!Ah….munch munch….frelandeau, exquisite….mmmm, and eldenbrie, wondrously smoky…and hmmm, dunduck…well, that's not very nice, is it?You have made my Jadamean cheese cataloging safari a success! I can die a happy man! You have the humble thanks of a man of cheese. And here is your promised reward!"
msgstr "太好了！把所有的奶酪给我！我一定要吃吃看！\n啊……嚼嚼……独角兽奶酪，味道太精致了……嗯嗯，艾顿布理，烟熏味相当的不错……登达克……味道就不怎么好了，对吧？\n你帮我完成了贾丹姆大陆的奶酪品尝之旅！我死也甘愿了！我太感激你了！这是我答应给你的报酬！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:813
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:818
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The night the stranger came through here was the same night that the crystal erupted in the center of town.\nI only caught a glimpse of the stranger.\nHe didn’t appear the potent mage that he was.\nI was not in the town square when he summoned the crystal, but I did see the flash of light that traveled across the sky.\nIt was truly a terrible night."
msgstr "陌生人出现的那天晚上，也就是这些诡异水晶出现的同一个晚上。我只看见那个陌生人的身影一眼，那看起来似乎没有多大的威胁。当他召唤出水晶的时候，我并不在城镇广场上，所以我并没有看见激射入天空的光芒。这真是恐怖的一夜。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:814
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:819
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A wanderer came into town.\nSeveral ruffians sought to relieve this traveler of whatever wealth he possibly possessed. The wanderer barely paid any of them much notice.\nWith a small flick of his wrist all fell before him.\nThen he walked to the town square and summoned the giant crystal that you'll find there today."
msgstr "一个漂泊者走进镇子。有几个流氓想要从他身上抢走一些小东西。但那人根本不理他们。他手腕轻轻一振，所有人就都跌倒在他面前。然后他就走到城镇广场上，召唤来你今天所看到的那个巨大的水晶。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:815
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:820
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There is an ancient saying among the Dark Elf people,\n\"a thing lives only as long as the last person who remembers it.\"\nThe events the night the crystal burst forth into our lives will live for a very long time.\nMany of us saw the events of that night.\nThe mage who summoned forth the crystal said not one word to anyone us.\nWhen he looked upon us, it seemed that all there was in his heart and eyes was pity."
msgstr "在黑暗精灵中有一句俗语，“必须要有人活着才能够把记忆留存下去。”水晶突然出现在我们镇中央的那个景象将会留存很长的一段时间。我们有很多人都看见了那个景象。召唤来水晶的人并没有跟我们说任何的话。当他看着我们的时候，似乎他的眼中和心中都只有同情和怜悯。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:816
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:821
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When the mage came into town I didn’t think much of it.\nThis is Ravenshore.\nEveryone who travels the roads of Jadame comes through here at some time or another.\nI guess I should have paid more attention to him.\nSeems he caused quite a stir in the town square."
msgstr "当那个法师来到镇上的时候，我并没有多想。这是渡鸦海滨，任何人在贾丹姆大陆上旅行都几乎会经过的地方。我想我应该更注意他一些的。看起来他似乎在城镇广场上造成了相当的混乱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:817
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:822
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Pirates of Regna own the seas.\nNo one can stand against them!\nSeveral years ago, some fishing boat captains thought that they could sail to Erathia to get help dealing with the pirates.\nWe never saw or heard from them again."
msgstr "雷格那海盗拥有整个大海。没有人可以对抗他们！几年以前，有一些渔船的船长认为自己可以前往埃拉西亚寻求救兵来对付这些海盗。后来我们却再也没有听过他们的消息。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:818
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:823
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Regnans are the worst slime to ever set foot on the shore of Jadame. They keep the peoples of this continent from trading with Erathia and Enroth.\nWhat choice do we have?\nEven the Merchants of Alvar couldn’t muster a fleet to deal with the pirates.\nRumor says that there are smugglers around that have found ways around the pirate blockades."
msgstr "雷格那人是贾丹姆大陆附近海域上最糟糕的流氓。他们让这个大陆上的人们无法和埃拉西亚和恩洛斯的人们贸易。我们有什么选择呢？即使连阿尔瓦的商人公会都无法召集够大的舰队来对付他们。谣传私枭们找到了方法可以躲过这些海盗的阻挡。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:819
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:824
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Regnans call themselves the Empire of the Endless Ocean--trying to make more of themselves than there really is.\nAll they are is bullies and bandits.\nOf course, don’t tell them that I said that!"
msgstr "雷格那人称自己属于无尽之海的帝国。这只不过是虚张声势而已。他们只不过是流氓和强盗而已。当然，你千万别跟他们说这句话是我说的！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:820
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:825
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Over the last few weeks there have been reports of bandits and Ogres robbing travelers on all of the major roads of Jadame. Times just seem to be getting worse.\nBetween the Regnan Pirates and these bandits it seems that no one is safe to travel by any means."
msgstr "过去几周以来，食人妖和强盗似乎在贾丹姆大陆的各主要干道间四处劫掠。日子真是越来越难过了。海上有雷格那海盗，路上又有这些该死的强盗，我们根本没有任何方法可以旅行嘛！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:821
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:826
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Several of the warriors got together to go take care of the ogres that were camping on the road to Ravenshore.\nThat’s when we first had word of the fortress they were constructing to the southwest of here.\nSince the fortress was completed the roads to the south and west have not been safe."
msgstr "曾经有几名战士成群结队地准备对付那些在渡鸦海滨道路附近兴建要塞的食人妖。这是我们第一次听说他们在西南方建造的要塞。从要塞完成之后，往西和往南的道路就都变得不安全了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:822
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:827
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Smuggler of Jadame may be a myth, but I think not.\nThe Merchants of Alvar seem to be able to send small amounts of goods away across the sea to Erathia and Enroth.\nYet they own no boats of their own.\n This would seem to support the idea that there really are smugglers.\nNow why they work for the merchants is beyond the likes of me."
msgstr "贾丹姆大陆的走私者也许被人视作神秘的传言，但我可不这么认为。阿尔瓦商人似乎能够将少量的货物运送到埃拉西亚和恩洛斯去。但是他们没有自己的船只。这看起来似乎证明了走私者的存在。但是，他们为什么要替这些商人工作就让我不能理解了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:823
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:828
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wererats!\nThey are the worst of scum!\nThe pick through our trash at night!\nAlways scurrying around in the dark!\nNever seen when the sun is up.\nGives one the shivers it does!"
msgstr "鼠人！他们是最糟糕的生物！他们日夜不停地在我们的垃圾堆里面乱挖！老是在黑暗中鬼鬼祟祟地乱跑！太阳升起之后他们就通通不见了。真是让我浑身起鸡皮疙瘩！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:824
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:829
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Cyclopes that dwell to the southeast of here have always been a threat to the village of Rust!\nBut the village has always been able to push back any raid.\nThey aren't so tough in small numbers, but if they can catch you out in the desert unaware, you will not survive!\n"
msgstr "居住在这里东南方的独眼巨人一直都是铁锈镇最大的威胁！但是，这座城镇原先可以抵挡任何种类的攻击。他们数量不多的时候没什么好担心的，但是，如果他们在沙漠中出其不意地突袭你，你就很难逃过一劫！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:825
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:830
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The sea of fire took us all by surprise.\nIt spread through the eastern half of the village like wildfire.\nLuckily its growth seems to have slowed.\nStill I don’t know how much longer any of us can last."
msgstr "火焰之湖是个让我们意料外的状况。它就像是野火一般地在村庄的东半边扩散。我们很幸运，因为它的扩散已经减缓下来了。但是我依然很怀疑我们到底还可以撑多久。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:826
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:831
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We need to find a new place to live!\nThere is no way any people could live under these conditions.\nEven the Cyclopes will be forced to move.\nThere are legends that talk about the ancient homeland that we traveled here from.\nThe stories say that it was lush and green.\nIf we only had such a place to return to."
msgstr "我们必须要找个新的居住地才行！没有任何的生物可以在这样的环境底下生存。即使是独眼巨人都准备要搬迁了。谣传我们过去是从别的地方搬迁到这里来的。传说中也提到了该处是个丰饶、翠绿的地方。真希望真的有这个地方存在。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:827
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:832
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are traders in Alvar and Shadowspire that trade for the different types of ore that can be found all over Jadame.\nThey use the ore to create items that they are more than happy to trade for more ore!"
msgstr "阿尔瓦和阴影塔地区的商人愿意贩卖贾丹姆大陆上所有你能够想到的矿石。他们可以利用矿石打造更多的物品，也因此愿意用这些物品换取更多的矿石。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:845
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:850
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Have you found the shield?\nThe recovery of Eclipse is very important to the Temple of the Sun!\nYou must help us find it!"
msgstr "你找到盾牌了吗？找回“日蚀”这个盾牌对太阳神庙来说是很重要的一件事情，你一定得帮帮我们！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:846
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:851
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks again for recovering the shield Eclipse!\nI hope it has proven helpful in your adventures."
msgstr "多谢你们替我们找回“日蚀”！希望在你的冒险中它能够给予你们足够的帮助！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:849
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, that matter's done. I will make arrangements to travel to Ravenshore so I myself may sit on your council. Frankly, I could use a bit of change. I will leave my second in command, Reginald Dorray, in charge.Again, good job."
msgstr "好的，就这么说定了。我会赶快做好安排，亲自前往渡鸦海滨的议会。说实话，我自己也想换换环境。我会让副手来接管我的工作。\n最后，我必须对你再一次说：干得好。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:856
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now that I need not fear my heir's destruction. I will visit my revenge on Quixote. His camp will face the assault of fire and claw. Those who have hunted us are now our prey animals.As for your alliance…you have done me a great service. I will honor my debt. As soon as I've set my enemies to flight or the beyond, I will join the alliance council in Ravenshore."
msgstr "既然现在我已不需要担心我们下一代的生命安危了，我就准备去找吉柯德复仇。他的营地将会面临我们利爪和火焰的攻击。原先狩猎我们的骑士将会变成我们的猎物。\n至于你所提到的联盟……你们帮了我很大的忙，我会遵守约定。只要我把敌人都处理掉了，我就会前往渡鸦海滨加入议会的阵容。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:881
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:886
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Centuries ago the largest battle to date between the Guild of Necromancers and the Temple of the Sun was fought on this spot!\nSo much magical energy was released that the very ground was scorched and is black to this very day!"
msgstr "数世纪以前，死灵法师公会和太阳神庙之间最大的战役就在此地进行！当时释放出的魔力大到把此地烤成焦黑，直到今天都没有恢复。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:882
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Very good…or at least, as good as can be expected. You managed to bring three partners into the alliance--the minimum number my advisors told me would be sufficient to fulfill the \"…Jadame, must stand together…\" part of the prophecy. A pity it could not be more, but events of the cataclysm are clearly coming to a head. It is time to move onward.You must travel to Ravenshore and meet with the alliance council gathered there. With them, decide what must be the next step we take in meeting the elemental crisis."
msgstr "很好……至少你已经尽力了。你让另外三个势力加入了联盟，这是我们所需要的最低人手。这样我们才能满足“贾丹姆大陆必须要团结在一起……”的预言。真可惜你无法弄到更多的援军，但大灾变已经迫在眉睫，我们的动作得要快一点。\n你必须要前往渡鸦海滨和在该处聚会的联盟议会碰面。在那之后，你将必须和他们讨论如何面对元素界所带来的大危机。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:884
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:889
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for releasing me. Know that Shalwend, Lord of Air, holds you in his favor. I go now to restore order to my realm and to join with my fellow lords to do what I can for yours. Be warned! Our actions will destabilize the crystal gateway. Leave now for your home, lest you be trapped here forever.\nInform Xanthor of what has happened here. Farewell"
msgstr "多谢你把我放出来，请记得，风元素之王永远感激你。\n我现在必须要去恢复我们空间的秩序，并且加入我的同伴们拯救你的世界。请小心！我们的行动会让水晶传送门变得不稳定。现在请你赶快离开，免得被永远困在这里。请通知萨索尔这里发生了什么事情。再会。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:885
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:890
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "\"The Destroyer\" is a fitting moniker for one who would imprison me in such a fashion. If it were not for you, I, Acwalander, Lord of Water, would have soon perished. My passing would have had an unbalancing effect across all the planes. Thank you. I go now to gather with the other lords. Together we will set things right. Be warned! Our actions will destabilize the crystal gateway. Leave now for your home, lest you be trapped here forever. Inform Xanthor of what has happened here. Farewell."
msgstr "能够把我禁锢在这边的人，用毁灭者称呼他实在是相当正确的。如果不是因为你的援手，我—水元素之王很有可能就这么被毁灭。我的毁灭将会造成所有元素界的不平衡。多谢你，我得要去加入其她的元素之王，让一切恢复旧观。\n我现在必须要去恢复我们空间的秩序，并且加入我的同伴们拯救你的世界。请小心！我们的行动会让水晶传送门变得不稳定。现在请你赶快离开，免得被永远困在这里。请通知萨索尔这里发生了什么事情。再会。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:886
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am free! Now will he who was fool enough to jail me--this Destroyer--feel my wrath. That I, the Lord of Earth, am called \"Gralkor the Cruel\" is no mistake. The suffering I have felt will be his returned in multitudes!I go now to gather with the other lords. Together we will set things right. Be warned! Our actions will destabilize the crystal gateway. Leave now for your home, lest you be trapped here forever. Inform Xanthor of what has happened here. Farewell"
msgstr "我自由了！我将要让这个囚禁我的笨蛋，什么鬼毁灭者知道我有多生气！我所受的苦将会以百倍千倍报应到他身上！\n我现在必须要去恢复我们空间的秩序，并且加入我的同伴们拯救你的世界。请小心！我们的行动会让水晶传送门变得不稳定。现在请你赶快离开，免得被永远困在这里。请通知萨索尔这里发生了什么事情。再会。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:887
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Free at last. My torment is over, but what of my subjects? I know the Destroyer has them compelled to a terrible task. My presence will sooth them. I must go to restore order to my realm and yours.Before I return to the Plane of Fire, I will gather with the other lords. Together we will set things right. Be warned! Our actions will destabilize the crystal gateway. Leave now for your home, lest you be trapped here forever.\nInform Xanthor of what has happened here. Farewell"
msgstr "我终于被释放了。我的苦刑已经结束了，但是我的子民们呢？我知道毁灭者强迫他们执行一个可怕的任务。我的出现将会让他们获得安宁。我得赶快走了，我要去恢复各地的秩序了。\n我现在必须要去恢复我们空间的秩序，并且加入我的同伴们拯救你的世界。请小心！我们的行动会让水晶传送门变得不稳定。现在请你赶快离开，免得被永远困在这里。请通知萨索尔这里发生了什么事情。再会。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:888
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh, what a mess you've made of things! When I asked you to find me a witness of events in the Ironsand Desert, I thought it would be obvious that you'd have to return him to me in good condition! I mean look at the poor Troll! Take him to the temple and get him fixed up.And please...try to remember you're working for the guild. We do have a reputation for conducting ourselves with at least passing competence."
msgstr "喔，你看你把事情弄成什么样子！当我要求你找个铁沙漠事件的目击证人时，我以为你会知道应该要把他好好的带回来！你看看这个可怜的家伙！赶快把他带到神庙去治疗。\n求求你……请你至少记得是在为公会服务，我们作事情有一定的水准。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:889
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:894
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You found Ebonest?\nWhat of my father?\nWhere is he?\nI thought you were going to return when you had found both my father and the spear."
msgstr "你找了艾邦斯特屠龙枪？我的父亲呢？他到哪里去了？我以为你会两个都找到才回来！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:890
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:895
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You found my father and Ebonest?\nI will be forever in your debt!\nWe should take the spear to Charles Quixote, and if he is agreeable, he will promote me and any knights in your party!"
msgstr "你找到了我的父亲和艾邦斯特屠龙枪？我真是太感激你了！我们应该赶快把艾邦斯特屠龙枪带去给查尔斯·吉柯德。如果一切顺利的话，他会把我和你们队伍中的骑士都晋升为勇士！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:915
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:920
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You cannot be promoted until we know where Cauri Blackthorne is!\nLocate her, and she will promote you.\nAfter she is found and has retuned to the Merchant Guild, I will be glad to promote any Dark Elves in your party to Patriarch."
msgstr "在你找到考瑞·黑王座之前，你不能够获得晋升！找到她，她就会让你晋升。在你找到她，回到商人公会之后，我很愿意帮你队伍中的任何黑暗精灵晋升为黑暗精灵长。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:916
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:921
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Cauri told me of how you helped her with the curse of the Basilisk.\nShe has instructed me to promote any Dark Elves that travel with you to Patriarch."
msgstr "考瑞告诉过我有关石化蜥蜴的诅咒。她交代我可以晋升你队伍中的黑暗精灵为黑暗精灵长。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:917
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:922
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You cannot be promoted until the Ancient Troll Home has been found!\nReturn here when you have found it and talk with Volog."
msgstr "在你找到古代巨魔之家之前你不能够晋升！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:918
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:923
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Before Volog left, he instructed me to promote any Trolls that travel with you to War Troll.\nThe village of Rust will be forever thankful to you!"
msgstr "在瓦洛格离开之前，他交代我将你们队伍中的所有巨魔晋升为战斗巨魔。恭喜你们，也多谢你帮我们找到新家园！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:919
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:924
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You cannot be promoted to Champion until you have proven yourself worthy!\n"
msgstr "在你证明了自己的能力之前无法晋升为勇士！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:920
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:925
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks for you help recovering the spear Ebonest!\nI can promote any Knights that travel with you to Champion."
msgstr "多谢你帮我们找到艾邦斯特屠龙枪！我可以将你队伍中的所有人晋升为勇士！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:921
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:926
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have not proven yourself worthy!\nUntil you strike a blow against the Dragon Hunters, none of you will be promoted!"
msgstr "你还没证明自己的能力！在你对猎龙人造成重大打击之前，你们都不会获得晋升！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:924
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:929
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You are always welcome here!\nOf course I will promote any Clerics that travel with you to Priest of the Sun!\n"
msgstr "我们永远都欢迎你！我当然愿意将你们队伍中的牧师晋升为太阳主教！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:925
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:930
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have not recovered the Lost Book of Kehl!\nThere will be no promotions until you return with the book!\nSpeak with Vetrinus Taleshire."
msgstr "你们还没有找回失落的凯尔之书，在你找回那本书之前，你们无法晋升！去找维崔那斯·泰尔沙尔谈谈！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:926
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:931
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, you return seeking promotion for others in your party?\nI have not forgotten your help in recovering the Lost Book of Kehl!\nAll Necromancers in your party will be promoted to Lich.\nBe sure each Necromancer has a Lich Jar in his possession."
msgstr "啊，你回来替自己的队友寻求晋升吗？我并没有忘记你们寻找失落的凯尔之书的功绩！你们队伍中所有的死灵法师都可以晋升为巫妖。请让每个死灵法师都拥有一个巫妖之瓶。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:927
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:932
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have not found Korbu and until you have I refuse to promote any of you!\nBegone!"
msgstr "你还没有找到可布，在那之前我拒绝让你晋升！快离开！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:928
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:933
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Any Vampires among you will be promoted to Nosferatu!\nI remember those who helped in the recovery of the Remains of Korbu."
msgstr "你们队伍中的所有吸血鬼都会被晋升为血之尊皇！我不会忘记你们寻回可布遗骸的功绩！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:929
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:934
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have not found the Axe of Balthazar!\nYou are not worthy of promotion!"
msgstr "你们还没有找到巴尔萨煞之斧！你们不值得获得晋升！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:930
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:935
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Herd of Masul is in debt to you.\nAny Minotaurs in your party are promoted to Minotaur Lord!"
msgstr "马苏尔的子民感激你。你队伍中的所有牛头人将被晋升为牛头领主。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:931
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:936
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My father sent you to rescue me?\nI am grateful.\nI will return to my father and let him know of your assistance!"
msgstr "我的父亲派你来拯救我？非常感谢你。我会回到我父亲身边，让他知道你的努力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:932
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:937
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Where is the Vial of Grave Dirt?\nDo not bother me until you have it!"
msgstr "坟土之瓶呢？在你找到它之前别回来找我！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:933
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:938
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I cannot yet travel with you!\nI would sooner sign on with a merchant caravan, than travel with you.\nReturn to me when you have discovered more of the world, and your place in it."
msgstr "我还没办法和你们一起旅行！我宁愿加入其它的商队。在你们经历过更多事物之后再回来找我。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:934
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:939
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I remember you!\nThe Book of Kehl has proven invaluable, and it would be a privilege to travel with you."
msgstr "我记得你！凯尔之书非常有用，能够和你一起旅行是我的荣幸！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:935
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:940
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When you have grown and learned more of the ways of the world, then it would be my pleasure to travel with you.\nUntil then I have studies to complete here."
msgstr "我还没办法和你们一起旅行！我宁愿加入其它的队伍。在你们经历过更多事物之后再回来找我。我现在宁愿先作些研究。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:936
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:941
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Certainly!\nTraveling with you would be an honor!"
msgstr "当然！和你们一起旅行是我的荣幸！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:938
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/npctext.txt.py:943
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent!\nNow that the Ogres are cleared from the roads and no longer inhabit the fortress, the roads to Ravenshore, Ironsand and Murmurwoods are safe again!\n"
msgstr "太好了！现在道路上的食人妖都已经被消灭了，要塞中再也没有食人妖，通往渡鸦海滨、铁沙漠和低语森林的道路又再度开放了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:940
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Emerald Island is southeast of Erathia, and far away from pirates and other ruffians.\nIt would be ideal, if not for the constant swarms of dragonflies that infest the island.\nFortunately, the large number of armed and skilled people this contest has attracted should thin their numbers a bit.Lord Markham has supplemented the normally sparse village with a weapon, armor, and alchemist shop for your convenience during the contest.\nA temple and basic magical guilds are also available.\nI would suggest making sure that you are completely ready before you start off on the contest."
msgstr "欢迎来到翡翠岛！我是你们在这个岛上的向导。我会向你们介绍这里的风土人情和本次竞赛的详细内容。你们在岛上最好安分守己点，免得发生不愉快的事。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:941
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:3
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome to Emerald Island!\nI'll be your docent for your stay on the island.\nIt is my duty to see that you understand the rules of both the island and the contest.\nFor the duration of your stay on Emerald Island please refrain from gross violations of civilized behavior."
msgstr "我敬佩你们的决心和勇气。只要比赛还没有决出优胜者，你们就还有机会去赢得胜利。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:942
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:4
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I respect your decision.\nI am, however, a patient man, and will offer you this chance until a winner in the contest is proclaimed."
msgstr "我尊重你的决定。不过我是一个有耐心的人，我会给你个机会，直到竞赛的胜者被宣布。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:943
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The rules of the contest are simple:\nThe first person to return with the items is the winner.\nAll you need to do is collect a wealthy hat, a red potion, a longbow, a seashell, a musical instrument, and a floor tile from the Temple of the Moon and bring them to the judge to win."
msgstr "比赛规则很简单。谁能第一个把所有物品找到并交给裁判托马斯，就是胜利者。参赛者要找到一顶漂亮帽子，一瓶红色药剂，一张长弓，一个贝壳，一件乐器，还有月亮神庙里的一块地砖。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:944
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Isn't this hunt exciting?\nI really am grateful you came to my little event, and I hope you have fun, even if you don't win.\nI think it's great that everyone is competing in a spirit of good sportsmanship and camaraderie."
msgstr "寻宝比赛有趣吧？你们答应为我解决这个小麻烦我真得谢谢你们。即使你们没有赢得胜利，我也希望你们能觉得参加比赛本身是一种乐趣。我想“公平竞争，同舟共济”才是这项比赛的宗旨。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:945
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you win, you'll be in charge of one of the most scenic areas in all Erathia!\nHarmondale is just outside of the Tularean Forest, right on the edge of the Elf-Human border.\nAnd I'm sure you'll love the castle.\nIt's a bit of a fixer-upper, but it's quite roomy and has excellent ventilation.\nIt breaks my heart to part with this property, but I feel that the time has come for me to give something back to the people."
msgstr "如果你们获胜了，我会把埃拉西亚风景最美的城堡赏给你们。这个地方就在图拉利昂森林边上，处于精灵族和人类领地的交界之处，虽然地势有点高，但宽敞得很，而且通风良好，你们一定会喜欢这个地方的。说实话我真舍不得这个城堡，但现在该是我回报人民的时候了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:946
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Congratulations!\nYou are the new Lords of Harmondale!\nIsn't it thrilling?\nYou can't imagine how good it feels for me to give this property away to you!\nAll of the benefits and rewards, and of course, the responsibilities of governing the town of Harmondale are now yours.\n(Lord Markham produces a deed and contract) Just sign here...And here... And if I could just get your initials here... Yes!\nWell, that's that!\nYou're all set.\nAnd once again, congratulations!!!"
msgstr "祝贺你们！你们现在是哈蒙代尔城堡的新主人了。把它交给你们我也就放心了。以后就由你们来掌管城堡的一切事务。（马克汉姆写了一份合同）在这里签个字吧，对，就在这儿。好了，一切全办妥了，再次祝贺你们，城堡的新主人！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:947
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, the ship that will take you to your fiefdom awaits you in the harbor.\nMy entourage and I will be taking a different ship out.\nJust board whenever you're ready."
msgstr "我已经在港口专为你们准备了一艘船把你们送到哈蒙代尔，如果收拾好了就快点上船吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:948
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Allow me to introduce myself.\nMy name is Mr. Malwick.\nI represent a group of, shall we say, \"investors in the future\".\nI have been observing you since you arrived on this island, and I believe your values and goals have much in common with ours.\nI am empowered to grant you a fireball wand to help you win the Hunt today, in exchange for a favor in the future.\nWhat do you say?"
msgstr "我先自我介绍一下，我叫马尔维克。干我们这一行的常自嘲为“投资未来者”。你们一上岛我就开始注意你们了，我发现你们的为人处事和人生目标和我们挺投缘的。我奉命把这根连珠火球魔杖送给你们，希望在这场比赛里能助你们一臂之力，不过将来你们可得报答我们哦。怎么样，答不答应？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:949
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We have reason to believe that whoever is in charge of Harmondale in the next few months will have an unprecedented opportunity to shape the future.\nThat is why I am here today--to make sure the shape of the future is pleasing to my associates.\nI'm sure you understand."
msgstr "我们认为以后谁能掌管哈蒙代尔城堡谁就能有机会主宰未来。我的来意不说你们也知道，是为了将来早作打算。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:950
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent.\nSometime in the future, I or a representative of my group will call on you to return the favor.\nI hope you won't disappoint us.\nHere is your fireball wand.\nWe should not be seen talking again, the others might get suspicious."
msgstr "好极了，将来我或我们圈子里的某个人会来找你们请求帮助的，到时候你们可不能翻脸不认帐。这根连珠火球魔杖你们拿去，我不再多说了，不然别人该起疑心了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:952
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have some nice sea shells for sale, shells that you can only find on Emerald Island.\nCan I sell one to you?\nThey're only a hundred gold pieces each."
msgstr "我有一些漂亮的贝壳要卖，这可是翡翠岛上独有的贝壳，你们想买吗？每个贝壳只要100个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:955
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I see you have a fine hat, there.\nHow about a deal:\nYou give me your hat, and we let you keep your lives?"
msgstr "啊，你们已经拿到漂亮帽子了，咱们做个交易如何？你们把帽子交出来，我们就给你们些保命的忠告？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:958
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This Temple is a pretty nasty place.\nYou should probably watch your back around here-- you never know what might want to kill you."
msgstr "这座神庙可是个凶险的地方，你们在里面可得处处小心，时刻提防，不然连死了也不知道是怎么回事。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:959
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You should have listened to me; I warned you this was a nasty place.\nNow get out of here before I decide to take something else from you."
msgstr "你们怎么不听我的话，我早说过那地方很危险。趁我现在还没兴趣向你们要些别的东西，你们快走吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:960
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I take this to mean you don't wish to accept my proposal.\nI believe our business is concluded."
msgstr "看来你们是拒绝我的提议了，好吧，咱们的买卖到此为止了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:961
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The toughest band of contestants have apparently hid out in the Temple of the Moon.\nI think they might be wanting to ambush any group that tries to go there."
msgstr "参赛者中最野蛮无耻的一伙正埋伏在月亮神庙。看来他们准备在那里伏击想进入神庙的其它参赛对手。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:962
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know how to make a blue potion, but not red ones…Just about any blue herb will do.\nJust mix it with an empty bottle and voila!\nInstant blue potion.\nI guess that making a red potion is similar, but I'm not sure.\nThey say mixing potions improperly can have really bad effects."
msgstr "我知道配制蓝色药剂的方法，但对红色药剂却不熟悉。只要把蓝色草药放入空瓶子，蓝色药剂就制成了。大概红色药剂的制法也差不多，不过我从来没试过。听说如果配制药剂方法不当会闯大祸的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:964
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good afternoon.\nMy duty is to verify that you have all the items necessary to win the contest.\nYou are required to bring a red potion, a longbow, a floor tile from the Temple of the Moon, a wealthy hat, seashell, and an instrument to me.\nYou can bring them in any order, just show them to me one at a time so that I may verify them."
msgstr "你们好，我负责鉴定你们赢得比赛所需要获取的物品。你们要给我一顶漂亮帽子，一瓶红色药剂，一张长弓，一个贝壳，一件乐器，还有月亮神庙里的一块地砖。你们要把所有这些东西都带来，我才能宣布你们为优胜者。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:965
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I see you have found a wealthy hat.\nI shall mark this off your list accordingly, good work."
msgstr "你们已经找到了漂亮帽子，还剩其它几样东西，再加把劲啊！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:966
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmm, a fine lute this is.\nLet me mark off the instrument from your list."
msgstr "嗯，你们找到拨弦琴了，可以把它从物品单上划去了，快去找其它几样东西吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:967
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:29
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Adventurers indeed!\nI didn't expect anyone to bring back a tile so quickly.\nThis is certainly a tile from the Temple, however so I shall mark the tile off your list."
msgstr "你们是真正的勇士，我没有料到这么快就能把地砖带回来。这确实是月亮神庙里的地砖，可以把它从物品单上划去了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:968
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:30
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This longbow certainly qualifies for the hunt.\nGood work, I shall mark that off your list."
msgstr "对，就是这张长弓。你们干得真不错。我可以把它从物品单上划去了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:969
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:31
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A beautiful shell, much like the ones that Sally sells.\nThis certainly came from Emerald Island- I shall mark the shell off your list."
msgstr "多漂亮的贝壳啊，一定是从塞莉那里买的吧。这是真正翡翠岛上的贝壳。我可以把它从物品单上划去了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:970
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:32
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What took you so long?\nAlmost every group has turned in a red potion by now.\nThis is the easiest item in the hunt to manage, but better late than never.\nI will mark it off your list."
msgstr "找这个东西竟然花了你们这么长时间！几乎所有的参赛者都已经把红色药剂交给我了，这可是最容易找的东西了，但你们毕竟找到它了，我可以把它从物品单上划去了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:971
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:33
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, that's all six items.\nYou're the winner of the contest!\nI suggest you talk to Lord Markham for the details on gaining your fiefdom, my work is done here."
msgstr "好，六样东西都找齐了，你们是这次比赛的优胜者！看来你们可以去马克汉姆爵士那儿领赏了，我的任务也算完成了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:972
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:34
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm sorry, but nothing you have is necessary for the hunt.\nI don't mean to belittle what you have, but I'm not looking for any of it."
msgstr "很抱歉，比赛要找的东西你们一样也没有带来。我不是贬低你们的能力，但你们身上的东西没有一件是比赛所要找的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:973
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:35
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Are you contestants in Lord Markham's Scavenger Hunt?\nHow neat!\nI'm here to provide entertainment to Lord Markham's entourage, the contestants, and to anyone else that would like to hear a song."
msgstr "你们就是参加马克汉姆爵士寻宝竞赛的参赛者吗？多神气啊！我是唱歌的。我唱给马克汉姆爵士的侍卫们听，唱给你们这些参赛者听，唱给所有爱听我的歌的人听，为他们带来轻松和快乐。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:974
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:36
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I own a few instruments, but I only brought my lute with me.\nIts old and not quite as well kept as some of the others, but I didn't want one of my good instruments stolen by pirates or damaged from exposure to the humid, salty air."
msgstr "我有一些乐器，但身上只带了把拨弦琴。虽然有点旧了，也不如其它乐器保存得好，但我还是很爱惜它。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:975
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:37
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You say you need an instrument for the Scavenger Hunt?\nI suppose you could buy my lute, but I've had it for such a long time.\nI guess I'd part with it for 500 gold.\nInterested?"
msgstr "你们说你们参加寻宝比赛需要找一件乐器，不妨买我的拨弦琴吧。不过它陪伴我这么长时间了，我真有点舍不得。你们得出500个金币才能买它，愿不愿意？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:976
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:38
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, promise to at least take care of it and not use it for firewood.\nI suppose I'll have to make do without an instrument for the rest of this trip.\nMaybe I should tell stories instead of sing until I get back home."
msgstr "这把琴归你们了，你们可得好好收藏它哦！现在我身上一件伴奏的乐器也没有了，不能给人唱歌，只好去给人讲故事了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:977
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:39
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It would help if you had the 500 gold pieces.\nPlease don't try and cheat me out of my instrument."
msgstr "你们连500个金币也没有，可别想来骗我的拨弦琴。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:978
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:40
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello there!\nI suppose you're part of the contest?\nGood to hear.\nWe were wondering if you would want to trade a red potion, assuming you have one, for a hat.\nWe could help each other along a little."
msgstr "你们好，你们也是参赛者吧？有没有兴趣用红色药剂来换顶帽子啊，这样对我们大家都有好处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:979
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:41
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wonderful!\nHere's the hat and I'll take the potion.\nThanks so much, now we're almost finished with our list."
msgstr "好极了，你们真够朋友！这顶帽子归你们了，药剂我拿走。这样我们都可以得到比赛所要找的东西了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:980
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:42
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What's the matter?\nYou don't like to work with others?\nFine then, you'll get no help from us."
msgstr "你们怎么回事，不肯合作吗？好吧，以后你们永远别想得到我们的帮助。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:981
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:43
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Is this some sort of trick?\nYou don't even have a red potion.\nYou don't think I'll just give you the hat, do you?"
msgstr "开玩笑吧，你们连红色药剂也没有？是不是以为我们不会给你们帽子？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:982
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:44
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good job, mates!\nWe'll be heading off for Harmondale right now.\nCongratulations."
msgstr "祝贺你们，干得真不错，伙计！现在我们向哈蒙代尔前进！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:985
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:47
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There really is a dragon on the island?\nI thought everyone was referring to the dragonflies everywhere.\nI'll warn everyone to stay away from that cave so we don't lose anyone else."
msgstr "岛上真有龙吗？是不是指岛上到处都是的龙蝇。我早警告过人们要想太太平平过日子，就得离那个洞穴远点。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:986
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:48
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmm… I recall a few strangers poking around the entrance to the Dragon's Cave recently.\nI didn't notice if they went inside, but I haven't seen them around since.\nThey must have realized how dangerous that place is and headed back to town."
msgstr "嗯，我想起是有些陌生人曾在龙穴附近逗留过，但没注意到他们是否进去了。从此以后再没有看见过他们。一定是他们感到这里太危险，及时退回去了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:987
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:49
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The cave right behind my house is not the Abandoned Temple.\nIt belongs to Morcarack the Pitiless, the Dragon of Emerald Island.\nHe doesn't appreciate visitors, so I wouldn't advise going there.\nThe Abandoned Temple is buried in the hill south of my house.\nYou can get to it by entering the caves at the top of the hill."
msgstr "我屋子后的洞穴可不是什么废庙，它是翡翠岛上的巨龙“冷血莫卡莱克”呆的地方。它对不速之客很不客气，你们最好别上那里去。废庙就埋在我屋子南面的小山上，你们可以从山顶的洞口进去。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:988
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:50
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wild Dragonflies have infested the northwestern side of Emerald Island recently, making it dangerous to store things in our shed out there.\nDragonflies aren't terribly powerful, but they are fast and can even occasionally shoot fire at you.\nDon't take them too lightly!"
msgstr "龙蝇近来在岛的西北面猖獗肆虐，去那里的仓库存放物品可是件危险的事。龙蝇虽然不是厉害无比，但它们飞行迅速，有的龙蝇还会喷射火焰，你们可别把它们不当一回事。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:989
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:51
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Dragon of Emerald Island lives in a cave in the northeast.\nI wouldn't go there, though, he doesn't like visitors.\nHe spares our town so that we may pay him tribute, and in return he keeps pirates and undesirables out."
msgstr "翡翠岛的巨龙住在东北面的龙穴里。它不喜欢不速之客，我可不敢上那儿去。我们向它进贡，它保护我们的镇子不受海盗和外人的袭击。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:990
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:52
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You're contestants in the Scavenger Hunt?\nIf so, I wouldn't wander off to the Dragon Cave, then.\nMorcarack doesn't tolerate strangers very well.\nI bet the missing people went there thinking his cave was the Abandoned Temple--they're probably long dead."
msgstr "你们是参加寻宝比赛的参赛者？要是这样我可不会带你们去龙穴，莫卡莱克对外人可不怎么友好。那些失踪的人肯定以为它的洞穴是个废庙，贸然闯入，都成了它的点心了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:991
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:53
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'd watch those other contestants-- some of them seem ruthless.\nOne particularly nasty group headed to the north side of the island, and I haven't seen them since.\nI'm surprised at the attention this contest has received, apparently people are hoping to get on the good side of the contestants for future favors if they win."
msgstr "我还见过别的参赛者，他们有些人真是无礼至极。有一伙人特别下流无耻，我看见他们向岛的北面去了，却再也没见他们回来过。我对参赛者们总是特别注意，更希望他们之中善良的人能够赢得比赛，这样将来对大家都有好处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:992
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have decided that you no longer desire my information about the places on Emerald Island.\nIf you later decide that you'd like to hear what I have to say, find me in the Two Palms tavern and then select Tour On."
msgstr "你们已经决定不再要我提供关于翡翠岛的信息了吗？要是你们以后想再要听我的忠告，请到双叶旅店里找我并选择“开始指导”。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:993
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:55
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have decided to listen to my tour about the points of interest on Emerald Island.\nIf you decide that you no longer want me to point out areas of interest then select Tour Off."
msgstr "你们要我告诉你们关于翡翠岛的信息吗？你们要是以后对这些信息不感兴趣了，请选择“结束指导”。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:994
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:56
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though the law may decide who is guilty and who is not, I decide who is called Thief, and who is just a criminal.\nBring me that lovely vase I saw on the mantle in Lord Markham’s manor, and I shall call you Rogue."
msgstr "法律可以判定谁有罪，谁无罪。我可以决定谁可以被称为神偷，谁只是个小偷。你们只要把马克汉姆爵士庄园里的那个漂亮花瓶偷来，我就封你们为神偷。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:995
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:57
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Common criminals steal whatever catches their eye; Rogues steal what I tell them to steal.\nI shall not grant titles to failures.\nReturn with Lord Markham’s Vase and I will promote all Thieves to Rogues, and all non-thieves to Honorary Rogues."
msgstr "一般的小偷见什么偷什么，但神偷只偷我指定的东西。如果行动失败了，我可不会给什么封号。把马克汉姆爵士的那个漂亮花瓶偷来给我，我将把你们之中的窃贼提拔为神偷，不是窃贼的授予荣誉神偷称号。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:996
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:58
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well done.\nStealing that vase took guts and skill.\nI grant you the title of Rogue, and a small payment for your services. "
msgstr "干得好，把这个花瓶偷来可需要高超的技术。我授予你们神偷的称号，这点报酬是你们应得的，拿去吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:997
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:59
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have chosen the path of Darkness, and I will promote you no further.\nPerhaps an Assassin would have something to teach you.\nI hear there is one in Deyja."
msgstr "你们既然已经选择了黑暗之路，我就不能提拔你们了。也许杀手会向你们传授一些知识，听说在迪雅有一个杀手。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:998
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:60
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You are not quite ready to take the next step.\nThe time is fast approaching when you must decide whether to follow the path of light, or the path of darkness.\nIf you choose the Light, return to me to complete your training."
msgstr "你们还没有作出进一步的选择。你们必须尽快决定向哪个方向发展，是光明之路还是黑暗之路。如果你们选择光明之路，那么还可以回到我这里完成你们的修炼。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:999
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:61
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your next task is somewhat more difficult…more suited for Spies than Rogues.\nI have been asked to ensure that Watchtower 6, the only tower to survive the recent wars against the Necromancers, be unable to defend itself the next time it is attacked.\nKilling the guards inside won’t help—the Necromancers will just fill it again with more troops.\nThe tower is on the southern edge of the Necromancers’ land.\nI want you to slip inside and move the counterweight in the gatehouse at the top of the tower to the gatehouse at the bottom of the tower.\nIt is a heavy weight that can be found in a slot against the wall with a rope tied to it.\nWhen the time comes for an attack, the misplaced weights will be noticed too late, and the gate will not close.\nIf you can do this, you will have proven your status as a Spy."
msgstr "你们的下一个任务可有点难度。看来密探比神偷更适合完成这个任务。现在死灵法师和我们之间的战争已经到了最关键的阶段。我接到命令必须捣毁他们硕果仅存的6号哨塔，使其丧失战斗力。杀光里面的守兵是无济于事的，死灵法师只会派更多的队伍来防守哨塔。唯一的办法就是派人偷偷潜入那里，把在塔顶哨口里的顶门石移到塔楼底层的房间里去。那块石头就在塔顶一堵墙对面的房间里，用一根绳子系着。你们只要完成任务，我们一旦发动进攻，他们不能关上大门，这样部队就可以长驱直入了。那个哨塔就在死灵法师领地的南部。如果你们能完成这项任务，你们就无愧于密探的称号了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1000
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:62
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Um…The weight needs to go in the box in the lower gatehouse—not here.\nGo back to Watchtower 6 and put the weight in the right box!"
msgstr "嗯…这块顶门石必须移到塔楼的底层去，可不能放在这个地方。快回去把石头放到应该放的地方去。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1001
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:63
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmm.\nRemoving the weight from the upper gatehouse was a start, but where is it now?!?\nThe plan won’t work unless you put the weight in the lower gatehouse!\nGo back to Watchtower 6 and put the weight in the right box!"
msgstr "嗯，光把顶门石从塔顶移开可不行。你们把它放什么地方去了？如果石头没放到塔楼底层，我们的计划就前功尽弃了！快回6号哨塔，把石头放到应该放的地方去。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1002
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:64
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You haven’t done the job yet!\nRemember, you must go to Watchtower 6 and move the weight from the box in the upper gatehouse to the lower gatehouse.\nI will not promote you until that is done. "
msgstr "我交给你们的任务你们还没完成呢！记住，你们只有把6号哨塔顶层的顶门石放到塔楼底层，才算圆满完成任务，不然的话我是不会提拔你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1003
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:65
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good work!\nSome day, your sabotage of that watchtower will save hundreds of lives.\nFor your services, I hereby promote the Rogues among you to the status of Spy, and the Honorary Rogues to Honorary Spies! Oh, and here’s some gold as payment. "
msgstr "干得太棒了，你们这次行动的成功将在未来的战斗中挽救数百人的生命。鉴于你们的功绩，我将你们之中的神偷提拔为密探，荣誉神偷提拔为荣誉密探!这里还有一笔奖金，你们拿去吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1004
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:66
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, Johann be wanting the Faerie Pipes, eh?\nI can't say I'm surprised--he wouldn't come here himself, the coward.\nThe Pipes will cost you, though… all your food.\nOf course, I've got some delightful food down below, should thee be wanting to restock your packs."
msgstr "乔安想要神笛？她自己怎么不来？我明白了，这个胆小鬼可不敢上我这儿来。要拿神笛，你们得用你们身上所有的食物来换，这两天我象是患了贪食症，老是吃不够。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1006
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:68
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So…you wish to become an Assassin.\nVery well.\nI can provide the Rogues among you the training necessary, but you must prove both your skill and your loyalty before I will invest time in you.\nMy superiors inform me that a certain Lady Eleanor Carmine’s life must end.\nShe used to work for us, but has taken up residence in the Celestial Court with our enemies, and is providing them with information damaging to our cause.\nSilence her, and return with a trinket of hers to prove the job is done."
msgstr "哦，你们要成为杀手，好吧，不过我只能把你们之中的神偷提拔为杀手，而且你们还得完成我交给你们的任务，以证明你们的忠诚和能力，不然就别来浪费我的时间了。我接到命令，必须干掉埃利诺·卡米尔这个臭女人。她原来也是我们一伙的，现在她竟然投靠了我们的敌人，泄露了不少机密，真是太可恶了。她就住在塞莱斯特的通天院，把她从埃拉西亚蒸发掉，这个任务就交给你们了。记住完成任务后别忘了把她身上的匕首带回来，有了它作证据我就可以提拔你们了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1007
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:69
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have chosen the path of Light, and therefore can never become an effective Assassin.\nI cannot train you.\nPerhaps you should continue a softer hearted training with the Spy."
msgstr "你们既然已经选择了光明之路，就当不成杀手了，我可不能传授你们什么东西。还是做密探去吧，这样人会变得善良些。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1008
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:70
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can turn a simple Rogue into a fearsome killer, but only if he has the right kind of temperament for the job.\nThe time is coming when you must choose to walk in the light, or in the dark.\nIf you prefer the shadow, come to me and I will complete your training."
msgstr "我能够把一个普通的神偷训练成为冷血无情的杀手。不过我得看看你们是否有这方面的气质和天赋。你们得尽快在光明之路和黑暗之路之间作出选择。如果你们决定投身邪派，那么上我这儿来吧，我会训练你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1009
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:71
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you were looking for someone to train you in advanced stealth techniques, I\nwould be your man.\nBut you still need someone to teach you basic techniques.\nReturn to me when you achieve Rogue or Honorary Rogue status.\nThen, perhaps, I can further your education.\nSeek the Master Thief in the sewers of Erathia."
msgstr "要是你们想找人学习高级的盗窃技术，那你们可找对人了。不过你们得首先成为神偷或是荣誉神偷，这样我就可以传艺了。去找盗贼大师吧，他就在埃拉西亚的下水道里。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1010
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:72
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Without proof, I cannot assume Lady Carmine is dead.\nBring me proof, and I will honor you with the title of Assassin."
msgstr "没有匕首，我怎么知道卡米尔死没死。快把证据拿来，我就能授予你们杀手称号了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1011
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:73
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, the job is done. [He examines the dagger slowly, then sighs.] She was very dear to me, but emotion is the enemy of reason.\nI could not have done the job myself.\nThank you.\nTruly now, you are Assassins.\nThe rogues among you, I will give special training to.\nHere is a small payment to help cover the expenses you incurred on the job. "
msgstr "嗯，活干得不错。（他仔细端详着匕首，叹了口气）我曾经深爱过她，可最终理智战胜了感情，不过我实在不忍心自己亲自下手，谢谢你们了，从现在起，你们之中的神偷就是杀手了，我会传你们几手绝活的。这点酬金你们拿去吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1012
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:74
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You don't have the tapestry yet, and the clock is ticking.\nIt would be prudent to keep to the task at hand rather than bothering me with your babble."
msgstr "你们还没有拿到挂毯，不过没关系，还有的是时间。在你们完成任务以前可别再来找我了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1013
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:75
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ha! So, thee wishes to take the test to be a crusader?\nI cannot blame thee—the sense of pride one feels when one has accomplished a heroic deed is sublime!\nThe test is simple.\nA dragon must be slain.\nI know just the one—Wromthrax the Heartless!\nHe lives in a cave in Tatalia, and terrorizes the peasants who live near him when he’s home.\nHe should be in the cave this time of year.\nBecause this is probably thine first dragon, I will travel with thee to give thee pointers.\nSo, let us go forthwith, and spill this monster’s black blood!"
msgstr "哈，你们想成为十字军？是啊，人人都想尝尝做英雄的滋味，一定很风光吧！不过要想成为十字军，得杀一条龙。我就知道有条名叫劳斯莱克的巨龙，它就住在泰塔利亚的一个洞穴里，经常骚扰附近的百姓。估计今年它肯定待在洞穴里。由于这条龙凶残无比，我决定跟你们一块去，一路上可以给你们一些指点。快走吧，这个家伙已经死到临头了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1014
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:76
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hurrah!\nThe Dragon has fallen!\nTruly thou art grand Crusaders in good standing, with a fine deed behind thee.\nI would stay and sing songs of thy bravery with thee, but duty calls.\nSurely we will meet again, Crusaders!"
msgstr "哈，巨龙完蛋了！鉴于你们立下大功一件，我授予你们十字军的称号。本来我应该留下来和你们一起庆祝胜利，可惜还有些要紧的事要办，后会有期了，十字军们！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1016
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:78
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am pleased to see thee chose the path of Light, Crusaders!\nA wrong has been committed, friends, and who else but us can put it right?\nA wicked villain has kidnapped a fair maiden by the name of Alice Hargreaves.\nHis name is William Setag, and he has imprisoned her in his tower.\nYou must ride forthwith to put this villain to the sword and rescue sweet Alice!\nIf you succeed, you will truly be Heroes of the Land!"
msgstr "很高兴你们能选择光明之路，十字军们！有件事要麻烦你们，一位名叫埃莉斯·哈格的善良姑娘被绑架了。绑匪名叫威廉姆·塞塔格，他把人关在他的塔里了。如果你们能手刃这个家伙，救出可怜的姑娘，你们就可以成为英雄。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1017
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:79
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will not have truck with thee further, scoundrel!\nI see now thee hath chosen the path of Darkness.\nMayhaps thee should seek a villain like thyself for training."
msgstr "我没功夫和你们多废话，你们这群流氓！你们既然已经选择了黑暗之路，还来找我干什么，去找你们的同路货吧，他们会有兴趣训练你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1018
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:80
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, fellow Crusaders!\nI know thee thirsts for another task with which to hone thy Crusading skills, but first thee must pass a far more serious test.\nThee must agree to follow the Path of Light before I can help thee further.\nYou will know when you have made this choice.\nReturn to me then."
msgstr "啊，原来是十字军来了！我知道你们急于想立功，以便学习英雄的本领。但你们得先作出一个慎重的决定，只有选择了光明之路，我才能帮助你们完成心愿。还是拿定主意再来找我吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1019
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:81
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thee’ve done it! I knew thee could do it!\nI’m so proud of thee!\nAlice has been freed of the clutches of the wicked William Setag, evil has been vanquished, and good upheld.\nWhere once there was wrong, now there is right! [Charles sighs and smiles broadly] Well.\nMy work here is done!\nThee have passed the tests and deserve thy reward.\nTherefore do I solemnly declare thee Heroes! "
msgstr "你们成功了，我知道你们行的，真为你们骄傲。你们把埃莉斯从威廉姆·塞塔格的魔爪中救了出来，伸张正义，铲除邪恶，真是太了不起了。（查尔斯放声大笑）好了，你们已经完成了任务，证明了你们的能力，我宣布你们为埃拉西亚的英雄。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1021
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:83
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tsk tsk.\nYou haven't finished your training as a Crusader; I cannot instruct you until you show proper dedication."
msgstr "什么，你们还没有成为十字军，那么等你们获得这个称号再来向我求教吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1022
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:84
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It should be impossible for you to see this right now.\nIf you are reading this, tell Bryan that the event and/or logic of this quest is messed up because you should either be good attempting the Hero quest, or evil attempting the Villain quest and you are apparently neither."
msgstr "你们本来不可能马上看到这个。要是你们真的看过它，得告诉伯瑞安这个任务委派错了。你们要么做好人，去完成英雄的任务，要么做坏人，去完成恶棍的任务，可现在你们既没有选择光明之路也没有选择黑暗之路，哪一边的人都不是。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1023
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:85
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Help!\nWilliam has captured me and imprisoned me in this tower.\nPlease get me out of here as quickly as possible, I don't want to die."
msgstr "救命啊！威廉姆绑架了我，把我囚禁在这个塔里。请把我救出去吧，这个鬼地方我一刻也不想呆了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1025
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:87
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excuse me, but who might you be?\nHey!\nGet your hands off of me!\nHelp!"
msgstr "对不起，请问你们是谁？嗨，别碰我，救命！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1026
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:88
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Where do you think you're taking me?\nI have a rich family-- you'll be in a lot of trouble if you don't let me go!"
msgstr "你们把我带哪儿去？我的家族可是很庞大的，你们要是不让我走，会有很多人要你们好看！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1027
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:89
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Let's get down to business, shall we?\nI know you are well aware of my standing as the blackest Villain in Erathia.\nIt requires effort and drive to prove to be this evil-- I hope you have the mettle for it.\nI would love nothing more than to keep you in my training for years and teach you the finest parts of being a Villain.\nUnfortunately, I am under pressure to speed up your tutelage.\nTo this end, I have a direct way to learn the arts of Villainhood.\nThere is a woman, Alice Hargreaves, who is of noble blood and pure character.\nCapture this woman from her residence in Castle Gryphonheart. Return here and imprison her in my tower.\nComplete this, and I shall promote all Crusaders in your group to Villains, and the rest of your group to Honorary Villains."
msgstr "让我们谈正事吧。你们应该知道我是埃拉西亚最臭名昭著的大魔头。要成为魔头也不容易，必须煞费苦心地干几件惊天动地的大事才能证明自己的邪恶，希望你们有信心迎接挑战。本来我想花几年功夫好好调教你们，让你们了解魔头本领的精髓，可惜我最近要事缠身，没这么多闲功夫。不过我有一个速成法，有个血统高贵的贵族小姐名叫埃莉斯·哈格，你们去把她从格芬哈格城堡抓来，关进我的塔楼。一旦你们完成这个任务，我会把你们之中的十字军提拔为魔头，其他人授予荣誉魔头称号。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1028
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:90
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'd certainly love nothing more than to corrupt your obviously pious soul, but I'm afraid you wouldn't have the stomach to follow through with my teachings.\nYou have chosen the Path of Light, you will garner no assistance from me."
msgstr "我确实很想腐蚀你们虔诚的灵魂，但恐怕你们没有勇气听从我的教诲。既然你们已经选择了光明之路，我可什么都不能传授你们了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1029
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:91
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Before you make this decision, you have a more pressing, immediate decision you will be forced to make.\nIf you choose the darker road, you may return to me and complete your training in the Paladins' arts."
msgstr "在你们决定向我拜师学艺以前，你们必须在光明之路和黑暗之路间作出选择。如果选择黑暗之路，你们可以来找我，我会传授你们圣武士的本领。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1030
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:92
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Capital!\nYou have shown dedication, daring, and the power of raw force.\nCertainly the imprisonment of such a fair and noble creature in this wicked place earns you the right to be called a Villain-- or Honorary Villain.\nGo now upon the world and make all fear your name."
msgstr "干得棒极了！你们在这次行动中显示了非凡的勇气和高超的本领，竟然把这么位漂亮高贵的小姐抓来了。你们的所作所为完全配得上魔头和荣誉魔头的称号。你们现在可以在埃拉西亚为所欲为了，整个大陆将臣服在你们脚下。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1031
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:93
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Where's Alice?\nI'm not asking for much, just a simple kidnapping.\nIs it really that difficult?\nI suggest you speed up your efforts."
msgstr "埃莉斯带来了吗，连绑架个人这点小事都不会办，真没有出息。你们得加一把劲了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1032
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:94
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, it is normal for novice Monks to ask for the path of enlightenment.\nI shall tell you of the path, though the journey is yours to make.\nIn the Barrow Downs is a series of tombs-- one of which was constructed on a site of great natural power.\nYou will know the right barrow because it is different from the rest.\nReach this barrow and meditate by the water, and your promotion to Initiate will be complete."
msgstr "啊，几乎所有的年轻僧侣都想升职为修士，让我来告诉你们如何能够实现这个愿望。你们到拜尔德斯去，那里有一个坟墓具有神奇的魔力，显得与众不同，你们很容易认出来。你们在这个坟墓边先喝水，然后静默冥想。这样你们就可以升职为修士了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1033
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:95
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[Bartholomew Hume contacts you mentally] Congratulations, young ones.\nMy final lesson given to you as Monks is this:\nenlightenment is gained by the journey, not the destination.\nIn this case, the destination was critical to prove that you were capable of the journey.\nI shall now promote all Monks to Initiates and everyone else to Honorary Initiates-- congratulations."
msgstr "（巴斯洛缪·海墨尔诚挚地对你们说）祝贺你们，年轻人。你们要记住，顿悟是一项需要不断增进提高的技能，能够顿悟并不是目的，而只是修炼的开始。你们需要不断使这项本领精益求精。好了，我把你们之中的僧侣提拔为修士，其他人授予荣誉修士称号。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1034
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:96
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have not finished your journey.\nReturn to me only when you have completed your task."
msgstr "你们还没有把该做的完成呢！等你们完成了使命再来找我吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1035
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:97
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I see you wish to continue your journey.\nExcellent!\nHave no fear, for you are prepared for your next step.\nYou must extinguish the remnants of an evil order- the Order of Baa.\nDefeat their High Priest and return to me and I shall complete your training and promote you to Master."
msgstr "你们想继续在埃拉西亚铲除邪恶，匡扶正义，真是太好了，这样你们可以在光明之路上更进一步。你们的任务是扫平羊鸣教的残余势力，打败羊鸣教的高级神甫后回来见我，我会把你们提拔为智者。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1036
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:98
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am sorry, but I am permitted to train you no longer.\nYou will need to find a new Master to learn from."
msgstr "很抱歉，我不能再教你们什么了，你们得另找位大师学艺。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1037
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:99
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A fork approaches in your path.\nI will only train you after you've chosen to walk the lighter path."
msgstr "现在你们的人生道路面临重大抉择。你们只有选择光明之路，我才能传授你们本领。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1038
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:100
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I cannot improve upon training you do not already have.\nYou must be promoted to Crusader before I can train you in the ways of villainy."
msgstr "你们竟然连十字军也不是，别来浪费我的时间了，等你们得到十字军称号再来找我学习魔头的本领吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1039
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1831
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:101
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:140
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the one you need to speak with in order to join the Guild of the Elements.\nThe cost to join is 100 gold pieces.\nOnly members may purchase spells from our fine library.\nThe guild has spells from all four of the elemental disciplines, and like all guilds in the kingdom, we have two guild halls.\nMembership in one automatically enrolls you in the other."
msgstr "如果你要加入元素魔法行会，就必须先来找我。加入本教派你得先付100个金币。然后就可以从我们的魔法密笈库中购买魔法咒语。本教派拥有元素魔法的全部咒语。和王国里的其它教派一样，我们有两个教派大堂。加入其中一个就可以自动进入另一个大堂。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1040
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1832
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:102
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:141
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is my sacred duty to accept donations for the Guild of the Self.\nIf you contribute 100 gold pieces, we will grant you guild member status.\nMembers are permitted to buy spells from any Guild of the Self in the land."
msgstr "我专门负责处理对自我魔法行会的捐献。如果你愿付100个金币，就可以加入本教。到时你可以从国内的自我魔法行会中购买魔法咒语。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1041
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:103
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Air is the element the sorcerers join the profession to learn!\nWe have all the best spells--including the glorious Fly spell.\nDon't miss out on this fantastic opportunity to join the Air guild!\nJust 50 gold!"
msgstr "空气魔法是巫师必修的一种魔法。我们空气魔法行会拥有的魔法种类众多，威力无比，还有象飞行奇术这类顶级魔法。加入我们行会才要50个金币，你们可千万别错失这个好机会啊。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1042
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:104
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Membership in the Guild of Earth will give you access to our excellent library of earth spells.\nThis membership is good for all Earth Guilds on the continent of Erathia.\nThe cost to join is but 50 gold pieces."
msgstr "加入土系魔法行会可以在浩如烟海的土系魔法库里尽情领略魔法的奥妙与神奇，使每个人受益终生。只要付50个金币就可以得偿所愿。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1043
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:105
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Why be subtle when you can learn Fire magic?\nJoining our guild costs but 50 gold for a lifetime membership."
msgstr "能够学习到威力无比的火系魔法，你们还犹豫什么呢？花50个金币加入我们的火系魔法行会将是你们一生最正确的选择。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1044
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:106
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Membership in the Guild of Water gives you the right to buy our spells of change and movement.\nIt's my job to recruit new members and collect membership dues from them.\nThe price is 50 gold, and that includes membership in all of our guild halls."
msgstr "加入了水系魔法行会，你们就可以尽情学习我们行会光怪陆离的魔法。我负责为行会召募新成员，你们只要付50个金币，就可以加入我们的行会。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1045
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:107
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the guild recruiter for the Guild of Body.\nA lot of people think that our spells just heal the body, but some can damage the bodies of your opponents too.\nThe cost is 50 gold pieces."
msgstr "我负责为肢体魔法行会召募新成员。许多人都以为我们行会的魔法只会治病救人，其实我们还有可置人死命的魔法。加入我们行会的费用为50个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1046
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:108
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "50 gold pieces buys you membership in the Guild of the Mind.\nWhy fight a monster yourself when you can get its friends to fight it for you?\nKills two birds with one stone, if you ask me.\nWell, what do you say?"
msgstr "你们只要花50个金币就可以加入我们心智魔法行会。我们魔法的妙处在于你们与怪物作战时自己不必亲自参加战斗，而是施放心智魔法召唤它的盟友与它为敌，你们正好可以一石二鸟，坐山观虎斗，多么奇妙的魔法啊！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1047
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:109
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Many believe the most powerful magic to be Light magic, or Dark magic, or something destructive, like Fire.\nWe at the Spirit guild would like to point out that no magic besides Light magic can raise the dead, and even then it takes a Grandmaster in the element.\nIf you want power over life and death, choose Spirit magic.\nThe cost to join is but 50 gold pieces."
msgstr "许多人认为威力最大的魔法当推光明、暗黑两大盖世魔法。有的认为火系魔法之类的魔法也挺厉害的。但是世上有哪种魔法可以起死回生呢，除了光明魔法就只有我们灵魂魔法了。别的行会魔法即使练到宗师级也不顶用。如果你们要学习关于生与死的魔法，加入我们的魔法行会吧，只要付50个金币就够了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1048
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:110
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Light magic represents the most powerful magic a person can wield without cost to his soul.\nWe feel confident our price of 1000 gold pieces for guild membership is fair.\nYou won't regret your decision to pursue Light magic."
msgstr "光明魔法是正直善良的人所能修炼的最高等级魔法。我们想花1000个金币加入我们的行会是再合适不过了。光明魔法的神妙一定会让你们感到物有所值。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1049
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:111
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "At last you have an opportunity to learn Dark magic by joining the Guild of the Dark.\nDon't squander it!\nDark magic is the strongest magic.\nThe cost is only 1000 gold pieces.\nYou know it's worth it."
msgstr "你们要学习暗黑魔法，就只有加入暗黑魔法行会。别轻易放弃这个机会，我们的魔法可是世上威力最强大的魔法。我们只要你们1000个金币，怎么样，便宜吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1072
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Missing Text 133"
msgstr "失落的正文133"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1073
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:135
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good work.\nNo longer shall the Order of Baa stain the lands of Erathia.\nNow, allow me to promote all Initiates to Masters, and all Honorary Initiates to Honorary Masters.\nKeep in mind that this is but a stop along the path of enlightenment.\nYour journey only ends with your eventual death-- never close your mind."
msgstr "干得漂亮，这下羊鸣教在埃拉西亚彻底土崩瓦解了。我现在把你们之中的修士提拔为智者，荣誉修士提拔为荣誉智者。记住你们所完成的只是顿悟的一个阶段而已，你们必须终生坚持冥想，苦思，顿悟，永不松懈，方可得成正果。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1074
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:136
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Temple of Baa still stands, their High Priest still lives.\nUntil this is completed, you are not ready for the title of Master.\nGo now and do not fail."
msgstr "羊鸣教的神庙还在那儿，他们的高级神甫还活得好好的。别气馁，继续加把劲，只要你们完成任务，我就提拔你们为智者。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1075
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:137
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "An agent of mine has sent me a message I need deciphered.\nThe cipher relies on knowing which word of which a certain book to match it against.\nIf you wish to become a Ninja, this is what you must do: Infiltrate the School of Wizardry and find out what the third word of the famed Scroll of Waves is.\nUse it to decipher the message, then do what the message tells you to do.\nIt is the key to enter the Tomb of the Master.\nYou'll find the tomb in Southern Erathia.\n[Stephan hands you a scrap of paper] Here is the encoded message."
msgstr "我的一个手下交给我一份密码，破解这份密码的关键词隐藏在一份魔法卷轴中。你们要成为忍者，就必须潜入魔法学院，找出波浪魔法卷轴中的关键词，解开这份密码。然后你们要按照密码上提供的信息行动，它会告诉你们如何进入宗师坟墓，那个坟墓就在埃拉西亚的南面。（斯丹芬尼递给你们一张纸片）这就是要破译的密码。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1076
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:138
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ambition is good, but I only train experienced students.\nCome back when you've achieved Initiate status, and perhaps I'll teach you…IF you have the right outlook.\nIf you're looking for someone who is willing to help you become an Initiate, perhaps you should start with that wimp Bartholomew Hume.\nI'm sure he'd be willing to give you an elementary education."
msgstr "年轻人求知欲强固然很好，但我可不教没有经验的学生。你们只有达到修士的等级，并且天资聪慧，我才会传艺给你们。要想知道谁能使你们成为修士吗？你们不妨去找巴斯洛缪·海墨尔，他会把这些基本技能传授给你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1077
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:139
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[Stephan Sand sneers] YOU want ME to teach you something?\nYou sniveling do-gooders make my knife arm twitch!\nGet out of my sight before I REALLY teach you about fighting!"
msgstr "（斯丹芬尼嘲笑）你们想向我拜师学艺？瞧你们这笨手笨脚的样子，我的兵器都快被你们磕坏了。快滚吧，不让我可真要教训教训你们了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1078
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:140
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though you have achieved initiate status, I am uncertain that you can stomach some of my more extreme teachings.\nReturn to me when you have formally rejected all philosophies that turn people into weaklings and cowards."
msgstr "尽管你们已经达到了修士等级，但我担心你们学得太杂，无法对我传授的本领全身心投入。你们首先得抛弃以前所学的跳梁小丑般的鬼魅伎俩，才能学习我威力无比的本领。."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1079
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:141
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you have the key, but you haven't followed the directions in the message.\nRemember, the tomb is in Southern Erathia.\nComplete your task, and return to me to report success.\nIf you can't complete your mission, don't bother returning to me.\nFailure is pathetic."
msgstr "你们既然已经破解了密码，为什么不按照上面说的做。我再说一遍，坟墓在埃拉西亚南面，你们得完成任务然后回来向我报告，要是失败了，就不用回来了。这次行动对你们来说“不成功，便成仁”。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1080
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:142
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[Sand sighs] Once again, the cipher key is the third word of the first paragraph of the Scroll of Waves.\nYou can find it somewhere in the School of Wizardry.\nI don't care how you get in there--kill anyone who gets in your way, or sneak in.\nWhatever you want.\nThe only thing that matters is success.\nEverything else is an excuse for personal weakness."
msgstr "（山德叹气）你们这些笨蛋，我再重复一遍。密码就是波浪魔法卷轴中的关键词，你们到魔法学院去，肯定能找到这份卷轴。我不管你们使用什么手段，暗杀，地遁，计策，随你们的便。我要的是结果，别再找什么借口了，这次一定要成功。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1081
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:143
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well done.\nNo one can argue with success except apologists for the weak and the cowardly.\nI hereby promote all Initiates to Ninjas, and all non-Initiates to Honorary Ninjas.\nOh yeah, go ahead and keep that little trinket you stole from the tomb.\nThis was just a training exercise, after all."
msgstr "干得漂亮，你们这次行动如此出色，我除了称赞还能说什么呢。我现在把你们之中的修士提拔为忍者，其他人授予荣誉忍者称号。你们从坟墓里带回来的东西就作为战利品奖赏给你们，毕竟这只是次小考验而已，你们要经历的风浪还多着呢！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1082
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:144
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A few generations ago, an enchanted bow was created by alchemists in the Tularean Forest to seal another peace treaty between the elves and the humans.\nWhile en route to Erathia, the bow was taken from the couriers by the Titans in Avlee.\nThey have no use for the thing, so it's probably in their stronghold still.\nStrike a blow for our profession, and get that bow back.\nIt is absolutely the finest thing of its kind ever made.\nOh, and while you're there, feel free to cut some of those bullies down to size--They stole it out of cruelty, not need!\nIf you are successful, I will promote all Warrior Mages to Master Archers, or honorary Master Archers, as the case may be."
msgstr "一些年以前，图拉利昂森林里有个炼金术士打造了一张完美之弓用来见证精灵族和人类所订立的和平条约，使双方能够和平相处。但在向埃拉西亚进发的途中，埃里的泰坦巨人抢走了这张完美之弓。这帮蠢货又不会射箭，要这张弓有什么用。它们一定把弓放在他们的营地里了。开弓放箭是我们的老本行，我们自然有义务把完美之弓夺回来，那可是件旷世罕见的兵器啊！你们的任务就是去把完美之弓夺回来，顺便教训教训这帮家伙，连没用的东西都要偷，真是可恶。如果你们顺利完成任务，我会把你们之中高级射手提拔为神箭手，其他人授予荣誉神箭手称号。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1083
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:145
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, you've achieved the rank of Warrior Mage, and wish to advance to Master Archer!\nA worthy goal, but I only promote those who's heart and courage match their skill.\nCome back to me when you have firmly committed to the Light.\nThen I will help you."
msgstr "你们已经成为高级射手，还想晋升为神箭手？虽然你们理想远大，但我的要求非常严格，只提拔那些真正有恒心，有毅力，而且本领超群的英雄好汉。你们再慎重考虑考虑，如果你们决心坚定不移地选择光明之路，可以再来找我，我会帮助你们实现理想的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1084
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:146
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have chosen the path of Darkness.\nI will never help you improve, for fear you will use your skills to advance your selfish goals!"
msgstr "你们既然已经选择了黑暗之路，还来找我干什么。我可不会传授你们本领，省得将来为虎作伥，助纣为虐。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1085
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:147
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the person to see if you want to become Master Archers, but you have come too soon!\nYou must have the proper background to become a Master, and that means first becoming a warrior mage.\nReturn when you are ready."
msgstr "我确实可以把弓箭手系列职业人员提拔为神箭手。可是你们还没有达到要求，连高级射手也不是，我没法提拔你们，还是回去加紧准备，等达到要求再来找我吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1086
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:148
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You found the bow!\nLet me take some measurements and adjust it to your specific style of archery. Once I have finished you should keep it, and use it in defense the of the land and the people.\nI am happy to promote all Warrior Mages to Master Archers, and all Honorary Warrior Mages to Honorary Master Archers."
msgstr "你们把完美之弓夺回来了，真了不起！这张弓作为奖赏就送给你们了，我先得把它稍加改造，让你们使用起来更加得心应手。你们一定要用它来保护埃拉西亚的人民百姓。现在我把你们之中的高级射手提拔为神箭手，其他人授予荣誉神箭手称号。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1087
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:149
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No luck getting the bow?\nWell, take your time, and plan your assault against the Titans carefully.\nAgainst such powerful opponents, there is no shame in striking and retreating.\nDo what you must to defeat these monsters."
msgstr "还没有拿到完美之弓吗？不要紧，慢慢来，时间还多着呢。对付这帮凶残无比的家伙，得讲究策略，不能一味猛攻，多动动脑子，你们一定会成功的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1088
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:150
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[Wheeze] So you think you can become Warrior Mages, do you?\nIt isn't easy.\nYou must be equally proficient in magical skills and physical skills.\nThere is a test of this.\nVisit the Red Dwarf Mines.\nInside you will find two kinds of beasts--one that can be harmed only with magic, and one that can be harmed only with steel.\nIn the back of the lower section of the mines you will find a machine created by the Dwarves that powers the lift-- the only access between the upper and lower sections of the mines.\nTo keep the creatures trapped in the lower section, you will have to replace the belt in the machine with this one, a worn belt that will only last about an hour before breaking.\nThis should give you enough time to get to the lift and get out before you are trapped down there.\nSeal away these creatures and return to me-- only then will I call you Warrior Mages."
msgstr "（喘气）你们想成为高级射手，那可不容易。你们不仅要弓箭射得准，而且还要精通魔法。你们的任务是去红矮人矿井一趟，那里有两种不同的怪物，一种刀枪不入，只有魔法才可以伤害它们，另一种魔法对它们不起作用，要对付它们只有用兵器。在矿井下面走到底你们会找到矮人族所制造的升降梯，这是连接矿井地上和地下的唯一通路。你们必须把所有的怪兽都赶到矿井地下，然后把升降梯的吊索换上这根快断的，这根吊索只能坚持一个小时，不过这点时间已足够你们脱险回到地上了。完成任务后再上我这儿来吧，我会提拔你们为高级射手。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1089
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:151
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Very Good.\nYou have passed the test.\nNow the creatures are sealed away and won't be able to prey on the dwarves any longer, and you have proven your ability in both sorcery and steel.\nI am proud to declare all Archers amongst you Warrior Mages, and everyone else Honorary Warrior Mages.\nCongratulations!\nNow get out.\nI already weary of your company."
msgstr "你们干得真不错，竟然这么快就完成了任务。怪兽们都被埋在地底下，再也不会出来危害我们矮人族了。你们已经显示了非凡的武艺和高超的魔法技能，我现在提拔你们之中的弓箭手为高级射手，其他人授予荣誉高级射手称号。祝贺你们！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1090
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:152
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You haven't sabotaged the machine yet.\nYou must finish this before I'll promote you to Warrior Mage."
msgstr "你们还没有把升降机毁了。只有完成了任务，我才可以提拔你们为高级射手。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1091
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:153
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Getting ambitious, are we?\nThink you can earn the title of sniper?\nPerhaps you can.\nHere is what you must do:\nIn the stronghold of the Titans is a very special bow that was meant as a peace offering from the elves to the humans to quell a conflict long since forgotten.\n[Master Snick shakes his head] Gads! This peace stuff makes me nauseous!\nIn any case, fetch the bow for the good of our profession, and I'll promote you to Sniper.\n[Heh] you better act like snipers if you expect to defeat the Titans.\nA toe to toe...or should I say head to knee fight won't go well for you."
msgstr "什么，你们要成为狙击手。这里有个任务要你们去干。在泰坦巨人的营地里有一张完美之弓。这是精灵族送给人类的礼物以平息他们之间连绵不断的战争冲突。（斯尼克大师摇着头）混蛋，什么和平礼物，真让我恶心！不过这张弓对我们来说可是件宝物，你们只要能把完美之弓拿回来，我就提拔你们为狙击手，你们要对付泰坦巨人可得小心些，千万不能硬拼，鸡蛋碰石头可没有什么好下场。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1092
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:154
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Want to be a Sniper, eh? Maybe.\nBut I doubt you have the heart for it.\nIt needs to shrivel like a raisin and get hard as a stone to be able to do what you must.\nProve to me you are following the Path of Darkness, and then I will teach you further."
msgstr "想要成为狙击手，好啊！但我不知道你们有没有恒心。要做一名出色的狙击手，必须风餐露宿，跋山涉水，人会变得面目憔悴，铁石心肠。如果你们选择了黑暗之路，我会传授你们本领的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1093
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:155
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Following the Path of Light, are we?\nHow can you be a Sniper if you cry everytime you shoot someone in the back?\nMaybe you should ask that lily-livered Lawrence Mark to help you.\nI know that I will not."
msgstr "既然你们已经选择了光明之路，就别想成为狙击手了，我可不愿教个徒弟伏击时会傻乎乎地先向敌人示警。你们还是去找劳伦斯·马克吧，说不定他有法子帮你们，我可无能为力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1094
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:156
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have the bow?!\nExcellent!\nIt's been centuries since someone was brave enough to take on the Titans and try to get that bow back!\nLet me take some measurements and adjust it to your specific style of archery.\nI am proud to be the one to first call all Warrior Mages amongst you Snipers, and to say that all Honorary Warrior Mages are Honorary Snipers!\nI must admit I didn't think you had it in you to succeed.\nI am happy that I was wrong."
msgstr "你们把完美之弓带回来了！好极了！很久以来没人敢上泰坦巨人那里去偷完美之弓，你们真是太伟大了。这张完美之弓就给你们了，我会对它稍加改进，让你们使用更加得心应手。我现在提拔你们之中的高级射手为狙击手，其他人授予荣誉狙击手称号！说实话，我可没料到你们会成功。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1095
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:157
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "More failure? [Master Snick yawns]\nHow surprising.\nI'll make it simple--no bow, no title."
msgstr "怎么又失败了？（斯尼克大师咆哮着）咱们把话说明白了，没有完美之弓，别想升职。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1096
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:158
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you want to be champions, do you?\nHa!\nHow can you be a champion if you don't win any tournaments?\nYou know, I can't really promote you to Champion status--you have to do it yourself, just like everything else.\nGo and win five championship tournaments in the Arena at Knight level, and come back to me.\nI'll call you Champions then, if you want."
msgstr "你们要成为勇士，就一定要参加竞技大会。要达到勇士的等级必须经受血与火的洗礼，这一切得靠你们自己的努力。你们必须去竞技场赢得五次骑士级别的挑战，然后我才能提拔你们为勇士。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1097
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:159
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can see you very much want to be called Champions, but I'm not so sure I should help you.\nProve to me that you follow the Path of Light, and then we'll talk about promotion."
msgstr "看得出你们很想成为勇士，但我不知道是否帮得上忙？你们只有坚定选择了光明之路，我才能够提拔你们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1098
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:160
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Call you Champions?\nNever!\nThe only reason I'm not hacking you evil doers to bits is that you came here peacefully.\nLeave now, before I change my mind and rid the world of another problem."
msgstr "提拔你们为勇士，真是痴心妄想！我可不会和你们这帮选择了黑暗之路的家伙打交道，趁我还没有发脾气，快滚吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1099
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:161
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the person to talk to if you want to be called Champions.\nFirst, though, you must practice.\nReturn to me when you've become Cavaliers.\nThen, if you have the right outlook, I will tell you what you must do to become Champions."
msgstr "不错，要成为勇士你们只有来找我。但你们首先得达到豪侠等级。你们只有达到豪侠等级，并且选择光明之路，我才能告诉你们如何成为勇士。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1100
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:162
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Congratulations for you recent tourney victories, my friends!\nI gladly name the Cavaliers among you Champions, and the Honorary Cavaliers I name Honorary Champions!\nAlways fight for the Light, Champions!"
msgstr "祝贺你们在竞技大会上大获全胜。我现在提拔你们之中的豪侠为勇士，荣誉豪侠授予荣誉勇士称号。为伸张正义而战斗吧，我的勇士们！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1101
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:163
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have not yet won 5 championship tournaments in the Arena.\nReturn to me when you have won five, and I will promote you.\nRemember, these battles MUST be at the Knight difficulty level."
msgstr "你们还没有在竞技大会上赢得五场比赛，没有达到升职为勇士的要求。记住，你们必须赢得五次骑士级别的挑战，才能达到升职要求。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1102
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:164
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The hallmark of the Cavalier is courage.\nI can promote you to Cavalier status, but before I'll do that, you'll have to prove to me your bravery in battle.\nSince most people are yellow bellied cowards at heart, I doubt you'll succeed.\nBut if you want to try, here is what you must do: Destroy all the undead in the haunted mansion in the Barrow Downs."
msgstr "豪侠向来以英勇无畏著称，如果你们能在战斗中显示无畏的勇气，我可以提拔你们为豪侠。不过现在的人都是胆小鬼，平时耀武扬威，一到打仗就当逃兵，不知你们是不是这样。其实你们的任务很简单，就是去拜尔德斯中的鬼屋，把那里的亡灵全干掉。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1103
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:165
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you're back!\nAnd from the look on your faces I see you have finished the job.\nWell done!\nI hereby officially promote all Knights amongst you to Cavaliers, and everyone else to honorary Cavaliers.\nCarry your title with pride!"
msgstr "啊，你们这么快就完成任务了，干得真出色。我现在提拔你们之中的骑士为豪侠，其他人授予荣誉豪侠称号，接受这个光荣的称号吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1104
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:166
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Did one little haunted house send you packing in fear?\nI've seen chocolate eclairs with more backbone than you!\nGet you gone, and don't come back 'til you've stiffened your spine!"
msgstr "怎么，鬼屋里这两个小亡灵就把你们吓成这样了？你们这样的胆小鬼我见得多了！快滚吧，你们这种人根本不配作豪侠。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1105
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:167
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you think you can become Black Knights, do you?\nVery well.\nYou know, I've heard many people say that criminals are cowards.\nThat just isn't true.\nIt takes a lot of courage to risk your life in a robbery, or in battle.\nYou've already proven you are courageous, and now it's time to put that courage and your skills to use.\nI want you to rob the Elvish Treasury.\nIt's one of the biggest hoards of treasure in the land, and it is very well guarded.\nDo the deed and abscond with the wealth.\nReturn to me when you've finished.\nThen I will promote you to Black Knights."
msgstr "你们想成为黑骑士，真不错！人们常说坏人都是胆小鬼，真是胡说八道。我们杀人放火，打家劫舍，胆子不大能行吗！你们已经显示了非凡的勇气，达到了豪侠等级，下一个任务要考验你们的胆量和本领，去抢劫精灵宝库。那个地方可是埃拉西亚最大的宝库，警卫特别森严，如果你们能带着宝藏顺利回到这里，我就会提拔你们为黑骑士。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1106
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:168
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's true that I am the one you go to when you're looking to be promoted to Black Knight status.\nBut how can you become a Black Knight when you haven't even decided whether or not you're evil?\nReturn to me when you have fully committed to Darkness.\nOnly then will I resume your training."
msgstr "没错，要成为黑骑士是必须来找我。但你们还没有决定加入我们邪派，还妄想什么黑骑士。等你们决定选择黑暗之路再来找我吧，那时候我会调教你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1107
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:169
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Bah!\nYou do-gooders are worthless!\nIt is impossible for me to teach anything more to you!\n"
msgstr "呸！你们这种两面三刀的名门正派，选择了光明之路还来找我干什么，快滚！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1108
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:170
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All RIGHT!\nThat robbery was brilliant!\nI am very proud of you.\nKeep the loot--it's your reward for a job well done.\nI can safely say the Cavaliers among you have become Black Knights today, and I'll throw in an Honorary Black Knight title for the rest of you.\nYou've done well, my students!"
msgstr "太棒了！我真为你们骄傲。宝藏你们就自己留着吧，这是对你们的奖励。我现在提拔你们之中的豪侠为黑骑士，其他人授予荣誉黑骑士称号。好好干吧，伙计们！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1109
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:171
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Robbery not complete?\nNo.\nDon't come to me and report failure.\nDon't come and tell me you lost your nerve.\nGet out there and rob that treasury!\nFailure is not an option!"
msgstr "怎么，抢劫失败了，再去试一次。打起精神，动点脑子，我等着你们的好消息，快去吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1110
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:172
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, it looks like you might be able to do the job I have in mind.\nThe fundamental task a Ranger Lord faces is caring for the land.\nRecently, poachers removed a magical gemstone called the \"heart of the forest\" from the Tularean Forest.\nThe forest has become restless, and attacks travelers who come too close.\nThe forest blames all 'Walkers' for the theft, and won't calm down until the stone is returned.\nFind the stone and return it to the oldest tree in the Forest.\nCome back to me when you've done this."
msgstr "也许你们能帮我解决这个棘手的难题。游骑领主的职责就是维护埃拉西亚的治安。最近有人把图拉利昂森林里的魔法宝石“古树之心”偷走了。森林从此变得很不太平，游人常在那里遭到袭击。如果不把宝石交回去，它会把到那里的所有人类都认为是小偷，不分青红皂白地加以攻击。你们的任务就是找到宝石并把它送到森林中年龄最长的一棵古树那里。然后你们就来找我吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1111
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:173
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I would like to be your teacher--I really would, but I'm not sure you're cut out to be a Ranger Lord.\nSoon you must make a decision of the heart.\nIf you choose the Path of Light, return to me.\nI would be honored to be your teacher."
msgstr "我挺乐意传授你们本领的，但我不知道你们是否有资格成为游骑领主。要是你们真心诚意选择了光明之路，你们可以再来找我。我会传授你们本领的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1112
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:174
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[Lysander shakes his head, smiling gently] Too soon, eager ones.\nI train only the most advanced students.\nSeek me out again when you reach Hunter status."
msgstr "（里桑德摇头，微笑）你们心太急了，我只训练有经验的人，等你们达到猎手等级再来找我吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1113
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:175
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[Lysander frowns] You've chosen the path of darkness.\nI refuse to teach such as you--you would only use my lessons to further your selfish goals.\nMay Heaven have mercy on your souls."
msgstr "（里桑德皱眉）你们已经选择了黑暗之路。我可不会教你们任何东西。不然会铸成大错。愿上帝能宽恕你们的罪恶。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1114
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:176
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you can't figure out where to start, you should try finding the oldest tree in the forest.\nIt should be somewhere outside of Pierpont in Avlee.\nThe oldest tree has the power of speech, and may know something helpful.\nIt will be happy to tell you whatever you want to hear, plus a whole lot more.\nYou'll see."
msgstr "你们觉得毫无头绪吗？让我来指点你们吧。你们先要找到森林里最古老的一棵树。它就在埃里的匹尔邦特外面。这棵树会说话，你们可以通过它得到一些信息。你们想知道什么，它都会告诉你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1115
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:177
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, you've spoken with the tree, and now know as much as I do about the theft.\nIf you manage to find the stone, take it directly to the tree and then come see me."
msgstr "啊，你们已经和老树谈过了，情况你们已经相当了解了吧。现在你们可以去寻找宝石了，找到后直接交给老树，然后再来见我。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1116
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:178
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You've done a good thing, returning the Heart.\nThe forest is quieter now, and no longer attacks travelers.\nYou've probably saved many lives.\nFor service to the Land and the Light, I hereby promote all Hunters among you to Ranger Lords, and all honorary Hunters to honorary Ranger Lords!"
msgstr "你们干得好极了，这么快就找到宝石了。森林现在已经风平浪静，游人再也不会遭到袭击了。我现在把你们之中的猎手提拔为游骑领主，荣誉猎手授予荣誉游骑领主称号。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1117
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:179
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Think you can improve?\nI have a test for you.\nA hunter needs to understand the woods, and a hunter needs to be as skilled with magic as with a blade.\nThe best teachers for that are the faeries.\nThere's a faerie mound in Northern Avlee.\nFigure out how to get in, and the Faeries will grant magic to the genuine rangers among you, meaning that they will be promoted to Hunter status.\nThe rest of you will be honorary hunters. "
msgstr "你们想升级就必须完成一个任务。做猎手得对森林的环境了如指掌，而且还必须精通魔法和兵器技能，而神仙是猎手最好的老师。在埃里北面有一个神仙冈，如果你们能在那里找到神仙，他们会把你们之中的游骑兵提拔为猎手，其他人授予荣誉猎手称号。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1118
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:180
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Foxed by the Faeries? [Ebednezer snickers, then begins to laugh uproariously at his own wit] Foxed?\nFaeries?\nHahahah!\nGet it?\nFoxed… you know…ah ahahah.\nMaybe not.\nWell, I've already told you how to become Hunters.\nGet inside the Faerie Mound in Avlee.\nNow, stop bothering me!\n"
msgstr "给神仙作弄了吗？哈哈，真好笑（埃伯登泽狂笑）反正我已经告诉你们如何去升级猎手了。快去埃里的神仙冈吧，别再来烦我了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1119
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:181
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Better a bounty hunter than a plain old hunter, huh?\nWell, this test is even simpler than the Faerie Mound idea, and you won't have to think so hard.\nEver notice how the town halls are always looking for someone to kill a monster for them?\nAll you have to do is collect 10,000 in bounties from town halls.\nWhen you've done that, come back to me, and I'll promote you to Bounty Hunters.\n"
msgstr "不甘心做个猎人，还想升级吗？好吧，要成为赏金猎人所要完成的任务比神仙冈的任务容易多了。市政厅正悬赏招募勇士去除掉一个怪物。你们要做的就是想办法把那笔奖金一万个金币拿来，这样我就会提拔你们为赏金猎人了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1120
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:182
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'll be blunt.\nI don't think I like you.\nYou'll have to prove to me you're worth something.\nSoon, you will have to choose if you'll follow the Path of Dark or the Path of Light.\nIf you choose Light, don't even bother speaking to me again.\nGot it?"
msgstr "你们这些人怎么这么糊涂，连正派邪派都不分就来找我了。你们必须尽快决定是选择光明之路还是黑暗之路。要是你们选择了光明之路，就别再来烦我了，咱们分道扬镳。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1121
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:183
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Gahhh!\nI can smell the stink of self righteousness on you!\nGet away from me!\nG'won, get!"
msgstr "啊！看得出你们是个正人君子，快滚，我一闻到你们的味道就恶心。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1122
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:184
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, how did if feel?\nAll that killing?\nMmmmm.\nHeh.\nYou qualify, my friends.\nYou definitely qualify.\nAll Hunters amongst you are now Bounty Hunters, and all Honorary hunters and Honorary Bounty Hunters!\nGood job."
msgstr "啊，赏金拿回来了，那帮蠢货都死光了吧。好了，我现在把你们之中的猎手提拔为赏金猎人，其他人授予赏金猎人称号。你们干得真不错。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1123
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:185
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not yet, not good enough!\nYou need to collect more bounties, and more importantly, kill more creatures.\nThere's some good clean fun in that.\nKilling, don't you know."
msgstr "嗨，你们拿的赏金还不够，你们要得到更多的赏金，去杀更多的怪物。疯狂杀戮也是一种乐趣，你们会觉得很痛快的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1124
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:186
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Come to my door looking for magic?\nThee've always had it, if thee knew where to look.\nSome I tell this to, and they still can't see it, though it be plain as the nose on their face.\nThose amongst thee that are simple Rangers are now Hunters, and those who aren't are but Honorary Hunters.\nClever the ones who can knock on my door!"
msgstr "啊，你们找到我了。我对上门求教魔法的人总是来者不拒，可惜有些人资质平庸，简直是个废物。好吧，我把你们之中的游骑兵提拔为猎手，其他人授予荣誉猎手称号。能找到我真是你们的福气。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1125
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:187
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The thieves reached deep inside me to take my Heart.\nThe grapevines say they are hiding in the Mercenary Guild in Tatalia.\nWe would squeeze them, but they aren't close enough to reach.\nWalkers are needed to catch walkers.\nCatch the thieves for us.\nOk?"
msgstr "有贼溜进我的身体里把我的心偷走了。葡萄藤说这些盗贼藏在泰塔利亚的雇佣兵行会里。我本来要亲自去找他们，可惜脚下生根，一步都走不了。需要人类才能抓住人类。去教训这帮歹徒，把我的心还给我吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1126
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:188
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ahhh!\n[The tree sighs happily]\nYou have the heart!\nThe forest sings with joy!\nTonight we will recite the song of the ancestors.\nWill you stay and recite with us?"
msgstr "啊！（老树快乐地说）你们把心拿回来了。整个森林将为之快乐，为之歌唱。我们今晚要吟唱先辈留下来的老歌来庆祝一下，你们留下来和我们一起庆祝吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1127
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:189
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh, the forest is still very angry.\nThe grapevines say the thieves have not left their hiding place.\nYou will catch the thieves for us, won't you?"
msgstr "哦，整个森林仍旧怒不可遏。葡萄藤说那帮歹徒仍然藏在那里，你们应该尽快去找他们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1128
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Priests.\nYou have come to me seeking that I be your guide on the Path of Light.\nBut be warned, to learn its ways, you must learn the ways of your own soul.\nI would suggest that we meditate on this for awhile, but you look like you're in a hurry.\nSouth of Bracada is an island called Evenmorn, and upon that island are the old temples of the Sun and the Moon.\nBoth are inhabited by the remnants of the two religions, their once proud churches reduced to two old temples fighting for a small island.The Church of the Sun was the founding religion for our current faith, the Path of Light.\nI propose we help them out and tip the balance in favor of the Church of the Sun.\nUsing the map that Daedalus Falk sent you to find in order to become priests, convince a sea captain to bring you to the island.\nThere, bring aid and comfort to the Church of the Sun by purifying the altar in the Church of the Moon.\nThis will so weaken the Moon cult that the Church of the Sun will be able to overcome them in battle.\nReturn to me when you have done this.\n "
msgstr "啊，你们要我指点如何走上光明之路。不过我得事先提醒你们，一旦你们选择了光明之路，就得花费毕生精力全身心地投入修炼，心无旁鹜，永不放弃，你们还是慎重考虑一下吧。布拉卡达南面有个叫做埃弗蒙的小岛。岛上有两个古老的神庙。一个是太阳神庙，一个是月亮神庙。太阳教和月亮教本来是两个势力很大的教派，但由于他们两家势同水火，是天生的死对头，经过连年征战，大家两败俱伤，如今只剩下岛上的这两座神庙了，然而他们仍旧争斗不休。\n太阳神庙是信仰我们光明之路的，我想派你们去助他们一臂之力。你们可以用在执行成为神甫任务时达德拉斯·福克交给你们的航海图，租船下海，到达那个小岛。你们只要捣毁月亮神庙的神坛，他们就会一蹶不振，太阳神庙就可以轻而易举地对付他们了。如果你们顺利完成任务，就可以回我这儿来了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1129
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:191
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you wish to follow the Path of Light, first you must formally choose it.\nSoon you will be asked to make the choice, and the way will be clear.\nUntil then, I cannot be your guide."
msgstr "如果你们要学习光明之路的本领，就得尽快作出选择，遵从我们的信仰，不然我可什么也不能传授你们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1130
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:192
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you wish to become Priests of the Light, you must first become Priests.\nI don't have time to train priests, but my bitter rival, Daedalus Falk, does.\nDo not worry, he will promote you fairly, even if you do not wish to follow the terrible path of darkness that he represents."
msgstr "你们要成为光明主教，就得先达到神甫等级。去找我的死对头达德拉斯·福克吧，他这人气量倒是不小，即使你们不信仰他的黑暗之路，他也会指点你们如何成为神甫的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1131
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:193
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You've come to the wrong person if you want to be promoted beyond priest.\nI am well aware of your choice to follow the Path of the Dark, and I will have nothing to do with you."
msgstr "你们既然已经选择了黑暗之路，还来找我干什么。我可什么也不会教你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1132
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:194
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your bravery has advanced our faith tremendously, Priests.\nIt's with a glad heart that I can hereby promote all Priests to Priests of the Light, and all honorary Priests to Honorary Priests of the Light.\nThank you so much for your help!"
msgstr "我们正需要你们这种具有非凡勇气和过人本领的人。既然你们已经顺利完成了任务，现在我提拔你们之中的神甫为光明主教，荣誉神甫为荣誉光明主教，感谢你们对太阳教所做的一切。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1133
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:195
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must visit Evenmorn island and purify the Altar of Darkness in the Church of the Moon.\nOnly then can I promote you to Priests of the Light."
msgstr "你们必须去埃弗蒙岛把那里月亮教的暗黑神坛摧毁，我才会提拔你们为光明主教。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1134
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:196
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[Falk gives you a grandfatherly smile] You have, perhaps, an ambition to be priests?\nI can help you, if you'll help me.\nThere is an island south of Bracada where stands an old temple that I need to find again.\nI think the pirates west of Erathia must know where the island is.\nThe Erathian navy is rather feeble, and hasn't been able to root them out of their hiding places amongst the Tidewater Caverns.\nPerhaps the pirates have a map.\nIf you can bring me that map, I would promote you to Priest status immediately."
msgstr "（福克慈祥地笑着）你们要成为神甫，这个不难，不过得完成一个任务。听说布拉卡达南面有个小岛，上面有座古老的神庙，我找了它已经很久了。埃拉西亚西部的海盗们肯定知道小岛的确切位置。埃拉西亚的皇家舰队都是些废物，至今拿这些海盗没有办法，他们正在潮水洞穴里逍遥快活呢。如果你们能上那儿去把他们的航海图拿来，我会立刻升职你们为神甫。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1135
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:197
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Map!\nYou found it!\n[Falk looks at the map, and points at the island] There it is.\nThe island has been shrouded in mist since the Churches of the Sun and Moon began fighting over a century ago.\nKeep the map--I have the coordinates now, and will have no trouble finding the place when I need to.\nI am proud to declare the Clerics amongst you to be Priests, and the rest to be honorary Priests.\nThank you so much for your good work!"
msgstr "啊，你们拿到航海图了。（福克看着地图，然后指向一个小岛）对，就是这里。自从一百多年前太阳教和月亮教的大战爆发后，这个小岛就被浓雾笼罩。把地图好好保存着吧，我已经知道了确切位置，就不愁找不到神庙了。现在我把你们之中的牧师提拔为神甫，其他人授予荣誉神甫称号。我真为你们骄傲。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1136
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:198
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If there is a map that says where that island is, the map would be in the Tidewater Caverns of western Erathia.\nWhen you bring me that map, then I will be happy to promote you all to Priests."
msgstr "只有埃拉西亚西面潮水洞穴里的地图才会标明小岛的确切位置。你们只要把地图拿来，我一定会把你们提拔为神甫。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1137
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Priests.\n[Falk gazes coldly at you] Well it is that you have come to see the wisdom of the Path of the Dark.\nNever regret your decision, and never look back.\nSouth of Bracada is an island called Evenmorn, and upon that island are the old temples of the Sun and the Moon.\nBoth are inhabited by the remnants of the two religions, their once proud churches reduced to two old temples fighting for a small island.The Church of the Moon was the founding religion for our current faith, the Path of Darkness.\nI propose we help them out and tip the balance in favor of the Church of the Moon.\nUsing the map that I sent you to find, convince a sea captain to bring you to the island.\nThere, bring aid and comfort to the Church of the Moon by defiling the altar in the Church of the Sun.\nThis will so weaken the Sun cult that the Church of the Moon will be able to overcome them in battle.\nReturn to me when you have done this.\n "
msgstr "（福克冷冷地看着你们）你们想加入黑暗之路，领略我们深奥的魔法。不过我得事先提醒你们，一旦选择了黑暗之路，就得苦心修炼，永无退路。布拉卡达南面有个叫做埃弗蒙的小岛。岛上有两个古老的神庙。一个是太阳神庙，一个是月亮神庙。太阳教和月亮教本来是两个势力很大的教派，但由于他们两家势同水火，是天生的死对头，经过连年征战，大家两败俱伤，如今只剩下岛上的这两座神庙了，然而他们仍旧争斗不休。\n\n月亮神庙是信仰我们黑暗之路的，我想派你们去助他们一臂之力。你们可以用在执行成为神甫任务时我交给你们的地图，租船下海，到达那个小岛。你们只要捣毁太阳神庙的神坛，他们就会一蹶不振，这样月亮神庙就可以轻而易举地对付他们了。如果你们顺利完成任务，就可以回我这儿来了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1138
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:200
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you wish to follow the Path of Darkness, first you must formally choose it.\nSoon you will be asked to make the choice, and the way will be clear.\nUntil then, I cannot be your guide."
msgstr "如果你们要学习黑暗之路的本领，就得尽快作出选择，遵从我们的信仰，不然我可什么也不能传授你们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1139
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:203
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must visit Evenmorn island and defile the Altar of Light in the Church of the Sun.\nOnly then can I promote you to Priests of the Dark."
msgstr "你们必须去埃弗蒙岛把那里太阳教的光明神坛摧毁，我才会提拔你们为黑暗主教。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1140
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:204
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am indeed the one to speak to if you wish to become Wizards.\nEvery student of mine must complete a project before I name them Wizards.\nThis year's project is to build a golem.\nThere are spare parts scattered about the lands from here to Avlee.\nYou'll need all four limbs plus the torso and the head.\nPay special attention to where you get the head--one of my students made a mistake while making a head last summer and gave the defective head away as a joke.\nWhen you have all the parts, come talk to me.\nI'll promote you to Wizards then, and I'll animate your Golem.\nWell, on your way, and have fun!"
msgstr "你们要成为法师，就必须完成我交给你们的任务。今年的任务是拼合一个人偶。人偶身体的各个部分散布在从这里到埃里的道路上。你们要把人偶的头颅，身体躯干，四肢都找齐。找头颅的时候一定要加倍注意，我有个弟子就是因为用错了头颅而功亏一篑的。\n\n如果你们把人偶拼好了，就上我这儿来吧，我会提拔你们为法师，并且使人偶复活。好吧，你们该上路了，祝你们好运！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1141
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:205
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[You proudly display your assembled golem to Master Grey, and he nods approvingly] Well done.\nHead looks alright, but you can never be sure…Well, good work!\nClearly, you qualify for Wizard status.\nAll Sorcerers amongst you are now Wizards, and all non Sorcerers are now honorary Wizards!\n[Master Grey spends awhile casting the spell that animates your golem] He's all yours!\nTake him back to your castle and put him where you want.\nHe'll attack intruders relentlessly.\n"
msgstr "（你们自豪地把拼好的人偶交给格雷大师，他赞许地点点头）嗯，干得不错，我现在提拔你们之中的巫师为法师，其他人授予荣誉法师称号。（格雷大师施展魔法激活了人偶）这个复活的人偶归你们了，你们把它带回城堡吧，它会忠诚地保护你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1142
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome back, students.\nThe golem lesson was just an exercise, but to advance to Archmage, you really have to do something for the profession.\nCopies of the fabled Divine Intervention spell are very rare, and unfortunately the School doesn't have one.\nThere's been a history of bad luck regarding the spell.It has been around for time immemorial, but the spell has never found its way into our hands.\nAlways just out of reach, we often send guild members to find it, but every one has failed.\nSometimes they have it in their hands, but lose it on the way back, other times, the book seems to vanish, only to resurface 20 years later in some old dungeon, or on a deserted island.\nRight now, we think it's in the Breeding Zone in the Pit.\nFind the spell, and return with it.\nBreak the curse!"
msgstr "很高兴你们又回来了。人偶这个任务充其量只是个小考验而已，要成为大法师，你们可得花费更多的心血。在我们魔法学院，普渡众生魔法已经失传很久了，这个魔法自从诞生之日起就多灾多难，惹出不少风波。\n\n很久以前，我们就四处派人寻找这个魔法，可惜都没有成功。有人说在某个荒岛上见到过这种魔法，又有人说在某个地穴里发现过它。现在我们已经打听清楚了，它就在地狱城的再生之地里。你们如果能上那里去把这本魔法书带回来，我就提拔你们为大法师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1143
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:208
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Archmage training is reserved only for people dedicated to the Path of Light.\nProve to me you have chosen the right way, and I will be proud to be your teacher."
msgstr "只有选择光明之路才有资格成为大法师。如果你们选择了光明之路，我会传授你们魔法本领的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1144
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:209
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You've chosen Darkness, my students.\nI will teach you no more."
msgstr "你们已经选择了黑暗之路，我什么都不能传授你们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1145
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:210
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The book!\nThe book!\n[Master Grey clutches his ears and spins around in joy] You did it!\nOh, what a wonderful day!\nI am so proud of you!\nYou're all Archmages!\nOf course, if you weren't Wizards to begin with, it's only an honorary title, but who cares?\nYou found the book!\n[The Master sets the book down on a table next to a blank book.\nBoth open simultaneously, and quill arises from the desk to begin copying the text in the new book] You may keep the copy, and you should start seeing more copies in the Light guilds of Bracada and Celeste."
msgstr "啊，你们把魔法书带回来了，（格雷大师喜上眉梢）我真为你们骄傲！现在我提拔你们之中的法师为大法师，其他人授予荣誉大法师称号。（格雷施展魔法复制了一本一模一样的魔法书）这本书你们留着吧，好好钻研里面的魔法。这项魔法会在布拉卡达和塞莱斯特广泛流传下去的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1146
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:211
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I expect trouble finding the book, which is why I'm sending you to find it.\nI know you can succeed in this mission.\nKeep trying!"
msgstr "正因为你们与众不同，我才看中你们来完成这项任务。你们可别辜负我，加紧干吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1147
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fear not death?\nI can perform the Ritual on any Wizard.\nYou need a Soul Jar.\nYears ago the Wizards stole a shipment of Jars en route from Nighon to Deyja.\nThe jars are very hard to destroy, so they hid them, thinking we would never be able to find them.Fortunately for us, dead men do indeed tell tales.\nBetter, in fact, than living ones--dead men never forget, never refuse to talk, and never lie.\nSo, we found the one who buried the Jars, and made him die.\nHe was very cooperative after his death, and said he hid them somewhere in the Walls of Mist for the Wizards in Celeste. Retrieve these jars and I will perform the Ritual on all Wizards amongst you.\nThe rest may become Honorary Liches, for what that's worth, in thanks for finding the extra Jars for us."
msgstr "你们无畏死亡，想成为巫妖？好吧，我可以帮助你们进行永生仪式，不过你们得先完成我的任务。去找一个灵魂之坛。许多年以前在尼根到迪雅的路上有伙法师把整整一船灵魂之坛都偷走了。这些坛子异常牢固，摔不破砸不烂，他们只好把坛子藏起来，想叫我们永远也得不到坛子。\n幸好我们具有把死人点化成亡灵的高超本领，亡灵可比活人强多了，他们记性特别好，而且问什么说什么，老实极了。我们找到一个为法师们埋坛子的家伙，把他变成了亡灵，他就老实交代灵魂之坛藏在了塞莱斯特的迷雾之墙那里了。\n如果你们能把坛子找回来，我就会帮你们做永生仪式，把你们转化为巫妖，快去好好干吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1148
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:213
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you haven't even become Wizards yet, you aren't ready to become Liches.\nTrouble me not 'til you're qualified."
msgstr "你们还没有达到法师等级，就想成为巫妖，真是太可笑了。在你们成为法师前别来烦我。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1149
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:214
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Only followers of the Dark Path can become Liches.\nYou have not yet chosen the path.\nReturn when you choose Darkness."
msgstr "只有选择黑暗之路才能成为巫妖，你们还没有作出决定，我什么也不能传授你们。等你们选择了黑暗之路再来找我吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1150
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:215
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Having chosen the path of Light, you are not suited to become Liches.\nThe Ritual would reject you, and you would die a real death.\nIf that is what you want, you certainly don't need my help…"
msgstr "你们已经选择了光明之路，就不适合成为巫妖了。如果进行永生仪式，你们会真正地死掉的。如果你真想死，可以找别人。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1151
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:216
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Jars.\nYessss.\nYou have helped us greatly.\nNow for the Ritual.\n[The Lich draws a knife, and approaches you]\nThis won't hurt a bit!\n[The ritual actually hurts quite a bit, and takes several hours to complete.\nWhen it is over, the Lich speaks again]\nSo, now it is done.\nThose among you who were Wizards are now most certainly Liches.\nThose who were not, have my gratitude for returning the jars, and I will call you \"Honorary Liches\".\nRemember, Liches must keep their Soul Jars with them at all times while they travel.\nYou cannot be separated from your Jar for long, or you will die a real death."
msgstr "啊，你们找到灵魂之坛了，真是帮了我们大忙了。现在进行永生仪式，（死灵法师持刀走向你们），别怕，一会儿就好了，不疼的。（然而确实很疼，几个小时后你们变成了亡灵）现在我宣布你们之中的法师成为巫妖，其他人授予荣誉巫妖称号。记住，巫妖必须和自己的灵魂之坛形影不离，一旦你们失去它，你们也将魂飞魄散，在这个世界上消失。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1152
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:217
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have no spare Jars with which to perform the Ritual.\nIt is impossible for me to promote you until you return with the Jars.\nRemember, each one of you must have a Jar to be Promoted."
msgstr "你们没把永生仪式必须的灵魂之坛带回来，我可不能转化你们为巫妖。记住，要升级，每个人得有自己的灵魂之坛。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1153
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:218
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Advancement as a Druid is simple.\nYou must visit the three ancient temples to nature we erected centuries ago and pray at their centers.\nThey are in Tatalia, Evenmorn Isle, and Avlee, and look like circles of stone with an altar of water in their centers.\nWhere exactly I will not say, but exploring the land about them is part of the process.\nWhen you have visited all three Circles, return to me to detail your experience."
msgstr "要升级为高级德鲁伊其实挺简单的。你们必须在我们建立的三个古老神庙里祈祷，它们分别在泰塔利亚、埃弗蒙岛和埃里。你们不仅要在神庙中央被石圈围着的祭坛中央祈祷，还得在神庙周围走一走，视察一下有什么情况。只要你们把这些事都能一一完成，我会升级你们为高级德鲁伊。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1154
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:219
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Visit the Circles, then return to me.\nThat is the process.\n"
msgstr "你们先得去神庙祈祷，我才能升级你们为高级德鲁伊。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1155
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:220
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You've found a circle!\nVery good, but you must find all three before you will be ready for promotion.\nRemember, circles three, then return to me."
msgstr "啊，你们已经在一个神庙祈祷过了，不错。不过只有在三个神庙都祈祷过，我才能升级你们为高级德鲁伊。记住，必须在三个神庙祈祷。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1156
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:221
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have only to look into your eyes to see where you've been.\nYou have seen the circles, and they have left their imprint upon you.\nTelling you that all Druids amongst you are now Great Druids is but a formality.\nTelling the rest of you that you're now honorary Druids is showing you respect for the respect you have shown me and my faith.\n"
msgstr "啊，三个神庙你们都去过了，它们在你们身上都留下了印记。为了表彰你们的功绩，现在我升级你们之中的德鲁伊为高级德鲁伊，其他人授予荣誉高级德鲁伊称号。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1157
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:222
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "To be named an Arch Druid, you must serve the land.\nI know of a service you could perform.\nIn the land above Stone City, where the Dwarves bury their dead, is the barrow of King Zokarr IV.\nHe died fighting in defense of Stone City during the invasion of Erathia by Nighon.\nHis remains were never recovered and still lie in those tunnels.\n\nRetrieve his bones and place them in his coffin in his barrow.\nWhen you have done this, the King will rest, and so will the land.\nReturn to me when you've performed this service, and I will perform the Ceremony of Ascension and name you Arch Druids."
msgstr "要成为大德鲁伊，你们要为埃拉西亚做一件惊天动地的大事。石头城是矮人族的坟地，他们的国王佐卡尔四世也长眠在那里。他是在保卫石头城，抗击尼根侵略的时候英勇牺牲的。他的尸体至今仍散落在城堡中，未能妥善安葬。\n你们的任务就是找到他的尸骨，放入他的棺材里。这样国王可以安息了，埃拉西亚人民也就放心了。如果你们顺利完成这个任务，我会为你们举行提升仪式，封你们为大德鲁伊。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1158
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:223
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am dedicated to the service of the Light.\nI will not promote you further until you are as dedicated as I.\nCome back to me when you choose the Light."
msgstr "我致力于为光明服务。在你也投身于光明之前，我不会提拔你们。等你们选择了光明之路再来找我吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1159
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:224
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Servants of Darkness, I am sorry I promoted you earlier.\nI am ashamed I didn't notice the darkness in your souls until it was too late.\nLeave me."
msgstr "你们这些黑暗的奴仆，我真后悔以前把你们提拔为高级德鲁伊。我当时居然没有注意到你们灵魂深处的黑暗，现在意识到这点也已经晚了。走开，我不想再看见你们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1160
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:225
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[Master Green seems beside himself with joy at your accomplishment] I felt the King's soul return to the land of the dead when you returned his bones.\nThe land breathed a sigh of relief--did you feel it?\nThe Ceremony of Ascension is complete.\nI'm happy to promote all Great Druids amongst you to Arch Druids, and all honorary Great Druids to Honorary Arch Druids.\nThis is a very happy day!\nYour service will be remembered!"
msgstr "（格林大师见你们完成了任务，变得喜气洋洋）啊，你们完成了任务，国王的灵魂可以在天堂安息了，整个埃拉西亚正为之高兴呢！\n提升仪式已经完成，现在我把你们之中的高级德鲁伊升级为大德鲁伊，其他人授予荣誉大德鲁伊称号，人民会记住你们的功绩的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1161
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:226
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Service is not easy, but it needs to be done.\nRemember, you must bring the bones of King Zokarr IV from where they lie in the tunnels between Stone City and Nighon to Zokarr's coffin in a secret dwarven barrow.\nOnly then can I perform the Ceremony of Ascension and promote you."
msgstr "尽管这个任务难度很高，但你们要升级为大德鲁伊就必须完成它。记住，你们一定要把留在从石头城到尼根之间地道里的国王尸骨带回拜尔德斯的矮人坟地，放入他的棺材里。只有完成这个任务，我才可以举行提升仪式升级你们为大德鲁伊。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1162
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:227
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Becoming a Warlock for some is a simple process, and for others it is nearly impossible.\nYou need to find a familiar suited to your personality.\nThe familiar will help to focus your magical abilities and sharpen your concentration.\nSometimes a single familiar can be shared, other times not.\nThe magical effects will not be noticed by anyone but a Great Druid--someone who is already attuned to nature.\nNow, let me see what kind of familiar you will need...[Tor picks up an elaborately carved gem and peers at you through it.\nHe frowns.]\nHmm.\nWell, the good news is that you all need the same familiar, and when you find it, you will be very powerful.\nThe bad news is that you need to find a dragon familiar.\nYou must find a dragon egg.\nBring them back here and I will hatch it, and cast the familiar spell.\nThe baby dragon will imprint to you all, and you to it.\nYou may be able to find an egg in a dragon cave in the Land of the Giants.\n'Ware the mother, though."
msgstr "要成为邪术师说难也不难。只要你们具有这方面的天赋，就可以不费吹灰之力地学习我们的本领，让我看看你们有没有这方面的天赋。（他拿起一个玲珑剔透的水晶球仔细观察）啊，看来你们果然有这方面的天赋，不过在升级为邪术师以前必须完成一个任务，去和龙打交道。\n\n你们必须找到一只龙蛋，把它带回我这里。我可以施展魔法马上把蛋孵化，幼龙诞生后会在你们身上留下印记，使你们拥有龙的力量。听说在巨人领地的龙穴里就有一个龙蛋，不过你们可得小心龙妈妈，她可是个很厉害的家伙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1163
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:228
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I would love to get you started on the way to becoming Warlocks, but nothing I can do for you will be of any use until you become Great Druids.\nReturn when you have achieved that level of understanding."
msgstr "尽管我很乐意传授你们邪术师的本领，可惜你们功力还不到家，连高级德鲁伊也不是。等你们成为高级德鲁伊再来找我吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1164
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:229
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though I like to think of the Warlocks as being followers of the Path of Twilight, or Dawn, we are technically followers of the Path of Darkness.\nYou must be dedicated followers of Darkness before I can help you.\n"
msgstr "我们邪术师都是选择黑暗之路的人，你们要是想加入我们，就必须献身黑暗之路，不然我可无能为力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1165
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:230
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmmmm.\n[Tor looks at you carefully]\nNope.\nCan't teach you.\nYou chose the Path of Light.\nI can smell it on you.\nI can sympathize with your choice, but I know that none of our spells or rituals can promote you once you have started down that path.\nSorry."
msgstr "嗯（仔细端详着你们），你们怎么选择了光明之路，我都能闻出你们身上正义的气味了。一加入光明之路，就是和黑暗之路分道扬镳，我们邪术师的本领你们一招也别想学了，快滚吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1166
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:231
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[Tor looks at you in astonishment] You really found a dragon egg!\nIt's been more than a century since any Warlock has both needed and found a dragon familiar!\nThis will go down in the history books, that's for sure!\nMy spell book!\nI need my book!\nAh, here it is.\n[Tor chants a spell from the book, then taps the egg three times.\nThe egg hatches, and a baby dragon crawls out of the shell]\nThere you are!\nAwww, isn't he cute?\nCongratulations!\nNo longer are you simple Great Druids, but Warlocks!\nOf course, that's just an honorary title if you weren't a natural Great Druid to begin with, but nonetheless, something to be proud of.\n"
msgstr "（惊奇地望着你们）啊，你们拿到龙蛋了。一百多年来只有你们成功了，简直可以名垂青史。哦，我的魔法书在哪里，啊，原来在这儿。（他对龙蛋轻拍三下，念了个咒语，龙蛋破了，一只小龙蹒跚地爬了出来）看，它多可爱啊。祝贺你们，现在我提拔你们之中的高级德鲁伊为邪术师，荣誉高级德鲁伊授予荣誉邪术师称号，你们真了不起。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1167
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:232
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You need to bring me a dragon's egg so you I can hatch your familiar.\nThere is no way around this.\nTry looking in the Land of the Giants for a dragon cave-- perhaps there you can find an egg."
msgstr "你们别无选择，只有找到龙蛋我才能提拔你们为邪术师。到巨人领地的龙穴去碰碰运气吧，说不定那里有龙蛋。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1176
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:241
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have all the parts together!\nNow you just have to return to Master Grey for the animation process."
msgstr "好了，人偶的各个部位你们都已经找到了，快去格雷大师那里把人偶复活吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1179
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:244
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You should not be reading this message.\nThis means that you somehow have triggered this event without holding the normal or Abbey normal Golem heads which, based on the preconditions for this event, is absolutely impossible.\nPlease tell Bryan that he lost his bet and owes Keith 5 bucks because this event doesn't work properly."
msgstr "你们不可能知道这件事的。你们连人偶的头都没有，怎么能办下面的事，这是绝对不可能的。你们去告诉伯瑞安，他把事情搞砸了，瞧我怎么收拾他。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1180
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:245
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank heavens you've cleaned them out!\nNow we need to find a way to clean up the castle and rebuild the damaged sections.\nThe only people I can think of who would have the inclination and the ability to do this are the Dwarves in Stone City, located in the Barrow Downs to the south.\nThe entrance to Stone City lies in the center of the Barrow Downs on one of the largest hills.\n"
msgstr "感谢你们终于把这些讨厌的家伙都赶走了，现在我们可以开始重建家园的计划了。我们必须找一些既精通伐木造屋，又和我们交情不错的人来帮忙，看来唯一胜任的只有石头城的矮人族了。这个城堡就在南面拜尔德斯，它的入口位于那里中央最大的一座山上。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1181
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:246
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I fear that talking will fail with these goblins, my lords.\nMay I suggest violence?"
msgstr "我认为跟这些大耳怪多废话简直是白费功夫，不如给他们些厉害看看。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1182
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:247
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So…The new lords of Harmondale I have before me.\nNot impressed.\nDoubt other kings think much of you either.\nHrmph.\nProbably get yourselves killed soon.\nBut maybe there's more than meets the eye here.\nYes.\nMaybe you can do something for me, and I for you.\nMedusas have taken my mines in eastern Bracada.\nTurned a few of my people to stone.\nDangerous monsters, don't want to lose more lives on a rescue.\nOk to lose yours though.\nTake this elixir and pour it on the statues.\nWake them up.\nThen I will fix up your castle.\nGive you respect.\nGo now, and beware the griffins in Bracada.\n"
msgstr "啊，你们是哈蒙代尔的新主人，见到你们真是太荣幸了。你们要我们帮你们修复城堡，我们当然乐意效劳，不过我们想先麻烦你们一下，帮我一个小忙。美杜莎女妖霸占了我们在布拉卡达东面的矿井，还把我们一些人变成了石头。这帮该死的女妖真是太可恶了，你们能帮我们去教训她们一下吗？\n\n你们要做的就是把这些丹药浇到石像上，这样我们的人就可以变回人形。如果你们完成这个任务，我们会修复你们的城堡的。快去吧，不过你们得小心那里的狮鹫啊。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1183
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome back, Lords of Harmondale!\nNow, I will help you.\nMy engineer will work for you.\nFix up your castle.\nYou have my thanks.\nYou are welcome here forever.Hmmph.\nOne more thing.\nYour work has interested the other courts.\nThey will send ambassadors to you now--check your throne room.\nWatch your back, my friends."
msgstr "啊，你们这么快就完成任务回来了，真是太好了。感谢你们，哈蒙代尔的主人。现在我的手下已经全部准备就绪，只等你们一声令下，我们就可以开工修复城堡了。你们是我们永远的朋友，我们随时乐意为你们效劳。\n嗯，还有一件事要告诉你们，你们现在是埃拉西亚的名人了，许多地方的领主已经开始注意你们了，他们会纷纷派遣使节和你们联系，你们可要好自为知啊。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1184
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:249
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Back again, eh?\nYour part of the bargain isn't finished.\nNo help 'til you're done.\n"
msgstr "什么，我们交给你们的事还没办好。咱们事先说好的，你们先为我们办事，我们才会为你们效劳。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1185
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:250
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your Queen wishes to speak with you as soon as possible.\nSince the War, she has taken up residence at Gryphonheart Castle in Steadwick.\nThis is strictly business--whenever new lords assume their office she meets with them to make sure there are no misunderstandings.\nQueen Catherine is particularly interested in you, and has told me she wishes to employ your services."
msgstr "王后凯瑟琳陛下想尽快与你们会面。自从埃拉西亚大战爆发后，王后陛下一直住在斯坦德威克的格芬哈特城堡。这个王国所有的领主上任后都要去朝见王后，这已形成惯例。你们的事迹已经在埃拉西亚广为流传，王后特别赏识你们，要亲眼见一见你们这些埃拉西亚的大英雄。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1186
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:251
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've received word that you met with the Queen.\nI hope it went well."
msgstr "听说凯瑟琳王后已经接见过你们了，希望你们能给她留个好印象。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1187
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:252
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The queen is very pleased with you!\nThe rescue operation went well, and Loren can no longer be held as a bargaining chip for that wicked King Parson!\nWhen the current Harmondale conflict is over, I'm sure the Queen will reward you for your aid."
msgstr "你们的营救行动完成得很出色，王后对你们非常满意。劳伦已经脱险了，这下帕尔森再也不能有恃无恐了。只要哈蒙代尔的争端一结束，王后就会封赏你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1188
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:253
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Queen tells me your loyalty is very strong.\nYou did the right thing when you informed the Queen of the treachery King Parson was plotting.\nAnd I'll tell you this:\nYour loyalty is not only strong, but it is well placed.\nHarmondale is the rightful province of Erathia, despite Elvish claims to the contrary.\nYour work for us helps to ensure that Harmondale will forever be in the hands of Humans."
msgstr "王后告诉我是你们及时揭露了帕尔森准备暗地里突袭埃拉西亚的阴谋，你们真是我们王国的大忠臣啊！哈蒙代尔交给你们掌管，我们也就放心了。现在我们共同的敌人就是精灵族的帕尔森这个坏蛋，让我们一起努力除掉这个逆贼。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1189
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:254
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[Lady Ellen gasps in delight] You have Gryphonheart's Trumpet!\nThis is wonderful!\nWhen it disappeared from the strongbox, we thought it had been stolen by the enemy!\nThank you for bringing it back to us!"
msgstr "（艾尔伦高兴得叫起来）啊，你们拿到格芬哈特的号角了，真是太伟大了。这个东西很久以前就莫名其妙地失踪了，肯定是被我们的敌人偷走了，真是谢谢你们能把它完璧归赵。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1190
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:255
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Gryphonheart's Trumpet was no doubt stolen by the Elven raiding party.\nYou were too late to save it.\n[Lady Ellen sighs] Well, this is bad, but I suppose we've suffered much worse disasters."
msgstr "格芬哈特号角一定是被帕尔森派人偷走了，你们来迟一步了。（艾尔伦夫人叹了口气）真不知还有什么灾难会降临到我们头上。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1191
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:256
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've learned from Queen Catherine that you betrayed us with the old false prisoner trick.\n[Lady Ellen curtsies respectfully] Your skills in the art of deception are formidable.\nI will be sure not to be tricked so easily by your sincere manner again."
msgstr "我从凯瑟琳王后那里得知你们提供假冒囚犯的事。（艾尔伦夫人毕恭毕敬地行了个礼）你们骗人的伎俩实在太高明，我再也不会被你们道貌岸然的外表所蒙骗了，请你们出去。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1192
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:257
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though Avlee is not currently in charge of Harmondale, my King, Eldrich Parson of Avlee, lays claim to this territory as our rightful domain.\nThe reasons are complicated, but boil down to the simple fact that Erathia stole our land in the Timber Wars many years ago, and we will not give up until we have it back.\nMy King wishes to speak with you.\nPlease travel to Pierpont in the Tularean Forest and meet with him.\nWe will make it worth your while."
msgstr "尽管哈蒙代尔现在不属于埃里的领土，但我们的国王，埃里的最高统治者帕尔森一直认为哈蒙代尔应当是我们的。关于这片土地的纠纷由来已久，反正是埃拉西亚很久以前就无耻地从我们手里骗取了这个地方，我们不把它夺回来是不会善罢甘休的。我们主人要在图拉利昂森林的匹尔邦特和你们见面，你们快去吧，一定会觉得不虚此行的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1193
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:258
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Messengers have informed me of your visit with my King.\nI hope you can see now why we are the rightful rulers of Harmondale.\n"
msgstr "我奉命通知你们去和我们的国王帕尔森会面。我希望你们明白我们才是哈蒙代尔的真正统治者。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1194
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:259
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard of your daring infiltration of Fort Riverstride, and I am impressed!\nOur strategists are analyzing the plans now, and they say the information will be very useful in any assault they mount against the Fort.\nYou have Avlee's gratitude!"
msgstr "我听说你们成功地潜入利文斯德要塞偷取了城堡的设计图。我们已经研究过了，这份设计图对我们攻取城堡非常有用。我代表整个埃里感谢你们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1195
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:260
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Word from Court is that you rejected a request from Erathia to break that spy Loren Steel out of prison.\nNot only that, you helped us plant a false prisoner who has been feeding them misinformation ever since he got there.\nAvlee is in your debt!"
msgstr "你们不仅拒绝了埃拉西亚的要求，没把密探劳伦·斯蒂尔搭救出狱，还向他们提供了一个假囚犯，透露的情报尽是胡说八道。你们干得真是太出色了，埃里的人民感谢你们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1196
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:261
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have Gryphonheart's Trumpet!\nExcellent!\nWe lost track of it during the raid, and were afraid that one of the Erathians got away with it.\nThank you very much for your help!"
msgstr "你们拿到格芬哈特的号角了！自从上次我们袭击埃拉西亚后，这个东西就不见了，一定是被他们的人偷走的。真是谢谢你们能把它带回来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1197
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:262
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It seems our raid on the Erathians has failed, and they or someone else got away with the Trumpet.\n[Ambassador Alain shakes his head sadly] Maybe next time things will go our way."
msgstr "我们大举进攻埃拉西亚竟然被打得一败涂地，连号角也不见了。（埃兰大使悲哀地摇摇头）我们一定会卷土重来的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1198
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:263
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've received a warning from my superiors regarding your delivery of falsified plans from Erathia.\nThe King is not amused. And there was some concern that you had more treachery in store for us.\n[Alain smiles, true to his profession] All's fair in love and war, so it's all water under the bridge, eh?\nYes, all is forgotten.\n[The ambassador chuckles heartily].\n"
msgstr "我们已经开始怀疑是你们交给我们假的要塞设计图才导致这次我们战役的失败。国王现在正大发脾气。要是真是这样的话，我们以后不知还会吃多少苦头。（埃兰露出职业外交家的伪装的微笑）好了，不管这是不是真的，我们的关系到此结束，以前的事就一笔勾销吧！（大使会心地微笑起来）"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1199
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[Queen Catherine inclines her head regally] You are the lot that won Lord Markham's silly contest, I see.\nI must admit I had little faith until the Dwarf King recognized you as the rightful rulers of Harmondale.\nYou must have done something to win his respect, or he would have nothing to do with you.\nI'm still not sure what he saw in you, but perhaps there really is something of substance here.\nWe shall see.Maybe you can do something for me that would make me think I should let you keep your new titles.\nRecently, a valuable...agent of mine was arrested in the Tularean Forest for merely doing his job.\nThey're keeping him in a cave somewhere outside of Pierpont.\nHis name is Loren Steel, and they are threatening to execute him if certain unacceptable conditions are not met in 28 days.\nReturn with him before then and you will win respect, gold, and gratitude."
msgstr "你们就是马克汉姆举办的那个荒唐的寻宝比赛的优胜者。说实话，要不是矮人族国王拼命为你们说好话，我可根本看不上你们。你们一定是帮了他的大忙，不然按他的脾气，理也不会理你们。不过我还是认为耳听为虚，眼见为实，你们要是有真才实学，自然会脱颖而出的，我们等着瞧吧。\n眼下就有一件事让你们来证明自己的能力。几天前我有一个密探在图拉利昂森林不幸被捕了，他的名字叫劳伦·斯蒂尔，被关在匹尔邦特的一个洞穴里。敌人威胁说要是在一个月内不答应他们提出的条件，就会把他处死。如果你们能把他营救出来，我会封赏你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1200
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:265
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[Catherine stands and smiles] Good job!\nYou've really solved a terrible dilemma for me.\n[Catherine turns to Loren and shakes his hand] Loren.\nIt's good to meet you at last.\nSince everyone knows who you are now, you're not much good to me as a spy, but I would like to offer you a job in the Royal Diplomatic Corps.\nPlease give it some thought.\nAs for our heroes, you have my thanks.\nMy purser will credit your bank account with 5000 gold pieces for your services.\n "
msgstr "（凯瑟琳王后站起来微笑着）你们真是太出色了，为我解决了一个大难题。（凯瑟琳转向劳伦）能见到你我真是十分高兴，我还以为你回不来了。现在你的身份已经暴露，不再适合作密探这一行了，还是做我的外交官吧。怎么样？考虑考虑吧。至于我们的英雄们，哈，我要对你们致以最诚挚的感谢，并奖励你们5000金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1201
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:266
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Loren's life is on the line.\nI cannot give into the Elvish demands, or many more lives will be lost.\nPlease hurry.\nI'm sure Avlee will execute him on schedule."
msgstr "劳伦的生命已经是危在旦夕。我也不可能答应精灵方面提出的条件，不然会牺牲更多无辜的生命。快去营救他吧，去晚了就来不及了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1202
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:267
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[Catherine stands and smiles] Good job!\nYou've really solved a terrible dilemma for me.\n[Catherine turns to the false Loren and shakes his hand] Loren.\nIt's good to meet you at last.\nSince everyone knows who you are now, you're not much good to me as a spy, but I would like to offer you a job in the Royal Diplomatic Corps.\nPlease give it some thought.\nAs for our heroes, you have my thanks.\n "
msgstr "（凯瑟琳王后站起来微笑着）你们真是太出色了，为我解决了一个大难题。（凯瑟琳转向假扮的劳伦）能见到你我真是十分高兴，我还以为你回不来了。现在你的身份已经暴露，不再适合作密探这一行了。还是做我的外交官吧。怎么样？考虑考虑吧。至于我们的英雄们，哈，我要对你们致以最诚挚的感谢。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1203
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:268
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[The Queen's eyes narrow] What's this?\nYou're admitting to treachery?\nHow noble.\nGuards!\nOff with their heads!"
msgstr "（凯瑟琳王后脸都白了）什么，你们终于承认欺骗了我。你们这些无耻的家伙，卫兵，把他拉出去斩首。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1204
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:269
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "King Parson asked you to steal the floor plan to Fort Riverstride?\nHmmm.\n[Catherine turns to one of her advisors] Have some false plans of Fort Riverstride drawn up.\nMake it painful.\n[She turns back to you] If it's plans he wants, it's plans he'll get.\nGive these plans to the King.\nI'm sure he'll be grateful.\nMake sure you don't let him know they're fake.\n[After awhile the advisor returns with the plans and gives them to you]\nYou'll need to get the plans back to him on time, of course.\nI'm sure he plans to attack us soon."
msgstr "帕尔森国王要你们来偷取利文斯德要塞的设计图？嗯，（凯瑟琳转向她的一个侍卫）给我画一张假的要塞设计图，可要画得象一点。（又转向你们）既然他要设计图，那么我们就大方点给他就是了。你们就把假的设计图给他吧，他一定会对你们感激不尽的。（过了一会儿侍卫把假的设计图交给你们）你们必须快点把设计图交给他，看来他们马上会发动进攻了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1205
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:270
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "He took the plans?\nExcellent!\nI'll have the Riverstride commander roll out the red carpet for them.\nAs for you, I've instructed my purser to deposit 5,000 gold pieces in your account."
msgstr "他对那张设计图一点也没有怀疑，真是太好了。我已经命令利文斯德的守军严阵以待，就等着给他们一点利害瞧瞧。至于你们，我会奖赏给你们5000金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1206
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:301
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "First, you need to speak to Gavin Magnus in Celeste and complete his training.\nAfter you have proven your ability and loyalty you will learn more about your role in the future of Erathia."
msgstr "首先你们要去找住在塞莱斯特的格文·马格努斯，并接受他的考验。一旦你们顺利完成任务，他会告诉你们如何成为主宰埃拉西亚大局的人物。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1207
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:302
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Each of Gavin's advisors has a task for you.\nTalk to Resurectra, Sir Caneghem, and Crag Hack for more information.\nDo not fail in these missions- in them rests the balance of the future."
msgstr "盖文手下每一个大臣都会交给你们一个任务。你们要与瑞瑟雷克特、卡格汉、克拉格·汉克多谈两句以获得更多的情报，你们必须把他们交给你们的任务一一完成，这关系到埃拉西亚将来的命运。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1208
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:303
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Robert the Wise has a regrettable, but necessary, mission for you to complete.\nFor any of our plans to continue, this mission must succeed.\nPrepare most carefully for the task, or you invite certain failure."
msgstr "智者罗伯特有一个相当重要的任务要你们去完成，它决定我们今后行动的成败与否。你们一定要谨慎从事，不能有半点马虎，成败在此一举啊！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1209
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:304
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Kreegan, the Devils, and their leader Xenofex must be destroyed completely for the plan to have any long-term benefit.\nYou will find their 'hive' in the Land of the Giants."
msgstr "为了我们的计划能够顺利实施，必须把克里根族和他们的首领诺菲克斯一网打尽。你们可以在巨人领地找到他们的巢穴。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1210
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:305
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "To the west of Avlee lies the craft that Resurectra and her associates used to come to Erathia.\nVisit the ship and retrieve the Oscillation Overthruster to insure our victory.\nMake sure to be properly outfitted for the journey."
msgstr "瑞瑟雷克特和他的手下是坐船来到这片大陆的，如今这艘船就在埃里西面的海里。你们要找到那艘船，并把振荡器带回来，一路上可要小心啊！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1211
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:306
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Bring the Oscillation Overthruster back to Resurectra immediately!\nEvery moment wastes valuable time!"
msgstr "快把振荡器交给瑞瑟雷克特，这件事十万火急，稍有延误就会酿成大祸。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1212
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:307
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Test involves entering the 'front door' of the Walls of Mist, and exiting through the 'back door'.\nI use the word 'door' loosely--you'll see when you get there.\nYou will not need your weapons.\nYou will fail the test if you kill any creature in the Walls of Mist.\nIf you can complete this task, you will be given membership in the Guild of Light. Good luck."
msgstr "这项考验要求你们安全地从迷雾之墙的前门进去，后门出来。我使用“门”这个字也许不大贴切，你们见了就会知道这是怎样一扇门了。在此过程中你们不能使用任何武器，一旦你们杀死一人，此项行动即告失败。如果你们能成功通过这次考验，就可以加入我们光明魔法行会，祝你们好运。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1213
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:308
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You passed the Test!\nThat's quite an achievement--few succeed as quickly as you did.\nMy advisors are now eager to speak to\nyou; they can be found in the four houses on the eastern side of Celeste.\nOnce again, congratulations!"
msgstr "你们已经通过考验了，你们真了不起，我还没有看见一个人能象你们这样这么快就完成了这个任务。我的大臣们现在想见见你们，他们就在塞莱斯特东面的四间屋子里。再次祝贺你们，我的勇士们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1214
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:309
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Remember, you must enter through the front door of the Walls of Mist, and exit through the back door.\nYou must not kill any creatures in the Walls of Mist.\nWhen you have done this, return to me."
msgstr "听仔细了，你们必须安全地从迷雾之墙的前门进去，后门出来，并且不得杀死任何人。你们只有顺利做到这一点，才可以上我这儿来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1215
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:310
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We need your help retrieving half of a key to a very important place from our enemies, the Necromancers.\nLike us, they have enshrined their half of the key in their highest temple--The Temple of the Dark.\nI'm under no illusions this will be easy.\nTake your time and act when you're prepared.\nAlso, bring our half of the key to us, as well.\nIt is enshrined in the Temple of the Light.\nSince you're our ally, no one should trouble you when you go there to fetch the key.\nBy the same token, please don't harm any of them, either."
msgstr "我们需要你们的帮助。你们要到暗黑神庙去一趟。那里是我们的死对头死灵法师供奉那块圣坛碎片的地方。你们要想方设法把那块碎片拿来，这可是个相当棘手的任务，你们可得多费点功夫。你们还要把另一块圣坛碎片也拿来给我，它就供奉在我们的光明神庙里，你们是我们的朋友，神庙里的人不会麻烦你们的，但你们也不得伤害任何人。等把两块碎片配齐了，你们再上我这里来吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1216
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:311
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No key halves yet, I see.\nWell, take your time.\nIt must be done eventually, and sooner is better than later, but later is better than being chained to an altar and sacrificed by the High Priest of the Dark in one of their bloody rituals.\nJust bring back both halves of the key from the temples of Dark and Light, and try not to get yourselves killed doing it."
msgstr "你们还没有把两块圣坛碎片都配齐，不过不要灰心，再想想办法，慢慢来。虽说此次行动越快越好，但操之过急，反而欲速则不达，甚至可能在暗黑神庙丢了性命。你们不但要分别从暗黑神庙和光明神庙收集到两块圣坛碎片，还要平安地返回我这里。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1217
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:312
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, I'm glad you found our half of the key, but you still need their half.\nHold onto it until you get the other half.\nWhen you have both halves, return to me.\nI will make them whole."
msgstr "啊，你们已经找到我们的那块圣坛碎片了，不过另一块还在暗黑神庙。等你们把两块圣坛碎片都配齐了再上我这儿来吧，我会使它们完整如初的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1218
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:313
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good work on retrieving their half of the key, but you still need ours.\nIt is located in the Temple of the Light here in Celeste."
msgstr "你们干得真不错，把暗黑神庙里的那块圣坛碎片拿来了，不过你们还要去塞莱斯特的光明神庙拿我们的那块，快去吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1219
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:314
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I knew you could do it!\nNever doubted you for a second!\n[You hand her the key halves, and she joins them by running a finger along the crack between them.\nIt mends before your eyes, good as new] Finally!\nOne piece of the plan is in place.\nYour assistance has been invaluable.\nWe are already in your debt, and I expect we'll be even deeper in debt before our plan comes to fruition.\nSo have faith in us awhile longer--the future we're planning will astound you!"
msgstr "我早就知道你们会成功的。（你们把两块圣坛碎片递给她，她把碎片拼合在一起，施展魔法向裂缝处一指，立刻变得严丝合缝，完好如初了）由于你们的帮助，我们的行动已经迈出了关键的一步。也许在我们的计划实现以前还得麻烦你们，有你们这么一个出色的助手实在是我们的幸运。十分感谢你们，我们不会忘记你们的，让我们以后有机会能一起分享胜利的喜悦。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1220
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Our plans rapidly approach their conclusion, but there is a hitch.\nThe Kreegan--also known as the Devils, or the Demons, must be destroyed before we finish our plans.\nThey represent a terrible threat, and though they do little but lick their wounds today, will one day regain their strength and devastate the world.\nIf anything we do is to have lasting effect, we must first destroy these monsters for once and for all.You are strong, but not strong enough to defeat the devils on your own.\nThey are vulnerable to the brand of magic most commonly wielded by the Necromancers, and less so by our own Wizards.\nIt is imperative that you infiltrate the Devil's base and kill their leader Xenofex.\nThat should end their threat to this world for some time.\nThe Warlocks have dug a tunnel from their volcano to the Land of the Giants-- the land the Devils claim as their own.\nPerhaps you can use that."
msgstr "我们的计划已经快要大功告成了。不过还有个小麻烦，我们必须先铲除克里根族。他们常被人称作魔鬼，野兽，曾经在埃拉西亚猖獗一时。虽然如今他们的势力日渐衰落，已经没有从前猖狂了，但仍对我们构成不小的威胁，谁知道他们哪一天又会东山再起，重新在这个世界作威作福。为了使我们的计划能够成功实施，当务之急就是把这伙魔鬼一网打尽，根除后患。\n虽然你们本领高强，但还不足以单枪匹马挑战整个克里根族。他们的克星是我们的死对头死灵法师，这些蠢货对那些巫师的魔法几乎毫无还手之力，而我们的魔法就不是那么有效了。你们必须潜入他们的老巢干掉克里根族的首领诺菲克斯，这样就可以永绝后患，使克里根人土崩瓦解。还有一个情报也许对你们有用。邪术师曾经从他们那里的火山处挖了条地道，直接通向巨人领地--克里根族的老巢。你们说不定可以从地道进去。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1221
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:316
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "YOU ARE HEROES!!!\nYour work against the devils was masterful!\nAnd the rescue of King Roland was as delightful as it was unexpected.\nHistory will never forget your names for doing what you just did!\nI, for one, am very proud to know you.\n"
msgstr "你们真是太伟大了！你们不仅除掉了这帮魔鬼，还救出了相传死去多年的罗兰德国王，真是太出人意料了。你们的功绩将会永垂青史，我真为你们骄傲，为埃拉西亚能拥有你们这样的勇士而庆幸。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1222
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:317
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I guess there's no hurry getting this job done, but we don't want the Necromancers to grow bored waiting for us to do our part and destroy the blocker.\nSo, please, as soon as you feel ready you must attack the Devils.\nRemember that the Warlocks have dug a tunnel from their volcano to the land of the Devils.\nYou should be able to use that to get yourselves there."
msgstr "我想这件任务并非十万火急，但你们也不要把时间拖得太长，万一邪术师一时兴起，把地道给封了，那可就大事不妙了。所以希望你们当机立断，果断采取行动，出其不意地把这伙魔鬼连根铲除。记住，邪术师已经从他们的火山处挖了条地道通向克里根族的巢穴，你们可以通过地道发动进攻。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1223
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:318
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Our allies in Tatalia have been complaining for some time of a mysterious presence.\nThere have been numerous deaths and disappearances for the last few months, and they've asked us if we knew anything about it.\nI think I do.\nI suspect a vampire is preying on Tatalia.\nI don't have time to pursue the question myself, but to keep our allies happy, I'm asking you to please look into it.\nIt's possible the monster's presence has deeper implications than just bad luck for Tatalia."
msgstr "我们在泰塔利亚的盟友告诉我们最近几个月他们不断有人不是莫名其妙的失踪，就是离奇地死于非命，这其中肯定有什么古怪。我对此事也非常关心，看来大概是吸血鬼在作恶。不过最近我实在太忙，抽不出空亲自调查此事，但为了向盟友有个交代，只能麻烦你们代劳了。你们一定要仔细调查，我想这次吸血鬼肆虐，并不会象表面那么简单，说不定背后还有什么大阴谋。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1224
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:319
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Just as I suspected!\nGood work.\nWith the death of the Vampire, Tatalia can sleep a bit easier now.\nQueen Catherine is grateful as well, and has been making moves to further strengthen the ties between Bracada and Erathia."
msgstr "啊，你们干得真不错，调查的结果正如我所料。既然吸血鬼已经除掉了，泰塔利亚也该太平两天了。凯瑟琳王后也为此事向你们深表谢意，并且已经亲自去布拉卡达进一步加强与他们之间的团结合作。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1225
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:320
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Keep looking for that Vampire.\nI'm sure that's our problem, and he must be somewhere in or near Tatalia.\n"
msgstr "你们应该加紧寻找吸血鬼，我想它肯定在泰塔利亚附近游荡。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1226
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:321
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The plan involves stealing the soul jars the Necromancers rely on to prolong their miserable lives.\nThey have them hidden somewhere in their Guild Castle, and are probably not prepared for the kind of small scale assault you people are so good at.\nA quick strike--in and out--should do the trick.\nDon't hang around the castle too long, or reinforcements will arrive, and try to get it right the first time, or they will permanently double their patrols.\nOnce you have the soul jars, bring them back here so we can dispose of them properly."
msgstr "死灵法师都是把他们的灵魂放在灵魂之坛里才能够延续他们邪恶的生命，他们把灵魂之坛藏在他们的行会城堡里。你们的任务就是趁他们毫无防备之际以迅雷不及掩耳的速度一举把灵魂之坛夺过来。记住千万不要在城堡里滞留太久，不然他们的援兵就会赶到，那时候你们就麻烦了。这次行动必须一击成功，全身而退。如果不成功的话，他们必然会加强守卫，到那时候就难以下手了。如果你们拿到灵魂之坛，必须立刻赶来见我，我们会处理这些东西的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1227
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:322
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[Sir Caneghem looks at the jars curiously, as though observing a poisonous snake behind glass] So these are soul jars.\nI expected something more…impressive, I suppose.\nGood job!\n[he takes the case of jars] I will make sure these jars are never seen again."
msgstr "（卡格汉好奇地看着灵魂之坛，好象隔着玻璃看一条毒蛇）这就是灵魂之坛吗？我还以为是什么神奇的东西，原来就是几个破坛子。你们这次行动非常出色，我要让这些坛子永远消失。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1228
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:323
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Be well prepared when you go for the jars.\nTheir security won't be so lax if you have to retreat and return.\n"
msgstr "在采取行动以前你们必须考虑周全，务必一次成功，不然下次再去，他们的守卫就不会那么松懈了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1229
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:324
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Our counterparts, the former advisors to Archibald, each carry a token called a command cube on their person that we absolutely must acquire to complete the Goal.\nThere is no way any of them will part with their cube willingly, which means that we must get it some other way.\nYou will have to take it from one of them, and we think the easiest would be Tolberti.\nUnlike the rest of them, he disdains proper security and has taken up residence in one of the apartments in the Pit.\nI need you to infiltrate the pit again and get the cube from him.\nBe careful--he is well armed and much tougher than he appears.\nWhen you have the Cube, return to me.\nWe have but a short distance to the Goal, and all will be revealed very soon."
msgstr "我们的死对头是阿基巴德手下那些死灵法师。他们每个人身上都有一块控制晶片，只有拿到这个东西我们的计划才能成功。看来他们谁都不会心甘情愿地把控制晶片交出来，我们只好另想办法了。你们的任务就是想办法从他们之中的一个人身上拿到控制晶片，我们已经探听清楚了，最容易下手的是一个叫托尔伯蒂的，他不象其他人护卫众多，防守森严，而是孤身一人住在地狱城的别墅里。你们要想方设法潜入地狱城，从他身上得到控制晶片。和他交手你们得千万小心，不要被他的柔弱的外表所迷惑，他可是个很不容易对付的对手。如果你们拿到控制晶片，马上回来交给我，这样我们的计划就快大功告成了，到时候会向你们透露真相的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1230
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:325
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[Robert takes the cube] Once again, you succeed!\nThe Goal is so close!\nI know you have many questions, and I'm sure Resurectra will answer them all, after you do just one more mission for her.\nYou will find her with Gavin Magnus in the throne room of Castle Lambent."
msgstr "（罗伯特拿着控制晶片）你们又成功了！我们就快大功告成了。我知道你们有许多问题想问个明白，快去瑞瑟雷克特那里吧，只要再为她完成一个任务，她就会把我们的计划和盘托出的。她现在正和格文·马格努斯在光辉城堡的宫殿里呢！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1231
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:326
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Keep trying to find his apartment.\nTolberti has never really believed anything bad could happen to him, and so far he's been right.\nWe need to prove him wrong.\nTake the cube any way you can.\nIf you can do it without violence, fine.\nIf you must kill him, well, that's O.K. too.\nJust get the cube."
msgstr "你们要加紧寻找托尔伯蒂。他曾经扬言没有人能够伤他半根毫毛，我们现在就想给他点利害瞧瞧。你们要想办法把控制晶片夺过来，能够不伤他性命那最好不过，不然的话就索性把他干掉，快去吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1232
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:327
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We need your help retrieving half of a key to a very important place from our enemies, the Wizards.\nLike us, they have enshrined their half of the key in their highest temple--The Temple of the Light.\nIt'll be a snap.\nMost so called good people spend more time defending and healing themselves than delivering damage.\nHow can you win if you don't fight?\nAnyway, take your time and act when you're prepared.\nAlso, bring our half of the key to us, as well.\nIt is enshrined in the Temple of the Darkness.\nSince you're our ally, no one should trouble you when you go there to fetch the key.\nBut if you feel like you need the practice, go ahead a take a whack at some of them.\nThey're not very important, and most of them can regenerate from even the most severe injuries.\nTry it--it's alot of fun!"
msgstr "我们需要你们的帮助。你们要到光明神庙去一趟。那里是我们的死对头光明法师供奉圣坛碎片的地方。你们要想方设法把那块圣坛碎片拿来。这个任务真是太简单了，这帮家伙只知道救死扶伤，治病救人，根本不会花时间去修炼致人死命的魔法，你们去拿圣坛碎片可谓轻而易举。如果准备好了，就赶快出发吧。\n\n你们还要把另一块圣坛碎片也拿来给我，它就供奉在我们的暗黑神庙里。你们是我们的朋友，神庙里的人不会找你们麻烦的，不过你们要是觉得自己功力不够，想增加点经验值的话不妨拿神庙里的人开刀，他们都是些无足轻重的小人物，而且很多人具有自我恢复的能力，所以你们尽管痛下杀手，不必留情。杀人可是件很爽的事哦！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1233
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:328
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No key halves yet?\nBah!\nI hope you're more competent than you seem right now!\nHow hard can this be?\nAll you have to do is burst in the front door and start shooting.\nWhen there's no one left, you can clean their place out at your leisure.\nJust hurry up and bring us both key halves."
msgstr "还没有拿到那两块圣坛碎片？想不到你们竟然这样没用。其实太简单了，你们只要径直闯进去，把魔法乱放一气，还没死的补他两家伙，不就完了。快去放手干吧，我可等得不耐烦了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1234
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:329
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, I'm glad you found our half of the key, but you still need their half.\nHold onto it until you get the other half.\nWhen you have both halves, get back over here and I'll fix them."
msgstr "嗯，你们去了那么长时间，我还以为你们在光明神庙完蛋了呢！现在你们拿到他们的那块圣坛碎片了，可我们那一块还没拿到。快去暗黑神庙吧，把两块碎片配齐了送到我这儿来，我会使它们完好如初的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1235
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:330
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Finally!\nI was beginning to wonder if you might have got yourselves killed already.\nWell, no matter.\nYou forgot to get the key from the Temple of the Dark, so be on your way.\nWhen you have it, return to me so I can make the two halves whole again."
msgstr "不错，你们拿到我们的那块圣坛碎片了，可光明神庙里的那一块还没到手。你们把两块圣坛碎片都拿到再来找我吧，我会把它们拼好的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1236
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:331
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent!\n[Kastore takes the two halves of the key and bangs them together.\nWith a bright white flash, they join together seamlessly]\nThe first part of the Plan is complete.\nI knew we, uh, Archibald made the right decision in trusting you!\n"
msgstr "好极了！（卡斯托把两块圣坛碎片拼在一起，施展魔法，只见一道白光闪过，它们变得严丝合缝）好了，我们计划的第一步算是完成了，阿基巴德真是没有看错人啊！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1237
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Soon our plans will bear fruit, but there are a few details that must be handled before we are ready.\nThe Kreegan, also known as the Devils, share this world with us.\nThe only reason we're sharing is because they are weak right now.\nIf they ever get strong, they will try to kill every person in the world.Anyway, it's no fun to rule a world full of dead people, so we have to kill the Devils before they kill us.\nOur plan is for you to infiltrate the Devils lair and destroy their leader, Xenofex.\nThe warlocks of Nighon have dug a tunnel from their volcano to the Land of the Giants-- the land of the Devils.\nYou can probably use that tunnel to get there."
msgstr "我们的计划就快大功告成了，不过还有点小麻烦。你们知道克里根族吗，就是那些常被人称作魔鬼，野兽的那些家伙。他们和我们约好要瓜分这个王国。他们之所以这样做，是因为如今他们势单力薄，已经掀不起什么风浪了。如果有朝一日他们东山再起，会六亲不认地铲除任何反对势力，真要到那个时候，这个王国尽是死人，我们还找谁发号施令，说不定还自身难保呢。所以我们必须先下手为强，趁早除掉这些碍手碍脚家伙。你们的任务就是潜入他们的老巢，干掉他们的头领诺菲克斯。尼根的邪术师曾经挖了条地道从火山直接通向他们盘踞的巨人领地的老巢，你们可以从这条地道进去发动进攻。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1238
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:333
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "THAT WAS AWESOME!\nYou did it!\nAnd now the single greatest threat to our plans is gone!\nWe will be Kings of the World!\n[Kastore throws his head back and laughs wildly] AHAHAHAHAHA!!!!! Ah ha ha. Yes.\nWell, good job.\nI'll even forgive you for letting that King Roland character go free--we could have used him as a bargaining chip, you know.\n[he shrugs] you probably didn't have a choice, I suppose.\nIn any event, this is a happy day!\n"
msgstr "你们真是太棒了，现在我们夺取世界的计划的最大障碍已经被扫除了，我们就是天下的主宰了！（卡斯托背着手哈哈大笑）啊哈哈哈哈哈！干得太出色了。至于你们把罗兰德国王放走这件事我们也不再追究了，要知道，我们本来可以把他作为讨价还价的重要筹码。（他耸了耸肩）大概你们当时别无选择吧，不过不论怎样，今天真让我高兴。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1239
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:334
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Could you please hurry up with this raid against the Devils?\nArchibald has promised forces, but they won't be available forever.\nWhat's worse, the devils breed faster than rabbits.\nThe longer you wait, the more you'll have to fight."
msgstr "你们动作能不能快点，把这伙恶魔干掉就完事了。阿基巴德是答应会派援军的，可是时间来不及了。要知道，这帮家伙生孩子的本事比老鼠还大，你们越是这样等下去，他们的人数就越多，到时候有你们忙的，还不快点去。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1240
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:335
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Archibald has asked us to find a source of soul jars for his necromancers.\nThese are the jars that are needed to complete the Ritual that gives them eternal life, and we're almost out.\nThere are far more candidates for Lichdom than we have jars, so some of our necromancers are facing the grim possibility of real death.\nThe makers of the jars are the Warlocks.\nGo to them and convince them to give us the jars.\nIf they won't hand them over, take the jars by force-- I'm done negotiating prices with them."
msgstr "阿基巴德要我们去为死灵法师找一个能弄到灵魂之坛的地方。死灵法师就靠这些坛子来放自己的灵魂，进行永生仪式，只有这样他们才能得到永生，可是最近我们这些坛子都快用完了。如今要成为死灵法师的人越来越多，我们要是再搞不到灵魂之坛，恐怕有些人真的要寿终正寝了。天下只有邪术师会制作灵魂之坛，你们的任务就是去和他们商量商量，问他们要些灵魂之坛。要是他们不肯，那你们只有动武硬抢了，你们不必害怕，一切麻烦有我来应付。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1241
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:336
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[Maximus takes the case of jars with obvious delight] Nice work.\nI won't even ask what you had to do to get them.\nSuccess speaks for itself.\n"
msgstr "（马克西姆惊喜地看着灵魂之坛）你们干得太棒了。真不知道你们怎么把它们搞到手的，真是了不起。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1242
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:337
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You don't have to be nice about getting the jars from them--just get the jars any way you can.\nWe can renegotiate peace with them if we must, just like we renegotiate the price for each purchase of soul jars."
msgstr "你们去拿灵魂之坛可别不好意思，只要能达到目的，可以不择一切手段，甚至不惜和他们撕破脸。既然我们可以为了价钱和他们谈判，自然也可以为了和平和他们讨价还价，没什么大不了的，最多死几个人罢了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1243
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:338
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lord Archibald has another request--the creatures that have inhabited Clanker's laboratory must be evicted--and the teleport shield brought down.\nThe laboratory is on an island east of Pierpont in the Tularean Forest.\nBe careful--the monsters in that lab were created by Clanker himself, and some of them are much more powerful than their more common fellows elsewhere in the world.\nTake whatever you like from the place.\nLord Archibald is only interested in the real estate and the laboratory equipment.\nOnce the shield is down, Lord Archibald will be able to begin moving necromancers and equipment inside via Lloyd's Beacon. "
msgstr "阿基巴德有新的任务交给你们。要你们铲除科兰克实验室里盘踞的怪兽，并摧毁那里的远距离传输防护盾。这个实验室就在图拉利昂森林的匹尔邦特东面一个小岛上。你们可要小心那些怪兽，它们可是科兰克亲手制造的，虽然有的外形和普通的野兽差不多，可是却具有超强的力量。实验室里的东西你们喜欢的可以随便拿，阿基巴德只对那个实验室感兴趣。一旦防护盾被摧毁，他就可以施展时空之门魔法把死灵法师和仪器设备都运到实验室去了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1244
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:339
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's good to see we can count on you.\nSo few of our allies are as reliable and capable as yourselves.\nThank you very much for your aid."
msgstr "能看到你们平安回来真让人高兴。说实话，我们还从来没看到过象你们这样又能干又守信的盟友，非常感谢你们的帮助。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1245
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:340
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This is a simple task--get a move on!\nOnce again, the laboratory on an island east of Pierpont in the Tularean Forest.\nGet the shield lowered, and your part of the job is done."
msgstr "交给你们这么简单的任务，还不快去。我再说一遍，听仔细了。实验室在图拉利昂森林的匹尔邦特东面一个小岛上，你们要进去把远距离防护盾摧毁，把怪兽都干掉。听懂了吗！快滚吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1246
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:341
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Just as Archibald has us, King Magnus of Bracada has his advisors.\nAnd, just like us, each of them wears a small token called a command cube.\nWe need one of their cubes, and they're not going to just hand one over to us.\nWe must take one of their cubes, and we have decided it should be Robert the Wise who suffers.\nOne of our spies in their castle has damaged the lock to his room.\nThey have been lax about replacing it, so you should have no trouble going through the door.\nI don't care if you kill him or not--just get the cube and return to me at once."
msgstr "和阿基巴德一样，马格努斯国王手下大臣也都有表明身份的控制晶片，我们必须把这玩意儿搞到手。目标已经选好了，是个叫智者罗伯特的倒霉鬼。我的手下已经有人潜入他的住宅，把他住的屋子的锁弄坏了，他们竟然懒得把锁修好，这真是天赐良机。你们的任务就是潜入城堡拿到控制晶片，把它带给我们，杀不杀他随你们的便。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1247
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:342
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "[Tolberti takes the cube] This brings us very close to completing our Plan.\nI know Kastore hasn't told you exactly what the Plan is, but you'll like it, I'm sure!\nI am not allowed to say much, but I can tell you your position will be much higher than simply Lords of Harmondale, you can count on that!\nYou will find Kastore in his place on the throne of Castle Gloaming."
msgstr "（托尔伯蒂拿着控制晶片）这下我们的计划马上要大功告成了。我知道你们很想知道全部计划的真相，卡斯托还没有交代清楚吧。不过我也不能说得太多，天机不可泄露。反正我可以告诉你们，一旦我们成功了，你们的职位就不仅仅是个哈蒙代尔城堡的小领主了，等着瞧吧，好戏还在后头呢！要找卡斯托，你们可以去黄昏城堡的宫殿看看。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1248
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:343
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What's wrong?\nDon't tell me you're losing your nerve?\nHe's tough, but not immortal.\nYou can take him!\nI wouldn't have sent you on this mission if I didn't think you could handle it."
msgstr "怎么了，不要告诉我你们准备放弃了。不错，他是挺利害的，可也不是什么顶尖高手，以你们目前的功力，完全可以把他收拾了。这么一个简单的任务，是我特意留给你们让你们立功的，想不到你们这么没出息。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1249
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:344
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes, the test.\nIt's simple.\nNear the center of the city is a place we call the Breeding Zone.\nThere's a lot of foul monsters in the pit, and they regenerate constantly.\nIt makes for a good source of slaves, spare parts, and target practice.\nAll of our necromancers are tested there when they want to rise above the level of initiate.\nI'm sure you'll pass the test.\nJust jump in the pit and find a way out.\nKill anything you want down there.\nShow no mercy.\nWhen you escape, crawl out of the pit and come see me again.\nIf you complete this, I will give you membership in the Guild of Dark. *If* you complete this..."
msgstr "这个考验很简单。地狱城附近有个叫再生之地的地方，那里面净是些怪兽，而且现在越来越多，能把它们捉来做奴隶倒是再合适不过了。你们要做的就是进入那个地方，杀开一条血路，从另一头的出口出来就行了。这些怪兽都是些凶残狡猾的家伙，你们可千万不要对它们手下留情。如果你们能活着回来，我就接纳你们为暗黑魔法行会的成员。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1250
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:345
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You show promise, my friends.\nA fine performance.\nI think it will be sufficient proof of your skill for my advisors.\nThey are quite eager to assign tasks to you now; they can be found in the four houses in the western side of the Pit.\nAnd don't worry.\nRewards will follow, of course."
msgstr "你们干得真不错，现在我的手下可以心服口服了，他们还会争先恐后地向你们分派任务呢！他们就住在地狱城西面的四间屋子里。快去吧，要知道，他们给的报酬可是很丰厚的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1251
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:346
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am beginning to suspect my allies were right about you.\nCan't you pass this simple test?\nAre you too afraid, or too feeble to succeed?\nPerhaps we need new allies?"
msgstr "我真怀疑你们有没有资格成为我们的盟友，连这么简单的考验都通不过，以后碰到大风大浪怎么办！你们到底是胆子太小，还是本领太差了，我真搞不懂，看来我应该另选盟友了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1252
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:347
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The time has come to achieve our Goal.\nThe reason we have sent you on all these missions is simple:\nwe have been busy gathering the parts needed to open a gate to the Ancients--the ones who colonized this world ages ago.\nUnfortunately, our former compatriots also seek those parts for their own dark dreams.\nThey wish to rebuild the Heavenly Forge from the times before the Silence, and use it to duplicate the weapons we brought with us to your world.\nWe have been competing with them for these parts, but at last we have what we need.\nExcept for one thing.\nWe have been unable to find the Oscillation Overthruster on your world.\nAll would be lost, but there is one such device aboard the Lincoln--the vehicle that brought us to your world.\nIt is in the sea west of Avlee and secured against entry, even from ourselves.\nNow you must wear our environment suits, enter the ship, and return with the Overthruster; you will find these suits in the chest outside this throne room.\nFor the suit to function properly you must not be wearing any equipment.\nAs for us, we must stand watch at the gate, and battle our former comrades.\n"
msgstr "看来真相大白的时候到了。老实告诉你们吧，我们要你们完成这些任务，就是为了收集物品，能够打开时空之门，去寻找我们的祖先创造的伟大文明。不幸的是，我们族人中有些败类也想到了这个主意。他们是想回到寂静时代以前，重建天堂铸造厂，打造上古神器，运到现在这个世界来靠它们征服全世界。为了能抢先打开时空之门，我们展开激烈的竞争，幸好最终还是我们先得手了。\n不过我们还少了振荡器这一样东西，如果找不到它，我们会前功尽弃。我知道有一艘叫林肯号的船上就有一个振荡器，我们就是乘这艘船才来到你们这片大陆的。这艘船在埃里西面的海里。你们只有穿上我们的潜水服才能上船，这些衣服就在宫殿外面的箱子里。还有一件事，你们只有卸下身上所有的装备潜水服才会起作用。快去船上把振荡器拿回来吧，我们现在就守在门口等着收拾那些败类。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1253
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:348
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have returned!\nAt last!\nWe have the Overthruster.\nNow, come with us as we open the way to the Ancients!"
msgstr "啊，你们这么快就回来了。噢，这就是振荡器。快，和我们一起打开通往古代文明之路吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1254
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:349
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't forget you'll need the wetsuits to get to the Lincoln.\nThese suits are in the chest outside this throne room and the Lincoln is in the sea west of Avlee.\nReturn here with the Overthruster as soon as possible."
msgstr "别忘了你们要上林肯号，就必须得穿我们的潜水服。它们就在宫殿外面的箱子里，林肯号在埃里西面的大海里，快去吧，记住把振荡器拿回来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1255
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Our finest hour is upon us.\nWhile you have been taking care of all those important tasks, my compatriots and I have been struggling with our former friends for the parts we need to rebuild the Heavenly Forge of legend.\nBy former friends, I mean the four chief advisors to King Magnus of the Wizards.\nThey have a plan to build a gate to the Ancients.\nThey could have stood with us, but threw it all away on some vague hope of a 'better future'.\nBut you!\nYou have stood with us all this time.Only one task remains--we need the Oscillation Overthruster from our old vehicle, the Lincoln.\nWe have been unable to find one on your world.\nThe ship is in the sea west of Avlee and secured against entry, even from ourselves.\nNow you must wear our environment suits, enter the ship, and return with the Overthruster.\nOur old environments suits have been prepared for you in the chest outside this throne room.\nFor the suit to function properly you must not be wearing any equipment.We will stand watch over the Forge, and defend it against our enemies.\nBring us the Overthruster, my friends, and together, we shall rule the world!"
msgstr "看来我们就快大功告成了。就在你们四处奔波，费尽心机地完成我们交给你们的任务的时候，我们为了争夺能重建传说中的天堂铸造厂的宝物，和我们以前的盟友反目成仇，展开了一场激战。我们的对手就是马格努斯国王手下的四个光明法师。他们想得到宝物是为了重建通往古代伟大文明的时空之门。本来我们双方可以互相合作，各取所需，可是他们却妄想建立一个和平安详的世界，说什么上古神器不能用来发动邪恶的战争，简直胡说八道，对这种人就得好好教训教训他们。可你们就不同了，你们会永远站在我们这一边，成为我们永远的朋友。\n\n不过我们还少了振荡器这一样东西，如果找不到它，我们可会前功尽弃。我知道有一艘叫林肯号的船上就有一个振荡器，我们就是乘这艘船才来到你们这片大陆的。这艘船就在埃里西面的海里，你们只有穿上我们的潜水服才能上船，这些衣服就在宫殿外面的箱子里。还有一件事，你们只有卸下身上所有的装备潜水服才会起作用。快去船上把振荡器拿回来吧，我们统治全世界的日子就要到了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1256
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:351
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "YOU'VE DONE IT!!!\nYou have the Overthruster!\nQuickly, come with me to the laboratory!\nThe forge is ready…"
msgstr "啊，你们成功了，振荡器到手了。快，和我去实验室，我们的铸造厂要建成了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1257
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:352
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't forget you'll need the environmental suits to get to the Lincoln.\nThese suits are in the chest outside the throne room, and the Lincoln is in the sea west of Avlee.\nWhat else do you need to know?"
msgstr "记住，你们要上林肯号，就得穿上潜水服，它就在宫殿外面的箱子里。林肯号在埃里西面的大海里，快去吧，别浪费时间。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1261
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You need to have your own deck of cards to play. We will supply the opponent.\nVictory conditions vary per inn. Build your tower, destroy your opponent's tower, or collect enough resources before your opponent does. Large yellow numbers in column are the generators. This is how many new units of a particular resource you will receive on your next turn. Small black numbers in column are the resources. This is how many units you have available to spend on your current turn.Cards: Each have their own cost to play, indicated in a small circle in the lower right corner of the card. The cost will be deducted from your resources according to the color of the card.\nLeft click on a card plays the card. Right click on a card to discard without playing.Red represents your Quarry Generator which produces your Brick resources, blue represents your Magic Generator which produces Gem resources, green represents your Zoo generator which produces Beast resources. "
msgstr "你们自己身上必须带着一副牌。我们会给你们选个对手。每个旅店玩牌的胜利条件各不相同。反正就是要把自己的城堡造好，摧毁对方的城堡，或者赶在对手之前收集到足够的资源。\n黄色的大数字是产量计数器，它代表你们下个回合可以得到的资源的数量。黑色的小数字表示现有资源，也就是本回合你们可以使用的资源数量。\n牌：每张牌右下角小圆圈里面的数字表明它的资源消耗量。消耗的资源种类由每张牌的颜色而定。左键点击一张牌即可出牌。右键点击一张牌表示弃牌。\n红色的“采石场”生产砖头，蓝色的“魔法阵”生产宝石，绿色的“地下城”生产怪物。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1262
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:357
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All ArcoMage games here start with each player having a Tower of 15, Wall of 5.\nThe object is to get to either a Tower of 30, one of the resources to 100, or to destroy your opponent's Tower."
msgstr "玩这里的魔幻牌，一开始每个玩家都拥有15单位的城堡、5单位的城墙。胜利的条件是要获得30单位的城堡，或者任意一种资源达到100，或者彻底摧毁对方的城堡。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1263
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1264
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:358
