msgstr "成为心智魔法的宗师可以起死回生，长生不老，简直赛过了神仙。如果你们心智魔法技能达到10级并给我8000个金币，我就传授你们宗师级的心智魔法技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1329
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:424
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With Expert Body Magic you can learn all of the Expert spells for this devotion.\nHigher Level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.\nExpert Body Magic can be yours if you have a skill level of 4 in Body Magic and can pay the price of 1000 gold."
msgstr "肢体魔法是一种治病救人、救死扶伤的高超魔法。如果你们的肢体魔法技能达到4级并付我1000个金币，我就传授你们心智魔法的专家级技术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1330
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:425
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With Master Body Magic you can learn all of the Master spells for this devotion.\nHigher Level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.\nMaster Body Magic can be yours if you have an Expert skill level of 7 in Body Magic and can pay the price of 4000 gold."
msgstr "大师级的肢体魔法技能具有妙手回春般的医疗作用。如果你们的肢体魔法技能达到7级并给我4000个金币，我就传授你们这项技术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1331
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:426
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With Grand Master Body Magic you can learn all of the Grand Master spells for this devotion.\nHigher Level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.\nGrand Master Body Magic can be yours if you have a Master skill level of 10 in Body Magic and can pay the price of 8000 gold."
msgstr "成为肢体魔法的宗师可以起死回生，长生不老，简直赛过了神仙。如果你们肢体魔法技能达到10级并给我8000个金币，我就传授你们宗师级的肢体魔法技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1332
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With Expert Light Magic you can learn all of the Expert spells for this element.\nHigher Level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.\nExpert Light Magic can be yours if you have a skill level of 4 in Light Magic and can pay the price of 1000 gold."
msgstr "光明魔法堪称最高深的魔法之一，效用神奇，变幻莫测。如果你们的光明魔法技能达到4级并付我1000个金币，我就传授你们专家级的光明魔法技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1333
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:428
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With Master Light Magic you can learn all of the Master spells for this element.\nHigher Level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.\nMaster Light Magic can be yours if you have an Expert skill level of 7 in Light Magic, have completed the Walls of Mist quest and can pay the price of 5000 gold."
msgstr "成为大师级的大法师是每个选择光明之路的勇士的梦想。如果你们完成了迷雾之墙这个任务，光明魔法的技术达到7级并给我5000个金币，我就传授你们大师级的光明魔法技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1334
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:429
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With Grand Master Light Magic you can learn all of the Grand Master spells for this element.\nHigher Level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.\nGrand Master Light Magic can be yours if you have a Master skill level of 10 in Light Magic, have completed either the Archmage or Priest of Light promotion quests and can pay the price of 8000 gold."
msgstr "成为光明魔法的宗师简直可以呼风唤雨，无所不能。不过你们必须先成为光明主教或大法师，光明魔法技能达到10级并给我8000个金币，我就传授你们宗师级的光明魔法技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1335
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With Expert Dark Magic you can learn all of the Expert spells for this element.\nHigher Level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.\nExpert Dark Magic can be yours if you have a skill level of 4 in Dark Magic and can pay the price of 1000 gold."
msgstr "暗黑魔法堪称最高深的魔法之一。威力无比，变幻莫测。如果你们的暗黑魔法技能达到4级并付我1000个金币，我就传授你们专家级的暗黑魔法技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1336
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:431
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With Master Dark Magic you can learn all of the Master spells for this element.\nHigher Level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.\nMaster Dark Magic can be yours if you have an Expert skill level of 7 in Dark Magic, have completed the Breeding Zone quest and can pay the price of 5000 gold."
msgstr "掌握大师级的暗黑魔法是每个选择暗黑之路的勇士的梦想。如果你们完成了再生之地这个任务，暗黑魔法的技术达到7级并给我5000个金币，我就传授你们大师级的暗黑魔法技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1337
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:432
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "With Grand Master Dark Magic you can learn all of the Grand Master spells for this element.\nHigher Level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.\nGrand Master Dark Magic can be yours if you have a Master skill level of 10 in Dark Magic, have completed either the Lich or Priest of Dark promotion quests and can pay the price of 8000 gold."
msgstr "成为暗黑魔法的宗师简直可以呼风唤雨，无所不能。不过你们必须先成为黑暗主教或巫妖，暗黑魔法技能达到10级并给我8000个金币，我就传授你们宗师级的暗黑魔法技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1339
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:434
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wands, scrolls, rings and potions can be important items, and not knowing what they are is just foolishness.\nWith Mastery of the Identify Items skill you can attempt to identify weapons, armor, and other miscellaneous items.\nFor a small fee of 2500 gold and demonstration of an Expert Skill level of 7, I can teach you Mastery of the Identify Items Skill."
msgstr "鉴定魔杖、魔法卷轴、魔力戒指和药剂这类东西容易得很，连傻瓜都会。掌握了大师级物品鉴定术就可以鉴定兵器、盔甲和其它一些更神奇的物品了。你们只要物品鉴定术达到7级并付我2500个金币，我就传授你们这项技术的大师级知识。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1340
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:435
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Found and ancient item or relic and don’t know what it does or what its for.\nIgnorance in the case is not bliss, in fact it could very well kill. With Grand Mastery of the Identify Item Skill you can attempt to identify anything you have found including artifacts and relics.\nA Master Skill level of 10 and 6000 gold is all that is required to learn this Skill."
msgstr "要识别上古神器和某些特殊的宝物非得学会宗师级物品鉴定术不可。如果你们物品鉴定术达到10级，给我6000个金币，我就能传授你们这项技术的宗师级知识。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1341
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:436
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Shop owners are a greedy lot.\nWant to get better prices for what you buy and sell?\nThen you better have the Merchant Skill and fast. I can teach you the Expertise of the Merchant Skill if you have a skill level of 4 and pay 2000 gold.\nExpertise doubles your bonus towards prices."
msgstr "如今这世道奸商多得是，你们要做买卖不会讨价还价怎么行，所以你们必须掌握经商术。如果你们的经商技术达到4级并给我2000个金币，我就传授你们专家级的经商技术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1342
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:437
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Shop owners are a greedy lot.\nWant to get better prices for what you buy and sell?\nThen you better have the Merchant Skill and learn the ins and outs of trading. I can teach you Mastery of the Merchant Skill if you have an Expert Skill level of 7, a Personality of 50 and pay 5000 gold.\nMastery triples your bonus towards prices."
msgstr "如今这世道奸商多得是，你们要做买卖不会讨价还价怎么行，所以你们必须掌握经商术。如果你们的经商技术达到7级，个性值达到50，并给我5000个金币，我就传授你们大师级的经商技术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1343
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:438
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Shop owners are a greedy lot.\nWant to get better prices for what you buy and sell?\nThen you better have the Merchant Skill and learn the ins and outs of trading. I can teach you Grand Mastery of the Merchant Skill if you have a Master Skill level of 10 and pay 8000 gold.\nGrand Mastery allows you to pay and receive the actual price for goods."
msgstr "如今这世道奸商多得是，你们要做买卖不会讨价还价怎么行，所以你们必须掌握经商术。如果你们的经商技术达到10级并给我8000个金币，我就传授你们宗师级的经商技术。有了这种技术你们就可以按物品实际价格做买卖了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1344
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:439
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your equipment is only as good as the person who repairs it.\nIf you can't fix it, you could find yourself stuck in the wilderness with no armor or weapons.\nThis could be extraordinarily bad. Expertise with the Repair Item skill allows you not only the chance of repairing weapons, but armor as well.\nThis skill can be yours if you have a Skill level of 4 and pay 500 gold."
msgstr "修补术可是一项很重要的本领。你们的兵器和盔甲总有坏的时候，到时候不会修补术会带来很多不便。如果你们修补技术达到4级并付我500个金币，我会传授你们专家级的修补技术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1345
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:440
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your equipment is only as good as the person who repairs it.\nIf you can't fix it, you could find yourself stuck in the wilderness with no armor or weapons.\nThis could be extraordinarily bad. Mastery of the Repair Item skill allows you not only the chance of repairing weapons and armor any broken miscellaneous item as well.\nThis skill can be yours if you have an Expert Skill level of 7 and pay 2500 gold."
msgstr "修补术可是一项很重要的本领。你们的兵器和盔甲总有坏的时候，到时候不会修补术会带来很多不便。如果你们修补技术达到7级并付我2500个金币，我会传授你们大师级的修补技术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1346
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:441
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your equipment is only as good as the person who repairs it.\nIf you can't fix it, you could find yourself stuck in the wilderness with no armor or weapons.\nThis could be extraordinarily bad. A Grand Master of the Repair Items Skill can fix ANYTHING that is broken.\nThis skill can be yours if you have a Master Skill level of 10 and pay 6000 gold."
msgstr "修补术可是一项很重要的本领。你们的兵器和盔甲总有坏的时候，到时候不会修补术会带来很多不便。而宗师级的修补术可以修复任何物品。如果你们修补技术达到10级并付我6000个金币，我会传授你们这项修补技术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1347
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:442
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you think you are adventurers, do you?\nThere's not enough meat on you to protect you from the slap of a baby goblin!\nBody Building is the only way to go.\nYou will be stronger and tougher than before!\nAn Expert of Body Building is tougher than the normal hero.\nI can teach you this if your skill level is 4, pay 500 gold and are ready to sweat!"
msgstr "哈，你们也算是行侠天下的英雄。看你们弱不禁风的样子，还要锄强扶弱？真是笑话。还是学习健身术，把身子练得壮实些吧。如果你们的健身技术达到4级并给我500个金币，我就传授你们专家级的健身技术，到时候一般人就比不上你们了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1348
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:443
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you think you are adventurers, do you?\nThere's not enough meat on you to protect you from the slap of a baby troll!\nBody Building is the only way to go.\nYou will be stronger and tougher than before!\nA Master of Body Building is much tougher than the average hero.\nI can teach you this if your Expert Skill level is 7, pay 2500 gold and have and Endurance of 50! No pain no gain!"
msgstr "哈，你们也算是行侠天下的英雄。看你们弱不禁风的样子，还要锄强扶弱？真是笑话。还是先钻研健身术，把身子练得壮实些吧。如果你们的健身技术达到7级，耐力值达到50，并给我2500个金币，我就传授你们大师级的健身技术。为了有强壮的身体，受点苦也值得。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1349
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:444
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you think you are adventurers, do you?\nThere's not enough meat on you to protect you from the slap of a baby dragon!\nBody Building is the only way to go.\nYou will be stronger and tougher than before!\nA Grand Master of Body Building is the toughest hero you can find.\nI can teach you this if your Master Skill level is 9, pay 6000 gold and have and Endurance of 50! No pain no gain!"
msgstr "哈，你们也算是行侠天下的英雄。看你们弱不禁风的样子，还要锄强扶弱？真是笑话。还是先钻研健身术，把身子练得壮实些吧。如果你们的健身技术达到10级，耐力值达到50，并给我6000个金币，我就传授你们宗师级的健身技术。为了有强壮的身体，好好练吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1350
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:445
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not enough spell points for casting those Expert spells?\nMeditation is what you need.\nWith an Expert Skill in Meditation you get a double bonus to your available spell points.\nThis could mean one more powerful spell when you most need it!\nExpertise can be yours if your skill level is 4 and pay me 500 gold."
msgstr "战斗时是不是觉得魔法值总不够用，看来你们得钻研一下冥想术了。如果你们的冥想技术达到4级并给我500个金币，我就会传授你们专家级的冥想术，这样你们的魔法值就可以增加一倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1351
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:446
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not enough spell points for casting those Master spells?\nMeditation is what you need.\nWith a Master Skill in Meditation you get a triple bonus to your available spell points.\nThis could mean one more powerful spell when you most need it!\nMastery can be yours if your Expert Skill level is 7 and pay me 2500 gold."
msgstr "战斗时是不是觉得魔法值总不够用，看来你们得钻研一下冥想术了。如果你们的冥想技术达到7级并给我2500个金币，我就会传授你们大师级的冥想术，这样你们的魔法值就可以增加两倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1352
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:447
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not enough spell points for casting those Grand Master spells?\nMeditation is what you need.\nWith a Grand Master Skill in Meditation you get a quadruple bonus to your available spell points.\nThis could mean one or more powerful spells when you most need them!\nGrand Mastery can be yours if your Master Skill level is 10 and pay me 6000 gold."
msgstr "战斗时是不是觉得魔法值总不够用，看来你们得钻研一下冥想术了。如果你们的冥想技术达到10级并给我6000个金币，我就会传授你们宗师级的冥想术，这样你们的魔法值就可以增加三倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1353
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:448
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Things are sometime hidden in the dungeons and castles of this land.\n You may have missed something without even knowing it was there.\nPerception increases your chance of finding these hidden things. Expertise in the Perception skill doubles your chances of finding these hidden things.\nFor 500 gold and a skill level of 4 in Perception, I will teach you."
msgstr "这片大陆上宝藏多得是，但它们都散布在地穴和城堡各处，稍不留神就可能错过，不过掌握娴熟的洞察技术可以帮你们的大忙。如果你们的洞察技术达到4级并给我500个金币，我就传授你们专家级的洞察技术，这样你们发现宝藏的机会能提高1倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1354
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:449
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Things are sometime hidden in the dungeons and castles of this land.\n You may have missed something without even knowing it was there.\nPerception increases your chance of finding these hidden things. Mastery of the Perception skill triples your chances of finding these hidden things.\nFor 2500 gold and an Expert skill level of 7 in Perception, I will teach you."
msgstr "这片大陆上宝藏多得是，但它们都散布在地穴和城堡各处，稍不留神就可能错过。不过掌握娴熟的洞察技术可以帮你们的大忙。如果你们的洞察技术达到7级并给我2500个金币，我就传授你们大师级的洞察技术，这样你们发现宝藏的机会能提高2倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1355
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:450
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Things are sometime hidden in the dungeons and castles of this land.\nYou may have missed something without even knowing it was there.\nPerception increases your chance of finding these hidden things. Grand Mastery of the Perception skill quintuples your chances of finding these hidden things. For 6000 gold and a Master Skill level of 10 in Perception, I will teach you."
msgstr "这片大陆上宝藏多得是，但它们都散布在地穴和城堡各处，稍不留神就可能错过。不过掌握娴熟的洞察技术可以帮你们的大忙。如果你们的洞察技术达到10级并给我6000个金币，我就传授你们宗师级的洞察技术，这样你们发现宝藏的机会能提高4倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1356
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My brother, Elron, was an avid Arcomage player.\nHave you played Arcomage yet?\nHorribly addicting game, if I do say so.\nIn any rate, you can only play if you have a deck, and decks are hard to come by… so I guess you probably haven't.\nIn any case, Elron wanted to go over some strategies to help him win more games.\nUnfortunately, he didn't want to be in town because he didn't want anyone else to spy on him learn his tricks so he went to the White Cliff Caves southeast a bit from town.Elron hasn't been back in almost a week.\nI'm certain something horrible has happened to him, but if he's alive I'd like to know that too.\nWould you do me the service of locating him?\nI don't have a lot of money to pay you back with, but I'd be greatly in your debt."
msgstr "我兄弟埃尔隆是个出了名的牌鬼，玩牌简直如痴如醉，已经到了不要命的地步。这种游戏真是害死人啊！如果你们要玩牌的话，必须先找到一副纸牌，不过要找到这样一副牌也挺不容易的。我兄弟为了提高牌技，四处寻访拜师，最近有人在镇子东南面的悬崖洞穴见过他，天知道他去这么危险的地方干什么？\n\n埃尔隆已经有一个星期没回来了，现在活不见人，死不见尸，我真为他担心。如果你们能帮我个忙，打听一下他的下落，我会重重酬谢你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1357
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:452
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Still no sign of him?\nI understand.\nIf you do happen to find out what happened to him, please let me know."
msgstr "还没有他的消息。我知道要找他的确很不容易，你们要是有他的消息，别忘了告诉我一声。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1358
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:453
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Dead?\nOh dear!\nThose are certainly his cards, though.\nI don't want the cards; you can have them-- that game has cost me enough now.\nOh, poor Elron!\nI have a little money you can keep for your help, and thank you for finding out what happened to Elron."
msgstr "什么，他死了，哦，我的天啊！对，这是他随时携带的魔幻牌。这东西我不要了，我已经受够了，你们要就拿去吧，玩牌可千万不要上瘾啊，不然埃尔隆就是榜样！这里有点酬金，你们一定要收下，谢谢你们帮我打听到他的下落。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1359
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:454
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The School of Sorcery here in the Bracada Desert collects a number of odd magical paraphernalia.\nA few years ago an item of particular interest was stolen from the School by raiders from Deyja.\nThis item, the Seasons' Stole, was worn by Priests of the Sun during religious ceremonies at the turn of the seasons.\nAs a representative of the School of Sorcery, I'm authorized to reward you for its return.\nOur last information placed the stolen Stole in the Hall of the Pit; I would suggest checking there first."
msgstr "布拉卡达沙漠里的魔法学院里有很多神奇的魔法物品。几年前这个学院遭到迪雅的袭击，他们抢走了一件珍贵的魔法披风，它叫四季披风。光明主教在四季交替时要举行隆重的仪式，必须穿着这件披风。我接受魔法学院的委托，希望你们能帮助我们找到这件披风。据说有人在地狱之厅见过它，你们可以去那里找找看。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1361
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:456
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent!\nThis most certainly is the Seasons' Stole.\nHere is your reward; you've done both the School of Sorcery and myself a great service."
msgstr "好极了，你们这么快就找到四季披风了。这些酬金你们收下吧。你们为我们魔法学院做了件大好事，我们会记住你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1362
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:457
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tired of chests blowing up in your face?\nSick of poison gas clouds, fireballs, and lightning bolts sending party members to the Great Beyond?\nExpert Lock Picking doubles your chance of disarming these traps before they go off.\nI will teach you Expert Lock Picking if you have a Skill level of 4 and can pay 500 gold."
msgstr "怎么样，开箱子的时候被那些机关整苦了吧。这些机关里可隐藏了非常厉害的魔法，什么毒云笼罩、连珠火球、霹雳闪电，稍不留神你们就会全军覆没，糊里糊涂就见了上帝。不过你们只要掌握开锁技术，就可以避免这些麻烦。如果你们的开锁技术达到4级并付我500个金币，我就传授你们专家级的开锁技术，使你们拆卸机关的能力增强一倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1363
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:458
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tired of chests blowing up in your face?\nSick of poison gas clouds, fireballs, and lightning bolts sending party members to the Great Beyond?\nMaster Lock Picking triples your chance of disarming these traps before they go off.\nI will teach you Master Lock Picking if you have an Expert Skill level of 7 and can pay 2500 gold."
msgstr "怎么样，开箱子的时候被那些机关整苦了吧。这些机关里可隐藏了非常厉害的魔法，什么毒云笼罩、连珠火球、霹雳闪电，稍不留神你们就会全军覆没，糊里糊涂就见了上帝。不过你们只要掌握开锁技术，就可以避免这些麻烦。如果你们的开锁技术达到7级并付我2500个金币，我就传授你们大师级的开锁技术，使你们拆卸机关的能力增强两倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1364
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:459
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Tired of chests blowing up in your face?\nSick of poison gas clouds, fireballs, and lightning bolts sending party members to the Great Beyond?\nGrand Master Lock Picking eliminates these pesky traps entirely before they go off.\nI will teach you Grand Master Lock Picking if you have a Master Skill level of 10 and can pay 6000 gold."
msgstr "怎么样，开箱子的时候被那些机关整苦了吧。这些机关里可隐藏了非常厉害的魔法，什么毒云笼罩、连珠火球、霹雳闪电，稍不留神你们就会全军覆没，糊里糊涂就见了上帝。不过你们只要掌握开锁技术，就可以避免这些麻烦。如果你们的开锁技术达到10级并付我6000个金币，我就传授你们宗师级的开锁技术，使你们拆卸机关万无一失。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1365
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:460
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The best defense to an attack is not to be there when the attack is made.\nOf course you must be quick and agile to do this, and wear no armor. While your Dodging skill makes you that more difficult to hit, this bonus is doubled when you have learned my Expert teachings.\nI will instruct you if you have a Skill level of 4 in Dodging and pay 2000 gold."
msgstr "最好的防守技术就是趁对手未发动进攻就逃之夭夭。高超的闪躲术不但要求你们动作敏捷，机警灵巧，而且还不能穿着任何盔甲。如果你们的闪躲术达到4级并给我2000个金币，我就传授你们专家级的闪躲术，使你们的闪躲术提高一倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1366
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:461
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The best defense to an attack is not to be there when the attack is made.\nOf course you must be quick and agile to do this, and wear no armor. While your Dodging skill makes you that more difficult to hit, this bonus is tripled when you have learned Mastery of dodging.\nI will instruct you if you have an Expert Skill level of 7 in Dodging and pay 5000 gold"
msgstr "最好的防守技术就是趁对手未发动进攻就逃之夭夭。高超的闪躲术不但要求你们动作敏捷，机警灵巧，而且还不能穿着任何盔甲。如果你们的闪躲术达到7级，并给我5000个金币，我就传授你们大师级的闪躲术，使你们的闪躲术提高两倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1367
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:462
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The best defense to an attack is not to be there when the attack is made.\nOf course you must be quick and agile to do this, and wear no armor. Or so you thought, for Grand Mastery gives you all of the benefits of Dodging while wearing leather armor. Your Dodging skill makes you that much more difficult to hit and this bonus is still tripled when you have achieved Grand Mastery of Dodging.\nI will instruct you if you have a Master Skill level of 10 in Dodging, pay 8000 gold and skill level of 10 in Unarmed combat."
msgstr "最好的防守技术就是趁对手未发动进攻就逃之夭夭。高超的闪躲术不但要求你们动作敏捷，机警灵巧，而且还不可以穿着任何盔甲。但如果你们掌握了宗师级的闪躲术，就能够身穿皮甲，而且闪躲术也会提高两倍。如果你们的闪躲术达到10级，并给我8000个金币，我就传授你们这项闪躲术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1368
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:463
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hand to hand combat is the quickest way to fight.\nNo weapons to slow you down. With my Expert teachings you will learn to do more damage with every hit you land upon your enemy. You must have a skill level of 4 in Unarmed combat and pay my price of 2000 gold."
msgstr "空手搏斗术古已有之，而且是最公平的较量。我可以传授你们专家级的空手搏斗术，使你们战斗时威力大增。不过你们的空手搏斗术必须达到4级，并给我2000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1369
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:464
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You wish to continue upon the path of Mastery of Unarmed combat?\nWith Mastery you will double your bonus to hit and damage with every attack.\nFirst you must have an Expert skill level of 7 with Unarmed combat and pay 5000 gold.\nOnly then will I teach you."
msgstr "想要成为空手搏斗术的大师吗？成为大师就可以使空手搏斗术的威力增强一倍。如果你们的空手搏斗术达到7级并给我5000个金币，我就传授你们这项技术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1370
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:465
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Attaining Grand Master level of Unarmed combat gives you the chance to avoid attacks entirely, leaving you unhampered to slay your foe.\nYou must demonstrate a Master skill level of 10 in Unarmed combat, a skill level of 10 in Dodging and pay 8000 gold to receive my instruction."
msgstr "掌握了宗师级的空手搏斗术，对手就连你们的边也摸不着，而你们揍他们却是易如反掌。如果你们的空手搏斗术达到10级，并付我8000个金币，我就传授你们这项技术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1371
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:466
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Knowing what you are up against in combat can mean the difference between life and death.\nBeing able to identify the monsters and opponents you are fighting can make this difference. I can teach you Expert Identify Monster if you already have a skill level of 4 and and pay 500 gold."
msgstr "知己知彼才能百战百胜，不然连你们的对手是谁都不知道，糊里糊涂送了性命，岂不是太可惜了。所以怪物鉴定技术就是一项非常有用的技术。如果你们的怪物鉴定技术达到4级，并付我500个金币，我就传授你们专家级的怪物鉴定技术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1372
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:467
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "He who runs away today lives to run away another day.\nThis doesn't necessarily mean he is a coward, however.\nHe may just be very smart.\nHe may know how his opponent attacks and what spells he may use, if any.\nI can teach you Master Identify Monster if you have achieved an Expert Skill level of 7 and can pay 2500 gold."
msgstr "知己知彼才能百战百胜，不然连你们的对手是谁都不知道，糊里糊涂送了性命，岂不是太可惜了。所以怪物鉴定技术就是一项非常有用的技术。如果你们的怪物鉴定技术达到7级，并付我2500个金币，我就传授你们大师级的怪物鉴定技术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1373
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:468
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you can probe your enemies defenses and know his weaknesses, you will always prevail.\nWith Grand Mastery of Identify Monster, you will know how your enemy attacks and what his defenses are.\nThis knowledge will allow you to attack his weakest points. I can raise you to Grand Master of this skill if you have a Master skill level of 10 and pay 6000 gold."
msgstr "知己知彼才能百战百胜，不然连你们的对手是谁都不知道，糊里糊涂送了性命，岂不是太可惜了。所以怪物鉴定技术就是一项非常有用的技术。如果你们的怪物鉴定技术达到10级，并付我6000个金币，我就传授你们宗师级的怪物鉴定技术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1374
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:469
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Knowledge of a single weapon is great.\nHaving knowledge of all weapons is even better.\nArmsmaster skill allows you to decrease the recovery time of any melee weapon you are already skilled with and gives the chance for greater inflicted damage.\nI can make you an Expert Armsmaster if you have a skill level of 4 and pay 2000 gold."
msgstr "只有对自己使用的兵器了如指掌，才能在战斗中克敌制胜。掌握武器使用术可以降低战斗中兵器的损坏程度，并增强杀伤力。如果你们武器使用术达到4级，并给我2000个金币，我就传授你们专家级的武器使用术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1375
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:470
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Knowledge of a single melee weapon is great.\nHaving knowledge of all melee weapons is even better.\nArmsmaster skill allows you to decrease the recovery time of any melee weapon you are already skilled with and gives the chance for greater inflicted damage.\nI can make you a Master Armsmaster if you have an Expert skill level of 7 and pay 5000 gold."
msgstr "只有对自己使用的兵器了如指掌，才能在战斗中克敌制胜。掌握武器使用术可以降低战斗中兵器的损坏程度，并增强杀伤力。如果你们武器使用术达到7级，并给我5000个金币，我就传授你们大师级的武器使用术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1376
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:471
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Knowledge of a single melee weapon is great.\nHaving knowledge of all melee weapons is even better.\nArmsmaster skill decreases the recovery time of any melee weapon you are already skilled with and gives the chance for greater inflicted damage.\nI can make you a Grand Master Armsmaster if you have a Master skill level of 10 and pay 8000 gold."
msgstr "只有对自己使用的兵器了如指掌，才能在战斗中克敌制胜。掌握武器使用术可以降低战斗中兵器的损坏程度，并增强杀伤力。如果你们武器使用术达到10级，并给我8000个金币，我就传授你们宗师级的武器使用术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1377
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:472
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don’t want to pay for an item from a store?\nThe five finger discount gives you a chance to to take an item without paying for it.\nI can teach you Expert Stealing for 500 gold and if your skill level is already 4.\nThis will double you chance of success!"
msgstr "不劳而获是人的天性。你们这双手是派什么用处的，不就是用来拿东西的吗？如果你们的偷窃技术达到4级并给我500个金币，我就传授你们专家级的偷窃技术，使你们的偷窃成功率提高一倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1378
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:473
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Just a little short on gold?\nOr do you think that free is always better than having to pay?\nIf you already have an Expert Skill level of 7 in Stealing and pay me 2500 gold, I can teach you ways of Master Stealing, tripling you chances of success while stealing!"
msgstr "怎么样，缺钱花了吗？干我们这一行可从来不会缺钱花，因为我们根本用不着钱。如果你们的偷窃技术达到7级并给我2500个金币，我就传授你们大师级的偷窃技术，使你们的偷窃成功率提高两倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1379
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:474
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Want to keep all that hard earned gold, do you?\nDon’t want to have to pay to replace that broken item you can't repair? As a Grand Master of Stealing I can teach you ways to quintuple your chances of success when stealing.\nYou must already have a Master skill level of 10 and pay me 6000 gold!"
msgstr "自己辛苦挣些钱也不容易，怎么能轻易上那些奸商的当呢？对这种人不偷白不偷。只要你们的偷窃技术达到10级，并给我6000个金币，我就传授你们宗师级的偷窃技术，使你们的偷窃成功率提高四倍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1382
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:477
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The black potion is the Alchemist's ultimate creation!\nThey can effect so many different things and are even wonderful to taste!\nGrand Mastery of Alchemy can be yours if you have a Master skill level of 10 in Alchemy, possess one of each of the best reagents and pay 6000 gold."
msgstr "制成黑色药剂是炼金术士们朝思暮想的愿望。这种药剂威力强大，神奇无比。如果你们的炼金术达到10级，给我6000个金币并收集到了制成黑色药剂的所有原料，我就传授你们宗师级的炼金技术，使你们制成这种药剂。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1383
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:478
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Learning allows you to gain more experience from your travels and encounters. Expert Learning doubles the bonus to gained experience, leading you down the path of greater wisdom.\nI will instruct you in Expert Learning if your Skill level is 4 and you pay me 2000 gold."
msgstr "学习术可以增加你们闯荡天下所得到的经验值，而专家级的学习术可以使你们得到的经验值提高一倍。如果你们的学习术达到4级并给我2000个金币，我就传授你们这项技术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1384
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:479
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Learning allows you to gain more experience from your travels and encounters. Master Learning triples the bonus to gained experience, leading you down the path of greater wisdom.\nI will instruct you in Master Learning if you have an Expert Skill level of 7, pay me 5000 gold and have and Intellect of 50."
msgstr "学习术可以增加你们闯荡天下所得到的经验值，而大师级的学习术可以使你们得到的经验值提高两倍。如果你们的学习术达到7级，智力值达到50，并给我5000个金币，我就传授你们这项技术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1385
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:480
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Learning allows you to gain more experience from your travels and encounters. Grand Master Learning quintuples the bonus to gained experience, leading you down the path of greater wisdom.\nI will instruct you in Grand Master Learning if you have a Master Skill level of 10, pay me 8000 gold and have and Intellect of 50."
msgstr "学习术可以增加你们闯荡天下所得到的经验值，而宗师级的学习术可以使你们得到的经验值提高四倍。如果你们的学习术达到10级，智力值达到50，并给我8000个金币，我就传授你们这项技术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1386
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:481
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thomas Grey runs the School of Sorcery.\nIf you're looking for promotion to Wizard or Honorary Wizard, he's your man.\nHis room is right through the door behind me."
msgstr "托马斯·格雷是魔法学院的长老。你们要是想升职为法师或荣誉法师，可以去找他。他就住在我的屋子后面。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1387
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:482
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Would you like a membership to the School of Sorcery Scroll Shop?\nA membership allows you free access to the scrolls available in our library.\nIt costs 5000 gold for a six month membership, but the shop stocks once per week."
msgstr "加入我们的魔法学院吧，这样你们就可以随心所欲地学习每个魔法商店里的魔法了。你们只要付5000个金币就可以成为我们学院的成员，有效期为六个月。记住，我们魔法商店里的魔法每个星期会更换一次。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1388
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:483
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Here's the membership, remember it only lasts for six months.\nCheck the shelves in the front rooms here to see what is available."
msgstr "好了，你们现在是我们魔法学院的成员了，记住有效期为六个月。快去前面的魔法商店看看有什么你们感兴趣的魔法吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1390
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:485
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You want to bury the bones of Zokarr IV in our old barrows?\nNo dwarf here will brave the dangers, but Zokarr deserves to be laid to rest in the right place.\nLook for the secret barrow, the one with only one entrance.\nIn there is a coffin waiting for Zokarr's bones."
msgstr "你们想把佐卡尔四世的遗骨埋在旧坟墓里吗？这里没有矮人愿意冒这危险的，但佐卡尔国王确实应该被好好安葬。你们要找一个秘密墓穴，那个只有一个入口的就是他的坟墓。那里有一口棺材是用来安葬佐卡尔的遗骨的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1391
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:486
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We have no one to turn to but you, the new Lords of Harmondale. The Lantern of Light is a treasured holy relic, used by the temples of Erathia.\nIts value is more symbolic than of power-- without it the temples servants lose faith.\nThis Lantern disappeared while being brought to this temple from the temple in Stone City.\nWe believe it was lost somewhere in the maze-like Barrows.\nPlease find it and return it to us."
msgstr "我们现在只有靠你们找回神灯了，哈蒙代尔的新主人们。埃拉西亚神庙里的光明神灯是举世罕见的珍宝。其实它并没有什么魔力，但具有鼓舞人心的作用。没有它，埃拉西亚的僧侣们就会人心惶惶，无心修炼。神灯是在石头城运往这里的路上丢失的，我想它肯定在拜尔德斯那个迷宫般蜿蜒曲折的坟墓里，拜托你们把它取回来，多谢了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1392
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:487
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Have you found the Lantern of Light?\nWe're certain it was lost in the maze of Barrows in the Barrow Downs."
msgstr "还没有找到光明神灯吗？它肯定在拜尔德斯的墓地里。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1393
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:488
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you, Lords of Harmondale.\nThe Lantern's return will bolster our faith and allows us to continue our services.\nPlease take this small reward as a token of our gratitude."
msgstr "太感谢你们了，哈蒙代尔的主人们。神灯回到我们的手中，这下大家又可以专心修炼了。这些酬金是你们应该得的，请拿去吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1394
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:489
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My, brother, Haldar passed away last month.\nThe family was sending his remains to me to be put to final rest.\nSomething happened to those delivering these remains to me; they disappeared in Nighon and not been heard from since. I fear my brothers soul will never rest unless they are found!\nPlease return Haldar to me if you find him? I will reward you well for this!"
msgstr "我的弟弟哈尔代尔上个月去世了，本来尸体打算运到我这里妥善安葬，但在路上突发意外，在尼根他的遗体莫名其妙地不见了，从此再无消息。要是找不到遗体的话，只怕我弟弟在天堂永远不会瞑目的。麻烦你们走一趟探听一下我弟弟的尸体的下落。如果找到的话我必有重金酬谢。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1395
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:490
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Did you find Haldar's Remains?\nHis soul must be in sheer agony!\nPlease find the jar with his remains!"
msgstr "你们找到哈尔代尔的尸体了吗？没有尸体他的灵魂就成了无主的孤魂，那该多痛苦啊！麻烦你们再加把劲，把他的遗体找回来吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1396
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:491
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for returning my \"brother's\" remains!\nHe was a promising Warlock and his life was ended to soon.\nNow that I have his remains, I will attempt to bring him back as a Lich, and together we will seek greater power and glory!"
msgstr "谢谢你们把我兄弟的遗体带回来。他曾经是个有前途的邪术师，却早早地结束了生命。现在我已经有了他的尸体，我会试着把他变为巫妖，这样我们又可以一起去寻求力量和荣耀了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1397
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:492
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My lords, I was beset by foul bandits when I returned from Avlee and they took everything I had brought with me from the Elves.\nThey even took my signet ring!\nWithout it I cannot continue my business because I cannot seal contracts between myself and other merchants.\nI've heard the bandits base themselves out of a camp in Erathia, but I'm no warrior-- I'd not last a minute against them.\nPlease go to Erathia and see this justice done!"
msgstr "主人啊，我实在太不幸了。我从埃里回来的路上遇到一伙强盗，他们把我的财宝一抢而光，最要命的是他们抢走了我的戒指印章。没有这个东西我没法签合同，连生意都不能做了。听说这伙歹徒就盘踞在埃拉西亚东北面的巢穴里，我真想亲自找上门去教训他们，可惜我只是个手无缚鸡之力的商人。我只能请求你们去除强扶弱，为我伸张正义，事成之后我一定会重重酬谢你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1398
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:493
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You don't have my ring yet?\nThe bandits are south of Castle Gryphonheart in Erathia.\nPlease help me, I don't have anyone else to turn to."
msgstr "你们还没有拿到戒指。这伙强盗就在埃拉西亚格芬哈特城堡的南面。快去吧，你们可是我唯一的指望啊！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1399
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:494
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My ring!\nThank you lords.\nI can now continue my business and recover my losses, and you have made the trading routes safer for all the merchants!"
msgstr "哦，这就是我的戒指。真是谢谢你们了，我的主人！现在我又能做生意了，你们真是我们商人的大恩人啊！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1400
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:495
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So you are the Lords of Harmondale, eh?\nYou don’t look like much; we shall see how history judges you!\nI myself am a historian and collector of rare historical items.\nLord Markham also collects such items of interest and there is one item in particular that would complete my collection, Parson's Quill-- the Quill used to sign the Treaty of Pierpont ending the first Timber War.\nI know you have dealt with Lord Markham before, it's how you became Lords of this land after all, and if you would take this letter to Lord Markham in Tatalia, I'm sure he would respond favorably.\nI would be even more in your debt if Lord Markham sends this item back with you!\nI would be sure to favorably record your heroic acts and deeds!"
msgstr "啊，你们就是哈蒙代尔城堡的新主人！看起来不怎么象。不过象不象不是我说了算的，老百姓自有评判。我是个历史学家，还是个历史文物的收藏爱好者。听说马克汉姆爵士在这方面和我是同道，他有一件非常珍贵的收藏---帕尔森的羽毛笔。那可不是普通的羽毛笔，结束第一次木材战争时签署匹尔邦特和平协议用的就是这支笔。你们既然能成为哈蒙代尔的主人，和马克汉姆爵士的交情肯定不错。麻烦你们把这封信带给他，他现在已经住在泰塔利亚了。如果爵士看了这封信，能把那支羽毛笔托你们交给我，那真是感激不尽，我一定会让您名垂青史。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1401
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:496
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Did Lord Markham refuse to give you the Quill, or have you not even visited him yet?\nHis Manor is in Tatalia, please don't forget to help me."
msgstr "到底是马克汉姆爵士不给我羽毛笔，还是你们根本没有去见过他。记住，他就住在泰塔利亚，你们一定要帮我这个忙啊！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1402
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:497
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The actual Peacock feather that was used to sign the Treaty of Pierpont.\nMy collection is complete!\nI will be sure to record your activities and deeds correctly and justly so that all will know you as the true Lords of Harmondale!"
msgstr "对，这就是签署匹尔邦特协议的孔雀羽毛笔。现在我的收藏可谓十全十美了。我会把这件事载入史书，让你们名垂青史。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1403
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:498
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A letter from Norbert Thrush the Historian? Let me see it.\n[Lord Markham scans the letter briefly] Hmmmmm…he wants the Peacock feather that was used to sign the Treaty of Pierpont, does he.\nWell, seeing as though he has a supposed original of the Treaty, I guess the feather should go to him.\nHe has promised me anything else in his collection.\nTake this to him and tell him that I will come collect from him shortly!"
msgstr "这是历史学家诺伯特·西拉丝的信，让我好好看看。（马克汉姆爵士很快扫了一下信）嗯，他要签署匹尔邦特协议的那支羽毛笔。既然他有了协议的原件，把羽毛笔给他倒是未尝不可，他在信里还说要用其它文物来交换。好吧，你们就把羽毛笔带给他吧，不过你们得告诉他，我很快要上他那儿去挑几件我中意的文物。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1404
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:499
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hear you folk are the new Lords of Harmondale, eh?\nPerhaps you could do me a large favor, and help yourselves in the process.\nTo the north, in Avlee, lies the Hall under the Hill, the domain of the Faerie King.\nHe owes me a debt from a previous service of mine, and I would like to collect it.\nUnfortunately, the faeries in the Hall and the tricks they play frighten me to death.\nIf you would deliver this letter to the Faerie King, and return what he gives you to me, I'd be very grateful.\nYou would also have the chance to meet the Faerie King for yourselves."
msgstr "原来你们就是哈蒙代尔城堡的新主人，那么这件事就要麻烦你们了。不过此事如果成功，你们自己也大有好处。在埃里北面的小山底下有个地下大厅，那里是仙帝的领地。以前我为他立下一件大功，他欠我一个人情，现在该是他报答我的时候了。可是那里住的神仙很爱作弄人，我可不敢去，不然准得被他们吓得半死。我现在只有拜托你们去把这封信交给仙帝，他会托付你们把一些东西交给我，你们把它们带回来就行了，到时候我会重重谢你们。你们还可以要仙帝帮忙实现你们的心愿，肯定会不虚此行的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1405
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:500
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent!\nThe Pipes!\nYou don't know what this means to me.\nHere, take this as a reward and thank you again for your help in this!"
msgstr "好极了，你们把笛子带回来了，这东西对我来说真是太重要了。这些酬金是你们应得的报酬，你们快收下吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1406
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:501
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't forget to give the letter to the Faerie King.\nWithout it, he probably won't even want to talk to you."
msgstr "记住别忘了把信交给仙帝。没有信，他理也不会理你们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1407
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:502
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We request your services for only one small task.\nIn Castle Lambent rests a valuable tapestry taken from an attack on Watchtower 3 years ago.\nI would like you to get the tapestry for me, as you must have *some* access to the Castle-- my normal associates can't even come near the place.\nI hear a large band of goblins and renegade swordsmen are about... it would be a shame if they happened to find a way to Harmondale.\nYou have one month to get the tapestry.\nDon't be late."
msgstr "我们有件小事想麻烦你们。三年以前光辉城堡袭击了我们的哨塔，抢走了一块名贵的挂毯。那个地方守卫非常森严，驻扎了大批大耳怪和邪恶剑手，我的手下根本无法靠近那里。看来只有你们能胜任这个任务，想办法潜入城堡，把那块挂毯夺回来。不过记住，你们只有一个月的时间，超过期限他们就会发现你们的哈蒙代尔城堡，并会立即发动，好了，别浪费时间了，快去快回吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1408
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:503
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We request your services for one task.\nA rare and valuable tapestry rests in Castle Gloaming, an antique from near the Silence stolen from the wizards some time ago.\nI would like you to get the tapestry for me, as my normal associates don't have access to Castle Gloaming.\nIn return, I'll make sure that the large band of renegade swordsmen and goblins near Harmondale don't accidentally stumble upon your quiet, little village.\nYou have one month; don't be late."
msgstr "我们需要你们帮个小忙。法师们有一块珍贵的挂毯，是从寂静时代流传下来的一件文物。黄昏城堡派人偷走了这块挂毯。那个地方守卫非常森严，驻扎了大批大耳怪和邪恶剑手，我的手下根本无法靠近那里。看来只有你们能胜任这个任务，想办法潜入城堡，把那块挂毯夺回来。不过记住，你们只有一个月的时间，超过期限他们就会发现你们的哈蒙代尔城堡，并会立即发动，好了，别浪费时间了，快去快回吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1409
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:504
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent!\nI see that you can be trusted to perform well when called upon.\nI'll keep that in mind the next time I need a job done.\nYour reward is nothing more than status quo-- things could be much worse than they already are.\nGo now, I have no more time for you."
msgstr "好极了，看来你们是值得信赖的朋友，下次我们有事一定再会来找你们的。由于你们的努力，哈蒙代尔城堡终于安然无恙了，我想这是对你们的最高奖赏。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1410
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:505
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I see.\nWell, it would appear that the band of renegades has indeed discovered your little town, and has begun looting.\nYou may find your bank account a little, well, pinched.\nConsider this a lesson in punctuality.\nGo now and have a pleasant, pleasant day."
msgstr "现在一个月的期限已经过了，那帮匪徒终于发现了你们的小城堡，如今他们正在哈蒙代尔大肆抢劫屠杀，看来你们的全部家当都难保了。这次就当作一个教导你如何守时的教训吧。走吧，去享受这愉快的一天去吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1411
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:506
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A few years back, while mining underneath Stone City, we came upon quite a shock.\nIt seems that the Warlocks from Nighon had burrowed under the sea to make a sneak attack upon the shores of Erathia.\nTheir careless tunneling has sunken the earth around here until now the areas around the old dwarven barrows and, of course, Stone City, rest far above the terrain.\nWe discovered a force of troglodytes in our mining areas, with a tunnel leading back to Nighon.\nIf you could help us by ridding the tunnels of the troglodytes, we could get back to mining.\nCan you help us?"
msgstr "几年前我们在石头城地下挖矿的时候发现了一桩大阴谋。尼根的邪术师竟挖掘了海底地道，想通过地道偷袭埃拉西亚的海岸。由于他们大肆挖掘，致使那里的地层下陷，现在石头城和原来的矮人族墓地比起那块地都高出许多了。在我们的采矿区有一条地道可以通往尼根，但现在那里被洞穴人霸占着。如果你们能帮助我们赶走洞穴人，我们就可以继续采矿了。请你们帮帮我们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1412
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:507
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are still troglodytes roaming the lower mine levels.\nPlease remove them!"
msgstr "洞穴人还在那个低洼的矿区里逍遥自在。快去把他们赶走吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1413
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:508
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "They're gone?\nRouted back into the connecting tunnels to Nighon!\nExcellent!\nWe can get back to mining immediately!\nThank you so much for your help; take this as a reward for your services."
msgstr "他们逃走了，顺着那条地道滚回尼根去了！真是太好了，我们现在可以开工采矿了，真是太谢谢你们了，这是你们应得的报酬，请收下吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1414
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:509
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have recently gained information that the forces of Queen Catherine, in Erathia, have begun to build a force to attack Deyja.\nBecause of the difficult terrain, they have begun to breed and train griffins to assist in their attack.\nThese griffins are being raised in both Erathia and the Bracada Desert.\nI need you to kill off all the griffins in those two areas so that the Erathians will be forced to drastically delay their plans of attack."
msgstr "我已经得到确切情报，埃拉西亚的凯瑟琳王后正调兵遣将想要进攻迪雅。但由于迪雅地势险要，他们正积极训练狮鹫以在战斗中助他们一臂之力。狮鹫只生活在埃拉西亚和布拉卡达的沙漠里。我需要你们去那两个地方把那些讨厌的狮鹫杀个干净，这样就可以大大推迟他们的进攻计划。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1415
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:510
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You haven't killed off all the griffins in either Erathia or the Bracada Desert.\nIt is imperative that you finish this task to prevent their invasion."
msgstr "埃拉西亚和布拉卡达沙漠里的狮鹫多着呢！你们一定要把它们消灭干净才能阻止埃拉西亚的进攻。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1416
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:511
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You've killed the griffins near Spyre Town, but you haven't dealt with the griffins in Erathia yet.\nFinish them both off and return to me."
msgstr "你们只消灭了布拉卡达沙漠里的狮鹫，埃拉西亚那里还有很多，不把它们全部消灭就别来见我。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1417
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:512
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You've killed the griffins near Steadwick, but you haven't dealt with the griffins in the Bracada Desert yet.\nFinish them both off and return to me."
msgstr "你们只消灭了埃拉西亚的狮鹫，布拉卡达沙漠里还有很多，不把它们全部消灭就别来见我。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1418
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:513
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent!\nYou've done a splendid job.\nHere, take this as your reward and know you've earned the respect of Deyja for your bold success."
msgstr "好极了，你们干得真不错。这些酬金你们收下吧，整个迪雅都会感激你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1419
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:514
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Baby Dragon grants all Warlocks in the party a bonus of 3 to all their spell skills and recovers spell points for them over time.\nThe Dragon, however, needs food to grow up big and strong and therefore resting requires an additional food."
msgstr "幼龙可以使队伍中的邪术师的魔法类技能的等级全部增加3点，并恢复全部魔法值。不过龙为了增强力量会额外消耗你们1个单位食物。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1421
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:516
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The ultimate teacher in the ways of the Staff, Jillian Mithrit, can be found in the elven territory of Avlee.\nHer home is in the city in the northeast."
msgstr "手杖宗师基里安·米斯瑞特住在埃里东北面的镇子里。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1425
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:520
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Grandmaster of the Dagger, Token Fist, can be found in city of Tidewater in Tatalia.\nRumor has it that the Master Thief in the depths of the Erathian Sewers beneath the capitol city of Steadwick can also instruct at this level."
msgstr "匕首宗师托肯·费斯特住在泰塔利亚的潮水镇里。据说埃拉西亚首都斯坦德威克下水道里的盗贼大师也能传授宗师级的匕首技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1438
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:533
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master instructor of uses of Chain Armor, Medwari Dragontracker, can be found in the elven territory of Avlee.\nHis home is in the city in the northeast."
msgstr "锁甲大师麦德沃里住在埃里的东北部。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1444
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:539
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master tutor of Air Magic, Rislyn Greenstorm, lives in the elven territory of Avlee.\nHis home is in the city in the northeast."
msgstr "空气魔法大师瑞斯林·革林斯道住在埃里的东北部。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1448
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:543
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master tutor of Earth Magic, Lara Stonewright, makes her home in the elven territory of the Tularean Forest.\nHer residence is in the city of Pierpont."
msgstr "土系魔法大师兰拉·斯通莱特住在图拉利昂森林的匹尔邦特城。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1450
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:545
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master who taught me, Heather Dreamwright, makes her home in Erathia, somewhere in the capitol city of Steadwick.\nFurther knowledge of Spirit Magic can be gained there."
msgstr "灵魂魔法大师希瑟·德姆利忒住在埃拉西亚首都斯坦德威克。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1451
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:546
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The ultimate teacher in the ways of Spirit Magic, Benjamin the Balanced, can be found in the elven territory of the Tularean Forest.\nHis home is in the city of Pierpont."
msgstr "灵魂魔法宗师本杰明住在图拉利昂森林的匹尔邦特城。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1452
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:547
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master teacher in the ways of Mind Magic, Myles Featherwind, can be found in the elven territory of Avlee.\nHis home is in the city to the northeast."
msgstr "心智魔法大师米莱斯·菲德文特住在埃里的东北部。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1454
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:549
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master teacher in the ways of Body Magic, Brother Bombah, can be found in the swampy regions of Tatalia.\nHis home is somewhere in the southern region."
msgstr "肢体魔法大师邦布大哥住在泰塔利亚南部。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1456
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:552
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Grandmaster of the Identify Item skill, Payge Blueswan, can be found in the elven territory of Avlee.\nHis home is just northwest of the elven city of Spaward."
msgstr "物品鉴定术宗师佩吉·布鲁斯文住在图拉利昂森林。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1464
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:560
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Grandmaster of Meditation, Kaine, can be found in the elven territory of Avlee.\nHis home is on an island somewhere in the central bay."
msgstr "冥想术宗师克因住在埃里中部海湾的小岛上。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1465
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:561
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master of the Perception Skill, Garret Dotes, can be found in the elven area of the Tularean Forest.\nHis home is in the Elven city of Pierpont."
msgstr "洞察术大师嘉瑞特·多迪斯住在图拉利昂森林中的匹尔邦特城里。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1473
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:569
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master instructor of the Identify Monster Skill, Jeni Swiftfoot, lives in the elven territory of Avlee.\nHer home is in the city in the northeast."
msgstr "怪物鉴定术大师吉尼·斯威夫特住在埃里的东北部。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1475
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:571
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Master tutor of the Armsmaster Skill, Paula Brightspear, lives in the elven territory of Avlee.\nHer home is in the city in the northeast."
msgstr "武器使用术大师保拉·布莱斯住在埃里东北部。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1480
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:576
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Grandmaster instructor of Alchemy, Lucid Apple, can be found in the elven territory of Avlee.\nHis home is on an island somewhere in the central bay."
msgstr "炼金术宗师鲁西德·埃普住在埃里中部海湾的小岛上。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1486
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:582
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Grand Master of Dark Magic can be found in the necromancer castle, Castle Gloaming.\nAt times Archibald has been know to take the journey to Clankers Lab."
msgstr "暗黑魔法宗师阿基巴德住在黄昏城堡的死灵法师殿里。他还经常去科兰克的实验室。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1506
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:602
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So YOU'RE the ones that won Lord Markham's contest!\nHow do you like your winnings so far?\nHad enough winning?\nIf I were you, I'd give him a piece of my mind!\nHis mansion is in Tatalia, near the wharf."
msgstr "你们就是马克汉姆爵士举办的寻宝竞赛的优胜者！你们赢得比赛有什么奖赏，光一个小小的哈蒙代尔城堡就把你们打发了。我要是你们，就一定会缠着他多要些好处。他就住在泰塔利亚的码头附近。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1507
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:603
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Watch your wallet while you're here, my friends--Steadwick abounds in thieves.\nAs a matter of fact, we are the world capital of thieves!\nIt's common knowledge that Bill Lasker, the Master Thief, lives in the sewers beneath Steadwick."
msgstr "你们在这儿得小心看着你们的钱包。斯坦德威克到处是小偷，是有名的盗贼之都。盗贼大师比尔·拉斯克就住在斯坦德威克下面的下水道里。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1508
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:604
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Back when I was in the army, I was assigned to scout out the watchtowers in Deyja.\n<chuckling> It's no good trying to go through the front door, so I usually looked around for another way in.\nThose Necromancers are so cowardly, they always have an escape route.\nAnd a way out is also a way in..."
msgstr "我在退伍前，是负责侦察迪雅的哨塔的侦察兵。要从那个哨塔的正门硬闯进去，简直是送死。可我找到另一个出口，原来这些死灵法师也都是胆小鬼，他们还另有一个小门用来逃命。哈，这些我可方便了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1509
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:605
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Bill Lasker may be a criminal, but he has worked for the Crown from time to time.\nSpecial missions, official denials of involvement, spying…that sort of stuff.\nQuite a few unusual events can be tied to Bill, but none to the Crown.\nSeriously, don't you think the Queen's men could find and arrest one man, even if he was hiding in the sewer?"
msgstr "比尔·拉斯克虽然名声不好，可他确实为王室立了不少功劳。有些任务大动干戈也无济于事，但他盗贼大师一旦出马就手到擒来。埃拉西亚王室少不了他，怎么还会抓他呢！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1510
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:606
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You want to know about that traitor, Carmine?\nWell, she used to work for the diplomatic corps, until she went soft and signed up with the goody two-shoes wizards.\nNow she walks the streets of Celeste freely, without a care in the world for the people she left behind.\nSomething bad will happen to her soon, mark my words!"
msgstr "你们要了解叛徒卡米尔的情况。她本来是我们的一个外交使节，可惜不知道哪一天她听信了光明法师的蛊惑，竟加入了他们一边。现在她正在塞莱斯特悠闲地散步呢！等着瞧吧，这个女人终有一天会倒大霉的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1511
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:607
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Looking for \"work\"?\nYou can find the Master Assassin somewhere in the Pit.\nHe'll have something for you.\nThere's always someone or something that needs killing, that's for certain."
msgstr "想找活干吗？杀手大师就住在迪雅，他会给你们些活干的。这世道该死的人多的是，你们干这行不愁没饭吃。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1512
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:608
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Until recently, our local dragon Wromthrax the Heartless has confined his depredations to the hills in the south--eating goats, farm animals, and stray dogs.\nBut he has developed a taste for elvish blood, and now hunts us as well.\nIf you should care to confront him, his cave is in the north, west of the Mercenary Guild in the mountains.\nHe isn't always there.\nBe careful--he is mighty."
msgstr "本来这里的巨龙劳斯莱克只待在南面的小山上觅食小动物，从不骚扰周围的百姓。可是最近它狂性大发，吃了我们精灵族不少人。它的洞穴就在雇佣兵行会西面的山上，它有时会外出猎食，不在洞里。你们要对付它得千万小心，这条龙实在太厉害了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1513
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:609
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What, you wanna be a crusader too?\nThis town is filling up with them, I swear!\nWell, there's a crazy man living in the back of a building near the center of town.\nPeople keep trying to sign up with him, and he keeps rejecting them.\nGood luck."
msgstr "你们想成为十字军？这个镇子里可到处都是十字军。镇子中央一所房子的后面住着一个怪人，人们都想见他一面，可他谁也不见。但愿你们运气好，能够见到他。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1514
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:610
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Just a minute, let me check.\nMirror, mirror, on the wall… <the witch peers into her mirror for a few minutes, then sighs> It's still Alice Hargreaves.\nShe lives in Castle Gryphonheart.\nShe's quite a noble beauty, that girl is!\nTakes me back to my youth, this one does."
msgstr "等一下，让我仔细看看。（巫师朝镜子里端详了好一会儿）啊，正是埃莉斯·哈格，她住在格芬哈特城堡。多漂亮的女孩啊！不过我年轻的时候也不比她差。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1515
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:611
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "One of our finest, most upstanding citizens is William Setag, considered by some to be the most black hearted villain alive.\nAs a matter of fact, he's one of our best agents.\nWizards and their ilk complain because they've been on the receiving end of his schemes too many times-- but he's about the best there is in his profession.\nIf you're looking for employment, go see him.\nHis tower is on the north shore of Deyja at a rather inaccessible point.\nHe doesn't like visitors, but he should be glad to see more students turn up at his door."
msgstr "威廉姆·塞塔格可是我们这里最能干的人，他使光明法师们吃尽了苦头，所以他们对他恨之入骨，其实他只是以牙还牙而已。\n你们要拜他为师吗？为了清净，他住在迪雅北面海滩上一个非常隐蔽的地方。尽管他不喜欢不速之客，但有人来拜师他还是不会拒绝的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1517
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:613
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hear there are markings on the walls of the barrows that can be used to find your way around the tombs.\nIt'll keep you from getting lost, but it won't save you from the undead that defend those graves."
msgstr "据说墓地里墙上的记号可以帮助你们认清路径，避免迷路，可你们还得小心守卫墓地的那些亡灵。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1518
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:614
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A few years back, a weird cult called the Temple of Baa moved into the area.\nAt first they seemed popular, what with their free offers of healing, but it soon became clear they were devoted to darkness.\nNo one goes up there very much, now, and it seems that whatever evil gods were backing them have withdrawn their support.\nBut they're up there still, lurking in the shadows.\nCreepy."
msgstr "几年前一个名叫羊鸣教的邪教霸占了这个地方。起初由于他们积善行德，免费为老百姓救死扶伤，因此名声大震，广受欢迎。可是不久他们邪恶的本来面目被揭穿后就很少有人去那儿了，而且他们膜拜的邪神似乎也不再青睐他们，于是这个教派日渐衰弱。可是他们如今还盘踞在这里，等待东山再起的那一天。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1519
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:615
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lots of sheep have gone missing since the Baa cult moved in--and I mean lots.\nNo doubt they were taken to the Baa temple for sacrifice.\nI'm going to go broke if someone doesn't do something about those cultists!"
msgstr "自从羊鸣教到了这里，我养的羊就少了好多，一定是被他们偷去祭神了。要是再这样下去我就要破产了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1520
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:616
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ssspies abound in places like this, my friendsss.\nIf you wish your letters and communiqués to remain sssecret, you should use a cipher when you write.\nThere is a book in the Castle library that will explain everything, my friendsss."
msgstr "这个地方到处都是密探，要是你们不想让别人知道自己写些什么，就非得用密码不可。在这里城堡的图书馆里有本书能破译所有的密码。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1521
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:617
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Eight years ago, we sent a team of scholars to what is now the Red Dwarf Mine to study the strange creatures that would occasionally show up there.\nThe first thing we noticed was that Ooze ectoplasm makes an excellent potion catalyst.\nThe second was that ooze just can't be physically damaged--they split apart or squish, then run back together. If you want to kill one, you'll have to do it with magic."
msgstr "八年前，据说红矮人矿那里经常有怪兽出没，于是我们派了一队学者去看个究竟。我们发现原来这东西叫粘土怪，它可是做药剂的好材料。兵器对它不起作用，无论刀砍斧劈，它都能马上还原。要对付它们，只有靠魔法。\n"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1522
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:618
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There is a breed of Medusa infesting the Red Dwarf Mines that is immune to magic.\nThese monsters are a real terror!\nI can only thank the Gods that these creatures haven't escaped the mine.\nWhat would we do then, beat them to death with our staves?"
msgstr "在红矮人矿盘踞着一伙美杜莎女妖，魔法对她们无能为力，真是些可怕的家伙。谢天谢地她们就待在矿井里，还没有出来作恶。不然就凭我们根本对付不了她们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1523
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:619
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you head south past the Wyvern Plains, don't go knocking at the door of that huge fortress you'll see standing in the middle of the water.\nIt's the Titan's Stronghold, and they don't much like visitors."
msgstr "你们要是走到南面的维文平原，千万不要去湖中那个堡垒，那里是泰坦巨人的营地，他们可不欢迎不速之客。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1524
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:620
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Arena fighting is available to anyone who wants to practice against any kind of opponent.\nYou can get to the arena by visiting a stable on any Sunday and asking them to take you there.\n"
msgstr "谁要是精力太旺盛需要发泄，去竞技场角斗倒不错。不过一定要在星期天去驿站，只有那天才有去那里的车。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1525
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:621
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Arena Champships are held on each Sunday.\nThey are open to all--but be careful!\nYour opponents are chosen by the Arena management, not you!"
msgstr "每个星期天竞技场都举行比武大会，你们可以上那里碰碰运气。不过你们的对手可都是些不好惹的家伙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1526
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:622
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Every graveyard or ancestral burial place seems to have a haunted house nearby--and ours is no exception.\nThere is a mansion near one of the plateaus on the surface in the northwest.\nIt is most certainly haunted."
msgstr "每片坟墓附近都有一幢鬼屋，我们这也一样。西北面就有一个，里面尽是讨厌的游魂。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1527
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:623
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fear the touch of the Ghost as you fear the loss of your life.\nIt inflicts terrible spiritual wounds and drains your youth before your eyes!"
msgstr "千万别惹那些游魂，它们会强大的灵魂魔法，还可以使你们迅速衰老。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1528
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:624
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A few wars ago, my great grandfather worked on an escape tunnel from the Elvish castle to the Tularean Caves.\nI don't think it's ever been used--no attack on the castle has ever brought it down--but it sure is an interesting piece of history, don't you think?"
msgstr "很久以前我的祖父曾被招募去挖一条准备撤退时用的地道，这条地道从精灵城堡一直通往图拉利昂洞穴。由于城堡从未被攻占，所以这条地道就从来没有人用过，不过这也应该算是历史上一个伟大的工程了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1529
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:625
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "They say that elves are faeries, but in truth we are only distantly related.\nThe true faeries don't live in civilization, and they're just like the stories say--playful, cruel, magical, and dangerous.\nBut if you really want to meet them, you could visit them in their Hall under the Hill, as they call it.\nIt is just outside of the village, to the North and West.\nIt will be challenging to get to the front door... "
msgstr "人们总以为精灵就是神仙，其实两者差了十万八千里。其实真正的神仙可不会和人类混在一起。他们生性贪玩、铁石心肠、法术高强、脾气暴躁，如果你们真的想要见见他们，可以去小山下面的大厅。那座山就在村子的西北面，不过你们要从正门进去可得花点功夫。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1530
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:626
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A while ago, I saw some men come to the Tularean Forest at night with axes and torches, following some sort of map.\nWhen they left, they were laughing and happy.\nIt looked like they were carrying a big green rock.\nMy brother says they were a band of mercenaries from Tatalia.\nAnyway, the next day was when the forest went mad.\nIt's too dangerous to go there now."
msgstr "从前我看见有人按照地图的指引，明火执仗地闯入图拉利昂森林，心满意足地拉走了一块绿色的大岩石，有人说他们是泰塔利亚派来的雇佣兵。第二天可不得了，整个森林都发怒了，它们疯狂袭击胆敢进入森林的任何人，如今没人敢去那里。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1531
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:627
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Tularean Forest is so old that it has developed a mind…sort of.\nThe forest is vaguely aware of who walks through it, but only one part of the forest can communicate with people.\nThat's the oldest tree.\nIf you want to have a very long and slow conversation, it will be happy to oblige.\nLook for it on an island to the south east of the forest.\nIt's larger than the rest of the trees.\nYou can't miss it."
msgstr "图拉利昂森林里的老树年深日久，都快变成树精了。它们能够发觉有人进入了森林，但只有其中年纪最大的一棵树会和人说话。你们要是想知道更多一些情况，可以去那里找它。它在森林东南面的岛上，比别的树高大得多，很好认的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1532
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:628
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Anyone needing to earn some spare cash can visit a town hall in any major city to pick up a bounty hunting assignment.\nCity councils are always fearful of the latest man eating monster or bandit or mad wizard, and set bounties on the creature that is bothering them most this month.\nThere's no rhyme or reason to their choices, so don't try to figure it out.\nThey often pay quite well."
msgstr "要是你们想挣点钱花，可以去各个大城市的市政厅接受赏金任务。这些市政厅每个月都会悬赏消灭一种生物，比如吃人的怪兽、邪恶的魔法师或是猖狂的歹徒，反正他们想干掉谁就会出钱招募杀手。重赏之下必有勇夫，你们也可以去试试运气。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1533
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:629
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you ever get tired of amateur bounty hunts, and want to advance your career, speak with Ebednezer Sower in Avlee.\nHe only teaches followers of the shadow path, though."
msgstr "要是你们厌倦了简单的赏金任务，想要把自己的本领更提高一步，可以去埃里找埃伯登泽·索渥。不过他只向选择黑暗之路的人传授本领。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1534
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:630
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Pirates been operating out of the tidewater caverns for twenty years.\nThey're not Regnans, and they aren't part of Bill Lasker's men, but they're still pretty mean.\nYou want to get in there, just get yourself out to the islands to the west."
msgstr "海盗在潮水洞穴为非作歹已经有二十年了。这些年来他们无恶不作，犯下了滔天罪行。你们要是想找他们去算帐，可以到西面的岛上去。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1535
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:631
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Evenmorn Island isn't lost, so much as hard to get to.\nIt is surrounded by treacherous reefs, sandbars, whirlpools, and sharks.\nIf it's dangerous, the Island is surrounded by it.\nThere are only one or two safe ways in, and the map for those ways was stolen by pirates during the chaos of the recent wars.\nThey probably still have the map in their caves.\n"
msgstr "埃弗蒙岛可是个凶险的地方，它周围到处是旋涡和暗礁，不熟悉地形根本无法上岛。但是海盗们趁火打劫，趁着战乱偷走了埃弗蒙岛的地图，现在地图一定在他们盘踞的洞穴里。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1536
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:632
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The boat captains would be happy to take any paying fare to Evenmorn island, but they don't have proper maps.\nThere's no way anyone is going to risk their ship in the reefs around the Island unless they have the map!"
msgstr "只要你们有钱，总有船会带你们去埃弗蒙岛。不过没有这个岛的地图，恐怕没人敢陪你们去送死。你们还是先去找地图吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1537
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:633
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, I don't have any golem parts--I never took that class--but there are students all over Bracada who have spare golem parts lying around.\nThey aren't worth anything unless you have them all, so they'll probably just give them to you for free."
msgstr "我身上可没有什么人偶的肢体，我对这玩艺儿不感兴趣。不过我听说在布拉卡达有些人身上带有人偶肢体的一部分，这个人偶只有拼合完整才有巨大的威力，所以我想他们会很乐意给你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1538
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:634
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You see all those golems walking around Bracada?\nEvery single one of them was made by the School.\nNot bad for students, eh?\nThey don't have much to say, but they're tough guardians and can tell when a follower of Darkness is near.\nYou should see them go into action when one of those Necromancers or Warlocks wanders into our lands.\nZowwwwwieeee!"
msgstr "你们在布拉卡达看见那些四处瞎逛的人偶了吗？它们都是在魔法学院中修炼的法师的杰作，不赖吧。这些人偶虽然话不多，却非常“嫉恶如仇”。只要有死灵法师或是邪术师踏上我们的土地，人偶们就会奋起进攻。咿咿咿呀！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1539
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:635
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Our astrologers have determined that the missing Divine Intervention text lies somewhere deep under the ground.\nUnder Deyja, to be precise.\nThey fear that the current incarnation of the text has fallen into the Breeding Pit--the Necromancer's version of our Proving Grounds.\nOh, what must we have done to offend the Gods so?\nWe will never retrieve the text from that forsaken place!"
msgstr "我们已经掌握确切消息，失落的普渡众生魔法就在迪雅的地下，确切点说，是在死灵法师们修炼魔法的再生之地里。愿神宽恕我们的罪过吧，看来我们要永远失去它了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1540
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:636
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The spell of Divine Intervention, the highest of the school of Light magic, has been missing for centuries.\nIt is a curse, we believe, for our lack of devotion and faith to the Light.\nWe struggle, and some go forth to find the spell, from time to time, but none have been successful.\nEach time they find it, fate cruelly snatches it from our hands.\nOur Grandmasters have been bereft of this final, great spell for as long as anyone alive can remember."
msgstr "光明魔法中最神圣的魔法---普渡众生已经失踪了好几个世纪了。这大概是神对我们亵渎神灵，玷污光明教荣誉的惩罚。这些年来我们尽力赎罪，四处派人寻找这个魔法，但每次都功败垂成。我们光明教派的宗师曾经练成过这种魔法，它的威力真是旷古罕见。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1541
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:637
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The only people in the world who make soul jars are the Warlocks of Nighon.\nIt is a secret of their profession--which is strange, since they have absolutely no use for them.\nStill, we are forced to bargain for the jars in order to advance our craft.\nOf course, we have wrested the jars from them, from time to time...but then they raise their prices in revenge.\nIt must be our fate to suffer so."
msgstr "天下只有尼根的邪术师会制造灵魂之坛，这是他们的独门绝技。可奇怪的是这项技术对他们来说并没有什么用处，而灵魂之坛是我们修炼魔法必需的圣物。这些年来我们巧取豪夺，讨价还价，从他们那里弄来不少坛子，而他们开的价也越来越高，唉，这样下去可怎么办啊！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1542
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:638
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Every Necromancer aspires to be a Lich one day.\nAll you need is a Soul Jar, knowledge of the Ritual, and the magical skill to survive the journey to the Land of the Dead and return.\nThe body withers while the soul lives on in a glorious state free from hunger, disease, and injury.\nOnly shallow and superficial people would mind what the Ritual does to one's appearance.\nTrue practitioners hardly notice."
msgstr "每个死灵法师都想有朝一日成为巫妖。只要有了属于自己的灵魂之坛，经过永生仪式，就可抛弃自己的肉身，让灵魂自由自在地游荡，再也不用忍饥挨饿，再也不怕病魔侵袭，也不用担心受伤流血。人们总说永生仪式是多么的可怕，多么的惨无人道，可是为了灵魂的自由，还有什么不可以牺牲呢？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1543
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:639
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Three circles of stones were built by the Druids long ago.\nSince hearing of their locations ruins ascension attempts for would be Great Druids, I can only give you a general clue--All are in the open, unhidden and bare, and all are distant from settlements.\nTo tell you more would spoil your Ascension."
msgstr "德鲁伊们很早以前就造了三个石圈，听说那是他们升职为高级德鲁伊时必须在那里举行仪式。石圈所在的地方非常偏僻，你们可得仔细搜寻啊！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1545
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:641
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The graveyard does indeed hold the bones of the ancient King, but the hallowed land will curse any who disturb it.\nI don't envy you this task.\nEach grave you open will unleash its curse, and possibly some other trap.\nBest be sure you're opening the correct grave when you begin to dig."
msgstr "国王的尸骨确实在这片墓地里，不过这个地方被赋予了魔力，任何擅入者将死无葬身之地。你们只可以挖掘真正埋有国王尸骨的坟墓，其它东西一样都不要碰。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1546
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:642
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though the barrows were built to deter thieves, a way was needed to navigate them during burials and ceremonies.\nNear each of the gates you'll find a plaque.\nThese plaques are cryptic, but they will keep you from losing your way, as long as you use them.\nNo thief yet has realized their significance, so once they enter the barrows, they never leave."
msgstr "这片墓地的道路犹如迷宫，是为了预防盗墓贼的。不过为了方便其他人能进出坟墓举行葬礼，这里每扇门旁边都有一个神秘的金属牌，它是指路用的，有了这个就不会在墓地里迷路了。很多盗贼不知道这个秘密，往往是有来无回。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1547
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:643
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We built a tunnel leading from our Thunderfist Mountain to the Land of the Giants during the War.\nIt was there we discovered the Kreegan, and more titans and dragons then you can imagine.\nI suppose one who's familiar is to be a dragon could find eggs in one of the dragon caves of that terrible land.\n'Ware the mother..."
msgstr "在战争期间我们修建了一条地道从桑达非斯通往巨人领地。在那里我们不仅发现了克里根族，还有很多巨人和龙。既然那里有很多龙穴，龙蛋肯定也不少，不过谁敢上那里去送死呢！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1548
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:644
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard legends that there is a dragon in the Land of the Titans greater than any that have come before.\nLesser dragons and titans do battle on the slopes of the mountain in which its cave resides.\nThis dragon is so huge, and so mighty that the other dragons feed it for fear it will one day leave its cave and devour them all in its fury.\nThe dragons believe it is a god.\nIf that is so, imagine its treasure..."
msgstr "我听说在巨人领地有一条奇大无比的龙，附近的巨人和其它龙看见它就逃之夭夭。为了太平，它们还经常向这条巨龙进贡物品，甚至把它奉为神灵。看来这条龙的龙穴里一定有不少宝藏。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1549
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:645
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Glad you found the way in the back door.\nYou probably avoided a really nasty ambush that way.\nI hope my advice was useful!"
msgstr "你们找到另一个出口了，看来他们的伏击计划这下泡汤了。怎么样，听我的话没错吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1550
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:646
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So…what goes around comes around, eh?\nGood job with that Carmine traitor!"
msgstr "真是天遂人愿，这就是叛徒卡米尔应有的下场。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1551
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:647
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The dragon is fallen--and at your hands!\nYou are a hero!"
msgstr "你们竟然可以亲手屠龙，简直太伟大了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1552
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:648
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Baa cult is gone?\nWell that IS good news!\nEveryone is in your debt, whether they know it or not.\n"
msgstr "羊鸣教终于瓦解了。我们真是太感谢你们了，人民不会忘记你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1553
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:649
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Glad to hear the Baa cult has gone missing, instead of my sheep!\nGood job!"
msgstr "羊鸣教完蛋了，这下我的羊群该太平了，真是谢谢你们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1555
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:651
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The forest is much safer now, thanks you to!\nThe oldest tree is very happy with you, and has included you in its history recitals."
msgstr "森林现在重新恢复了宁静，这要感谢你们所做的一切。老树对你们非常赞赏，还把你们的事迹编成歌谣传唱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1556
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:652
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh, so the map is found?\nWhat will you do with your newfound treasure?\nShare it, I hope!"
msgstr "你们找到地图了。这下找那些宝藏就容易多了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1557
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:653
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now that you have the map, I guess you'll be going there soon.\nBe careful--they say the island is cursed!"
msgstr "你们找到地图了，这下去那个地方就容易多了。不过你们还得处处小心，听说那可是一个被魔法笼罩的地方。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1558
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:654
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you don't mind the swamp and fog, Evenmorn Island is a great place to live.\nOf course, the Curse doesn't help--ghosts and skeletons roam the island freely--but other than that, the neighbors keep to themselves.\nThe Churches of the Sun and the Moon don't even fight each other very much anymore.\n<Heh!> probably means they're running out of adherents..."
msgstr "如果你们不介意泥沼遍地，终日迷雾遮天的话，埃弗蒙岛倒是个景色秀丽的地方。听说岛上到处是游魂和骷髅，但也没干过什么坏事。岛上的月亮教和太阳教也不象前些年那样打得不可开交了，看来他们都已经日渐衰败，成不了什么气候了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1559
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:655
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Divine intervention has been found and copied?\nA miracle!\nI never expected to see it in my lifetime!\n"
msgstr "啊，你们找到普渡众生魔法了，真是个奇迹。我以为自己活不到亲眼目睹魔法的这一天了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1560
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:656
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All the grandmasters are very pleased with you.\nYou have done our profession a great service!"
msgstr "现在我们所有的魔法宗师都非常赏识你们，你们为我们教派做了件大好事。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1561
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:657
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Since you've discovered the circles on your own they have worked their magic on you.\nI hope you will refrain from telling others of their whereabouts, as I have done for you."
msgstr "你们成功的找到了石圈，得到了它赋予的魔力。不过我希望你们不要把石圈所在的位置说出去，那可是我们的秘密。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1562
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:658
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "During the wars between the Temples of the Sun and Moon, three statuettes were stolen from the shrines in the Bracada Desert, Tatalia, and Avlee.\nI represent a group of Druids that want these shrines back to their original form-- it is critical for their worship.\nTo this end, I am offering a substantial reward for anyone that will find the statuettes and place them on the shrines."
msgstr "在太阳教和月亮教的战争中，布拉卡达、泰塔利亚和埃里三个地方祭坛上膜拜的石像同时失踪了。我接受德鲁伊的委托悬赏寻找这些石像，这可是德鲁伊修炼至关重要的圣物。如果谁能找到石像并把它们放回祭坛，我会以重金酬谢。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1563
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:659
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All three statuettes are not placed.\nI cannot reward partial success.\nReturn when you have placed all three."
msgstr "你们不但要找到石像，还要把它们放回祭坛，等完成这个任务再来拿赏金吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1564
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:660
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Great work!\nThe Druids are so pleased, they threw in a little extra for your fine performance.\nTake this… you most certainly deserve it."
msgstr "干得好极了，德鲁伊对你们非常感谢。这是你们应该得到的报酬，拿去吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1565
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:661
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As you may have already guessed, I'm a collector of fine art.\nCurrently, I am looking for a set of paintings, one of King Roland, one of his brother Archibald, and one of the angel statue in the courtyard of Castle Ironfist.\nThis set is of great value, and, as a collector, I'm willing to pay quite handsomely for it.\nIf you should gather the entire set of paintings bring them back to me and I'll be sure to compensate you well for your effort."
msgstr "你们好，我是一个艺术品的收藏家。这两天我正要找一套珍贵的艺术品，包括一幅罗兰德国王的画像，一幅阿基巴德的画像和一幅天使画像。为了得到这套举世罕见的精品画像，我会不惜一切代价。如果你们能找到这三幅画的话，我会重重酬谢你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1566
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:662
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You don't have any of the paintings.\nI'm looking for the set containing Roland, Archibald, and the statue."
msgstr "你们什么都没找到，别想来领赏。我再说一遍，我要一幅罗兰德国王的肖像画，一幅阿基巴德的肖像画和一个天使画像。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1567
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:663
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Remember, I need the complete set of paintings-- they aren't worth much by themselves.\nWhen you have the rest, bring them all to me."
msgstr "这三件艺术品只有收集在一起才值钱，你们快去找吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1568
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:664
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wonderful!\nThis set has eluded me for years!\nYou more than deserve the reward I promised; here, hopefully this will be sufficient."
msgstr "你们干得好极了，为了找到它们我可费了不少心血。这些酬金是你们应该得的，请收下吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1569
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:665
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "To be declared ArcoMage Champion, you must win a game of ArcoMage in every tavern on, in, and under the continent of Erathia.\nThere are 13 such taverns sponsoring ArcoMage events.\nWhen you have accomplished this, return to me to claim the prize."
msgstr "要成为魔幻牌的冠军，你们必须去埃拉西亚。那里有十三家开设魔幻牌比赛的客栈，你们只有赢得所有的比赛，才能获得这个称号，到那时候你们可以到我这里来领赏。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1570
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:666
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must claim a victory at ALL 13 taverns.\nUntil you do, you cannot be declared ArcoMage Champion."
msgstr "你们必须在所有十三家客栈都赢得胜利，才能成为魔幻牌的冠军。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1571
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:667
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Congratulations!\nYou have become the ArcoMage Champion!\nThe prize is waiting in the chest right outside my house."
msgstr "祝贺你们，现在你们已经是玩魔幻牌的冠军。你们的奖赏就在我屋子外面的箱子里，快去拿吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1572
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:668
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Here is the %s you have lost.\nBe more careful in the future."
msgstr "这是你们需要的%s。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1574
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:670
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "People say the Dwarves live in the barren lands south of Harmondale, but that's not exactly true--They live UNDER them.\nLook for their front gate in the center of the Barrow Downs where three bridges meet."
msgstr "相传矮人族住在哈蒙代尔南面的拜尔德斯，其实他们是住在那里的地底下。拜尔德斯中部三座桥相连的地方就是他们住所的进口。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1575
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:671
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ever since the Warlocks of Nighon tunneled through Stone City from their island, travelers have been asking to pass through the city to get to Nighon.\nThe Dwarf King hates this, and would like to charge a hefty fee for people seeking to enter Stone City.\nHe has not started charging however, fearing political and possible violent repercussions with the Warlocks of Nighon."
msgstr "尼根的邪术师修建了一条从他们居住的岛屿通往石头城的地道，所有想去他们那里修炼的人都是通过这条地道去那里的。矮人国王对此大发脾气，甚至要向所有进入石头城的人征收高额的进城费。不过他幸好没有这么做，不然激怒了尼根的邪术师那可不得了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1576
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:672
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Warlocks of Nighon live in Thunderfist Mountain--an extinct volcano on a large island a few miles from the mainland.\nDuring the recent wars, the Warlocks tunneled through Stone City to transport their forces across the channel.\nThose tunnels are still open and can be traversed."
msgstr "邪术师住在桑达非斯山，那是一个座落在一个大岛上的火山。在最近的战争中，邪术师修建了一条地道用来运送部队，那条地道现在还可以让人通行。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1577
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:673
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "During the War, the Warlocks tunneled from Nighon through Stone City to get to the mainland and seize territory.\nEven though they were pushed back to their island by Erathia, the tunnels remain."
msgstr "在战争中，尼根的邪术师修建了一条从他们居住的岛屿通往石头城的地道，想通过地道出其不意地发动进攻，占领整个大陆。虽然他们的进攻被击退了，但那条地道还留在那里。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1578
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:674
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Dwarves live under the ground of the Barrow Downs--a barren collection of ancient gravesites built by their race centuries ago to honor fallen kings and heroes.\nNot all of the barrows can be reached on the surface--many are magically connected to each other through a system of teleporters and traps that protect the graves from those who would rob them.\nIf you look closely at the walls you should see markings that might help you navigate."
msgstr "矮人族住在拜尔德斯的地下。那里有很大一片墓地，安葬着千百年来矮人族的国王和英雄们。那里的坟墓机关密布，密如蛛网，许多坟墓都由远距离传送装置连接。但如果你们仔细观察，会发现墓地的墙上有指路的记号，有了它你们就不会迷路了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1579
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:675
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We were making a fortune in the Red Dwarf Mines until the Medusas came!\nWe had to run before they turned everyone to stone.\nWithout our mining, we have almost no way to make a living.\nNot the way for a proper Dwarf to live, I say!"
msgstr "本来我们在红矮人矿井靠采矿为生，可是美杜莎女妖霸占了这个地方，还把我们的人变成了石头。我们矮人世代以采矿为生，没有了矿井，这叫我们怎么活啊！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1580
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:676
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Bracada leased the land where we started the Red Dwarf Mine to us a few years ago.\nThat was until the Medusas came and took the mines from our people.\nOnly the Gods know what horrors go on in there now.\nThe mines were in the Northeast corner of Bracada."
msgstr "布拉卡达把红矮人矿井交给我们，让我们可以在那里采矿。可是美杜莎女妖霸占了这个地方，还把我们的人变成了石头，天知道现在那里被她们糟蹋成什么样子了。矿井就在布拉卡达的东北角。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1581
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:677
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When the Medusas took the Red Dwarf Mines from us, not everyone escaped.\nThere are still several statues in the mines.\nThey can be rescued if their statues haven't been broken yet, but you would have to fight through the Medusas to do it."
msgstr "美杜莎女妖霸占了红矮人矿井，还把我们的人变成了石头。要使他们重新复生全靠你们了，但千万要小心那伙可恶的女妖，她们可不是好对付的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1582
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:678
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you like our city?\nIt's not just a hole in the ground--it's a home in the ground!\nDwarves have been working this mountain for centuries!\nThere isn't much mining left here, though, and what there is happens to be in unstable and unsafe tunnels.\nBe careful if you go to the lower levels."
msgstr "你们喜欢这个地方吗？经过矮人族千百年来的建设，这里已经是一座宏伟的地下城了。不过这里的矿已经被采得差不多了，地层深处尽是些快崩塌的地道，你们要是想去那儿得千万小心。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1583
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:679
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Respectfully, my lords, I must say that no one expects you to last long because no other lords of Harmondale have lasted long.\nThe fighting and politics between Erathia and Avlee will claim you sooner or later.\nProbably sooner."
msgstr "你们好，尊敬的哈蒙代尔领主。哈蒙代尔的历任主人没有一个人能长久的统治这个城堡，看来你们也一样。你们迟早会卷入埃拉西亚和埃里的明争暗斗，等着瞧吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1584
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:680
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Rebellions here in Harmondale are rare, but we've had a couple of big ones!\nMost of the time lords here don't last long enough to rebel against, but there've been some wicked ones!\nNot that I think you're wicked, my lords."
msgstr "哈蒙代尔的人民都很安分守己，所以这里很少发生百姓暴动。但到了官逼民反的地步，人民的怒火就会象火山一样爆发，历史上最著名的人民暴动就发生在这里。不过你们看来不象暴君，只要对老百姓好，他们不会给你们惹事的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1585
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:681
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's good to see someone in Harmondale again, my lords.\nThe castle's been standing empty since the War, except for the goblins.\nBut they don't count, I suppose."
msgstr "哈蒙代尔终于有了新主人了。自从战争爆发以来，城堡就没有人掌管了，现在你们来了，百姓们这下该放心了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1586
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:682
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What with all the wars that Avlee gets itself into all the time, and all the high taxes, I've moved to Harmondale to stay.\nHarmondale sees a lot of violence, but at least they don't conscript.\nYou know, there's been so many wars in Avlee that one of the kings had a tunnel dug from his castle to the caves in the North just in case the castle was taken AGAIN."
msgstr "为了打赢这场战争，埃里已经耗尽了所有的资源，还不断向人民横征暴敛，我只好搬迁到哈蒙代尔居住，看来这里是唯一没有卷入战争的一方乐土。埃里的国王在战争中挖了条地道通往北方的洞穴，以便在城堡失陷时能够逃命。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1587
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:683
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A ways outside of Harmondale there's a cave system that's always been the home of bandits, monsters, and other ne'er-do-wells.\nThey're called the White Cliff Caves.\nIf you're ever robbed, or are looking for some evil doers to punish, all you got to do is go up there.\nYou'll find a fight for sure!"
msgstr "哈蒙代尔城外有一个岩洞群，那里是匪徒和怪兽盘踞的安乐窝。哈蒙代尔的百姓吃尽了他们的苦头，现在该是向他们算帐的时候了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1588
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:684
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Did you notice that covered bridge on the way from Harmondale to Steadwick?\nIt's called Fort Riverstride, and it protects us from surprise Elvish attacks coming through Harmondale.\nThere's so many traps and tricks inside there, they say it will never fall without the help of treachery.\n"
msgstr "你们在哈蒙代尔到斯坦德威克路上看见那座吊桥了吗？这就是利文斯德要塞，是为了防御精灵族发动突袭而建的。要塞中到处是机关陷阱，简直是一座永不陷落的堡垒。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1589
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:685
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There's an artifact that Avlee and Erathia have been fighting over for decades.\nBoth claim it was made by their people, and have lost the thing to raids against one another many times.\nIt isn't even magical--just a trophy.\nFifteen years ago, the trophy was lost during a raid, and no one knows where it went.\nRecently, rumors have been flying, and the hunt's been on to figure out where it went.\nIf they find it--watch out!\nBlood will be spilt. "
msgstr "埃里和埃拉西亚为了争夺一件神器而打了几十年的仗。其实这也不是什么稀奇的东西，又没有什么魔力，就是件战利品而已。十五年前，这件战利品在一次战斗中失踪了，最近又有人发现了这件东西的下落，双方正在分头寻找，看来一场战争又迫在眉睫了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1590
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:686
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Because of all the tension in the air, Erathia and Avlee hired an arbiter to help them work out their differences.\nHe's staying in the \"House of Stars\" on the eastern edge of Harmondale territory.\nMaybe he has some advice for you."
msgstr "据说埃拉西亚和埃里已经找了个调解人来解决双方的分歧。这个人就住在哈蒙代尔东面的群星之屋，也许他能给你们些忠告。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1591
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:687
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you ever feel like you need advice on what next to do, or you've lost something important, go visit the Arbiter in the House of Stars near the Eastern edge of Harmondale territory.\nHe often knows where lost items went, or has advice on what you need to do.\nI'm sure you'll find him helpful."
msgstr "你们要是毫无头绪，不知下一步该怎么办，可以上群星之屋找调解人帮忙。他就住在哈蒙代尔东面。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1592
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:688
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The death of Judge Grey, Arbiter of Harmondale, has put the War on hold.\nIt's like the whole world is holding its breath, waiting for you to make a choice.\nBetter be careful who you choose--this sounds like a big one, my Lords."
msgstr "住在哈蒙代尔的战争调解人格瑞突然死于非命，看来战争已经迫在眉睫了。到底是帮助埃拉西亚还是埃里，这可是关系到哈蒙代尔安危的大事，你们可要权衡利弊，仔细考虑啊！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1593
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:689
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The proving grounds, called the Walls of Mist,\nis the place where all the wizards in Celeste have to go before they learn the High Art.\nI hear it is much more of a moral test than a physical one.\nYou aren't allowed to kill any of the monsters in the maze."
msgstr "所有住在塞莱斯特的法师要升职为光明法师，必须去被称为迷雾之墙的净心堂接受考验。这种考验与其说是考察武功魔法，不如说是考察道德品质。你们不能在那个迷宫里伤害任何人。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1594
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:690
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The city of Celeste has been home to the Light for centuries.\nIt was established by King Magnus II\nin 499 as the centerpiece to the Kingdom of Bracada, and as a beacon of hope to the rest of the world.\n"
msgstr "塞莱斯特城堡千百年来就是光明教派的根据地。它是由马格努斯二世国王在499年建造的，现在已经成为布拉卡达的中心了。长久以来这座城市一直是人民心目中正义和希望的象征。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1595
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:691
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What you see on the surface in Deyja is only a small part of the true Kingdom of Death.\nThere is an underground city they call the Pit.\nIt can be reached from the surface only by way of the Hall of the Pit in Northern Deyja.\n"
msgstr "其实地面上的建筑只是迪雅城的很小一部分，大部分建筑在一个叫做地狱城的地下城里。迪雅北面有个叫地狱之厅的地方，从那里可以进入地狱城。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1596
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:692
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Celeste is the magical city built by the Wizards of Bracada centuries ago, and anchored half in the mountains, and half in mist high above Bracada.\nYou must use one of their teleporters to get there--you can find it near the center of Bracada."
msgstr "千百年前布拉卡达的法师们建造了塞莱斯特这个城市。它一半建在山里，一半被布拉卡达的迷雾笼罩。要到那里去，你们只有依靠布拉卡达中心的那个远距离传送装置。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1597
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:693
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There was another murder, recently, that's been all the talk around town.\nAnother body--young woman, so I hear--was found near the sewers.\nDrained of blood, for the love of Light!\nIt's those thieves living' in the sewers I tell you!\nRats, they are.\nSomeone should go down there and put them out of business!"
msgstr "最近有发生一起杀人案。我们在下水道附近发现了一个姑娘的尸体，肯定是下水道里的那帮窃贼干的好事，该是收拾那帮家伙的时候了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1598
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:694
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "During the War, the Warlocks had dealings with some strange creatures called the \"Kreegan\" in the mountains south of Avlee.\nIt's impossible to get there from the mainland, but the Warlocks dug a tunnel under the sea from their island that leads to the Kreegan's home."
msgstr "战争期间，邪术师和埃里南部山区的克里根魔族曾经打过交道。这个地方一般是没有办法上去的。不过邪术师在海底修建了一条地道，从他们住的岛屿一直通往克里根人的老巢，这可是一条捷径啊！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1599
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:695
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We…overplayed our hand during the War, and failed to win any territory on the mainland.\nOur \"allies\", the Kreegan, turned out to be very untrustworthy.\nPeople from Enroth call them devils--now we know why.\nAt just the moment when we needed them most, they turned and ran, leaving us to face the wrath of the armies of Erathia and Avlee.\nNext time, we won't be so trusting."
msgstr "我们在这场战争中费尽心机，如今竟然在大陆上毫无立足之地。这全是我们的“盟军”克里根人干的好事。他们背信弃义，在我们最需要他们的时候竟不发援兵帮助，我们面对埃拉西亚和埃里联手进攻，寡不敌众，最终功败垂成。唉，下次我们该吸取教训了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1600
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:696
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There's been quite a bit of activity in Deyja, people are saying.\nIt seems that Archibald Ironfist, the leader of Deyja (and former King of Enroth) has left the Pit for an island off the Eastern shore of Avlee.\nA lot of Necromancers followed him there--seems there's some sort of split going on."
msgstr "据说迪雅发生了大变故，有人看见迪雅的领袖、恩洛斯的前任国王阿基巴德·艾恩法斯特率领大批死灵法师离开了地狱城。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1601
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:697
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Rumors have been trickling out of Nighon that King Roland of Enroth may still be alive.\nSome Warlocks have said that they personally saw him when they met with the foul Kreegan.\nThe rumors also say that the Kreegan are keeping him in a cage and mistreating him horribly."
msgstr "在尼根有人传说恩洛斯的国王罗兰德还活着。有些邪术师说他们在与克里根人见面的时候曾经看到过他，他被克里根人关在一个笼子里，受着非人的虐待。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1602
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:698
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A Soul Jar is what a Necromancer needs to complete the Ritual and become a Lich--an immortal undead monster that retains its mind and memories from life.\nIt's pretty obvious that this is not a desirable condition for most people, which is why the market for these artifacts isn't very good.\nNonetheless, Necromancers will do almost anything to get more--their profession's very existence depends on them."
msgstr "死灵法师要升职为巫妖必须得到一个灵魂之坛，以进行永生仪式。灵魂之坛对他们来说可谓生死攸关。为了得到更多的灵魂之坛，他们会不择一切手段，甚至付出生命的代价。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1603
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:699
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "People have been disappearing recently.\nNot just one or two, but several every day!\nThey go to bed at night, and the next day they aren't seen and their houses are empty!\nI certainly wish someone would find out what it happening!"
msgstr "这两天不断有人莫名其妙地失踪，真不知道发生了什么事？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1604
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:700
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So much for the mighty defenses.\nWord is the Necromancers, led by Archibald Ironfist, teleported straight into Clanker's Laboratory and took over.\nI'm told that treachery from within had something to do with it, though."
msgstr "虽然科兰克的实验室警卫森严，但阿基巴德·艾恩法斯特率领死灵法师通过远距离传送装置，一举攻占了那个地方。看来肯定有内应，不然实验室不会这么轻易地被占领。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1605
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:701
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Although the Warlocks are technically servants of the Dark, they usually aren't violent.\nThey will defend themselves if attacked, of course, but they won't start a fight unless you start it first.\nThey're quite reasonable, as a matter of fact, and they take their business seriously.\nI've found dealing with them to be quite pleasant."
msgstr "邪术师由于信奉暗黑教派，一直被人看作无恶不作的杀人魔王。其实他们遵守人不犯我，我不犯人的信条，从不骚扰百姓。而且他们待人彬彬有礼，做事认真负责。我和他们打过交道，觉得他们并不象传说中那么可怕。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1606
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:702
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The underground complex Clanker has created is surprisingly well defended.\nThe front door will keep out all magical attacks, and the island makes it difficult for any sort of large force to land on the island.\nSo far, Clanker has kept to himself, and no one has seriously tried his defenses, but his best protection comes from a series of teleport blockers inside the complex.\nNo magical invasion force can teleport past the front door until those blockers are brought down first."
msgstr "科兰克的实验室地形复杂，守卫森严。实验室的大门是用特殊材料制成，任何魔法都打不开它，而且实验室所处的岛屿地势狭小，大批部队无法登陆。实验室最著名的防御设施是反远距离传送防护盾，有了它任何魔法师都无法施展时空之门魔法攻占实验室。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1607
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:703
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We made landfall on the western shore of Northern Avlee.\nWalk into the sea from the farthest point west on the beach, and look around underwater.\nThe ship is unmistakable."
msgstr "我们在降落在埃里西面的大海里，然后从水里走上岸。看来我们降落的位置准确无误。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1608
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:704
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Lords of Harmondale!\nHeroes, I say!\nMy cousin was one of the ones you rescued!\nWe are in your debt!"
msgstr "啊，你们真是埃拉西亚的大英雄。谢谢你们救了我的表弟，人民会记住你们的功绩的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1609
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:705
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for delivering our people from the medusas!\nThe Dwarves of Stone City will not forget you!"
msgstr "感谢你们把我们的人从美杜莎女妖魔爪中解救出来，石头城的矮人族将永远为你们效劳。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1610
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:706
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "We owe you much for your daring rescue of our people.\nRebuilding your castle was the least we could do for you."
msgstr "你们拯救了我们的人民，我们对你们感激不尽，重建哈蒙代尔城堡这件事就包在我们身上。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1611
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:707
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good day, my lords.\nI must say the people are changing their minds about your chances of survival.\nEveryone is saying how wonderful it is to have stable rulers in the Castle!"
msgstr "嗨，你们好，我的主人。哈蒙代尔的百姓现在都对你们刮目相看，每个人都相信城堡在你们的治理下将永远繁荣昌盛。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1612
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:708
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's good to see the Castle rebuilt and those loathsome goblin bandits evicted.\nThings are looking better around here since you took over!"
msgstr "大耳怪被打跑了，城堡也得到重建，恢复了以前雄伟壮观的样子。自从你们来了后好事就一件接着一件，这下百姓该放心了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1613
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:709
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard Fort Riverstride was taken with the aid of treachery!\nWhat a shame that those wretches were able to wring concessions from the Queen in exchange for the return of what was already ours!"
msgstr "我听说由于叛徒的出卖，利文斯德要塞终于陷落了。这下凯瑟琳王后只能割地以换取和平了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1614
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:710
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Looks like the trophy fell into the hands of Erathia.\nI hear there was quite a fight over it! "
msgstr "看来战利品落入埃拉西亚手中，听说为了争夺这个东西打了很多年的仗。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1615
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:711
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Looks like the trophy fell into the hands of Avlee.\nI hear there was quite a fight over it! "
msgstr "看来战利品落入埃里手中，听说为了争夺这个东西打了很多年的仗。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1616
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:712
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Looks like the trophy fell into the hands of the Arbiter.\nI hear there was quite a fight over it! "
msgstr "看来战利品落入阿基巴德手中，听说为了争夺这个东西打了很多年的仗。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1617
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:713
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The death of Judge Grey was a blow to all of us.\nI hope his replacement does his legacy justice."
msgstr "调解人格瑞意外死亡对我们是个沉重的打击。希望他的继任者能象他一样主持公正，维护正义。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1618
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:714
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It looks like the consequences of your choice are just beginning, my lords.\nI hope you chose wisely."
msgstr "看来你们已经作出了自己的选择，希望你们是对的，这样对大家都有好处。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1619
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:715
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So it was a vampire that was killing all those people!\nI hear you're the ones to get rid of it, too!\nThanks!\nEveryone feels much safer now."
msgstr "啊，原来是吸血鬼作怪，残害了这里不少百姓。感谢你们能够除掉这一祸害，现在这里该平安无事了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1620
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:716
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "They say you are being credited with rescuing King Roland!\nThat's quite a feather in your cap, my lords!\nQUITE a feather!"
msgstr "听说是你们拯救了罗兰德国王，你们真是太了不起了，简直是埃拉西亚最伟大的人物。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1621
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:717
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Looking for Expert instruction in one of your Skills?\nExpert teachers for most Skills can be found in Harmondale, Erathia and the Tularean Forest. "
msgstr "想要使自己的技术达到专家级水准。告诉你们吧，大多数技术的专家住在哈蒙代尔，埃拉西亚和图拉利昂森林。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1628
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:724
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The signal rocket on the west side of the island should be set of to warn ships off from approaching to close to that side of the island.\nThe reefs off the west coast have proven deadly in the past."
msgstr "应该在海岛西面发生信号弹，警告过往船只不要靠近那里。那个地方旋涡密布，暗礁林立，船只到了那儿肯定有去无回。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1629
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:725
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Beware the marshes of the southern tip of the island.\nThe dragon flies that pester our town spawn there!\n"
msgstr "小心海岛南部的沼泽地，那里可是龙蝇的安乐窝。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1630
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:726
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fallen or dead trees can sometimes be the hiding place of some treasure or trinket.\nHowever, it can also be home to insects or worse!"
msgstr "一片枯树林可能是埋藏财宝的好地方，但有些讨厌的怪兽也会把它当作安家的好地方。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1631
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:727
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The teleporters of central Bracada can get you to numerous locations in the desert.\nJust check the pillar in front of the teleporter for the location it will take you to.\nBe careful however, some of the teleporters haven't been working correctly and will not show the destination!"
msgstr "通过布拉卡达中央的远距离传送器，你们可以到达沙漠中的很多地方。你们可以仔细查看一下传送器旁边的柱子，上面写明了所要到的地方。不过你们得小心，有时候这个传送器会出点小问题，不知会把你们送到哪里。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1632
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:728
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My Lords!\nLord Archibald sent engineers and artisans to upgrade Castle Harmondale!\nNow we have an upstairs and downstairs!\nLord Archibald also left gifts in chests in these new areas.\nThe artisans are setting up shop in the entry hall and will have many wonderful items for sale!\nOh, yes, the workers discovered an older area to the castle--a torture chamber and dungeon!\nWe are very lucky!\nI never thought Harmondale could afford such luxuries, my lords!"
msgstr "我的主人，阿基巴德派来了大批工匠把城堡翻修一新，还留下了很多金银财宝。哦，他们还在城堡中发现了一个地下宝库，想不到哈蒙代尔竟有这么多的宝藏，我在这里居住了这么多年也不知道这个秘密，这真象做梦一样。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1633
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:729
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My Lords!\nGavin Magnus sent engineers and artisans to upgrade Castle Harmondale!\nNow we have an upstairs and downstairs!\nGavin Magnus also left gifts in chests in these new areas.\nThe artisans are setting up shop in the entry hall and will have many wonderful items for sale!\nThe workers, however, discovered an older area to the castle--a torture chamber and dungeon.\nIt isn't a pretty sight, I'm afraid."
msgstr "我的主人，盖文·马格努斯派来了大批工匠把城堡翻修一新，还留下了很多金银财宝。哦，他们还在城堡中发现了一个地下宝库，想不到哈蒙代尔竟有这么多的宝藏，我在这里居住了这么多年也不知道这个秘密，这真象做梦一样。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1634
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:730
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My Lords ::bows:: Now that you have cleared Castle Harmondale of the goblins and vermin, you should concentrate on removing the goblins from the area surrounding Harmondale.\nTo the east of here is the center of the disputed region.\nMany great battles have been waged there between the forces of King Eldrich of the Elves and Queen Catherine of Erathia.\nThe goblins have taken the ruined fort in this area an use it to attack any travelers attempting to reach Harmondale!"
msgstr "我的主人，你们虽然把把哈蒙代尔城堡里的大耳怪消灭干净了，可城堡附近仍然有大耳怪在作恶。城堡的东面是有名的争议之地，埃里的精灵国王和埃拉西亚的凯瑟琳王后常率兵在那里交战，而大耳怪趁火打劫，占领了那里废弃的堡垒，不断骚扰过往哈蒙代尔的行人。你们好人做到底，应该去把它们也收拾干净。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1635
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:731
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My Lords, remember Castle Harmondale is YOURS.\nFeel free to relax while you're here.\nYour sleep will never be disturbed by attacking monsters, nor will anything you decide to store in the castle's chests ever be stolen or removed.\nYou are home."
msgstr "我的主人，既然哈蒙代尔城堡归你们统治，你们就应该把这里当作家一样。这里的一切都属于你们，一切人都听你们的派遣。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1636
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:732
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you seek aid from Erathia, light the beacon fires near the roads to the Barrow Downs, Erathia, and the Tularean Forest.\nThe Erathian forces near here will see the fires and rush to your aid!"
msgstr "如果你们要向埃拉西亚求援，可以在通往拜尔德斯、埃拉西亚和图拉利昂树林三地的大路附近点燃烽火。附近的埃拉西亚军队看到烽火会立即赶来的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1639
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "::You receive a telepathic message:: My…Lords.\nMy name is Archibald Ironfist.\nYou've probably heard of me--it is I who, up until recently, was the ruler of the Pit.\nWith my retirement, I find myself no longer concerned with the affairs of state.\nI know that we were adversaries, but I am forced to ask for your help.\nIn return, I think I can help you.With the aid of equipment I have found in my new laboratory, I have discovered that my brother Roland, husband to Queen Catherine of Erathia, remains imprisoned by the devils in their foul, ah, dwelling.\nI overheard that you're on your way to do battle with them (this equipment really is wonderful), and I want to make sure it goes well.\nMy brother has stolen the key to their leader's chambers, and has hidden it in the beastly cage they're keeping him in.\nPlease rescue him!\nNot even I can bear to think of my brother in those conditions!\nTo help you along, I offer this weapon.\nIt was...found by my loyal servant sergeant Piridak, amongst my advisor's personal belongings.\nI hope it helps."
msgstr "你们收到一份心灵感应信息，全文如下：                                                               我的主人。我叫阿基巴德·艾恩法斯特。你们大概听说过我，我以前是地狱城的统治者。现在我已经退位了，决心不再关心什么国家大事了。虽然我们以前是对手，但现在我有件事想求你们帮忙，作为回报，我以后将尽力为你们效劳。\n我最近有了一个新的实验室，通过里面的设备，我发现我的兄弟罗兰德，也就是埃拉西亚的凯瑟琳王后的丈夫竟然还活着，被关在克里根人的巢穴里。我听说你们正要收拾这帮恶魔，我希望你们能顺便把他救出来，他已经偷到了克里根首领住的房间的钥匙，或许这会对你们有用。\n看到我兄弟现在的处境我很难受，请你们无论如何要把他营救出来。这件武器你们也许用得着，这是我的一个部下珍藏多年的物品，希望它能助你们一臂之力。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1641
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:737
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Our friend Tolberti has a job for you now.\nGo to him, and he will instruct you."
msgstr "我的朋友托尔伯蒂有件事要你们去办，快上他那儿去吧，他会详详细细告诉你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1642
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:738
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Our friend Robert the Wise has a job for you now.\nGo to him, and he will instruct you."
msgstr "我的朋友智者罗伯托有件事要你们去办，快上他那儿去吧，他会详详细细告诉你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1643
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:739
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This 1000 gold will go a long way to keeping zombies off the roads.\nThank you for your contribution."
msgstr "这1000个金币对我们的帮助真是太大了，谢谢你们的慷慨捐赠。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1644
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:740
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "That's a shame.\nWhat a coincidence, I think I see some zombies on the roads.\nPerhaps next time you'll be more inclined to contribute."
msgstr "哈，你们这个小气鬼，连一分钱都不给，将来没有好下场的，等着瞧吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1645
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:741
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent!\nHere is a crate of Arrowheads.\nPip Hillier in Erathia pays the best prices for these. Be sure to see him!"
msgstr "这里是一箱箭头，你们拿去吧。埃拉西亚的海利尔会好好酬谢你们的，快上他那儿去吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1646
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:742
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ahh, a shipment of Tularean Wood from my friend Robert Belknap.\nI hope everything is well with him. Here's your payment."
msgstr "啊，这船图拉利昂木料是罗伯特·贝尔克耐普托你们送给我的，他一切都好吧。这是你们的酬金，请收下吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1647
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:743
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Here's your crate of Griffin Feathers.\nRobert Belknap in the Tularean Forest pays the best prices for these feathers.\nBe sure to give him my regards when you see him."
msgstr "这是一箱狮鹫羽毛，你们拿去吧。住在图拉利昂森林的罗伯特·贝尔克耐普会好好酬谢你们的。你们见到他别忘了把我的报酬给他。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1648
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:744
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Rydric has sent me another shipment of Arrowheads.\nWonderful!\nHere's your payment."
msgstr "瑞德里克又给我送箭头来了，好吧，谢谢你们，这是你们的酬金，请收下吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1649
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:745
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Here's your crate of Tularean Wood.\nBe sure to take it to Rydric in Harmondale.\nHe will pay you well for them."
msgstr "这箱图拉利昂木料你们拿去吧。只要把它交给哈蒙代尔的瑞德里克，他会好好酬谢你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1650
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:746
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Pip Hillier sends another shipment of Griffin Feathers.\nHere's your payment.\nEnjoy the day!"
msgstr "海利尔又给我送狮鹫羽毛来了，好吧，谢谢你们，这是你们的酬金，请收下吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1651
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:747
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks!\nHere's your crate of Sand. Arvin Beneclowd in the forsaken Barrow Downs pays well for this Sand, from it he creates fine bottles!"
msgstr "这箱矿砂你们拿去吧。只要把它交给拜尔德斯的阿尔文·伯纳克劳德，他会好好酬谢你们的，他制造玻璃瓶必须得用这个东西。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1652
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:748
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ahh, a shipment of Enrothian Wine from Infernon.\nThis will warm the hearts of many! Here's your payment."
msgstr "啊，伊弗农又给我送恩洛斯好酒来了，亏他还能想到我。这是你们的报酬，请收下吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1653
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:749
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Be sure to take this crate of Glass Bottles to Infernon in Avlee.\nHe bottles the finest Enrothian Wine."
msgstr "请把这箱玻璃瓶交给住在埃里的伊弗农。他可以用它们来盛恩洛斯的美酒了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1654
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:750
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ahh, a shipment of Sand from Calindra Goldensight.\nHere's your payment."
msgstr "卡林德拉·高登塞特给我送矿砂来了，谢谢你们，这是你们的报酬，请收下吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1655
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:751
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Here's your crate of Enrothian Wine.\nTake this to Calindra Goldensight in Tatalia and she will pay you well! "
msgstr "这箱恩洛斯美酒你们拿去吧，去把它交给泰塔利亚的卡林德拉·高登塞特，他会好好酬谢你们的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1656
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:752
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Arvin Beneclowd sends me another shipment of Glass Bottles.\nTime to bottle some more Enrothian Wine.\nHere's your payment."
msgstr "阿尔文·伯纳克劳德有给我送玻璃瓶来了。现在可以用它们来装恩洛斯的美酒了。谢谢你们，这是你们的报酬，请收下吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1658
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:754
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you are looking to make it quickly to Nighon through the tunnels below, you should take the left fork of the Nighon Tunnel.\nMany have taken the right fork and have never been heard from again.\nThen again they may have made it to Nighon only to be taken by the Warlocks!"
msgstr "你们要通过地道到尼根去，就得走左边的岔道。很多人喜欢走右边的岔道，结果进去后再也没出来。当然，他们可能确实到了尼根，不过是被邪术师押送过去的！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1659
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:755
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Many traders all over Erathia hire out to travelers to deliver their goods!\nIf you are ever in need of some extra coin, try finding one of these merchants and make a delivery for them!"
msgstr "埃拉西亚有许多商人常雇人帮他们搬运物品。如果你们缺钱花，可以去那些商人那里干这种活。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1660
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:756
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can see your heart is in the right place, but your purse obviously isn't.\nIf you don't have the money, just say so.\nIn any event, good luck dealing with the zombies.\nTa-ta!"
msgstr "看来你们这人还不错，但却是一个穷光蛋。你们要是没钱的话尽管开口好了，老天可不会亏待好人的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1670
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:766
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What!\nYou wouldn't believe this fabrication would you?\nI would never dream of sabotaging your rule here!\nGaahh!\nPrepare to die!"
msgstr "什么！你们该不会相信这种胡编的谣言吧？我从未想过破坏你们对本地区的领导！唉！算了，受死吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1671
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:767
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have heard rumors that the shrine to the southeast of here can send you to the Land of the Giants.\nI have been to the shrine many times and it has never done anything special for me.\nOr is that you can get here, FROM the Land of the Giants? I wonder..."
msgstr "听说哈蒙代尔东南面的祭坛可以把人传送到巨人领地，可是我试了几次，一点反应都没有。你们不妨去碰碰运气，说不定能成功。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1672
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/NPCTEXT.TXT.py:768
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Scattered around the land are the Challenges.\nIf your ability is great enough, and you best the challenge, you will be award skill points to do with as you wish!"
msgstr "这里到处都有技能挑战。如果你们能力足够高，挑战获胜的话，就可以得到技能点数作为奖励。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1694
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:3
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh!\nThe Seal.\nHere, I'm supposed to give you this money.\nNow, go away before we're seen together!\nSomeone will get suspicious."
msgstr "哦，是蜡封的信。这些钱是给你的。快走吧，免得被人看见我们俩在一起，会被人怀疑的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1695
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:4
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't try to say I didn't pay you!\nYou got your gold!\n"
msgstr "别说我没付你报酬，你得到的金币是我的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1696
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My instructions are quite clear.\nI am to pay the person carrying the letter that bears the Seal.\nSince you don't have a letter with a Seal, you get no money!"
msgstr "我曾受人重托，付钱给拿着蜡封信件的人，你没有蜡封的信件，我不能给你钱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1697
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Just south of town is an old keep called Goblinwatch.\nIt was originally built to help keep the town safe from goblin raids, but times have been so peaceful recently that we haven't been taking care of it.\nYou can imagine our embarrassment when we realized that the very monsters we were guarding against have moved into the keep!\nThey also changed the lock on a very important door leading to the caves below the dungeon level.\nWe have a standing reward of 2000 gold pieces to the ones who can figure out the combination and tell us what it is."
msgstr "镇南有座堡垒名叫大耳怪前哨。当初是为了抵御大耳怪侵袭而造。因为近来平安无事，就逐渐被遗忘了。谁知大耳怪却趁虚而入，占据了这个堡垒，真令我们羞愧万分。更糟的是，他们把通往地下洞穴的大门的锁也换了。如果有人能解开密码，打开这扇大门，我们会奖励他2000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1698
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "How can you find the combination to that lock by standing around here?\nGet going!"
msgstr "难道你站在这里就能解开密码吗？加油干吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1699
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, thank you for taking care of that little detail for us.\nHere's your gold!\nFeel free to return to Goblinwatch any time to finish clearing out the rest of the monsters.\nWe can't pay you, but you can have anything you find there.\n"
msgstr "啊，感谢你为我们解决了这个麻烦。这是你该拿的金币。你尽可放心回大耳怪前哨去解决残留的怪兽，我们不会付钱了，但堡垒里的东西你尽管拿吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1700
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You did such a fine job with the Goblinwatch assignment that we would like to employ you again.\nA cult has moved into an old abandoned temple a few day's journey west of here.\nTo pay for their blasphemous activities, they've been robbing travelers using the road that leads to Castle Ironfist.\nWe've appealed to the regent to do something about these horrible cultists, but he says all his forces are occupied in the west, or some such nonsense.\nWe want it gone now, so we're willing to pay you 5000 gold pieces to get rid of them and bring us back the Chime of Harmony as proof you've done the deed."
msgstr "你在大耳怪前哨干得不错。我们想再次和你合作。一个教派前些天占据了西面的一个废庙。为了筹集他们宗教洗礼仪式的费用，他们在通往铁拳城堡的路上打劫过路客商。我们向摄政王上告，可他说他的军队全在西方，然后又王顾左右而言它。我们实在无法忍受，如果你能除掉他们，并把美妙钟琴带回来作证，我们就奖励你5000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1701
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Without the Chime of Harmony, I'm not authorized to pay the reward money.\n"
msgstr "你没带来美妙钟琴，我无法给你报酬。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1702
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good work!\nHere's your gold!\nI can't thank you enough for ruining that temple.\nNow the road to Ironfist will be safe for travel again."
msgstr "干得好！这些金币是你的。对你的行侠仗义之举我不胜感激。现在通往铁拳城堡的大路一定安全多了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1703
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The road to Ironfist is much safer thanks to you.\nYou have our gratitude."
msgstr "通往铁拳城堡之路现在畅通无阻了，我们对你表示感谢。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1704
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The proprietor of the Howling Moon is George Caniss.\nIt's a wonderful place.\nTell him I said hi!"
msgstr "鸣月的主人名叫乔治·坎尼斯，那可是个好地方，代我向他问好。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1705
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you so much for bringing me these letters! <Wilbur begins reading the letters> I’ve been so worried…I see… This is not good news…Oh, no.\nTraitors!\nTraitors and conspirators everywhere!\nI must organize an expedition at once! <Wilbur lowers his voice> I trust you will not speak to the prince about these letters– he is already too depressed and unhappy to hear more bad news.\nAnd now I must see to the organization of the expedition.\nHere is a bag of gold as a reward– you’ve earned it and my gratitude.\nNow, if only I could find someone to finish looking for Lord Kilburn…"
msgstr "感谢你给我梢来这些信。<威尔伯开始读信>。我的担心由来已久。真是不幸。哦，不，叛徒，到处是叛徒和阴谋家。我必须立刻组织远征军。<威尔伯降低嗓音>我想你不会把这些信告诉王子的。他一直给郁郁寡欢，情绪低沉，不能再受这些消息打击了。现在我必须召集远征军将领。这袋金币是给你的报酬。我对你很满意。现在我要物色个人去寻找科尔本爵士。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1706
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<Wilbur snaps his fingers> Say, you wouldn’t happen to be interested in taking care of a little detail for me, would you?\nLord Kilburn disappeared near Blackshire.\nFind out what you can and return to me with the information.\nIf it is true that he has been slain by devils, return his shield to me if at all possible.\nI will grant you my favor with the High Council, should you require it, and you can rest assured your compensation will be generous."
msgstr "<威尔伯打了个响指>你不会介意帮我个小忙吧。科尔本爵士在布莱克郡地区失踪了。去打探他的下落，并回来告诉我。如果他真的被恶魔所杀，请尽可能把他的盾牌带回来。我会为你在高级议会多说好话的。你得到的回报将会非常丰厚。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1707
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmm.\nNo luck finding the shield yet, eh?\nWell, do keep looking, will you?\nIt really is important that someone accounts for his whereabouts."
msgstr "嗯，还没找到盾牌？再努力一把吧，知道他的下落是非常重要的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1708
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If his shield was in my Castle, I think I’d be aware of it.\nPerhaps if you were to leave, you may have better luck finding it…"
msgstr "如果他的盾牌在我的城堡里，我会知道的。如果你在城堡之外搜索，也许找到盾牌的可能性更大。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1709
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah.\n‘Tis a sad day when so noble a Knight should fall to such foul monsters!\nYou have done a good thing, bringing his shield to me.\nI shall ensure that he and his men receive all the honors due them.\nI am in your debt, and you have my favor with the council.\nHere is your reward."
msgstr "啊，一个高贵的骑士竟被如此肮脏的怪物所杀，真是不幸。你做了件好事，把他的盾牌带回来了。我保证他和他的部下会得到应有的荣誉。我欠你一个人情，所以在高级议会上我会全力帮助你。这是你的酬劳。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1710
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, you have my vote on the High Council.\nI trust you implicitly.\nI've sent a messenger instructing Slicker Silvertongue to vote for you on my behalf.\nNow I'm quite busy, and must attend to other duties.\nI'm sure you can take care of any problems and miscommunications that may arise in this matter.\nYes.\nQuite right."
msgstr "我已经绝对信任你了，我会在高级议会里投你的赞成票。我已派人叫斯里克·席尔瓦托恩代我投票。我这两天公务繁忙，实在抽不出空，但我想以你的能力，会把事情安排得井井有条，不会有什么差错。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1711
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I cannot thank you enough for uncovering that horrible traitor and his crimes against the throne.\nI understand you are on a mission of some importance, so for Services Rendered to the Crown, it behooves me to offer you free use of the royal yacht for your travels.\nIt will take you as far as Hermit's Isle, if you need it to.\nOnce again, thank you!"
msgstr "我对你揭发叛徒和其篡位企图的行为不胜感激。我知道你还有重要任务去完成，特赐予你皇家游艇以加快行程，它会把你尽快带到隐士岛的。再次万分感谢。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1712
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the Foremost Paladin, and as such, I am the one charged with the promotion and keeping of the titles and responsibilities of paladinhood.\nThose paladins who wish to perform a quest for the official promotion to crusader must rescue a damsel in distress.\nThose of you who are not paladins will be awarded the title of honorary crusader, and all will be given a sizeable gold reward.\nReturn to me with said damsel and I will promote any paladins aiding in her rescue to the status of crusader."
msgstr "我是首席圣武士，负责圣武士的升职。凡是欲升级为十字军的圣武士必须营救一名处于危难之中的少女。如果你不属圣武士职业，将被授予荣耀十字军职位，并获得丰厚的奖金。和被救的少女一起回来，我将把所有参与营救的圣武士升级为十字军。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1713
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know there is a shortage of damsels in distress, but this quest is the traditional test.\nI really can’t bend the rules here.\nKeep looking– I’m sure you’ll find someone.\nIf it helps, I hear Melody Silver, daughter of the noble John Silver, is being held captive by ruffians on the Island of Mist."
msgstr "我知道这里很少有少女处于危难之中。但这规矩是自古以来延续下来的，我不能坏了规距。再努力一把吧，我相信你会成功的。我曾听说贵族约翰·席尔瓦的女儿米拉达·席尔瓦被浓雾岛上的一伙强盗绑架了，你不妨去试一试。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1714
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have heard stories of the daring rescue, and I am delighted that you have returned with Miss Silver.\nI shall arrange to have her returned to her family at once.\nExemplary work!\nI hereby officially promote all paladins to the status of crusader, and all non-paladins to honorary crusaders!"
msgstr "我已听说了你们勇敢救人的事迹。很高兴你和席尔瓦小姐一起平安归来。我会妥善安置她回到她的亲属那里的。干得真棒。我正式提拔你们为十字军，非圣武士职业者授予荣誉十字军职位。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1715
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, then!\nIt is a fine thing to be promoted to crusader, but even finer a thing to be promoted to hero.\nAs you may have guessed by now, the condition for hero status is to slay a dragon.\nI know this seems difficult, but tradition has its demands.\nWhat’s worse, you can’t slay just any dragon, but must slay a named dragon.\nYour task is to slay Longfang Witherhide and return with a claw or tooth as proof.\nFortunately, we know that Longfang lives in a cave in the mountains behind Castle Darkmoor.\nHe has slain at least twelve would-be heroes, so be careful!"
msgstr "好吧，能成为十字军是件好事。但如能成为英雄就更好了。你也许已经猜到了将去执行什么任务——屠龙。这是难了点，可这是规矩。更难的是你们不能胡乱杀条龙来交差，你们必须杀掉长牙巨龙威瑟海德。它就住在黑摩尔城堡后面山区的山洞里，你必须把它的爪子或是牙齿带回来作为凭证。注意，它已经杀了至少12个想成为英雄的圣武士，你可得小心点。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1716
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There is no use returning to me to talk about your quest.\nI cannot change the rules or your quest.\nLongfang awaits your avenging sword.\nNow get to it!"
msgstr "你回来向我诉苦没有用。我不能坏了规矩。长牙巨龙威瑟海德就藏在那些岩洞里等待你的复仇之剑。快去吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1717
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well done!\nOne less horrible monster in the world is a good thing.\nI hereby officially promote all crusaders to heroes, and all honorary crusaders to the status of honorary hero! May you long continue to live up to the title!"
msgstr "干得好！世上又少了一头可怕的怪兽。我正式提拔你们为英雄。荣誉十字军将获得荣誉英雄的职位。希望你们永不辜负这个称号！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1718
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is always good to speak with heroes of the realm!\nCome back in some less troubled time and we'll swap tales of honor and courage by the fire!"
msgstr "和王国的英雄们说话总是令人愉快。等麻烦过去再来吧，到那时候再让我们靠着炉火讲述各自光荣而又英勇的故事！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1719
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The palace is deadly dull, and everyone tells me what to do.\nBeing royalty isn’t really worth much and no one will let me go outside the walls while my father is gone.\nI haven’t left the castle for months!\nAnyway, you people look pretty important.\nWhat if you helped me sneak out and stay with you for a couple of days?\nI can’t give you much in return yet, but I’ll owe you a favor.\nSomeday I’ll be able to repay you.\nI am the prince, after all!\nI’ll go out the secret door and meet you outside."
msgstr "皇宫里一点意思也没有，每个人都在教育我该怎么做。做王室成员根本不像想象的那么美好，自从父亲离开后，他们就没让我走出城墙。我呆在城堡里都好几个月了。你们似乎不是等闲之辈，带我溜出去和你们一起闯荡几天怎样？我没有多少报酬给你们，但我欠你们一个人情，有朝一日我会报答你们的。我毕竟还是个王子。我从密门溜出去和你们会合。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1722
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:31
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Um.\nHi. <smiling weakly> Would you believe I got lost and these nice people were taking me home?\nNo?\nI guess I wouldn’t either.\nI suppose it’s time we got back to the castle, then."
msgstr "嗨！<无力地笑了笑>你相不相信，我迷了路，这些可爱的好人正准备带我回家？不相信吗？我也不大相信。好吧，我想我们该回铁拳城堡了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1724
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:33
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<Nicolai speaks to you> Well, thanks for sneaking me out of the castle.\nSorry about the circus thing– I hope I wasn’t too much trouble to find.\nI’ll go in myself so no one will see that it was you who kidnapped me.\nThanks again, and goodbye.\nI’ll remember this, and I owe you a favor! "
msgstr "<尼古拉对你说话>谢谢你帮我溜出城堡。对马戏团那件事我很抱歉，还麻烦你辛苦地来找我。我自己一个人回皇宫，以免人家误会成是你绑架我的。再次万分感谢，我会记住你的，我欠你一个人情，后会有期。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1725
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:34
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks for bringing me home.\nI owe you a favor!"
msgstr "感谢你带我回家，我欠你一个人情。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1726
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:35
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Everyone says that my Uncle Archibald wasn’t a very nice person, and that he almost usurped the throne from my father, but we defeated him.\nFather had Tanir turn him to stone and then locked him in the library.\nNobody’s been in there for years. "
msgstr "大家都说我的叔叔不是个好人，几乎从我父亲那篡位成功，但我们打败了他。父亲命坦耐尔把叔叔变成石头，关在图书馆里。那里好久没人去了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1727
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:36
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You want to free Archibald?!\nIf the Oracle told you to do it, I guess we should, but he’ll be trouble once he’s loose, that’s for sure.\nI know where the bell is that turned him to stone, but I can’t open the family vault that it’s in without the Third Eye.\nIt’s one of three gems you need to put into the door of the vault in order to open it.\nI’ve got two of them– one in my father’s crown and one in his scepter, but my father hid the third one, and he didn’t tell me where it is.\nIf you could find it, I could open the vault and get the bell."
msgstr "你要搭救阿基巴德？如果是神使指示我们这样做，我们就照办吧。但他一旦自由了，一定会成为我们的麻烦的。我知道把他变成石头的那个神铃藏在哪里。但没有第三只眼我没法打开家里地下室的门。打开门需要三颗宝石，我已经得到了两颗，一颗在我父亲的皇冠上，一颗在他的权杖里。但他没告诉我第三颗，也就是“第三只眼”在哪里。如果你能找到，我就能打开地下室，取出神铃。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1728
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:37
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Without the Third Eye, I can’t get into the vault to get you the bell that will release Archibald.\nHe must have hidden it near the castle, because he used to just go right outside and fetch it whenever he needed to open the vault."
msgstr "没有第三只眼，我无法进入地下室，得到释放阿基巴德的神铃。但我想父亲一定是把它藏在这周围，这样一旦需要，他就可以随时拿出来打开地下室的门。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1729
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:38
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You found the Third Eye!\nAll right, wait here– the bell should be in the vault.\n<Nicolai runs out of the throne room, returning a short while later> Ok, here it is! "
msgstr "你找到第三只眼了，你真行。你等着，神铃就在地下室。<尼古拉跑出加冕殿，不一会儿就回来了>我找到它了，给你！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1730
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:39
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I hope you know what you're doing.\nEveryone says my uncle is quite treacherous."
msgstr "我希望你明白自己在干什么，所有人都说我叔叔是个叛徒。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1731
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "missing text 38"
msgstr "失落的正文38"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1732
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:41
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now wait just a minute Tanir, and I’ll make it worth your while to let me…Oh. <Archibald is silent for a long while> I guess I have you people to thank for releasing me from my prison of stone.\nThank you!\nYou say you need a spell that I've created?\n<reaching to the shelves and removing a library scroll> Well, as a reward, I’ll give you the Ritual of the Void.\nUse it in good health.\nNow, I’m sure you’re very busy, as am I…<Archibald waves his arms and fades away>"
msgstr "等一下，坦耐尔，只要你让我……哦，<阿基巴德沉默了好一阵子>很感谢你把我从石头的禁锢中释放出来。你说你需要一个我发明的咒语？<阿基巴德从书柜中抽出一个卷轴>好，我把虚空仪式书送给你，做为回报。好好用它吧。所以现在，你肯定很忙，我也是…<阿基巴德挥了挥手就无影无踪了>"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1733
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:42
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for rescuing me from the clutches of those ruffians!\nOh, I wish there was some way for me to reward you!"
msgstr "感谢你把我从这群坏蛋手里解救出来。我该怎样来报答你呢？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1734
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:43
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Mine is the traditional duty to oversee the, um, less than upright business in the Kingdom.\nMy House has done this for centuries under the philosophy that such business will always exist and is better watched and regulated than not.\nRecently, a man styling himself the 'Prince of Thieves' has begun to usurp my authority in Free Haven.\nNot only does he challenge my authority, he cooperates with that loathsome new cult that’s sprung up recently…what’s it called?\nMoo, or Yak, or Bark…no…whatever.\nSome sort of animal sound.\nAnyway, my sources tell me that this cult plots to overthrow the King and assume power in Enroth.\nThis is a bad business, and needs to be stopped.\nYou can start by arresting the Prince of Thieves and returning him to me in chains.\nI will, of course, reward you richly.\n"
msgstr "我的传统职责是监督王国中那些，嗯，不那么正规的商务活动。这样的活动会永远存在，存在即合理，只需适当的监督和管理。我的家族就在这种理念下做了几百年。但近来，有个自诩为“盗贼王子”的人开始破坏我在自由天堂的权威，还和一个新近崛起的邪恶教派狼狈为奸，那个教派好像叫做什么牛鸣教，或是猫喵教，也许是狗吠教，反正就是动物的叫声。有消息说该教派企图阴谋推翻国王，统治整个恩洛斯。总之是个恶劣的教派，必须要阻止他们。如果你能抓到盗贼王子并把他活捉回来，我会重重奖励你一番。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1735
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "missing text 42"
msgstr "失落的正文42"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1736
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:45
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have no information on his whereabouts, so it will do you no good to talk to me about it.\nTry going to Free Haven and asking around.\nHe must have a hideout somewhere in or near that town.\n<Smiling> if you find where he’s living, be sure to check under the bed and in the closet– you’ll probably find him hiding under a pile of clothes."
msgstr "我对他的行踪一无所知，你问我也是白问。去自由天堂问问吧，他在城市附近肯定有个据点。<微笑>如果你找到他的住处，千万别忘了检查床底下和衣柜里，他说不定就藏在衣服堆里。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1737
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:46
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah!\nMy friends, you have returned with the package!\nWell done!\nHere is your reward money.\nYou have my full support at the council. <looking at the Prince> Welcome to my humble home, mighty Prince.\nI have a room prepared just for you.\nGuards!\nTake him away."
msgstr "啊，我的朋友，你把俘虏带回来了，干得真不错！这是给你的报酬。你将得到我在议会的全力支持。<看着盗贼王子>欢迎光临我的寒舍，全能的王子。我为你准备了一个小房间。卫兵，把他带走。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1738
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:47
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your work in capturing the Prince of Thieves has been quite beneficial to me.\nYou have my full support on the High Council."
msgstr "你一举擒获盗贼王子，真是了不起。你帮了我的大忙，我会在高级议会里全力支持你的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1739
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "In addition to my duties as overseer of unlicensed business, I am the High Priest of Enroth.\nIt is my job to promote clerics to priests, and if warranted, priests to priests of light.\nRight now, the rolls are full of priests, and I am unable to promote new ones without creating new positions.\nTo do so would be highly irregular, but if someone were to perform an extraordinary service for the kingdom, the promotion would be acceptable.\n<Rubbing his temples> Come to think of it, there is a service I need.\nA temple in Free Haven was destroyed by fire a few months ago.\nIf you could get it rebuilt, I would have a reason to promote any clerics among you to priest status.\nSince I really want this job done, I am even willing to promote non-priests to an honorary priest status, and I will pay you well for your service.\nYou’ll need to hire a stonecutter and a carpenter and show them the temple you want them to work on."
msgstr "我是非正规商业的监管人兼恩洛斯的大主教。负责牧师至神甫和神甫至光明主教的升职。现在神甫的名额满了，没有空缺，我无法补充新人。但如果有人为王国立下奇功，可以得到破格升职。<揉了揉太阳穴>现在就有一个机会。几个月前，自由天堂的一处神庙被烈火所毁。如果你们能重建神庙，我就可以把你们之中的牧师升级为神甫，其他人授于荣誉神甫职位，并付给你们一大笔酬金。你需要雇一个石匠和一个木匠，并告诉他们如何重建神庙。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1740
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:49
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The temple I asked you to rebuild still stands in ruins.\nThe people are deprived of their rightful religious solace, and you return to me empty-handed.\nLeave here and complete your mission!\n"
msgstr "我要你修建的神庙仍是一片废墟。那里的人们失去了他们灵魂的安慰所，而你却空手而归。做事必须有始有终，快去做吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1741
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:50
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent work!\nThe temple has been rebuilt and the affront to the gods eased.\nFor this service, I am happy to promote all clerics to priests, and I grant honorary priest status to all non-clerics.\nCongratulations! "
msgstr "干得好极了！神庙修好了，神的愤怒也平息了。我将把你们中的牧师升职为神甫，其他人授予荣誉神甫职位。祝贺你们！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1742
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It seems a bit quick to promote anyone to high priests, given that the promotion to priest has been so recent.\nWhy, many wait their entire lives to receive such a promotion, only to be granted it posthumously.\nHowever, an extraordinary service could possibly accelerate that promotion to, well, right now for instance… and I do have such a service in mind.\nThe heretical monks that live on the islands east of Free Haven have stolen our sacred chalice.\nRetrieve it from the monks and put it in the temple you rebuilt.\nThen return to me."
msgstr "刚升职为神甫，就想再升为大主教，这未免太仓促了些。毕竟许多人终其一生谋求这一职位，甚至死后方才如愿以偿。除非你立下惊天动地的大功劳。现在倒有件可以做的。住在自由天堂东面岛屿上的异端僧侣们偷走了我们的圣杯。如果你能把圣杯夺回来，放入你修好的神庙内，就能被提拔为大主教。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1743
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:52
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The monks still have the chalice, and our temple is still without it.\nWhy do you delay?"
msgstr "邪教僧侣仍霸占着圣杯，我们的神庙没有这样一件圣物可不行。你还等什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1744
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:53
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I see that you have recovered the chalice!\nGood work, but you still need to ensconce it in the temple.\nTake it there at once and return to me for your promotion!"
msgstr "你终于找到圣杯了。干得好！但还要把它安置在神庙里。快去吧，干完后你就可获得升职。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1745
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You are successful!\nIt looks like I will have to keep my promise and make more irregular, early promotions.\nI do so with pleasure.\nI hereby promote all priests to high priests, and all honorary priests to honorary high priests."
msgstr "干得好极了！我将履行我的诺言，将你们破格提拔。你们中的神甫将被提拔为大主教，荣誉神甫提拔为荣誉大主教。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1746
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though your rise to priest of light status was almost unseemly quick, I have never seen finer priests of light in all my years.\nI am grateful for all you've done for myself and for Enroth."
msgstr "你升职为光明主教的速度令我惊讶，你是我一生中见过的最出色的光明主教。我代表整个恩洛斯王国为你所作的一切表示衷心感谢。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1747
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:56
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This is %s, the month of %s.\nJourney to the Shrine of %s and pray there to be rewarded."
msgstr "这是%s，%s的月份。去%s的神坛并在那里祈祷吧，你会得到奖赏的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1754
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:63
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I sometimes have the worst trouble trying to remember things I’ve learned.\nI’m not sure why this is, but I’ve discovered a way around the problem.\nI am going to create a mirror that will allow me to look back in time, so that I can remember what it is I’ve forgotten.\nTo do this, I need the Hourglass of Time, but my duties and research prevent me from searching for the hourglass on my own.\nThe hourglass is said to be in a dark cavern up near area… <pauses a moment>\nNo, that was the Spear of Darkness…\nwhere is the hourglass?\n<pauses again>\nI should be able to remember this.\n<snaps his fingers>\nOf course!\nIt’s buried in an old fort to the south of here.\nI can offer you my support in the council if you will help me in creating my mirror."
msgstr "我老是健忘，有时连自己所学的东西都记不起来。真不知道为什么。后来我发现了解决这个毛病的方法。我要发明一面镜子，通过它能回到过去，找到我遗忘的东西。镜子必须由时间沙漏磨成，但我的研究工作太忙了，抽不出空去找这东西。时间沙漏据说是在某个地方附近的黑暗洞穴里。<沉默片刻>不对，那是黑暗之矛藏的地方。<沉默片刻>我应该记得它在哪里的。<打个响指>对了，它埋在这儿南面的古堡里。如果你帮助我制造魔镜，我就在议会里支持你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1755
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:64
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Did you forget where the way out is?\nI sometimes do.\nI think it’s the large doors behind you.\nOr is that the kitchen?\nIn any case, I’m sure the hourglass isn’t here, I would have found it by now if it was."
msgstr "你忘了出去的路？我有时也这样。你身后有扇大门，大概是个厨房吧。反正我觉得时间沙漏不在这儿。否则我早就找到它了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1756
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:65
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I’m still looking for the mirror. <pauses> I mean Hourglass… I keep getting those mixed up.\nDid you try the dark cavern– no wait, it was the old fort south of here.\nI always seem to mix those up."
msgstr "我仍在找魔镜，<沉默>我的意思是指找时间沙漏。我把它们混一块了。你黑暗洞穴去过没有，不，你南面的古堡去过没有，我老是把东西混在一起。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1757
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:66
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now all I have to do is remember how to create the mirror.\nI wrote down all the important parts so I wouldn’t forget how to do it.\n<stops> Where did I put those notes?\n<ponders for a minute> I must have left them somewhere obvious, maybe in the laboratory.\nAnyway, your part in this is done, and again I thank you.\nYou will have my complete support in the council for this.\nWhat were your names again? "
msgstr "现在我得回忆怎么制造魔镜。我已经把重要细节记在纸上以免遗忘。<停顿>我把纸条放哪儿了？<沉思片刻>我肯定放在什么显眼地方了。也许在实验室里。你已经完成了任务，真是万分感谢。我将在议会里全力支持你，再问一遍，你叫什么名字？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1758
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:67
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The hourglass wasn’t there?\nOh, that’s right!\nI knew I forgot something!\nThe key is in there!\nYou use the key to open the Forge of… <pauses>\nWell, I can’t remember whose forge it is, but that is the resting place of the Hourglass of Time...I think.\nIt can’t hurt to look there, especially now that you’ve found the key.\n<pauses>\nAt least I THINK that’s what the key opens.\nAnyway, that forge or laboratory or whatever it is can be found on the islands north of New Sorpigal.\nGood Luck!"
msgstr "什么，时间沙漏不在那儿。哦，对了。我忘了件事。我忘把钥匙给你了。你用钥匙打开古堡<停顿>我记不清那是谁的古堡了，但我想那是时间沙漏的唯一藏身地。千万别硬闯，特别是你现在有了钥匙。<停顿>至少我想这把钥匙能打开古堡大门。你去新索匹格北面岛上的古堡，实验室，或是其它什么地方找找看。祝你好运！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1759
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:68
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks again for getting the hourglass for me!\nIf only I could remember where I put it.\n<sighs>\nYou have my support in the council for as long as you need it."
msgstr "再次感谢你为我拿到了时间沙漏。可我把它放在哪儿去了？<叹气>我会永远在议会中支持你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1760
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:69
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the magus in charge of training and promoting sorcerers.\nThough powerful, sorcerer is not the pinnacle of the elemental magician.\nWizards take the knowledge and ability of a sorcerer, and hone those abilities to a sharper level.\nThey have greater magical potential than the sorcerer, and demand greater respect.\nThe way to earn this training, however, is not easy.\nFind the Fountain of Magic, drink from its waters, and return here.\nIf you are able to do this, I will train you in the ways of the wizard."
msgstr "我是首席法师，专门负责巫师的升职。巫师虽然有一定法术，但在元素派法师中却算不了什么。法师会巫师的全部魔法，而且其境界更高。他们拥有比巫师更大的魔法潜力，并赢得更多的尊敬。但修炼之路并不平坦。必须找到魔法喷泉，饮其泉水，然后回来。如果你能做到这些，我就会训练你成为法师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1761
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:70
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the magus responsible for\nthe promotion of sorcerers.\nThough none of you are sorcerers, I’m a fair man.\nIf you are able to locate the Fountain of Magic, I’ll grant you honorary wizard status.\nYou won’t receive any benefits of the wizards’ training, but you will gain more respect in the eyes of sorcerers and wizards.\n"
msgstr "我是首席法师，负责巫师的升职。你们没有一个人是巫师。但我做人很公正，如果你们能找到魔法喷泉，我赐予你们荣誉法师头衔。你们没有法师的法术，但会获得巫师和法师的尊敬。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1762
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:71
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don’t ask me for hints, I’ve already forgotten where the Fountain is.\nI know this isn’t an easy task, but if it were not difficult, every sorcerer would already BE a wizard."
msgstr "别希望从我这里得到什么暗示。我早忘了喷泉在哪儿？我知道此任务并非轻而易举。如果简单，岂不每位巫师都成为法师了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1763
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:72
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You have done well in finding the Fountain.\nIt’s location and powers are a secret, do not spread its location around.\nNow, let me show you the secrets of the wizard."
msgstr "你终于找到了喷泉，干得不错。它的地点和用处还是个秘密，千万别透露出去。现在我告诉成为法师的秘密。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1764
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your training does not end with what you have learned as a wizard, one final step remains.\nMaster wizard status completes your mastery of elemental magic.\nBuilding on your wizard training, master wizards have vast magical ability– the most efficient and skilled use of magic anywhere.\nEarning this training requires a powerful artifact, owned by the powerful Arch Mage Drael-.. no, it was Frundir-… no, that’s not right either.\nActually, I can’t seem to remember what the artifact was or who owned it.\nI'd remember it if I saw it, though.\nI know it can be found in Corlagon’s Estate near the Mire of the Damned.\nSearch for it there and return it; I must have it to train you to become a master wizard."
msgstr "你的法术修炼并非到此为止。还有最后一项。只有修炼到大魔法师才能把元素魔法融会贯通。根据你法师修炼的基础，大魔法师将拥有超人一等的法力。他能随时随地纯熟运用各项魔法有效攻击对手。要修炼为大魔法师必须有一个威力强大的宝物。它在法力无边的大法师德里尔那里。不对，不对。在弗伦德尔那里，不对，也不对。我实在记不起宝物什么样，属于谁了。但我记得我见过它。它在幽灵沼泽附近的考勒根的豪宅里。到那儿看看，把它带回来。有了它，我才能把你训练成大魔法师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1765
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:74
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I’m sorry, but I still haven’t remembered exactly what it is you need.\nI know you need to search Corlagon’s Estate.\n "
msgstr "很抱歉，我真忘了你需要什么了。我只知道你要搜查考勒根的豪宅。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1766
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Great news!\nI remember what you need to find!\nThe Crystal of Terrax!\nOh, you seem to have found it already.\nWell, perfect!\nI can train you to master wizards, then.\nThe first arch mage, Terrax, used this Crystal to master the elements.\nFire, earth, water, and air all formed together to make it, and from analyzing it he learned a great deal about elemental magic.\nIn addition, its effect on light led him to his discoveries of light and dark magic.\nSince that time, the study of this crystal has guided every new master wizard.\nLet me show you the secrets of the crystal. "
msgstr "好消息，我想起你该找什么了。是德里克斯水晶。哦，你已经找到了。好极了。我可以训练你成为大魔法师了。首位大法师德里克斯就是用这块水晶来钻研元素魔法的。火，土，水，空气是元素魔法的四个要素，通过分析它们的构成就可练成此魔法。而且，德里克斯通过该魔法对光的作用而发现了光明魔法和暗黑魔法。自从那时起，每个新的大魔法师在水晶的指引下不断钻研。让我向你展示水晶的秘密吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1767
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:76
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I don’t have much time to talk right now– I have a lot to do.\nI’m in the process of organizing a few campaigns to attack the devils along the western coast.\nYou must realize, as I do, that nothing in all of Enroth poses as much of a threat to our safety as they do.\nI only wish the other Lords would assist me by contributing supplies and troops, or just helping in the planning of these attacks.\nThey spend more time bickering amongst themselves over borders and laws and trade than in helping me deal with the REAL threat.\nThe devils have an advance post in Kriegspire near the Sentinels.\nFrom here, they are able to base small raids and gather intelligence on our forces.\nI need you to sneak in and attack it, find what information you can on the location of any devil strongholds and patrol patterns, and destroy the place.\nDo not let any of the devils escape!\nSurprise and secrecy are our greatest weapons."
msgstr "我现在没时间多说了，我有许多事要做。我正在组建部队，攻击在西海岸的邪恶势力。你必须和我一样明白，他们才是恩洛斯安全真正的威胁。我希望其他贵族能在部队和供给方面助我一臂之力。或是帮我出谋划策。但他们总把时间花在领地，法律和贸易的争吵上，而对真正的威胁却无动于衷。恶魔们在圣蒂尼斯附近的克里格斯城堡建有前哨基地。从那儿派出小股部队，进行骚扰并窃取我军情报。我想派你潜入敌人基地，取得必要得情报并摧毁该基地。不要放走一个恶魔。记住，出其不意，攻其不备是我们的制胜法宝。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1768
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:77
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Still here?\nThe demons are to the west, near the coast, not in my throne room!\nOr are you THAT lost?\nYou have the information you need to complete this mission, all you need now is to go out and do it."
msgstr "你怎么还在这儿？恶魔在西面，在海岸附近，不在我的加冕殿里。你还不明白吗？我已经把任务都交代清楚了，你要做的就是执行任务，快去吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1769
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:78
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Did you fail in your mission?\nYou didn’t allow the demons to escape, did you?\nThat post MUST be destroyed for any large attack against them to be successful.\nAs long as that post exists, your mission still stands. "
msgstr "你行动失败了吗？你没让一个恶魔逃脱吧？为了整个战役的成功，一定要毁掉这个据点。它存在一天，你就得努力一天。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1770
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:79
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good job!\nWith the information you’ve brought back, we now have the intelligence we need to stage an attack on the devils, and with that post out of the way, we can hit them when they won’t expect it. I give you my full support in the council– hopefully the council will actually DO something for once."
msgstr "干得好。根据你带回来的情报，我们掌握了敌人的战略部署。既然这个前哨已被清除，我们就能攻它个出其不意。我会在议会里全力支持你的，希望议会还能干点正事。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1771
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:80
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent work in dispatching those devils!\nAgain, you have my thanks.\nMy support in the council is yours, at least until the threat of the devils is past.\nHopefully you can spur the council into action.\nBy the way, the information that you brought back has confirmed our suspicion about the enemy base.\nIt is definitely near the town of Sweet Water in Paradise Valley."
msgstr "你成功除掉了这些恶魔，干得真棒。我得再次感谢你。恶魔的威胁存在一天，我在议会里就会对你支持一天。希望你能督促议会早日采取行动。还有，你带回来的消息证实了我们对敌人老巢的推测。它就在甜水镇附近的天堂谷中。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1772
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:81
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the Armsmaster in charge of the promotion of all knights in Enroth.\nWorthy knights can be promoted to cavaliers.\nCavaliers embody the spirit of action and the power of purpose.\nBehind their courageous example, armies charge into battle and enemies flee in terror. However, to become a cavalier, you need to be nominated by a person of authority.\nIf you could get the nomination of a cavalier, that would be good enough for me.\n "
msgstr "我是军事专家，专职负责恩洛斯所有骑士的升职。磨炼到一定级别的骑士可以升级为豪侠。豪侠拥有钢铁般坚强的意志和超人的武功。他们作战英勇无畏，往往战无不胜，令敌人闻风丧胆。但要成为一名豪侠，你最好能得到另一位豪侠的推荐。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1773
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:82
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the Armsmaster in charge of the promotion of knights.\nUnfortunately, none of you are knights, and therefore the skills I would teach you would be worthless.\nHowever, if you so desire, you can attempt the task of a would-be cavalier.\nSeek the nomination of a person of authority, a cavalier, for example, and return to me."
msgstr "我是军事专家，专职负责所有骑士的升职。可惜诸位并不是骑士，因此我的技能对诸位毫无用处。但是如果诸位渴望学习的话，也可以参加升级豪侠的考验。同时寻找一位尊者的举荐，比如是一位豪侠，然后回来，我就会为你们升级。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1774
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:83
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well there, you’re looking for a nomination to become cavaliers?\nI was once a valiant knight in my day.\nI fought with Roland in the Succession wars, though now I’m too old to do much good on the battlefield.\nIt’s good to see Osric keeping the traditions of the knights alive.\nTell him that I proudly nominate you to become cavaliers, and if he gives you any trouble tell him to come see me himself."
msgstr "你好，听说你在寻找一位举荐人推举你为豪侠？想当年我也曾是一位英勇善战的骑士。尽管现在我已年迈，再也不能冲锋陷阵，驰骋沙场，当年我曾与罗兰德一起参与了继承王位的战争。很高兴看到奥斯利克依然保持着良好的骑士传统。告诉他我很荣幸成为你的举荐。如果他给你什么麻烦的话，让他亲自来见我。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1775
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:84
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Congratulations!\nI know you’ll make fine cavaliers.\nI only wish I had my youth again to serve with Osric in a campaign against the devils."
msgstr "祝贺你！我知道你能成为一名优秀的豪侠。我真希望自己能回到当年，与奥斯利克一齐屠杀恶魔。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1776
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:85
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Come now!\nA person of your fame and stature should have no problem being nominated.\nDon’t tell me your fame is contrived– are you sure you deserve to be as famous as you are?\n<laughs>\nI’m jesting, calm down.\nSeriously, I'd suggest looking in Free Haven or the village of Rockham.\nI've heard a few cavaliers frequent the taverns there."
msgstr "快来吧！像你这样有如此好的知名度和才干的人获得举荐应该毫无问题。别告诉我你只是徒有虚名，我想你一定人如其名吧？<大笑>别紧张，我只是开个玩笑。说真的，你不妨到自由天堂或洛克汉姆村去转悠一下，听说那里的旅店经常有豪侠光顾。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1777
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:86
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Congratulations!\nThe nomination may not seem important, but we have a tradition that must be followed for this promotion.\nAs a cavalier, you need to understand that the traditions and values of the people need to be defended.\nI gladly promote you to the rank of cavalier!"
msgstr "祝贺你！举荐看起来并不太重要，但根据传统要获得升级必须经过这一环节。作为豪侠，你需要懂得捍卫民众的传统和价值。我很高兴你能加入豪侠行列。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1778
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:87
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, worthy cavaliers, the final step in your training is to become a champion.\nA cavalier is a brave and noble warrior, but a champion is a power to behold.\nNo force can stand between the champion and victory.\nEntire campaigns are decided on the bravery, decisiveness, and powerful example of the champion.\nThe task to complete this promotion, however, is difficult.\nYou must defeat a powerful enemy to prove your ability and determination.\nThe only enemy worthy of this task is a man known only as the Warlord, a dangerous and powerful warrior.\nHe commands a legion of evil knights, normally based to the northeast of\nIcewind Pass.\nDefeat him, bring back proof of your victory, and your promotion to champion is assured."
msgstr "一名好豪侠最终的目的是成长为勇士。豪侠是一名勇敢高贵的斗士，而勇士还要拥有强悍的力量。没有什么力量能阻挠勇士获得胜利。整个战争胜负与否取决于那些勇敢无畏，行动敏捷，武艺惊人的勇士们。然而，升级为勇士是非常困难的。你必须打败凶恶残暴的敌人来证明你所具有的杀敌能力和坚强毅力。而称得上敌人的只有一种人，那就是军阀。他异常危险，极度残暴。他控制着恶魔骑士军团，盘据在冰风关隘的东北部。如果能打败他并取回胜利的证据，你就一定能升级为勇士。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1779
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:88
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You’re not scared of the Warlord, are you?\nHis terror needs to be put to an end.\nYou can’t become champion hiding underneath your bed or standing around looking at the walls– you need to go out and DO it!"
msgstr "你并不害怕军阀，是吗？他的恐怖统治已经到头了。如果你害怕得躲在床底下或只敢在大墙外观望，那你永远不可能成为勇士。你必须勇敢无畏的面对他并与他战斗，快去干吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1780
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:89
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good job!\nExcellent!\nI wasn’t sure you’d make it back alive.\nKergmond had more potential than I realized, but you’re certainly more than a match for an army of Kergmonds.\nYou’ve proven yourselves worthy of the rank of champion. You must not be afraid to take up arms to defend what is right.\nMay your enemies fear your approach and your allies rally behind your courage. And now, I promote you to the rank of champion! "
msgstr "干得好，实在好极了！我原以为你不能活着出来。科格蒙德比我想象的还利害，然而你比他更出色。你已经证明了你具有勇士的能力。你会毫无惧色的挺身捍卫正义。现在你的敌人害怕与你交战，而你的盟友将在你的勇气鼓舞之下恢复力量和信心。现在我把你升级为勇士。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1781
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Memory Crystal Alpha – Hermit’s Isle.Memory Crystal Beta – Alamos.Memory Crystal Delta – Darkmoor.Memory Crystal Epsilon – Kriegspire."
msgstr "阿尔法记忆水晶，目前在隐士岛。\n贝塔记忆水晶，目前在阿拉莫斯城堡。\n达尔塔记忆水晶，目前在黑摩尔城堡。\n艾普斯隆记忆水晶，目前在克里格斯城堡。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1782
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:91
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Place the memory Crystals into the modules above.\nAll four Crystals are necessary to activate the Oracle."
msgstr "把记忆水晶放在记忆模板上可唤醒神使，但这需要四块水晶同时起作用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1783
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am Melian, Guardian of Enroth.\nThank you for replacing my memory modules.\nArchibald took them from here when I refused to give him any help in his battle for succession.\nYour timing is impeccable.\nThe Kreegan have invaded our world, and you must try and stop them.\nUnfortunately, Archibald’s attempts at extracting information from me have damaged me enough that I cannot help you directly now.\nInstead, I can only give you advice.While most of the Kreegan can be slain with ordinary weapons and spells, the elite guards and upper echelon breeders have tougher skin and natural defenses that protect them from anything but very powerful weapons.\nIn the planetary control center beneath me are the weapons and armor you will need to survive battle with the enemy.\nMy orders, however, will only permit passage to someone with a Control Cube.\nMy instruments tell me that the only Control Cube left in Enroth can be found somewhere underground in Dragonsand.\n"
msgstr "我是梅里安，恩洛斯的守护神。谢谢你将我的记忆模板放回原处。因为我拒绝在继承王位战争中帮助阿基巴德，他就从我这里取走了记忆模板。你的到来真是好极了。现在克里根人正在入侵我们的世界，你必须尽力去阻止他们。不幸的是，我不能直接帮助你了。阿基巴德从我这里榨取信息，使我元气大伤。我唯一能帮你就是给你一条建议。\n\n尽管普通的武器和魔法可以杀死大多数克里根人，但他们的精锐卫兵和高等部队皮肤坚硬，有着过人的自然防御力，只有非常锋利的武器才能杀伤他们。在我下面的行星控制中心里有你战斗需要的盔甲和武器。然而只有拥有控制块的人才可以进入。我的仪器告诉我恩洛斯唯一的控制块就在飞龙沙漠的地下。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1784
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:93
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You now have access to the Control Center.\nSimply ask to be transported and I will oblige.\nOne warning however– the guardians of the Control Center are no longer under my control, so please exercise caution while visiting the Center."
msgstr "现在你可以进入控制中心。我会将你送入中心。但是要注意；控制中心的卫兵已不再受我的指挥，所以进入中心时务必要小心谨慎。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1785
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:94
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As I said, the Kreegan are resistant to most of the weapons available in Enroth, but not all.\nTo rid the world of them, you will need to find where their vessel crashed and destroy the main reactor.\nThe only problem is that the resulting explosions from the reactor will destroy this planet.\nYou will need a powerful spell to prevent the explosion from damaging the planet, but no spell like that exists in the world today.\nThe only person I can think of that would know of such a spell is Archibald, but he is in no condition to teach you.\nTo make matters worse, the reactor cannot be harmed by normal weapons or spells– you will need the ancient weapons in the Control Center to destroy the reactor."
msgstr "正如我所说，普通兵器对克里根人无能为力。要除掉他们，必须找出它们降落的地点并摧毁主反应器。但主控制器一旦爆炸，会危及整个星球，因此你还得学会一种威力强大的魔法，阻止爆炸毁灭我们的星球。现在知道这种魔法的人都死光了。我只知道阿基巴德通晓这种魔法，但他现在变成了石头。更糟糕的是，普通兵器或魔法不能奈何这个反应器，你只有去拿在控制中心储存的上古兵器方能奏效。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1786
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:95
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though my memory has been damaged by Archibald, I can still remember the danger that our ancient enemy, the Kreegan, pose to our world.\nThe Kreegan first appeared roughly 1500 years ago, attacking outlying colonies and stealing their resources.\nIt was thought at the time they simply needed certain minerals, and could be reasoned with, but this was not the case.\nTheir life cycle forces them to breed until the world cannot support their numbers, then they send ships off to other worlds to renew the cycle.\nTheir attacks against the empire of the Ancients disrupted the network of shipping and communications that held us all together, causing the Silence that marks the first year of our modern calendar.\nWithout support from the homeworlds, our fledgling technology failed, bringing us to this sorry state.\nI would help rebuild our technology, but I seem to have become a religious figure in the minds of many people, and very few visit me or understand what I have to offer.\nPerhaps this Kreegan crisis we face will bring people to their senses--as long as we survive it."
msgstr "尽管我的记忆已毁于阿基巴德之手，但我还记得我们自古以来势不两立的死对头克里根人是多么可怕。他们出现在一千五百年以前，凶残好战，疯狂抢夺他人的国土，霸占资源。其实这样做并不仅为了争夺资源，他们就像无耻的蝗虫，在一个星球上无节制的生殖繁衍，一旦这个星球支持不住了，他们会去袭击另一个星球，重新开始他们可怕的生存周期。由于他们的攻击，我们的星球交通断绝，信息闭塞，造成了历史上的寂静时代，就是我们纪年的开始。因为缺乏祖国的支持，我们的科研技术完全失灵，使我们现在处境尴尬。我本想重整旗鼓，修复技能，但在许多人的心目中我只是个宗教偶像，没有人知道我会给这个王国带来什么。也许我们现在面临的克里根人的入侵危机正是个证明我的机会。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1787
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:96
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I happen to know that you are amongst a short list of adventurers looking to receive favor from the High Council.\nWhat you want it for I don’t know, nor do I care.\nI’ll be blunt:\nI love money, and I want more.\nMuch more.\nI have a plan to fix the price of shipping in my favor for a time and I need competent agents to carry it out.\nPerform this task well and I will give you my support, not to mention a lot of money.\nHere is the plan:\nEach of the nine shipping companies in the Kingdom must be convinced to charge at least 48 gold per pound per mile of material they transport.\nThey are all in competition and they know it, so none will want to make a move before the others.\nI don’t care how you convince them– just get the job done and report back to me."
msgstr "我知道你是冒险者清单上的一员，希望得到高级议会的垂青。我并不知道也不关心你到底需要什么。我是个直率的人，我喜欢钱，钱越多越好。我需要一个有能力的人帮我将船舶运费固定一段时间。如果你能完成这一任务，我会在议会给予你充分的支持，并给你丰厚的报酬。具体计划如下：使王国的九个船运公司中都同意每磅货物每英里的价格保持在至少48个金币。他们都知道竞争非常激烈，所以没人愿意首先修改价格。我不管你采取什么方法去说服他们，放手去完成任务，然后回来向我报告。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1788
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:97
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not all of the companies have agreed to raise their prices!\nWhy do you return only to report incompetence?\nThere are large profits I could be reaping if you had done your job and convinced these idiots to raise their prices!\nMUST I DO THIS MYSELF?\nShould I send someone else?\nWhy do I surround myself with MORONS?!\nSo far I have lost a lot of gold because you haven’t finished your job!\nI’ll deduct these losses from your final payment, you can be sure of that!"
msgstr "你还没说服所有的船运公司提高价格呢，怎么就回来报告了？你是在汇报你的无能吗？如果你完成了任务，使这些傻瓜都同意提高价格，我就可以获得暴利。难道我必须亲自出马吗？还是说我应该另派他人？为什么我的周围都是低能儿？你未能完成你的工作，使我已经损失了大量金币，我会从最终给你的报酬中扣除这些损失的，你等着瞧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1789
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:98
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "At last!\nThought you would never finish.\nMaybe you’re good for something after all.\nYou have won my support in the council, and of course, your payment. "
msgstr "总算办妥了，我还以为你永远完不成任务呢。看来你还是有点儿能力的。我会在议会支持你。还有，这是你的报酬。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1790
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:99
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you're concerned about the suffering of the peasants over my price increase, don't be.\nI did it all for a good cause.\nI needed to raise money for granaries to store the excess grain we are harvesting this year.\nThe shipping prices are back down, and the availability of cheap, high quality grain more than makes up for it.\nThere!\nI'm not so horrible, am I?"
msgstr "你不必担心我的提价会使农民遭殃。我的动机是好的。我需要更多的钱贮藏产粮区丰收后多余的粮食。这样，粮食的运费就减低，人们就能得到价廉物美的粮食。怎么样，我没你想象的那么坏吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1791
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:100
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Although it may be hard to believe, I happen to be one of the top druids in the land.\nAs such I am empowered to promote druids to great and arch druid status, provided they prove themselves worthy.\nTo be promoted to great druid status, you must perform the Ceremony of the Sun.\nPray at the center of the Circle of Stone during any equinox or solstice– March 20th, June 21st, September 23rd, or December 21st.\nIf you are there at that time, I will contact you magically and lead you through the Ceremony, thus promoting you to great druid.\nThose among you who are not druids will be granted honorary great druid status, and I am sure the experience will be worthwhile."
msgstr "也许很难相信，我是这世界上的顶尖德鲁伊之一。我负责众德鲁伊的升职。一旦他们修炼到一定级别，就可以升为高级德鲁伊和大德鲁伊。要升为高级德鲁伊，必须进行太阳仪式。你们必需在每年的春秋分或冬夏至，即3月20日，6月21日，9月23日或12月21日的正午站在石圈的中心，我会通过魔法与你联系，指导你进行整个仪式，并且将你们升级为高级德鲁伊，非德鲁伊者授予荣誉高级德鲁伊头衔。你们一定会觉得不虚此行的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1792
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:101
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must pray at the center of the Circle of Stone during an equinox or solstice to complete the Ceremony of the Sun and be promoted to great druid.\nThere is nothing I can do for you to be promoted until then."
msgstr "你只有在春秋分或冬夏至的正午站在石圈中央，完成整个太阳仪式，方能升级为高级德鲁伊。除此之外别无它法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1793
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:102
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<Loretta Fleise contacts you via a telepathy spell> Welcome to the Ceremony of the Sun.\nStand ye in the circle of life and face the north while no shadows stretch before thee.\nMeditate upon this truth:\n“Money is everything.\nI have no truer a friend than money…” <grinning> Just kidding.\nNow, close your eyes, and meditate as you stand at the center of the world and time for just this one, sublime moment… <long, silent pause>\nOpen your eyes.\nI hereby promote all druids to great druids and all non-druids to honorary druids. <Loretta fades away> "
msgstr "<劳里达·弗丽斯通过心灵感应咒语与你联系>欢迎光临太阳仪式，你站在生命圈的中央，面向北方，你的前方一片光明。想想那句名言吧，“有钱能使鬼推磨”，<咯咯地笑>开个玩笑，别当真。现在闭上眼睛，想象你站在世界和时间的中心，多么神圣的时刻啊。<沉默良久>睁开眼睛。我提拔你们中的德鲁伊为高级德鲁伊，非德鲁伊者为荣誉高级德鲁伊。<劳里达消失了>"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1794
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:103
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, you believe you are deserving of the title of arch druid.\nYou must complete the Ceremony of the Moon to achieve arch druid status.\nThis used to be rather easy before the factional split amongst the last generation of druids, but now you must fight your way to the sacred altar.\nIt is in the Temple of the Moon, currently controlled by the evil heretic Cedric Druthers.\nThere is no way they will just let you complete the ceremony peacefully, so you will probably have to fight your way in.\nLike the Ceremony of the Sun, the Ceremony of the Moon must be performed at a certain place and time.\nPray at the Altar of the Moon in the Temple of the Moon at midnight during any full moon.\nIf you are there at that time, I will contact you magically and lead you through the Ceremony."
msgstr "你想成为大德鲁伊，就必须完成月亮仪式。这在德鲁伊教派分裂前是件轻而易举的事，现在可就困难了。你必须杀出一条血路找到神坛。神坛在月亮神庙里，现在被邪恶的塞德里克·德鲁泽控制着。他们不会让你平安地进行仪式，你要随机应变，从容应对。像太阳仪式一样，月亮仪式同样必须定时定点进行。你要在满月的午夜时分站在月亮神庙的月亮神坛前，到时我会通过魔法与你联络，并指引你进行整个仪式。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1795
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:104
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<Loretta Fleise contacts you via a telepathy spell> Welcome to the Ceremony of the Moon.\nStand ye before the altar of the Moon facing south.\nClose your eyes and meditate upon the Circle of Seasons and the Wheel of Life.\n<long, silent pause>\nOpen your eyes, my friends.\nI hereby promote all great druids to arch druids, and all honorary great druids to honorary arch druids.\n<Loretta fades away> "
msgstr "<劳里达·弗丽丝通过心灵感应魔法与你联系>欢迎光临月亮仪式，请站在月亮坛前，面向北面，闭上眼睛想象你处于四季循环和生命轮回的中心<沉默良久>睁开眼睛吧，我的朋友，我把你们中的高级德鲁伊升级为大德鲁伊，所有荣誉高级德鲁伊赐予荣誉大德鲁伊头衔。<劳里达消失了>"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1796
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:105
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must be standing before the altar of the Moon at midnight on any full moon to complete the Ceremony of the Moon and be promoted to arch druid.\nThere is nothing I can do for you to be promoted until then."
msgstr "你必须在满月的午夜时分站在月亮神坛前并完成整个月亮仪式方能升级为大德鲁伊，除此别无它法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1797
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:106
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The earth is wounded in the west.\nI can feel it, my fellow druids, and if you put your hand to the ground and listen with your heart, you'll feel it, too.\nI am bound here with my responsibilities, but I urge you to investigate the source of this pain.\nI am sure the wound and the Night of Shooting Stars are related.\n"
msgstr "我能感觉到西方的国土正在遭受蹂躏践踏，我的德鲁伊兄弟。如果你把手放在地面用心倾听，你也会有同样的感觉。我出于责任心才到这儿来，但我希望你来调查这桩不幸的由来。我想它一定与流星雨之夜有关。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1798
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:107
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I grow tired of winter.\nIn my lands, winter seems to last year round.\nAs a matter of fact, for the last few years, summer didn’t arrive at all.\nI have come to believe that something is wrong with the weather, and I want something done about it.\nI know your reputation, and I hear you can do anything.\nI have a deal for you.\nEnd the winter in my land and I will give you my support in the High Council when it comes time for you to ask for it.\nIf it's any help at all, I hear there is hermit on a mountaintop somewhere west of here who has studied the weather in detail."
msgstr "我已经无法忍受严冬的折磨了，在我的国土上，冬天是最讨厌的季节。事实上这些年来夏日的阳光从未照耀这片国土。我想一定是季节变换出了什么毛病，我一定要找出原因。你的大名我已如雷贯耳，听说你无所不能，我想和你做笔交易。你把冬天赶走，我将在高级议会里全力支持你。我听说西北某处的山头上有位世外高人，对于节气变化有相当的研究。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1799
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:108
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do you think you could hurry this miracle thing along?\nThe snow on the ground is building up, and we are going to have to start putting buildings on stilts!"
msgstr "你能不能快点完成你的伟业。大雪已经高高堆集起来了，我们将不得不踩着高跷造房子了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1800
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:109
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I was looking out my window when the weather broke and the snow vanished!\nA miracle!\nA genuine miracle!\nYou have done my people and me a great service.\n<Slapping his chest> Count Erik Von Stromgard as your friend forever!\n"
msgstr "当冬天不再肆虐，白雪无影无踪的时候我正向窗外眺望。奇迹，多么伟大的奇迹啊。你为我和我的人民立下如此丰功伟绩<拍着胸脯>埃里克·冯·斯壮姆嘉德将是你永远的朋友。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1801
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:110
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "For your services, I grant you my favor in the High Council!\nLong may you live, O enemies of Winter!"
msgstr "因为你的功绩，我将在高级议会全力支持你。只要你在，冬天就不会再次肆虐。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1802
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "20 years ago, I won the annual archery competition held at Castle Ironfist, and I have held the championship ever since.\nThis gives me the right to promote archers to the title of warrior mage and master archer as I see fit.\nI’ll grant the title of warrior mage to all the archers amongst you if you do me a little favor. I need the key to the old Dragon Towers set up near every major settlement in Enroth to shoot down flying creatures.\nI think that they can be set to shoot down only monsters, instead of shooting anything flying through the air. Since this is something of a pet project, I will reward honorary warrior mage status to the rest of you.\nThe key is in my old keep near the southern entrance to my lands.\nI had to leave it there when the ogres and their companions took it from me a few years ago.\nReturn with that key and be rewarded.\nAnd I won’t be crying in my beer if you kill a lot of those monsters while you’re at it.\nThey took my keep!"
msgstr "20年前，我在铁拳城堡举行的一年一度的弓箭比试大会中赢得了冠军，因此我被授权负责弓箭手至高级射手，以及高级射手至神箭手的升职。如果你们能帮我个小忙，我将把你们中的弓箭手升级为高级射手。我需要一把旧龙塔的钥匙。龙塔建在恩洛斯每个主要定居点附近，用来击落飞行生物。我认为可以将龙塔设置为只射怪兽，而不射空中的其他飞行物。这个任务我很看重，所以连你们中非弓箭手者我也会授予荣誉高级射手头衔。钥匙就在我的领土南面入口附近的旧堡垒里，前些年食人妖和同伙从我这里把钥匙抢走了。你去把钥匙夺回来，我会奖励你的。你在那里对付这些怪兽不必心慈手软，他们抢走了我的哨所，罪有应得。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1803
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:112
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No key—No reward.\nOur deal is simple and straightforward.\nFetch the key from my old keep and return once you have it.\n"
msgstr "不夺回钥匙就没有报酬，我们的交易直截了当。快去把钥匙夺回来吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1804
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Very good!\nYou got the key, and hopefully slew a large number of those loathsome beasts.\nI hereby promote all archers to the status of warrior mage, and all non-archers to honorary warrior mage."
msgstr "很好，你拿到钥匙了，一定把那些讨厌的怪兽杀了个精光吧。我特此将你们所有弓箭手提拔为高级射手，非弓箭手者授予荣誉高级射手头衔。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1805
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The reason I wanted the key was to open the Dragon Towers and make the adjustments to prevent them from shooting flyers indiscriminately.\nThere is a way to adjust the towers to shoot at only large objects, and I want all of them adjusted for the good of the Kingdom.\nMagic is becoming more common, as are stories of young Sorcerers getting shot from the sky because they didn’t know the function of the towers.\nYou have the key.\nIf you adjust all of the towers to shoot at only large objects, I will promote all warrior mages amongst you to master archers and promote any honorary warrior mages to honorary master archers."
msgstr "我要钥匙来进入龙塔的目的是为了阻止他们不分青红皂白，滥杀飞行生物。我们可以调节塔楼，使其只攻击大型生物。为了王国的利益，我希望所有塔楼都做出调整。年轻巫师因为不知道塔楼的功能而被从天上射下来的故事也越来越普遍。现在你们有了钥匙。如果你们能使所有的塔楼都只攻击大型飞行生物，我将把你们中的高级射手升级为神箭手。你们中的荣誉高级射手升级为荣誉神箭手。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1806
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:115
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmm.\nNot all of the towers have been reset.\nThey are easy to find, if a bit long in getting to.\nThe easiest is in Whitecap to the west of us."
msgstr "嗯，塔楼还没有全被重新设置。如果你们耐心寻找的话，塔楼其实很容易被发现。最容易发现的塔楼位于我们西面的白帽镇。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1807
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:116
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You’ve had a measure of success in resetting the towers, I see, but the job isn’t done yet.\nThere are still towers unadjusted.\nFinish what you’ve started and return to me to receive your reward."
msgstr "你们已经成功地重新设置了部分塔楼，但是这工作还没完全完成。一些塔楼还不具备鉴别功能。完成任务后再来我这里接受奖赏吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1808
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I knew my faith in you was well placed!\nYou have fixed a major problem in our kingdom, not to mention doing yourself a favor—It’s now safe to fly above towns.\nIt is my pleasure to promote all warrior mages to master archers, and all honorary warrior mages to honorary master archers.\n"
msgstr "我已经完全信任你了。你解决了我们王国最关键的问题，同时其实也帮了你自己一个忙——现在可以在城镇上空自由飞行了。我很荣幸把你们中的高级射手升级为神箭手，荣誉高级射手升级为荣誉神箭手。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1809
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome, master archers!\nYou may warm yourself by my hearth any time!"
msgstr "欢迎你们，我的神箭手！我将始终和你们心心相印！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1810
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:119
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I like it up here.\nIt’s as though I can watch the world turn from up high and all alone.\nSerene.\nUntouchable.\nAlmost…Prophetic.\nI can see the clouds churn and travel, break apart and mix together.\nI can predict the weather almost perfectly.\n<Smiling> Right now, I predict more snow."
msgstr "我喜欢这个世界熙熙攘攘的热闹景象。在这里我目睹了喧闹的世界变成死寂一片的全过程。多么沉寂，冰冷得令人不敢靠近。这几乎是命中注定的。坐看着白云苍狗，起伏不定，风起云涌，变幻莫测。我对天气的预测几乎百发百中。<微笑>现在，我预感暴风雪将更加猖獗肆虐。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1811
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:120
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, Stromgard needs a miracle with the weather, eh?\nAll this time I thought he was the one responsible for making it snow continually.\nI can break the enchantment on the weather easily, and if you hurry back to him, I’m sure you can claim responsibility."
msgstr "斯壮姆嘉德希望看到奇迹能使气候有所变化？我一直认为这场暴风雪是对着他来的。但是破解这种异常的天气对我来说轻而易举。你快赶回去吧，还可以赶得上邀功领赏。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1812
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:121
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As grateful as I am for your company, I am, in fact, a hermit.\nI'm sure you have plenty of important things to do and don't need to be cluttering up my house any longer."
msgstr "能和你们结识我很荣幸，可惜我已封刀退隐，不能和你们闯荡江湖了。我想你们还有很多事去干，天下没有不散的宴席，我们就此后会有期吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1813
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:122
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well met, champions!\nPlease, don’t waste your valuable time or mine in times like this.\nUse your skills for the good of Enroth and leave me to my planning!\nWhen this battle is over, THEN we can share tales of valor and skill."
msgstr "勇士们，见到你们真高兴。你我的时间都很宝贵。你们要去拯救整个恩洛斯王国，而我也有自己的事要干。还是等战斗结束了我们再次团聚，再来共叙我们的友谊和交流各自的传奇经历吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1814
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:123
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello there!\nAre you here to tile the floors?\nOh!\nSorry, for a moment I forgot who you were!\nWelcome again, arch mages!\nPerhaps you can assist me in an experiment or two when you’re less busy?"
msgstr "嘿，你好。你在地板上铺瓷砖吗？噢，对不起，我一下子想不起你到底是谁？哦，欢迎你，大法师。也许你能抽空帮我解决一两个魔法实验的小问题。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1815
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:124
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am only allowed to vote on the issues that Lord Temper specifically instructs me on.\nGarner his approval, and on his recommendation, I will vote in your favor."
msgstr "坦普爵士授权于我在这个决议上投票表决。得到他的许可，并有他的推荐，我自然会投票为你说好话。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1816
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:125
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Osric has instructed me to vote for your cause.\nI give you my full support in his name."
msgstr "奥斯里克已指示我帮助你，我会以他的名义对你全力支持。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1819
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:128
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lord Stone has not authorized me to vote in your behalf.\nYou will need to take this matter up with him."
msgstr "斯通爵士没有指示我对你投赞成票，你必须首先得到他的同意。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1821
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:130
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I cannot vote on matters that do not concern Lord Stromgard.\nUntil you have his backing, I cannot vote for you."
msgstr "没有斯壮姆嘉德爵士的许可我不能决定此事。只有使他回心转意我才能投票赞成。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1826
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:135
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As long as I am a member of this council, you will not be permitted to visit the Oracle.\nI am not convinced of your sincerity and will not grant your request."
msgstr "只要我还在议会中有一席之地，我就不会赞让你拜访神使，我对你的忠诚度有所怀疑，不能满足你的要求。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1827
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:136
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Do not believe you have won!\nSoon the Iron Fist will lose its grip, and I will be your king!\nAnd you can be sure I won't forget you…"
msgstr "你赢啦？做梦吧！艾恩法斯特王朝快要完蛋了，我将成为王国的主宰。不过，你放心，我不会忘记你的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1828
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:137
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Curses!\nFoiled again!"
msgstr "真见鬼！又是功败垂成。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1829
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:138
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, If Loretta's got a new scheme, count me in!\nBut you better get all the other companies to sign up!"
msgstr "好吧，如果劳里达有了新的指示，我可以答应你。但你最好也能争得其它人的同意。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1833
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:142
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Pssst…Wanna buy membership in the Buccaneers' Lair?\nWe have two chapter houses in the kingdom, and we support our members by teaching them certain valuable skills.\nI'm sure you know what I mean.\nAll we want is 25 gold pieces, and our services are at your disposal."
msgstr "嗯，你要加入海盗之巢？我们在王国里有两个行会大堂，并向本派成员传授非凡的技艺。只要你付25个金币，我们就可以为你效劳。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1834
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:143
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hi.\nI'm the guild recruiter for Protection Services, a 'special' guild sanctioned by Lord Anthony Stone to sell protection to merchants, whether they want it or not.\nBut we aren't all thugs– we offer legitimate services and classes, too.\nMembership in the Protection Services Guild costs 50 gold, and entitles you to buy classes in any skill we teach."
msgstr "你好，我是保护服务行会的训练师。本行会由安东尼·斯通爵士一手领导，不论商人们是否需要，都向他们提供保护并收取报酬。但我们并非是非法的黑社会组织，我们提供的都是合法保护。要加入本行会必须交纳50个金币，然后就能购买到我们所传授的任何技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1835
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:144
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Smugglers' Guild doesn't just run contraband goods past customs inspectors– it offers schooling in all the skills a smuggler needs to excel in his chosen profession.\nAll our members get access to the finest teachers in the business.\nAll we ask is a one time guild membership fee of 50 gold pieces."
msgstr "走私者行会并不只是偷运货物而已，我们传授走私者所必须具备的各项技能。我们有最好的教授经商术的行家。加入本行会需付50个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1836
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:145
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "HEY!\nThe Blades' End mercenary's guild wants YOU– provided you're willing to pay a small fee to join.\nFor 25 gold pieces, we'll give you access to teachers for many of the skills a good sword for hire needs to succeed.\n"
msgstr "嗨！终极利刃雇佣兵行会欢迎你的加盟。你只要付25个金币，我们将为你指派最好的导师，传授你高超的剑法，使你得到大家的赏识。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1837
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:146
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Duelists' Edge mercenary guild offers valuable teachings in all the skills that a warrior on the go needs to know.\nFor a one time fee of 50 gold, we'll give you access to not just one of our fine guild halls, but BOTH of them.\nRemember, ours is the only guild that teaches the valuable repair skill."
msgstr "双刃剑锋行会将向你传授作为一名行侠仗义的大侠所必备的各种技能。你只要付50个金币，就可以进入本派的两个大堂。注意，本派是唯一传授修补术的行会。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1838
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:147
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The only way to get someone to teach you how to properly wear plate armor, short of a four year stint in the Iron Army, is to join the Berserkers' Fury mercenary guild.\nWe teach many other skills as well, so our modest fee of 50 gold pieces to join for life is really cheap."
msgstr "缺乏在铁甲部队四年的磨炼而要学会穿着钢甲，唯一的办法是加入雷霆震怒行会。我们还将传授另外各种技能，只付50个金币就可终身受益，真是便宜你了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1839
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:148
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you already have membership in the Guild of the Elements, I'm sure you've found that their 'fine library' doesn't measure up to your exacting standards.\nThat's why I urge you to pay your dues at the Guild of Air.\nSince we concentrate on air magic, you're more likely to find what you're looking for.\nAnd the price is low, too!\nJust 50 gold for a lifetime membership."
msgstr "如果你已经是元素魔法行会的成员了，你一定会发现他们的魔法密笈库对你现在的情况并不十分合适。你不妨在付点钱加入空气魔法行会。我们着重指导空气魔法的修炼，我想这更适合你，而且价格也很便宜，只要付50个金币就可终身受益。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1840
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:149
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Membership in the Guild of Earth will give you access to our excellent library of earth spells.\nLike all the spell guilds, we have two guild houses, and membership in the one automatically enrolls you in the other.\nThe cost to join is but 50 gold pieces."
msgstr "加入土系魔法行会可以学习到天下最精湛的土系魔法咒语。与其它教派相似，我们也有两个教派大堂，加入其中一个就可以自动进入另一个。付费为50个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1841
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:150
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You may have noticed all the monsters and hostile people running around the kingdom lately.\nDefending yourself can be tough with the simple spells the Guild of the Elements teaches to its members.\nWhat you need is fire power!\nThe Guild of Fire has the most destructive spells short of dark magic known to man.\n50 gold pieces gives you access to our excellent library."
msgstr "你大概已经注意到了近来怪兽和不法之徒在王国里日益猖獗。光凭你在元素魔法行会学到点小法术是难以保护自己的。你需要的是强大的烈火威力。火系魔法行会可向你传授除暗黑魔法外威力最大的魔法精髓。只要付50个金币就可得到我们的魔法密笈。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1842
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:151
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Membership in the Guild of Water gives you the right to buy our spells of change and movement.\nIt's my job to recruit new members and collect membership dues from them.\nThe price is 50 gold, and that includes membership in both our initiate and adept guild halls."
msgstr "水系魔法行会可传授你改变或移动物体的本领。我专们负责招募新的教派成员。加入本教派付费为50个金币。可以同时进入我们的初级和高级教派大堂。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1843
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:152
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the guild recruiter for the Guild of Body.\nWe are aware that many people think the simple healing spells available at the Guild of the Self are adequate, but we assure you they're not.\nIf you join our guild, you'll have the opportunity to purchase much more effect Body magic spells.\nThe cost is 50 gold pieces."
msgstr "我负责招募肢体魔法行会的新成员。我想大多数人认为光靠在自我魔法行会所学的一点治疗魔法就足以自保，其实并非如此。如果你加入本教派，就可以购买更有效的肢体魔法咒语。付费为50个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1844
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:153
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The greatest mind magic spells cannot be found in the Guild of the Self– they can only be found at the Guild of the Mind.\nI am empowered to sell membership to the Guild of the Mind for 50 gold pieces.\nWe have two guild halls, and membership in either is one and the same."
msgstr "在自我魔法行会你不可能修炼最高深的心智魔法，除非你加入心智魔法行会。我负责招募心智魔法行会新的成员。你只要付50个金币，就能进入我们的两个教派大堂。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1845
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:154
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "When death strikes, often the measures an individual takes to prevent financial loss to the grieving family are inadequate, resulting in devastating burial costs.\nThe best way to prevent these costs is to invest in a Raise Dead or Resurrection spell purchased by the friendly folks at the Guild of Spirit Magic.\nYes, members enjoy full access to our luxurious and well stocked libraries for a small one time charge of 50 gold.\nAct now and set your mind at ease!"
msgstr "一旦死神降临在你身上，你的家里少不了一番破费，光给你找个安息之地价钱也非常惊人。要躲避死神，你只有通过灵魂魔法行会购买死而复生或转世重生等魔法。只要付50个金币，你就能进入我们浩如烟海的魔法密笈库里尽情学习。现在你可以放宽心了吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1846
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:155
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Light magic represents the most powerful magic a person can wield without cost to his soul.\nUnavailable anywhere else in the kingdom, we feel confident our price of 1000 gold pieces for guild membership is fair."
msgstr "光明魔法为不损伤灵魂就可施展的威力最强大的魔法。只有在我们这里才可以学到。加入我们的教派付费为1000个金币，你一定会觉得物有所值。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1847
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:156
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know what you want– power.\nYou're tired of half-hearted spells that nick and cut your enemies but do no real damage.\nLet me introduce you to the Guild of Dark.\nOur spells are the strongest in the land, plain and simple.\nMembership in our guild costs but 1000 gold."
msgstr "我知道你在不断寻求惊世骇俗的神力。你对那些无关痛痒，不值一提的小法术早已不屑一顾了。我介绍你加入暗黑魔法行会。我们的魔法威力无比，简单实用，入会费为1000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1867
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:176
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Followers of Baa and a band of cutpurses have been raiding Mist from the islands to the north.\nThey come to Mist through a teleporter on the northwest of the island.\nI'll activate the teleporter so that you can get to their islands and get rid of them.\nI'm sure they have all the things they've stolen on those islands, and you can get back from their teleporter.\n "
msgstr "一伙羊鸣教教徒和作恶多端的匪徒袭击并霸占了浓雾岛。他们是通过西北方岛上的一个远距离传送装置上岛的。我已经启动了远距离传送装置，你可以通过它上岛把它们一网打尽。我肯定它们偷来的赃物都藏在岛上。你可以通过它们的远距离传送装置返回。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1869
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:178
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Here is the %s you have misplaced.\nYou must be more careful in the future."
msgstr "你已经放错了%s，以后可要注意点。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1870
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:179
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Slicker Silvertongue refused my order?\nThis must be treason!\nStill, I've known him so long, and he's never disobeyed an order before…perhaps he is suffering from delusions.\nYes, that's it.\nHe's been spending so much time investigating that horrible Baa cult that it's affected his mind– I even found one of their cloaks in his room.\nPerhaps you can find a cure for him.\nThey must surely know what they've done to him!\nI would start at their headquarters east of Castle Kriegspire.\nHere, take the cloak– perhaps you can find some use for it."
msgstr "斯里克·席尔瓦托恩竟然拒绝执行我的命令。这简直是叛变。我和他相知已久，他对我的话总是言听计从，这次他一定是糊涂了。对了，一定是他夜以继日地调查羊鸣教这个邪教，以致过度疲劳而犯了错误。我还在他的房间里发现羊鸣教的一件披风。也许你能使他恢复正常。这群可恶的家伙真该为其所作所为付出代价。我首先要拿克里格斯东部他们的总部开刀。这件披风你拿去吧，也许对你会有用的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1871
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:180
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh, my!\nIt appears that Slicker Silvertongue really is a traitor!\nWho ever would have guessed it?\nYou've done a good thing, bringing this letter to me.\nTake it to High Council immediately so we can be rid of this wicked traitor for once and for all!"
msgstr "噢，老天！如此说来斯里克·席尔瓦托恩真是叛徒。又有谁会料到呢？你把这封信带给我，真是做了件天大的好事。赶快把这个消息通报给高级议会，我们就可以清除叛徒，一劳永逸。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1872
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:181
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Please hurry in your quest to find Slicker Silvertongue's cure!\nI am sure the poor man must be suffering horribly under their dreadful mind control spell!"
msgstr "你快去完成你的任务，使斯里克·席尔瓦托恩神志清醒。我想这个可怜的家伙一定是中了羊鸣教施展的心智魔法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1873
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:182
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome to the Circus of the Sun!\nWe have a variety of games for your amusement.\nYou can take the prizes you win from the various games and trade them in here for either kegs of wine or golden pyramids.\nYou need at least 10 points to get a keg of wine, and 30 or more points will win you a golden pyramid.\nIn case you didn't know, each lodestone is worth 1 point, each harpy feather is worth 3 points, and each four leaf clover is worth 5 points.\n"
msgstr "欢迎来到太阳马戏团。我们有各种各样的游戏节目，使你高兴而来，满意而归。你还能在游戏比赛中获得奖品，并以之交换桶装酒或金字塔。一桶酒需要10个点数，一个金字塔需要30个点数。你要明白一块天然磁石值1个点数，一支鹰身女妖的羽毛值3个点数，一片四叶草值5个点数。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1874
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:183
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Missing Text:\nCircus Main Tent Trade for Prize"
msgstr "失落的正文：在马戏团主帐篷里交换奖品"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1875
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:184
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm sorry, but you don't have 10 points yet.\nWhy don't you try a few more games?"
msgstr "你没有达到10个点数，我很抱歉。为什么不去再玩两个游戏呢？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1876
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:185
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Congratulations!\nYou win a keg of wine!\nThere are no limits on the prizes here, so keep playing!"
msgstr "祝贺你，你赢得了桶装酒。我们的奖品可不封顶，你还可以尽情地玩下去！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1877
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:186
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Congratulations!\nYou win a golden pyramid!\nGood work– remember there are no limits on the prizes, so keep playing!"
msgstr "祝贺你，你赢得了金字塔。干得真是太棒了。我们的奖品可不封顶，你还可以尽情玩下去。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1878
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:187
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome!\nTo play my game, simply pay 50 gold and step right up to compete against me.\nDepending on how well you do you can win either a lodestone, a harpy feather, or a four leaf clover.\nIf you do poorly, you win nothing.\nYou can trade in your lodestones, feathers, and clovers in the main tent."
msgstr "欢迎你！咱们不妨来较量一番。花50个金币，我就和你切磋一下武艺。如果你表现好的话，可以获得天然磁石，鹰身女妖的羽毛或四叶草，这根据你的武功而定。但如果你不堪一击，什么别想得到。拿着这些奖励你可以到主帐篷内换取奖品。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1879
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:188
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Too bad!\nYou came pretty close.\nFor 50 gold, I'll give you another chance."
msgstr "真不幸，你差点就赢了。再出50个金币，我就再给你一次机会。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1880
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:189
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good job, I thought I had you there.\nYou win a lodestone!"
msgstr "干得真不赖，我奖励你一块天然磁石。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1882
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:191
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Incredible!\nAre you sure you didn't cheat?\nWell, a rule's a rule.\nHere's your prize– a four leaf clover!"
msgstr "真是难以置信，你太出色了，该不是作弊吧。我遵守诺言，把四叶草奖励给你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1883
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:192
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As part of the effort to rebuild the Temple here in Free Haven, I'm collecting temple gongs.\nIf you have any gongs, I'll pay you 2000 gold for each of them."
msgstr "为了重建自由天堂的神庙，我到处收集神庙的铜锣。如果你有的话，我每面锣出价2000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1884
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:193
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This one's a little dirty, but I suppose it will do.\nHere is the gold I promised you for it.\nThanks for your help!"
msgstr "尽管脏了些，但我想它还管用，这是我许诺给你的报酬，多谢你的帮助。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1885
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:194
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm looking for bones to use in my rituals.\nI prefer bones from humans or humanoids, but I suppose I can make do with whatever you find.\nI'm willing to pay up to 1000 gold for bones that I can use."
msgstr "我正在寻找能在仪式上派上用场的骨头。我本来想要人或类人猿的骨头，但你只要找到能用的就行了。如果找到的骨头合适的话，我会给你1000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1886
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:195
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmm...\nA leg bone of a human?\nThis will do nicely.\nThis bone is certainly worth 1000 gold.\n"
msgstr "嗯，这是人的腿骨。很不错，我愿付1000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1887
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:196
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Many people aren't able to visit the circus, so I'm collecting circus prizes to give away to those not able to visit it themselves.\nI'll buy lodestones for 5 gold each if you want to part with them."
msgstr "许多人去不了马戏团，所以我专门收集马戏团的奖品卖给那些人。如果你有的话，每块天然磁石我出价5个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1888
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:197
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you!\nYou're too generous– this will make a lovely gift.\nHere's the 5 gold I owe you."
msgstr "谢谢你，你真是太慷慨了！这真是件可爱的礼物，这是我给你的5个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1889
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:198
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My daughter wants to go to the circus, but we never have the time when the circus is near here.\nI'd love to give her a bunch of the pretty harpy feathers for her.\nI'll take any harpy feathers you have for 10 gold each."
msgstr "我的女儿吵着要去看马戏团。可我们总是没有时间。我想给她一些鹰身女妖的羽毛来补偿她。如果你有的话，每支鹰身女妖的羽毛我出价10个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1890
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:199
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks!\nDon't tell my daughter about this, I want to surprise her.\nHere's the 10 gold."
msgstr "多谢你了，这事可不要向我的女儿声张。我要让她大吃一惊。这是我给你的10个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1891
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:200
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard that you can get really nifty things from Abdul's Desert Resort if you pay with golden pyramids.\nI'm hoping to go there one day, and I want to stock up on the pyramids now.\nI'll take any golden pyramids you have for 1000 gold."
msgstr "我听说有了金字塔就可以到阿卜杜的沙漠胜地去交换些新鲜玩意儿。我希望有朝一日能如愿，所以专门收集金字塔。如果你有的话，每个金字塔我出价1000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1892
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:201
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome, adventurers!\nDid you have something for me?\nI'm a very busy man, you know.\n"
msgstr "欢迎你们，我的勇士们，你们给我带来什么好东西了吗？我可是个大忙人，没空和你们多罗嗦。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1893
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:202
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can help you become an expert in the use of the staff as a weapon.\nAll you need is an intermediate skill in the staff (Rank 4) and 2000 gold."
msgstr "我可以训练你成为手杖专家，你只要具备中级手杖水平（达到4级），然后付2000个金币就可以了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1894
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not to brag, but I'm the best staff fighter in the land.\nI will teach any student who is already an expert with the staff and has a high degree of skill (Rank 7) for 5000 gold."
msgstr "不是吹牛，我是大陆上手杖的第一高手。我可以对已经是手杖专家并且拥有高级水平（达到7级）的学生进行教导，学费是5000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1895
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:204
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My teaching can improve your sword technique.\nYou must already be of intermediate skill (Rank 4) to benefit from my advice.\nI charge 2000 gold per student."
msgstr "我可以提高你的长剑技能造诣，但此前你必须具备中等水平（达到4级）。每个学生我收费2000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1896
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am amongst the finest swordsmen in the land.\nI will teach students who possess a high degree of skill (Rank 7) for 5000 gold. I won't waste my time with anyone else."
msgstr "我是天下最好的剑术家之一。对于具备高超的长剑技能（达到7级）者，我可以以5000金币为价格授艺。其他人可别来浪费我的时间。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1897
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:206
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wanna learn a few tricks with the dagger?\nYou've come to the right place, my friend.\nI'll teach you if you already know a thing or two with a dagger (Rank 4), and of course can pay my fee of 2000 gold."
msgstr "想要学一些匕首的绝技吗？我的朋友，你可来对地方了。如果你对匕首已经有了一定的了解（达到4级）并付我2000个金币，我就教你些绝招。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1898
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The dagger is a quick and subtle weapon that needs more brains than brawn to use.\nIf you're already skilled enough (Rank 7), I can train you to master rank for 5000 gold."
msgstr "匕首速度迅捷，招数精巧，想掌握它，必须用脑子而不是蛮力。如果你已经充分掌握了该技能（达到7级），付我5000个金币，我就训练你为大师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1899
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:208
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Using an axe is trickier than you think.\nIf you've already had some practice with the axe (Rank 4), I'll be happy to show you the finer points of splitting skulls.\nMy fee is 2000 gold."
msgstr "使用战斧可比你想象的复杂多了。如果你已经对战斧比较熟悉了（达到4级），再付我2000个金币，我就向你展示战斧斩兵杀敌的精髓。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1900
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, you want to train your axe skill the dwarven way?\nMy tutorage will show you how to dramatically increase the damage you inflict with an axe. I require a high skill (Rank 7) and 5000 gold."
msgstr "你想使你的战斧武功有突飞猛进的进展，就像矮人族一样把斧子使得炉火纯青吗？我可以教你如何大幅提升战斧的攻击杀伤。我需要你的有高超的技能（达到7级）并付我5000金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1901
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:210
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It takes practice to use a spear right.\nYou have to know how to keep your enemy from getting past the point, and what to do when he does.\nIf you have enough skill already (Rank 4), I can show you the right moves.\nAll I want is 2000 gold for my services."
msgstr "要纯熟使用长矛可得下一定的工夫。你必须懂得如何使对手无法进入矛头攻击圈、如果对手进入了应该怎么办。如果你已经有足够技能等级（达到4级），再付我2000个金币，我就会教你如何正确应对各种局面。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1902
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A little practice with the spear keeps you from making deadly mistakes in battle, but a lot more practice will help you get the best results from your spear.\nI will teach you the secrets of the masters if you've already had a little practice (Rank 7).\nMy fee is 5000 gold."
msgstr "对长矛粗通皮毛可让你在战斗不致于犯下致命的错误，而炉火纯青的技术则能让你将长矛的优点最大化。如果你在这方面已经有不少的锻炼（达到7级），付我5000个金币，我就会教你几招大师级的绝招。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1903
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:212
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Learning to use a bow quickly and accurately is a skill that can take a lifetime to master.\nI can start you down that road if you've already had some basic training (Rank 4) and 2000 gold in your purse.\nWhat do you say?"
msgstr "要达到弓箭大师的水准，做到射箭迅速、箭法精确必须花费一生孜孜以求。如果你已经有一定基础（达到4级），再付我2000个金币，我会领你登堂入室。怎么样？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1905
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:214
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A lot of people think there isn't much finesse in using a mace or hammer, but they're wrong.\nBeating something to death with a mace is a lot like playing the drums.\nYou have to target the hard, bony parts of your enemy so your weapon will bounce back quickly, cocking itself for another strike.\nI can teach you this technique if you already have a little skill (Rank 4) for 2000 gold."
msgstr "许多人认为他们天生不擅使钉锤和大锤，那就大错特错了。其实用钉锤致人死命就和敲锣打鼓差不多。你要瞄准敌人硬邦邦的骨头敲下去，锤会迅速弹回，紧接着就可以出第二招。如果你已经有一定的技术（达到4级）并付我2000个金币，我就传你此艺。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1906
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A master of the mace can strike enemies senseless with a single blow.\nI've been practicing this technique for years and have it down to a science.\nIf you have the skill (Rank 7), I can teach you my technique for 5000 gold."
msgstr "钉锤的大师可以只用一招即将敌人敲得不省人事。经过多年的修炼，我已经将这门技能变成了一门科学。如果你达到了一定的技能（7级），我愿意以5000个金币为学费，传授你我的技术。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1907
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:216
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No weapon today can match the power of the weapons from the Time of Wonders.\nI'm not sure any of those ancient weapons exist anymore, but I can show you some tricks if you find one.\nReally!\nI'm not crazy!"
msgstr "如今没有一种武器能和奇迹时代的武器威力相提并论。我不知道这些上古兵器今天是否还存在。但如果你能找得到，我会教你几招的。真的，我可没发疯。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1908
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:217
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Long ago I found an old weapon that fired sunlight and could kill almost anything I used it against.\nI killed so many dragons, it got to be routine.\nI could shoot them out of the sky like big, slow ducks.\nOne day, it just stopped working, and my career as a dragon slayer ended.\nIf you ever bring me one, I'll show you how to use it right for 5000 gold."
msgstr "很久以前我找到一种古代兵器，它可以发射阳光摧毁万物。那时屠龙就跟砍瓜切菜一样方便。龙在我眼里就像蠢笨的肥鸭。但一天武器失灵了，我的屠龙者生涯就此结束。如果你带来了这种武器，并付我5000个金币，我会教你如何正确地使用它。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1909
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:218
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Used correctly, a shield makes a big difference in a fight.\nYou have to defend yourself if you're going to have a chance of winning.\nI can give you a some advanced training if you've already practiced a little (Rank 4) and have 2000 gold to spend."
msgstr "如果准确使用盾牌可使你在战斗中占尽优势。对敌中若要战胜对手必须先学会防守。如果你已经对盾牌比较熟悉了（达到4级），再付我2000个金币，我将使你的水平更进一步。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1910
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's easy to use a shield, but hard to use it right.\nI can drastically improve your defense if you give me the chance.\nSince I only offer extremely advanced training, you have to be an expert student (Rank 7) before I can help you.\nAll I ask is 3000 gold for my fee."
msgstr "使用盾牌很容易，但要精通可就难了。如果有机会我会使你的技能突飞猛进的。我传授的都是至高绝学，你必须拥有较高水准（达到7级），再付我3000个金币，我会帮你修成正果。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1912
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My teaching will bring you up to master ranking in leather armor for 3000 gold.\nMy students must already be highly skilled (Rank 7) in the use of leather armor for my teaching to be worth anything to them."
msgstr "如果你已经高度掌握了皮甲技能（达到7级），我会以3000个金币为价格，训练你为这项技能的大师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1913
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:222
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Using chain armor is a skill that must be developed like any other.\nIt's not like wearing a heavy coat, that's for sure!\nI can train a little expertise into you for 1000 gold, provided you already have some skill (Rank 4) with chain armor."
msgstr "使用锁甲并非只是穿上一件厚重的衣服而是练习一门技能。如果你有一定技术（达到4级），再付我1000个金币，我就传授你一些专家级的知识。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1914
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Chain armor is a weapon of war, there's no doubt of that, and I'm careful who I train in its use.\nI require my students to be well practiced (Rank 7) before I'll train them.\nMy fee is 3000 gold."
msgstr "锁甲毫无疑问是一种战争武器，我对它的使用颇有心得。但我只传授给精通此技能（达到7级）的学生。学费是3000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1915
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:224
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "An expert with plate armor can wear it with elegance and style.\nI can instill this grace in my students if they already have a little skill (Rank 4) and 1000 gold for my fee."
msgstr "一个专家会把沉重的钢甲穿得优雅而有风度。我会传授我的学生这种优雅和风度，只要其已拥有一定的技术（达到4级）并愿付1000个金币的学费。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1916
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "One who is a master in the use of plate mail wears it as easily as he wears his own clothes.\nI'll only teach it to skilled people (Rank 7) for 3000 gold."
msgstr "大师级人物穿着钢甲就像寻常衣服般轻便自如。我只向精通此技能（达到7级）并付我3000金币者授艺。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1917
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:226
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The secrets of the fire are deep indeed, and can only be taught to one well initiated in the art (Rank 4).\nI can bring your skill to expert level for 1000 gold."
msgstr "火系魔法是一项高深的魔法艺术。如果你对这门艺术已有扎实的基础（达到4级）并付我1000个金币，我将训练你至专家级水平。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1918
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Long have I studied the mysteries of fire magic, and have finally come to master the skill.\nI can teach the highly skilled (Rank 7) some of the things I've learned for 4000 gold."
msgstr "长久以来我一直钻研火系魔法，已经达到登峰造极的水准。如果你已经高度掌握了此技能（达到7级），我可以以4000个金币为价格，传授你一些我知道的知识。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1919
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:228
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are ways to draw magical energy from the air to power your spells longer and more efficiently.\nIf you're practiced in the art of air magic (Rank 4), I can teach you for 1000 gold."
msgstr "用某些方法可以让你从空气中吸取魔法能量，以便更长时间、更高效地为空气魔法提供动力。如果你对空气魔法的艺术已有一定钻研（达到4级）并付我1000个金币，我将教你这些方法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1920
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Air magic is the most subtle and quirky of the elemental magics you can study.\nBecause of the difficulty involved in learning this skill, I require a high proficiency (Rank 7).\nMy price is 4000 gold."
msgstr "空气魔法是最精巧奇特的元素魔法。你只有精通了此技能（达到7级），我才能教你大师级的知识，学费是4000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1921
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:230
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Water is the element of movement and change.\nWithout skill in water magic, it takes forever to get from one side of the kingdom to the other.\nI can improve your skill to expert status if you've already had a little practice (Rank 4).\nMy fee is 1000 gold."
msgstr "水是有关于移动和变形的元素。缺了水系魔法，从王国的这端移动到另一端将花费你极其漫长的时间。如果你对这类魔法已经略有掌握（达到4级）并付我1000个金币，我将训练你至专家级水平。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1922
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A master of water magic with the Lloyd's Beacon spell can travel about the kingdom as much as he pleases.\nI teach the skill to the most advanced students (Rank 7) for 4000 gold."
msgstr "拥有时空道标咒语的水系魔法大师可以在王国里来去自如。我只教最精湛的学生（达到7级），学费为4000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1923
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:232
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you want to become an expert in earth magic, you've come to the right place.\nAll you need is a modest level of skill (Rank 4) and 1000 gold for my fee."
msgstr "如果你要成为土系魔法的专家，你可来对地方了。只要你有中级水平（达到4级）并付我1000个金币，我就教你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1924
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can teach experts in earth magic to become masters of earth magic.\nYou must be very highly skilled (Rank 7) before I can help you, and my fee is 4000 gold."
msgstr "我向土系魔法专家传授大师级别的知识，但此前你必须高度掌握这门魔法技能（达到7级），学费是4000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1925
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:234
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Spirit magic is the magic you need to bring life from death.\nI can train you in this important skill if you've already had a little practice (Rank 4) and are willing to pay me 1000 gold."
msgstr "灵魂魔法可使人起死回生，我可以进一步教授你这项重要的技能，只要你已有一定的训练（达到4级）并愿意支付我1000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1927
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:236
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can fine tune your skill in mind magic, bringing you up to the level of expert in this vital skill.\nYou must have had a little practice (Rank 4) and be willing to pay a fee of 1000 gold."
msgstr "我可以把你的心智魔法提高到专家级水平，但你必须有一定基础（达到4级）并付我1000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1929
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:238
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Body magic is the magic of healing and strengthening spells.\nI will train anyone who is interested up to expert level for 1000 gold.\nAll you need is a little prior practice (Rank 4) for me to help you."
msgstr "肢体魔法有疗伤和加强的作用。如果此项技能你已进行了一定的基础练习（达到4级），付1000个金币我就可以使你达到专家级水平。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1930
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The mysteries of the body can be yours all for the low, low price of 4000 gold.\nOnly highly skilled (Rank 7) experts can benefit from my teachings."
msgstr "只需4000个金币的超低价格，我就会传授你肢体魔法的终极奥秘。当然，技术高超（达到7级）的专家才能受益于我的教学。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1931
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can show you some of the secrets of light magic if you already have a little skill (Rank 4) to start with.\nMy fee is 1000 gold."
msgstr "如果你的光明魔法已经有一些技术了（达到4级），我可以向你揭示一些光明魔法的秘密，学费是1000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1932
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A master of light magic is amongst the most powerful spell casters in the world.\nI can improve nearly any expert to master status, but I do not do this lightly.\nI require a high skill (Rank 7) and 5000 gold."
msgstr "光明魔法是威力最为强大的魔法。我能够把此魔法的专家训练为大师，但我从不轻易这样做。我只传授给技能高超（达到7级）者，并需要支付5000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1933
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah!\nA student of darkness, no doubt!\nIf you want schooling in dark magic, I can help you if you've already practiced a little (Rank 4).\nMy fee is 1000 gold."
msgstr "啊！黑暗派系的学生，毫无疑问！如果你想接受暗黑魔法方面的教育，我可以帮你，但你必须已经有些基础（达到4级）并付我1000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1934
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can bring experts of dark magic up to master, provided they meet my standards.\nI only teach the genuinely dedicated– those of high skill (Rank 7).\nI make no exceptions, and charge only 5000 gold in the interests of spreading darkness throughout the world."
msgstr "我能把达到我的标准的暗黑魔法专家训练为大师。我只教授那些真正献身于黑暗——那些暗黑魔法高手（达到7级）。为了把黑暗散布到整个世界，我的教学仅收5000个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1935
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:244
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you've spent any time adventuring at all, you'll know how important it is to know what your equipment does and how much it's worth.\nI can improve your expertise with this skill if you already have a little identify skill to start with (Rank 4).\nMy price is 500 gold."
msgstr "如果你经常周游世界，你一定明白，对自己装备的特性和价值的了解有多么重要。我能使你成为鉴定术专家，只要你鉴定术达到了一定的级别（达到4级）并付我500个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1936
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You may already have found that while being an expert in identifying your treasure is good, it's not good enough.\nI change\nthat.\nI will teach experts to become masters for 2500 gold.\nAll you need is sufficient skill (Rank 7)."
msgstr "你也许已经感到成为鉴定术专家虽然挺不错，但有时还不足够。我可以改变这点。如果你有足够的技能等级（达到7级）并付我2500个金币，我就使你成为鉴定术大师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1937
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:246
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will happily teach anyone with enough (Rank 4) merchant skill to become an expert merchant for 2000 gold.\nIt may seem expensive, but it's worth it!"
msgstr "我很高兴传授专家级的经商知识给那些已有一定经商术技巧（达到4级）的人。2000个金币的学费听起来可能有点小贵，但其实是值得的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1938
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Rare is the expert merchant, but rarer still is the master.\nI can finish your merchant's education for 4000 gold, provided you have the skill (Rank 7) and the charm (Personality 50)."
msgstr "经商术专家很少，但经商术的大师更罕见。如果你已经有充分的技能（达到7级）和魅力（个性达到50），再付我4000个金币，我就使你成为大师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1939
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:248
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Any blacksmith shop can repair your equipment, but what do you do when something breaks while you're on the road?\nI can make you an expert at mending things that are broken.\nAll you need is a little repair skill (Rank 4) to start with, and the gold to pay me.\nMy fee is but 500 gold."
msgstr "铁匠铺能维修你的装备，但如果你不巧正在路上而装备却损坏了该怎么着？我能使你成为修补物品的专家，只要有一点儿基础（达到4级）和500个金币就行了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1940
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I teach experts in repair skill to be masters in the repair skill.\nYou must have a high skill (Rank 7) and 2500 gold for my fee."
msgstr "如果你已拥有很高级别的修补术（达到7级），付我2500个金币我就可以使你成为修补术大师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1941
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:250
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ja, you want to learn body building, right?\nThen you listen to me.\nI teach you right for 500 gold, if you have a little meat on your body (Rank 4) to start with."
msgstr "啊，你想健身？好吧，听着，如果你身上还有点肉（达到4级）并付我500个金币，我就教你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1942
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If ever I've seen such pathetic weaklings as you, for the life of me I cannot remember!\nStarving rats have more meat on their bones!\nFor a fee of 2500 gold, I'll beat you mercilessly until you become master body builders!\nYou must, however, already have spent time working out (Rank 7) and be tough enough to take my punishment (Endurance 50) before I'll have anything to do with you!"
msgstr "真没见过像你这样体质虚弱的家伙。饿死的老鼠还比你多几两肉。付我2500个金币，我就会毫不留情地训练你，直到你成为健身术大师为止。但你至少必须已经锻炼了一段时间了（达到7级）并且能够经受得住我的击打（耐力达到50）。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1943
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:252
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The way to achieve strength in the material realm is to achieve strength in the spiritual realm.\nI can show you the way.\nFor a fee of 500 gold, I will help you attain expert skill in meditation if you have already had a little practice (Rank 4)."
msgstr "想要从物质世界得到力量首先必须在精神世界中有所提高。我可以为你指点一二。如果你冥想术已经有了一定的基础（达到4级）并付我500个金币，我将助你成为冥想术专家。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1944
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Who disturbs my meditation, as the pebble disturbs the stillness of the pond?\nAhh, seekers of the True Path.\nIf you have already traveled the path of meditation for some time (rank 7) necessary for my teaching, I can lead you to master status for 2500 gold.\n"
msgstr "何人扰乱了吾之苦思冥想，如卵石击破水塘之静？啊，汝等乃真理之探寻者。嗯，若汝已于冥想之径上跋涉良久（达到7级），吾将以2500金币为价，授汝冥想术大师之技。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1945
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:254
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The watchful can sometimes see a trap just before it goes off.\nThe lucky and skillful can sometimes avoid damage altogether.\nI can teach you to recognize and avoid these traps provided you've already practiced a little (Rank 4) and have 500 gold for my fee.\n"
msgstr "目光敏锐者有时能在陷阱被触发之前发现它们。幸运和技艺不凡者有时能完全免受伤害。如果你已经有一定基础（达到4级）并付我500个金币，我将教你如何发现和回避陷阱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1946
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The lucky person with a well trained eye can often stay out of harm's way when a trap goes off unexpectedly.\nIf you've already had a lot of practice (Rank 7), I'll make you a master of the perception skill.\nMy fee is but 2500 gold."
msgstr "在陷阱突然被触发时，训练有素的慧眼和老天赐予你的幸运能使你遇难呈祥。如果你使用洞察术已久（达到7级），我会以2500金币的价格训练你为洞察术大师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1947
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:256
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Having trouble getting people to talk to you?\nThat's your reputation speaking!\nA little skill in diplomacy will lessen the impact of your past misdeeds.\nI can bring you up to expert diplomat if you've already practiced your diplomacy a little (Rank 4) and have 500 gold for my fee.\n"
msgstr "别人不愿意和你交谈？这是你的声誉有问题。交际术可以减少你过去的荒唐行径的负面影响。如果你已经有一定交际术的基础（达到4级）并付我500个金币，我将使你成为交际术专家。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1948
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:257
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Even a murderer is entitled to his day in court, and a good diplomat can turn a premeditated ambush into a case of desperate self defense.\nI specialize in training expert diplomats into master diplomats.\nYou must have had plenty of practice (Rank 7) and enough fame (200) for my teaching to be of help.\nMy fee is 2500 gold."
msgstr "连杀人犯在法庭上都有发言的机会。一个出色的外交家能把一次蓄意的伏击解释成一个危急关头的正当防卫。如果你使用交际术已久（达到7级），有一定的名气（知名度达到200），我可以训练你为交际术大师。学费是2500个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1949
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:258
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So much of the treasure of the land is in the hands of monsters and criminals, and they have been getting very clever with their traps.\nYou really need to know how to get past those traps and live to tell the tale.\nI can help.\nIf you already have a little skill (Rank 4), I can train you to expert rank for just 500 gold.\n"
msgstr "王国中大量的财宝已落入怪兽和罪犯手中，他们已变得越来越聪明，会设置许多精密的陷阱。你必须学会如何穿越这些陷阱，活下来向他人讲述你的传奇。如果你已经有一定技术了（达到4级）并付我500个金币，我会训练你达到专家水准。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1950
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's one thing to kill a rich and powerful monster, but it's something else entirely to get past the traps it puts on its treasure chests.\nMy disarm training is the best in the kingdom.\nIf you're already an expert and have the skill (Rank 7), I can train you to master rank for 2500 gold."
msgstr "除掉富有且强大的怪兽是一回事，平安穿越怪兽布在宝库上的陷阱是另一回事。我对陷阱拆卸术的教学是整个王国中最顶尖的。如果你已经是这项技能的专家，并且已有一定的技术（达到7级），我会以2500金币的价格训练你成为拆卸术的大师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1951
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:260
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must learn to learn well if you're to enjoy a long and fruitful life.\nIf you already understand what I'm talking about (Rank 4), I can take you a lot farther.\nMy teachings cost 2000 gold."
msgstr "如果你想让你的一生充满成就，你就必须学会如何学习。如果你能明白我在说什么（达到4级），付2000个金币学费，我就会好好调教你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1952
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the teacher of teachers, the master of learning.\nI can bring your understanding of the world around you to new heights.\nI will only train those who have studied under my old students and have a thorough understanding of my precepts (Rank 7).\nIf you are smart enough (Intellect 50), I can bring you to master rank for 5000 gold.\n"
msgstr "我是学习术的大师，是老师的老师。我能使你对世界的认识提高到新的高度。但你必须曾经师从我的学生，对我的规诫有彻底的了解（达到7级），并且足够聪明（智力达到50），我会以2500金币的价格训练你为学习术的大师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1960
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:269
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The best staff teacher in the land, Jasper Rice, lives up near Silver Cove.\nYou'll want to talk to him if you wish to continue your training with the staff."
msgstr "天下最好的手杖高手杰斯佩·莱斯住在银湾镇附近，如果你要使自己的手杖技能精益求精，不妨找他求教。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1961
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:270
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Guy Hampton in Blackshire taught me everything I know about the sword.\nIf you're looking to master the blade, he's the one to train under."
msgstr "住在布莱克郡的盖·汉普顿对剑术无所不知。如果你要成为长剑大师，可以去找他。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1962
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:271
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm only a novice when compared to someone like Jules Miles.\nHe lives near Castle Stone, and he can teach anyone how to improve their dagger skills."
msgstr "和朱尔斯·米尔斯的匕首技能相比，我简直是个初出茅庐的新手。他就住在斯通城堡附近，要提高匕首技能只有去找他。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1963
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:272
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Avinril Smythers mastered the axe before most of us were even born, but he doesn't train humans.\nI'm sure if you could do something special for him, he might consider teaching a human how to really swing an axe.\nHe spends most of his time in the Haunt in the Mire of the Damned."
msgstr "阿维里·辛西亚在我们出生前就开始钻研战斧技能。但他从不授艺予人。但你们如果干些惊天动地的大事，他说不定会破例。他总游荡在幽灵沼泽附近。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1964
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:273
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The best spearman in Enroth, Burton Rutherford, lives in Darkmoor.\nI'm not sure why he picks such a remote place to call his home.\nMaybe he doesn't like being bothered with students?"
msgstr "天下使矛的第一高手，伯顿·罗德福德住在幽灵沼泽。我真不明白他为什么隐居在这么偏僻的地方。也许他不喜欢被他的学生打扰。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1965
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:274
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As good as Lord Stromgard is with a bow, he won't accept students.\nTo master the bow, you need to talk to Desmond Weller in Kriegspire."
msgstr "斯壮姆嘉德射箭技能精湛，但从不收徒。要成为弓箭技能的大师，你可以去克里格斯城堡找德斯蒙德·威勒求教。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1967
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:276
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Very few people even know that these weapons exist.\nThe only other person I've ever seen using an ancient weapon is Rexella, but she was last living in Paradise Valley– I'm not sure she's even there anymore."
msgstr "很少人知道世上还有这种武器。我只见过李克斯拉使用过这类武器。以前她住在天堂谷，不知她现在是否还住在这个地方。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1968
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:277
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No one can use a shield like Bronwyn Meck in Blackshire.\nThat's the person to talk to if you want to master the shield."
msgstr "没人能像布莱克郡的布朗·梅克那样把盾牌使得如此纯熟自如。你要成为盾牌的大师可以去找他。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1969
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:278
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Arlen Sailor runs the best school in the art of wearing leather armor.\nHe normally holds his classes near Castle Stone."
msgstr "阿伦·瑟勒是传授皮甲技能的最佳导师。他通常住在斯通城堡附近。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1976
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:285
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Spirit can be mastered with the help of Bishop Inquisitorio.\nHe lives right behind Castle Ironfist, you can't miss him."
msgstr "要掌握灵魂魔法的精髓，必须求助于毕肖普·因奎斯特。他住在铁拳城堡的后面，还挺好找的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1980
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:289
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Su Lang Manchu was my teacher in dark magic.\nHe maintains a small house in a village in Paradise Valley."
msgstr "苏朗满是我学习暗黑魔法的老师。他在天堂谷中拥有一间小屋。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1982
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:291
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The smoothest talking merchant I've ever seen is Will Ottoman in Silver Cove.\nIf you're looking to improve your merchant skill, he's the man to see."
msgstr "威尔·奥特曼是我见过的最精明的商人。如果你要提高你的经商术，可以去找他。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1983
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:292
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you think I'm good at repairing things, Ryan Treacle is the best around.\nI'm sure he can be convinced to assist you in mastering the skill.\nHe lives up near Castle Stone the last I heard."
msgstr "我的修补术和瑞安·特里克尔相比不值一提。你可以说服他传授你大师级的修补术。我听说他住在斯通城堡附近。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1984
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:293
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Jason Traveler will coach you in the finest points of body-building.\nHe works in Free Haven, if you can handle his rigorous training."
msgstr "贾森·泰福勒是最好的健身术教练。如果你受得了他的严格训练，不妨去自由天堂找他。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1987
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Jacques Kohl is working with Lord Stromgard to develop experimental recipes.\nIf he has time, perhaps he can assist you as well in mastering the art of Alchemy."
msgstr "贾克斯·科霍一直为斯壮姆嘉德爵士开发试验性的药剂配方，如果他有时间，他可以帮助你成为炼金术的大师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1988
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:297
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The greatest trap disarmer, Gabe Lester, is currently teaching his craft near Castle Stone.\nHe's the person to talk to if you want to learn all the best tricks."
msgstr "天下最伟大的陷阱拆卸术高手盖贝·莱斯特现在在斯通城堡附近授艺。如果想使拆卸术登峰造极，不妨去找他。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1989
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:298
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "John Tuck can teach you to master the learning skill.\nI believe he's still living in Silver Cove."
msgstr "约翰·特克可使你成为学习术的大师。我觉得他依然住在银湾镇。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1990
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:299
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The King of the Dwarves, Snergle, usurped Rocklin for leadership of the dwarven clans.\nNow Rocklin is in exile somewhere and Snergle is in charge.\nMost dwarves don’t like Snergle and would like to see Rocklin back in power.\nUnfortunately, Snergle has claimed both Rocklin’s caverns and the largest dwarven Iron Mine.\nSnergle, fearing treachery near home, has removed me, the Dwarven Weaponmaster, from my position.\nWe need someone to get Snergle out of power by any means necessary.\nI’d even consider training you humans how to use an axe like a true dwarf if you’ll help us."
msgstr "现任的矮人国国王斯纳格是谋权篡位后登上矮人国王位的。原国王洛克林被他放逐边疆。大多数矮人国的民众不堪忍受斯纳格的残暴统制，都希望洛克林能重登王位。不幸的是，斯纳格占据了洛克林的岩洞和矮人国最大的铁矿。他为了巩固王位，撤了我矮人国武器大师的职位。我们需要有人帮助，使用任何手段把斯纳格赶下台。如果你能助我们一臂之力，尽管你是人类，我也会把矮人擅使的战斧绝招传授给你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1991
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:300
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I need proof that Snergle has been defeated.\nI’m sorry, but I just can’t take your word for it.\nBring back some personal item of his, like his axe maybe."
msgstr "我需要你证明斯纳格已经被打败了，很抱歉我不能相信你的一面之词。你最好能带回斯纳格的私人物品来证明，比如他的战斧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1992
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:301
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh, glorious day!\nWith Snergle’s passing, we can now search for Rocklin to put him back in power.\nEternal thanks to you for this, and dwarves everywhere owe you a debt of gratitude."
msgstr "啊，真是一个光荣的日子！斯纳格已经倒台了，现在我们可以找回洛克林国王让他重登王位。我们永远感激你，矮人国的所有民众都欠你一个人情。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1993
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:302
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Mayor here in Mist is considering allowing the Fraternal Order of Silver to police the town in their battle against evil.\nI know the Silver Helm Persecution Squads have murdered innocents in their misguided crusade against ‘evil,’ but there are no living witnesses to their atrocities.\nI need you to storm their outpost to the south of here to find proof so that I can convince the mayor to ban them from Mist."
msgstr "浓雾镇的镇长正考虑在与恶势力的战斗期间让银色兄弟会来管理整个城镇。但我知道银色兄弟会下属的银舵除奸队打着“向恶势力进军”的旗号杀戮了许多无辜的人。遗憾的是，没有幸存的目击者佐证他们的暴行。你的任务是突袭本镇东南边他们的前哨站，搜索证据，让我可以说服镇长取缔他们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1994
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:303
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Keep searching– the lives of the mayor and myself could very well be in your hands.\nWe can’t take action against them without proof."
msgstr "继续搜索吧，镇长和我的身家性命都掌握在你的手中。如果没有证据我们无法采取行动。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1995
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:304
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Just as I suspected!\nI’m surprised the Mayor was number three on their enemies list.\nI suppose he IS a tad incompetent, but he’s not a bad person.\nThanks again, please accept this gold and my gratitude as your reward."
msgstr "果然不出我所料！但镇长上了他们的黑名单并被列为第三号人物真让我吃惊不小。他虽然不太能胜任镇长一职，但为人倒是不坏。再次感谢你。请接受这些金币和我的感激之情。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1996
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:305
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I think I might just allow the Fraternal Order of Silver to police the areas around Mist.\nMaybe they’d be able to hunt down all the evil people and leave this island a paradise."
msgstr "我也许应该让银色兄弟会管理浓雾镇及周边地区。他们有能力扫清所有恶势力，使浓雾岛成为人间天堂。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1997
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:306
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can’t believe those Silver Helms wanted to kill me!\nI’ve never done anything wrong in my life!\nWell, nothing more wrong than any other mayor at least.\nThank you again for stopping them."
msgstr "真不敢相信银舵那帮人竟打算杀害我！我一辈子都没做错事！嗯，我是说至少和其他镇长相比不坏。实在感谢你阻止了他们的阴谋。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1998
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:307
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Could you do the Temple of Baa a favor?\nIt appears that my brethren left the old temple to the northwest of here in a little too much of a hurry, and a candelabra necessary for some of our rituals was left behind.\nNone of the Baa priests want to go back because they’re afraid of whatever curse has been placed on the temple.\nIf you were to bring back the candelabra to me, however, I could reward you in their place."
msgstr "你能帮羊鸣教个忙吗？我的弟兄们逃离旧庙去了西北方，匆忙中把举行仪式必不可少的蜡烛台遗忘在庙里。没有一个神甫敢回去取，他们惧怕笼罩在神庙上的魔法诅咒，如果你能把蜡烛台取回来，我们会由衷感谢你并给你重赏。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:1999
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:308
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Did the curse frighten you away as well?\nI can understand.\nBaa is patient, however.\nShould you work up the courage to find the candelabra, I’m still prepared to compensate you for it."
msgstr "是否诅咒同样也使你畏缩不前了？我能理解。羊鸣教是有耐心的，快重整旗鼓去把蜡烛台拿回来，我正准备好好酬谢你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2000
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:309
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent!\nBaa be praised!\nI see you were not frightened of the curse after all.\nHere is your reward and thank you again for your assistance."
msgstr "好极了，赞美羊鸣教！你对魔法诅咒毫无畏惧，太了不起了。这是你的报酬，感谢你的援手。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2001
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:310
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Who would have thought that the evil I sought to fight all across Enroth would be found so close to my own home?\nGerrard Blackames was once my second in command.\nNot long before he murdered me he began corresponding with the Temple of Baa, and they began to feed him targets for our Order.\nI ended up being one of the targets, and Gerrard took control of the Order.\nNow, the Silver Helms are as evil as the people they hunt.\nI’m certain the Temple of Baa is responsible for the corruption of our Order.\nAt the same time, Gerrard’s brother, Marcus the Sorcerer, has been supplying the Silver Helms with high quality equipment.\nThe last I heard, Marcus was assisting someone in a forge on an island to the southeast."
msgstr "谁能料到我驰骋整个恩洛斯征讨的邪恶势力竟在我的眼皮底下。杰拉德·布莱克墨斯曾经是我的二把手。在谋杀我的不久前，他勾结羊鸣教，羊鸣教帮他除去兄弟会里反对他的人，我就是其中一个目标，我死后杰拉德控制了整个银色兄弟会。现在的银舵和他们过去追猎的敌人一样邪恶。我能肯定，我们兄弟会的腐败是羊鸣教导致的。另外，杰拉德的兄弟马库斯，一个巫师，为银舵提供了很多高质量装备，他现在正在东南方一个小岛上的炼铁厂中帮人干活。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2002
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:311
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My niece, Melody, has been kidnapped from her home in Mist and locked in a Silver Helm outpost near there.\nShe’s one of the few people who know that I’ve been murdered.\nI’m sure Gerrard has her locked up for that reason, but I believe he wants to force her into marriage to eliminate any opposition to his leadership of the Fraternal Order of Silver."
msgstr "我的侄女米拉达在浓雾岛被绑架，软禁在离岛不远处的银舵前哨内。她是极少数得知我已被害的知情者之一，肯定是因为这个，杰拉德绑架了她。他还逼我侄女与他成婚，以巩固他在银色兄弟会中的地位。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2003
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:312
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for saving my niece.\nBehind this wall is a secret area I’ve kept hidden from even Gerrard all these years.\nYou are welcome to take whatever you want; I’d prefer you have this than Gerrard."
msgstr "感谢你救了我的侄女。这堵墙后面是我连杰拉德也未透露的密室，你可以任意拿取你需要的东西。与其留给杰拉德，我更愿意让你带走。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2004
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:313
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Gerrard has an ankh inscribed with his name given to him by the priests of Baa.\nI’m not sure exactly what the ankh is used for, but he may use it to identify himself as a friend of Baa."
msgstr "羊鸣教的神甫曾给杰拉德一块刻有他名字的十字架。我不清楚这块铭牌到底有什么用，可能是为了证明他是羊鸣教的朋友。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2005
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:314
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You want to defeat Snergle, do you?\nWell, he knows how he stands among most dwarves.\nHe’s holed up in Rocklin’s old caverns surrounded by a horde of his loyal dwarves.\nIf anything were to happen in there, he’d just immediately lock himself in his private room and let his followers handle it.\nYou’ll need a key to get into his room; there’s no way you’ll bash down a high quality dwarven door.\nI was a steward for Rocklin– I know that room well and I happen to still have a key to it hidden on me.\nFortunately for you, I’m in this cell because of Snergle, and there’s nothing I’d rather see than his reign put to a quick end.\nHere’s the key– think of it as payment for letting me out of this cell."
msgstr "你是不是想打败斯纳格？他知道怎样在众矮人中立于不败之地。他现在深居于洛克林的旧岩洞里，并被忠于他的矮人部落守着。一旦发生意外，他就会立刻锁住寝宫的大门，一切由手下人对付。你必须得到寝宫的钥匙，不然根本打不开那扇牢不可破的石门。我曾是洛克林国王的管家，对那间屋子了如指掌，还藏了把钥匙。你真幸运。我被斯纳格监禁在这儿。我最想看到的是斯纳格的倒台。这是钥匙，是对你救我脱此牢笼的酬劳。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2006
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:315
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for releasing me.\nThe only thing keeping the Silver Helms from killing me was the fact I’m a priest.\nFrankly, I’m surprised they would show me any mercy at all.\nListen, I’ve heard some strange sounds coming from around here… I think there might be a hidden passage near here.\nIn any event, I should probably be leaving now; I don’t want to stay in this cell any longer."
msgstr "感谢你解救了我。我想也许因为我是神甫，银舵才没有对我下毒手。说实话，我真奇怪他们怎么还有点仁慈之心。我听到周围传来奇怪的声音，我想这里肯定隐藏着秘密。我现在该走了，这鬼地方我一刻也不想呆了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2007
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:316
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Dragoons that have been plaguing the roads around here recently stole a harp of mine from one of my caravans.\nI’m not strong enough to get it back from them, but I’m willing to pay someone capable to do it for me.\nFind the harp and return it, and I’ll reward you."
msgstr "龙骑兵在附近的道路上四处打劫，还抢劫我的商队，拿走了珍贵的竖琴。我可没能耐夺回我的竖琴，如果你能为我代劳，我会重重酬谢你的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2008
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:317
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My harp is still lost, so the reward is still available for it.\nI know the Dragoons base their operations to the south of here near the coast.\nPlease bring back my harp."
msgstr "我的竖琴仍未见踪影，但我的承诺还生效，我知道龙骑兵在南面的海滩附近有个基地，你可以去那儿看看，把竖琴夺回来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2009
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:318
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My gratitude!\nMy wife loves this harp; I’m so glad you were able to recover it!\nHere, take this as a reward.\nI’ve heard rumors that the Dragoons were working with the Shadow Guild.\nIf that’s the case, I’m sure the Mayor of New Sorpigal would love to see proof of it.\nThank you again for your assistance."
msgstr "万分感谢！我的妻子对这把竖琴喜爱极了，很高兴你把它完璧归赵。这是你的报酬。我听说龙骑兵在为阴影教做事。如果真有此事，新索匹格的镇长一定想要看到证据。再次感谢你对我的帮助。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2010
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:319
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, this IS a musical instrument, but it’s not a harp.\nLet me explain the difference:\nYou brought back a flute.\nA flute is a pipe with holes in it.\nA harp has strings.\nDoes that help?\nI’m sure they still have the harp and I will reward you well for its return."
msgstr "这是件乐器，但不是竖琴。让我来解释它们的区别：你带回来的是长笛，是有洞的管子，而竖琴有琴弦，懂了吗？我相信竖琴还在，你把它带回来我会报答你的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2011
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:320
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have a few theories about the undead that I would very much like to prove.\nWhat I really need is the remains of an undead creature, preferably a powerful one.\nActually, what I really need is the remains of the FIRST lich, Ethric the Mad.\nI am a scholar, however, and don’t have the means to gain such a specimen.\nI do have some money saved up, and I’d be willing to pay you well for Ethric’s remains."
msgstr "我钻研出了一些灵魂不死的理论，并想验证这些理论。我现在需要一具不死生物的残骸，最好是个强大的。其实，史上第一个巫妖——疯子埃斯里克的残骸，那是最好不过了。我只是个书生，没有能力得到他的残骸。但我存了些钱，如果你能帮我得到埃斯里克的残骸，我会酬谢你的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2012
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:321
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am well aware of the difficulty of the task, believe me.\nTake your time but at the least, do the job properly. "
msgstr "相信我，我对任务的艰巨性一清二楚。你可以慢慢做，但要把任务做好。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2013
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:322
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good work! Now I can conclude my research.\nIf I can learn how the Ritual of Endless Night works, perhaps I can find a way to reverse the process.\nHere is the reward I promised you. "
msgstr "你干得真不错。现在我可以完成我的研究了。如果我钻研出无尽黑夜仪式是怎样进行的，就能找出办法逆转这个过程。这是我许诺给你的报酬。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2014
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:323
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Our town is periodically plagued by giant spiders.\nI’m pretty sure that if the spider queen were killed, the rest of the spiders would go away.\nCurrently, I’m offering a reward to the person that can kill the spider queen."
msgstr "我的城镇总不时被巨型蜘蛛抢劫掠夺。我很确信如果把蜘蛛女王杀了，剩下的余党就会不战而逃了。现在我正在重金寻找能杀死蜘蛛女王的勇士。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2016
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:325
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What a gruesome trophy!\nThis heart proves you’ve defeated the wicked spider queen.\nHopefully now the spiders won’t plague New Sorpigal anymore.\nHere is the reward I promised."
msgstr "多么美妙的战利品。这颗蜘蛛的心脏证明你干掉了邪恶的蜘蛛女王。希望蜘蛛不再骚扰新索匹格镇了。这些是给你的报酬。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2017
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:326
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Cedric Druthers and his Celestial Order have taken over the Monolith, an ancient place sacred to druids.\nTheir dark rituals are corrupting the Monolith and they need to be stopped– whatever altar they use as the center of their ceremonies needs to be defaced.\nDo this for us and we will compensate you for your time and services."
msgstr "塞德里克·德鲁泽和他的苍穹会霸占了独立碑，这块碑对德鲁伊来说是个古老的圣地。他们所进行的黑暗仪式玷污了圣碑的纯洁，这种行为必须被制止，他们用作仪式中心的神坛必须被摧毁。请帮我们完成这项任务，我们会为此酬谢你的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2019
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:328
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for your help!\nPlease allow me to compensate you for your efforts.\nWe can rest more safely knowing that Cedric and his renegade druids are no longer polluting that sacred area. "
msgstr "感谢你的帮助，这是对你的努力的奖励。我们可以好好睡觉了，因为塞德里克和他那些德鲁伊背叛者们再也不能玷污这块圣洁的地区了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2020
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:329
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am a collector of rare and exotic creatures, and I make a living by selling some of these creatures as pets.\nCurrently, cobras are in great demand, and I don’t have many cobras left to sell.\nTherefore, I’m willing to pay handsomely for any cobra eggs you might have.\nRemember, if you find any cobra eggs, I’ll give you the best prices."
msgstr "我是个珍稀动物的收藏者。靠贩卖此类动物给人当宠物谋生。现在眼镜蛇很抢手，但我的存货不多。你如果手头上有眼镜蛇蛋我愿出高价。记住，如果你找到眼镜蛇蛋，我会出最令你满意的价钱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2021
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:330
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Excellent specimen!\nI should be able to hatch this in no time and help my flagging business.\nHere is my payment for this wonderful egg.\nI’ll buy any more cobra eggs you have as long as they are in demand."
msgstr "多么可爱的眼镜蛇蛋啊。我得马上孵化它们以加强我的旗舰业务。这是那些蛋的报酬。只要眼镜蛇蛋还有人要，你有多少我收购多少。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2025
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:334
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Near here is a temple dedicated to the Order of the Fist.\nI once belonged to that order, but recently they uncovered a powerful evil crystal.\nThey hope to use the crystal as a bargaining chip to be accepted into the Temple of Baa.\nI don’t want to see the crystal fall into Baa’s hands– it must be destroyed.\nPlease infiltrate the temple and destroy the crystal."
msgstr "附近有一处神拳会的庙宇。我曾是它的成员。最近他们发现了一颗能量强大的邪恶水晶。他们想以此为讨价还价的筹码申请加入羊鸣教。但我不想见到水晶落入羊鸣教的魔掌，必须毁掉它。请潜入庙里毁了那颗水晶。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2026
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:335
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must hurry and destroy the crystal before Baa claims it.\nI’m not sure how long it will take, so time is of the essence."
msgstr "你必须加紧行动，不然羊鸣教就要接收它了。我不知道还有多久，但无疑时间紧迫。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2027
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:336
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good work!\nI’m glad you made it in time.\nI don’t like to think about what Baa would have done with that crystal.\nYou have done all of Enroth a great service."
msgstr "干得好。很高兴你能及时完成任务。我可不愿看到羊鸣教用水晶来为非作歹，你为整个恩洛斯做了件大好事。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2028
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:337
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My husband, Emmanuel, went to Star Island a few weeks ago with a few friends hoping to find some treasure.\nI haven’t seen him since, and I’m worried about him.\nI don’t dare go to the island; it’s rumored to be the home of medusas!\nIf you could find him and bring him home, I would be very grateful."
msgstr "我的丈夫埃曼纽尔前些天和他的几个朋友去星岛寻找财宝。从那以后再也没见到他们，几天来一直为此而忧心忡忡。我不敢上那个岛，传言那是美杜莎女妖的老巢。如果你能找到他并把他带回来，我将感激不尽。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2029
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:338
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No luck?\nHe must be in grave danger if you did not find him.\nIf you do happen to find him, please bring him back here.\nI’ll be waiting for him."
msgstr "没找到？你没找到他说明他正处在危险之中。如果你有幸发现了他，请把他带回来，我一直在等着他的归来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2030
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:339
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh, thank you for bringing Emmanuel back to me!\nNothing in this world means as much to me as him!\nPlease take this as a reward.\nI know it’s not much, but you deserve it for bringing him back to me."
msgstr "哦，感谢你把埃曼纽尔带回我的身边。在这个世界上他对我来说意味着一切。请收下我的报酬，虽然不多，但聊表心意。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2033
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:342
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Could you help me get out of here?\nI need to get back to my wife in Blackshire."
msgstr "你能带我离开这儿吗？我要回布莱克郡和妻子团聚。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2034
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:343
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "An explorer friend of mine recently uncovered a powerful artifact, Mordred, in his travels.\nHe wanted to sell it to me, and shipped it here for me to decide if I wanted it.\nUnfortunately, raiders attacked the caravan it was on and stole the artifact.\nThey were last seen headed to an area west of Castle Temper; I’m sure they must have some sort of base there.\nIf you bring back Mordred for me, I’ll give you a cut of what I’m paying my friend for it."
msgstr "我的一个探险家朋友最近在旅途中发现一件威力强大的宝物，名字叫莫德里德。他想把它运来给我，问我是否有兴趣买下来。但不幸的是有人袭击了他们的商队并偷走了这件宝物。袭击者是向坦普城堡西面逃窜而去的。我想他们在那里肯定有个基地。如果你能把那件宝物夺回来，我将把宝物买卖的钱分一部分给你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2035
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:344
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello again.\nNo one has found Mordred yet, so our deal is still good.\nI’ll give you part of the selling price for the artifact if you return it."
msgstr "你好，还没有人找到莫德里德，我们的买卖仍然有效。如果你把它夺回来，我就把宝物买卖的钱分一部分给你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2036
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:345
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So this is the legendary Mordred, eh?\nInteresting, I was expecting something much grander.\nI don’t think I want it, actually.\nWhy don’t you keep it, and I’ll deal with my friend on the cost."
msgstr "啊？这就是极富传奇色彩的莫德里德？有意思，我还指望它会更神奇些呢。我对这玩意儿兴趣不大，你拿着吧，钱我自己会向我的朋友商量的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2037
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:346
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Members of the Shadow Guild have moved down south recently, and have been trying to exert their influence over merchants in the area.\nI refused them access to our town, so they kidnapped Sharry Carnegie, an old healer loved by the townspeople, in an attempt to ‘convince’ me to let them operate here.\nI can’t believe that their extortion has moved so far south, I thought I was safe from that down here.\nPlease rescue Sharry– I can offer you some money as a reward, and I’m sure the townsfolk would appreciate her return."
msgstr "阴影教的教众近来南下扩张，试图对该地区的商人施加影响。我拒绝他们进入我的城镇，他们竟然绑架了雪莱·卡耐基，我们镇德高望重的老医师，想以此来“说服”我让他们在此地经营。真不敢相信他们已经来到南岸来进行敲诈勒索了，我还以为在这里是安全的。请去营救雪莱吧，我会给你丰厚的报酬。全镇人民将对你感激不尽。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2038
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:347
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Have you found Sharry yet?\nNo?\nI’m sure she’s wherever the Shadow Guild is hiding out.\nFind them and you’ll find her."
msgstr "还没找到雪莱吗？我想阴影教肯定把她藏在阴影教众群居躲藏的地方了。找到他们就可以找到雪莱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2039
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:348
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you so much for saving Sharry!\nI can’t tell you how much this means to both New Sorpigal and myself.\nYou have our gratitude forever."
msgstr "十分感谢你搭救了雪莱！你为整个新索匹格镇作出了难以估量的贡献。我们对你的恩情将永远铭记在心。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2040
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:349
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Interesting.\nThe Dragoons were hired by the Shadow Guild.\nI’m certain Anthony Stone will want to hear about this.\nI’ll present this letter when I see him next. Thank you for this.\nI’m sure he will want to take action against the Shadow Guild now that we have some proof of their deeds."
msgstr "真有意思，阴影教竟然雇佣龙骑兵。我想安东尼·斯通肯定想了解这个消息。下次见到他时，我会把这封信给他看的。现在我们有了证据，斯通会对阴影教采取行动的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2041
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:350
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for rescuing me from these horrible ruffians!\nI’d like to go back home to New Sorpigal now."
msgstr "感谢你把我从这些可恶的歹徒手中营救出来！现在我想要回新索匹格我的家乡。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2042
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:351
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh dear, can you help me?\nMy daughter Angela is missing!\nI think she may have wandered into the abandoned temple near town, and if she did she could be in terrible danger– who knows what kind of horrible things are lurking in that cursed place!\nPlease find her and bring her back to me."
msgstr "哦，亲爱的，你能帮助我吗？我女儿安吉拉不见了！我想她也许在城镇附近的废庙中四处游荡，如果这样的话她的处境十分危险，天知道有什么可怕的东西在这诅咒笼罩的神庙中藏着！求求你找到她并带她回来 。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2043
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:352
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You didn’t find poor Angela?\nSomething horrible must have happened to her!"
msgstr "你还没有找到可怜的安吉拉吗？她一定遇到了什么不测！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2044
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:353
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "She’s alive!\nThank you so much for finding Angela!\nIf I weren’t so happy to see her, she’d be in a lot of trouble.\nPlease take this as a reward for all you’ve done."
msgstr "她还活着！你能找到她真是太好了！这些作为你的奖励，请收下吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2046
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:355
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A good friend of mine, Sherell, went with a group of friends to the islands in Bootleg Bay to explore an old temple rumored to be there.\nHer friends returned and said she was captured by cannibals on the island and taken to some ancient temple.\nI’m sure she doesn’t have much time before they do something dreadful to her, please rescue her!"
msgstr "我的好友谢勒尔与一群朋友为了寻找传言中的古庙共同去了布特雷格湾中的小岛，她的朋友回来说谢勒尔被岛上的食人族捉住了并囚禁在古庙里。我相信目前她还未遭毒手，但情况十分危急，请抓紧时间去营救她。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2047
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:356
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh dear!\nYou haven’t found her yet?\nSurely she must have been sacrificed or eaten or something.\nPlease try to find her, or at least avenge her death."
msgstr "哦，亲爱的，你还没找到她吗？她准是被祭天了，要么就是被吃了。请务必找到她，要是她已经不在人世了，请为她报仇。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2048
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:357
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wonderful!\nShe’s not dead after all!\nThank you for all your trouble.\nI hope you will accept this token of my gratitude."
msgstr "好极了！她还活着。真是麻烦你了。请收下我的一片感激之情。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2049
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:358
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello!\nPlease, oh please, get me out of this temple.\nI don’t want to die!"
msgstr "你好！求求你，请把我从这鬼地方带走吧，我不想死！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2050
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:359
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Our town is under a terrible curse, though most people don’t believe it.\nUnder a full moon, we all change into werewolves.\nAlthough none of us are truly evil, we don’t really know what sort of horrible things we do as werewolves.\nWe can’t approach our lord, Acton Spindler about the problem because he doesn’t realize that we are the werewolves.\nPlease find a way to turn us back to normal!"
msgstr "我们的镇子正被一个可怕的诅咒笼罩着，尽管大多数人都不相信这个事实。在满月之际，我们全都会变成狼人。虽然我们都不是恶人，但我们并不知道自己变成狼人后做了什么可怕的事情。我们也不方便把这事禀告艾克顿·斯宾德勒爵士，他现在还并没有意识到我们就是那些狼人。请你想方设法让我们恢复正常吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2051
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:360
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Is there no hope for us?\nPlease promise me you’ll keep searching for a way to reverse the curse and turn us back to normal people."
msgstr "我们真的没希望了吗？求求你想个办法解除咒语把我们变为正常人吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2052
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:361
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you!\nWe can now sleep at night without worrying about what kinds of foul acts we will commit as monsters!\nIt’s a tragedy that our lord was a werewolf himself; he’ll be sorely missed.\nPlease accept this for your help, and for believing in us."
msgstr "太谢谢你了。现在我们晚上可以平平安安地睡觉了，用不着担心夜间会像野兽一样四处游荡为非作歹。真不幸连爵士自己都被变成了狼人，我们会怀念他的。为了感谢你对我们的信任和帮助，请收下这些。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2053
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:362
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Blackshire has been plagued by werewolves lately.\nThese caves must be where the werewolves are coming from!\nHowever, I will need help destroying them.\nYou’re welcome to any of the treasure we find.\nI’m only concerned with destroying them once and for all!"
msgstr "布莱克郡近来时常受到狼人的骚扰。这些岩洞肯定是它们的老巢。我需要有人帮我捣毁这些洞穴。如果你能办到，我们的财宝将任你挑选。我要你将它们一网打尽。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2055
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:364
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I was a guest at Lord Spindler's manor when it was attacked by a band of werewolves that had tunneled in from the mountains.\nI fought my way back down the tunnels they had created hoping to escape.\nEventually, they cornered me and I was killed at this very spot. "
msgstr "当狼人从山区挖掘隧道进入斯宾德勒的领地大肆杀戮时我正在他家作客。我杀开一条血路，想从隧道逃走，但最后还是被狼人逼到死胡同杀了，就在现在这个地方。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2056
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:365
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "In my flight, I managed to hide the Pearl of Purity in these caverns.\nThe pearl will both protect you from the curse of the werewolves, and will also destroy the Altar of the Wolf if the pearl touches it.\nThat should free everyone afflicted by the curse these werewolves have caused.\nThe pearl is at the end of the cavern across from this one.\nPlease do me one favor, return the Pearl to Wilbur Humphrey.\nHe is the lord in charge of paladins and the pearl belongs with him."
msgstr "在我逃跑的途中，我把纯洁珍珠藏在这里的岩洞里。珍珠可以保护你免受狼人的诅咒。如果珍珠放在狼之祭坛上还可以破坏祭坛，这样就可以解除狼人的诅咒。珍珠就在这个岩洞的尽头，请帮我个忙，把珍珠交给威尔伯·汉弗里。他是所有圣武士的首领，珍珠应该放在他那儿。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2057
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2058
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:366
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:367
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The werewolf leader possesses the Pearl of Putrescence, the opposite of my Pearl of Purity.\nWith this pearl, he has been able to cause the curse.\nI was never able to kill him in my retreat.\nI will be able to rest in peace knowing that he has been defeated."
msgstr "狼人首领拥有腐败珍珠，它是我的纯洁珍珠的天生对头。他正是用这颗珍珠施放诅咒的。我撤退时无法为民除害，现在我把此事拜托给你了。希望能得到你的好消息。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2059
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:368
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for defeating the werewolf leader.\nI wish that I had been strong enough to stop this from happening.\nPlease accept my thanks for allowing my spirit to move on.\nI will take the pearl away so that it may no longer cause any harm to the people of Enroth."
msgstr "感谢你打败了狼人首领。我一直愧疚自己不够强大，没能阻止这场悲剧的发生。你让我的灵魂可以摆脱愧疚，继续走下去了。真是太感谢你了。我得把珍珠带走，免得它在恩洛斯继续危害人间。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2060
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:369
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What’s this?\nYou have the Pearl of Purity?\nI thought Balthasar– oh, he’s dead is he?\nI’ll keep it for now, then, as per his last wishes.\nThank you on behalf of both him and me."
msgstr "这是什么？啊，你拿到了纯洁珍珠。看到这个令我想起了巴塞萨，哦，他已经去世了是吗？遵从他的遗愿，我将保存这珍珠。我以我们两人共同的名义感谢你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2065
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:374
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You no goblin!\nYou leave!\nWe take castle to watch over humans!\nYou no more kill us!"
msgstr "你不是大耳！你走！我们用城堡观察人！你们再不能杀我们！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2066
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:375
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good work removing the goblins from this keep.\nWe have the situation mostly under control now, though your help is always appreciated."
msgstr "感谢你把大耳怪从堡垒中赶走了，我们已经完全控制了局势。对你的见义勇为行为真是非常感谢。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2067
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:376
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello again, my pupils!\nI'm afraid there is nothing more I can teach you– your experiences must guide you from this point on.\nI know nothing more than you do about the devils that destroyed Sweet Water, but I know who you need to ask.\nThe Oracle in Free Haven will know what to do to rid Enroth of the terrible devils.\nUnfortunately, you will need the approval of the six High Council members, each of which represents one of the lords of Enroth.\nYou must do whatever necessary to speak to the Oracle in Free Haven and rid Enroth of the devils."
msgstr "你们好，我的孩子们！真高兴能再次见到你们。我这老头如今没什么用，不能再教给你们什么东西了，以后的路要靠你们自己去闯荡。至于那天晚上袭击甜水镇的恶魔，我对它们也几乎一无所知。但我知道有人知道这其中的一切。那就是在自由天堂的神使。只有神使清楚该如何除掉这群横行恩洛斯的恶魔。但是拜见神使必须得到高级议会六个成员的一致同意，每个成员代表了恩洛斯的每个爵士的意见。无论如何，你必须想尽一切办法得到神使的面授机宜，把恩洛斯的魔怪们杀个干净。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2068
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:377
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As you may know, the last members of the Necromancers' Guild in Enroth fled to Castle Darkmoor after their defeat in the Succession War.\nWho knows what foul magics they're concocting while we wait around.\nI'm certain that the book containing the Ritual of Endless Night, known as the Book of Liches, has been moved into that castle.\nIf the book were to be destroyed, it would deal a severe blow to whatever evil plans they have.\nI've tried a few times to get to the book, but the castle is too well defended.\nIf you are able to destroy the book, come back to me and I'll reward you personally."
msgstr "你也许听说过，自从死灵法师教派在王位争夺战争中遭到重创后，他们的残部就躲进了黑摩尔城堡。谁知道他们现在在捣什么鬼！但我确信记载有无尽黑夜仪式过程的巫妖之书被他们带入了城堡，如果能把这本书毁了，就能打乱这个邪派的行动步骤。为了得到这本书我努力了好几次，可惜都因为城堡的防御太严而功败垂成。如果你能把这本书销毁，我会重谢你的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2069
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:378
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There's no rush in destroying the book.\nIf you manage it, come back and talk to me.\nI'm not sure it's even possible to get to the book and destroy it– there are far too many evil creatures in that castle."
msgstr "我并不急于销毁此经书。如果你成功了，就回来领取奖赏。如果失败了也没什么大不了的，毕竟城堡中的怪兽实在太多了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2070
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:379
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Incredible!\nI didn't expect you'd be able to do it.\nNow that the Book of Liches is gone, the Necromancers' Guild here in Enroth will slowly fade away.\nThis is all thanks to you!\nHere, take this as a reward and accept my gratitude as well."
msgstr "真是难以置信！我本来对你不抱多少希望，想不到你干得如此出色。现在巫妖之书被毁了，死灵法师教派已经死到临头了。我对你的此行动感激不尽，请收下我的报酬和我的一片谢意。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2071
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:380
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I was once the court magician, long ago.\nThat all ended when Archibald… disrupted… things.\nArchibald had acquired some skill as a sorcerer and had knowledge of spells beyond that taught to magicians today, and therefore didn’t require my services.\nSince then, I’ve lived in this little shack, conducted my own research, and have grown old."
msgstr "很久以前我曾是宫廷魔法师。但自从阿基巴德犯上作乱后，一切都变得面目全非。阿基巴德作为巫师拥有傲世群伦的魔法技能。他掌握了几项现已失传的咒语，所以再也不需要我了。从此我隐居在此潜心钻研我的魔法，任凭岁月流逝，消蚀着我的生命。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2072
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:381
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I’ve discovered a way to reverse the effects of time and make myself young again.\nThis requires a complex magical ritual, which I’ve worked out.\nThe problem is that I need to place magical statuettes on various pedestals. The tiger statuette goes on the pedestal near Sweet Water, the bear statuette in Kriegspire, the eagle statuette in Dragonsand, the wolf statuette in the Mire of the Damned, and the dragon statuette in Bootleg Bay.\nThe distances are too far for me to travel in my old age, and in the meantime I need to prepare the ritual itself.\nThere is no way I can do all of this on my own; I need your help.\nThe statuettes are in the chest outside my house.\nPlace them on the pedestals and return to me.\nEven if the ritual is a failure, I'll pay you for your efforts."
msgstr "我研制出一种魔法可以使时间倒转，让我重获青春。这需要进行一项复杂的仪式。我知道如何进行这项仪式。但问题是我需要把这些魔法小雕像放各地的底座上。虎像放在甜水镇；熊像放在克里格斯镇；鹰像放在飞龙沙漠；狼像放在幽灵沼泽；龙像放在布特雷格湾。我年纪大了，走不了这么远的路，而且我还要准备仪式，没法自己亲自完成整个程序，我需要你的帮助。小雕像就在我屋子外面的箱子里，把它们放到各地相应的底座上，即使实验失败了，你回来后我仍会重重酬谢你的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2073
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:382
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I was one of the mages studying at Kriegspire when the creatures there went completely out of control.\nIn my escape from the castle, I left a valuable item behind, a jeweled egg.\nThis egg is a family heirloom that goes back in my family as far as the Silence.\nI have tried a few times to get it back, but the creatures there are too powerful for me.\nI’d gladly trade a generous sum of money to get my egg back."
msgstr "当克里格斯城堡的怪兽造反时，我正在那里学习魔法。我立即逃离该城堡，匆忙中把一颗价值连城的宝石蛋忘在那里。这颗宝石蛋是我们家的传家宝，从寂静时代流传至今。我屡次想夺回宝石蛋，但怪兽警卫森严，我又不是他们的对手。谁能替我把宝石蛋夺回来，我就重重赏他。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2074
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:383
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Kriegspire is the castle inside the volcano.\nWe mages were forced to raise the earth around the castle to try and prevent the creatures from overrunning the surrounding towns.\nNow they’re contained inside, and that’s where the egg is."
msgstr "克里格斯城堡是一座火山中的城堡。我们魔法师们害怕怪兽危害周围的城镇，就把城堡周围的泥土堆积起来不让他们出来。现在他们就在城堡里，而宝石蛋也在里面。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2076
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:385
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am the Lord of Fire, an immortal earth spirit.\nMy power is drawn from below the earth.\nThe channels that I use have been blocked by doors warded with powerful magic in the north.\nI need you to unward the doors so that I may awaken again.\nThough the enchantments on them are powerful, amber will break the ward on the doors."
msgstr "我是烈火爵士，长生不朽的土地神。我的能量来自于土地深处。但是现在，我汲取能量的通道被北边的几扇门封住了，这几扇门被强大的魔力锁住。我需要你解开这些门上的魔力之锁，让我的力量能够再次觉醒。虽然这些魔力之锁很强大，但琥珀可以破坏它们。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2077
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:386
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you get lost in the caverns, you may find assistance from my servants.\nIf you have a piece of amber, they will assume you are under my care and will teleport you back to me if you talk to them.\nIf you do not have any amber, they will drain with some of your life force as payment for teleporting you back up here.\nDon’t worry, they rarely kill anyone."
msgstr "如果你在岩洞中迷路了，可以向我的仆人求助。如果你有琥珀的话，他们就会认为你是我的贵客，你可以请他们把你远程传送回到我的身边。但如果你没有琥珀也不要紧，他们会吸走你一些生命力用来传送你。不要担心，这一般不会致命。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2078
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:387
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The doors became warded when a strange creature came to reside here.\nI am not familiar with this type of being, and I’ve seen many types in my long time here in Enroth.\nI do not know why it chose this place as its home, or why there is only one, but I would like to see it destroyed for the trouble it has caused me. "
msgstr "自从一个奇怪的生物来此定居后，这几扇门就被魔力锁住了。我在恩洛斯大陆上活了这么久，千奇百怪的东西见过不少，却不知这个生物是什么玩意儿。真不明白为什么它会在这里定居，为什么它仅此一只。我希望有人把它给除掉，它给我带来了不少麻烦。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2079
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:388
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As patient as I am, I would like to see the channels I use to sustain me opened again.\nPlease do not fail."
msgstr "我是个有耐心的人，我希望能量通道能够再次畅通无阻。你是我挑选的最佳人选，我不会看错人的，加油干吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2080
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:389
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you for your assistance.\nI am grateful to you for returning my source of sustenance to me.\nI need to recharge what little power I have left now that I am able to again."
msgstr "多谢你的援助，使我重新取得了能量来源。我要把失去的能量汲取回来，重振雄风。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2082
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:391
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So, Sir John was murdered and the Silver Helms were bought off by the Temple of Baa?\nThat explains a great deal.\nGood work on bringing this to me, but you’ll need to collect your reward from Anthony Stone."
msgstr "所以说，约翰爵士被杀害了，银舵已经被羊鸣教收买了？那倒是解释了过去发生的很多事。你们把这个带给我，干得真不错，不过你们得去安东尼·斯通那儿拿取报酬。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2083
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:392
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I should have known Baa was behind this, they seem to be behind everything.\nThank you for bringing this to me.\nIt answers the questions I had about the Fraternal Order of Silver."
msgstr "我早该知道是羊鸣教在背后捣鬼，几乎每个阴谋都有他们在暗中策划。多谢你们把这个带给我。它解释了我对银色兄弟会的疑问。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2084
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:393
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "So Baa was behind the corruption of the Silver Helms and the murder of Sir John Silver?\nWhat a tragedy for Sir John, rest his soul.\n<blink> Loretta told you to collect the reward from me?\nGreedy witch.\nHere, your services should not go unrewarded."
msgstr "所以是羊鸣教幕后主导了银舵的腐化和约翰·席尔瓦爵士的谋杀？他真是不幸，愿他的灵魂能在天堂安息。<流泪>劳里达要你到我这里拿报酬？她真是个铁公鸡。好吧，这些是给你的报酬。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2085
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:394
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good work!\nHave you ever thought about assisting me full-time?\nI could certainly use reliable help.\nI've managed to collect a variety of trinkets over the years, so please help yourself to a few of these in payment for your services.\nI need to clean up a few things here, but I think I'll head back to Castle Ironfist in a bit and see if there's an opening for a court magician."
msgstr "真是干得太好了。你们是否考虑一直跟着我干？我多年来收集了不少饰品，你们可以尽情拿取，作为对你们的酬劳。我得在这儿料理一些事情，然后回到铁拳城堡去看看那里是否欢迎我这样的前宫廷魔法师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2086
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:395
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks!\nI can't wait to take this to Abdul's Desert Resort and see what I get!\nOh, here's the money I owe you."
msgstr "多谢了！我可等不及把这东西带到阿卜杜的沙漠胜地去换东西了。这是我的酬谢，请收下。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2087
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:396
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My favorite wine is the stuff they give you for winning at the circus.\nI'll pay 300 gold for any keg of wine from the circus that you can bring me."
msgstr "我对你在马戏团里赢来的好酒十分感兴趣，只要你有，我出价每桶酒300个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2088
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:397
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My favorite!\nThanks for the wine!\nHere's 300 gold, it's well worth the price."
msgstr "我的宝贝！感谢你为我带来了好酒！这是300个金币，真是物有所值。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2089
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:398
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have an incredible teeth collection, but I'm always looking for more.\nIf you find a tooth I don't have in my collection, I'll pay you 500 gold for it."
msgstr "我对牙齿有异乎寻常的收集爱好，而且永远得不到满足。如果你有珍稀少见的牙齿，我会出价500个金币收购。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2091
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:400
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have been to the circus three times, and I can't win anything.\nAll I really want are the nifty four leaf clovers they use as prizes there.\nI'll pay 25 gold for any four leaf clover you bring me."
msgstr "我曾去过马戏团三次，但每次都一无所获。我对那里的奖品四叶草爱不释手，如果你有，我出价每片25个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2092
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:401
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm so tired of the Shadow Guild, but I don't have any substantial proof of their activities.\nI'd love to have something I could show to Anthony Stone proving the Shadow Guild is up to no good down here."
msgstr "我对阴影教已深恶痛绝了，但没有掌握他们罪行的充分证据，没办法处罚他们。如果有确凿的证据，我就能禀告安东尼·斯通爵士，把他们绳之以法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2093
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:402
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "One of the few remaining Paladin artifacts left is the Pearl of Purity.\nBalthasar was in possession of the pearl the last I heard.\nHe was visiting Lord Spindler in Blackshire, but I haven't heard anything from him in months."
msgstr "纯洁珍珠是圣武士的宝物中仅存的一件，它最后落在巴塞萨的手里。听说他曾经在布莱克郡造访斯宾德勒爵士，但近来已经有好几个月没有他的音讯了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2095
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:404
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Recently, the Fraternal Order of Silver has been disrupting my business and my caravans.\nI'm not sure why Sir John feels it necessary, but I'd like this to stop.\nIf you could convince him to leave me alone, I'm sure I could give you a portion of the money you would be saving me."
msgstr "最近银色兄弟会不断骚扰我的生意，打劫我们的商队。真不知道为什么约翰爵士不加以管束。这种情况必须制止。如果你能说服他不再给我添麻烦，我会给你大量金币作为报酬。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2096
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:405
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Fraternal Order of Silver has begun more direct attacks on my legitimate, underworld associates.\nI would appreciate it greatly if you could talk to Sir John and learn why he feels these actions are necessary."
msgstr "银色兄弟会对我合法组织的攻击已经变本加厉了。如果你能去和约翰爵士谈谈，了解他为什么会容忍手下的残暴行径，我将对你感激不尽。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2097
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:406
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hurray!\nThis is much easier and much less embarrasing than going to the circus and losing!\nHere's 25 gold!"
msgstr "太棒了。到马戏团来一试身手十分方便，输了也不失面子，真是不错。这是你的25个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2098
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:407
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard it's possible to find large chunks of amber in a series of caves north of Castle Ironfist.\nI never have the time to leave Free Haven, but I'd love to get my hands on some of that amber.\nI'll pay 500 gold for any piece of amber."
msgstr "我听说铁拳城堡北面的洞穴里有储量丰富的琥珀。我在自由天堂一直忙碌，无法抽身，但我对这些琥珀很感兴趣。每颗琥珀我出价500个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2099
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:408
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "This will do nicely!\nThank you for the amber, here is the 500 gold I promised you."
msgstr "真是太棒了！感谢你的琥珀，这是我答应你的500个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2101
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:410
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good work!\nI have my youth again, thanks to you– have you ever thought about assisting me full-time?\nI could certainly use reliable help.\nI've managed to collect a variety of trinkets over the years, so please help yourself to a few of these in the chest outside as payment for your services.\nI need to clean up a few things here, but I think I'll head back to Castle Ironfist and see if there's an opening for a court magician."
msgstr "真是个奇迹，我又重获青春，实在太感谢你们了。你们是否考虑一直跟着我干？我多年来收集了不少饰品，就在外面的箱子里，你们可以尽情拿取，作为对你们的酬劳。我得在这儿料理一些事情，然后回到铁拳城堡去看看那里是否欢迎我这样的前宫廷魔法师。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2123
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:432
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You must satisfy the six High Council members in Free Haven to visit the Oracle.\nEach lord will request a task of you to earn their favor.\nPerform each of these tasks and then talk to the Council member of that Lord to gain their approval.\nOnce all the members of the High Council give their permission, you will be allowed to visit the Oracle."
msgstr "要拜见神使，必须先使自由天堂高级议会的六个议员满意。恩洛斯六爵士每位都会给你布置一项任务，完成这项任务后，这名爵士在议会中的代表就会支持你。一旦议员一致通过，你就可以拜见神使了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2125
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:434
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It appears that Slicker Silvertongue is a traitor on the Council.\nYou will need proof to convince Regent Humphrey and have Slicker removed from the Council.\nGo to the Superior Temple of Baa in Kriegspire and return with proof associating Slicker with the Temple of Baa."
msgstr "看起来斯里克·席尔瓦托恩就是隐藏在议会中的叛徒。你必须用证据说服摄政王威尔伯·汉弗里，把叛徒逐出议会。你得到克里格斯的顶级羊鸣庙去一趟，把斯里克和羊鸣教阴谋勾结的确凿证据带回来。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2126
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:435
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The Oracle has been asleep since Archibald performed his mischief on it.\nYou will need the four memory crystals to revive the Oracle.\nThey can be found on Hermit's Isle, in Castle Alamos, in Castle Kriegspire, and in Castle Darkmoor."
msgstr "在阿基巴德对神使动了手脚之后，神使就沉睡至今。要使其重新觉醒，你需要四块记忆水晶。它们分别在隐士岛、阿拉莫斯城堡、克里格斯城堡和黑摩尔城堡。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2127
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:436
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "To gain access to the Control Center, you will need the Control Cube located in the Temple of VARN in Dragonsand.\nBring the Cube back to the Oracle to gain admittance into the Control Center.\nThe Kreegan reactor is immune to all attacks.\nOnly the ancient weapons from the Control Center will harm the reactor.\nMake sure you have these weapons and the skill to use them."
msgstr "要进入控制中心，必须先得到飞龙沙漠维兰神殿内的控制块。把控制块交还给神使，就可以进入控制中心了。克里根人的反应器免疫任何类似的攻击，它的唯一克星是控制中心内储存的上古兵器。你一定要拿到这些兵器并掌握使用它们的技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2130
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:439
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Before you destroy the reactor, you will need a spell capable of containing the resulting explosions.\nYou must free Archibald from his stone prison.\nTalk to Nicolai and bring him the Third Eye– he will allow you to use Tanir's Bell to turn Archibald back to normal.\nFrom there, you should be able to convince Archibald to give you the knowledge you need."
msgstr "在破坏反应器之前，你必须取得一种能将反应器的爆炸包裹控制起来的魔法。所以你必须把阿基巴德从石化中解放出来。先和尼古拉交谈，把“第三只眼”交给他，他会让你用坦耐尔之铃使阿基巴德恢复原形。然后你就可以说服阿基巴德传授你想要的魔法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2131
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:440
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now you must destroy the Kreegan Hive.\nDestroy the reactor, defeat their queen, and make sure to escape with the Ritual of the Void and you will succeed in your task."
msgstr "现在你必须摧毁克里根人的蜂房，破坏反应器，击败他们的女王，然后携带着虚空仪式书从那里逃脱，任务就成功完成了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2133
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:442
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Welcome to my Desert Resort!\nYou'll notice we don't have the riff-raff associated with the towns and villages of the lands here.\nTake a moment to relax and enjoy the serenity of the desert, my friends.\nIf you're interested, we have a few traders here that will trade rare items for weapons and armor– it may be worth your while to check them out."
msgstr "欢迎来到我的沙漠胜地。你也许注意到了我们这地方不像一般的城镇那样鱼龙混杂，乌烟瘴气。在这里你可以尽情享受沙漠中的静谧，彻底地得到放松。如果你感兴趣的话，我们这里专门有人用珍稀之物交换兵器和铠甲，如果你是个行家的话，一定会感到不虚此行的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2134
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:443
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It seems rumors abound about my little Resort.\nAlas, the Fountain of Youth everyone seems to be talking about is not here, it's a few days journey to the west."
msgstr "现在流传着一些关于我的这个胜地的谣言。其实人们所说的阿拉斯这个返老还童的喷泉并不在这里，它在西面的某个地方，从这里出发有几天的路程。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2135
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:444
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello!\nI've got great suits of armor that I'll trade for golden pyramids or kegs of wine."
msgstr "你好！我愿意用一套上好的铠甲交换金字塔或桶装酒。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2145
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:454
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm collecting used magic lamps, but I don't have any money.\nI'll trade you some of these pretty stones for the lamps, though."
msgstr "我专门收集使用过的魔法神灯。现在我身上身无分文，我用些漂亮的石头换你的神灯，怎么样？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2146
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npctext.txt.py:455
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks for the lamp!\nHere are your stones."
msgstr "谢谢你给我神灯，这是给你的石头。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2154
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "To travel through time and step onto the paths meant to be traversed by other heroes, you will need to use dimension doors present in areas infused with magic. Fear not, they're safe. Somewhat.\nYou'll find one of them in Murmurwoods, another in Dragonsand, and, if I recall correctly, one more awaits on the Evenmorn Island. There could be more. Or not. Who knows? Either way, once you find your door, you can activate it by casting the Town Portal spell nearby. There's also the option of finding Dimension Door scrolls rolling around with other junk at some stores. I think most folks take them for dicey cooking recipes, so ask for those.\nNo need to rush, by the way. The Universe is slow in restructuring itself and acting on the changes made to the fabric of time, but do try to get it all done before you get old, aye?"
msgstr "要穿越时间，踏上本该由其他英雄行走的道路，你需要借助那些藏身于充满魔力之地的维度门。别担心，它们是安全的——算是吧。\n你能在低语森林中找到一扇，飞龙沙漠里还有一扇，如果我没记错的话，埃弗蒙岛上也有一扇在等着你。说不定还有更多，也说不定没有，谁知道呢？不管怎样，一旦你找到了门，只要在附近施放时空之门法术就能将其激活。你也可以在一些商店里和其他杂货混在一起的维度门卷轴中碰碰运气。不过我猜大多数人会把它们当成什么邪门的烹饪配方，所以你得特意开口要这个。\n顺便说一句，不必着急。宇宙重整自身、让改变落实到时间的经纬里，是个很缓慢的过程，不过你还是尽量在自己老掉之前把这事儿办妥吧，好吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2268
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Well, I have no skills to offer, but I'm good company!\nJust feed me and throw me a few gold pieces and I'll be happy to accompany you!"
msgstr "好吧，尽管我身无长技，但是个相当不错的旅行伴侣。你只要管我吃饱，再给些零花钱，我就乐意跟你们去探险！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2269
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'll happily join you for 200 gold and %17 percent of all the gold we find.\nI'll fix any weapon you ask me to while I work for you."
msgstr "我很高兴加入你的队伍。不过你得付我200个金币，并分我所找到的金币的百分之%17。我会修补你交给我的所有兵器。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2270
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm looking for work fixing armor.\nAll I charge is 200 gold to start and %17 percent of all the gold we find.\nYou won't regret hiring me!"
msgstr "我专职修补铠甲。如果你付我200个金币并分给我所找到的金币的百分之%17。你一定会觉得物有所值的！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2271
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can mend any broken magic item you have, unless it's a piece of armor or a weapon.\nMy rate is 400 gold to start plus %17 percent of all the gold we find."
msgstr "我可以修复你交给我的所有魔法物件，这不包括兵器和铠甲。你必须付我400个金币，并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2272
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I studied under Lord Newton in Mist for eight years to learn to tell one magic item from another.\nI'll work for you for 500 gold to start, plus a %17 percent share of all the gold we find."
msgstr "我在浓雾镇的魔法学校修炼了八年，钻研如何鉴定物品。你只要付我500个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我就加入你的队伍。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2273
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know shortcuts and back roads throughout Enroth.\nI'll be your guide for a mere 100 gold to start and a %17 percent share of all the gold we find."
msgstr "我对整个恩洛斯的地形了如指掌，知道所有的近路。你付我100个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我就为你领路。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2274
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know shortcuts and back roads throughout Enroth.\nI'll be your guide for 200 gold to start, plus a %17 percent share of the gold we find."
msgstr "我对整个恩洛斯的地形了如指掌，知道所有的近路。你付我200个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我就为你领路。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2275
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know shortcuts and back roads throughout Enroth.\nI'll be your guide for a mere 300 gold to start, plus a %17 percent share of the gold we find."
msgstr "我对整个恩洛斯的地形了如指掌，知道所有的近路。你付我300个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我就为你领路。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2276
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Uh, Ya.\nI can uh, you know, work.\nOn a boat.\nI'll help get you places quicker.\nWith me, I can get you across the sea two days faster than normal.Uh, I uh, want oh, let's see, 100 gold to start, and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "啊，我可是个经验丰富的水手。如果你坐船航行，我可以使行程缩短两天的路程。不过你得付我100个金币，并分给我所找到的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2277
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've spent quite some time putting together accurate charts of the waters surrounding our continent.\nWith my charts and my skill, I can get you across water three days faster than normal.\nI charge 200 gold to start, plus %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "我对大陆周围的水路了如指掌，凭我的高超航海技能，我可以使航程缩短三天的路程。不过你得付我200个金币，并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2278
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can travel with you, my children, for an initial donation of 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find to my church.\nOnce per day I'll be able to heal you of all your wounds, short of death."
msgstr "你只要付我500个金币，并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我就跟你的队伍走。每天一次我将治疗你们的所有伤口，只要还没有一命归西。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2279
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As an expert healer, I can heal your wounds and many other conditions (but not death or turned to stone) once per day.\nAll I require is a donation of 2000 to my church and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "作为一个医术专家，我每天一次可以治愈你们的伤口和各种不利状态（死亡和石化状态除外）。你只要向我的教堂奉献2000个金币并分给你所发现的金币的百分之%17就行了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2280
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As a master healer, my services are in demand by many, but my power to magically heal only works but once per day.\nI can heal everything but eradication, and require a modest initial donation of 5000 gold to my temple and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "作为医术大师，求我治病的人络绎不绝，但我每天只能治疗一次。除了灰飞烟灭状态，我几乎可包治百病。你必须向我的神庙捐献5000个金币并分给你所找到的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2281
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can help you to interpret and understand what you see as you travel. I think my advice will increase your overall experience.\nI must charge 300 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find for my services, however."
msgstr "我能向你解释和了解一路上的所见所闻。我的忠告可以提高你的经验值。我的要价是300个金币并分给我你所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2282
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can help you to interpret and understand what you see as you travel. I think my advice will increase your overall experience.\nI must charge 700 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find for my\nservices, however."
msgstr "我能向你解释和了解一路上的所见所闻。我的忠告可以提高你的经验值。我的要价是700个金币并分给我你所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2283
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Everyone benefits from good advice, and my advice on weapons and combat is amongst the best.\nDuring battle, my direction will improve your skill at arms.\nI charge but 300 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "忠告总能使人受益。而我关于兵器和战斗的见解更是非凡。在对敌作战中，我的指点会大大提高你的兵器技能。你只要付我300个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2284
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Everyone benefits from good advice, and my advice on weapons and combat is the best.\nDuring battle, my direction will significantly improve your skill at arms.\nI charge but 400 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "忠告总能使人受益。而我关于兵器和战斗的见解更是非凡。在对敌作战中，我的指点会大大提高你的兵器技能。你只要付我400个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2285
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can lend a little magic to boost your spell skills and ease your magical burden for 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "我会为你指点迷津，提高你的魔法技能，减轻你的负担。我的要价是500个金币并分给我你所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2286
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can lend a good deal of magic to magnify your spell skills for 1000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "我会为你指点迷津，大大提高你的魔法技能，传授你锦囊妙计。我的要价是1000个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2287
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can lend my considerable magic reserves to sharply increase your spell skills and effects for the low, low price of 2000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "我会为你指点迷津，大大提高你的魔法技能，传授你锦囊妙计。我的要价相当便宜，2000个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2288
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sometimes, people have trouble bargaining in their own behalf.\nI'll be happy to give you advice to better the prices you receive while bargaining with Merchants.\nAll I ask is 100 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "有些时候人们总是碍于面子不喜欢和别人讨价还价。我却可以在你和商人做生意时给你些忠告。我的要价是100个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2289
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "As a long time member of the Merchant's Guild, and a former rug Merchant myself, I know all the tricks of the trade like the back of my hand.\nI can give you advice while bargaining with other Merchants to improve the prices you get.\nMy fee is but 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "作为一个资深的商人行会成员和一个精明的商人，我对经商的伎俩了如指掌。我会帮助你和别人讨价还价，得到一个合理的价位。我的要价是200个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2290
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My eyes are sharp, and my voice is loud.\nI can alert you to danger before it strikes.\nMay save your life…And all I need is 300 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "我的目光锐利，嗓音洪亮，可以在危险来临前事先警告你，说不定还能救你们一命。我的要价是300个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2291
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've spent my life in and around courts and bureaucracies, and I know how to make people more…sympathetic to a cause.\nHire me, and I'll do the same for you.\n200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "我一生出入于官场及法院，知道如何博得别人的同情。如果你付我200个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我会教你这套东西的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2292
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've spent my life in and around courts and bureaucracies, and I know how to make people more…sympathetic to a cause.\nHire me, and I'll do the same for you.\n300 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "我一生出入于官场及法院，知道如何博得别人的同情。如果你付我300个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我会教你这套东西的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2293
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I know a thing or two about fixing tools and whatnot.\nI also know about locks.\nI can help you pick them if you hire me for 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "我对修理工具和开锁等技能都略知一二。如果你付我200个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我就尽心尽力为你效劳。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2294
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Locksmithing is a difficult thing to learn, and you need a professional with you to help you handle the toughest locks.\nI can work for you for 300 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "开锁可是门技能活，不是每个人都能轻易学会的。在历险中你们一定需要一个专家锁匠为你们解决问题。如果你们付我300个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我就为你们效劳。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2295
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The gods favor drunks, children and fools.\nWell, I'm a fool!\nTake me with you and maybe the gods will favor you too.\nAll I want is 100 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find"
msgstr "众神总对小狗、孩子和傻瓜们青睐有加。我就是个傻瓜，让我与你们同行，说不定众神也会宠爱你们。我只要100个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2296
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "People say Chimney Sweeps are lucky.\nI don't know about that– sweeping chimneys is hard work!\nBut if you want, you could hire me for 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find..\nMaybe I'll bring you good luck."
msgstr "人们总说烟囱清扫工很幸运。我不清楚是不是这样，反正清扫烟囱可是件力气活。你们如果付我200个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我会跟你们走。也许我能带给你们好运。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2297
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "If you need someone to carry some traveller's comforts, like tents and cooking gear, I'm your man!\nAll I want is 100 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "如果你们要找人为你们在旅途中提行李或做饭，那你们可找对人了。我只要100个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2298
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "For 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find, I'll organize all your camping needs and carry your gear.\nI think you'll find me well worth the price!"
msgstr "只要付我200个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我会为你们安排一路的作息时间，安营扎寨。你会知道我是物有所值的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2299
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "For 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find I'll organize your finances and check all the coins you find for rarity.\nI can usually increase a client's wealth by 5 percent."
msgstr "付我500个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我会为你们理财，发现奇珍异宝。我可以使你们的财产增加5个百分点。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2300
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "For 1000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find I'll organize your finances and check all the coins you find for rarity.\nI can usually increase a client's wealth by 10 percent."
msgstr "付我1000个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我就会为你们理财，发现奇珍异宝。我可以使你们的财产增加10个百分点。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2301
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ever want your own personal cook?\nFor 300 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find, I'll carry extra food and prepare your meals for myself and the four of you.\nYou won't be sorry– everyone loves my cooking!"
msgstr "你们可曾想过要个高明的厨师？付我300个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我会增加你们的食物量并为队伍做饭。你不会遗憾的，人们都对我做的菜赞不绝口！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2302
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have studied in the finest cooking schools in Enroth, and I am willing to prepare your meals for a paltry 400 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "我曾在恩洛斯最好的厨师学校学习过。如果你们付我400个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我就给你们做饭。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2303
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can see you know little about handling horses and getting the most out of them.\nI'll be happy to take care of any horses you use when you rent horses at the stables.\nYou'll get to your destination faster with my help.\nAll I want is 100 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "我看你对驾驭马匹一窍不通，我很乐意在你从驿站租马时为你们照料马匹。在我的帮助下你们可以更快地到达目的地。我的要价是100个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2304
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My reputation as a famous musician follows me wherever I go.\nIf I'm with you, I'm sure some of my reputation will rub off on you.\nI only need 1000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find for living expenses."
msgstr "无论走到哪里，我都以著名音乐家的身份而闻名。如果我和你在一起，肯定会对你的声誉有正面的影响。我只要1000个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2305
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Dangerous Sorcerers abound throughout the land of Enroth.\nMost use spells that do some sort of elemental damage, like fire or lightning.\nI know a spell that will protect you from these elements, and I can keep it going all the time.\nI'll cast it for you if you take me along.\nAll I want is 1000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "恩洛斯土地上到处是危险的巫师。他们大多会施展可怕的元素魔法。像火系魔法和光明魔法。但我知道抵御这些魔法的魔法，并能使这种魔法一直生效。如果与你们同行，我就会施展该项魔法。我的要价是1000个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2306
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "For 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find, I can cast the Wizard Eye spell at expert level constantly."
msgstr "付我200个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我就能一直施展专家级水平的魔力神眼魔法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2307
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ever want to fly?\nTake me with you and I can cast the Fly spell on you once a day.\nAll I ask is 2000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find.\nCheap, huh?"
msgstr "你想飞行吗？让我与你们同行，我就可以每天为你们施展一次飞行奇术魔法。我的要价是2000个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17。很便宜，不是吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2308
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ancient prophets claimed the power to walk on water, and I've rediscovered their secret.\nOnce per day I can cast the Water Walk spell on you and everyone with you.\nMy rate is 1000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "古代先知声称有能在水面行走的强大魔法，而我就有幸得到了这个秘密法术。我可以每天为你们施展一次凌波微步魔法。你只要付我1000个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2309
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There are spells that duplicate some of the natural magical features of Enroth.\nOne of those, Town Portal, I've learned to cast at master level.\nI'll\ncast it for you up to once per day if you hire me.\nMy price is 2000 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "有些魔法能够复制恩洛斯的自然魔力，时空之门就是其中之一。我对这项魔法的理解已达到大师级水平。如果雇佣我，我每天可以为你们施展一次这项魔法。我的要价为2000个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2310
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "For a donation of 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find to my temple, I'll travel with you and cast the Bless spell once per day."
msgstr "向我的神庙捐献200个金币并分给神庙所发现的金币的百分之%17，我就和你们一起闯荡江湖并每天施展一次圣灵佑佐魔法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2311
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All armies travelling in style bring a piper along to inspire them to heroic deeds during combat.\nEven small groups like your own can benefit.\nI'll travel with you for 300 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "所有的部队都要个号手以便在战斗中鼓舞斗志。你的队伍也要像我这样一个人。如果你付我300个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我就跟你们走。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2312
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My experience in travelling the world can speed your journeys by a day whether you travel by land or by sea.\nAll I require is 100 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "以我多年的旅行经验，无论你们走陆路还是水路我都可以使你们缩短1天的路程。我只要100个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2313
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Arrr.\nMy life as a freedom-loving sailor has taught me to travel quickly on the seas and count my gold well.\nBut I'm down on my luck these days, so I'll sign on with you for only 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "啊，我一生追求在海上自由航行的那种感觉，知道怎样在海上抄近道以加快速度，并且知道怎样理财。但这两天我挺不顺心的，如果你付我500个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我就死心塌地为你效劳。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2314
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All warriors need a squire to take care of their weapons and armor and back them up in battle.\nI'll be your squire for 600 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "每个骑士都要有个随从为他们看管兵器和铠甲。如果你付我600个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我就作你的随从。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2315
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fortune is my business, and I can improve your fortunes for 400 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "我一直在钻研如何增加运气。如果你付我400个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我就增加你的运气。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2316
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My entire life has been spent on the road, and believe me when I say you gotta know how to travel and you gotta know how to deal.\nI can help you with both for 100 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "我的一生就是在路上踯躅而行。如果你付我100个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我将传授你旅行的技巧和如何及时应变。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2317
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not everyone knows how to talk strangers into giving them what they want.\nI make it my specialty.\nBring me along and I'll use my skills to ease your way through society.\nMy rate is 500 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "并不是每个人都知道如何与陌生人打交道。而这正是我的特长。如果让我与你们同行，我能教你如何融入这个社会。我的要价是500个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2318
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Lots of people can be talked out of stuff they would never give up if they thought about it.\nThe trick is to talk fast and don't let them pause to consider what you're really saying.\nI'll stay with you and coach you on this valuable skill for only 200 gold to start and %17 percent of the gold we find."
msgstr "许多人会在谈话中不知不觉地放弃原先的立场，作出一些他们自己也会认为不可思议的荒唐决定。其实技巧很简单，就是不停的说话，使对方无暇思考你的真正意图。如果你付我200个金币并分给我所发现的金币的百分之%17，我就和你在一起传授你这项技能。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2319
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Need traps disarmed?\nI've been doing it ever since I was released from jail three years ago.\nIf you need help, I'll come with you for free!\nI need the practice."
msgstr "想要拆卸陷阱吗？自从我出狱后三年来我一直干这个行当。如果你需要的话，我就跟你们走，我不取分文，只想增加点经验。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2320
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I don't have any skills to offer you, but if this will get me out of school and away from my chores, I'd love to follow you around!"
msgstr "尽管我没有什么技能可以帮助你，但跟你们走可以不用呆在学校里，还能不干活了，真是太棒了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2322
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Unlimited weapon repair.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "可修补任何兵器，%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2323
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Unlimited armor repair.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "可修补任何铠甲，%01花费你得到金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2324
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Unlimited magic item repair.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "可修补任何魔法物件。%01花费你得到金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2325
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Unlimited item Identification and a 5 percent bonus on all experience gained.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "可鉴定任何物品，并使经验值提高5个百分点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2326
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All map crossings one day faster (minimum one day).\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "步行穿越地图的时间缩短1天（但总时间最短不少于1天）。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2327
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All map crossings two days faster (minimum one day).\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "步行穿越地图的时间缩短2天（但总时间最短不少于1天）。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2328
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All map crossings three days faster (minimum one day).\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "步行穿越地图的时间缩短3天（但总时间最短不少于1天）。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2329
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All boat travel 2 days faster (minimum one day).\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "航船旅行的时间缩短2天（但总时间最短不少于1天）。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2330
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All boat travel 3 days faster (minimum one day).\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "航船旅行的时间缩短3天（但总时间最短不少于1天）。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2331
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Cures all party hit points once a day.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "每天一次加满你的所有角色的生命值。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2332
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Cures all party hit points and conditions (excepting dead, stoned, or eradicated) once per day.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "每天一次加满你的所有角色的生命值，并治疗其身体状态（死亡、石化和灰飞烟灭状态除外）。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2333
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Completely heals party of all hit points and conditions once per day.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "每天一次彻底治疗你的所有角色的身体状态并加满生命值。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2334
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ten percent bonus on all experience learned.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使经验值提高10个百分点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2335
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Fifteen percent bonus on all experience learned.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使经验值提高15个百分点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2336
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Two point bonus to all weapon skills for all characters.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使所有角色所有的兵器技能增加2点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2337
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Three point bonus to all weapon skills for all characters.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使所有角色所有的兵器技能增加3点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2338
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Two point bonus to all spell skills for all characters.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "所有角色所有的魔法技能增加2点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2339
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Three point bonus to all spell skills for all characters.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "所有角色所有的魔法技能增加3点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2340
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Four point bonus to all spell skills for all characters.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "所有角色所有的魔法技能增加4点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2341
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Four point bonus to Merchant skill for all characters.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "你的所有角色的经商术增加4点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2342
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Six point bonus to Merchant skill for all characters.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "你的所有角色的经商术增加6点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2343
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Six point bonus to perception skill for all characters.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "你的所有角色的洞察术增加6点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2344
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Four point bonus to Diplomacy skill for all characters.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "你的所有角色的交际术增加4点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2345
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Eight point bonus to Diplomacy skill for all characters.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "你的所有角色的交际术增加8点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2346
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Four point bonus to Disarm Traps skill for all characters.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "你的所有角色的陷阱拆卸术增加4点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2347
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Six point bonus to Disarm Traps skill for all characters.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "你的所有角色的陷阱拆卸术增加6点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2348
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Five point bonus to Luck statistic for all characters.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "你的所有角色的运气值增加5点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2349
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Twenty point bonus to Luck statistic for all characters.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "你的所有角色的运气值增加20点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2350
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "One less day of food use when camping, (minimum of one used).\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "安营扎寨时可减少1天食物的消耗量（最少要消耗1天食物）。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2351
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Two less days of food use when camping, (minimum of one used).\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "安营扎寨时可减少2天的食物的消耗量（最少要消耗1天食物）。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2352
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid " Ten percent bonus on all gold found.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使你找到的金币数量增加10个百分点。%01花费你得到的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2353
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid " Twenty percent bonus on all gold found.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使你找到的金币数量增加20个百分点。%01花费你得到的金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2354
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Makes one day of food per day (maximum of 14 days).\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "每天生产1天的食物（食物总数不得超过14天）。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2355
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Makes two days of food per day (maximum of 14 days).\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "每天生产2天的食物（食物总数不得超过14天）。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2356
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Trips using the stables take two days fewer to complete (minimum one day).\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使驿站旅行时间减少2天（但总时间最短不少于1天）。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2357
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Grants a constant, single category bonus to your reputation.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使你的声誉提高一个级别。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2358
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Increases protection from the four elements by 20 constantly.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "使你抵御四种元素魔法的能力提高20。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2359
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Keeps the Wizard Eye spell at expert ranking going at all times.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "一直施展专家级水平的魔力神眼魔法。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2360
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid " Casts the Fly spell (duration 2 hours) once per day.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "每天施展一次飞行奇术魔法（持续时间两小时）。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2361
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Casts the Water Walk spell (duration 3 hours) once per day.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "每天施展一次凌波微步魔法（持续时间三小时）。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2362
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Casts the Town Portal spell at master ranking once per day.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "每天施展一次大师级的时空之门魔法。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2363
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Casts the Bless spell (duration 2 hours) at master ranking once per day.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "每天施展一次大师级圣灵佑佐魔法（持续时间两小时）。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2364
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Casts the Heroism spell (duration 2 hours) at master ranking once per day.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "每天施展一次大师级天赐神力魔法（持续时间两小时）。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2365
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All travel times reduced by one day (minimum of one day).\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "所有旅程减少1天路程（最短为1天路程）。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2366
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "All boat travel reduced by two days, gold is increased by ten percent when found, and Reputation is decreased by one full category.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "航船路程减少两天旅程。找到的金币数量增加百分之10，声誉下降一个等级。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2367
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Armor and weapon skills are increased by two points for each character.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "每个角色的铠甲和兵器技能提高两个点数。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2368
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Perception skill is increased by five points and Luck statistics are increased by ten points for each character.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "每个角色的洞察术提高5点，运气值增加10点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2369
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Food use is reduced by one day's worth of food when resting (minimum one day), Merchant skill is increased by three points for each character, and Reputation is decreased by one full category.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "休息时减少1天的食物消耗量（最少消耗1天的食物）。每个角色的经商术提高3点，声誉下降一个等级。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2370
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Both Merchant and Diplomacy skills are increased by four points for each character.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "每个角色的经商术和交际术提高4点。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2371
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Merchant skill is increased by eight points for each character and Reputation is decreased by one full category.\n%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr "每个角色的经商术提高8点，声誉下降一个等级。%01花费你得到的所有金币的百分之%17。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2372
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Disarm Traps skill is increased by eight points for each character and Reputation is decreased by one full category.\n%01 costs you nothing!"
msgstr "每个角色的陷阱拆卸术提高8点。声誉下降一个等级。%01不会花你一文钱。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2375
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good %05!\nI'm %01.\nPleased to meet you!"
msgstr "%05好！我是%01。很高兴见到你！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2376
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh, Hullo %02.\nNice %05, isn't it?\n"
msgstr "哦，你好，%02。好一个%05。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2377
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hey, I already said I didn't want to be seen with you.\nGet lost!"
msgstr "嘿，我说过不想再见到你。快滚开！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2378
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Always glad to be of service, %06.\nDo you have %04 for me?"
msgstr "乐意为你效劳，%06。你能给我%04个金币吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2379
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Please don't kill me!\nI've told you everything you asked for!"
msgstr "不要杀了我！你想知道的东西，我都已经告诉你了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2380
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I only talk to real people, not unknowns like yourselves.\nI'm busy now, so go away."
msgstr "我只和有头有面的人谈话，从不和你这样的无名小卒聊天。现在我很忙，快走开。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2381
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh No!\nPlease don't hurt me, %06 %02! I'll tell you anything!"
msgstr "哦，不！请别伤害我，%02%06！我什么都可以告诉你！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2382
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The infamous %06 %02!\nI heard you've been murdering people right and left.\nThat's great!\nWhat can I do for you?"
msgstr "声名狼藉的%02%06！我听说你一直在忙着杀人。真了不起！我可以为你做些什么吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2383
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%07 %02!\nWhat an honor!\nEveryone is talking about how you %08!\nWhat can I do for you?"
msgstr "%02%07！真是幸会！每个人都在谈论您是怎样%08的！我可以为你做些什么吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2384
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh No!\n%06 %02!\nI didn't do it!\nIt was the other guy!\nI wasn't there!\nI'll tell you anything--anything, just don't hurt me!"
msgstr "哦，不！%02%06！不是我干的，是另外那个家伙干的！我并不在场！我什么都交代，什么都交代，就是别伤害我！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2385
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh…you people.\nI can't even bear to think of things people are saying about you!\nGo away and leave me alone!"
msgstr "哦……你这种人，光是听着别人讨论你，我都无法忍受！走开，离我远点！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2386
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oooh…I'm talking to %06 never do wrong!\nSuch an honor.\n"
msgstr "喔……我竟然在和那位伟大而总是正确的%06交谈！我感到好荣幸哦。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2387
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Although I have not heard many bad things about you, %02, I haven't heard many good stories either.\nI just don't trust you."
msgstr "虽然我没听说你有什么劣迹，但也没听说你做过什么好事，%02。我就是无法信任你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2388
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02, eh?\nI hear you might be a sheriff in disguise.\nI don't talk to sheriffs. Or guards…. or King's men.\nMaybe if you did a few crimes I could trust you. "
msgstr "%02，呃？我听说你可能是微服私访的长官。我不和长官、卫兵或任何为国王做事的人交谈。或许你去做点坏事我才会相信你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2389
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I've heard so many bad things about you.\nWhy won't you leave me alone?\nI want no trouble from you!"
msgstr "我已经听说过你的种种劣迹，快离我远点，别给我带来麻烦。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2390
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Maybe I didn't tell you before:\nI don't like you.\nI don't see why the high and mighty would want to talk to a lowlife like me anyway, so go away!"
msgstr "可能我之前没说清楚：我不喜欢你。我不知道你这种高贵强大的人物为什么要和我这种卑微小人谈话。快走开！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2391
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm simply not impressed.\nYour reputation is but %11.\nI won't talk to you unless it improves."
msgstr "我一点也不觉得你怎么样。你的声誉仅仅是%11，除非有所提高，否则我不会跟你说话。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2392
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your reputation is just too pure for me.\nI don't like it.\nIt's not right.\nMaybe if I heard some more bad gossip about you we could talk.\nUntil then…"
msgstr "你的声誉对我来说太高洁了，我很讨厌你这点，这可不行。也许等我听到一些关于你的不良传言，我们就可以谈谈了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2393
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh, all right.\nBut I really don't want to be seen with you.\nLet's not make this a habit."
msgstr "哦，好吧。但我真的不大想让别人看到和你在一起。所以，下不为例。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2395
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you, %06.\nNow, what did you want?"
msgstr "谢谢你，%06。现在你想要什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2397
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<gulp> I get it. Yes, %06.\nWhat do you want of me?"
msgstr "<咽了下口水>我知道了。好的，%06。你想要我做什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2400
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02, eh?\nI'll remember that."
msgstr "你叫%02是吧？我会记住的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2401
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02 again.\nWhat do you want?"
msgstr "又是你，%02。你想要什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2402
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My patience is at its end.\nGo away and stop bothering me."
msgstr "我的耐心已经到头了，快滚，别打扰我。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2403
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "More!\nMore gold!\nYes!\nGive me %04 more!"
msgstr "再来点！再来点金币！对！再给我%04个金币！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2405
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will not talk to nobodies.\nLeave me."
msgstr "我不想和小人物说话，滚远点。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2406
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Monsters!\nI have heard of your crimes.\nI would slay you if I could."
msgstr "怪物！我听说了你的罪行。可以的话我真想宰了你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2407
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your infamy precedes you, %02.\nAnything to serve one so wicked as you, %06."
msgstr "你还没到，你的恶名先到，%02%06。我愿为你这样邪恶的人做任何事。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2408
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%07 %02.\nI am gratified to know you.\nWhat is mine is yours."
msgstr "%02%07。非常高兴认识您。我的东西您可以随便要。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2409
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hissssss….Please, don't slay me.\nI am a worm, not worth your trouble.\nI grovel at your feet, mighty %10."
msgstr "啊，请别杀了我，我一区区草民不足劳你大驾，我给你磕头了，尊敬的%10。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2410
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I don't speak with evil humans.\nGo away before I become…violent."
msgstr "我不和恶人说话。趁我没发怒，快走开。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2411
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh, hooray.\nIt's the good guys.\nYou're lucky I'm in a good mood right now.\nLeave me before it changes."
msgstr "哦，万岁。好人来了。你很幸运，我现在心情不错。在我心情变坏前快滚。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2412
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Most humans are evil…and a simple lack of criminal reputation isn't enough to make me trust you.\nLeave me."
msgstr "大多数人都是邪恶的……没有前科不能使我信任你。快走吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2413
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02. I smell traces of an awful goodness seeping from your pores.\nI can't stand it!\nGo and commit some acts of unspeakable evil.\nMaybe then I'll talk to\nyou."
msgstr "%02，我闻到你毛孔中散发出的令人作呕的善良气息，真让我无法忍受！你得犯几件惊天动地的罪行，也许那之后我就会和你说话了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2414
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Back again, %02?\nI thought you were smarter than that.\nI can smell the evil on you.\nIt makes me hungry!"
msgstr "怎么又来了，%02？我以为你会放聪明点的呢。你身上还有股邪恶的味道，闻起来很好吃的样子！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2415
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My mood grows sour as I contemplate your lack of evil.\nI have nothing to say to you."
msgstr "你对邪恶之力的缺乏让我一肚子怒火。我对你无话可说。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2416
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The stories I hear about you are %11, but that isn't good enough.\nBe on your way."
msgstr "我听说过你那%11的事迹，但这还不够。走开吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2417
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can sense goodness upon you, %02.\nBring yourself down to %11, and then return to me."
msgstr "我能感觉到你的善良气息，%02。把你的声誉降到%11时，再回来见我吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2418
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your groveling has touched my heart.\nI will talk to you for a moment."
msgstr "你的卑躬屈膝打动了我的心，我可以与你谈一会儿。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2420
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Yes, good.\nWhat do you want?"
msgstr "行，很好。你想要什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2422
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Please, don't slay me!\nI will tell you what you want to know!"
msgstr "求你了，别杀我！我什么都告诉你！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2425
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hi.\nName's %01.\n"
msgstr "嗨，我叫%01。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2428
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Price is the same every time, %06.\n%04 gold!"
msgstr "我一直都要这个价，%06。%04个金币！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2429
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hey, uh, we're still friends, right?\nWhat do you need?"
msgstr "嘿，我们还是朋友，对不对？你需要什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2430
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Go away kid, ya bother me.\nCome back when you're not as wet behind the ears."
msgstr "滚开，小子，你烦到了我。毛长齐了再来找我吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2431
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It's <gulp>…%06 %02 and %09 band of merry pranksters!\nYou are so well known around here!\nA real…honor, my %10."
msgstr "这不是<咽了下口水>%02%06和%09愉快的恶作剧小队吗？你在这里无人不知！真有幸见到你，我的%10。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2432
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, the notorious %06 %02.\nAnything for you, %02!"
msgstr "啊，声名狼藉的%02%06。愿为你效力，%02！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2433
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your exploits are known far and wide, %06 %02.\n%01 at your service, my %10."
msgstr "您的冒险经历已经广为人知，%02%06。%01愿为您效劳，我的%10。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2434
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%07 %02!\nSo good to see you in person!\nWhich is surprising, since you are so famous and powerful and good, while I am so weak and pitiful.\nNot worth your time, no, not at all. Aheh-heh…Heh."
msgstr "%02%07！很高兴亲眼见到你！真令人惊讶，你如此著名、强大和善良，而我是如此弱小和可怜。我不值得你花费时间交谈，一点都不值得。嘿嘿。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2435
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You've a %11 reputation, %06.\nI don't want anything to do with you."
msgstr "你的声誉是%11，%06，我不想和你有任何关系。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2436
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<sneer> Stinkin' goody two-shoes.\nThey say you %08.\nWell isn't that just wonderful?\nYou people make me sick.\nGo your way before I do something you'll regret!"
msgstr "<冷笑>发臭的伪善好人。他们说你就是那个%08的人。哈，棒极了不是？你们真让我恶心。快走你们的路去吧，否则我会做一些让你们后悔的事情！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2437
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Nothing I've heard about you makes me want to speak with you, %02.\nI'm not saying you are bad people;\nI'm just saying that you might not be good.\nPerhaps if you improved your reputation…"
msgstr "我听说过你的事迹，但没有什么使我有兴趣和你交谈的，%02。我不是说你是坏人，只是觉得你可能不太好。或许等你提高了声誉之后再来找我？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2438
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<squinting>\nHmm.\nI've heard that you have a bad reputation.\nThat's a good start, but not quite enough.\nYour reputation is going to have to get a lot worse before I trust you!"
msgstr "<斜视>嗯。我听说你声誉不好，这是个不错的开端，但还远远不够。你的声誉必须变得更坏我才会相信你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2439
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There's a lot of talk about you people and none of it is good.\nI can't be seen with you.\nLet's go our separate ways, shall we?"
msgstr "关于你们有很多传言，但没有一件是好事。我不想被人看见和你在一起。让我们各走各的路吧，好吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2440
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh, back again, huh?\nHave you been deputized yet?\nFavored by the King?\nWell, I'll tell you--Mayors and Kings may welcome your type, but I sure don't.\nWatch your back."
msgstr "哦，你又来了，嗯？你是镇长的代表，还是国王的宠信？我告诉你，镇长和国王或许会欢迎你这种人，但我绝不会这样。你给我小心点。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2441
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, %02.\nUntil the rumors and gossip about you grow more positive, I don't want to talk to you. "
msgstr "啊，%02。等到坊间关于你的传言变得再好一些时，我才会你说话。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2442
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Look, all my friends are uncertain about trusting you.\nUntil you do something to earn our faith, something illegal, I just can't be seen with you.\nIt makes me look bad."
msgstr "听着，我的朋友都不确定能不能信任你。要想赢得我们的信心，你得做一些事情，一些法外之事。在此之前，不能让别人看见我和你在一起，这让我很丢脸。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2444
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I gave at the Guild.\nI'm not interested. I'm broke.\nIt's not my problem.\nGet a job.\nI don't care…Don't you get it?\nGo away, I don't want to talk to you!"
msgstr "我在行会干了。我没兴趣。我破产了。这不是我的问题。去找份工作吧。我不在乎……你还听不懂吗？走开，我不想跟你说话！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2445
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A pleasure doing business with you, %06.\nWhat can I do for you?"
msgstr "和你交易非常愉快，%06。需要我为你做什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2447
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ok, ok!\nWhatever you say, boss."
msgstr "好的，好的！洗耳恭听。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2453
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ahh, yes.\n< %01 rubs %03 hands together> More important business and discussion, I suppose.\nThe price, as always, is %04."
msgstr "啊，好的。<%01摩擦着%03手说>我想这笔买卖很重要，价格还是%04个金币。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2454
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh, dear!\nWhat more do you want?"
msgstr "哦，妈呀！你想要什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2455
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My merchandise is both rare and high quality.\nSo are my customers.\nSince you are low quality customers, it would seem we are unable to conduct business."
msgstr "我的商品量少质优，我的顾客也是如此。你属于劣质顾客，我们谈不来生意。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2456
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh, my, %02!\nPlease don't rob me!\nI have nothing of value!\nAll I own is debt!\nHave mercy, my %10!"
msgstr "哦，天哪，%02！请不要抢劫我！我身无分文！只有一屁股的债！饶了我吧，我的%10！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2457
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%07 %02!\nThat was really something when you slaughtered everyone in that small village!\nHad it coming, if you ask me.\nThat was you…wasn't it?\nWell, anyway, what can I do for you?"
msgstr "%02%07！你把那个小村村民屠杀一空的事迹真令人愉悦。我觉得他们活该。这才是真正的你，不是吗？嗯，我可以为你做什么吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2458
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I heard about how you %08.\nIt is an honor and a pleasure.\nAnything for you, my %10."
msgstr "我听说过您是怎样%08的。见到您我很荣幸也很高兴。您想要什么请随便提，我的%10。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2459
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Please, please, don't kill me, your worship! <sob>\nI am a wretch, not worth tiring your sword arm.\nIf you leave me alone, I will die on my own soon anyway!\nHave mercy, mighty %10!\nHave mercy!"
msgstr "求求您，求求您，请别杀了我，我给你磕头了！<抽泣>我是一个卑微小人，不值得劳你抬臂挥剑。就算你放了我，我很快也会自己死掉的！行行好吧，强大的%10！可怜可怜我吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2460
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02...\nI've heard things about you, none of them good.\nPlease remove yourself from my presence.\nImmediately."
msgstr "%02……我听说过你做的事，其中没有一件是好事，快立刻从我面前消失。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2461
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Psssst!\nHey, you wanna buy a <squints> wait a minute…never mind."
msgstr "嘿，你要买……<斜视>慢着……我什么都没说。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2462
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I only deal with people I know and trust.\nSince I haven't heard anything good about you, I have\nno reason to trust you.\nGood day."
msgstr "我只与熟悉和信任的人打交道。我从未听说过你的优良事迹，所以没有理由信任你。再见。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2463
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%10 %02.\nI've heard of you.\nThey say your reputation is %11.\nThat says a lot, but I need to hear more before I feel I can safely deal with you.\nCome back to me after you have proven yourself some more."
msgstr "%02%10，我听说过你。他们说你的声誉是%11，尽管这能说明一些事情，但在我觉得可以安全地与你打交道之前，我需要听到更多关于你的劣迹。在你证明了自己之后，再来找我吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2464
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I do not speak to ruffians!\nYour reputation is %11, well below my standards."
msgstr "我不与恶棍交谈！你的声誉是%11，远低于我的标准。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2465
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Are you talking to me?\nGo bother someone else.\nI have nothing for you."
msgstr "你是在和我说话吗？去烦别人吧，我什么也不知道。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2466
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Persons of quality are not telling me that you are a person of quality.\nSince I only deal with people whose reputations are %12 or better, we have nothing further to talk about."
msgstr "贵人们从未告诉过我你也是一名贵人。我只和声誉为%12或更好的人打交道，我们没有什么可谈的了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2467
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I just can't trust you.\nMaybe if your reputation were to fall to %11, or worse we could talk.\n<bowing> Until then %10."
msgstr "我就是没法相信你。或许你的声誉降到%11或更低的时候，我才能和你说话。<鞠躬>下回再见，%10。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2469
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "What about me makes you think I care about you or your problems?\nBegone, or I shall set the town guard on you."
msgstr "是什么让你觉得我会在乎你和你的问题？快滚吧，否则我会让卫兵来抓捕你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2470
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you!\nPlease, tell me what it is you are seeking."
msgstr "谢谢你！请告诉我你要什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2472
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I see.\nNo need for violence.\nWhat is it you need?"
msgstr "我懂了。没必要使用暴力。你需要什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2475
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am %01.\nWhat do you want?"
msgstr "我是%01。你想要什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2477
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I told you already--I don't have time for you.\nMaybe tomorrow."
msgstr "我告诉过你了，我没时间理你。明天再说吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2480
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You may have heard of me.\nSome call me…%02.\nBeing famous, I only associate with other famous and important people.\nYou are neither.\nBegone."
msgstr "你也许听说过我。有的人称呼我……等等，%02，作为名人，我只和其他有名和重要的人物打交道。你既没名气也不重要。滚蛋吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2481
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I never thought that I might one day come face to face with one as evil as you, %02.\nThis is not a happy day.\nWhat are your demands?"
msgstr "我以前从未想过有一天我会面对面碰见你这样邪恶的家伙，%02。今天真是个不幸的日子。你想要什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2482
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A delight to finally meet the mighty %06 %02 in the flesh.\nThe denizens of the netherworld can't stop praising your exploits, and they eagerly await your inevitable arrival…Until then, how may I serve you, my %10?"
msgstr "很高兴终于亲眼见到你，强大的%02%06。地狱里的生灵们对你真是赞不绝口，他们急切等待着你的到来……在此之前，我能为你效劳什么吗，我的%10？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2483
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "To know you is to love you, honorable %06 %02!\nYou are the ones who %08.\nYou have but to ask and from me you will receive!"
msgstr "越了解您越喜欢您，尊敬的%02%06！您是%08的英雄。您想要什么，我就给您什么。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2484
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wait!\nPlease don't attack me!\nI'll stop the experiments,\nI swear!\nNo more evil sorcery for me..I'm done with that, you can count on me, %10 %02.\n"
msgstr "等等！别攻击我！我以后不做那些实验了，我发誓！我再也不做邪恶巫师了……我要金盆洗手，你可以相信我，%02%10。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2485
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Bah!\nI haven't time enough for the likes of you!\nI will only speak to people of good repute--people who's reputation is %12…or better."
msgstr "唉！我没空和你这样的家伙闲聊，我只和声誉为%12或更好的人交谈。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2486
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "May the dark gods save us from the righteous!\nIs there no end to you people?\nGet away from me before I put a hex on you!"
msgstr "黑暗之神们能将我们从一本正经的世界中解救出来吗？你们这些人怎么没完没了呢？离我远点，否则我会对你施展某种法术！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2487
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am afraid I cannot associate with people whose charm and reputation do not approach my own.\nIt would taint my aura.\nSorry."
msgstr "恐怕我无法和那些魅力及声誉与我差之甚远的人交往。他们会玷污我身体周围的气场。抱歉。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2488
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02, I am %01.\nI am constrained by pacts and promises I have made from dealing over much with the innocent.\nI only tell you this because I heard that your reputation is %11.\nThat's bad, but not bad enough.\nReturn after performing a few more despicable acts.\nThen we will talk."
msgstr "%02，我是%01。我以前订立过契约和承诺，它们限制我和无罪者打交道不能过多。对一般人我不会透露这点，我告诉你这个，是因为我听说你的声誉是%11。这是个挺坏的声誉，但还不够坏。去做一些卑鄙的事情后再回来吧，那时我们就可以交谈了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2489
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I grow wrathful thinking about all the negative things the wind whispers about you.\nYour reputation is %11!\nNot very nice.\nNow begone, before my wrath turns to action!"
msgstr "我愤怒地思考着风中密语传唱的你的劣迹。你的声誉是%11！不是很好。在我出手前快走开吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2490
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wasn't I rude enough the last time we spoke?\nI detest you!\nYour angelic faces turn my stomach!\nYour innocence nauseates me! Leave!"
msgstr "难道我上次与你说话时太客气了吗？我厌恶你！你天使般的面容让我作呕！你的清白让我恶心！滚！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2491
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02.\nYour reputation suffers.\nProlonged association with the likes of you imperils the purity of my aura.\nI don't want to speak with you."
msgstr "%02，你的声誉不是非常优异。与你这样的人经常联系会危害我身体周围气场的纯洁。我不想和你说话。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2492
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your aura lacks the mottled purple and yellow spots I must see before I am allowed to speak with you.\nYou must do more evil, %02, before we can safely talk."
msgstr "你的气场中没有我必须看到的紫黄杂色斑点，因此我无法和你说话。在我们好好交谈之前，你必须做更多邪恶之事，%02。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2493
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<sigh> Very well.\nBut this is it for today!\nI don't have time for you."
msgstr "<叹气>好吧，但就今天而已，通常我没有时间和你交谈。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2497
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmmm.\nYou have a point.\nWhat do you want?"
msgstr "嗯……你有理。你想要什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2500
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02.\nCharmed, I'm sure."
msgstr "迷人的%02，您好。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2502
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No.\nI won't let you waste any more of my time.\nPerhaps tomorrow."
msgstr "不，我不会让你浪费我更多时间。明天再说吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2504
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Now what?\nHave you returned to slay me?\nI will surely call out your name before you strike me down!\nSomeone will come to save me!"
msgstr "又怎么了？你回来杀我？在你击倒我之前我会大声呼救，有人会来救我的！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2505
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I haven't time for simple folk such as yourselves!\nPerhaps when you have become more sophisticated…"
msgstr "我不会为头脑简单的家伙浪费时间。或许等你变得聪明些再来找我？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2506
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh dear, the infamous %06 %02 and accomplices…I suppose begging for my life isn't enough.\nWhat do you want of me?"
msgstr "哦天哪，声名狼藉的%02%06和同党……我想我光乞求饶命是不够的。你想要我做什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2507
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My %10, everyone with an open mind in the Kingdom follows your deliciously outrageous behavior.\nSuch a wonderful history your deeds will make.\nHow may I serve you?"
msgstr "我的%10，王国里每一个“思想开放”的人都非常欣赏你美妙的暴虐行为。你的事迹将书写一个伟大的历史。我可以为你效劳什么吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2508
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your deeds are known far and wide, my %10.\nI will gladly serve you."
msgstr "您的事迹已经广为人知，我的%10。我很高兴为您效劳。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2510
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "People have been talking about how you like to commit crimes, %02.\nI don't like how that sounds, so I don't want to talk to you."
msgstr "人们都在谈论着你是如何喜欢犯罪，%02。我不喜欢你的行径，所以也不想和你说话。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2511
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I doubt you would approve of my researches into the darker magics, just as I would not approve of your intolerant ways.\nI have nothing further to say to you."
msgstr "我不觉得你会赞同我对于一些十分黑暗的魔法的研究，我也不会赞同你对于我们这些人不宽容的处置方式。我没有什么可以对你说的了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2512
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The court of public opinion about you is divided, %02.\nSome say you are good people, others are not so sure. I, for one, will wait for more good rumors about you before I will speak with you."
msgstr "大家对你的看法有分歧，%02。一些人认为你是好人，另一些人则不怎么肯定。至于我，我要等到你得到更多好评后才能和你交谈。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2513
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Look--I'm bad company.\nEvil, pure and simple, through and through.\nHow would it look to all my friends to be caught associating with people who lack the kind of %12 reputation we have?\nThat's right--simply dreadful."
msgstr "听着，我是个坏家伙。彻头彻尾的、纯粹绝对的邪恶。我和我的朋友们都至少有%12声誉，要是我的朋友们发现我和达不到这个声誉的人交往，他们会如何看待我？没错，他们会超级鄙视我的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2514
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The talk about you and your friends is that you are not decent folk, %02.\nI, for one, will have nothing to do with you."
msgstr "传言说你和你的朋友都不是正直的人，%02。至于我，我和你们井水不犯河水。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2515
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is a pleasure withholding information from righteous do-gooders like you!\nBeg me to reconsider and I might condescend to speak with you."
msgstr "你是个愚蠢的正义战士，拒绝向你这种人透露信息让我非常愉快！不过要是你乞求我重新考虑的话，我倒是可能会屈尊与你说话。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2516
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<sigh>\nThough your reputation is at least %11, I promised my mother that I wouldn't talk to people whose reputation wasn't at least %12.\nSorry."
msgstr "<叹气>你的声誉仅仅是%11，我答应过我的母亲，我不会和声誉低于%12的人交谈。抱歉。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2517
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your reputation is only %12!\nI can't be seen with you.\nEveryone I know would laugh at me!\nI only associate with people whose reputation is %11 or worse."
msgstr "你的声誉仅仅是%12！我可不能被人看见和你在一起，否则别人会笑话我的。和我打交道的人声誉都为%11或者更低。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2521
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Money means little.\nKnowledge is power to me.\n"
msgstr "金钱对我来说微不足道，知识才是力量。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2522
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Understood %06.\nI want to live.\nWhat do you need?"
msgstr "我明白了，%06。你需要什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2525
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello there!\nA mighty fine %05, if you ask me!\nI'm %01."
msgstr "你好！真是个十分美好的%05！我是%01。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2526
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Good to see you again!\nHahahaha!\nUhm…What did you say your name was?"
msgstr "很高兴再次见到你！哈哈哈哈！嗯……你上次说你叫什么名字来着？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2527
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My generosity ends here.\nI've already helped you today and I am sick of seeing you.\nLeave me."
msgstr "我的慷慨到此为止了。今天已经帮过你了，再也不想见到你了。快走吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2530
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<yawns>\nNot interested.\nGo away--I'm waiting for someone important to speak to."
msgstr "<哈欠>我对你不感兴趣，走开。我期待着和重要人物交谈。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2531
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02!\nVillain! How dare you speak to me?"
msgstr "%02！恶棍！你怎么敢跟我说话？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2532
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Infamous %06, It is an honor to know you and a pleasure to serve you.\nWhat do you desire?"
msgstr "%06，你已声名狼藉，正因为如此，我很荣幸认识你并为你效劳。你想要什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2533
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, the famous and honorable %06 %02!\n<bowing> Whatsoever you desire that is in my power to give, I freely grant."
msgstr "啊，著名而尊敬的%02%06！<鞠躬>无论您想要什么，只要我能够，我都会给您。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2534
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02.\n<spits on the ground>"
msgstr "%02。<啐痰于地>"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2535
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "O Ho!\n%13! Er, %13.\nI think.\nWhatever.\nThere's gossip about you--all of it bad.\nGet thee hence, lest I spit thee on the point of my sword!"
msgstr "哦吼！%13！呃，%13，这是你的名字吧？关于你的传闻全都是坏的。所以快走开，免得我用剑来表达我对你的唾弃。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2537
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hello!\nI'm %01!\nI've heard of you, %13, and while you haven't done anything too terribly wrong, or at least that I've heard, you haven't done much good, either.\nSo get out there and do some good deeds!\nMaybe then I'll talk to you."
msgstr "你好！我是%01！我听说过你，%13是吧，尽管你没有做过为非作歹的事，但就我听说的传闻而言，你也没做过多少好事。去多做点善事吧！然后我可能就会愿意与你交谈了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2538
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%13, it is good to meet you at last.\nYour reputation is %11.\nCould be worse.\nMatter of fact, it makes me think you are some kind of wimp!\nYeah, until I hear worse, I don't want to be seen with you.\nGet out of my sight!"
msgstr "啊是%13吧，很高兴终于与你见面了。你的声誉是%11，但还可以变得更恶。其实，你现在这个声誉让我觉得你是个窝囊废！没错，在我听说你的声誉变得更坏之前，我不想和你相见。离开我的视线！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2539
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Back again, %13?\nIs this some sort of challenge?\nHave you come to insult me?\nFriend %13, I warn you--you're walking a narrow bridge with me, and the chasm is very deep…very deep indeed!"
msgstr "怎么又回来了，%13是吧？你是不是在向我挑衅？你来侮辱我吗？我的朋友%13，我警告你：你这是在独木桥上散步——走险！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2540
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am this far--this far from hacking your saintly head from your shoulders!\nLeave me while you still can."
msgstr "我已经忍不住要砍下你圣洁的头颅了！趁你的头还在，快滚吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2541
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%13!\nMaybe someday I will have something to say to you!\nMaybe.\nBut not until your reputation improves."
msgstr "%13！也许有朝一日我会有话要对你诉说！也许会的。但绝不是在你的声誉提高之前。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2542
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%13!\nYou've returned!\nReturned with a reputation of %11…Hmmm.\nLooks wimpy to me.\nDo something to impress me, 'cause I don't associate with the weak, or the helpless.\nUntil then, take off, eh?"
msgstr "又是%13是吧！带着区区一个%11的声誉，你又回来了！……唉，看起来你就是个胆小鬼。做点什么能给我留下深刻印象的事去吧，因为我不与软弱无助的人打交道。快去吧，嗯？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2543
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I suppose I could speak to you for a few minutes.\nHurry up."
msgstr "我只能和你谈几分钟。有话快说。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2550
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Peace, %06.\nMy name is %14 %01.\n"
msgstr "愿你平安，%06。我是%01%14。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2551
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A glorious %05, %02.\nHow may I help you?"
msgstr "真是个愉快的%05，%02。有什么可以帮您的吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2552
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Though your need is obviously great, It would be a disservice to others to attend solely to your needs.\nPerhaps some other time."
msgstr "虽然你有需要，但仅仅满足你的需要对其他人来说是一种伤害。或许下次吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2555
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have important matters to attend to, child.\nSomeday you'll be important too, but you aren't yet, so go now, in peace."
msgstr "我还有重要的事去做，孩子。总有一天你也会变得重要的，但现在你还没达到这一步。请静静地走开吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2556
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is the Devil himself before me!\nI do not fear you, nor will I help you!"
msgstr "我面前站着魔鬼本人！我不怕你，也不会帮你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2557
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My Master…your work in the name of darkness is unparalleled.\nYour evil is superior to mine.\nTo serve you is my one and only desire."
msgstr "我的主人，你以黑暗为名开创的事业是空前绝后的。你比我更加邪恶。为你服务是我唯一的愿望。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2558
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Praise the Light!\nA gift from Heaven to be in the presence of the sweet and honorable %10 %06! "
msgstr "颂扬光明吧！这是来自天堂的礼物，它将被赠给可爱可敬的%02%06！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2559
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "The higher you climb, the farther you will fall…And you have climbed oh so high!\nRest assured, sainted one, that I will not be there to catch you when you fall!"
msgstr "你爬得越高，摔得越重。你已经爬了这么高了。歇手吧，圣人，你摔下来我可没法接住你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2560
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have heard that you stopped walking in the Light.\nReturn to me when you have found your way."
msgstr "我听说你不愿再走正路，等你回心转意再来找我吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2561
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Begone, fool!\nI will not speak to cowards unwilling to travel the shadowed path."
msgstr "滚吧，傻子！我不和不敢走夜路的胆小鬼说话。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2562
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You haven't an aura of evil or good strong enough for my spells to detect.\nUntil I know one way or the other, I must decline to speak with you."
msgstr "因为你的气场既不极善也不极恶，我的符咒无法侦测出你的气场。在你的气场强大到能够被我侦测出来之前，我必须拒绝和你交谈。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2563
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02, your reputation is %11, indicating to me that there is hope you will join the darkness yet!\nStill, there are traces of goodness in your soul that are troublesome.\nEliminate them and return.\nThen we can talk."
msgstr "%02，你的声誉已是%11，对我来说，这意味着你有希望走入黑暗之路！尽管如此，你灵魂中的良知仍然很令人讨厌。把良知泯灭了再回来找我吧。那时我们就可以交谈了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2564
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Still dealing in shadows?\nI know you can do better, %02.\nGo in peace, and return once you have renounced your evil ways."
msgstr "还躲在黑暗中吗？我知道你能变好的，%02。请静静地离开，一旦你弃恶从善了再来找我吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2565
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You try my patience, craven one.\nI am tempted to experiment with the powers the netherworld has granted me…"
msgstr "你是在考验我的耐心吧？软蛋。我很想实验一下地狱赋予我的力量。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2566
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My dear %02.\nYou must tend to your soul before I can attend to your needs.\nGo, and return only when your feet are more firmly on the righteous path."
msgstr "我亲爱的%02。你必须净化你的灵魂，然后我才能满足你的需求。去吧，当你的双脚更坚定地走在正义的道路上时再回来找我。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2567
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02, your personal darkness is shot through with streaks of light.\nI won't have it!\nI refuse to deal with the uncommitted, the uncertain, and the weak!\nReturn to me after you have proven your evil and stained your soul!"
msgstr "%02，你的黑暗中还存有一线光明。我拒绝和没有全身心投入事业、犹豫不决或是软弱的人打交道！在证明了你的邪恶，玷污了你的灵魂之后，再来找我吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2568
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "How could I not respond to such a piteous cry for help?\nWhat do you require, %15?"
msgstr "我无法对如此可怜的呼求无动于衷。你需要什么，%15？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2570
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I see now that you are not a malicious defiler of all I hold dear, but rather a misguided soul that has lost %09 way.\nHow may I help you, child?"
msgstr "我现在发现你并不是一个邪恶的亵渎神灵者，而只是一个没被正确引导而迷失了%09道路的灵魂而已。孩子，需要我怎样帮助你？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2576
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah, yes, %02.\nCan I help you?"
msgstr "啊，是%02。需要帮忙吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2578
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:8
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm afraid I will require a second payment, %06.\n%04 now, or the conversation ends here."
msgstr "我想你得再付点钱，%06。马上付%04个金币，否则谈话到此为止。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2580
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sorry, I'm looking for famous Heroes, not unknown peasants.\nBe off with you now."
msgstr "对不起，我在寻找著名的英雄，而不是无名的农民，快走开吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2581
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh, the notorious %02.\nYes, I've heard of you, and I'm not impressed.\nI hope you are brought to justice soon!"
msgstr "哦，声名狼藉的%02。我听说过你，但并不觉得你怎么样。希望你会尽早受到正义的审判！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2582
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "By the Word, your deeds are an inspiration to us all!\nKeep up the good work--with your help, the Kingdom will surely fall soon!"
msgstr "你的所作所为鼓舞着我们！请继续干吧。在你的帮助之下，肯定很快就能把王国搞垮的！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2583
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "An honor, great %10.\nHow may I serve you?"
msgstr "真是幸会，伟大的%10。我可以如何为您效劳？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2585
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My sources tell me that you may have committed a number of crimes.\nYou must clear those problems up before I can speak with you."
msgstr "根据给我的情报，你可能犯下了一系列罪行。澄清了这些问题之后我才能和你说话。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2586
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Sorry, %06 but it doesn't matter to me if you %08.\nAs a matter of fact, I consider your holier-than-thou attitude quite insulting…%06."
msgstr "对不起，%06，我不在乎你是不是那个%08的人。事实上，我觉得你那种自认为品格高人一等的态度相当侮辱人，%06。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2587
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A smart official only associates with people of quality reputation.\nYour reputation is only %11.\nNot good enough for me.\nSorry."
msgstr "一个明智的官员只和声誉优异的人交往，你的声誉仅仅是%11，远远不够。对不起了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2588
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02.\nI understand you may be something less than a good citizen, and perhaps something more than a common criminal…There are always uses for such as you--if not for me than for my…associates.\nBut I need more proof!\nCommit some more crimes--then we can talk.\nAnd don't tell anyone we spoke about this--I'll deny our little conversation if accused."
msgstr "我知道你不是一个好人，甚至也不仅仅是一个普通罪犯……你这种人会很有用的——对于我，或者对于我的同……同事。但我需要更多证据！去犯下更多罪行，然后我们就可以谈谈了。另外，别把这件事告诉任何人——如果被指责，我会否认我们进行过这次交谈。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2589
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02? The record is still quite clear:\nYour reputation is %11.\nOur conversation must end here."
msgstr "%02？你的声誉记录依然很明了：%11。我们的谈话到此为止。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2591
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I will only associate with people who won't embarrass me!\nYou will.\nMaybe if people start telling me your reputation is %12.\nUntil then…"
msgstr "和你打交道会让我丢脸。如果有人告诉我你的声誉是%12，那时或许可以……"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2592
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I retain doubts about your commitment to a life on the shady side.\nI must hear that your reputation is %12 or less!\nOtherwise I can have nothing to do with you!"
msgstr "我仍对你一心作恶的信心表示怀疑。你的声誉必须降为%12或者更低！否则我不会和你打任何交道。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2594
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Beg all you like.\nI still won't help you."
msgstr "无论你怎么哀求，我都不会帮你的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2595
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thank you.\nHow may I be of service?"
msgstr "谢谢你，需要我如何为你效劳？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2598
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A threat?\nYou had best be gone before I set the watch on you!"
msgstr "威胁我？在我令看守来抓捕你之前你最好快滚！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2605
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02?\nNever heard of you.\nNow go away and stop wasting my time."
msgstr "%02？从没听说过你。快走开，别浪费我时间。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2608
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%10 %02.\nAn honor."
msgstr "%02%10，真是幸会。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2609
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<drawing %03 sword> %02!\nIn the name of Zenofex, prepare to die!"
msgstr "<拔出%03的剑>%02！以诺菲克斯的名义，受死吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2610
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I heard you may have been less than lawful, recently.\nIf it could be proven, I would arrest you right now. "
msgstr "我听说你近来做了违法乱纪的事，一经证实我会立刻逮捕你的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2611
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Word is you %08.\nThat makes me sick!\nIf you aren't away from me soon, I'll do a lot more than just arrest you!"
msgstr "据说你就是那个%08的人，这真让我恶心！如果你不马上离开我，我就不单单是逮捕你这么简单了！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2612
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have been instructed to talk only with persons of sound reputation.\nYours is %11, while I must demand %12.\nBe on your way."
msgstr "我接到指示，只能和声誉优良的人说话。你的声誉仅仅是%11，我的要求是达到%12。快走吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2613
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I have been ordered to speak only with persons of, ah, the right kind of reputation.\nYours is merely %11.\nBe on your way."
msgstr "我被命令只能和声誉……嗯……声誉对口的人说话。你的声誉仅仅是%11，走开吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2615
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can't believe you're back.\nMy sword hand is starting to itch…"
msgstr "真不敢相信你还敢回来找我，我执剑的手发痒了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2616
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can't talk to you.\nI know your reputation is only %11. It must be better.\nOrders.\nSorry."
msgstr "我不能和你说话。你的声誉仅仅是%11，还不够好。这是命令，抱歉。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2617
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can't talk to you.\nI know your reputation is only %11. It must be worse.\nOrders.\nSorry."
msgstr "我不能和你说话。你的声誉仅仅是%11，还不够恶。这是命令，抱歉。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2620
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:25
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Thanks.\nWhat is it you wanted?"
msgstr "谢谢，你想要什么？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2623
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "HA!\n<drawing %03 sword> Threaten me, will you?"
msgstr "哈！<拔出%03剑>你还敢再威胁我吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2629
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:9
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "No need to threaten me a second time--I'll cooperate.\nAfter all, Baa will rule the Kingdom in the end.\nNothing you or I can say or do will change that."
msgstr "不必再威胁我，我会协助你的。但羊鸣教终将统治这个王国，你我都无力改变这个事实。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2630
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmmm?\nWhat? Here, go away, I don't have time for the little people--that means you!\nYou aren't famous enough."
msgstr "唔？什么？走开，我没时间和小人物罗嗦——我说的就是你！你名气不够。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2631
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02!\n<shrieking> Please don't kill me! I'll tell you anything!"
msgstr "%02！<尖叫>请别杀我！我什么都说！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2632
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<smiling>\nThe end of the world nears--with a little help from you and me, %10 %02.\nIs there anything I can do for you?"
msgstr "<微笑>世界末日就要来临了，你我都无力改变这点，%02%10。需要我为你做什么吗？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2633
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Wonderful %10 %02!\nYou have come to save the world!\nPraise be!\nI only hope you aren't too late."
msgstr "伟大的%02%10！您来拯救世界了！赞美你！我希望现在还不算太晚。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2634
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Too bad you're on the losing side, %02!\nBut listen, I'll tell you anything you want--the Temple of Baa will reign soon no matter what you do!\nJust please don't kill me. "
msgstr "真是不幸，你站在失败的那一方，%02！不过听着，我会告诉你我所知道的一切。但不管你做什么，羊鸣教很快都会统治这个世界！就是请别杀我。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2635
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Oh, my!\nEveryone is saying terrible things about you and your friends, %02.\nI'm afraid I can't speak with you."
msgstr "噢，老天！每个人都在述说关于你和你的朋友的可怕的事情，%02。恐怕我无法和你说话。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2636
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Baaaa! <grinning nastily> Baaa! The herd calls, friend.\nWhy not go and do some good deeds or something?\nG'won!\nGit!"
msgstr "咩！<龇牙咧嘴地笑>咩！羊群在召唤，朋友。为什么不行点善事呢？走吧，小子。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2638
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Baaa, friend %02!\nI've heard that you might be just the kind of people we are looking for.\nBut I'm not sure.\nYou need to get a reputation for doing those things our cult requires…I'm sure you get the idea!"
msgstr "咩，我的朋友%02！我听说你可能就是我们正在寻找的那种人，但我还不敢确定。你需要去做一些我们教派所要求的事情，获得相应的声誉……我相信你懂的！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2639
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<whispering> I'm still not allowed to speak with you, %02!\nNow please go, before I'm seen with you!"
msgstr "<低声说道>我仍然被禁止和你交谈，%02！在别人看到我和你在一起之前，请快点走开吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2640
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Are you soft in the head?\nI said go away!\nI don't need any good deeds done today."
msgstr "你是不是脑子有毛病？我说过，快滚！今天我不需要你助人为乐。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2641
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Everyone in my secret cult tells me that you aren't nice enough to be with.\nSo go get nicer and I'll start talking to you."
msgstr "我们的秘密教派中每个人都告诉我说你还不够出色。加油干吧，等更出色了我会和你交谈的。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2642
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your reputation isn't appropriate for my organization, %02, therefore I can't be seen talking to you.\nCome back when your reputation has…improved."
msgstr "你的声誉和我们的组织不相称，%02。所以我不能被人看见和你说话。等你的声誉下……改良了再来找我吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2644
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:24
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I already told you I don't really care for you.\nBother someone else."
msgstr "我告诉过你了我真的不在乎你，去缠别人吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2646
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My devotion to Baa is greater than any amount of money.\nI will never accept your bribe, never!"
msgstr "我对羊鸣教的投入是无法用金钱来衡量的。我决不会接收你的贿赂，决不！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2647
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:27
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ok, Ok!\nPlease, don't kill me.\nI'm not supposed to die yet."
msgstr "好的，好的！请别杀我，现在还没到该我死的时候。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2652
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I'm no longer in a good mood.\nGo trouble someone else."
msgstr "我心情不好，去缠别人吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2655
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Don't bother me, simpleton!\nI reserve my time solely for known, capable Heroes--not for unknown, incompetent, peasants."
msgstr "别来烦我，傻子。我只为有名气有实力的英雄花费时间，不会浪费时间在无名无能的农民身上。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2656
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<eyes widening> %02? Villain!\nThe world would be a better place without you!"
msgstr "<瞪着眼睛>%02？恶棍！没有你世界会变得更好！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2657
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "<bowing deeply> %10 %02! Your evil is known throughout the land!\nConsider me your most ardent supporter."
msgstr "<深深鞠躬>%02%10！你的邪恶整个大陆上无人不知，我是你最忠实的拥护者。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2658
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "An honor to know you, %02.\nI am at your service."
msgstr "非常荣幸认识您，%02。我愿为您效劳。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2659
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:14
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02.\nYour shining goodness is giving me a headache. <rubbing %03 temples>\nI think I'm going to have to slay you to cure it."
msgstr "%02，你的光辉和善良真让我头痛。<揉了揉%03太阳穴>我想我必须杀了你才能治好我的头痛。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2660
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "There is a rumor going 'round saying that you are a criminal.\nI'm afraid I don't associate with criminals."
msgstr "有传言说你是个罪犯，恐怕我没法和罪犯打交道。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2661
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Everyone says your reputation is %11.\nI hate that.\nBut, because you amuse me, I'll let you live awhile longer--as long as you go pester someone else."
msgstr "每个人都说你的声誉是%11。我痛恨这种声誉的人。但你这人让我发笑，我就让你再多活几天吧——只要你去缠别人而不是我。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2662
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:17
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My name is %01.\nIt would be a violation of my sacred oaths to speak with people whose reputation is less than %12.\nTherefore, I must bid you good day."
msgstr "我名叫%01。和声誉低于%12的人谈话违背了我神圣的誓言。因此，再见了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2663
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02.\nAs a Champion of evil, it pleases me to hear that your reputation is %11, but you just aren't evil enough for me!\nGet worse!\nI'm talking atrocities!\nCause a calamity or do something dastardly, then we can talk."
msgstr "%02。做为邪恶的斗士，很高兴你的声誉为%11，但对我来说这还远远不够！去做些事情来降低你的声誉！我指的是暴行！制造灾难或做一些极为卑鄙的事，然后我们就可以交谈了。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2664
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02, your reputation is %11.\nMy instincts tell me to slay you on the spot, but in the interests of charity, I'll give you a chance to redeem yourself by letting you live.\nFor now."
msgstr "%02，你的声誉是%11。我的直觉告诉我我应该将你就地正法，但我慈悲为怀，暂且饶你一命，给你一个改过自新的机会。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2666
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmm.\n%02.\nI have sworn an oath to avoid those of ill repute.\nYour reputation is %11, which is beneath me.\nPerhaps if it improves..."
msgstr "嗯，%02。我曾发誓不和声誉不够好的人谈话，你的声誉仅仅是%11，比我更低。或许等有了提高的时候……"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2667
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02, your evil wavers.\nMore.\nMore I say!\nYou need to be at least %12 for me to want to talk to you, so get to work!\n"
msgstr "%02，你这个带邪念的墙头草。更坏，我说过了要更坏！你的声誉必须至少是%12时，我才愿意和你说话。快干吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2668
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmmm.\nAll right.\nBut only because my mood is good."
msgstr "嗯，好吧，我今天心情不错。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2671
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I think not.\nNo amount of money could change my opinion of you."
msgstr "不行，无论多少钱都不会让我改变我对你的看法。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2673
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:28
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "You would challenge me?\nI am ready for the likes of you!"
msgstr "你想和我决斗吗？我早就为你这种人做好了准备！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2675
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:5
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02.\nI am pleased to make your acquaintance."
msgstr "%02，很高兴认识您。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2676
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:6
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "%02.\nI hope you aren't going to waste my time…"
msgstr "%02，希望你不会浪费我的时间。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2677
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:7
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your audience is over.\nBe off with you and trouble me no further today."
msgstr "我不想再听你说话了。快走吧，今天别来缠我。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2680
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:10
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I am looking to speak with Heroes, not children.\nIf you want my time, go do something heroic."
msgstr "我希望和英雄交谈，而不是小孩儿。如果你想找我，先去做些英勇事迹再说。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2681
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:11
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Hmmm.\nThe infamous and wicked %02. I am surprised that one of the Heroes of the land has not yet slain you.\nI shall be sure to help raise the bounty on your heads."
msgstr "唔，声名狼藉而邪恶的%02，我很惊讶这片土地上的英雄们怎么没杀了你。我一定要加足赏金取你的人头。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2682
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:12
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "A pleasure to know the intriguing and adventurous %10 %02.\nWhen I first heard about your wickedness, I was very impressed!"
msgstr "很高兴认识计谋多端、铤而走险的你，%02%10。当我第一次听说你的恶行时，我印象非常深刻！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2683
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:13
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Ah! An honor and a privilege to see you, %02.\nMy considerable resources are at your disposal."
msgstr "啊！真是非常荣幸见到您，%02。我所有的资源任您享用。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2685
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:15
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My sources tell me that you have committed a number of crimes.\nThey say you may even have KILLED.\nI am afraid that with that record, I cannot help you."
msgstr "根据给我的情报，你可能犯下了一系列罪行，甚至连杀人的勾当都做过。这个犯罪记录摆在那里，恐怕我帮不了你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2686
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:16
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Not everyone appreciates how you %08.\nI am one of those people.\nI doubt we have much to say to one another."
msgstr "不是每个人都欣赏你是如何%08的。我就属于不欣赏你的人。我们之间没什么话可说。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2688
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:18
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I can see you might be the type of person I commonly associate with, %02, but the rumors of your behavior vary.\nI must hear more before I will tolerate your presence.\nPerhaps you could dominate and bully some peasants…"
msgstr "我想你应该属于我一惯交往的那种人，%02，但关于你的传闻各不相同。在我接受你之前，我必须听到更多你的事迹。也许你可以去支配和欺凌一些农夫？"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2689
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:19
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "It is unseemly for me to be seen talking to criminals like yourselves.\nNow get out of my sight!"
msgstr "和一个像你这样的罪犯谈话对我来说是不合适的，快从我的视线中消失！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2690
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:20
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I still do not quite care for you %02.\nYour reputation amongst the common folk is %11, which is a bad business in my book.\n"
msgstr "我还是不会理你的，%02。你的社会声誉是%11，不适合和我来往。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2691
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:21
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "My friends all tell me your reputation is %11, %02.\nThat's not good enough!\nPerhaps a good deed or two would make your presence more acceptable to civilized society."
msgstr "%02，我的朋友都告诉我说你的声誉仅仅是%11，这还不够好！也许去做一两件善事会让文明社会更能接受你。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2692
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:22
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "I cannot believe you would enter my presence with a reputation of merely %11!\nThe insult is dire indeed, %10.\nLeave, and return when your reputation is %12!"
msgstr "我不敢相信你会带着区区一个%11的声誉站在我的面前！简直是在侮辱我，%10。走开，当你的声誉达到%12后再来找我吧！"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2693
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:23
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Today I will grant your wish. I will speak with you.\nBriefly."
msgstr "今天我让你如愿以偿，和你说两句吧。"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_NPCText.txt.py:2696
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/npcbtb.txt.py:26
msgctxt "npc conversation"
msgid "Your paltry wealth isn't enough to even tempt me.\nI will not be bribed."
msgstr "你微不足道的财富根本不足以诱惑我。我是不会被收买的。"

